{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab2d6"},"product_id":43,"item_id":"B000NGKLOQ","category_id":239,"name":"Sterling Silver Cubic Zirconia All-Around Band Stacking Ring Set (Set of 3), Size 8","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Sterling Silver","weight_lb":0.11,"price_cents":26999,"stock":78,"description":"Set of three stackable rings featuring full circles of sparkling Cubic Zirconia stones prong set in 925 sterling silver\nCubic Zirconia (CZ) is an affordable, conflict-free alternative to diamond that reveals brilliant shine and a meticulous cut\nPerfect jewelry gift to expand a woman's fashion wardrobe with a modern, on trend style\nTriple stack rings can be worn individually or all together for versatility\nHand-crafted in pure .925 Sterling Silver; Rhodium plating added to enhance shine and durability\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Set of three stackable rings featuring full circles of sparkling Cubic Zirconia stones prong set in 925 sterling silver\", \"Cubic Zirconia (CZ) is an affordable, conflict-free alternative to diamond that reveals brilliant shine and a meticulous cut\", \"Perfect jewelry gift to expand a woman's fashion wardrobe with a modern, on trend style\", \"Triple stack rings can be worn individually or all together for versatility\", \"Hand-crafted in pure .925 Sterling Silver; Rhodium plating added to enhance shine and durability\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"ring set\", \"eternity rings\", \"all around ring\", \"all around rings\", \"cz\", \"cz jewelry\", \"cz ring\", \"cz stacking rings\", \"white cz\", \"cheap diamond\", \"affordable diamond\", \"fake diamond\", \"imitation diamond\", \"prime day jewelry\", \"prime week jewelry\", \"jewelry with free shipping\", \"gift\", \"jewelry gift\", \"gift for woman\", \"gifts for women\"]","node_path":"Departments/Women/Jewelry/Rings/Bands","created_at":"2024-05-25T05:18:23Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab2d7"},"product_id":44,"item_id":"B000NJBN6I","category_id":346,"name":"Denali 93-Piece 1/4-, 3/8-, and 1/2-Inch Drive Socket Set, SAE/Metric","brand":"Denali","color":"Grey","weight_lb":"","price_cents":4199,"stock":196,"description":"Professional grade 93-piece socket set with three quick release high-torque rachets\nThree drive sizes and wide range of sockets for versatility; includes 6pt, 8pt and 12pt for maximum turning power\nCorrosion resistant chrome vanadium steel; laser etched\nIncludes a heavy duty impact resistant case for easy storage and transporting\nAll tools meet or exceed both ANSI and DIN standards","bullets":"[\"Professional grade 93-piece socket set with three quick release high-torque rachets\", \"Three drive sizes and wide range of sockets for versatility; includes 6pt, 8pt and 12pt for maximum turning power\", \"Corrosion resistant chrome vanadium steel; laser etched\", \"Includes a heavy duty impact resistant case for easy storage and transporting\", \"All tools meet or exceed both ANSI and DIN standards\"]","keywords":"[\"standard\", \"rachets.\", \"1/2\\\"\", \"93\", \"accessory\", \"bore\", \"boring\", \"carpentry\", \"charge\", \"coated\", \"comfortable\", \"denaly\", \"drawer\", \"drivers\", \"extension\", \"glass\", \"ground\", \"high\", \"high speed\", \"home\"]","node_path":"Products/Power, Garden & Hand Tools/Hand Tools/Sockets & Socket Sets/Socket Sets","created_at":"2023-08-01T15:48:10Z"}
