ating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"bracelets\", \"all around\", \"all-around\", \"dainty\", \"18k gold\", \"18 karat gold\", \"18 carat gold\", \"eighteen karat gold\", \"eighteen carat gold\", \"18 karat yellow gold\", \"18 carat yellow gold\", \"genuine gemstone\", \"semi-precious gemstone\", \"gemstone jewelry\", \"birthstone jewelry\", \"january birthday\", \"january birthday gift\", \"january birthday present\", \"january push present\", \"dimond\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-02-22T10:35:39Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab2f1"},"product_id":71,"item_id":"B000VDI8UK","category_id":346,"name":"Denali LED Aluminum Flashlight Set, 2AA and 3D","brand":"Denali","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":2699,"stock":17,"description":"The Denali 2-Pack of LED flashlights features two of today's most popular and useful sizes\nThe popular 2AA flashlight comes in handy when working in tight spaces and the tilting head of 3D flashlight gives this traditional flashlight many more uses\nLED flashlights are constructed from rugged machined aluminum\n3D flashlight features a tilting head; ideal for camping, working on the car, and other jobs requiring a focused light source\nSet includes: 1 AA aluminum LED flashlight and 1 3D aluminum LED flashlight with tilting head","bullets":"[\"The Denali 2-Pack of LED flashlights features two of today's most popular and useful sizes\", \"The popular 2AA flashlight comes in handy when working in tight spaces and the tilting head of 3D flashlight gives this traditional flashlight many more uses\", \"LED flashlights are constructed from rugged machined aluminum\", \"3D flashlight features a tilting head; ideal for camping, working on the car, and other jobs requiring a focused light source\", \"Set includes: 1 AA aluminum LED flashlight and 1 3D aluminum LED flashlight with tilting head\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"aaa\", \"de\", \"medical\", \"compact\", \"lumen\", \"nightstick\", \"klarus\", \"18650\", \"xt11s\", \"intrinsically\", \"dorcy\", \"bright\", \"1000\", \"lumens\", \"resistant\", \"focus\", \"tm06\", \"best\", \"holster\"]","node_path":"Categories/Safety & Security/Flashlights/Handheld Flashlights","created_at":"2023-02-10T21:57:20Z"}
