{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab339"},"product_id":142,"item_id":"B002ACONPY","category_id":193,"name":"Pike Street 135-Gram Printed Flannel Twin Sheet Set, Fairies","brand":"Pinzon by Amazon","color":"Fairies","weight_lb":"","price_cents":2699,"stock":38,"description":"Cozy, twin-sized flannel sheet set with flat and fitted sheets, and 1 pillowcase\n100 percent cotton lightly brushed for softness; machine wash and dry\nCrafted with 135 grams of cotton flannel per square meter; matching duvets sold separately\nPrinted on one side with a charming, versatile pattern; wide variety of prints available\n66-by-96-inch flat sheet; 39-by-75-inch fitted sheet; 20-by-30-inch pillowcase","bullets":"[\"Cozy, twin-sized flannel sheet set with flat and fitted sheets, and 1 pillowcase\", \"100 percent cotton lightly brushed for softness; machine wash and dry\", \"Crafted with 135 grams of cotton flannel per square meter; matching duvets sold separately\", \"Printed on one side with a charming, versatile pattern; wide variety of prints available\", \"66-by-96-inch flat sheet; 39-by-75-inch fitted sheet; 20-by-30-inch pillowcase\"]","keywords":"[\"floral\", \"bed\", \"ashley\", \"pink\", \"shabby\", \"bedsheets\", \"laura\", \"chic\", \"sheets\", \"bedding\", \"blue\", \"purple\", \"chevron\", \"simply\", \"flannel\", \"sheet sets\", \"softness\", \"warmth\"]","node_path":"Categories","created_at":"2023-09-04T00:15:10Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab33a"},"product_id":143,"item_id":"B002AQST64","category_id":238,"name":"Sterling Silver Multi Pressed Flower Teardrop Pendant Necklace, 16\"","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Silver Multi","weight_lb":"","price_cents":13999,"stock":12,"description":"Unique translucent teardrop-shape pendant featuring real dried flowers preserved in resin and surrounded by sterling silver settings\nThe natural properties of real flowers provides a one-of-a-kind look to each piece. The image may show a slight difference to the actual flowers in color and composition.\nGrown in the fields of Taxco, Mexico, these miniature flowers are gathered by hand and preserved permanently in resin\n16\" cable chain with spring-ring clasp\nMade in Mexico\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Unique translucent teardrop-shape pendant featuring real dried flowers preserved in resin and surrounded by sterling silver settings\", \"The natural properties of real flowers provides a one-of-a-kind look to each piece. The image may show a slight difference to the actual flowers in color and composition.\", \"Grown in the fields of Taxco, Mexico, these miniature flowers are gathered by hand and preserved permanently in resin\", \"16\\\" cable chain with spring-ring clasp\", \"Made in Mexico\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"whimsical\", \"pressed flower\", \"pressed flowers\", \"pressed flower jewelry\", \"dried flower\", \"dried flowers\", \"dried flower jewelry\", \"flower jewelry\", \"floral jewelry\", \"unique jewelry\", \"unique gift\", \"for mom\", \"for women\", \"valentines day\", \"valentines day gift for her\", \"valentines day gifts\", \"anniversary\", \"gift\", \"mother's day\", \"mother's day gifts\"]","node_path":"Archive/2021-03/7889891010 - Pendants","created_at":"2024-04-16T20:04:28Z"}
