{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab359"},"product_id":174,"item_id":"B0046EC1NK","category_id":238,"name":"Sterling Silver Diamond Accent Lotus Flower Pendant Necklace, 18\"","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Silver","weight_lb":"","price_cents":8599,"stock":81,"description":"Lotus pendant necklace in sterling silver featuring diamond trio at center\nCable chain with spring-ring clasp\nCarat weight listed is the total for all stones.\nAll our diamond suppliers confirm that they comply with the Kimberley Process to ensure that their diamonds are conflict free.\nGreat for everyday wear.\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Lotus pendant necklace in sterling silver featuring diamond trio at center\", \"Cable chain with spring-ring clasp\", \"Carat weight listed is the total for all stones.\", \"All our diamond suppliers confirm that they comply with the Kimberley Process to ensure that their diamonds are conflict free.\", \"Great for everyday wear.\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"whimsical\", \"valentine's day gift^mother's day gift^anniversary gift^graduation gift^birthday gift^fashion jewelry^gifts for her^gifts^holiday gift^bridesmaid gift^teen jewelry^cheap jewelry^classic jewelry^gifts for women^mom gifts^gifts for woman^godmother^valentines day gift for her^gifts for grandmother^grandmother jewelry^holiday jewelry\", \"diamond necklace^diamond pendant necklace^fashion^fine fashion^mothers day gifts^fashion jewelry^graduation gifts^valentines day gift^christmas gift^holiday gift^special occasion^amazon curated collection jewelry gifts^anniversary gift^modern^birthday^bridesmaid gift^bridal fashion^honeymoon gift^push present^engagement gift^wedding gift^mother's day^mother's day gifts^mothers day^mothers day gifts^classic^classics^gift for her^sentiment^sentimental^everyday^nature^flower^sterling silver diamond necklace^charm^lotus flower\", \"valentines day gifts for her^valentines day jewelry^valentines day^love^gifts for women^valentine jewelry^valentines jewelry^gifts for her\"]","node_path":"Departments/Women/Jewelry/Necklaces/Pendant Necklaces","created_at":"2023-05-20T08:57:25Z"}
