{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab368"},"product_id":189,"item_id":"B005DJACP6","category_id":238,"name":"Sterling Silver Italian 0.8 mm Diamond Cut Box Chain Necklace, 18\"","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Silver","weight_lb":0.02,"price_cents":25999,"stock":0,"description":"Made in Italy\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Made in Italy\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"classics\", \"classic\", \"12_13necklace\", \"12_13goldsilver\"]","node_path":"Categories/Women/Necklaces","created_at":"2024-01-10T14:12:02Z"}
