{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab381"},"product_id":214,"item_id":"B0087XAENA","category_id":238,"name":"Sterling Silver Diamond-Accented Four-Picture Heart Locket Necklace, 18\"","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"silver","weight_lb":0.02,"price_cents":7599,"stock":11,"description":"Necklace featuring polished sterling silver heart locket with starburst-set diamond at center\nLocket opens to reveal four photograph windows\nAll our diamond suppliers confirm that they comply with the Kimberley Process to ensure that their diamonds are conflict free.\nHand crafted in the USA.\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Necklace featuring polished sterling silver heart locket with starburst-set diamond at center\", \"Locket opens to reveal four photograph windows\", \"All our diamond suppliers confirm that they comply with the Kimberley Process to ensure that their diamonds are conflict free.\", \"Hand crafted in the USA.\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"hearts\", \"locket necklace\", \"lockets for girls\", \"gold locket\", \"engraved necklace\", \"personalized necklace\", \"amazon collection\", \"bar necklace\", \"sterling silver locket necklace\", \"lockets\", \"photo locket necklace\", \"personalized rings\", \"engraved rings\", \"girls locket\", \"necklace locket\", \"picture locket necklace\", \"picture necklace\", \"picture lockets\", \"lockets for women\", \"photo lockets\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-04-02T10:07:43Z"}
