{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab389"},"product_id":222,"item_id":"B008WYDSAK","category_id":238,"name":"Two-Tone Sterling Silver and Rose Gold Over Sterling Silver Angel with Heart Pendant Necklace, 18\"","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"White","weight_lb":"","price_cents":10999,"stock":142,"description":"Pendant necklace featuring an angel accented with pave set Cubic Zirconia stones and holding a rose gold plated heart\nCubic Zirconia (CZ) is an affordable, conflict-free alternative to diamond that reveals brilliant shine and a meticulous cut\nA thoughtful jewelry gift that will be cherished for years to come\n18\" box chain with spring ring closure\nHand-crafted in pure .925 Sterling Silver; 14K Rose Gold plating added to enhance design and appearance\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Pendant necklace featuring an angel accented with pave set Cubic Zirconia stones and holding a rose gold plated heart\", \"Cubic Zirconia (CZ) is an affordable, conflict-free alternative to diamond that reveals brilliant shine and a meticulous cut\", \"A thoughtful jewelry gift that will be cherished for years to come\", \"18\\\" box chain with spring ring closure\", \"Hand-crafted in pure .925 Sterling Silver; 14K Rose Gold plating added to enhance design and appearance\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appea