o send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\", \"A series of seven Cubic Zirconia stones offer shimmer to this timeless pair of earrings.\", \"Cubic Zirconia showcases the same brilliant shine that one would find in a well-cut diamond.\", \"1.42 Diamond equivalent carat total weight\"]","keywords":"[\"classics with a twist\", \"anniversary gifts for her\", \"cheap diamond\", \"cz earring^ imitation diamond earring^ cheap diamond earrings^ cheap diamond earring^ simulated diamond earring\", \"fake diamond\", \"imitation diamond\", \"jewelry for women\", \"jewlery\", \"simulated diamond\", \"valentines day\", \"valentines day gift for her\", \"valentines day gifts\", \"valentines day gifts for her^valentines day jewelry^valentines day^love^gifts for women^valentine jewelry^valentines jewelry^gifts for her\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-11-10T15:44:37Z"}
