{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab39b"},"product_id":240,"item_id":"B00B3RE7QM","category_id":238,"name":"Rose Gold Plated Sterling Silver Angel Wing Drop Pendant Necklace, 18\"","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Rose Gold","weight_lb":0.02,"price_cents":15999,"stock":20,"description":"Rose Gold Plated Sterling silver necklace featuring open-work wing pendant\n18\" link chain with spring-ring closure\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Rose Gold Plated Sterling silver necklace featuring open-work wing pendant\", \"18\\\" link chain with spring-ring closure\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"whimsical\"]","node_path":"Categories/Women/Necklaces","created_at":"2023-01-25T05:13:14Z"}
