{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab3a6"},"product_id":251,"item_id":"B00C4R9TF4","category_id":238,"name":"Men's Sterling Silver Italian 5.5mm Solid Figaro Link Chain Necklace, 24\"","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Silver","weight_lb":"","price_cents":18999,"stock":21,"description":"Italian-crafted men's necklace featuring polished Figaro chain in sterling silver\nLobster-claw clasp\nMade in Italy\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Italian-crafted men's necklace featuring polished Figaro chain in sterling silver\", \"Lobster-claw clasp\", \"Made in Italy\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"classics with a twist\"]","node_path":"Categories/Men/Jewelry/Necklaces","created_at":"2023-07-16T13:38:55Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab3a7"},"product_id":252,"item_id":"B00CFJQ5S0","category_id":193,"name":"Pinzon 650-Gram Textured Cotton 6-Piece Towel Set, Crimson","brand":"Pinzon by Amazon","color":"Crimson","weight_lb":1.99,"price_cents":3199,"stock":49,"description":"Six-piece towel set includes 2 bath towels, 2 hand towels, and 2 washcloths\nMade of 2-ply cotton woven to a plush 650-gram weight\nBath towels measure 30 by 58 inches, hand towels measure 16 by 30 inches, washcloths measure 13 by 13 inches\nMachine washable and dryable. For best use, wash separately on first use. You may see some lint on the first wash which will diminish after each washing. This will not affect the look, feel, or performance of your towel set","bullets":"[\"Six-piece towel set includes 2 bath towels, 2 hand towels, and 2 washcloths\", \"Made of 2-ply cotton woven to a plush 650-gram weight\", \"Bath towels measure 30 by 58 inches, hand towels measure 16 by 30 inches, washcloths measure 13 by 13 inches\", \"Machine washable and dryable. For best use, wash separately on first use. You may see some lint on the first wash which will diminish after each washing. This will not affect the look, feel, or performance of your towel set\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"Categories/Bath/Bath Linen/Towels","created_at":"2024-04-01T19:48:03Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab3a8"},"product_id":253,"item_id":"B00CIOBRO4","category_id":238,"name":"Amazon Collection Women's - 0.925 Rhodium-Plated Silver","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"","weight_lb":0.02,"price_cents":19999,"stock":183,"description":"Sterling Silver Initial Disc Necklace\nHang with a silver cable chain and fitted with a spring ring.\nSterling Silver 18\"\nIdeal for everyday use.\nImported.\nThese silver pieces are built for durability. This piece has a metal coating or flashing or electroplating for a more radiant look, but it can wear out for prolonged or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items, keep your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a bag or airtight box and avoid the plates rubbing together. Also try to avoid exposure to detergents and perfumes, which can both adversely affect your objects. Your local jeweller can tell you where to send your jewelry if you ever want to replace it again.","bullets":"[\"Sterling Silver Initial Disc Necklace\", \"Hang with a silver cable chain and fitted with a spring ring.\", \"Sterling Silver 18\\\"\", \"Ideal for everyday use.\", \"Imported.\", \"These silver pieces are built for durability. This piece has a metal coating or flashing or electroplating for a more radiant look, but it can wear out for prolonged or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items, keep your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a bag or airtight box and avoid the plates rubbing together. Also try to avoid exposure to detergents and perfumes, which can both adversely affect your objects. Your local jeweller can tell you where to send your jewelry if you ever want to replace it again.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-04-24T17:47:36Z"}
