{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab3e5"},"product_id":314,"item_id":"B00L7HWTAE","category_id":236,"name":"Sterling Silver Tree of Life Earrings","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Silver","weight_lb":0.02,"price_cents":13999,"stock":114,"description":"Dangle drop earrings featuring circular tree of life charm\nFishhook backings\nRhodium plated silver\nMade in Mexico\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Dangle drop earrings featuring circular tree of life charm\", \"Fishhook backings\", \"Rhodium plated silver\", \"Made in Mexico\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"classics with a twist\", \"anniversary\", \"dried flower\", \"for mom\", \"for women\", \"gift\", \"gifts for her\", \"gifts for woman\", \"gifts for women\", \"godmother\", \"inspirational earrings\", \"inspirational gifts\", \"inspirational jewelry\", \"love\", \"mom gifts\", \"mother's day\", \"mother's day gifts\", \"moth