tal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"bracelets\", \"thin\", \"dainty\", \"all around\", \"all-around\", \"18k gold\", \"18 karat gold\", \"18 carat gold\", \"eighteen karat gold\", \"eighteen carat gold\", \"18 karat yellow gold\", \"18 carat yellow gold\", \"genuine blue topaz\", \"genuine gemstone\", \"semi-precious gemstone\", \"gemstone jewelry\", \"birthstone jewelry\", \"december birthday\", \"december birthday gift\", \"december birthday present\"]","node_path":"Categories/Women/Bracelets","created_at":"2024-01-27T17:48:48Z"}
