{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab406"},"product_id":347,"item_id":"B00NFSCVD8","category_id":236,"name":"Yellow Gold Plated Sterling Silver Inside-Out Hoop Earrings set with Swarovski Zirconia (3 cttw)","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Yellow-gold-plated","weight_lb":0.01,"price_cents":10999,"stock":117,"description":"Hoop earrings featuring shared-prong Swarovski Zirconia set on outer front of hoop and inner backing (3 cttw)\nEarrings are secured by hinge with click-top backings\nEach set is polished yellow gold plated .925 sterling silver\nEach Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Hoop earrings featuring shared-prong Swarovski Zirconia set on outer front of hoop and inner backing (3 cttw)\", \"Earrings are secured by hinge with click-top backings\", \"Each set is polished yellow gold plated .925 sterling silver\", \"Each Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoi