ing for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"religious\", \"colorsoflove\", \"pressed flower\", \"pressed flowers\", \"pressed flower jewelry\", \"dried flower\", \"dried flowers\", \"dried flower jewelry\", \"flower jewelry\", \"floral jewelry\", \"unique jewelry\", \"unique gift\", \"for mom\", \"for women\", \"valentines day\", \"valentines day gift for her\", \"valentines day gifts\", \"anniversary\", \"gift\", \"mother's day\"]","node_path":"Departments/Women/Jewelry/Necklaces/Pendant Necklaces","created_at":"2023-10-02T12:55:40Z"}
