{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab43e"},"product_id":403,"item_id":"B00TI2NCWO","category_id":236,"name":"Rose Gold Plated Sterling Silver Antique Drop Earrings set with Asscher Cut Swarovski Zirconia","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Rose-gold-plated","weight_lb":0.02,"price_cents":17999,"stock":30,"description":"Asscher cut drop earrings set with Swarovski Zirconia in cushion-shape halos set beneath trios of bezel-set rounds\nRose gold plated sterling silver secured with a lever-back closure\nVintage inspired drop earrings\nEach Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\nDrop earrings featuring asscher-cut Swarovski Zirconia stones in cushion-shape halos set beneath trios of bezel-set rounds\nLever-back closures","bullets":"[\"Asscher cut drop earrings set with Swarovski Zirconia in cushion-shape halos set beneath trios of bezel-set rounds\", \"Rose gold plated sterling silver secured with a lever-back closure\", \"Vintage inspired drop earrings\", \"Each Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\", \"Drop earrings featuring asscher-cut Swarovski Zirconia stones in cushion-shape halos set beneath trios of bezel-set rounds\", \"Lever-back closures\"]","keywords":"[\"classics with a twist\"]","node_path":"Categories/Women/Jewelry/Earrings","created_at":"2023-11-13T16:40:55Z"}
