{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab459"},"product_id":430,"item_id":"B012SZYS2K","category_id":239,"name":"Platinum-Plated Sterling Silver Flower Halo Ring set with Swarovski Zirconia (2.9 cttw), Size 9","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Platinum-Plated","weight_lb":"","price_cents":12999,"stock":10,"description":"Flower halo ring, set with centerpiece and halo of Swarovski Zirconia\nEach ring features two Swarovski Zirconia adorned bands\nA size 9 ring made from platinum plated sterling silver ensures a comfortable fit and high quality product\nEach Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Flower halo ring, set with centerpiece and halo of Swarovski Zirconia\", \"Each ring features two Swarovski Zirconia adorned bands\", \"A size 9 ring made from platinum plated sterling silver ensures a comfortable fit and high quality product\", \"Each Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"classics with a twist\", \"rin67\", \"525claant\", \"525rsets\", \"valentines day\", \"valentines day gift for her\", \"valentines day gifts\", \"fake diamond\", \"imitation diamond\", \"cheap diamond\", \"simulated diamond\", \"jewelry for women\", \"anniversary gifts for her\", \"jewlery\", \"cz ring^ imitation diamond ring^ cheap diamond rings^ cheap diamond ring^ simulated diamond ring\", \"swarovski crystal^ swarovski elements\"]","node_path":"Departments/Women/Jewelry/Rings/Statement","created_at":"2024-05-01T12:27:18Z"}
