{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab471"},"product_id":454,"item_id":"B014WC370Q","category_id":239,"name":"Platinum-Plated Sterling Silver Round 3-Stone Ring made with Swarovski Zirconia (3 cttw), Size 5","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Platinum Plated Silver","weight_lb":0.01,"price_cents":24999,"stock":5,"description":"Classic 3 stone ring set with round brilliant cut Swarovski Zirconia (3 cttw)\nA size 5 ring made from platinum plated sterling silver ensures a comfortable fit and high quality product\nThis jewelry design was manufactured with the highest quality standards. All efforts are being made to use sustainable resources and socially responsible providers.\nEach Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Classic 3 stone ring set with round brilliant cut Swarovski Zirconia (3 cttw)\", \"A size 5 ring made from platinum plated sterling silver ensures a comfortable fit and high quality product\", \"This jewelry design was manufactured with the highest quality standards. All efforts are being made to use sustainable resources and socially responsible providers.\", \"Each Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"classics\", \"jwclassics17\", \"62rin\", \"62cla\", \"fake diamond\", \"imitation diamond\", \"cheap diamond\", \"simulated diamond\", \"jewelry for women\", \"anniversary gifts for her\", \"jewlery\", \"cz ring^ imitation diamond ring^ cheap diamond rings^ cheap diamond ring^ simulated diamond ring\", \"swarovski crystal^ swarovski elements\"]","node_path":"Departments/Women/Jewelry/Rings","created_at":"2023-01-06T00:11:20Z"}
