{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab474"},"product_id":457,"item_id":"B0154UQWAC","category_id":239,"name":"Platinum-Plated Sterling Silver Cubic Zirconia Bypass Freshwater Cultured Pearl Ring, Size 9","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"White","weight_lb":"","price_cents":21999,"stock":20,"description":"Bypass Ring in platinum plated sterling silver set with Freshwater Pearl and Swarovski Zirconia accents\nA size 9 ring\nThis jewelry design was manufactured with the highest quality standards. All efforts are being made to use sustainable resources and socially responsible providers.\nEach Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Bypass Ring in platinum plated sterling silver set with Freshwater Pearl and Swarovski Zirconia accents\", \"A size 9 ring\", \"This jewelry design was manufactured with the highest quality standards. All efforts are being made to use sustainable resources and socially responsible providers.\", \"Each Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"fine fashion\", \"610fashpearl\", \"primedrin\", \"june birthstone\", \"costume jewelry\", \"women's jewelry\", \"fashion jewelry\", \"amazon curated collection jewelry gifts\", \"cz\", \"crystal\", \"cubic zirconia\", \"amazon jewelry\", \"amazon curated collection\", \"simulated diamond\", \"synthetic diamond\", \"graduation gifts\", \"bridesmaid gifts\", \"anniversary gift\", \"birthday gift\", \"honeymoon gift\"]","node_path":"Departments/Women/Jewelry/Rings/Statement","created_at":"2024-03-05T21:08:50Z"}
