{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab48f"},"product_id":484,"item_id":"B017XDCYI2","category_id":236,"name":"IGI Certified 14k White Gold Lab Created Diamond Stud Earrings (4 cttw, I-J Color, SI1-SI2 Clarity)","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"White","weight_lb":0.0,"price_cents":35999,"stock":13,"description":"Lab-created diamonds are an eco-friendly and sustainable alternative to earth-mined diamonds. Compared to mining diamonds, production of Lab-created diamonds results in fewer carbon emissions and less energy and water usage, excavation and disruption of land, and waste disposal, & human impact.\nIGI-certified, jewelry has been assessed and authenticated by the International Gemological Institute's expert gemologists\nMade in USA\nAll our diamond suppliers confirm that they comply with the Kimberley Process to ensure that their diamonds are conflict free","bullets":"[\"Lab-created diamonds are an eco-friendly and sustainable alternative to earth-mined diamonds. Compared to mining diamonds, production of Lab-created diamonds results in fewer carbon emissions and less energy and water usage, excavation and disruption of land, and waste disposal, & human impact.\", \"IGI-certified, jewelry has been assessed and authenticated by the International Gemological Institute's expert gemologists\", \"Made in USA\", \"All our diamond suppliers confirm that they comply with the Kimberley Process to ensure that their diamonds are conflict free\"]","keywords":"[\"classics\", \"valentines day\", \"valentines day gift for her\", \"valentines day gifts\", \"1 carat and above\"]","node_path":"Categories/Women/Jewelry/Earrings","created_at":"2023-06-27T18:50:33Z"}
