{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab496"},"product_id":491,"item_id":"B019D0LS4E","category_id":29,"name":"AmazonBasics Mini DisplayPort (Thunderbolt) to VGA Adapter","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"","weight_lb":0.07,"price_cents":2599,"stock":37,"description":"Compatible with a Mini DisplayPort compatible computer to an HDTV, monitor or projector with VGA\nSupports video resolutions up to 1920 x 1200 and 1080p\nTransmits video from computer or tablet to monitor display\nVGA does not transmit audio\n1-year limited warranty\nFor customer service and warranty related queries please contact_us: [1800-419-0416] (available Monday to Saturday from 9:30 AM to 6:00 PM except national holidays)","bullets":"[\"Compatible with a Mini DisplayPort compatible computer to an HDTV, monitor or projector with VGA\", \"Supports video resolutions up to 1920 x 1200 and 1080p\", \"Transmits video from computer or tablet to monitor display\", \"VGA does not transmit audio\", \"1-year limited warranty\", \"For customer service and warranty related queries please contact_us: [1800-419-0416] (available Monday to Saturday from 9:30 AM to 6:00 PM except national holidays)\"]","keywords":"[\"thunderbolt to vga\", \"monitor for computer\", \"display port to vga\", \"thunderbolt\", \"vga cable for pc\", \"amazon basics\", \"thunderbolt to hdmi cable for mac\", \"vga\", \"computer monitors\", \"apple vga adapter\", \"apple vga to lightning\", \"lightning to vga\", \"mini display port to vga\", \"mini displayport to vga\", \"mini displayport to vga adapter\", \"vga mac adapter\", \"vga to lightning adapter\", \"vga to mini displayport\"]","node_path":"Categories/Accessories & Peripherals/Cables/DisplayPort Cables","created_at":"2023-09-24T10:27:22Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab497"},"product_id":492,"item_id":"B019ID1YKE","category_id":238,"name":"Platinum Plated Sterling Silver \"V\" Initial Pendant Necklace set with Swarovski Zirconia (.22 cttw)","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"White","weight_lb":0.0,"price_cents":13999,"stock":44,"description":"Necklace featuring a Swarovski Zirconia set V initial pendant\nEach initial pendant is platinum plated .925 sterling silver\nPendant is suspended from 18\" cable chain with 2\" extender\nEach Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Necklace featuring a Swarovski Zirconia set V initial pendant\", \"Each initial pendant is platinum plated .925 sterling silver\", \"Pendant is suspended from 18\\\" cable chain with 2\\\" extender\", \"Each Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"sentiments\"]","node_path":"Categories/Women/Jewelry/Necklaces","created_at":"2023-09-20T07:41:57Z"}
