{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab4bd"},"product_id":530,"item_id":"B01EJPZJNO","category_id":193,"name":"AmazonBasics Laundry Sorter and White Drying Rack Set","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"White","weight_lb":"","price_cents":2399,"stock":9,"description":"Includes 3-bag laundry sorter and white drying rack\nLaundry sorter has 3 removable bags for efficiently organizing laundry\nMachine-washable bins measure approximately 15x9x22 inches each (LxWxH)\nWhite drying rack made of durable yet lightweight steel that is easy to move from room to room\nAccordion-style drying rack folds flat for compact storage\nDrying rack measures approximately 14.5x29.5x41.75 inches (LxWxH)","bullets":"[\"Includes 3-bag laundry sorter and white drying rack\", \"Laundry sorter has 3 removable bags for efficiently organizing laundry\", \"Machine-washable bins measure approximately 15x9x22 inches each (LxWxH)\", \"White drying rack made of durable yet lightweight steel that is easy to move from room to room\", \"Accordion-style drying rack folds flat for compact storage\", \"Drying rack measures approximately 14.5x29.5x41.75 inches (LxWxH)\"]","keywords":"[\"laundry sorters\", \"3\", \"three\", \"clothes\", \"dry\", \"hamper\", \"iron\", \"laundry\", \"organizer\", \"sorter\", \"rolling\", \"triple\", \"wash\", \"basket\", \"washable\"]","node_path":"Categories/Storage & Organization/Laundry Storage & Organization/Laundry Sorters","created_at":"2023-10-17T22:58:01Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab4be"},"product_id":531,"item_id":"B01EL67B8C","category_id":239,"name":"Platinum-Plated Sterling Silver Celebrity \"Pippa\" Swarovski Zirconia Asscher Cut Antique Ring, Size 5","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Clear","weight_lb":"","price_cents":23999,"stock":5,"description":"Celebrity themed Engagement Ring fit for a princess!\nDazzling Swarovski Asscher-Cut stone surrounded by a halo of Swarovski Zirconia\nAdd some Hollywood Glamour to your wedding ring finger or wear as a statement piece on your right hand.\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Celebrity themed Engagement Ring fit for a princess!\", \"Dazzling Swarovski Asscher-Cut stone surrounded by a halo of Swarovski Zirconia\", \"Add some Hollywood Glamour to your wedding ring finger or wear as a statement piece on your right hand.\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"pippa middleton\", \"james matthews\", \"engagement\", \"bridal\", \"celebrity engagement ring\"]","node_path":"Categories/Women/Jewelry/Rings/Statement","created_at":"2023-03-15T02:32:32Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab4bf"},"product_id":532,"item_id":"B01ERB5XK4","category_id":239,"name":"Platinum-Plated Sterling Silver Golden Yellow All-Around Band Ring made with Swarovski Zirconia, Size 9","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Golden Yellow","weight_lb":"","price_cents":29999,"stock":61,"description":"All-Around Band Ring set with Swarovski Zirconia in platinum or gold plated sterling silver\nA size 9 ring\nA timeless design\nEach Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"All-Around Band Ring set with Swarovski Zirconia in platinum or gold plated sterling silver\", \"A size 9 ring\", \"A timeless design\", \"Each Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"classics\", \"fake diamond\", \"imitation diamond\", \"cheap diamond\", \"simulated diamond\", \"jewelry for women\", \"anniversary gifts for her\", \"jewlery\", \"cz ring^ imitation diamond ring^ cheap diamond rings^ cheap diamond ring^ simulated diamond ring\", \"swarovski crystal^ swarovski elements\"]","node_path":"Departments/Women/Jewelry/Rings/Bands","created_at":"2024-05-06T05:03:31Z"}
