{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab4c3"},"product_id":536,"item_id":"B01F5MZOEE","category_id":239,"name":"Rose Gold Plated Sterling Silver Cushion Cut Champaign Cubic Zirconia 6mm Double Halo Ring, Size 5","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Rose","weight_lb":0.02,"price_cents":13999,"stock":20,"description":"Gorgeous ring featuring a cushion cut 6mm champagne Cubic Zirconia center stone and a double halo of smaller CZ stones set in 14k rose gold plated sterling silver\nCubic Zirconia (CZ) is an affordable, conflict-free alternative to diamond that reveals brilliant shine and a meticulous cut\nA thoughtful jewelry gift that will be cherished for years to come\nAn affordable option for an alternative engagement ring or promise ring\nHand-crafted in pure .925 Sterling Silver; 14K Rose Gold plating added to enhance design and appearance\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Gorgeous ring featuring a cushion cut 6mm champagne Cubic Zirconia center stone and a double halo of smaller CZ stones set in 14k rose gold plated sterling silver\", \"Cubic Zirconia (CZ) is an affordable, conflict-free alternative to diamond that reveals brilliant shine and a meticulous cut\", \"A thoughtful jewelry gift that will be cherished for years to come\", \"An affordable option for an alternative engagement ring or promise ring\", \"Hand-crafted in pure .925 Sterling Silver; 14K Rose Gold plating added to enhance design and appearance\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"classics with a twist\", \"anniversary gifts for her\", \"cheap diamond\", \"cz ring^ imitation diamond ring^ cheap diamond rings^ cheap diamond ring^ simulated diamond ring\", \"fake diamond\", \"imitation diamond\", \"jewelry for women\", \"jewlery\", \"simulated diamond\"]","node_path":"Categories/Women/Jewelry/Rings/Statement","created_at":"2023-12-25T19:44:01Z"}
