{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab4c6"},"product_id":539,"item_id":"B01FJ21MFU","category_id":239,"name":"Rose Gold Plated Sterling Silver Made with Swarovski Zirconia Criss Cross Single\"X\" Ring, Size 7","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Rose Gold Plated Sterling Silver","weight_lb":0.01,"price_cents":28999,"stock":16,"description":"Criss Cross \"X\" Ring set with brilliant cut Swaroksi Zirconia in rose gold plated sterling silver\nA size 7 ring\nA timeless design\nEach Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Criss Cross \\\"X\\\" Ring set with brilliant cut Swaroksi Zirconia in rose gold plated sterling silver\", \"A size 7 ring\", \"A timeless design\", \"Each Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"fine fashion\", \"fake diamond^imitation diamond^cheap diamond^simulated diamond^jewelry for women^anniversary gifts for her^jewlery^cz ring^ imitation diamond ring^ cheap diamond rings^ cheap diamond ring^ simulated diamond ring^swarovski crystal^ swarovski elements\"]","node_path":"Categories","created_at":"2024-02-11T03:33:21Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab4c7"},"product_id":540,"item_id":"B01FJAOSKS","category_id":16,"name":"AmazonBasics AAA Rechargeable Batteries (8-Pack) and Ni-MH AA & AAA Battery Charger With USB Port Set","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":3799,"stock":9,"description":"Includes (1) 8-pack of pre-charged AAA Rechargeable Batteries and (1) AmazonBasics Ni-MH AA & AAA Battery Charger with USB Port\n4-hour Ni-MH battery charger with USB charge port; Recharges 2 or 4 AA / AAA Ni-MH batteries at a time, Protects against wrong polarity charging and over charging; Built-in switching power technology for worldwide use (100-240 V AC)\nAAA rechargeable battery (8-pack, 800 mAh); ideal for digital cameras, remote controls, toys, and more\nLong battery life; extremely gradual self-discharge; maintains 80% capacity for 24 months\nSame product, new look! Appearance of batteries you receive may vary.\nThe batteries can be recycled when they no longer hold a charge. To find a recycling location near you, simply copy/paste this link into your browser: call2recycle.org/locator/","bullets":"[\"Includes (1) 8-pack of pre-charged AAA Rechargeable Batteries and (1) AmazonBasics Ni-MH AA & AAA Battery Charger with USB Port\", \"4-hour Ni-MH battery charger with USB charge port; Recharges 2 or 4 AA / AAA Ni-MH batteries at a time, Protects against wrong polarity charging and over charging; Built-in switching power technology for worldwide use (100-240 V AC)\", \"AAA rechargeable battery (8-pack, 800 mAh); ideal for digital cameras, remote controls, toys, and more\", \"Long battery life; extremely gradual self-discharge; maintains 80% capacity for 24 months\", \"Same product, new look! Appearance of batteries you receive may vary.\", \"The batteries can be recycled when they no longer hold a charge. To find a recycling location near you, simply copy/paste this link into your browser: call2recycle.org/locator/\"]","keywords":"[\"amazon\", \"basics\", \"triple