{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab4e1"},"product_id":566,"item_id":"B01HD7XCXY","category_id":236,"name":"Amazon Essentials Sterling Silver Round Swiss Blue Topaz Birthstone Stud Earrings (December)","brand":"Amazon Essentials","color":"Blue","weight_lb":"","price_cents":24999,"stock":69,"description":"Stud earrings featuring round birthstone in four-prong basket settings in sterling silver\nButterfly backing\nCrafted in .925 sterling silver\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Stud earrings featuring round birthstone in four-prong basket settings in sterling silver\", \"Butterfly backing\", \"Crafted in .925 sterling silver\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"earring\", \"studs\", \"birthstone studs\", \"posts\", \"post earrings\", \"pierced ears\", \"genuine blue topaz\", \"genuine gemstone\", \"semi-precious gemstone\", \"gemstone jewelry\", \"birthstone jewelry\", \"december birthday\", \"december birthday gift\", \"december birthday present\", \"december push present\", \"prime day jewelry\", \"prime week jewelry\", \"jewelry with free shipping\", \"gift\", \"gift for woman\"]","node_path":"Categories/Women/Jewelry/Earrings","created_at":"2023-06-19T05:50:57Z"}
