{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab4e3"},"product_id":568,"item_id":"B01HGKTHAK","category_id":237,"name":"Girls' Petite Sterling Silver African Amethyst Open Heart Stud Earrings and 16\" Pendant Necklace Jewelry Set","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Purple","weight_lb":0.07,"price_cents":12999,"stock":14,"description":"Birthstone jewelry set featuring 2.5mm genuine African amethyst open heart studs and a matching 4mm genuine African amethyst open heart pendant necklace in .925 sterling silver\nAmethyst is the February birthstone\nSweet, dainty jewelry gift for young girls, tweens, and teens\nEarrings have secure bullet backing; Necklace has 16\" rope chain with spring ring closure\nHand-crafted in pure .925 Sterling Silver; Rhodium plating added to enhance shine and durability\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Birthstone jewelry set featuring 2.5mm genuine African amethyst open heart studs and a matching 4mm genuine African amethyst open heart pendant necklace in .925 sterling silver\", \"Amethyst is the February birthstone\", \"Sweet, dainty jewelry gift for young girls, tweens, and teens\", \"Earrings have secure bullet backing; Necklace has 16\\\" rope chain with spring ring closure\", \"Hand-crafted in pure .925 Sterling Silver; Rhodium plating added to enhance shine and durability\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"delicate\", \"small\", \"tiny\", \"haert\", \"solitaire\", \"amythest\", \"amethysts\", \"holiday gift\", \"christmas\", \"christmas gift\", \"christmas present\", \"xmas\", \"chrismas\", \"hannukkah\", \"hanukkah gift\", \"chanukah\", \"hanukah\", \"hannukah\", \"gift guide\", \"holiday gift guide\"]","node_path":"Departments/Women/Jewelry/Jewelry Sets","created_at":"2023-12-16T15:19:29Z"}
