{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab4eb"},"product_id":575,"item_id":"B01JIWRUSA","category_id":239,"name":"Platinum-Plated Sterling Silver All-Around Band Ring set with Round Swarovski Zirconia (1/2 cttw), Size 8","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Platinum Plated Silver","weight_lb":"","price_cents":20999,"stock":150,"description":"All-around eternity band ring featuring set with round brilliant cut Swarovski Zirconia (1/2 cttw), the most brilliant simulated diamonds in the world\nMade from platinum plated .925 sterling silver ensures a comfortable fit and high quality product\nThis item runs large, size down.\nEach Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"All-around eternity band ring featuring set with round brilliant cut Swarovski Zirconia (1/2 cttw), the most brilliant simulated diamonds in the world\", \"Made from platinum plated .925 sterling silver ensures a comfortable fit and high quality product\", \"This item runs large, size down.\", \"Each Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"fine fashion\", \"fake diamond\", \"imitation diamond\", \"cheap diamond\", \"simulated diamond\", \"jewelry for women\", \"anniversary gifts for her\", \"jewlery\", \"cz ring^ imitation diamond ring^ cheap diamond rings^ cheap diamond ring^ simulated diamond ring\", \"swarovski crystal^ swarovski elements\"]","node_path":"Departments/Women/Jewelry/Rings/Bands","created_at":"2024-02-26T01:18:21Z"}
