{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab515"},"product_id":618,"item_id":"B01M4J1DDP","category_id":39,"name":"AmazonBasics USB 3.1 Type-C to 4 Port USB Hub - Black","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Black","weight_lb":0.15,"price_cents":1799,"stock":17,"description":"Transform a computer’s Type-C port into four individual USB Type-A 3.1 ports for connecting phones, keyboards and other peripherals\nFast USB data-transfer speed of up to 5 Gbps\nReversible design - easily insert the connector into any Type-C enabled device; supports USB 3.1 and is also backwards compatible with USB 2.0\nCompatible with Windows 10/8.1/8, Mac OS and Chrome; easy installation - no drivers or power adapters required\nComplete connection requires USB Type-A cables (sold separately); backed by an AmazonBasics 1-Year Limited Warranty","bullets":"[\"Transform a computer’s Type-C port into four individual USB Type-A 3.1 ports for connecting phones, keyboards and other peripherals\", \"Fast USB data-transfer speed of up to 5 Gbps\", \"Reversible design - easily insert the connector into any Type-C enabled device; supports USB 3.1 and is also backwards compatible with USB 2.0\", \"Compatible with Windows 10/8.1/8, Mac OS and Chrome; easy installation - no drivers or power adapters required\", \"Complete connection requires USB Type-A cables (sold separately); backed by an AmazonBasics 1-Year Limited Warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"usb hub c splitter extension adapter 3 anker 3.0 dock usb-c port extender powered dongle usbc satechi ps4 multi\", \"amazon basics\", \"basics\", \"4 usb charging adapter usb 3.0\", \"adapter hub usb c\", \"macbook usb c adapter\", \"macbook usb c hub\", \"type c hub\", \"type-c hub\", \"usb 3.0 hub\", \"usb c adapter\", \"usb c adapter hub\", \"usb c hub\", \"usb c macbook\", \"usb c port\", \"usb c port adaptor\", \"usb c ports\", \"usb hub\", \"usb hub 3.0 with type c\", \"usb hub type c\"]","node_path":"Products/Accessories/USB Hubs","created_at":"2023-05-07T22:01:58Z"}
