{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab517"},"product_id":621,"item_id":"B01M63YJ54","category_id":29,"name":"AmazonBasics Mini DisplayPort to HDMI DVI VGA Display Adapter - Black","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Black","weight_lb":0.15,"price_cents":3599,"stock":74,"description":"Male-to-female adapter connects computer with Mini DisplayPort or Thunderbolt 2 to an HDTV, monitor, or projector with HDMI/DVI-D/VGA\n3-in-1 convenience—use the HDMI, DVI, or VGA port; only 1 port works at a time\nTransmits audio and video with resolution up to 4K at 30Hz via HDMI, or 1920x1200 and 1080p (Full HD) via VGA/DVI (no audio output via DVI or VGA)\nPlug and play (no drivers required); separate HDMI/DVI/VGA cable required (sold separately); Black color\nFor Windows 10/8.1/8/7 and Mac OS 10.0 and above; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty","bullets":"[\"Male-to-female adapter connects computer with Mini DisplayPort or Thunderbolt 2 to an HDTV, monitor, or projector with HDMI/DVI-D/VGA\", \"3-in-1 convenience—use the HDMI, DVI, or VGA port; only 1 port works at a time\", \"Transmits audio and video with resolution up to 4K at 30Hz via HDMI, or 1920x1200 and 1080p (Full HD) via VGA/DVI (no audio output via DVI or VGA)\", \"Plug and play (no drivers required); separate HDMI/DVI/VGA cable required (sold separately); Black color\", \"For Windows 10/8.1/8/7 and Mac OS 10.0 and above; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"chromecast\", \"lightning\", \"thunderbolt\", \"apple tv\", \"remote\", \"adapter\"]","node_path":"Categories/Computers & Accessories/Accessories/Adapters/DVI-HDMI Adapters","created_at":"2023-02-26T00:13:56Z"}
