{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab547"},"product_id":668,"item_id":"B01N26B7LN","category_id":239,"name":"Yellow-Gold Plated Sterling Silver Princess-Cut Solitaire Ring made with Swarovski Zirconia (1 cttw), Size 7","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Yellow Gold Plated Silver","weight_lb":"","price_cents":28999,"stock":62,"description":"Princess brilliant cut ring set with Swarovski Zirconia (1 cttw), secured with 4 prongs\nYellow gold plated sterling silver band, size 7\nMust have piece for everyone's jewelry box\nEach Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Princess brilliant cut ring set with Swarovski Zirconia (1 cttw), secured with 4 prongs\", \"Yellow gold plated sterling silver band, size 7\", \"Must have piece for everyone's jewelry box\", \"Each Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"classics\"]","node_path":"Categories/Women/Rings","created_at":"2024-01-27T10:07:07Z"}
