{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab55b"},"product_id":688,"item_id":"B01N6S6Q4P","category_id":239,"name":"Platinum Plated Sterling Silver Swarovski Zirconia Channel Set Eternity Ring, Size 7","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Clear","weight_lb":0.01,"price_cents":28999,"stock":28,"description":"Platinum-Plated Sterling Silver ring set with All-Around Swarovski Zirconia (1.12 cttw)\nA size 7 ring\nThis jewelry design was manufactured with the highest quality standards. All efforts are being made to use sustainable resources and socially responsible providers.\nEach Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Platinum-Plated Sterling Silver ring set with All-Around Swarovski Zirconia (1.12 cttw)\", \"A size 7 ring\", \"This jewelry design was manufactured with the highest quality standards. All efforts are being made to use sustainable resources and socially responsible providers.\", \"Each Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark,