{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab59e"},"product_id":756,"item_id":"B06Y38FZ7K","category_id":203,"name":"AmazonBasics LED E14 Small Edison Screw Candle Bulb, 6W (Equivalent to 40W), Clear, Dimmable- Pack of 6","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Clear","weight_lb":0.4,"price_cents":999,"stock":7,"description":"With a life of 15,000 hours, the bulb will last over 13 years (based on 3 hours of use each day)\nProvides 470 lumens of light immediately, with no waiting time to warm up to full brightness\nWith a colour temperature of 2700 Kelvin, the bulb provides a warm white light, creating a comfortable atmosphere in any room\nUsing 6 watts of energy and just £0.92 per year to operate, this bulb saves up to 85% per year and £71.41 over its lifetime compared to its incandescent equivalent (based on 3 hours/day, 0.14 £/kWh; may vary depending on rates and use)\nHigh colour rendering (CRI > 80) provides vivid and natural colour; beam angle of 270 degrees for a wide flood light\nDimmable—easily create more or less light, depending on your mood and the desired ambiance","bullets":"[\"With a life of 15,000 hours, the bulb will last over 13 years (based on 3 hours of use each day)\", \"Provides 470 lumens of light immediately, with no waiting time to warm up to full brightness\", \"With a colour temperature of 2700 Kelvin, the bulb provides a warm white light, creating a comfortable atmosphere in any room\", \"Using 6 watts of energy and just £0.92 per year to operate, this bulb saves up to 85% per year and £71.41 over its lifetime compared to its incandescent equivalent (based on 3 hours/day, 0.14 £/kWh; may vary depending on rates and use)\", \"High colour rendering (CRI > 80) provides vivid and natural colour; beam angle of 270 degrees for a wide flood light\", \"Dimmable—easily create more or less light, depending on your mood and the desired ambiance\"]","keywords":"[\"bulbs daylight kitchen hue bridge global store\"]","node_path":"Categories/Light Bulbs/LED Bulbs","creat