{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab5b6"},"product_id":779,"item_id":"B0719WQ4GK","category_id":87,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Bryant Modern Accent Chair with Slipcover, 41.8\"W, Optic White","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Optic White","weight_lb":73.5,"price_cents":3699,"stock":20,"description":"Highly versatile, this chair will add a sleek modern appeal to any space in need of extra seating. A machine washable slipcover fits over the ultra-padded frame, making this piece just as comfortable as it is convenient.\n41.8\"W x 39.1\"D x 34.7\"H\nHardwood frame covered in blend of cotton, linen, viscose, polyester\nModern with classic touches\nClassic contemporary styling with straight lines and sturdy frame\nNo assembly required\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Highly versatile, this chair will add a sleek modern appeal to any space in need of extra seating. A machine washable slipcover fits over the ultra-padded frame, making this piece just as comfortable as it is convenient.\", \"41.8\\\"W x 39.1\\\"D x 34.7\\\"H\", \"Hardwood frame covered in blend of cotton, linen, viscose, polyester\", \"Modern with classic touches\", \"Classic contemporary styling with straight lines and sturdy frame\", \"No assembly required\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"living-room-chairs\", \"sectional sofa\", \"couch\", \"sofa\", \"accent chair\", \"recliner chair\", \"loveseat\", \"sleeper sofa\", \"sofa sets for living room\", \"chair\", \"sectional couch\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"optic white\", \"white\", \"living room chair\", \"gaming chair\", \"office chair\", \"hanging chair\"]","node_path":"Categories/Home Décor/Slipcovers/Armchair Slipcovers","created_at":"2024-03-28T19:18:36Z"}
