{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab5b9"},"product_id":782,"item_id":"B071FMSY5S","category_id":93,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Revolve Modern Upholstered Loveseat Sofa, 56\"W, Denim Blue","brand":"Rivet","color":"Denim","weight_lb":73.3,"price_cents":29999,"stock":1,"description":"This modern loveseat features simple lines and square armrests atop tall tapered legs, giving it a minimalist look that pairs well with most decor styles.\n56.3\"W x 34.6\"D x 35.4\"H\nHardwood frame, solid beech wood legs and durable polyester upholstery stand up to wear and tear\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less, just attach the legs that come zippered inside the product\nWipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-Year Warranty.","bullets":"[\"This modern loveseat features simple lines and square armrests atop tall tapered legs, giving it a minimalist look that pairs well with most decor styles.\", \"56.3\\\"W x 34.6\\\"D x 35.4\\\"H\", \"Hardwood frame, solid beech wood legs and durable polyester upholstery stand up to wear and tear\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less, just attach the legs that come zippered inside the product\", \"Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-Year Warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"sofas\", \"sectional sofa\", \"couch\", \"sofa\", \"accent chair\", \"recliner chair\", \"loveseat\", \"sleeper sofa\", \"sofa sets for living room\", \"chair\", \"sectional couch\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"denim\", \"blue\", \"futon\", \"sofa bed\", \"living room furniture\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Sofas & Couches","created_at":"2023-08-29T14:35:31Z"}
