{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab5c0"},"product_id":789,"item_id":"B071GKY7HW","category_id":265,"name":"Amazon Brand - Solimo 200-Watt 3-in-1 Hand Blender with Blending Jar, Chopper Bowl, Whisking Attachment","brand":"Amazon Brand - Solimo","color":"White","weight_lb":2.54,"price_cents":2999,"stock":5,"description":"Strong and sturdy blender with a 200 W powerful and efficient motor that can be used across a range of cooking needs\nDo not worry if you experience some burning smell when you run your blender for the 1st time .This is due to the motor varnish getting heated for the 1st time. The problem should not recur in subsequent uses.\nThis product is designed for 1 minute continuous use. If used for over 1 minute continuously, there is a risk of product failure. If you want to use it for more time, kindly wait for 2 mins before re-starting the product.\n2 speed power button switches (Low and Turbo) that will make your kitchen operations such as blending, chopping, whisking quick and easy\nWarranty: 1 year limited warranty. To claim it, please contact_us on: [1800-419-0416]\nFood safe, rust free stainless steel blending blades, whisk and chopper blades\nPower: 200 watts; Operating voltage: 220-240 volts; Easy to operate, clean with detachable and easily washable parts\nPack contents: 1 Hand blender, 1 Chopper Bowl with 500ml capacity, 1 Chopping Attachment, 1 Blending Jar with 600ml capacity, 1 Whisking Attachment, User Manual","bullets":"[\"Strong and sturdy blender with a 200 W powerful and efficient motor that can be used across a range of cooking needs\", \"Do not worry if you experience some burning smell when you run your blender for the 1st time .This is due to the motor varnish getting heated for the 1st time. The problem should not recur in subsequent uses.\", \"This product is designed for 1 minute continuous use. If used for over 1 minute continuously, there is a risk of product failure. If you want to use it for more time, kindly wait for 2 mins before re-starting the product.\", \"2 speed power button switches (Low and Turbo) that will make your kitchen operations such as blending, chopping, whisking quick and easy\", \"Warranty: 1 year limited warranty. To claim it, please contact_us on: [1800-419-0416]\", \"Food safe, rust free stainless steel blending blades, whisk and chopper blades\", \"Power: 200 watts; Operating voltage: 220-240 volts; Easy to operate, clean with detachable and easily washable parts\", \"Pack contents: 1 Hand blender, 1 Chopper Bowl with 500ml capacity, 1 Chopping Attachment, 1 Blending Jar with 600ml capacity, 1 Whisking Attachment, User Manual\"]","keywords":"[\"solimo\", \"hand blenders\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-02-13T20:38:19Z"}
