{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab5c4"},"product_id":791,"item_id":"B071GR84XN","category_id":238,"name":"14K Rose Gold Plated Sterling Silver Genuine Turquoise and Created Sapphire Evil Eye Bracelet, 7.25\" + 1\" Extender","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Blue","weight_lb":"","price_cents":19999,"stock":14,"description":"Bolo adjustable bracelet featuring an evil eye design with genuine stabilized turquoise, created white and blue sapphire stones, and gunmetal finish details in 14k rose gold plated sterling silver\nWear this evil eye jewelry as a symbol of protection\nPerfect jewelry gift to expand a woman's fashion wardrobe with a modern, on trend style\n7.25\" bracelet with 1\" extender and spring ring closure\nHand-crafted in pure .925 Sterling Silver; 14K Rose Gold plating added to enhance design and appearance\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Bolo adjustable bracelet featuring an evil eye design with genuine stabilized turquoise, created white and blue sapphire stones, and gunmetal finish details in 14k rose gold plated sterling silver\", \"Wear this evil eye jewelry as a symbol of protection\", \"Perfect jewelry gift to expand a woman's fashion wardrobe with a modern, on trend style\", \"7.25\\\" bracelet with 1\\\" extender and spring ring closure\", \"Hand-crafted in pure .925 Sterling Silver; 14K Rose Gold plating added to enhance design and appearance\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"gift for woman\", \"gifts for women\", \"gifts for her\", \"romantic gift\", \"birthday\", \"birthday gift\", \"birthday present\", \"anniversary\", \"aniversary\", \"anniversary gift\", \"anniversary present\", \"holiday\", \"holiday gift\", \"holiday present\", \"valentine’s day\", \"valentines day\", \"valentine’s day gift\", \"valentine’s day gift for her\", \"mother’s day\", \"mothers day\"]","node_path":"Departments/Women/Jewelry/Bracelets","created_at":"2023-04-15T22:28:26Z"}
