{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab5c8"},"product_id":797,"item_id":"B071J4SDZZ","category_id":213,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Muted Boho Rug, 7'6 x 9'6, Off-white","brand":"Rivet","color":"Cream","weight_lb":60.0,"price_cents":14999,"stock":69,"description":"Pile: 100% Polypropylene, Backing: 100% Jute\nImported\nBring Bohemian design into your living room with the detailed design of this cream rug. Constructed of 100% polypropylene, its soft, yet low pile, makes it the perfect addition to your busy home.\nBohemian design in cream\nPower-loomed fibers\nLow, 0.2\" pile suits high-traffic, transitional indoor areas\nPair with a rug pad (sold separately).\n7'6\" x 9'6\"\nShips tightly rolled in a protective bag.","bullets":"[\"Pile: 100% Polypropylene, Backing: 100% Jute\", \"Imported\", \"Bring Bohemian design into your living room with the detailed design of this cream rug. Constructed of 100% polypropylene, its soft, yet low pile, makes it the perfect addition to your busy home.\", \"Bohemian design in cream\", \"Power-loomed fibers\", \"Low, 0.2\\\" pile suits high-traffic, transitional indoor areas\", \"Pair with a rug pad (sold separately).\", \"7'6\\\" x 9'6\\\"\", \"Ships tightly rolled in a protective bag.\"]","keywords":"[\"area-rugs\", \"area rugs\", \"rugs\", \"rug\", \"area rug\", \"rugs for living room\", \"area rugs 8x10 clearance\", \"outdoor rug\", \"area rugs 5x7 clearance under 50\", \"8x10 area rug\", \"area rugs 8x10\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"cream\", \"grey\", \"8'x10'\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-04-05T12:58:28Z"}
