{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab5d9"},"product_id":814,"item_id":"B071QWKMLC","category_id":42,"name":"AmazonBasics iPad Pro PU Leather Case with Auto Wake/Sleep Cover, Black, 12.9\"","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Black","weight_lb":0.86,"price_cents":3599,"stock":85,"description":"12.9-inch faux-leather case for 2017 iPad Pro 12.9-inch; offers sleek look, nonslip grip, and screen protection\nAutomatic sleep/wake cover functionality; provides full access to device’s buttons and ports (no need to remove the case)\nIntegrated magnets keep cover lightly closed; elastic stylus holder included on the side\nCover folds horizontally for use as a stand; stylish Black color\nFor customer service and warranty related queries please contact_us: [1800-419-0416] (available Monday to Saturday from 9:30 AM to 6:00 PM except national holidays)","bullets":"[\"12.9-inch faux-leather case for 2017 iPad Pro 12.9-inch; offers sleek look, nonslip grip, and screen protection\", \"Automatic sleep/wake cover functionality; provides full access to device’s buttons and ports (no need to remove the case)\", \"Integrated magnets keep cover lightly closed; elastic stylus holder included on the side\", \"Cover folds horizontally for use as a stand; stylish Black color\", \"For customer service and warranty related queries please contact_us: [1800-419-0416] (available Monday to Saturday from 9:30 AM to 6:00 PM except national holidays)\"]","keywords":"[\"ipad cover\", \"ipad leather case\", \"ipad leather cover\", \"ipad foldable cover\", \"ipad cover 7th generation\", \"ipad cover 6th generation\", \"ipad cover 10.5 inch\", \"ipad case 9.7 inch\", \"ipad covers\", \"ipad air covers and cases\"]","node_path":"Categories/Accessories & Peripherals/Tablet Accessories/Bags,Cases & Sleeves/Cases","created_at":"2024-04-06T19:28:23Z"}
