{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab5db"},"product_id":816,"item_id":"B071S5F4CS","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Hobbs Mesh Cage Pendant Ceiling Chandelier Fixture With Light Bulb - 7.75 Inch Shade, 20.5 - 60.5 Inch Cord, Oil-Rubbed Bronze","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Oil-rubbed Bronze","weight_lb":"","price_cents":11999,"stock":9,"description":"A bit of vintage and a touch of industrial come together in this cage pendant chandelier. A vintage bulb is housed inside an oil-rubbed bronze fixture with metal mesh. The cord can be adjusted to just the right height for a kitchen island.\n7.75\" Diameter. Included rods can adjust height from 20.5\" to 60.5\".\nMetal fixture with bronzed finish and metal mesh\nFarmhouse and modern touches make this piece blend with any style.\n60-watt vintage bulb included\nIntended for indoor use only\nProfessional installation recommended","bullets":"[\"A bit of vintage and a touch of industrial come together in this cage pendant chandelier. A vintage bulb is housed inside an oil-rubbed bronze fixture with metal mesh. The cord can be adjusted to just the right height for a kitchen island.\", \"7.75\\\" Diameter. Included rods can adjust height from 20.5\\\" to 60.5\\\".\", \"Metal fixture with bronzed finish and metal mesh\", \"Farmhouse and modern touches make this piece blend with any style.\", \"60-watt vintage bulb included\", \"Intended for indoor use only\", \"Professional installation recommended\"]","keywords":"[\"ceiling-pendant-fixtures\", \"pendant lighting\", \"ceiling light\", \"chandeliers\", \"light fixtures ceiling\", \"wall sconce\", \"kitchen light fixtures\", \"flush mount light fixture\", \"flush mount ceiling light\", \"wall lamp\", \"bathroom light fixtures\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"oil rubbed bronze\", \"black\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Ceiling Lights/Pendant Lights","created_at":"2023-01-04T20:43:46Z"}
