{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab5de"},"product_id":819,"item_id":"B071VMNJXM","category_id":194,"name":"AmazonBasics Heat Insulating Blackout Curtain, 1 Piece, 135 x 244 cm (WxL), Spa Blue","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Spa Blue","weight_lb":2.57,"price_cents":4399,"stock":0,"description":"Blackout curtain blocks out sunlight and harmful UV rays, reduces outside noise, and ensures total privacy\nCreates energy-saving insulating barrier against heat and cold, keeping room cooler in the summer and warmer in the winter\n1 panel made of innovative triple-weave fabric; no stiff liner; elegantly frames windows with a sophisticated drape\nRod pocket fits any standard or decorative rod; includes 1 hook tape tie for pulling back the curtain\nMeasures 134.5 x 244 cm; machine washable\nThis curtain has several pockets at the top and bottom","bullets":"[\"Blackout curtain blocks out sunlight and harmful UV rays, reduces outside noise, and ensures total privacy\", \"Creates energy-saving insulating barrier against heat and cold, keeping room cooler in the summer and warmer in the winter\", \"1 panel made of innovative triple-weave fabric; no stiff liner; elegantly frames windows with a sophisticated drape\", \"Rod pocket fits any standard or decorative rod; includes 1 hook tape tie for pulling back the curtain\", \"Measures 134.5 x 244 cm; machine washable\", \"This curtain has several pockets at the top and bottom\"]","keywords":"[\"blackout curtain lining black out curtian curtains for bedroom\"]","node_path":"Categories/Home Décor/Window Treatments/Draperies & Curtains","created_at":"2024-02-13T08:19:32Z"}
