{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab5fc"},"product_id":849,"item_id":"B0723DFX97","category_id":213,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Textured Pattern Farmhouse Wool Area Rug, 5' x 7' 6\", Aqua","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Aqua","weight_lb":29.0,"price_cents":12999,"stock":4,"description":"76% Wool, 24% Rayon\nImported\nMake a distinctive style statement with this unique rug in a tranquil aqua hue. It features a subtle diamond pattern crafted from blended fibers that are processed with a special dye technique, resulting in alluring texture and tone.\nEye-catching style for casual spaces\nHand woven. Made in India.\nIdeal for any furnished area in high traffic rooms\n5' x 7'6\"\nPairs with a rug pad (sold separately)\nShips tightly rolled in a protective bag\nUnroll, allow a few days for natural fibers to settle.","bullets":"[\"76% Wool, 24% Rayon\", \"Imported\", \"Make a distinctive style statement with this unique rug in a tranquil aqua hue. It features a subtle diamond pattern crafted from blended fibers that are processed with a special dye technique, resulting in alluring texture and tone.\", \"Eye-catching style for casual spaces\", \"Hand woven. Made in India.\", \"Ideal for any furnished area in high traffic rooms\", \"5' x 7'6\\\"\", \"Pairs with a rug pad (sold separately)\", \"Ships tightly rolled in a protective bag\", \"Unroll, allow a few days for natural fibers to settle.\"]","keywords":"[\"area-rugs\", \"area rugs\", \"rugs\", \"rug\", \"area rug\", \"rugs for living room\", \"area rugs 8x10 clearance\", \"outdoor rug\", \"area rugs 5x7 clearance under 50\", \"8x10 area rug\", \"area rugs 8x10\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"aqua\", \"blue\", \"5'x7'6\\\"\", \"wool rug\", \"wool rugs\", \"wool rugs 8x10\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-10-02T22:43:54Z"}
