{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab5ff"},"product_id":852,"item_id":"B0723H8JP1","category_id":91,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Bradbury Chesterfield Modern Tufted Ottoman, 30.3\"W, Navy","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Navy","weight_lb":29.7,"price_cents":6499,"stock":47,"description":"This classic, tailored ottoman is the perfect place for extra guests to sit or to rest your feet after a long day. Simple modern design in a magnificent deep navy color adds just the right pop of color.\nDimensions: 22.4”D x 30.3 ”W x 19.7”H\nSolid and engineered hardwoods; polyester/nylon fabric\nTimeless and functional\nRefreshed design of a classic\nMinimal assembly; just attach legs\nFree returns for 30 days. 3 year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This classic, tailored ottoman is the perfect place for extra guests to sit or to rest your feet after a long day. Simple modern design in a magnificent deep navy color adds just the right pop of color.\", \"Dimensions: 22.4”D x 30.3 ”W x 19.7”H\", \"Solid and engineered hardwoods; polyester/nylon fabric\", \"Timeless and functional\", \"Refreshed design of a classic\", \"Minimal assembly; just attach legs\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3 year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"ottomans\", \"ottoman\", \"storage ottoman\", \"ottoman with storage\", \"storage bench\", \"pouf ottoman\", \"bench\", \"ottoman foot rest\", \"pouf\", \"ottoman coffee table\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"navy\", \"blue\", \"round ottoman\", \"foot ottoman\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Accent Furniture/Ottomans","created_at":"2023-12-21T05:09:39Z"}
