{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab601"},"product_id":854,"item_id":"B0725Z2499","category_id":79,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Parson King Wood Bed with Headboard, 80.5\"W, Natural","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Brown","weight_lb":80.0,"price_cents":46999,"stock":194,"description":"This design is modern farmhouse at its best. Oak veneer gives a distinctive grain to the tall headboard and low-profile footboard. The natural beauty and cozy feel of this piece will have you looking forward to bedtime.\n80.5\"W x 86\"L x 56\"H\nSolid hardwood with hand-selected oak veneer\nThis rustic bed has the look of natural reclaimed wood with distressed finish.\nFive slats with two legs each sturdily support a mattress and boxspring (sold separately).\nSimple assembly in 15-30 minutes\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This design is modern farmhouse at its best. Oak veneer gives a distinctive grain to the tall headboard and low-profile footboard. The natural beauty and cozy feel of this piece will have you looking forward to bedtime.\", \"80.5\\\"W x 86\\\"L x 56\\\"H\", \"Solid hardwood with hand-selected oak veneer\", \"This rustic bed has the look of natural reclaimed wood with distressed finish.\", \"Five slats with two legs each sturdily support a mattress and boxspring (sold separately).\", \"Simple assembly in 15-30 minutes\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"beds\", \"bed frame\", \"queen bed frame\", \"twin bed frame\", \"king bed frame\", \"headboards for queen beds\", \"platform bed frame\", \"daybed\", \"queen headboard\", \"bed\", \"bed frame queen\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"brown\", \"king\", \"metal beds\", \"queen bedset\", \"king platform beds\", \"king beds\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Bedroom Furniture/Beds, Frames & Bases/Beds","created_at":"2024-02-06T03:22:41Z"}
