{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab608"},"product_id":861,"item_id":"B0728NVXWL","category_id":90,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Hoffman Down-Filled Performance Fabric Sofa Couch, 97\"W, Ecru","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Ecru","weight_lb":143.0,"price_cents":10999,"stock":23,"description":"Whatever you need to accommodate kids, pets, spills and every other facet of a busy life, this sofa has it all: Plush comfort, stain-resistant fabric, durable construction, and a timeless look to blend with your existing styles.\n97”W x 39.5”D x 37”H\nSolid hardwood frame with Revolution Performance Fabric\nModern casual\nExceptional comfort with high performance polypropylene fabric for heavy wear.\nNo assembly required\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Whatever you need to accommodate kids, pets, spills and every other facet of a busy life, this sofa has it all: Plush comfort, stain-resistant fabric, durable construction, and a timeless look to blend with your existing styles.\", \"97”W x 39.5”D x 37”H\", \"Solid hardwood frame with Revolution Performance Fabric\", \"Modern casual\", \"Exceptional comfort with high performance polypropylene fabric for heavy wear.\", \"No assembly required\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"sofas\", \"sectional sofa\", \"couch\", \"sofa\", \"accent chair\", \"recliner chair\", \"loveseat\", \"sleeper sofa\", \"sofa sets for living room\", \"chair\", \"sectional couch\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"ecru\", \"ivory\", \"97\\\" sofa\", \"sofa bedsofa cover\", \"sofa table\", \"outdoor sofa\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Accent Furniture","created_at":"2023-04-13T20:33:20Z"}
