{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab615"},"product_id":874,"item_id":"B072KL3FM3","category_id":235,"name":"Platinum-Plated Sterling Silver Freshwater Cultured Pearl with Fancy Pink Color Swarovski Zirconia Earring Jacket","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Fancy Pink","weight_lb":"","price_cents":13999,"stock":0,"description":"Plated sterling silver ear jacket earring with center cultured pearl and prong-set cubic zirconia border\nVersatile styling allows you to either wear both pieces together, or just the stud depending on your mood or occasion\nThe drop is adjustable to three different positions\nEach Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Plated sterling silver ear jacket earring with center cultured pearl and prong-set cubic zirconia border\", \"Versatile styling allows you to either wear both pieces together, or just the stud depending on your mood or occasion\", \"The drop is adjustable to three different positions\", \"Each Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"fine fashion\"]","node_path":"Categories/Women/Jewellery/Earring Jackets","created_at":"2023-09-21T14:56:23Z"}
