{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab643"},"product_id":920,"item_id":"B0732FTB3W","category_id":213,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Braided Jute Area Rug, 5 x 8 Foot, Smoke","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Smoke","weight_lb":23.6,"price_cents":9199,"stock":39,"description":"70% Jute, 30% Cotton\nImported\nThe simple, hand-woven pattern of this rug brings a casual feel to your living spaces. The natural color variations of braided jute add texture and distinctive style in your home.\nCasual, neutral style\nHand woven in India. Jute and cotton blend.\nDurable yet soft\n5' x 8'\nPairs with a rug pad (sold separately)\nShips tightly rolled in a protective bag\nUnroll, allow a few days for natural fibers to settle.","bullets":"[\"70% Jute, 30% Cotton\", \"Imported\", \"The simple, hand-woven pattern of this rug brings a casual feel to your living spaces. The natural color variations of braided jute add texture and distinctive style in your home.\", \"Casual, neutral style\", \"Hand woven in India. Jute and cotton blend.\", \"Durable yet soft\", \"5' x 8'\", \"Pairs with a rug pad (sold separately)\", \"Ships tightly rolled in a protective bag\", \"Unroll, allow a few days for natural fibers to settle.\"]","keywords":"[\"area-rugs\", \"area rugs\", \"rugs\", \"rug\", \"area rug\", \"rugs for living room\", \"area rugs 8x10 clearance\", \"outdoor rug\", \"area rugs 5x7 clearance under 50\", \"8x10 area rug\", \"area rugs 8x10\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"smoke\", \"grey\", \"5' x 8'\", \"wool rug\", \"wool rugs\", \"wool rugs 8x10\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-01-22T10:03:35Z"}
