{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab64f"},"product_id":932,"item_id":"B07356T6XN","category_id":239,"name":"Halo Platinum Plated Sterling Silver Swarovski Crystal Flower Ring","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Rose Gold","weight_lb":"","price_cents":31999,"stock":66,"description":"Flower Ring with Swarovski Zirconia\nEach ring has two Swarovski Zirconia bracelets.\nEach Swarovski zirconia is engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world.\nImported.\nThese silver pieces are built for durability. This piece has a metal coating or flashing or electroplating for a more radiant look, but it can wear out for prolonged or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items, keep your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a bag or airtight box and avoid the plates rubbing together. Also try to avoid exposure to detergents and perfumes, which can both adversely affect your objects. Your local jeweller can tell you where to send your jewelry if you ever want to replace it again.","bullets":"[\"Flower Ring with Swarovski Zirconia\", \"Each ring has two Swarovski Zirconia bracelets.\", \"Each Swarovski zirconia is engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world.\", \"Imported.\", \"These silver pieces are built for durability. This piece has a metal coating or flashing or electroplating for a more radiant look, but it can wear out for prolonged or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items, keep your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a bag or airtight box and avoid the plates rubbing together. Also try to avoid exposure to detergents and perfumes, which can both adversely affect your objects. Your local jeweller can tell you where to send your jewelry if you ever want to replace it again.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-04-30T07:04:27Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab650"},"product_id":934,"item_id":"B073593M33","category_id":239,"name":"Rose Gold-Plated Sterling Silver Swarovski Zirconia Round-Cut Halo Ring (1.95 cttw), Size 6","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"White","weight_lb":"","price_cents":52999,"stock":75,"description":"Round brilliant cut Zirconia center piece from Swarovski, framed in a halo set with Swarovski Zirconia\nEach ring is made from sterling silver plated in rose gold and features additional stones on the shank\nClassic look versatile for both the everyday as well as special occasions\nEach Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Round brilliant cut Zirconia center piece from Swarovski, framed in a halo set with Swarovski Zirconia\", \"Each ring is made from sterling silver plated in rose gold and features additional stones on the shank\", \"Classic look versatile for both the everyday as well as special occasions\", \"Each Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"classics\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-06-28T01:27:06Z"}
