{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab658"},"product_id":941,"item_id":"B0735RJPCY","category_id":213,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Geometric Boho Bohemian Wool Area Rug, 5 x 8 Foot, Cream with Blue","brand":"Rivet","color":"Cream With Blue","weight_lb":35.2,"price_cents":15999,"stock":17,"description":"85% Wool 15% Cotton\nImported\nThis contemporary rug shines with bohemian appeal. Its wool, hand-tufted construction makes it soft, versatile and durable so that you may enjoy it in any room for years to come.\nArea rug features a modern, globally inspired pattern\nHand-tufted.\nPlush .6'' pile suits medium-traffic, indoor areas\nPair with a rug pad (sold separately)\n5' x 8'\nShips tightly rolled in a protective bag\nUnroll, allow a few days for natural fibers to settle","bullets":"[\"85% Wool 15% Cotton\", \"Imported\", \"This contemporary rug shines with bohemian appeal. Its wool, hand-tufted construction makes it soft, versatile and durable so that you may enjoy it in any room for years to come.\", \"Area rug features a modern, globally inspired pattern\", \"Hand-tufted.\", \"Plush .6'' pile suits medium-traffic, indoor areas\", \"Pair with a rug pad (sold separately)\", \"5' x 8'\", \"Ships tightly rolled in a protective bag\", \"Unroll, allow a few days for natural fibers to settle\"]","keywords":"[\"area-rugs\", \"area rugs\", \"rugs\", \"rug\", \"area rug\", \"rugs for living room\", \"area rugs 8x10 clearance\", \"outdoor rug\", \"area rugs 5x7 clearance under 50\", \"8x10 area rug\", \"area rugs 8x10\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"cream with blue\", \"ivory\", \"5'x8'\", \"wool rug\", \"wool rugs\", \"wool rugs 8x10\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-06-18T13:39:52Z"}
