{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab65a"},"product_id":943,"item_id":"B0735SLBYK","category_id":213,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Global Ikat Wool Area Rug, 4 x 6 Foot, Blue","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"","weight_lb":8.4,"price_cents":7499,"stock":22,"description":"80% Wool 20% Cotton\nImported\nIkat geometric patterns in this rug will be an eye-catching focal point in your room. This blue, grey and green rug will pull together a living area or make a style statement in an entryway. The 100% wool pile is durable for a busy family.\n4' x 6'\nHand-tufted in India\nMedium pile height makes it durable and easy to vacuum\nVacuum, professionally clean\nPair with a rug pad, which is sold separately\nShips tightly rolled in a protective bag","bullets":"[\"80% Wool 20% Cotton\", \"Imported\", \"Ikat geometric patterns in this rug will be an eye-catching focal point in your room. This blue, grey and green rug will pull together a living area or make a style statement in an entryway. The 100% wool pile is durable for a busy family.\", \"4' x 6'\", \"Hand-tufted in India\", \"Medium pile height makes it durable and easy to vacuum\", \"Vacuum, professionally clean\", \"Pair with a rug pad, which is sold separately\", \"Ships tightly rolled in a protective bag\"]","keywords":"[\"area-rugs\", \"area rugs\", \"rugs\", \"rug\", \"area rug\", \"rugs for living room\", \"area rugs 8x10 clearance\", \"outdoor rug\", \"area rugs 5x7 clearance under 50\", \"8x10 area rug\", \"area rugs 8x10\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"4' x 6'\", \"wool rug\", \"wool rugs\", \"wool rugs 8x10\", \"safavieh wool rug\", \"wool carpet\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-02-03T17:33:43Z"}
