{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab65f"},"product_id":948,"item_id":"B07374C6R9","category_id":200,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Glass Column Living Room Standing Floor Lamp With Light Bulb and Linen Shade, 59\"H, Black","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Black","weight_lb":16.1,"price_cents":6499,"stock":32,"description":"This floor lamp is sure to turn heads with its impressive style. A black metal pole stands within a clear glass column for a sleek look\nBold modern design\nBlack metal and glass column, textured linen shade\nIdeal for any room needing a spark of style along with light\nDimensions: 59\"H x 13''W x 13\"D\nSimple assembly\nIntended for indoor use only","bullets":"[\"This floor lamp is sure to turn heads with its impressive style. A black metal pole stands within a clear glass column for a sleek look\", \"Bold modern design\", \"Black metal and glass column, textured linen shade\", \"Ideal for any room needing a spark of style along with light\", \"Dimensions: 59\\\"H x 13''W x 13\\\"D\", \"Simple assembly\", \"Intended for indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"floor-lamps\", \"floor lamp\", \"lamp\", \"table lamp\", \"desk lamp\", \"lamps\", \"floor lamps for living room\", \"lamps for bedrooms\", \"lamps for living room\", \"salt lamp\", \"table lamps\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"black\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Lamps & Shades/Floor Lamps","created_at":"2023-10-10T14:00:58Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab660"},"product_id":949,"item_id":"B07374K53B","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Metal Wall Mount Sconce Fixture With Light Bulb And Glass Shade - 16 x 8 x 10 Inches, Brushed Brass","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Brushed Brass","weight_lb":2.8,"price_cents":7699,"stock":48,"description":"A clean, simple design makes this attractive modern sconce a welcome addition to a bedroom. It mounts easily on a wall to shed pleasing light on your bedtime reading.\nModern, clean style\nMetal hardware with brushed brass finish and glass shade\nMounts in places inconvenient for a lamp or chandelier, such as over a bed\n16\"H x 8\"W x 10\"D\nProduct is hardwired (professional installation recommended)\nIntended for indoor use only","bullets":"[\"A clean, simple design makes this attractive modern sconce a welcome addition to a bedroom. It mounts easily on a wall to shed pleasing light on your bedtime reading.\", \"Modern, clean style\", \"Metal hardware with brushed brass finish and glass shade\", \"Mounts in places inconvenient for a lamp or chandelier, such as over a bed\", \"16\\\"H x 8\\\"W x 10\\\"D\", \"Product is hardwired (professional installation recommended)\", \"Intended for indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"wall-sconces\", \"pendant lighting\", \"ceiling light\", \"chandeliers\", \"light fixtures ceiling\", \"wall sconce\", \"kitchen light fixtures\", \"flush mount light fixture\", \"flush mount ceiling light\", \"wall lamp\", \"bathroom light fixtures\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"brushed brass\", \"gold\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Wall Lights/Wall Lamps & Sconces","created_at":"2023-10-11T17:17:33Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab661"},"product_id":950,"item_id":"B07374K53C","category_id":200,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Ceramic Geometric Cut-Out Table Desk Lamp With LED Light Bulb, 25\"H, White","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Polished Nickel","weight_lb":3.3,"price_cents":6199,"stock":0,"description":"This lamp will bring a touch of glamorous style to your living room or bedroom. The Off White ceramic pillar has geometric cut-outs for an artistic flair. A wide linen shade tops off this modern but graceful style.\nCeramic base, polished nickel hardware, and Off White linen shade\nLED bulb included\nSimple assembly\n25\"H x 13\"W x 13\"D\nFor indoor use only","bullets":"[\"This lamp will bring a touch of glamorous style to your living room or bedroom. The Off White ceramic pillar has geometric cut-outs for an artistic flair. A wide linen shade tops off this modern but graceful style.\", \"Ceramic base, polished nickel hardware, and Off White linen shade\", \"LED bulb included\", \"Simple assembly\", \"25\\\"H x 13\\\"W x 13\\\"D\", \"For indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"table-lamps\", \"floor lamp\", \"lamp\", \"table lamp\", \"desk lamp\", \"lamps\", \"floor lamps for living room\", \"lamps for bedrooms\", \"lamps for living room\", \"salt lamp\", \"table lamps\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"polished nickel\", \"ivory\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Lamps & Shades/Table Lamps","created_at":"2023-12-20T01:56:57Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab662"},"product_id":951,"item_id":"B07374M9ZT","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet 5-Arm Mid Century Modern Ceiling Pendant Chandelier Fixture With 5 Light Bulbs - 20 x 20 x 36 Inches, Black and Brass Finish","brand":"Rivet","color":"Antique Brass","weight_lb":3.6,"price_cents":5899,"stock":18,"description":"This glamorous pendant chandelier with 5 arms will illuminate quiet nights at home or social times with friends and family. This fixture works well in a kitchen or living room and has classic elements to blend with your existing style. Product is hardwired (professional installation recommended).\nSleek, simple and easy style\nMetal with black and antique brass finishes\nAdds fun, fresh industrial style along with light\n20''Wx20''Dx36''H\nProduct is hardwired (professional installation recommended)\nIncludes five 15 watt bulbs","bullets":"[\"This glamorous pendant chandelier with 5 arms will illuminate quiet nights at home or social times with friends and family. This fixture works well in a kitchen or living room and has classic elements to blend with your existing style. Product is hardwired (professional installation recommended).\", \"Sleek, simple and easy style\", \"Metal with black and antique brass finishes\", \"Adds fun, fresh industrial style along with light\", \"20''Wx20''Dx36''H\", \"Product is hardwired (professional installation recommended)\", \"Includes five 15 watt bulbs\"]","keywords":"[\"chandeliers\", \"chandelier\", \"crystal chandelier\", \"ceiling light\", \"dining room lighting fixtures hanging\", \"pendant lighting\", \"chandeliers for dining rooms\", \"light fixtures ceiling\", \"lighting\", \"modern chandelier\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"antique brass\", \"gold\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Ceiling Lights/Chandeliers","created_at":"2024-06-21T16:02:42Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab663"},"product_id":952,"item_id":"B07374VCVN","category_id":200,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Copper Geometric Bedside Table Desk Lamp With Light Bulb - 16.75 Inches, Copper","brand":"Rivet","color":"Copper","weight_lb":6.0,"price_cents":7599,"stock":18,"description":"Glamorous, modern style\nPolyresin, multi-faceted base with a copper finish and smooth linen shade\nAdds polish and high style to your room\n11.5\"Wx11.5\"Dx16.75\"H\nFast & easy assembly\nAdd some glam to your room with this fashionable contemporary table lamp. The multi-faceted geometric base has a copper finish that pairs well with dark furniture for that modern look.","bullets":"[\"Glamorous, modern style\", \"Polyresin, multi-faceted base with a copper finish and smooth linen shade\", \"Adds polish and high style to your room\", \"11.5\\\"Wx11.5\\\"Dx16.75\\\"H\", \"Fast & easy assembly\", \"Add some glam to your room with this fashionable contemporary table lamp. The multi-faceted geometric base has a copper finish that pairs well with dark furniture for that modern look.\"]","keywords":"[\"table-lamps\", \"floor lamp\", \"lamp\", \"table lamp\", \"desk lamp\", \"lamps\", \"floor lamps for living room\", \"lamps for bedrooms\", \"lamps for living room\", \"salt lamp\", \"table lamps\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"copper\", \"gold\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Lamps & Shades/Table Lamps","created_at":"2023-01-15T06:51:48Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab664"},"product_id":953,"item_id":"B07376VCCS","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Eclipse Mid Century Modern 5-Globe Hanging Ceiling Pendant Chandelier Fixture - 30 x 12 x 36 Inches, Brass with Frosted Glass Globes","brand":"Rivet","color":"Brushed Brass","weight_lb":17.7,"price_cents":9099,"stock":28,"description":"Contemporary, sleek globe pendant lights add high style and a touch of glamour to your get-togethers with friends. A rectangular canopy with five hanging lights makes for high-impact illumination over your drinks and appetizers. Product is hardwired (professional installation recommended).\nClassic and modern style\nBrass finish on metal with frosted glass globes\nAdds stylish flair along with light to your kitchen or bar area\n30''Wx12''Dx36''H\nProduct is hardwired (professional installation recommended)","bullets":"[\"Contemporary, sleek globe pendant lights add high style and a touch of glamour to your get-togethers with friends. A rectangular canopy with five hanging lights makes for high-impact illumination over your drinks and appetizers. Product is hardwired (professional installation recommended).\", \"Classic and modern style\", \"Brass finish on metal with frosted glass globes\", \"Adds stylish flair along with light to your kitchen or bar area\", \"30''Wx12''Dx36''H\", \"Product is hardwired (professional installation recommended)\"]","keywords":"[\"chandeliers\", \"chandelier\", \"crystal chandelier\", \"ceiling light\", \"dining room lighting fixtures hanging\", \"pendant lighting\", \"chandeliers for dining rooms\", \"light fixtures ceiling\", \"lighting\", \"modern chandelier\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"brushed brass\", \"gold\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Ceiling Lights/Chandeliers","created_at":"2023-05-18T08:20:39Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab665"},"product_id":954,"item_id":"B073771JBV","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Modern Satellite 15 Globe Ceiling Pendant Chandelier Fixture With Light Bulbs - 9.75 x 9.75 x 44.75 Inches, Black","brand":"Rivet","color":"Black","weight_lb":6.0,"price_cents":9499,"stock":13,"description":"This globe light pendant chandelier will provide a focal point to any room. The 15-bulbed fixture spreads plenty of light throughout your space, whether you're having a quiet meal with your significant other or entertaining a roomful of guests. Product is hardwired (professional installation recommended).\nModern, edgy style\nMetal with black finish\nAdds polish and high style along with light\n9.75''Wx9.75''Dx44.75''H\nProduct is hardwired (professional installation recommended)","bullets":"[\"This globe light pendant chandelier will provide a focal point to any room. The 15-bulbed fixture spreads plenty of light throughout your space, whether you're having a quiet meal with your significant other or entertaining a roomful of guests. Product is hardwired (professional installation recommended).\", \"Modern, edgy style\", \"Metal with black finish\", \"Adds polish and high style along with light\", \"9.75''Wx9.75''Dx44.75''H\", \"Product is hardwired (professional installation recommended)\"]","keywords":"[\"chandeliers\", \"chandelier\", \"crystal chandelier\", \"ceiling light\", \"dining room lighting fixtures hanging\", \"pendant lighting\", \"chandeliers for dining rooms\", \"light fixtures ceiling\", \"lighting\", \"modern chandelier\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"black\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Ceiling Lights/Chandeliers","created_at":"2023-06-01T10:06:42Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab666"},"product_id":955,"item_id":"B0737756WD","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Deco Black Accordion Arm Wall Mount Sconce Light Fixture with Metal Shade - 20 x 28 x 6 Inches, Dark Bronze with Brass Accent","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Black","weight_lb":7.1,"price_cents":8999,"stock":5,"description":"This cleverly designed sconce mounts easily on a wall to bring light to spots that may not be convenient for a lamp or chandelier. Accordion-like hardware allows it to be pulled out and pushed back to suit your needs -- for more light or more space!\nModern, clean style\nMetal hardware and shade with black finish, brass accent, and on/off switch on cord\nStrong modern style that adjusts in and out to meet your space needs\n20\"H x 28\"W x 6\"D\nSimple assembly (plug into existing outlet--no hardwiring required)\nIntended for indoor use only","bullets":"[\"This cleverly designed sconce mounts easily on a wall to bring light to spots that may not be convenient for a lamp or chandelier. Accordion-like hardware allows it to be pulled out and pushed back to suit your needs -- for more light or more space!\", \"Modern, clean style\", \"Metal hardware and shade with black finish, brass accent, and on/off switch on cord\", \"Strong modern style that adjusts in and out to meet your space needs\", \"20\\\"H x 28\\\"W x 6\\\"D\", \"Simple assembly (plug into existing outlet--no hardwiring required)\", \"Intended for indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"wall-sconces\", \"pendant lighting\", \"ceiling light\", \"chandeliers\", \"light fixtures ceiling\", \"wall sconce\", \"kitchen light fixtures\", \"flush mount light fixture\", \"flush mount ceiling light\", \"wall lamp\", \"bathroom light fixtures\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"black\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Wall Lights/Wall Lamps & Sconces","created_at":"2023-12-21T21:55:34Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab667"},"product_id":956,"item_id":"B073G6T3HK","category_id":91,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Benton Square Ottoman, 35\"W, Midnight","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Midnight","weight_lb":31.0,"price_cents":21999,"stock":83,"description":"A perfect combination of style and practicality, this modern square ottoman is a great addition to any seating area. Its generous size and sturdy build allow it to work as a comfy footrest or a place to rest a tray of snacks.\n35\"W x 35\"D x 16\"H\nSolid pine frame and legs with polyester fabric\nModern casual\nPractical design for use as extra seating or a footrest\nMinimal assembly required\nMade-to-order\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"A perfect combination of style and practicality, this modern square ottoman is a great addition to any seating area. Its generous size and sturdy build allow it to work as a comfy footrest or a place to rest a tray of snacks.\", \"35\\\"W x 35\\\"D x 16\\\"H\", \"Solid pine frame and legs with polyester fabric\", \"Modern casual\", \"Practical design for use as extra seating or a footrest\", \"Minimal assembly required\", \"Made-to-order\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"storage-ottomans\", \"ottoman\", \"storage ottoman\", \"ottoman with storage\", \"storage bench\", \"pouf ottoman\", \"bench\", \"ottoman foot rest\", \"pouf\", \"ottomans\", \"ottoman coffee table\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"midnight\", \"blue\", \"round ottoman\", \"foot ottoman\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Accent Furniture/Ottomans","created_at":"2023-02-03T02:12:01Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab668"},"product_id":957,"item_id":"B073G7BVBP","category_id":81,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Martin Modern Storage Bench, 39\"W, Sundried Velvet","brand":"Rivet","color":"Sundried Velvet","weight_lb":38.0,"price_cents":8099,"stock":8,"description":"You're having friends over, but didn't have time to clean first. No problem - this storage ottoman is a great place to quickly stash clutter. In addition to its functionality, it's a stylish piece when closed.\nNOTE: This item is made-to-order, please expect an increased shipping time.\n39” W x 19” D x 19” H\nSolid pine wood with polyester fabric\nContemporary but classic\nA great ottoman for the living room or storage for blankets in a bedroom\nSimple assembly; just attach legs\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"You're having friends over, but didn't have time to clean first. No problem - this storage ottoman is a great place to quickly stash clutter. In addition to its functionality, it's a stylish piece when closed.\", \"NOTE: This item is made-to-order, please expect an increased shipping time.\", \"39” W x 19” D x 19” H\", \"Solid pine wood with polyester fabric\", \"Contemporary but classic\", \"A great ottoman for the living room or storage for blankets in a bedroom\", \"Simple assembly; just attach legs\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"storage-ottomans\", \"ottoman\", \"storage ottoman\", \"ottoman with storage\", \"storage bench\", \"pouf ottoman\", \"bench\", \"ottoman foot rest\", \"pouf\", \"ottomans\", \"ottoman coffee table\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"sundried velvet\", \"red\", \"round ottoman\", \"foot ottoman\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Entryway Furniture/Storage Benches","created_at":"2023-02-03T01:48:28Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab669"},"product_id":958,"item_id":"B073G7BVCT","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Highland Modern Wingback Living Room Accent Chair, 31.9\"W, Oatmeal","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Oatmeal","weight_lb":65.8,"price_cents":7199,"stock":215,"description":"Bridging classic and contemporary, this accent chair is a modern twist on the timeless wingback chair. The clean, updated style with thick-woven fabric brings welcoming comfort to your seating area.\n31.9\"W x 37.8\"D x 42\"H\nSustainably sourced solid beech wood covered in thick-woven fabric\nContemporary\nUpdated design on a classic piece blends well with existing décor.\nMinimal assembly; just attach legs\nFree returns for 30 days. 3 year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Bridging classic and contemporary, this accent chair is a modern twist on the timeless wingback chair. The clean, updated style with thick-woven fabric brings welcoming comfort to your seating area.\", \"31.9\\\"W x 37.8\\\"D x 42\\\"H\", \"Sustainably sourced solid beech wood covered in thick-woven fabric\", \"Contemporary\", \"Updated design on a classic piece blends well with existing décor.\", \"Minimal assembly; just attach legs\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3 year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"living-room-chairs\", \"sectional sofa\", \"couch\", \"sofa\", \"accent chair\", \"recliner chair\", \"loveseat\", \"sleeper sofa\", \"sofa sets for living room\", \"chair\", \"sectional couch\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"oatmeal\", \"beige\", \"living room chair\", \"futon\", \"sofa bed\", \"living room furniture\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2023-05-07T17:47:12Z"}
