{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab66f"},"product_id":964,"item_id":"B073GCWSTH","category_id":81,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Martin Modern Storage Bench, 39\"W, Navy Velvet","brand":"Rivet","color":"Navy Velvet","weight_lb":38.0,"price_cents":22999,"stock":23,"description":"You're having friends over, but didn't have time to clean first. No problem - this storage ottoman is a great place to quickly stash clutter. In addition to its functionality, it's a stylish piece when closed.\nNOTE: This item is made-to-order, please expect an increased shipping time.\n39” W x 19” D x 19” H\nSolid pine wood with polyester fabric\nContemporary but classic\nA great ottoman for the living room or storage for blankets in a bedroom\nSimple assembly; just attach legs\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"You're having friends over, but didn't have time to clean first. No problem - this storage ottoman is a great place to quickly stash clutter. In addition to its functionality, it's a stylish piece when closed.\", \"NOTE: This item is made-to-order, please expect an increased shipping time.\", \"39” W x 19” D x 19” H\", \"Solid pine wood with polyester fabric\", \"Contemporary but classic\", \"A great ottoman for the living room or storage for blankets in a bedroom\", \"Simple assembly; just attach legs\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"storage-ottomans\", \"ottoman\", \"storage ottoman\", \"ottoman with storage\", \"storage bench\", \"pouf ottoman\", \"bench\", \"ottoman foot rest\", \"pouf\", \"ottomans\", \"ottoman coffee table\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"navy velvet\", \"blue\", \"round ottoman\", \"foot ottoman\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Entryway Furniture/Storage Benches","created_at":"2023-03-03T18:45:40Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab670"},"product_id":965,"item_id":"B073HG8M86","category_id":31,"name":"AmazonBasics USB 3.0 Universal Laptop Docking Station","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Black","weight_lb":0.71,"price_cents":5199,"stock":2,"description":"Universal laptop docking station provides convenient connectivity for an expanded workspace; connect a Windows laptop, desktop, or tablet with up to 2 additional monitors, an Ethernet network, and 9 peripherals—all through a single USB cable; for web/productivity software (not recommended for gaming); functions as a USB hub only; does not offer charging functionality\nConnect up to two monitors using the HDMI and DVI-I ports; DVI-I to VGA adapter included\nFeatures 9 peripheral ports: 2 USB 3.0 ports for connecting accessories like an external hard drive or extra USB graphics adapter; 4 USB 2.0 ports for connecting older devices like mice, keyboards, and printers; RJ-45 Gbit Ethernet network port; audio/input to connect headphones and microphones\nCompatible with Windows 10, 8.1, 7 (does not support Surface RT, Mac OS X, or Linux/Unix). In order for this docking station to work as intended DO NOT connect it to a computer before installing the provided drivers (drivers provided in the CD). If you experience issues please uninstall the DisplayLink Graphics drivers as described in the User Manual. Requires current DisplayLink drivers which can be downloaded at DisplayLink (dot) com\nIncludes universal laptop docking station, USB 3.0 cable, power adapter, CD (driver and user manual), and quick installation guide","bullets":"[\"Universal laptop docking station provides convenient connectivity for an expanded workspace; connect a Windows laptop, desktop, or tablet with up to 2 additional monitors, an Ethernet network, and 9 peripherals—all through a single USB cable; for web/productivity software (not recommended for gaming); functions as a USB hub only; does not offer charging functionality\", \"Connect up to two monitors using the HDMI and DVI-I ports; DVI-I to VGA adapter included\", \"Features 9 peripheral ports: 2 USB 3.0 ports for connecting accessories like an external hard drive or extra USB graphics adapter; 4 USB 2.0 ports for connecting older devices like mice, keyboards, and printers; RJ-45 Gbit Ethernet network port; audio/input to connect headphones and microphones\", \"Compatible with Windows 10, 8.1, 7 (does not support Surface RT, Mac OS X, or Linux/Unix). In order for this docking station to work as intended DO NOT connect it to a computer before installing the provided drivers (drivers provided in the CD). If you experience issues please uninstall the DisplayLink Graphics drivers as described in the User Manual. Requires current DisplayLink drivers which can be downloaded at DisplayLink (dot) com\", \"Includes universal laptop docking station, USB 3.0 cable, power adapter, CD (driver and user manual), and quick installation guide\"]","keywords":"[\"universal docking station thunderbolt dock laptop surface pro 3 hp dell\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-07-20T12:26:44Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab671"},"product_id":966,"item_id":"B073HJJJL2","category_id":265,"name":"AmazonBasics W11 Vacuum Dust Bags with Odour control Pack of 4","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"","weight_lb":0.31,"price_cents":3299,"stock":27,"description":"Offers higher suction capacity and up to 50% longer life compared to paper vacuum cleaner bags\nUnchanged suction power through special synthetic material to prevent dust accumulation\nHigher hygiene and purification through innovative fabric filter\nThe ultralight and tear resistant material for best suction results on any vacuum\nSuitable for AMAZONBASICS 3.0L; AFK BS, PS; DAEWOO RC; DIRT DEVIL Antiinfective R1/R3/R4/R9, Avanty, Derby, Energy, Factory, Fello & Friend, Galaxxy, Mustang, Powerline, Skuppy, Vito; KAMBROOK KVC; KÄRCHER Original, TSC; LG Original, RG","bullets":"[\"Offers higher suction capacity and up to 50% longer life compared to paper vacuum cleaner bags\", \"Unchanged suction power through special synthetic material to prevent dust accumulation\", \"Higher hygiene and purification through innovative fabric filter\", \"The ultralight and tear resistant material for best suction results on any vacuum\", \"Suitable for AMAZONBASICS 3.0L; AFK BS, PS; DAEWOO RC; DIRT DEVIL Antiinfective R1/R3/R4/R9, Avanty, Derby, Energy, Factory, Fello & Friend, Galaxxy, Mustang, Powerline, Skuppy, Vito; KAMBROOK KVC; KÄRCHER Original, TSC; LG Original, RG\"]","keywords":"[\"miele hoover bags hetty henry vacuum gn hyclean 3d efficiency meile vacume cleaner\"]","node_path":"Home & Garden/Home & Kitchen/Categories/Kitchen & Home Appliances/Vacuums & Floor Care/Vacuum Accessories/Vacuum Bags/Cylinder Bags","created_at":"2024-01-27T01:42:35Z"}
