{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab674"},"product_id":969,"item_id":"B073NZPNN9","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Geometric Aqua and Black Angled Canvas Print in Silver Frame, 31.75\" x 31.75\"","brand":"Rivet","color":"Silver","weight_lb":6.3,"price_cents":5999,"stock":97,"description":"This striking series of geometric shapes gives a contemporary flair to your room. Aqua and black forms, mixed with a few accent colors, create an eclectic, modern piece that is housed in a silver floater frame for a sophisticated look.\nContemporary geometric shapes\nHand-stretched canvas around engineered wood stretcher bar with floater frame in a silver finish; arrives ready to hang\n31.75\" x 31.75\"\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"This striking series of geometric shapes gives a contemporary flair to your room. Aqua and black forms, mixed with a few accent colors, create an eclectic, modern piece that is housed in a silver floater frame for a sophisticated look.\", \"Contemporary geometric shapes\", \"Hand-stretched canvas around engineered wood stretcher bar with floater frame in a silver finish; arrives ready to hang\", \"31.75\\\" x 31.75\\\"\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"louis vuitton\", \"oliver gal\", \"stone & beam\", \"oliver gal wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"rivet\", \"louis vuitton shoes\", \"stone and beam\", \"framed wall art\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"silver\", \"multi\", \"31.75\\\"x31.75\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-03-21T08:43:10Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab675"},"product_id":970,"item_id":"B073NZPP4V","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Copper Metallic Foil Canvas Print Wall Art in White Frame, 21.75\" x 17.75\"","brand":"Rivet","color":"White","weight_lb":2.41,"price_cents":10999,"stock":71,"description":"This contemporary treatment of a tree line reflected on a lake will bring an air of sophistication and a bit of metallic glam to your room. Printed on canvas and housed in a white frame, it will add a modern flair to an otherwise neutral room.\nModern treatment of classic scene with a touch of glam\nHand-stretched canvas around engineered wood stretcher bar with floater frame in a white finish; arrives ready to hang\n21.75\" x 17.75\"\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"This contemporary treatment of a tree line reflected on a lake will bring an air of sophistication and a bit of metallic glam to your room. Printed on canvas and housed in a white frame, it will add a modern flair to an otherwise neutral room.\", \"Modern treatment of classic scene with a touch of glam\", \"Hand-stretched canvas around engineered wood stretcher bar with floater frame in a white finish; arrives ready to hang\", \"21.75\\\" x 17.75\\\"\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"louis vuitton\", \"oliver gal\", \"stone & beam\", \"oliver gal wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"rivet\", \"louis vuitton shoes\", \"stone and beam\", \"framed wall art\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"white\", \"multi\", \"17.75\\\"x21.75\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-01-24T13:34:09Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab676"},"product_id":971,"item_id":"B073NZPPC9","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Up Close Black and White Elephant Photo Canvas Print Wall Art Decor, 36\" x 24\"","brand":"Rivet","color":"Black","weight_lb":4.0,"price_cents":10999,"stock":145,"description":"A close-up look into the eye and soul of one of the world's most intelligent and beloved mammals. Handsomely printed on hand-stretched canvas and mounted on wood, this black and white photo will add a contemporary touch of nature to your room.\nA contemporary print of a classic, timeless scene\nHand-stretched canvas on wood. Ready to hang with hardware included.\n36\" x 24\"\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"A close-up look into the eye and soul of one of the world's most intelligent and beloved mammals. Handsomely printed on hand-stretched canvas and mounted on wood, this black and white photo will add a contemporary touch of nature to your room.\", \"A contemporary print of a classic, timeless scene\", \"Hand-stretched canvas on wood. Ready to hang with hardware included.\", \"36\\\" x 24\\\"\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"black\", \"36\\\"x24\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-09-01T17:02:53Z"}
