{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab678"},"product_id":973,"item_id":"B073NZSG22","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Seattle Sun Flare in Black and White Canvas Print of Seattle, 60\" x 20\"","brand":"Rivet","color":"Red","weight_lb":6.61,"price_cents":5699,"stock":44,"description":"Camera flares become part of the metro landscape in this artistic photo of Seattle. Perhaps taken through the glass window of a plane about to land there, this photo will add a contemporary and cosmopolitan look to your room.\nA contemporary, sophisticated addition to your room\nHand-stretched canvas on wood.\n60\" x 20\"\nReady to hang with hardware included.\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"Camera flares become part of the metro landscape in this artistic photo of Seattle. Perhaps taken through the glass window of a plane about to land there, this photo will add a contemporary and cosmopolitan look to your room.\", \"A contemporary, sophisticated addition to your room\", \"Hand-stretched canvas on wood.\", \"60\\\" x 20\\\"\", \"Ready to hang with hardware included.\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"red\", \"multi\", \"60\\\"x20\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-03-12T00:41:16Z"}
