{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab67a"},"product_id":975,"item_id":"B073NZT5DP","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Coral Ikat-Inspired Print Wall Art on Canvas, 16\" x 16\"","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Multicolor","weight_lb":1.0,"price_cents":2099,"stock":7,"description":"This abstract print gives the impression of an Ikat-style work of art. A brilliant coral is accented by purples and whites for an eye-catching design. A combination of ancient and modern touches will help this piece blend with most styles.\nAncient-inspired design in modern print\nHand-stretched canvas on wood. Ready to hang, all hardware included.\n16\" x 16\"\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"This abstract print gives the impression of an Ikat-style work of art. A brilliant coral is accented by purples and whites for an eye-catching design. A combination of ancient and modern touches will help this piece blend with most styles.\", \"Ancient-inspired design in modern print\", \"Hand-stretched canvas on wood. Ready to hang, all hardware included.\", \"16\\\" x 16\\\"\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"multi\", \"16\\\"x16\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-01-09T07:12:52Z"}
