{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab680"},"product_id":981,"item_id":"B073P13P7Q","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Abstract Black and White Print of Tree Line in Black Frame, 24\" x 16\"","brand":"Rivet","color":"Black","weight_lb":2.0,"price_cents":2699,"stock":38,"description":"This abstract depiction of a silhouette of trees brings an edgy look along with a touch of nature to your room. Stark black trees are printed against a white background for a modern look ideal for an urban-style setting.\nA modern take on a nature theme\nHand-stretched canvas on wood, encased in black floater frame\n26\" x 18\"\nReady to hang with hardware included.\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"This abstract depiction of a silhouette of trees brings an edgy look along with a touch of nature to your room. Stark black trees are printed against a white background for a modern look ideal for an urban-style setting.\", \"A modern take on a nature theme\", \"Hand-stretched canvas on wood, encased in black floater frame\", \"26\\\" x 18\\\"\", \"Ready to hang with hardware included.\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"louis vuitton\", \"oliver gal\", \"stone & beam\", \"oliver gal wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"rivet\", \"louis vuitton shoes\", \"stone and beam\", \"framed wall art\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"black\", \"26\\\"x18\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-06-03T06:08:54Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab681"},"product_id":982,"item_id":"B073P14CBD","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Multi-Color Canvas Fingerprint Wall Art, 24\" x 28\"","brand":"Rivet","color":"Multi","weight_lb":3.0,"price_cents":8499,"stock":63,"description":"Whether you're a fan of forensic crime dramas or just like being one of a kind, this rendering of a fingerprint will make an artistic statement. Muted colors help this piece bridge contemporary and classic styles.\nA modern, sophisticated addition to your room\nHand-stretched canvas on wood. Ready to hang with hardware included.\n24\" x 28\"\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"Whether you're a fan of forensic crime dramas or just like being one of a kind, this rendering of a fingerprint will make an artistic statement. Muted colors help this piece bridge contemporary and classic styles.\", \"A modern, sophisticated addition to your room\", \"Hand-stretched canvas on wood. Ready to hang with hardware included.\", \"24\\\" x 28\\\"\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"multi\", \"24\\\"x28\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-05-01T13:03:13Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab682"},"product_id":983,"item_id":"B073P15S9V","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Contemporary Gold and Grey Hay Bales Print Wall Art on Canvas, 30\" x 30\"","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Multicolor","weight_lb":3.0,"price_cents":4099,"stock":230,"description":"Grey morning mist hangs over golden bales of hay sitting peacefully beside the ocean, perhaps on the California coast. This modern print of a classic nature scene brings a sense of calm, and neutral colors, to your room.\nContemporary print of classic coastal scene\nHand-stretched canvas on wood. Ready to hang, all hardware included.\n30\" x 30\"\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"Grey morning mist hangs over golden bales of hay sitting peacefully beside the ocean, perhaps on the California coast. This modern print of a classic nature scene brings a sense of calm, and neutral colors, to your room.\", \"Contemporary print of classic coastal scene\", \"Hand-stretched canvas on wood. Ready to hang, all hardware included.\", \"30\\\" x 30\\\"\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"multi\", \"30\\\"x30\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-01-06T13:20:24Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab683"},"product_id":984,"item_id":"B073P16R7Q","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Red and Gold Tulip Print on Canvas, Brown Frame, 31.75\" x 31.75\"","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Multicolor","weight_lb":6.3,"price_cents":6299,"stock":69,"description":"Two vivid red tulips appear to be lit by the sun, but are juxtaposed on a gold background with muted patterns. This modern twist on a classic floral theme arrives in an espresso-colored floater frame, ready to add bright classic colors to any room.\nContemporary treatment of classic floral theme\nHand-stretched canvas in espresso-color floater frame\n31.75\" x 31.75\"\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"Two vivid red tulips appear to be lit by the sun, but are juxtaposed on a gold background with muted patterns. This modern twist on a classic floral theme arrives in an espresso-colored floater frame, ready to add bright classic colors to any room.\", \"Contemporary treatment of classic floral theme\", \"Hand-stretched canvas in espresso-color floater frame\", \"31.75\\\" x 31.75\\\"\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"louis vuitton\", \"oliver gal\", \"stone & beam\", \"oliver gal wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"rivet\", \"louis vuitton shoes\", \"stone and beam\", \"framed wall art\", \"farmhouse\", \"multi\", \"31.75\\\" x 31.75\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-05-06T16:52:45Z"}
