{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab685"},"product_id":986,"item_id":"B073P19TKD","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Sun Exposed Cactus Canvas Photo Print 45\" x 30\"","brand":"Rivet","color":"Multi","weight_lb":6.0,"price_cents":4599,"stock":49,"description":"You can almost feel the heat and dryness of the midday desert as the sun blindingly shines on this desert cactus. Muted green and brown tones in this artistic treatment of a nature scene are a perfect complement to a mostly neutral room.\nA contemporary landscape photo that will look nice in any room\nHand-stretched canvas on wood; ready to hang, all hardware included.\n45\" x 30\"\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"You can almost feel the heat and dryness of the midday desert as the sun blindingly shines on this desert cactus. Muted green and brown tones in this artistic treatment of a nature scene are a perfect complement to a mostly neutral room.\", \"A contemporary landscape photo that will look nice in any room\", \"Hand-stretched canvas on wood; ready to hang, all hardware included.\", \"45\\\" x 30\\\"\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"multi\", \"45\\\"x30\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-12-27T03:22:11Z"}
