{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab68a"},"product_id":991,"item_id":"B073P1CJGC","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Black and White Abstract Canvas Print Wall Art, 24\" x 36\"","brand":"Rivet","color":"Black","weight_lb":4.0,"price_cents":3799,"stock":1,"description":"Yin and yang. Black and white. Day and night. Interdependent and constantly evolving, competing and completing each other. This piece, titled \"All of Me,\" reflects on these themes and adds an element of sophistication to your room.\nAbstract, modern print\nHand-stretched canvas on wood. Ready to hang with hardware included.\n24\" x 36\"\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"Yin and yang. Black and white. Day and night. Interdependent and constantly evolving, competing and completing each other. This piece, titled \\\"All of Me,\\\" reflects on these themes and adds an element of sophistication to your room.\", \"Abstract, modern print\", \"Hand-stretched canvas on wood. Ready to hang with hardware included.\", \"24\\\" x 36\\\"\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"black\", \"24\\\"x36\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-01-26T17:53:03Z"}
