{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab693"},"product_id":1000,"item_id":"B073P1H786","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Up Close Black and White Elephant Photo Canvas Print Wall Art Decor, 45\" x 30\"","brand":"Rivet","color":"Red","weight_lb":6.0,"price_cents":4999,"stock":5,"description":"A close-up look into the eye and soul of one of the world's most intelligent and beloved mammals. Handsomely printed on hand-stretched canvas and mounted on wood, this black and white photo will add a contemporary touch of nature to your room.\nA contemporary black and white print\nHand-stretched canvas on wood. Ready to hang with hardware included.\n45\" x 30\"\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"A close-up look into the eye and soul of one of the world's most intelligent and beloved mammals. Handsomely printed on hand-stretched canvas and mounted on wood, this black and white photo will add a contemporary touch of nature to your room.\", \"A contemporary black and white print\", \"Hand-stretched canvas on wood. Ready to hang with hardware included.\", \"45\\\" x 30\\\"\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"red\", \"black\", \"45\\\"x30\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-05-23T19:53:47Z"}
