{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab696"},"product_id":1003,"item_id":"B073P1J8FB","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Abstract Pale Rose and White Textured Print, in Gold Frame, 15\" x 18\"","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Multicolor","weight_lb":1.0,"price_cents":6099,"stock":9,"description":"This print, which includes tan, white and pale rose brush strokes, will bring a sophisticated design twist to any room. Housed in a gold Emma frame, it adds a touch of glam as well.\nModern abstract art with a bit of glam\nPrinted on paper, behind glass in Emma wood frame with a gold finish\n15\" x 18\"\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"This print, which includes tan, white and pale rose brush strokes, will bring a sophisticated design twist to any room. Housed in a gold Emma frame, it adds a touch of glam as well.\", \"Modern abstract art with a bit of glam\", \"Printed on paper, behind glass in Emma wood frame with a gold finish\", \"15\\\" x 18\\\"\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"louis vuitton\", \"oliver gal\", \"stone & beam\", \"oliver gal wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"rivet\", \"louis vuitton shoes\", \"stone and beam\", \"framed wall art\", \"farmhouse\", \"multi\", \"15\\\"x18\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-11-27T07:18:06Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab697"},"product_id":1004,"item_id":"B073P1JGM2","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Pop Art Print of New York City Map in Primary Colors, 18\" x 26\"","brand":"Rivet","color":"","weight_lb":2.0,"price_cents":5199,"stock":0,"description":"Cosmopolitan meets artsy in this stained glass-look interpretation of a map of New York City. This mostly white canvas print with accents of primary colors of red, yellow and blue will liven up a wall in a contemporary setting.\nModern art cartography\nPrinted on wood with satin finish, in black floater frame.\n18\" x 26\"\nReady to hang with hardware included.\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"Cosmopolitan meets artsy in this stained glass-look interpretation of a map of New York City. This mostly white canvas print with accents of primary colors of red, yellow and blue will liven up a wall in a contemporary setting.\", \"Modern art cartography\", \"Printed on wood with satin finish, in black floater frame.\", \"18\\\" x 26\\\"\", \"Ready to hang with hardware included.\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"18\\\"x26\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-06-28T01:29:20Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab698"},"product_id":1005,"item_id":"B073P1JGP2","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet White on Bronze Print of Taj Mahal Wall Art, Bronze Frame, 26\" x 18\"","brand":"Rivet","color":"Multi","weight_lb":2.0,"price_cents":3099,"stock":74,"description":"Completed in 1648, the Taj Mahal was commissioned by the emperor as a tomb for his beloved wife. The magnificent, enduring architecture is depicted here in a reverse print on a bronze background. This piece will add a sophisticated touch to any room.\nModern print of a iconic World Heritage site\nPrinted on paper. Arrives ready to hang in bronze frame.\n26\" x 18\"\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"Completed in 1648, the Taj Mahal was commissioned by the emperor as a tomb for his beloved wife. The magnificent, enduring architecture is depicted here in a reverse print on a bronze background. This piece will add a sophisticated touch to any room.\", \"Modern print of a iconic World Heritage site\", \"Printed on paper. Arrives ready to hang in bronze frame.\", \"26\\\" x 18\\\"\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"multi\", \"26\\\"x18\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-08-12T13:28:54Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab699"},"product_id":1006,"item_id":"B073P1JNL5","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Contemporary Blue and White Mandala Print Wall Art on Canvas, 36\" x 24\"","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Purple","weight_lb":4.0,"price_cents":2999,"stock":29,"description":"Unlock your inner dreaminess with this mandala-inspired contemporary piece. This international symbol of meditation will add a visually appealing and peaceful accent to a room. Neutral colors will blend with your existing decor.\nMandala images fade and overlap in this abstract print\nHand-stretched canvas on wood. Ready to hang, all hardware included.\n36\" x 24\"\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"Unlock your inner dreaminess with this mandala-inspired contemporary piece. This international symbol of meditation will add a visually appealing and peaceful accent to a room. Neutral colors will blend with your existing decor.\", \"Mandala images fade and overlap in this abstract print\", \"Hand-stretched canvas on wood. Ready to hang, all hardware included.\", \"36\\\" x 24\\\"\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"purple\", \"multi\", \"36\\\"x24\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-02-22T22:43:46Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab69a"},"product_id":1007,"item_id":"B073P1JNWZ","category_id":189,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Impressionistic Floral Print Wall Art on Canvas, 36\" x 24\"","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Chocolate","weight_lb":4.0,"price_cents":2999,"stock":57,"description":"Vivid pinks, yellows, blues and greens jump off the canvas in this beautiful print of a flower garden. This modern but impressionistic-style piece will give any style of room a touch of nature and a blast of color.\nModern impressionistic-style print of classic flower garden\nHand-stretched canvas on wood. Ready to hang, all hardware included.\n36\" x 24\"\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"Vivid pinks, yellows, blues and greens jump off the canvas in this beautiful print of a flower garden. This modern but impressionistic-style piece will give any style of room a touch of nature and a blast of color.\", \"Modern impressionistic-style print of classic flower garden\", \"Hand-stretched canvas on wood. Ready to hang, all hardware included.\", \"36\\\" x 24\\\"\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"chocolate\", \"multi\", \"36\\\"x24\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-05-29T18:36:46Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab69b"},"product_id":1008,"item_id":"B073P1JP14","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Dark Blue Print, Billiard Rack Patent, in Black Frame, 17\" x 20\"","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Multicolor","weight_lb":1.0,"price_cents":7999,"stock":92,"description":"Bring a touch of history and a conversation piece into your home with this modern reprint of the 1942 billiard rack patent drawing. Ideal for a recreation room with a pool table -- or anywhere else you want a sophisticated style touch.\nModern reprint of patent drawing\nPrinted on paper, behind glass in black wood frame\n17\" x 20\"\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"Bring a touch of history and a conversation piece into your home with this modern reprint of the 1942 billiard rack patent drawing. Ideal for a recreation room with a pool table -- or anywhere else you want a sophisticated style touch.\", \"Modern reprint of patent drawing\", \"Printed on paper, behind glass in black wood frame\", \"17\\\" x 20\\\"\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"louis vuitton\", \"oliver gal\", \"stone & beam\", \"oliver gal wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"rivet\", \"louis vuitton shoes\", \"stone and beam\", \"framed wall art\", \"farmhouse\", \"multi\", \"17\\\"x20\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-09-10T22:27:23Z"}
