{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab6a0"},"product_id":1012,"item_id":"B073P1N3BY","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Persian-Style Print on Canvas, 16\" x 24\"","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Black","weight_lb":2.0,"price_cents":5899,"stock":40,"description":"This abstract print gives the impression of a Persian-style carpet with contemporary influences. With red and gold tone flourishes against a neutral background, this piece has plenty of modern and classic touches to blend with your existing style.\nAbstract print with classic and modern touches\nHand-stretched canvas on wood. Ready to hang, all hardware included.\n16\" x 24\"\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"This abstract print gives the impression of a Persian-style carpet with contemporary influences. With red and gold tone flourishes against a neutral background, this piece has plenty of modern and classic touches to blend with your existing style.\", \"Abstract print with classic and modern touches\", \"Hand-stretched canvas on wood. Ready to hang, all hardware included.\", \"16\\\" x 24\\\"\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"black\", \"multi\", \"16\\\"x24\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-07-21T04:03:42Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab6a1"},"product_id":1014,"item_id":"B073P1YLCV","category_id":193,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Silver Ink Reprint of Fishing Lure Patent Wall Art, Silver Frame, 15\" x 21\"","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Multicolor","weight_lb":1.0,"price_cents":2799,"stock":53,"description":"Bring a touch of history and a conversation piece into your home with this modern reprint of a 1925 fishing lure patent drawing. Silver metallic ink gives a surprising and modern twist to an object not normally associated with fine art.\nModern treatment of vintage patent drawing\nPrinted on paper, behind glass in wood frame with silver finish\n15\" x 21\"\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"Bring a touch of history and a conversation piece into your home with this modern reprint of a 1925 fishing lure patent drawing. Silver metallic ink gives a surprising and modern twist to an object not normally associated with fine art.\", \"Modern treatment of vintage patent drawing\", \"Printed on paper, behind glass in wood frame with silver finish\", \"15\\\" x 21\\\"\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"louis vuitton\", \"oliver gal\", \"stone & beam\", \"oliver gal wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"rivet\", \"louis vuitton shoes\", \"stone and beam\", \"framed wall art\", \"farmhouse\", \"multi\", \"15\\\"x21\\\"\"]","node_path":"Categories/Home Décor/Photo Albums, Frames & Accessories/Picture Frames","created_at":"2023-07-15T03:58:35Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab6a2"},"product_id":1015,"item_id":"B073P1YLPV","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Six Succulent Print in Birch Floater Frame Wall Art, 24 x 24\"","brand":"Rivet","color":"Multi","weight_lb":2.0,"price_cents":3699,"stock":7,"description":"This modern take on botanical prints, accented with a birch wood floater frame, brings a nice touch of nature to your room. An array of pleasing greens and blues allow this piece to blend with a range of contemporary and classic styles and colors.\nA sophisticated touch of the outdoors\nCustom-printed on wood, encased in beautifully crafted floater frame\n26\" x 26\"\nReady to hang with hardware included.\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"This modern take on botanical prints, accented with a birch wood floater frame, brings a nice touch of nature to your room. An array of pleasing greens and blues allow this piece to blend with a range of contemporary and classic styles and colors.\", \"A sophisticated touch of the outdoors\", \"Custom-printed on wood, encased in beautifully crafted floater frame\", \"26\\\" x 26\\\"\", \"Ready to hang with hardware included.\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"multi\", \"26\\\"x26\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-05-07T02:10:51Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab6a3"},"product_id":1016,"item_id":"B073P23TMG","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Tan and White Print of Old Towers on Canvas Wall Art, 36\" x 24\"","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Multicolor","weight_lb":4.0,"price_cents":7499,"stock":27,"description":"Bring historic architectural flair into your home with this reprint of classic Italian towers. Printed in vintage-look tan ink on white canvas, this neutral-tone piece will fit with any existing style.\nModern print of classic architectural-themed drawing\nHand-stretched canvas on wood. Ready to hang, all hardware included.\n36\" x 24\"\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"Bring historic architectural flair into your home with this reprint of classic Italian towers. Printed in vintage-look tan ink on white canvas, this neutral-tone piece will fit with any existing style.\", \"Modern print of classic architectural-themed drawing\", \"Hand-stretched canvas on wood. Ready to hang, all hardware included.\", \"36\\\" x 24\\\"\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"multi\", \"36\\\"x24\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-01-22T14:31:52Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab6a4"},"product_id":1018,"item_id":"B073P2CP5G","category_id":200,"name":"Rivet Zoey Mid Century Modern Tripod Living Room Floor Lamp With Light Bulb and Table - 18.5 x 18.5 x 58 Inches, Walnut","brand":"Rivet","color":"Brown","weight_lb":12.0,"price_cents":8799,"stock":23,"description":"Clean mid-century modern style\nWarm walnut with brushed silver and linen\nHighly functional light with storage/display shelf\n18.5\"Wx18.5\"Dx58\"H\nAssembly in 15-30 minutes\nThis mid-century modern floor lamp brings style, warmth and functionality to any room. Rich walnut legs form a tripod base with a round storage shelf in the middle. The brushed sliver neck merges with a crisp white linen shade.","bullets":"[\"Clean mid-century modern style\", \"Warm walnut with brushed silver and linen\", \"Highly functional light with storage/display shelf\", \"18.5\\\"Wx18.5\\\"Dx58\\\"H\", \"Assembly in 15-30 minutes\", \"This mid-century modern floor lamp brings style, warmth and functionality to any room. Rich walnut legs form a tripod base with a round storage shelf in the middle. The brushed sliver neck merges with a crisp white linen shade.\"]","keywords":"[\"crate and barrel stow-ocean-17-leather-storage-ottomans31176000\", \"rivet modern home furniture home décor\", \"small space studio apartment urban living room\", \"contemporary mid-century modern industrial quality color glam global trend trendy affordable\", \"west elm cb2 wayfair target project 62 curated joybird design\", \"exclusively on amazon\", \"side table\", \"end table\", \"living room table\", \"funriture\", \"wood\", \"night stand\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Lamps, Bases & Shades/Floor Lamps","created_at":"2024-03-31T14:34:44Z"}
