{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab6b8"},"product_id":1037,"item_id":"B073P63RQK","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Abstract Topographic Print in Grey Wood Frame, 20\" x 20\"","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Multicolor","weight_lb":3.5,"price_cents":2099,"stock":98,"description":"The once unsettled wilderness of the Wild West is depicted in this artistic treatment of the United States map. Various browns and greens bring a bit of nature and an antique feel to this piece, which is housed in a weathered-look grey frame.\nModern treatment of antique-look map\nPrinted on wood with a satin finish, with a weathered grey wood frame\n20\" x 20\"\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"The once unsettled wilderness of the Wild West is depicted in this artistic treatment of the United States map. Various browns and greens bring a bit of nature and an antique feel to this piece, which is housed in a weathered-look grey frame.\", \"Modern treatment of antique-look map\", \"Printed on wood with a satin finish, with a weathered grey wood frame\", \"20\\\" x 20\\\"\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"louis vuitton\", \"oliver gal\", \"stone & beam\", \"oliver gal wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"rivet\", \"louis vuitton shoes\", \"stone and beam\", \"framed wall art\", \"farmhouse\", \"multi\", \"20\\\"x20\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-09-01T08:43:51Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab6b9"},"product_id":1039,"item_id":"B073P6BGCS","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Wooden Door to an Old City Photo Print with Oak Hanger, 30\" x 40\"","brand":"Rivet","color":"Multi","weight_lb":1.5,"price_cents":3599,"stock":24,"description":"An ancient brown wooden gate is left open, allowing a view of tall stairs in an Old World city that could be on the Mediterranean. The classic photo is printed on cotton paper and comes with an oak hanger for a matte finish and contemporary twist.\nClassic photo with modern printing technique\nAcid-free archival ink on 100% cotton paper with oak hanger\nDirections to attach oak hanger found in User Manual under Product Information section\n30\" x 40\"\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"An ancient brown wooden gate is left open, allowing a view of tall stairs in an Old World city that could be on the Mediterranean. The classic photo is printed on cotton paper and comes with an oak hanger for a matte finish and contemporary twist.\", \"Classic photo with modern printing technique\", \"Acid-free archival ink on 100% cotton paper with oak hanger\", \"Directions to attach oak hanger found in User Manual under Product Information section\", \"30\\\" x 40\\\"\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"multi\", \"30\\\"x40\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-01-25T23:22:52Z"}
