{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab6df"},"product_id":1076,"item_id":"B073ZNVNLL","category_id":93,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Kristin Chair-and-a-Half Upholstered Sleeper Sofa, 55.5\"W, Stone","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Stone","weight_lb":95.0,"price_cents":35999,"stock":13,"description":"In addition to being a lovely accent piece for any room, this chair doubles as a pull-out twin bed perfect for hosting guests. Round arms and clean style give this chair modern and classic touches, allowing it to blend with most styles.\n55.5\"W and 72\"D when unfolded into bed\nSolid hardwood and laminate wood frame; polyester/nylon performance fabric\nModern casual\nDoubles as an accent chair and pull-out twin bed\nNo assembly required\nFree returns for 30 days. 3 year warranty.","bullets":"[\"In addition to being a lovely accent piece for any room, this chair doubles as a pull-out twin bed perfect for hosting guests. Round arms and clean style give this chair modern and classic touches, allowing it to blend with most styles.\", \"55.5\\\"W and 72\\\"D when unfolded into bed\", \"Solid hardwood and laminate wood frame; polyester/nylon performance fabric\", \"Modern casual\", \"Doubles as an accent chair and pull-out twin bed\", \"No assembly required\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3 year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"living-room-chairs\", \"sectional sofa\", \"couch\", \"sofa\", \"accent chair\", \"recliner chair\", \"loveseat\", \"sleeper sofa\", \"sofa sets for living room\", \"chair\", \"sectional couch\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"stone\", \"grey\", \"chair and a half sleeper\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Sofas & Couches","created_at":"2023-06-16T09:30:44Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab6e0"},"product_id":1077,"item_id":"B0741CYHJS","category_id":236,"name":"Sterling Silver Genuine Garnet 5mm Bezel Set January Birthstone Stud Earrings","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Red","weight_lb":"","price_cents":11999,"stock":23,"description":"Stud earrings featuring round cut 5mm genuine garnet stones bezel set in high polished sterling silver\nGarnet is the January birthstone\nA thoughtful jewelry gift that will be cherished for years to come\nButterfly backing\nHand-crafted in pure .925 Sterling Silver; Rhodium plating added to enhance shine and durability\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Stud earrings featuring round cut 5mm genuine garnet stones bezel set in high polished sterling silver\", \"Garnet is the January birthstone\", \"A thoughtful jewelry gift that will be cherished for years to come\", \"Butterfly backing\", \"Hand-crafted in pure .925 Sterling Silver; Rhodium plating added to enhance shine and durability\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"earring\", \"studs\", \"post\", \"posts\", \"genuine gemstone\", \"semi-precious gemstone\", \"gemstone jewelry\", \"birthstone jewelry\", \"january birthday\", \"january birthday gift\", \"january birthday present\", \"january push present\", \"gift\", \"gift for woman\", \"gifts for women\", \"gifts for her\", \"romantic gift\", \"birthday\", \"birthday gift\", \"birthday present\"]","node_path":"Categories/Women/Earrings","created_at":"2024-04-05T04:42:00Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab6e1"},"product_id":1078,"item_id":"B0741KL3BM","category_id":73,"name":"AmazonBasics Hardside Luggage Spinner - 68cm, Navy Blue","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Navy Blue","weight_lb":9.32,"price_cents":12999,"stock":82,"description":"68-centimetre hardside spinner check-in luggage—ideal for 3- to 5-day trips\nProtective hard shell made of extra-thick ABS (thicker than the competition) for enhanced strength and durability\nFully lined interior with divider; 150D-polyester interior organizer with 3 zippered pockets for conveniently storing smaller items\nExpandable for up to 15% additional packing capacity; solid, strong zippers; telescoping handle for comfortable maneuvering; securely mounted short handle\n4 double spinner wheels ensure smooth-rolling mobility in any direction","bullets":"[\"68-centimetre hardside spinner check-in luggage—ideal for 3- to 5-day trips\", \"Protective hard shell made of extra-thick ABS (thicker than the competition) for enhanced strength and durability\", \"Fully lined interior with divider; 150D-polyester interior organizer with 3 zippered pockets for conveniently storing smaller items\", \"Expandable for up to 15% additional packing capacity; solid, strong zippers; telescoping handle for comfortable maneuvering; securely mounted short handle\", \"4 double spinner wheels ensure smooth-rolling mobility in any direction\"]","keywords":"[\"samsonite suitcase large luggage bags for travel suitcases set\"]","node_path":"Categories/Suitcases & Travel Bags/Suitcases","created_at":"2024-04-08T23:04:31Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab6e2"},"product_id":1079,"item_id":"B0742NMZ2R","category_id":113,"name":"365 EVERYDAY VALUE Flexible Drawstring Trash Bags 30GL, 35 CT","brand":"365 Everyday Value","color":"","weight_lb":3.31,"price_cents":1199,"stock":35,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\nOur Flextra Trash Bags are tough and durable with the strength and superior performance you expect. Made with a proprietary blend of resins, our bags have a unique embossed pattern, which results in additional puncture and tear resistance.\nPlus, the drawstring hugs the trash can to help the bag stay in place.\nYou can also use these bags to store, pack-on-the-go or protect!\nProduct of USA.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\", \"Our Flextra Trash Bags are tough and durable with the strength and superior performance you expect. Made with a proprietary blend of resins, our bags have a unique embossed pattern, which results in additional puncture and tear resistance.\", \"Plus, the drawstring hugs the trash can to help the bag stay in place.\", \"You can also use these bags to store, pack-on-the-go or protect!\", \"Product of USA.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-06-16T07:26:23Z"}
