{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab70a"},"product_id":1119,"item_id":"B074F297S7","category_id":159,"name":"Amazon Basic Care Lansoprazole Delayed Release Capsules, 15 mg, treats frequent heartburn, 42 Count","brand":"Amazon Basic Care","color":"","weight_lb":0.06,"price_cents":4999,"stock":110,"description":"ACTIVE INGREDIENT: This product contains lansoprazole 15 mg, an acid reducer, which compares to the active ingredient in Prevacid 24 HR.\nHEARTBURN TREATMENT: This delayed-release heartburn medicine is clinically proven to treat frequent heartburn. Heartburn is a painful, burning sensation in the lower chest or throat that occurs when stomach acid backs up.\nACID REDUCER: When taken as directed, Amazon Basic Care Lansoprazole Delayed Release Capsules, 15 mg reduce heartburn by deactivating acid-producing pumps in the stomach lining to inhibit acid production at the source.\n14 DAYS: Although some people get complete relief within 24 hours; it may take 1 to 4 days for full effect. Take Amazon Basic Care Lansoprazole Delayed-Release Capsules 15 mg every day for 14 days to treat frequent heartburn (2 or more days a week).\nSODIUM FREE: Amazon Basic Care Lansoprazole Delayed-Release Capsules 15 mg stops acid production at the source – the pumps that release acid into the stomach. These capsules are a sodium-free choice to treat frequent heartburn.","bullets":"[\"ACTIVE INGREDIENT: This product contains lansoprazole 15 mg, an acid reducer, which compares to the active ingredient in Prevacid 24 HR.\", \"HEARTBURN TREATMENT: This delayed-release heartburn medicine is clinically proven to treat frequent heartburn. Heartburn is a painful, burning sensation in the lower chest or throat that occurs when stomach acid backs up.\", \"ACID REDUCER: When taken as directed, Amazon Basic Care Lansoprazole Delayed Release Capsules, 15 mg reduce heartburn by deactivating acid-producing pumps in the stomach lining to inhibit acid production at the source.\", \"14 DAYS: Although some people get complete relief within 24 hours; it may take 1 to 4 days for full effect. Take Amazon Basic Care Lansoprazole Delayed-Release Capsules 15 mg every day for 14 days to treat frequent heartburn (2 or more days a week).\", \"SODIUM FREE: Amazon Basic Care Lansoprazole Delayed-Release Capsules 15 mg stops acid production at the source – the pumps that release acid into the stomach. These capsules are a sodium-free choice to treat frequent heartburn.\"]","keywords":"[\"antacid stomach problems ache pain heartburn nausea diarrhea acid reflux lansoprazole\"]","node_path":"Products/Health Care/OTC Medications & Treatments/Digestion & Nausea/Antacids","created_at":"2024-06-14T14:51:41Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab70b"},"product_id":1120,"item_id":"B074F297T8","category_id":159,"name":"Basic Care Ibuprofen Tablets 500 Count","brand":"Basic Care","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":2799,"stock":127,"description":"ACTIVE INGREDIENT: Ibuprofen Tablets 200 mg are used as a pain reliever/fever reducer (NSAID) which compares to Advil active ingredient.\nPAIN RELIEVER/FEVER REDUCER (NSAID): If you have a fever or muscular aches, minor arthritis pain, toothache, backache, menstrual cramps or minor aches and pains from the common cold, then Ibuprofen Tablets 200 mg can bring you some relief when taken as directed.\nNSAID: Basic Care Ibuprofen Tablets 200 mg is a nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drug (NSAID) that temporarily reduces fever and provides temporary relief of minor aches and pains due to: headache, muscular aches, backache, the common cold and menstrual cramps\nEFFECTIVE: Ibuprofen Tablets 200 mg are used as a pain reliever and fever reducer (NSAID) for adults and children 12 years and over.\nPAIN MANAGEMENT: Exercise may help with pain as it releases endorphins, the body’s natural pain blocker. These coated tablets temporarily relieve minor aches and pains due to headache, minor pain of arthritis, and the common cold.","bullets":"[\"ACTIVE INGREDIENT: Ibuprofen Tablets 200 mg are used as a pain reliever/fever reducer (NSAID) which compares to Advil active ingredient.\", \"PAIN RELIEVER/FEVER REDUCER (NSAID): If you have a fever or muscular aches, minor arthritis pain, toothache, backache, menstrual cramps or minor aches and pains from the common cold, then Ibuprofen Tablets 200 mg can bring you some relief when taken as directed.\", \"NSAID: Basic Care Ibuprofen Tablets 200 mg is a nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drug (NSAID) that temporarily reduces fever and provides temporary relief of minor aches and pains due to: headache, muscular aches, backache, the common cold and menstrual cramps\", \"EFFECTIVE: Ibuprofen Tablets 200 mg are used as a pain reliever and fever reducer (NSAID) for adults and children 12 years and over.\", \"PAIN MANAGEMENT: Exercise may help with pain as it releases endorphins, the body’s natural pain blocker. These coated tablets temporarily relieve minor aches and pains due to headache, minor pain of arthritis, and the common cold.\"]","keywords":"[\"pain relief backache muscle ache headache period cramps advil join pain fever analgesic\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-03-19T21:59:28Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab70c"},"product_id":1121,"item_id":"B074F2FSX7","category_id":159,"name":"Basic Care Miconazole Nitrate Vaginal Insert (1200 mg) and Miconazole Nitrate Cream (2%) Combination Pack, 1-Day Treatment For Vaginal Yeast Infection","brand":"Amazon Basic Care","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1499,"stock":20,"description":"ACTIVE INGREDIENTS: This combo pack contains miconazole nitrate 1200 mg (in vaginal insert) and miconazole nitrate 2% (external cream), which are both vaginal antifungals. Compare to the active ingredients in Monistat 1 Combination Pack.\n1-DAY TREATMENT: Cures most vaginal yeast infections using 1 vaginal softgel insert with 1 flexible applicator plus external cream for itch relief.\nEXTERNAL VULVAR ITCH CREAM: This combo pack also includes an external cream to relieve external vulvar itching and irritation due to a vaginal yeast infection. Contains miconazole nitrate 2%, a vaginal antifungal.\nA VAGINAL YEAST INFECTION is a fungal infection that causes irritation, odor-free discharge and intense vaginal itching.\nSYMPTOMS: Yeast infection symptoms can range from mild to moderate, and include: vaginal itching and irritation (in the vagina and vulva), redness and swelling of the vulva, vaginal rash, vaginal pain and soreness, watery vaginal discharge, a burning sensation, especially during intercourse or while urinating, and thick, white, odor-free vaginal discharge with a cottage cheese appearance.","bullets":"[\"ACTIVE INGREDIENTS: This combo pack contains miconazole nitrate 1200 mg (in vaginal insert) and miconazole nitrate 2% (external cream), which are both vaginal antifungals. Compare to the active ingredients in Monistat 1 Combination Pack.\", \"1-DAY TREATMENT: Cures most vaginal yeast infections using 1 vaginal softgel insert with 1 flexible applicator plus external cream for itch relief.\", \"EXTERNAL VULVAR ITCH CREAM: This combo pack also includes an external cream to relieve external vulvar itching and irritation due to a vaginal yeast infection. Contains miconazole nitrate 2%, a vaginal antifungal.\", \"A VAGINAL YEAST INFECTION is a fungal infection that causes irritation, odor-free discharge and intense vaginal itching.\", \"SYMPTOMS: Yeast infection symptoms can range from mild to moderate, and include: vaginal itching and irritation (in the vagina and vulva), redness and swelling of the vulva, vaginal rash, vaginal pain and soreness, watery vaginal discharge, a burning sensation, especially during intercourse or while urinating, and thick, white, odor-free vaginal discharge with a cottage cheese appearance.\"]","keywords":"[\"1 day vaginal treatment yeast feminine hygiene\", \"miconazole, vaginal yeast infection, miconazole nitrate, vaginal antifungal, monistat, vagina, vaginal itching, vaginal discharge, external yeast infection, vaginal infection\"]","node_path":"Products/Health Care/Women's Health/Yeast Infection Treatments","created_at":"2023-04-08T07:44:03Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab70d"},"product_id":1122,"item_id":"B074F2TF71","category_id":156,"name":"Basic Care Omeprazole Delayed Release Tablets Acid Reducer, Wild Berry Mint, 42-ct","brand":"Amazon Basic Care","color":"","weight_lb":0.07,"price_cents":1499,"stock":25,"description":"EFFECTIVE HEARTBURN TREATMENT: Amazon Basic Care Omeprazole Delayed Release Tablets 20 mg work to reduce digestive acid that may cause heartburn. Compare to Prilosec OTC.\nTREATS FREQUENT HEARTBURN: This acid reducer treats frequent heartburn that occurs 2 or more times a week.\nACID REDUCER: Amazon Basic Care Omeprazole Delayed Release Tablets 20 mg is a Proton Pump Inhibitor (PPI) that deactivates pumps in the stomach lining to inhibit acid production at the source.\n14-DAY COURSE OF HEARTBURN TREATMENT: Taken once every 24 hours for 14 days, Amazon Basic Care Omeprazole Delayed Release Tablets 20 mg is not intended for immediate relief of heartburn and may take 1 to 4 days for full effect.","bullets":"[\"EFFECTIVE HEARTBURN TREATMENT: Amazon Basic Care Omeprazole Delayed Release Tablets 20 mg work to reduce digestive acid that may cause heartburn. Compare to Prilosec OTC.\", \"TREATS FREQUENT HEARTBURN: This acid reducer treats frequent heartburn that occurs 2 or more times a week.\", \"ACID REDUCER: Amazon Basic Care Omeprazole Delayed Release Tablets 20 mg is a Proton Pump Inhibitor (PPI) that deactivates pumps in the stomach lining to inhibit acid production at the source.\", \"14-DAY COURSE OF HEARTBURN TREATMENT: Taken once every 24 hours for 14 days, Amazon Basic Care Omeprazole Delayed Release Tablets 20 mg is not intended for immediate relief of heartburn and may take 1 to 4 days for full effect.\"]","keywords":"[\"antacid stomach problems ache pain heartburn nausea diarrhea acid reflux prilosec omeprazole\", \"basic care, basic care omeprazole, omeprazole, omeprazole 20 mg, omeprazole 20 mg, omeprazole 20 mg, prilosec otc, prilosec, prilosec otc 42, acid reducer, h