{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab70e"},"product_id":1123,"item_id":"B074F2WCKP","category_id":156,"name":"Amazon Basic Care Nicotine Gum, Nicotine Polacrilex Gum, 2 mg (nicotine), Original Flavor, Stop Smoking Aid, 20 Count","brand":"Amazon Basic Care","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1299,"stock":4,"description":"NICOTINE GUM: Amazon Basic Care Nicotine Gum is part of a Nicotine Replacement Therapy, a treatment to help people stop smoking. Compare to the active ingredient in Nicorette Gum.\nSMOKING CESSATION: Nicotine Replacement Therapy is designed to wean your body off cigarettes. It helps regulate, control and gradually reduce your body's cravings for nicotine.\nQUITTING SMOKING: Smoking has two addictive components, a physical and a mental need for the nicotine in tobacco.\nSTOP SMOKING AID: Nicotine gum reduces withdrawal symptoms, including nicotine craving, associated with quitting smoking.","bullets":"[\"NICOTINE GUM: Amazon Basic Care Nicotine Gum is part of a Nicotine Replacement Therapy, a treatment to help people stop smoking. Compare to the active ingredient in Nicorette Gum.\", \"SMOKING CESSATION: Nicotine Replacement Therapy is designed to wean your body off cigarettes. It helps regulate, control and gradually reduce your body's cravings for nicotine.\", \"QUITTING SMOKING: Smoking has two addictive components, a physical and a mental need for the nicotine in tobacco.\", \"STOP SMOKING AID: Nicotine gum reduces withdrawal symptoms, including nicotine craving, associated with quitting smoking.\"]","keywords":"[\"stop smoking withdrawls nicorette\", \"basic care, basic care nicotine gum, nicotine gum 2mg, nicotine replacement therapy, stop smoking, nicotine, quitting smoking, stop smoking aid, nicotine gum\", \"nicotine gum 2mg 20\", \"nicotine gum 2mg 20 count\", \"smoking cessation\", \"nicotine gum\", \"quit smoking\", \"nicotine\", \"nicotine replacement\"]","node_path":"Products/Health Care/Smoking Cessation/Nicotine Gums & Lozenges","