{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab720"},"product_id":1141,"item_id":"B074H5H1P5","category_id":113,"name":"365 Everyday Value, Wild Rice, 14 oz","brand":"365 Everyday Value","color":"","weight_lb":0.97,"price_cents":699,"stock":6,"description":"Our Wild Rice is the same rice Native Americans have harvested for thousands of years. Ours is grown in the mineral rich soils of California where it takes advantage of long warm summers and water from the High Sierras.\nThe result is a hearty whole grain rice that complements recipes from around the globe. Get wild and try it tonight!\n48g of Whole Grains per serivng. Good source of Fiber. Low Fat.Sodium Free.\nCertified GMO-Free, Certified Kosher, Certified Vegan.\nBrought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.","bullets":"[\"Our Wild Rice is the same rice Native Americans have harvested for thousands of years. Ours is grown in the mineral rich soils of California where it takes advantage of long warm summers and water from the High Sierras.\", \"The result is a hearty whole grain rice that complements recipes from around the globe. Get wild and try it tonight!\", \"48g of Whole Grains per serivng. Good source of Fiber. Low Fat.Sodium Free.\", \"Certified GMO-Free, Certified Kosher, Certified Vegan.\", \"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.\"]","keywords":"[\"whole foods, whole food, whole foods,365 everyday value\"]","node_path":"Categories/Pantry Staples/Dried Grains & Rice/Wild","created_at":"2023-11-16T09:53:36Z"}
