{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab732"},"product_id":1159,"item_id":"B074H5TNJW","category_id":136,"name":"Whole Foods Market, Vinegar Balsamic Of Modena Aged, 16.9 Fl Oz","brand":"Whole Foods Market","color":"","weight_lb":1.06,"price_cents":399,"stock":22,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. When it comes to innovative flavors and products sourced from artisans and producers around the world, the Whole Foods Market brand has you covered. Amazing products, exceptional ingredients, no compromises.\nOur aged balsamic vinegar undergoes a traditional aging process which produces complex layers of flavor and aroma within the complementary contrast of sweet and tart.\nA woodsy aroma with hints of stewed fruit is the harmonious balance that makes our balsamic vinegar an Italian masterpiece to be savored.\nDelightfully versatile, try drizzling it on a piece of good parmesan cheese or splash it on thin slices of beef to create a Tuscan favorite 'tagliata di manzo.'\nCertified GMO-Free, Certified Vegan, Sodium Free.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. When it comes to innovative flavors and products sourced from artisans and producers around the world, the Whole Foods Market brand has you covered. Amazing products, exceptional ingredients, no compromises.\", \"Our aged balsamic vinegar undergoes a traditional aging process which produces complex layers of flavor and aroma within the complementary contrast of sweet and tart.\", \"A woodsy aroma with hints of stewed fruit is the harmonious balance that makes our balsamic vinegar an Italian masterpiece to be savored.\", \"Delightfully versatile, try drizzling it on a piece of good parmesan cheese or splash it on thin slices of beef to create a Tuscan favorite 'tagliata di manzo.'\", \"Certified GMO-Free, Certified Vegan, Sodium Free.\"]","keywords":"[\"grocery & gourmet food cooking & baking cooking oils, vinegars & sprays vinegars balsamic vinegars balsamic vinegars\", \"whole foods, whole food, whole foods,whole foods market\"]","node_path":"Categories/Pantry Staples/Cooking & Baking/Cooking Oils, Vinegars & Sprays/Vinegars/Balsamic","created_at":"2023-04-17T23:58:17Z"}
