{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab750"},"product_id":1189,"item_id":"B074H6KTWH","category_id":99,"name":"Three Beans Coffee, Coffee Extra Dark Whole Bean, 13 Ounce","brand":"Three Beans Coffee","color":"","weight_lb":0.81,"price_cents":1199,"stock":158,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market.\nYour mornings are about to get better. Our Three Beans Dark Roast Coffee is crafted from some of the most loved coffee around. It’s then ultra-deep roasted to deliver that famous west coast roast style many of us have come to love.\nOur 100% arabica beans are smoky, deep and satisfying so that you can enjoy this coffee with or without cream. For that ultimate fresh-roasted flavor, we recommend grinding these beans just before brewing.\nWhole coffee beans.\nCertified Kosher.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market.\", \"Your mornings are about to get better. Our Three Beans Dark Roast Coffee is crafted from some of the most loved coffee around. It’s then ultra-deep roasted to deliver that famous west coast roast style many of us have come to love.\", \"Our 100% arabica beans are smoky, deep and satisfying so that you can enjoy this coffee with or without cream. For that ultimate fresh-roasted flavor, we recommend grinding these beans just before brewing.\", \"Whole coffee beans.\", \"Certified Kosher.\"]","keywords":"[\"breakfast coffee whole bean packaged grocery & gourmet food beverages coffee, tea & cocoa coffee\", \"placeholder\"]","node_path":"Categories/Beverages/Coffee, Tea & Cocoa/Coffee/Roasted Coffee Beans","created_at":"2024-05-21T10:22:24Z"}
