{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab7ac"},"product_id":1281,"item_id":"B074HJF6KM","category_id":156,"name":"365 EVERYDAY VALUE Organic Black Chia Seeds, 15 OZ","brand":"365 Everyday Value","color":"","weight_lb":0.98,"price_cents":2399,"stock":6,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\nLooking for an easy and mildly nutty way to bump up your intake of Omega-3 Fatty Acids? Sprinkle some of our Organic Black Chia Seeds onto morning cereals or evening salads, take in 4767mg of Omega-3, 9 grams of Fiber and 6 grams of Protein per serving.\nMuch like Poppy Seeds, they also add subtle flavor, texture and visual interest—something that hot bowl of oatmeal might be interested in. (P.S. No grinding necessary!)\nChia Seeds Are Naturally Sodium Free\nVegan\nCertified Kosher\nNon-GMO Project Verified\nUSDA Certified Organic\nQAI Certified Organic - If It's Organic It's Non-GMO","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\", \"Looking for an easy and mildly nutty way to bump up your intake of Omega-3 Fatty Acids? Sprinkle some of our Organic Black Chia Seeds onto morning cereals or evening salads, take in 4767mg of Omega-3, 9 grams of Fiber and 6 grams of Protein per serving.\", \"Much like Poppy Seeds, they also add subtle flavor, texture and visual interest—something that hot bowl of oatmeal might be interested in. (P.S. No grinding necessary!)\", \"Chia Seeds Are Naturally Sodium Free\", \"Vegan\", \"Certified Kosher\", \"Non-GMO Project Verified\", \"USDA Certified Organic\", \"QAI Certified Organic - If It's Organic It's Non-GMO\"]","keywords":"[\"whole foods, whole food, whole foods,365 everyday value\"]","node_path":"Products","created_at":"2023-07-04T04:16:38Z"}
