{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab7cd"},"product_id":1314,"item_id":"B074M97389","category_id":119,"name":"Whole Foods Market, Organic Pipe Rigate, 16 oz","brand":"Whole Foods Market","color":"","weight_lb":1.18,"price_cents":1099,"stock":76,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. When it comes to innovative flavors and products sourced from artisans and producers around the world, the Whole Foods Market brand has you covered. Amazing products, exceptional ingredients, no compromises.\nOur organic pipe rigate is made in Italy at an authentic pastificio dedicated to making only the highest quality pastas. Made with organic durum wheat, our pasta is bronze cut the old-fashioned way and slowly dried to preserve its authentic flavor.\nA larger version of macaroni, its hollow shape holds sauce on the inside while the ridges grab it on the outside-it's the perfect pasta selection for a meaty or chunky tomato sauce.\nLow Fat, Sodium Free.\nCertified Organic, Certified Kosher, Certified Vegan.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. When it comes to innovative flavors and products sourced from artisans and producers around the world, the Whole Foods Market brand has you covered. Amazing products, exceptional ingredients, no compromises.\", \"Our organic pipe rigate is made in Italy at an authentic pastificio dedicated to making only the highest quality pastas. Made with organic durum wheat, our pasta is bronze cut the old-fashioned way and slowly dried to preserve its authentic flavor.\", \"A larger version of macaroni, its hollow shape holds sauce on the inside while the ridges grab it on the outside-it's the perfect pasta selection for a meaty or chunky tomato sauce.\", \"Low Fat, Sodium Free.\", \"Certified Organic, Certified Kosher, Certified Vegan.\"]","keywords":"[\"rigatoni\", \"ziti\", \"pasta\", \"mezzi\", \"linguini\", \"rotini\", \"noodle\", \"dried\", \"mezze\", \"bucatini\", \"dececco\", \"grain\", \"linguine\", \"vegetable\", \"speghetti\", \"ounce\", \"canned\", \"sauce\", \"spagetti\", \"spaghetti\"]","node_path":"Categories/Pantry Staples/Pasta & Noodles/Pasta/Rigatoni","created_at":"2023-08-24T15:23:53Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab7ce"},"product_id":1315,"item_id":"B074M992CV","category_id":119,"name":"365 Everyday Value, Shells & Cheese, 7.25 oz","brand":"365 Everyday Value","color":"","weight_lb":0.67,"price_cents":699,"stock":20,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.\nTiny, tender durum wheat pasta shells mixed with a tangy white cheddar cheese sauce make our Shells and Cheese a delicious version of a classic american favorite.\nWarm and satisfying, ready to eat in just minutes, it’s the perfect quick lunch, dinner or afternoon snack, any day of the week.\nMade with White Cheddar Cheese.\nCertified Vegetarian.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.\", \"Tiny, tender durum wheat pasta shells mixed with a tangy white cheddar cheese sauce make our Shells and Cheese a delicious version of a classic american favorite.\", \"Warm and satisfying, ready to eat in just minutes, it’s the perfect quick lunch, dinner or afternoon snack, any day of the week.\", \"Made with White Cheddar Cheese.\", \"Certified Vegetarian.\"]","keywords":"[\"cheesy\", \"snack\", \"boyardee\", \"grocery\", \"meatball\", \"beef\", \"pasta\", \"meal\", \"chicken\", \"lasagne\", \"food\", \"shell\", \"stroganoff\", \"canned\", \"meat\", \"ravioli\", \"dinner\", \"dish\", \"sauce\", \"lasagna\"]","node_path":"Categories/Pantry Staples/Canned, Jarred & Packaged Foods/Packaged Meals & Side Dishes/Pasta & Noodle Dishes/Pasta","created_at":"2024-06-14T16:01:06Z"}
