{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab7d6"},"product_id":1323,"item_id":"B074M9QT31","category_id":203,"name":"AmazonBasics 100 Watt Equivalent, Soft White, Dimmable, A21 LED Light Bulb | 16-Pack","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Soft White","weight_lb":9.0,"price_cents":699,"stock":46,"description":"With a life of 15,000 hours, the bulb will last over 13 years (based on 3 hours of use each day)\nProvides 1500 lumens of light immediately, with no waiting time to warm up to full brightness\nWith a correlated color temperature of 2700 Kelvin, this bulb provides a soft white light, creating a comfortable atmosphere for any room\nThis LED light bulb uses only 15 watts of energy, saving up to $140.25 over the life of the bulb vs. its incandescent equivalent (based on 3 hours/day, 11 cents/kWh, may vary depending on rates and use)\nThis bulb costs only $1.81 per year to operate (based on 3 hours/day, 11 cents/kWh) making it an economical alternative to incandescent bulbs\n1 year limited warranty","bullets":"[\"With a life of 15,000 hours, the bulb will last over 13 years (based on 3 hours of use each day)\", \"Provides 1500 lumens of light immediately, with no waiting time to warm up to full brightness\", \"With a correlated color temperature of 2700 Kelvin, this bulb provides a soft white light, creating a comfortable atmosphere for any room\", \"This LED light bulb uses only 15 watts of energy, saving up to $140.25 over the life of the bulb vs. its incandescent equivalent (based on 3 hours/day, 11 cents/kWh, may vary depending on rates and use)\", \"This bulb costs only $1.81 per year to operate (based on 3 hours/day, 11 cents/kWh) making it an economical alternative to incandescent bulbs\", \"1 year limited warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"100w\", \"a21\", \"led\", \"amazon basics\", \"bulb\", \"energy efficient\", \"light\", \"lightbulb\", \"low energy\"]","node_path":"Categories/Indoor Lighting/Light Bulbs/LED Bulbs","created_at":"2023-07-18T22:09:17Z"}
