{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab7d8"},"product_id":1325,"item_id":"B074MDF9RX","category_id":295,"name":"AmazonBasics Pet Enclosure","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"","weight_lb":4.52,"price_cents":1799,"stock":1,"description":"Pet Enclosure with locking access ideal for dwarf dogs, small dogs or other small non-climbing animals\nCreates a 0.74 square metre pen, can also be used in other ways such as For example as a fence or gate for your pet\nThe parts are made from high strength polypropylene plastic, parts can be locked securely with long bars, non-slip rubber feet for secure placement\nExpandable design (additional parts sold separately from AmazonBasics) for indoor/outdoor use - colour selectable\nPlease note: Please pay attention to the size of your pet relative to the size of the bars Very small pets, such as small puppies, can sit between the bars when trying to escape from the enclosure","bullets":"[\"Pet Enclosure with locking access ideal for dwarf dogs, small dogs or other small non-climbing animals\", \"Creates a 0.74 square metre pen, can also be used in other ways such as For example as a fence or gate for your pet\", \"The parts are made from high strength polypropylene plastic, parts can be locked securely with long bars, non-slip rubber feet for secure placement\", \"Expandable design (additional parts sold separately from AmazonBasics) for indoor/outdoor use - colour selectable\", \"Please note: Please pay attention to the size of your pet relative to the size of the bars Very small pets, such as small puppies, can sit between the bars when trying to escape from the enclosure\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-09-29T23:52:00Z"}
