{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab7e3"},"product_id":1336,"item_id":"B074MFKG1L","category_id":117,"name":"365 Everyday Value, Organic Pinto Beans, 16 oz","brand":"365 Everyday Value","color":"","weight_lb":1.13,"price_cents":599,"stock":43,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.\nOur Organic Pinto Beans are nutritious and an excellent source of fiber. A staple of Mexican and Southwestern cooking, pinto beans are small and flavorful.\nAdd them to burritos, use them for soups and side dishes, or make a classic dish of refried beans from scratch. The taste will be worth the extra time!\nExcellent source of Fiber. Good source of Iron & Potassium. Low Fat. Low Sodium.\nCertified Organic, Certified Kosher, Certified Vegan.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.\", \"Our Organic Pinto Beans are nutritious and an excellent source of fiber. A staple of Mexican and Southwestern cooking, pinto beans are small and flavorful.\", \"Add them to burritos, use them for soups and side dishes, or make a classic dish of refried beans from scratch. The taste will be worth the extra time!\", \"Excellent source of Fiber. Good source of Iron & Potassium. Low Fat. Low Sodium.\", \"Certified Organic, Certified Kosher, Certified Vegan.\"]","keywords":"[\"refried\", \"grocery\", \"frijoles\", \"gluten\", \"vegetarian\", \"frijol\", \"foods\", \"unsalted\", \"canned\", \"sodium\", \"negros\", \"italian\", \"dried\", \"bushs\", \"seasoning\", \"beens\", \"blacl\", \"beand\"]","node_path":"Categories/Pantry Staples/Dried Beans, Lentils & Peas/Beans/Pinto","created_at":"2024-06-12T14:41:44Z"}
