{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab7e7"},"product_id":1340,"item_id":"B074MFKYJX","category_id":143,"name":"Whole Foods Market, Fizzing Bath Bomb, Coconut Milk, 2.3 oz","brand":"Whole Foods Market","color":"","weight_lb":0.16,"price_cents":2899,"stock":216,"description":"Fill your tub and release a fizzing bath bomb into pleasantly warm water. Thousands of tiny bubbles release the skin softening mixture of salt, sugar, coconut oil and natural fragrance from the most enjoyable of essential oils.\nSoak, breathe deeply, and enjoy the benefits of aromatherapy with a bathing experience that soothes and renews.\nProduct of USA.\nWhole Foods Market Premium Body Care.\nBrought to you by Whole Foods Market. When it comes to innovative flavors and products sourced from artisans and producers around the world, the Whole Foods Market brand has you covered. Amazing products, exceptional ingredients, no compromises.","bullets":"[\"Fill your tub and release a fizzing bath bomb into pleasantly warm water. Thousands of tiny bubbles release the skin softening mixture of salt, sugar, coconut oil and natural fragrance from the most enjoyable of essential oils.\", \"Soak, breathe deeply, and enjoy the benefits of aromatherapy with a bathing experience that soothes and renews.\", \"Product of USA.\", \"Whole Foods Market Premium Body Care.\", \"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. When it comes to innovative flavors and products sourced from artisans and producers around the world, the Whole Foods Market brand has you covered. Amazing products, exceptional ingredients, no compromises.\"]","keywords":"[\"wfm\", \"175293\", \"bath and shower products\", \"grocery\"]","node_path":"Products/Personal Care/Bath & Bathing Accessories","created_at":"2023-02-17T17:47:22Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab7e8"},"product_id":1341,"item_id":"B074MFLSZT","category_id":97,"name":"Engine 2, Rip's Big Bowl, Original Cereal, 13 oz","brand":"Engine 2","color":"","weight_lb":1.05,"price_cents":799,"stock":74,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market.\nRip's Big Bowl has been my signature breakfast for more than twenty-five years. I never get tired of it, and no two bowls are ever quite the same when you add your favorite fruits and plant-based milk.\nThe core of each big bowl is a bountiful blend of four wholesome whole grain cereals - oats, shredded wheat, wheat berries, and sprouted grain nuggets -topped off with an earthy, walnut crunch.\nLow Sodium, no sugar added.\nCertified GMO-Free, Certified Kosher, Certified Vegan.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market.\", \"Rip's Big Bowl has been my signature breakfast for more than twenty-five years. I never get tired of it, and no two bowls are ever quite the same when you add your favorite fruits and plant-based milk.\", \"The core of each big bowl is a bountiful blend of four wholesome whole grain cereals - oats, shredded wheat, wheat berries, and sprouted grain nuggets -topped off with an earthy, walnut crunch.\", \"Low Sodium, no sugar added.\", \"Certified GMO-Free, Certified Kosher, Certified Vegan.\"]","keywords":"[\"cereal\", \"ounce\", \"kellog\", \"food\", \"bran\", \"morning\", \"flake\", \"ceral\", \"kellogg\", \"crunchy\", \"cheerio\", \"dollar\", \"path\", \"flavored\", \"grain\"]","node_path":"Categories/Breakfast Foods/Cereals/Cold Cereals","created_at":"2023-04-03T07:24:54Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab7e9"},"product_id":1342,"item_id":"B074MFN7H6","category_id":113,"name":"365 Everyday Value, Potato Chips, Dill Pickle, 1.5 oz","brand":"365 Everyday Value","color":"","weight_lb":0.12,"price_cents":699,"stock":59,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.\nIt's time to get tangy! Our chips are made with thin slices of potatoes, rapidly cooked in expeller pressed oil and seasoned with salt, vinegar and that oh-so-tangy flavor of a crunchy dill pickle.\nThese pucker-worthy crisps are a classic snack; they're perfect for picnics, road trips or with your next sandwich. They're simply irresistible.\nNo sugar added.\nCertified GMO-Free, Certified Gluten Free, Certified Kosher, Certified Vegan.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.\", \"It's time to get tangy! Our chips are made with thin slices of potatoes, rapidly cooked in expeller pressed oil and seasoned with salt, vinegar and that oh-so-tangy flavor of a crunchy dill pickle.\", \"These pucker-worthy crisps are a classic snack; they're perfect for picnics, road trips or with your next sandwich. They're simply irresistible.\", \"No sugar added.\", \"Certified GMO-Free, Certified Gluten Free, Certified Kosher, Certified Vegan.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"Categories/Snack Foods/Chips & Crisps/Potato","created_at":"2023-01-17T02:11:03Z"}
