{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab7fc"},"product_id":1361,"item_id":"B074MG73TM","category_id":118,"name":"365 Everyday Value, Organic Light Coconut Milk, 13.5 fl oz","brand":"365 by Whole Foods Market","color":"","weight_lb":1.05,"price_cents":699,"stock":99,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\nClimbing a tree for fresh coconut milk isn't an easy job, so we've got you covered. Carefully pressed and naturally processed, our Organic Light Coconut Milk has a silky smooth texture and exceptional flavor and a lot less fat.\nFrom spicy curry to island fresh piña coladas, our organic coconut milk can give your recipe that extra jolt of exotic flavor. And you don't have to climb a single tree.\nSodium free, no sugar added.\nCertified Organic, Certified Vegan.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\", \"Climbing a tree for fresh coconut milk isn't an easy job, so we've got you covered. Carefully pressed and naturally processed, our Organic Light Coconut Milk has a silky smooth texture and exceptional flavor and a lot less fat.\", \"From spicy curry to island fresh piña coladas, our organic coconut milk can give your recipe that extra jolt of exotic flavor. And you don't have to climb a single tree.\", \"Sodium free, no sugar added.\", \"Certified Organic, Certified Vegan.\"]","keywords":"[\"cocunut\", \"coconutmilk\", \"cocount\", \"lowfat\", \"ghee\", \"cocnut\", \"evaporated\", \"milk\", \"oat\", \"unsweetend\", \"subscribe\", \"cocont\", \"soymilk\", \"aroy\", \"flavored\", \"concentrate\", \"sweetened\", \"crema\", \"ounce\", \"millk\"]","node_path":"Categories/Pantry Staples/Cooking & Baking","created_at":"2024-01-20T07:57:32Z"}
