{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab806"},"product_id":1371,"item_id":"B074MGP5HV","category_id":117,"name":"365 Everyday Value, Organic Red Kidney Beans, 16 oz","brand":"365 Everyday Value","color":"","weight_lb":1.13,"price_cents":399,"stock":0,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.\nOur Organic Red Kidney Beans are robust, nutritious and versatile. A great way to up your intake of protein and fiber, they soak up the flavor in a meatless chili, a hearty minestrone soup or red beans and rice.\nThey are also a terrific burst of color in bean salads and layered party dips.\nExcellent source of Fiber & Iron. Good source of Potassium. Fat Free. Sodium Free.\nCertified Organic, Certified Kosher, Certified Vegan.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.\", \"Our Organic Red Kidney Beans are robust, nutritious and versatile. A great way to up your intake of protein and fiber, they soak up the flavor in a meatless chili, a hearty minestrone soup or red beans and rice.\", \"They are also a terrific burst of color in bean salads and layered party dips.\", \"Excellent source of Fiber & Iron. Good source of Potassium. Fat Free. Sodium Free.\", \"Certified Organic, Certified Kosher, Certified Vegan.\"]","keywords":"[\"cannellini\", \"frijole\", \"refried\", \"kidney\", \"vegetarian\", \"frijol\", \"food\", \"canned\", \"sodium\", \"vegetable\", \"dried\"]","node_path":"Categories/Pantry Staples/Dried Beans, Lentils & Peas/Beans/Kidney","created_at":"2023-02-12T21:16:23Z"}
