{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab81d"},"product_id":1394,"item_id":"B074MHLXCF","category_id":101,"name":"365 Everyday Value, Woven Wheats, Baked Crackers, 7 oz","brand":"365 by Whole Foods Market","color":"","weight_lb":0.79,"price_cents":799,"stock":0,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\nOur woven wheats are made from just two ingredients, shredded whole wheat and salt, and always without hydrogenated oils. Our simple recipe is baked for a crisp crunch that is perfect for snacking.\nWith 29 grams of whole grains per serving, they're a satisfying snack on their own, or serve them alongside a bowl of tomato soup, or top with anything from cheese to peanut butter and jelly.\nLow fat, no sugar added.\nCertified Kosher, Certified Vegan.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\", \"Our woven wheats are made from just two ingredients, shredded whole wheat and salt, and always without hydrogenated oils. Our simple recipe is baked for a crisp crunch that is perfect for snacking.\", \"With 29 grams of whole grains per serving, they're a satisfying snack on their own, or serve them alongside a bowl of tomato soup, or top with anything from cheese to peanut butter and jelly.\", \"Low fat, no sugar added.\", \"Certified Kosher, Certified Vegan.\"]","keywords":"[\"wheat\", \"crisp\", \"multigrain\", \"toasted\", \"cracker\", \"thins\", \"pretzel\", \"saltine\", \"snack\", \"triscuits\", \"galletas\", \"biscuit\", \"veggie\", \"grain\", \"parmesan\", \"food\", \"unsalted\", \"shredded\", \"chicken\", \"gmo\"]","node_path":"Catego