{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab83e"},"product_id":1427,"item_id":"B074VJYSKZ","category_id":194,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Mudcloth-Inspired Decorative Throw Pillow, 17\" x 17\", Pale Grey","brand":"Rivet","color":"Pale Gray","weight_lb":1.0,"price_cents":4899,"stock":20,"description":"This throw pillow's mudcloth-inspired pattern will give your room a global, modern twist. Skillfully sewn, high quality fabric and a plush pillow insert make this a cozy, resilient addition to a sofa or chair.\nMudcloth-inspired patterns create a modern, global style\nSewn in U.S. of durable cotton/polyester blend fabric\nPillow Cover: 74% Cotton,26% Polyester. Insert Shell: 100% Cotton. Stuffing: 100% Polyester\nMade in USA and Imported\nRemovable plush fiber-filled insert included\nPillow cover features hidden bottom zipper\n17\" x 17\"\nSpot clean with damp white cloth and allow to air dry","bullets":"[\"This throw pillow's mudcloth-inspired pattern will give your room a global, modern twist. Skillfully sewn, high quality fabric and a plush pillow insert make this a cozy, resilient addition to a sofa or chair.\", \"Mudcloth-inspired patterns create a modern, global style\", \"Sewn in U.S. of durable cotton/polyester blend fabric\", \"Pillow Cover: 74% Cotton,26% Polyester. Insert Shell: 100% Cotton. Stuffing: 100% Polyester\", \"Made in USA and Imported\", \"Removable plush fiber-filled insert included\", \"Pillow cover features hidden bottom zipper\", \"17\\\" x 17\\\"\", \"Spot clean with damp white cloth and allow to air dry\"]","keywords":"[\"throw-pillows\", \"throw pillows\", \"decorative pillows\", \"throw pillow covers\", \"pillows decorative throw pillows\", \"throw pillows for couch\", \"couch pillows\", \"pillow covers\", \"outdoor pillows\", \"decorative pillow covers\", \"throw pillow\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"pale gray\", \"gray\", \"17\\\"x17\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-06-22T14:44:21Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab83f"},"product_id":1428,"item_id":"B074VKWJWP","category_id":209,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Striated Velvet Linen-Look Decorative Throw Pillow, 17\" x 17\", Vanilla","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Vanilla","weight_lb":1.0,"price_cents":4099,"stock":10,"description":"Subtle striations give a modern twist to this classic velvet pillow, which comes in a variety of colors for easy mixing and matching. For a different look, flip the pillow around to display the solid linen-look fabric on the back.\nModern refresh of classic velvet pillow\nPolyester. Front is velvet; back is smooth, linen-like fabric\nPillow Cover: 100% Polyester. Insert Shell: 100% Cotton. Stuffing: 100% Polyester\nMade in USA and Imported\nRemovable plush fiber-filled insert included\nPillow cover features hidden bottom zipper\n17\" x 17\"\nSpot clean with damp white cloth and allow to air dry","bullets":"[\"Subtle striations give a modern twist to this classic velvet pillow, which comes in a variety of colors for easy mixing and matching. For a different look, flip the pillow around to display the solid linen-look fabric on the back.\", \"Modern refresh of classic velvet pillow\", \"Polyester. Front is velvet; back is smooth, linen-like fabric\", \"Pillow Cover: 100% Polyester. Insert Shell: 100% Cotton. Stuffing: 100% Polyester\", \"Made in USA and Imported\", \"Removable plush fiber-filled insert included\", \"Pillow cover features hidden bottom zipper\", \"17\\\" x 17\\\"\", \"Spot clean with damp white cloth and allow to air dry\"]","keywords":"[\"throw-pillows\", \"throw pillows\", \"decorative pillows\", \"throw pillow covers\", \"pillows decorative throw pillows\", \"throw pillows for couch\", \"couch pillows\", \"pillow covers\", \"outdoor pillows\", \"decorative pillow covers\", \"throw pillow\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"vanilla\", \"ivory\", \"17\\\"17\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-04-30T04:14:08Z"}
