{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab859"},"product_id":1454,"item_id":"B074Y74CCR","category_id":98,"name":"Whole Foods Market, Limited Edition Panettone, Traditional, 16 Ounce","brand":"Whole Foods Market","color":"","weight_lb":1.0,"price_cents":599,"stock":3,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.\nLimited Edition - Get yours while supplies last!\nProduct of Italy\nPrepared according to a time-honored recipe and imported from Italy, our Panettone is made with creamery butter, sweet candied orange peels and plump sultanas.\nFrom start to finish, each loaf takes over 36 hours to develop, and the end result is a unique holiday dessert with a distinctively sweet aroma.\nVegetarian\nIts robust flavor truly shines when served toasted with a cup of strong, dark coffee or tea. And the next day, slice up the rest for deliciously festive French toast.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.\", \"Limited Edition - Get yours while supplies last!\", \"Product of Italy\", \"Prepared according to a time-honored recipe and imported from Italy, our Panettone is made with creamery butter, sweet candied orange peels and plump sultanas.\", \"From start to finish, each loaf takes over 36 hours to develop, and the end result is a unique holiday dessert with a distinctively sweet aroma.\", \"Vegetarian\", \"Its robust flavor truly shines when served toasted with a cup of strong, dark coffee or tea. And the next day, slice up the rest for deliciously festive French toast.\"]","keywords":"[\"grocery & gourmet food breads & bakery cakes panettones bread other\", \"placeholder\"]","node_path":"Categories/Breads & Bakery/Cakes/Panettones","created_at":"2023-10-22T08:46:00Z"}
