{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab85e"},"product_id":1459,"item_id":"B074ZV2DSW","category_id":39,"name":"AmazonBasics USB 3.1 Type-C to 4-Port Aluminum Hub Connector, Black","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Black","weight_lb":0.24,"price_cents":2399,"stock":47,"description":"USB hub transforms 1 USB Type-C port into 4 USB Type-A ports—ideal for mice, keyboards, cameras, and smartphones; not recommended to charge high-powered devices such as tablets\nSyncs and charges up to 4 devices at a time; fast data-transfer speeds of up to 5 Gbps; supports USB 3.1; backwards compatible with USB 3.0 and 2.0\nReversible design - easily insert the connector into any Type-C enabled device; plug and play (no drivers required); compatible with Windows 10, 8, and 7 and Mac OS 10 or later\nDurable aluminum shell; ports are positioned at an upward angle for easy access; available in Black or Silver\nSelf-adhesive Velcro strips for secure placement; backed by an AmazonBasics limited 1-year warranty","bullets":"[\"USB hub transforms 1 USB Type-C port into 4 USB Type-A ports—ideal for mice, keyboards, cameras, and smartphones; not recommended to charge high-powered devices such as tablets\", \"Syncs and charges up to 4 devices at a time; fast data-transfer speeds of up to 5 Gbps; supports USB 3.1; backwards compatible with USB 3.0 and 2.0\", \"Reversible design - easily insert the connector into any Type-C enabled device; plug and play (no drivers required); compatible with Windows 10, 8, and 7 and Mac OS 10 or later\", \"Durable aluminum shell; ports are positioned at an upward angle for easy access; available in Black or Silver\", \"Self-adhesive Velcro strips for secure placement; backed by an AmazonBasics limited 1-year warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"sabrent\", \"small\", \"anker\", \"connectors\", \"extension\", \"basics\", \"powered\", \"thunderbolt\", \"reader\", \"converter\", \"switches\", \"dongle\", \"totu\", \"j5\", \"air\", \"laptop\", \"multi\", \"switch\", \"ps4\", \"um43)\"]","node_path":"Categories/Computers & Accessories/Computer Accessories & Peripherals/USB Hubs","created_at":"2024-02-23T18:14:39Z"}
