{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab863"},"product_id":1464,"item_id":"B07537HZ5K","category_id":35,"name":"AmazonBasics Wireless Mouse with Nano Receiver and Mini Gaming Mouse Pad, Black","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Black","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1899,"stock":17,"description":"Smooth, precise and affordable wireless optical 3-button mouse with nano receiver for laptop, desktop and netbook PCs\n2.4 GHz wireless provides a powerful, reliable connection\nNano-receiver stays in your PC USB port or stows conveniently inside the wireless mouse when not in use (note: Receiver is stored within the mouse from production and needs to be removed once opened)\nMini gaming mouse pad-ideal for gamers, graphic designers, or anyone who uses a mouse\nHigh-quality cloth surface promotes smooth mouse gliding and enhanced precision\nSteady, thick, rubberized base keeps mouse pad in place","bullets":"[\"Smooth, precise and affordable wireless optical 3-button mouse with nano receiver for laptop, desktop and netbook PCs\", \"2.4 GHz wireless provides a powerful, reliable connection\", \"Nano-receiver stays in your PC USB port or stows conveniently inside the wireless mouse when not in use (note: Receiver is stored within the mouse from production and needs to be removed once opened)\", \"Mini gaming mouse pad-ideal for gamers, graphic designers, or anyone who uses a mouse\", \"High-quality cloth surface promotes smooth mouse gliding and enhanced precision\", \"Steady, thick, rubberized base keeps mouse pad in place\"]","keywords":"[\"computer\", \"infrared\", \"wireless\", \"cordless\", \"mouse\", \"optical\", \"black\", \"multimedia\", \"pc\", \"apple\", \"mac\", \"windows\", \"os\", \"plug and play\"]","node_path":"Categories/Computers & Accessories/Computer Accessories & Peripherals/Keyboards, Mice & Accessories/Mice","created_at":"2023-11-23T13:31:06Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab864"},"product_id":1465,"item_id":"B0753LWN5S","category_id":238,"name":"Rose-Gold-Plated Sterling Silver Princess-Cut Misty Rose Swarovski Topaz Gemstone Pendant Necklace","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Misty Rose","weight_lb":0.01,"price_cents":16999,"stock":29,"description":"imported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"fine fashion\"]","node_path":"Categories/Women/Jewellery/Necklaces","created_at":"2023-01-11T22:25:44Z"}
