{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab883"},"product_id":1496,"item_id":"B075HR7DM7","category_id":224,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Modern Angled Stoneware Vase, 5.25\"H, White","brand":"Rivet","color":"","weight_lb":1.32,"price_cents":3899,"stock":7,"description":"Neutral white with angled patterns allow it to blend with any room\n100% stoneware with transparent glaze\n4.75\"Diameter x 5.25\" H\nDurable stoneware vase great for display or holding flowers.\nSoft folds and angles bring a chic design to this contemporary stoneware vase. The lovely milky white color with transparent glaze will go with any décor. Add flowers if you wish, but this vase can also stand alone as a decorative piece.","bullets":"[\"Neutral white with angled patterns allow it to blend with any room\", \"100% stoneware with transparent glaze\", \"4.75\\\"Diameter x 5.25\\\" H\", \"Durable stoneware vase great for display or holding flowers.\", \"Soft folds and angles bring a chic design to this contemporary stoneware vase. The lovely milky white color with transparent glaze will go with any décor. Add flowers if you wish, but this vase can also stand alone as a decorative piece.\"]","keywords":"[\"vases\", \"vase\", \"flower vase\", \"glass vase\", \"floor vase\", \"farmhouse decor\", \"vases for decor\", \"floor vases decorative tall\", \"white vase\", \"vases for centerpieces\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"wide\"]","node_path":"Categories/Home Décor/Vases","created_at":"2023-04-02T03:59:11Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab884"},"product_id":1497,"item_id":"B075HWJ4MF","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Mid Century Modern Geometric Abstract Mt. Ranier Wall Art Decor on Canvas - 18\" x 24\"","brand":"Rivet","color":"Multicolor","weight_lb":4.0,"price_cents":7499,"stock":0,"description":"This geometric abstract painting on canvas commands attention as it captivates the eye. Inspired by cubism, wisps of gray, orange, green and gold create alternating planes that rise toward the top of the canvas.\n18\"W x 24\"H\nPrinted canvas with hand painted details\nAbstract modern shapes add interest and color to a modern decor\nHanging materials not included","bullets":"[\"This geometric abstract painting on canvas commands attention as it captivates the eye. Inspired by cubism, wisps of gray, orange, green and gold create alternating planes that rise toward the top of the canvas.\", \"18\\\"W x 24\\\"H\", \"Printed canvas with hand painted details\", \"Abstract modern shapes add interest and color to a modern decor\", \"Hanging materials not included\"]","keywords":"[\"prints\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"multi\", \"18\\\"x24\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-01-31T02:30:13Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab885"},"product_id":1498,"item_id":"B075HWJHDJ","category_id":260,"name":"AmazonBasics 6\" x 9\" x 3\" Compostable Clamshell Take-Out Food Container, 300-Count","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Natural","weight_lb":21.38,"price_cents":2599,"stock":0,"description":"Clamshell hinged food container (great for hoagie sandwiches); measures 6 by 9 by 3 inches; includes 6 packs of 50 containers (300 containers total)\nMade of 100% sugarcane fiber\nNo plastic or wax lining; can be used for hot or cold items; note: hot foods can cause the container to perspire and condensation to form at the bottom\nCommercially compostable (can be processed in commercial facilities)\nIdeal for restaurants, food trucks, to-go orders, and other types of food service","bullets":"[\"Clamshell hinged food container (great for hoagie sandwiches); measures 6 by 9 by 3 inches; includes 6 packs of 50 containers (300 containers total)\", \"Made of 100% sugarcane fiber\", \"No plastic or wax lining; can be used for hot or cold items; note: hot foods can cause the container to perspire and condensation to form at the bottom\", \"Commercially compostable (can be processed in commercial facilities)\", \"Ideal for restaurants, food trucks, to-go orders, and other types of food service\"]","keywords":"[\"dispenser,paper,bags,bag,cake,cambro,box,insulated,pizza,dinnerware,home,small,biodegradable,plates,serving,clear,supply,heat,4,75,lunch,away,warmers,camtainer,foam,sustainable,styrofoam,lid,friendly,takeout,uber,eco,baking,togo,supplies,thermal\", \"take out\", \"food service\", \"container\", \"compostable\", \"amazonbasics\"]","node_path":"カテゴリー別/建築金物/建築金具","created_at":"2023-09-27T01:18:12Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab886"},"product_id":1499,"item_id":"B075HWTLKF","category_id":189,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Mid Century Modern Southwestern Blue and Green Cactus Print Wall Art Decor on Canvas, 30 x 30 Inches","brand":"Rivet","color":"Multi Color","weight_lb":4.0,"price_cents":2699,"stock":17,"description":"An iconic figure of southwestern style gets a touch of city chic in this modern painting on canvas. A verdant green cactus plant and blue sky background recalls the vivid color palettes of classic pop art imagery.\n30\"W x 30\"H\nPrinted canvas with hand painted details\nA modern print that will conjure up thoughts of warm desert air and sun\nHanging materials not included","bullets":"[\"An iconic figure of southwestern style gets a touch of city chic in this modern painting on canvas. A verdant green cactus plant and blue sky background recalls the vivid color palettes of classic pop art imagery.\", \"30\\\"W x 30\\\"H\", \"Printed canvas with hand painted details\", \"A modern print that will conjure up thoughts of warm desert air and sun\", \"Hanging materials not included\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"multi\", \"30\\\"x30\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-01-03T12:46:24Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab887"},"product_id":1500,"item_id":"B075HWX46K","category_id":224,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Farmhouse Triangle Pattern Stoneware Home Decor Flower Vase - 9 x 6.6 Inches, Ecru White","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"White","weight_lb":2.6,"price_cents":6299,"stock":7,"description":"With or without flowers, this vase adds a sophisticated touch to a table top or window sill. A reactive glaze gives it an off-white, variegated finish. Geometric triangle patterns add a modern twist to a classic silhouette, complementing any style room.\nNeutral color, modern patterns, classic shape blend in any style room\n100% stoneware. Reactive glazing makes each piece one of a kind.\n6.6\"Diameter x 9\"H\nDurable stoneware vase works for display or holding flowers","bullets":"[\"With or without flowers, this vase adds a sophisticated touch to a table top or window sill. A reactive glaze gives it an off-white, variegated finish. Geometric triangle patterns add a modern twist to a classic silhouette, complementing any style room.\", \"Neutral color, modern patterns, classic shape blend in any style room\", \"100% stoneware. Reactive glazing makes each piece one of a kind.\", \"6.6\\\"Diameter x 9\\\"H\", \"Durable stoneware vase works for display or holding flowers\"]","keywords":"[\"vases\", \"vase\", \"flower vase\", \"glass vase\", \"floor vase\", \"farmhouse decor\", \"vases for decor\", \"floor vases decorative tall\", \"white vase\", \"vases for centerpieces\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"white\", \"9\\\"h\"]","node_path":"Categories/Home Décor/Vases","created_at":"2023-03-15T10:16:44Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab888"},"product_id":1501,"item_id":"B075HX2JJH","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Abstract Gold, White, and Peach Flecks Painting on Canvas Wall Art Decor, 30\" x 30\"","brand":"Rivet","color":"Gold","weight_lb":4.0,"price_cents":6199,"stock":46,"description":"The gilded details and broad brushstrokes of this abstract painting on canvas bring glamour to the room. Beneath gold metal leaf, a textural white and peach background will look luxe in a transitional or modern room. Hang horizontally or vertically.\n30\"W x 30\"H\nPrinted canvas with hand painted details\nSophisticated texture and color will be a focal point of a transitional or modern room\nHanging materials not included","bullets":"[\"The gilded details and broad brushstrokes of this abstract painting on canvas bring glamour to the room. Beneath gold metal leaf, a textural white and peach background will look luxe in a transitional or modern room. Hang horizontally or vertically.\", \"30\\\"W x 30\\\"H\", \"Printed canvas with hand painted details\", \"Sophisticated texture and color will be a focal point of a transitional or modern room\", \"Hanging materials not included\"]","keywords":"[\"prints\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"gold\", \"30\\\"x30\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-07-19T09:02:04Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab889"},"product_id":1502,"item_id":"B075HX5QDJ","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Abstract Blue and Purple Clouds with Gold Leaf Accent on Canvas Wall Art Decor, 24\"W x 36\"H","brand":"Rivet","color":"Multicolor","weight_lb":5.0,"price_cents":16999,"stock":0,"description":"Abstract, swirling white clouds and celestial shades of purple and blue express emotion that transcends time and space. Scattered shades of metal leaf accents cover the piece, forming a galaxy of gold and copper for a modern touch of glam.\n24\"W x 36\"H\nPrinted canvas with hand painted details\nBrilliant colors and effect to add a touch of glam to a modern or transitional room\nHanging materials not included","bullets":"[\"Abstract, swirling white clouds and celestial shades of purple and blue express emotion that transcends time and space. Scattered shades of metal leaf accents cover the piece, forming a galaxy of gold and copper for a modern touch of glam.\", \"24\\\"W x 36\\\"H\", \"Printed canvas with hand painted details\", \"Brilliant colors and effect to add a touch of glam to a modern or transitional room\", \"Hanging materials not included\"]","keywords":"[\"prints\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"multi\", \"24\\\"x36\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-05-14T16:16:40Z"}
