{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab88b"},"product_id":1504,"item_id":"B075HXJ6Q9","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Abstract Modern Gold Halo Painting on White Canvas Wall Art Decor, 30\" x 30\"","brand":"Rivet","color":"Multicolor","weight_lb":4.0,"price_cents":3399,"stock":58,"description":"A shimmering gold halo is the center of this abstract painting on canvas that uses a single circle to suggest continuity and eternity. The artful fusion of matte and metallic finishes makes this modern art piece a stunning addition to urban spaces.\n30\"W x 30\"H\nPrinted canvas with hand painted details\nGold and neutral tones combine for a modern glam look\nHanging materials not included","bullets":"[\"A shimmering gold halo is the center of this abstract painting on canvas that uses a single circle to suggest continuity and eternity. The artful fusion of matte and metallic finishes makes this modern art piece a stunning addition to urban spaces.\", \"30\\\"W x 30\\\"H\", \"Printed canvas with hand painted details\", \"Gold and neutral tones combine for a modern glam look\", \"Hanging materials not included\"]","keywords":"[\"prints\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"multi\", \"30\\\"x30\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-06-12T17:36:31Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab88c"},"product_id":1505,"item_id":"B075HXJPW6","category_id":224,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Ceramic Home Decor Flower Vase With Geometric Pattern - 6.25 Inch, Brown and Grey","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Brown","weight_lb":1.44,"price_cents":2799,"stock":37,"description":"This round stoneware vase features earth-tone geometric patterns fired in a reactive glaze, giving each piece a one-of-a-kind variegated finish. Whether used to hold flowers or simply as a display, its neutral colors will enhance any style room.\nModern patterns on classic ceramic\n100% stoneware with reactive glaze\n5\"Diameter x 6.25\"H\nSturdy, durable piece for decorative display or holding plants","bullets":"[\"This round stoneware vase features earth-tone geometric patterns fired in a reactive glaze, giving each piece a one-of-a-kind variegated finish. Whether used to hold flowers or simply as a display, its neutral colors will enhance any style room.\", \"Modern patterns on classic ceramic\", \"100% stoneware with reactive glaze\", \"5\\\"Diameter x 6.25\\\"H\", \"Sturdy, durable piece for decorative display or holding plants\"]","keywords":"[\"vases\", \"vase\", \"flower vase\", \"glass vase\", \"floor vase\", \"farmhouse decor\", \"vases for decor\", \"floor vases decorative tall\", \"white vase\", \"vases for centerpieces\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"brown\", \"medium\"]","node_path":"Categories/Home Décor/Vases","created_at":"2023-10-25T14:37:41Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab88d"},"product_id":1506,"item_id":"B075L9W1BN","category_id":238,"name":"Amazon Essentials Yellow Gold Plated Sterling Silver Cubic Zirconia Princess Halo Pendant Necklace","brand":"Amazon Essentials","color":"Yellow Gold Plated Sterling Silver","weight_lb":0.01,"price_cents":14999,"stock":26,"description":"Sterling silver necklace featuring a cubic zirconia pendant encircled by a pave-set cubic zirconia halo\nCable chain with spring-ring clasp\nCrafted in .925 sterling silver\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Sterling silver necklace featuring a cubic zirconia pendant encircled by a pave-set cubic zirconia halo\", \"Cable chain with spring-ring clasp\", \"Crafted in .925 sterling silver\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"classics with a twist\"]","node_path":"Departments/Boys/Jewelry/Necklaces","created_at":"2023-03-08T19:45:46Z"}
