{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab892"},"product_id":1511,"item_id":"B075M4X9HK","category_id":113,"name":"Whole Foods Market, Milk Chocolate Bar (32% Cacao), 3.5 oz","brand":"Whole Foods Market","color":"","weight_lb":0.22,"price_cents":499,"stock":79,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. When it comes to innovative flavors and products sourced from artisans and producers around the world, the Whole Foods Market brand has you covered. Amazing products, exceptional ingredients, no compromises.\nOur Whole Foods Market Milk Chocolate has a bright flavor with hints of citrus, and a smooth finish with notes of honey and vanilla. Many believe that cacao, like wine, reflects the distinct characteristics of its region.\nOur chocolate is made with chocolate liquor sourced exclusively from Madagascar, and is then prepared and poured by Belgian chocolatiers who add milk and sugar. Enjoy!\nFairtrade.\nCertified Kosher, Certified Vegetarian.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. When it comes to innovative flavors and products sourced from artisans and producers around the world, the Whole Foods Market brand has you covered. Amazing products, exceptional ingredients, no compromises.\", \"Our Whole Foods Market Milk Chocolate has a bright flavor with hints of citrus, and a smooth finish with notes of honey and vanilla. Many believe that cacao, like wine, reflects the distinct characteristics of its region.\", \"Our chocolate is made with chocolate liquor sourced exclusively from Madagascar, and is then prepared and poured by Belgian chocolatiers who add milk and sugar. Enjoy!\", \"Fairtrade.\", \"Certified Kosher, Certified Vegetarian.\"]","keywords":"[\"hershey\", \"snack\", \"chocolate\", \"dark\", \"count\"]","node_path":"Categories/Candy & Chocolate/Candy & Chocolate Bars","created_at":"2023-12-18T08:22:26Z"}
