{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab896"},"product_id":1515,"item_id":"B075M8YKKC","category_id":114,"name":"365 Everyday Value, Organic Ground Cloves Ground, 1.87 oz","brand":"365 by Whole Foods Market","color":"","weight_lb":0.12,"price_cents":799,"stock":133,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\nProduct of Sri Lanka.\nCertified Organic, Certified Kosher.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\", \"Product of Sri Lanka.\", \"Certified Organic, Certified Kosher.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"Categories/Pantry Staples/Herbs, Spices & Seasonings/Single Herbs & Spices/Cloves","created_at":"2023-03-16T15:31:56Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab897"},"product_id":1516,"item_id":"B075M8YLKH","category_id":157,"name":"365 Everyday Value, Whole Leaf Filtered Aloe Vera Juice, Pomegranate Cranberry Flavor, 32 fl oz","brand":"365 by Whole Foods Market","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1399,"stock":17,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\nOur Aloe is traditionally processed using the entire leaf. This inclusive method retains more biologically active components found in the most potent part of the plant.\nWith no added water and sweetened only with the juices of pomegranate, cranberries and pear, our Aloe Vera Juice can help soothe your upset stomach, mucous membranes and other internal tissues.\nFiltered to reduce Anthraquinone to less than 5 parts per million.\nContains the full range of aloe polyssacharides.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\", \"Our Aloe is traditionally processed using the entire leaf. This inclusive method retains more biologically active components found in the most potent part of the plant.\", \"With no added water and sweetened only with the juices of pomegranate, cranberries and pear, our Aloe Vera Juice can help soothe your upset stomach, mucous membranes and other internal tissues.\", \"Filtered to reduce Anthraquinone to less than 5 parts per million.\", \"Contains the full range of aloe polyssacharides.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"Products/Vitamins & Dietary Supplements/Herbal Supplements/Aloe Vera","created_at":"2024-03-23T22:50:23Z"}
