{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8a8"},"product_id":1533,"item_id":"B075NYHXMF","category_id":265,"name":"AmazonBasics 10-Cup Water Pitcher with Filter and AmazonBasics Replacement Water Filters for AmazonBasics & Brita Pitchers - 3-Pack","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":2299,"stock":12,"description":"Reduces chlorine taste and odor and elements like copper, mercury, benzene, and limescale for great-tasting water\nElectronic filter-change indicator; removable lid ensures easy refilling; large, easy-grip handle for comfortable pouring\nOval shape allows for convenient refrigerator-door storage; dishwasher-safe pitcher and removable reservoir\n3-pack of replacement water filters for AmazonBasics and Brita pitchers\nFast, easy set-up with no pre-soaking required","bullets":"[\"Reduces chlorine taste and odor and elements like copper, mercury, benzene, and limescale for great-tasting water\", \"Electronic filter-change indicator; removable lid ensures easy refilling; large, easy-grip handle for comfortable pouring\", \"Oval shape allows for convenient refrigerator-door storage; dishwasher-safe pitcher and removable reservoir\", \"3-pack of replacement water filters for AmazonBasics and Brita pitchers\", \"Fast, easy set-up with no pre-soaking required\"]","keywords":"[\"brita\", \"clean\", \"healthy\", \"purifier\", \"dispenser\", \"system\", \"brita;water pitcher;water filters\"]","node_path":"Categories/Kitchen & Bath Fixtures/Water Filtration & Softeners/Replacement Water Filters/Replacement Pitcher Water Filters","created_at":"2024-01-31T17:49:47Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8a9"},"product_id":1534,"item_id":"B075QBL1TB","category_id":89,"name":"Rivet Nova Modern Arched Headboard Queen Gold Metal Bed Frame, 63.5\"W, Gold Finish","brand":"Rivet","color":"Gold","weight_lb":"","price_cents":18999,"stock":94,"description":"Elevate your bedroom with this distinctive gold-finished metal bed. It can be played up or down to either be a focal point of an otherwise neutral room or paired with glam-inspired furnishings.\n85\"L x 63.5\"W x 46\"H\nSturdy metal with elegant gold finish\nThe arched headboard has simple rounded spindles; beautifully tapered legs\nTall legs leave plenty of room underneath for storage\nAssemble in 30 minutes to 1 hour. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Elevate your bedroom with this distinctive gold-finished metal bed. It can be played up or down to either be a focal point of an otherwise neutral room or paired with glam-inspired furnishings.\", \"85\\\"L x 63.5\\\"W x 46\\\"H\", \"Sturdy metal with elegant gold finish\", \"The arched headboard has simple rounded spindles; beautifully tapered legs\", \"Tall legs leave plenty of room underneath for storage\", \"Assemble in 30 minutes to 1 hour. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"beds\", \"bed frame\", \"queen bed frame\", \"twin bed frame\", \"king bed frame\", \"headboards for queen beds\", \"platform bed frame\", \"daybed\", \"queen headboard\", \"bed\", \"bed frame queen\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"gold\", \"queen\", \"metal beds\", \"queen bedset\", \"king platform beds\", \"king beds\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Bedroom Furniture/Beds, Frames & Bases/Headboards & Footboards/Headboards","created_at":"2023-09-25T09:14:16Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8aa"},"product_id":1535,"item_id":"B075QDMWTL","category_id":79,"name":"Stone & Beam Bordeaux Tufted Low Wingback Queen Bed with Headboard, 71\"W, Grey","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Infinity Gray","weight_lb":80.5,"price_cents":65999,"stock":13,"description":"The modest wingback on this tall, stately headboard recalls classic style. The tufted upholstered headboard is paired with a simple low-profile footboard and side rails. The lovely neutral grey accents a sophisticated transitional piece.\n90.75\" L x 71\"W x 58.5\"H\nPolyester fabric covers a solid wood frame\nSophisticated classic style provides a focal point in a transitional style bedroom\nNo boxpring required; mattress sold seperatly\nAssemble in 30 minutes to 1 hour\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"The modest wingback on this tall, stately headboard recalls classic style. The tufted upholstered headboard is paired with a simple low-profile footboard and side rails. The lovely neutral grey accents a sophisticated transitional piece.\", \"90.75\\\" L x 71\\\"W x 58.5\\\"H\", \"Polyester fabric covers a solid wood frame\", \"Sophisticated classic style provides a focal point in a transitional style bedroom\", \"No boxpring required; mattress sold seperatly\", \"Assemble in 30 minutes to 1 hour\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"wrangle\", \"cherry\", \"de\", \"study\", \"madera\", \"sds\", \"con\", \"hidden\", \"south\", \"kid\", \"adults\", \"stairs\", \"hideabed\", \"boys\", \"mattresses\", \"storage\", \"captain\", \"remote\", \"incluido\", \"three\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Bedroom Furniture/Beds, Frames & Bases/Beds","created_at":"2024-04-17T08:43:52Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8ab"},"product_id":1536,"item_id":"B075QDV244","category_id":90,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Meredith Twin Backless Daybed Frame With Trundle, 42.5\"W (Mattress Not Included)","brand":"Rivet","color":"Luminata Natural","weight_lb":118.0,"price_cents":10999,"stock":6,"description":"This modern twin daybed is as functional as it is attractive. A trundle on casters rolls out, providing a place to store blankets or clothes -- or a place to put another twin mattress for company. The backless design is convenient for small spaces.\n84.8\"L x 42.5\"W x 35\"H\nNatural hued polyester fabric\nModern lines with classic fabric to blend with most any style\nDaybed and trundle standard twin size mattresses not included. Trundle mattress thickness should not exceed 6.5\".\nAssembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty","bullets":"[\"This modern twin daybed is as functional as it is attractive. A trundle on casters rolls out, providing a place to store blankets or clothes -- or a place to put another twin mattress for company. The backless design is convenient for small spaces.\", \"84.8\\\"L x 42.5\\\"W x 35\\\"H\", \"Natural hued polyester fabric\", \"Modern lines with classic fabric to blend with most any style\", \"Daybed and trundle standard twin size mattresses not included. Trundle mattress thickness should not exceed 6.5\\\".\", \"Assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"daybed-sets\", \"bed frame\", \"queen bed frame\", \"twin bed frame\", \"king bed frame\", \"headboards for queen beds\", \"platform bed frame\", \"daybed\", \"queen headboard\", \"bed\", \"bed frame queen\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"luminata natural\", \"natural\", \"twin daybed\", \"beds\", \"metal beds\", \"queen bedset\"]","node_path":"Categories/Bedding/Bedding Sets & Collections/Daybed Sets","created_at":"2023-04-13T12:28:38Z"}
