{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8ad"},"product_id":1538,"item_id":"B075QG3JVF","category_id":79,"name":"Rivet Payton Mid-Century Modern Tufted King Bed with Headboard, 82\" W, Natural","brand":"Rivet","color":"Natural Herringbone","weight_lb":131.0,"price_cents":31999,"stock":55,"description":"This bed is as functional as it is elegant. Subtle tufting in the herringbone fabric gives the headboard and footboard distinctive style. Four drawers underneath provide the perfect place for hiding Christmas gifts or storing off-season clothing.\n89.4\"L x 82\"W x 59.8\"H\n100% polyester fabric\nMid-century modern-inspired design with subtle tufting\nTwo drawers on each side are preassembled and easy to slide in\nAssemble in 30 minutes to 1 hour. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\nNo box spring required; mattress sold seperately\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This bed is as functional as it is elegant. Subtle tufting in the herringbone fabric gives the headboard and footboard distinctive style. Four drawers underneath provide the perfect place for hiding Christmas gifts or storing off-season clothing.\", \"89.4\\\"L x 82\\\"W x 59.8\\\"H\", \"100% polyester fabric\", \"Mid-century modern-inspired design with subtle tufting\", \"Two drawers on each side are preassembled and easy to slide in\", \"Assemble in 30 minutes to 1 hour. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\", \"No box spring required; mattress sold seperately\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"beds\", \"bed frame\", \"queen bed frame\", \"twin bed frame\", \"king bed frame\", \"headboards for queen beds\", \"platform bed frame\", \"daybed\", \"queen headboard\", \"bed\", \"bed frame queen\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"natural herringbone\", \"natural\", \"king\", \"metal beds\", \"queen bedset\", \"king platform beds\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Bedroom Furniture/Beds, Frames & Bases/Beds","created_at":"2023-06-23T02:13:53Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8ae"},"product_id":1539,"item_id":"B075QLB22X","category_id":89,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Elaine Tufted Line Headboard Full/Queen, 60\"H, Cornflower Blue","brand":"Rivet","color":"Blue","weight_lb":62.7,"price_cents":32999,"stock":0,"description":"This upholstered headboard will add a polished update to any style bedroom. Performance fabric with a linen-like texture is accented by hand-pulled button tufting. Plentiful foam padding makes it cozy to lean against while reading a good book.\n64\"W x 7.25\"L x 60\"H\nSturdy hardwood frame; polyeser performance fabric; birch wood legs\nTransitional style that blends with most décor\nNarrow profile makes it easy to move. Mattress, boxspring and bed frame sold separately.\nEasy assembly. All hardware and assembly tools included\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This upholstered headboard will add a polished update to any style bedroom. Performance fabric with a linen-like texture is accented by hand-pulled button tufting. Plentiful foam padding makes it cozy to lean against while reading a good book.\", \"64\\\"W x 7.25\\\"L x 60\\\"H\", \"Sturdy hardwood frame; polyeser performance fabric; birch wood legs\", \"Transitional style that blends with most décor\", \"Narrow profile makes it easy to move. Mattress, boxspring and bed frame sold separately.\", \"Easy assembly. All hardware and assembly tools included\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"headboards\", \"bed frame\", \"queen bed frame\", \"twin bed frame\", \"king bed frame\", \"headboards for queen beds\", \"platform bed frame\", \"daybed\", \"queen headboard\", \"bed\", \"bed frame queen\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"blue\", \"full or queen\", \"beds\", \"metal beds\", \"queen bedset\", \"king platform beds\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Bedroom Furniture/Beds, Frames & Bases/Headboards & Footboards/Headboards","created_at":"2023-05-14T01:22:04Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8af"},"product_id":1540,"item_id":"B075QLD8F2","category_id":89,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Darby Wingback King Headboard, 80\"W, Mist Blue","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Blue","weight_lb":69.3,"price_cents":17999,"stock":0,"description":"This mid-century modern headboard's wingback design is covered in linen-look performance fabric for durability. Nailhead trim adds another touch of elegance, and ample foam padding makes it comfortable to lean against while enjoying a good book.\n80\"W x 11.5\" D x 51.5\"H\nHardwood frame; polyester performance fabric; metal nailheads with antiqued brass finish\nAn update of a classic mid-century modern style\nPerformance fabric is durable, easy to clean. Headboard has Dacron-wrapped foam padding.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less. Clean with water-based shampoo or foam upholstery cleaner.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This mid-century modern headboard's wingback design is covered in linen-look performance fabric for durability. Nailhead trim adds another touch of elegance, and ample foam padding makes it comfortable to lean against while enjoying a good book.\", \"80\\\"W x 11.5\\\" D x 51.5\\\"H\", \"Hardwood frame; polyester performance fabric; metal nailheads with antiqued brass finish\", \"An update of a classic mid-century modern style\", \"Performance fabric is durable, easy to clean. Headboard has Dacron-wrapped foam padding.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less. Clean with water-based shampoo or foam upholstery cleaner.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"headboards\", \"bed frame\", \"queen bed frame\", \"twin bed frame\", \"king bed frame\", \"headboards for queen beds\", \"platform bed frame\", \"daybed\", \"queen headboard\", \"bed\", \"bed frame queen\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"blue\", \"king or cal king\", \"beds\", \"metal beds\", \"queen bedset\", \"king platform beds\"]","node_path