{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8ba"},"product_id":1551,"item_id":"B075V2GSZ2","category_id":213,"name":"Rivet Vania Jute Natural Chevron Rug, 4' x 6', Tan, Navy","brand":"Rivet","color":"Navy","weight_lb":17.0,"price_cents":12999,"stock":136,"description":"100% Jute\nImported\nWith its chevron v-shaped pattern and neutral hues, this area rug is equal parts modern and earthy. Handwoven with 100% natural jute fibers, this durable essential is ideal for low- to medium-traffic spaces.\nArea rug features a two-tone chevron pattern\nHandwoven with 100% natural jute fibers\nMedium 0.33'' pile suits low- to medium-traffic indoor areas\nPair with a rug pad (sold separately)\n4' x 6'\nShips tightly rolled in a protective bag\nUnroll, allow a few days for natural fibers to settle.","bullets":"[\"100% Jute\", \"Imported\", \"With its chevron v-shaped pattern and neutral hues, this area rug is equal parts modern and earthy. Handwoven with 100% natural jute fibers, this durable essential is ideal for low- to medium-traffic spaces.\", \"Area rug features a two-tone chevron pattern\", \"Handwoven with 100% natural jute fibers\", \"Medium 0.33'' pile suits low- to medium-traffic indoor areas\", \"Pair with a rug pad (sold separately)\", \"4' x 6'\", \"Ships tightly rolled in a protective bag\", \"Unroll, allow a few days for natural fibers to settle.\"]","keywords":"[\"area-rugs\", \"area rugs\", \"rugs\", \"rug\", \"area rug\", \"rugs for living room\", \"area rugs 8x10 clearance\", \"outdoor rug\", \"area rugs 5x7 clearance under 50\", \"8x10 area rug\", \"area rugs 8x10\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"navy\", \"4'x6'\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-10-22T02:45:17Z"}
