{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8be"},"product_id":1555,"item_id":"B075X29QYK","category_id":89,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Newport Arced Headboard Queen Bed, 63\"W, Oak","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Brown","weight_lb":999.0,"price_cents":21999,"stock":68,"description":"A backward-arcing headboard gives this bed an elegant side silhouette. Light grey upholstery on the headboard is combined with a warm oak finish on the footboard and side rails. The padded headboard is cozy to lean against while reading.\n63\"W x 92\" L x 48.5\" H\nHardwood headboard with upholstery on front and back; hardwood footboard and side rails\nClean modern lines combine with traditional-look fabric for a transitional style.\nSlat roll included; no boxspring required. Mattress sold separately.\nAssemble in 15-30 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"A backward-arcing headboard gives this bed an elegant side silhouette. Light grey upholstery on the headboard is combined with a warm oak finish on the footboard and side rails. The padded headboard is cozy to lean against while reading.\", \"63\\\"W x 92\\\" L x 48.5\\\" H\", \"Hardwood headboard with upholstery on front and back; hardwood footboard and side rails\", \"Clean modern lines combine with traditional-look fabric for a transitional style.\", \"Slat roll included; no boxspring required. Mattress sold separately.\", \"Assemble in 15-30 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"beds\", \"bed frame\", \"queen bed frame\", \"twin bed frame\", \"king bed frame\", \"headboards for queen beds\", \"platform bed frame\", \"daybed\", \"queen headboard\", \"bed\", \"bed frame queen\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"brown\", \"queen\", \"metal beds\", \"queen bedset\", \"king platform beds\", \"king beds\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Bedroom Furniture/Beds, Frames & Bases/Headboards & Footboards/Headboards","created_at":"2023-05-28T20:06:43Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8bf"},"product_id":1556,"item_id":"B075X2NLK5","category_id":200,"name":"Rivet Modern Deer Head Ceramic Lamp With Bulb, 19.5\"H, White and Brass","brand":"Rivet","color":"White","weight_lb":4.0,"price_cents":3999,"stock":63,"description":"Whether you're a nature enthusiast or simply want a stylish conversation piece, this deer head lamp is sure to turn heads in your living area or bedroom. The white ceramic base is topped with painted ceramic horns and a textured round drum shade.\n12\" Diameter x 19.5\"H\nCeramic base with brass finished horns and a fabric shade\nEclectic novelty lamp. Classic color and materials help it blend with most styles\n9-watt LED bulb included\nEasy assembly\nIntended for indoor use only","bullets":"[\"Whether you're a nature enthusiast or simply want a stylish conversation piece, this deer head lamp is sure to turn heads in your living area or bedroom. The white ceramic base is topped with painted ceramic horns and a textured round drum shade.\", \"12\\\" Diameter x 19.5\\\"H\", \"Ceramic base with brass finished horns and a fabric shade\", \"Eclectic novelty lamp. Classic color and materials help it blend with most styles\", \"9-watt LED bulb included\", \"Easy assembly\", \"Intended for indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"table-lamps\", \"floor lamp\", \"lamp\", \"table lamp\", \"desk lamp\", \"lamps\", \"floor lamps for living room\", \"lamps for bedrooms\", \"lamps for living room\", \"salt lamp\", \"table lamps\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"white\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting Fixtures/Indoor Lighting/Lamps","created_at":"2023-02-14T05:37:34Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8c0"},"product_id":1557,"item_id":"B075X2WNWG","category_id":93,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Uptown Mid-Century Tufted Customizable Daybed Sofa, 78\"W, Rain &amp; Silver","brand":"Rivet","color":"Rain","weight_lb":137.0,"price_cents":111999,"stock":20,"description":"This item is made to order just for you\n78\"W x 27\"D x 25\"H\nSolid wood frame, soft velvet upholstery and silver metal finish\nHighly versatile piece for extra seating in a living room or at the foot of a bed\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\nThis stylish piece can serve as a daybed and loveseat. Upholstered in a subtle off-white and teal pattern, it features a long tufted cushion, arms with side bolster pillows, and metal legs in three choices of finish, making it perfect for any room.\nSimple leg assembly. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.","bullets":"[\"This item is made to order just for you\", \"78\\\"W x 27\\\"D x 25\\\"H\", \"Solid wood frame, soft velvet upholstery and silver metal finish\", \"Highly versatile piece for extra seating in a living room or at the foot of a bed\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\", \"This stylish piece can serve as a daybed and loveseat. Upholstered in a subtle off-white and teal pattern, it features a long tufted cushion, arms with side bolster pillows, and metal legs in three choices of finish, making it perfect for any room.\", \"Simple leg assembly. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\"]","keywords":"[\"sofas\", \"sectional sofa\", \"couch\", \"sofa\", \"accent chair\", \"recliner chair\", \"loveseat\", \"sleeper sofa\", \"sofa sets for living room\", \"chair\", \"sectional couch\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"rain\", \"blue\", \"futon\", \"sofa bed\", \"living room furniture\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Sofas & Couches","created_at":"2024-02-26T15:00:05Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8c1"},"product_id":1558,"item_id":"B075X2WP1H","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Lawson Modern Angled Ottoman, 27\"W, Charcoal","brand":"Rivet","color":"Charcoal","weight_lb":32.0,"price_cents":22999,"stock":37,"description":"You'll enjoy kicking up your tired feet, as well as always having a handy extra seat, with this sophisticated ottoman. Sleek lines with tapered legs give it urbane, mid-century influenced style. Available in leather and fabric upholstery.\nThis item is made to order just for you\n27\"W x 20\"D x 16\"H\nSturdy hardwood frame and legs with 92% polyester and 8% linen upholstery.\nFirm nylon webbing makes cushion resilient\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\nNo assembly. Vacuum or wipe with a dry cloth. If needed, spot clean with a damp cloth.","bullets":"[\"You'll enjoy kicking up your tired feet, as well as always having a handy extra seat, with this sophisticated ottoman. Sleek lines with tapered legs give it urbane, mid-century influenced style. Available in leather and fabric upholstery.\", \"This item is made to order just for you\", \"27\\\"W x 20\\\"D x 16\\\"H\", \"Sturdy hardwood frame and legs with 92% polyester and 8% linen upholstery.\", \"Firm nylon webbing makes cushion resilient\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\", \"No assembly. Vacuum or wipe with a dry cloth. If needed, spot clean with a damp cloth.\"]","keywords":"[\"sofas\", \"ottoman\", \"storage ottoman\", \"ottoman with storage\", \"storage bench\", \"pouf ottoman\", \"bench\", \"ottoman foot rest\", \"pouf\", \"ottomans\", \"ottoman coffee table\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"charcoal\", \"black\", \"round ottoman\", \"foot ottoman\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2023-11-06T02:36:58Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8c2"},"product_id":1559,"item_id":"B075X2X4V8","category_id":90,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Leila Tufted Chair, 44\" W, Charcoal","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Charcoal","weight_lb":98.0,"price_cents":3799,"stock":22,"description":"This item is made to order just for you\n44\"W x 36\"D x31\"H\nSolid wood frame and legs with durable fabric upholstery.\nThe tight, fixed back and removable/reversible cushion ensures durability and comfort.\nTreat yourself to luxury in this striking, vintage look chair. With solid wood legs in a dark walnut finish, plush upholstery and a low, curved tufted back, it exudes opulence. The removable/reversible seat cushion ensures many years of use.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less. Vacuum or wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This item is made to order just for you\", \"44\\\"W x 36\\\"D x31\\\"H\", \"Solid wood frame and legs with durable fabric upholstery.\", \"The tight, fixed back and removable/reversible cushion ensures durability and comfort.\", \"Treat yourself to luxury in this striking, vintage look chair. With solid wood legs in a dark walnut finish, plush upholstery and a low, curved tufted back, it exudes opulence. The removable/reversible seat cushion ensures many years of use.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less. Vacuum or wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"living-room-chairs\", \"sectional sofa\", \"couch\", \"sofa\", \"accent chair\", \"recliner chair\", \"loveseat\", \"sleeper sofa\", \"sofa sets for living room\", \"chair\", \"sectional couch\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"charcoal\", \"black\", \"living room chair\", \"futon\", \"sofa bed\", \"living room furniture\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Accent Furniture","created_at":"2024-01-19T15:51:38Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8c3"},"product_id":1560,"item_id":"B075X2YJHZ","category_id":200,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Vintage Industrial Spotlight Tripod Floor Lamp With LED Light Bulb - 25.5 x 25.5 x 60 Inches, Black","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Black","weight_lb":"","price_cents":15999,"stock":54,"description":"Indulge your inner Hollywood director with a show-stopping floor lamp. The spotlight adjusts up and down and side to side, while a glass lens diffuses the light. This one piece combines vintage, modern, industrial and glam for a true style statement.\n25.5\"W x 25.5\"D x 60\"H\nBlack metal hardware and tripod; glass diffuser\nA bold style piece for a transitional, modern or industrial room\nLED bulb included\nEasy assembly\nIntended for indoor use only","bullets":"[\"Indulge your inner Hollywood director with a show-stopping floor lamp. The spotlight adjusts up and down and side to side, while a glass lens diffuses the light. This one piece combines vintage, modern, industrial and glam for a true style statement.\", \"25.5\\\"W x 25.5\\\"D x 60\\\"H\", \"Black metal hardware and tripod; glass diffuser\", \"A bold style piece for a transitional, modern or industrial room\", \"LED bulb included\", \"Easy assembly\", \"Intended for indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"floor-lamps\", \"pendant lighting\", \"ceiling light\", \"chandeliers\", \"light fixtures ceiling\", \"wall sconce\", \"kitchen light fixtures\", \"flush mount light fixture\", \"flush mount ceiling light\", \"wall lamp\", \"bathroom light fixtures\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"black\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Lamps & Shades/Floor Lamps","created_at":"2023-12-23T22:54:54Z"}
