{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8ce"},"product_id":1571,"item_id":"B075X4J169","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Hillsboro Modern Wingback Living Room Accent Chair With Nailhead Trim, 29\"W, Beige","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Stone Brown","weight_lb":65.56,"price_cents":18999,"stock":0,"description":"Streamlined, gently curving \"wings\" and arms give a refined, modern refresh to the mid-century wingback chair. Hand-applied nailhead trim with brass finish adds an air of sophistication, while the seat cushion is removable for easy cleaning.\n29\"W x 37''D x 40.5''H\nDurable polyester fabric; metal nailhead trim with brass finish; wood legs.\nA modernized silhouette of the mid-century wingback style with removable seat cushion\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less. Vacuum or wipe with soft dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Streamlined, gently curving \\\"wings\\\" and arms give a refined, modern refresh to the mid-century wingback chair. Hand-applied nailhead trim with brass finish adds an air of sophistication, while the seat cushion is removable for easy cleaning.\", \"29\\\"W x 37''D x 40.5''H\", \"Durable polyester fabric; metal nailhead trim with brass finish; wood legs.\", \"A modernized silhouette of the mid-century wingback style with removable seat cushion\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less. Vacuum or wipe with soft dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"living-room-chairs\", \"sectional sofa\", \"couch\", \"sofa\", \"accent chair\", \"recliner chair\", \"loveseat\", \"sleeper sofa\", \"sofa sets for living room\", \"chair\", \"sectional couch\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"stone brown\", \"living room chair\", \"futon\", \"sofa bed\", \"living room furniture\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2024-04-28T09:06:20Z"}
