{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8d4"},"product_id":1577,"item_id":"B075X4PTG6","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Charles Classic Oversized Leather Chair, 39\"W, Walnut","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Walnut","weight_lb":99.0,"price_cents":8999,"stock":215,"description":"This item is made to order just for you\nOverall depth: 39\", Seat depth: 23\", Height: 38\", Width: 39\"\nSturdy hardwood frame with 100% cow hide leather.\nAn oversized traditional chair with plenty of room for family, friends and pets\nLet yourself be wrapped in comfort by this extra large seat. Traditional rolled arms and turned wood legs are combined with modern 100% leather upholstery for an update on a classic piece. Its long silhouette means ample space for you and your dog.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less. Vacuum or wipe with a dry cloth. Spot clean if needed.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This item is made to order just for you\", \"Overall depth: 39\\\", Seat depth: 23\\\", Height: 38\\\", Width: 39\\\"\", \"Sturdy hardwood frame with 100% cow hide leather.\", \"An oversized traditional chair with plenty of room for family, friends and pets\", \"Let yourself be wrapped in comfort by this extra large seat. Traditional rolled arms and turned wood legs are combined with modern 100% leather upholstery for an update on a classic piece. Its long silhouette means ample space for you and your dog.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less. Vacuum or wipe with a dry cloth. Spot clean if needed.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"living-room-chairs\", \"couch\", \"accent chair\", \"sofa\", \"leather sofa\", \"bar stools\", \"full size bed frame\", \"living room furniture\", \"recliner chair\", \"glider rocker\", \"sleeper sofa\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"walnut\", \"beige\", \"living room chair\", \"sectional sofa\", \"sofa bedsofa cover\", \"sofa table\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/