{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8d5"},"product_id":1578,"item_id":"B075X4QFK2","category_id":93,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam St. Cloud Modern Armless Straight Back Settee, 49\"W, Brown","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Brown","weight_lb":60.0,"price_cents":47999,"stock":104,"description":"This item is made to order just for you\n49\"W x 33\"D x 38\"H\nSturdy wood frame, durable polyester fabric, wood legs with walnut finish.\nA mid-century inspired design that will add elegance to a modern or transitional room\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less. Vacuum or wipe with soft dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\nA straight back and sloping, low-profile arms are the highlights of this mid-century inspired settee. Assembled in the U.S., the sturdy wood frame is upholstered with durable, tightly woven fabric for a handsome design that's built to last.","bullets":"[\"This item is made to order just for you\", \"49\\\"W x 33\\\"D x 38\\\"H\", \"Sturdy wood frame, durable polyester fabric, wood legs with walnut finish.\", \"A mid-century inspired design that will add elegance to a modern or transitional room\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less. Vacuum or wipe with soft dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\", \"A straight back and sloping, low-profile arms are the highlights of this mid-century inspired settee. Assembled in the U.S., the sturdy wood frame is upholstered with durable, tightly woven fabric for a handsome design that's built to last.\"]","keywords":"[\"sofas\", \"sectional sofa\", \"couch\", \"sofa\", \"accent chair\", \"recliner chair\", \"loveseat\", \"sleeper sofa\", \"sofa sets for living room\", \"chair\", \"sectional couch\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"brown\", \"settee\", \"futon\", \"sofa bed\", \"living room furniture\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Sofas & Couches","created_at":"2023-09-27T16:13:29Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8d6"},"product_id":1579,"item_id":"B075X4QMX3","category_id":93,"name":"Stone & Beam Westport Modern Nailhead Upholstered Sofa, 87\"W, Linen","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Neutral","weight_lb":177.76,"price_cents":50999,"stock":34,"description":"Elevate your style with this head-turning modern sofa. A long down-blend bench seat is combined with back cushions that are reversible. Nailhead trim on the arms and across the sides, along with the exposed wood base, adds extra sophistication.\n87\"W x 37.75''D x33''H\n60% cotton/40% linen fabric; metal nailhead trim; wood legs.\nRemovable, reversible back cushions. Corner clips keep bench seat firmly in place.\nNo assembly required. Vacuum or wipe with soft dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Elevate your style with this head-turning modern sofa. A long down-blend bench seat is combined with back cushions that are reversible. Nailhead trim on the arms and across the sides, along with the exposed wood base, adds extra sophistication.\", \"87\\\"W x 37.75''D x33''H\", \"60% cotton/40% linen fabric; metal nailhead trim; wood legs.\", \"Removable, reversible back cushions. Corner clips keep bench seat firmly in place.\", \"No assembly required. Vacuum or wipe with soft dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"sofas\", \"sectional sofa\", \"couch\", \"sofa\", \"accent chair\", \"recliner chair\", \"loveseat\", \"sleeper sofa\", \"sofa sets for living room\", \"chair\", \"sectional couch\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"neutral\", \"ivory\", \"futon\", \"sofa bed\", \"living room furniture\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Sofas & Couches","created_at":"2023-06-11T12:36:34Z"}
