{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8d8"},"product_id":1581,"item_id":"B075X4VM8W","category_id":93,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Lawson Modern Angled Leather Sofa, 78\"W, Charcoal","brand":"Rivet","color":"Charcoal Leather","weight_lb":114.0,"price_cents":58999,"stock":3,"description":"This item is made to order just for you\n78\"W x 34\"D x 34\"H\nSturdy hardwood frame and legs with 100% leather upholstery.\nTight, padded back with two removable seat cushions make it functional and comfortable.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\nYou'll enjoy snuggling with family and friends, or by yourself, on this sophisticated sofa. A sleek back, angled arms, removable seat cushions and tapered legs give it urbane, mid-century influenced style. Available in leather and fabric upholstery.\nNo assembly. Vacuum or wipe with a dry cloth. If needed, spot clean with a damp cloth.","bullets":"[\"This item is made to order just for you\", \"78\\\"W x 34\\\"D x 34\\\"H\", \"Sturdy hardwood frame and legs with 100% leather upholstery.\", \"Tight, padded back with two removable seat cushions make it functional and comfortable.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\", \"You'll enjoy snuggling with family and friends, or by yourself, on this sophisticated sofa. A sleek back, angled arms, removable seat cushions and tapered legs give it urbane, mid-century influenced style. Available in leather and fabric upholstery.\", \"No assembly. Vacuum or wipe with a dry cloth. If needed, spot clean with a damp cloth.\"]","keywords":"[\"sofas\", \"couch\", \"accent chair\", \"sofa\", \"leather sofa\", \"bar stools\", \"full size bed frame\", \"living room furniture\", \"recliner chair\", \"glider rocker\", \"sleeper sofa\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"charcoal leather\", \"black\", \"sectional sofa\", \"sofa bedsofa cover\", \"sofa table\", \"outdoor sofa\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Sofas & Couches","created_at":"2023-05-19T09:33:39Z"}
