{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8dd"},"product_id":1586,"item_id":"B075X5QYPN","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Jamie Upholstered Mid-Century Modern Low Arm Accent Chair, 31\"W, Marine Blue","brand":"Rivet","color":"Marine Blue","weight_lb":"","price_cents":11999,"stock":91,"description":"A great addition to any room, this versatile accent chair is sure to be a conversation piece. It features eye catching Mid-century inspired design with distinctive slanted arms and sturdy hardwood legs.\n31\"W x 32.3\"D x 35”H\nSolid hardwood frame with fabric blend of 70% Polyester, 20% Linen, 10% Cotton.\nHighly fashionable design in a compact size for small spaces.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\nSimple leg assembly. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.","bullets":"[\"A great addition to any room, this versatile accent chair is sure to be a conversation piece. It features eye catching Mid-century inspired design with distinctive slanted arms and sturdy hardwood legs.\", \"31\\\"W x 32.3\\\"D x 35”H\", \"Solid hardwood frame with fabric blend of 70% Polyester, 20% Linen, 10% Cotton.\", \"Highly fashionable design in a compact size for small spaces.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\", \"Simple leg assembly. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\"]","keywords":"[\"living-room-chairs\", \"sectional sofa\", \"couch\", \"sofa\", \"accent chair\", \"recliner chair\", \"loveseat\", \"sleeper sofa\", \"sofa sets for living room\", \"chair\", \"sectional couch\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"marine blue\", \"blue\", \"living room chair\", \"futon\", \"sofa bed\", \"living room furniture\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2023-10-31T14:48:10Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8de"},"product_id":1587,"item_id":"B075X61WKJ","category_id":91,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Norah Leather and Wood Round Ottoman, 39.5\", Saddle Brown","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Chaps Saddle","weight_lb":54.78,"price_cents":5599,"stock":75,"description":"This simple but stylish round ottoman is designed to blend with most any decor. The wood frame has a light oak finish for a rustic touch, with a smooth top-grain leather upholstered top. Use as a foot stool or extra seat for guests.\n39.5'' Diameter x 17.25''H\n100% top-grain leather on wood frame.\nUse as a resting place for tired feet, a snack tray, or an extra guest\nNo assembly required. Wipe with a soft dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This simple but stylish round ottoman is designed to blend with most any decor. The wood frame has a light oak finish for a rustic touch, with a smooth top-grain leather upholstered top. Use as a foot stool or extra seat for guests.\", \"39.5'' Diameter x 17.25''H\", \"100% top-grain leather on wood frame.\", \"Use as a resting place for tired feet, a snack tray, or an extra guest\", \"No assembly required. Wipe with a soft dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"storage-ottomans\", \"ottoman\", \"storage ottoman\", \"ottoman with storage\", \"storage bench\", \"pouf ottoman\", \"bench\", \"ottoman foot rest\", \"pouf\", \"ottomans\", \"ottoman coffee table\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"chaps saddle\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Accent Furniture/Ottomans","created_at":"2024-01-13T06:09:17Z"}
