{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8e0"},"product_id":1589,"item_id":"B075XT6282","category_id":236,"name":"AGS Certified 14k White Gold Round-Cut Diamond Stud Earrings (2cttw, K-L Color, I1-I2 Clarity)","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"White","weight_lb":0.01,"price_cents":30999,"stock":65,"description":"Classic solitaire studs featuring diamonds nestled in four-prong settings and screw-on backings\nThese classic solitaire studs are ags certified and a certificate will be included\nAll our diamond suppliers confirm that they comply with the kimberley process to ensure that their diamonds are conflict free\nCarat weight listed is the total for both studs\nMade in the USA","bullets":"[\"Classic solitaire studs featuring diamonds nestled in four-prong settings and screw-on backings\", \"These classic solitaire studs are ags certified and a certificate will be included\", \"All our diamond suppliers confirm that they comply with the kimberley process to ensure that their diamonds are conflict free\", \"Carat weight listed is the total for both studs\", \"Made in the USA\"]","keywords":"[\"classics with a twist\"]","node_path":"Departments/Women/Jewelry/Earrings/Stud","created_at":"2024-03-16T11:05:57Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8e1"},"product_id":1590,"item_id":"B075XTNHSP","category_id":304,"name":"AmazonBasics Portable Charger/Power Bank, 3,350 mAh, Silver","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Silver","weight_lb":0.15,"price_cents":1299,"stock":109,"description":"Compact 3,350 mAh portable charger (powered with LG batteries); charges smartphones and other portable devices through the USB port; compatible with Apple and Android devices\nFully charges an Apple iPhone 8 once before needing to be recharged; battery-level indicator with 4 LEDs; 3.5-hour recharging time for power bank (via 2A charger)\nUL-2056 certified; advanced safety features include overload protection, short-circuit protection, over-charge protection, over-discharge protection, over-voltage and under-voltage input protection, and input/output over-temperature protection\nIncludes micro USB charger cable, carrying pouch, and user manual; for best results in charging your device, use the cable that came with your device or use a cable that has been certified to work with your device; note: does not support Qualcomm Quick Charge\nMeasures 3 by 0.9 by 1.4 inches; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty","bullets":"[\"Compact 3,350 mAh portable charger (powered with LG batteries); charges smartphones and other portable devices through the USB port; compatible with Apple and Android devices\", \"Fully charges an Apple iPhone 8 once before needing to be recharged; battery-level indicator with 4 LEDs; 3.5-hour recharging time for power bank (via 2A charger)\", \"UL-2056 certified; advanced safety features include overload protection, short-circuit protection, over-charge protection, over-discharge protection, over-voltage and under-voltage input protection, and input/output over-temperature protection\", \"Includes micro USB charger cable, carrying pouch, and user manual; for best results in charging your device, use the cable that came with your device or use a cable that has been certified to work with your device; note: does not support Qualcomm Quick Charge\", \"Measures 3 by 0.9 by 1.4 inches; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"portable charger^power bank^portable iphone charger^portable phone charger^phone charger^lipstick size portable charger^portable charger 3350^lipstick battery^powercore^lipstick size fast power bank^battery charger^battery pack^power packs for cell phones\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-01-05T06:49:27Z"}
