{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8e8"},"product_id":1597,"item_id":"B075YL2RQN","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Mid Century Modern Teal and Pink Eiffel Tower Print Framed Wall Art Decor - 21\" x 27\" Frame, Wood-Tone","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Multicolor","weight_lb":10.0,"price_cents":12999,"stock":22,"description":"A pastel of the iconic Eiffel Tower is rendered in retro hues of teal, rust and grey. Encased in a light wood-toned frame, this print is ready to add color to any contemporary or mid-century modern-influenced room.\n21\"W x 27\"H\nPrint on paper in brown frame\nRetro, mid-century modern-influenced print of an iconic structure\nReady to hang, all hardware included","bullets":"[\"A pastel of the iconic Eiffel Tower is rendered in retro hues of teal, rust and grey. Encased in a light wood-toned frame, this print is ready to add color to any contemporary or mid-century modern-influenced room.\", \"21\\\"W x 27\\\"H\", \"Print on paper in brown frame\", \"Retro, mid-century modern-influenced print of an iconic structure\", \"Ready to hang, all hardware included\"]","keywords":"[\"prints\", \"wall art\", \"louis vuitton\", \"oliver gal\", \"stone & beam\", \"oliver gal wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"rivet\", \"louis vuitton shoes\", \"stone and beam\", \"framed wall art\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"multi\", \"18x24\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-01-17T19:46:40Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8e9"},"product_id":1598,"item_id":"B075YL3HWX","category_id":193,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Decorative Chalkboard with Rustic Wood Frame - 25.5 x 37.5 Inch","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Rustic Brown","weight_lb":17.6,"price_cents":3799,"stock":62,"description":"Display your reminders, messages or menus in style with this beautiful chalkboard. It's a functional wall décor piece crafted with a wood frame in a rustic brown finish to blend effortlessly with your existing furnishings.\n36.5\"W x 24.5\"H\nChalk board and rustic brown wood\nModern rustic, functional wall décor\nReady to hang, all hardware included","bullets":"[\"Display your reminders, messages or menus in style with this beautiful chalkboard. It's a functional wall décor piece crafted with a wood frame in a rustic brown finish to blend effortlessly with your existing furnishings.\", \"36.5\\\"W x 24.5\\\"H\", \"Chalk board and rustic brown wood\", \"Modern rustic, functional wall décor\", \"Ready to hang, all hardware included\"]","keywords":"[\"decorative-chalkboards\", \"jewelry organizer\", \"jewelry armoire\", \"jewelry box\", \"full length mirror\", \"plate stand\", \"mirror\", \"ring holder\", \"plate stands for display\", \"plant stand\", \"jewlery holder organizer\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"rustic brown\", \"brown\", \"36.5x24.5\"]","node_path":"Categories/Home Décor/Photo Albums, Frames & Accessories/Picture Frames/Wall & Tabletop Frames","created_at":"2023-02-25T06:31:56Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8ea"},"product_id":1599,"item_id":"B075YL5LFQ","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Modern Farmhouse American Quilt Print Wall Art Decor - 27\" x 27\" Frame, Warm Grey Barnwood","brand":"Rivet","color":"Multicolor","weight_lb":10.0,"price_cents":2299,"stock":11,"description":"A square print of an American quilt in historic red, white and blue conveys a patriotic message for traditional, modern farmhouse or transitional spaces. This subtly meaningful print arrives in a wooden frame with an antiqued finish.\n21\"W x 27\"H\nPrinted on paper in polystyrene frame with antiqued finish\nModern take on traditional quilt print\nReady to hang, all hardware included","bullets":"[\"A square print of an American quilt in historic red, white and blue conveys a patriotic message for traditional, modern farmhouse or transitional spaces. This subtly meaningful print arrives in a wooden frame with an antiqued finish.\", \"21\\\"W x 27\\\"H\", \"Printed on paper in polystyrene frame with antiqued finish\", \"Modern take on traditional quilt print\", \"Ready to hang, all hardware included\"]","keywords":"[\"artwork\", \"wall art\", \"louis vuitton\", \"oliver gal\", \"stone & beam\", \"oliver gal wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"rivet\", \"louis vuitton shoes\", \"stone and beam\", \"framed wall art\", \"farmhouse\", \"multi\", \"24x24\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-04-02T22:39:12Z"}
