{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8ec"},"product_id":1601,"item_id":"B075YLKFB6","category_id":208,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Black and White Reading by the Water Photo Framed Wall Art Decor - 12 x 12 Inch Picture Frame, Black","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Black","weight_lb":3.59,"price_cents":2999,"stock":38,"description":"What could be more relaxing than an afternoon reading in the sun by the water? Bring that air of calm to your home with this modern black and white giclee print of a woman reading. It arrives ready to hang in a black frame.\n12\"W x 12\"H\nBlack finish frame, paper and glass\nModern photo print\nReady to hang, all hardware included","bullets":"[\"What could be more relaxing than an afternoon reading in the sun by the water? Bring that air of calm to your home with this modern black and white giclee print of a woman reading. It arrives ready to hang in a black frame.\", \"12\\\"W x 12\\\"H\", \"Black finish frame, paper and glass\", \"Modern photo print\", \"Ready to hang, all hardware included\"]","keywords":"[\"photographs\", \"wall art\", \"louis vuitton\", \"oliver gal\", \"stone & beam\", \"oliver gal wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"rivet\", \"louis vuitton shoes\", \"stone and beam\", \"framed wall art\", \"farmhouse\", \"black\", \"13\\\" x 15\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-07-11T04:42:56Z"}
