{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8ee"},"product_id":1603,"item_id":"B075YLTDZP","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Transitional Shoreline With Hills Print, Cool Wood-Tone Frame, 27\" x 27\"","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Multicolor","weight_lb":10.0,"price_cents":6799,"stock":12,"description":"This print of a starkly beautiful shoreline with sloping hills achieves much of its impact through shades of blue ranging from nearly white to deep indigo. It is housed in a frame with driftwood finish to complement the rustic, coastal theme.\n27\"W x 27\"H\nPrint on paper with driftwood finish frame\nA transitional piece that wll blend with any home\nReady to hang, all hardware included","bullets":"[\"This print of a starkly beautiful shoreline with sloping hills achieves much of its impact through shades of blue ranging from nearly white to deep indigo. It is housed in a frame with driftwood finish to complement the rustic, coastal theme.\", \"27\\\"W x 27\\\"H\", \"Print on paper with driftwood finish frame\", \"A transitional piece that wll blend with any home\", \"Ready to hang, all hardware included\"]","keywords":"[\"wall decor\", \"wall art\", \"posters\", \"oliver gal\", \"overstockart\", \"oliver gal canvas wall art\", \"framed wall art\", \"dewalt tools\", \"tool set\", \"canvas wall art\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-06-12T02:49:22Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8ef"},"product_id":1604,"item_id":"B075YLTFH9","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Black and White Canoes on Water Photo Framed Wall Art Decor - 13\" x 15\" Frame, Black","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Black","weight_lb":3.59,"price_cents":5499,"stock":10,"description":"Peace and tranquility abound in this modern, black and white giclee print of canoes lined up on the water as the morning fog covers the distant mountains. This print on paper is housed under glass in a black frame.\n15\"W x 13\"H\nBlack finish frame, paper and glass\nModern photo print of tranquil water scene\nReady to hang, all hardware included","bullets":"[\"Peace and tranquility abound in this modern, black and white giclee print of canoes lined up on the water as the morning fog covers the distant mountains. This print on paper is housed under glass in a black frame.\", \"15\\\"W x 13\\\"H\", \"Black finish frame, paper and glass\", \"Modern photo print of tranquil water scene\", \"Ready to hang, all hardware included\"]","keywords":"[\"prints\", \"wall art\", \"louis vuitton\", \"oliver gal\", \"stone & beam\", \"oliver gal wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"rivet\", \"louis vuitton shoes\", \"stone and beam\", \"framed wall art\", \"farmhouse\", \"black\", \"13\\\" x 15\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-01-04T16:22:18Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8f0"},"product_id":1605,"item_id":"B075YLXVBF","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Black and White Nautical Sailboat at Sea Photo Wall Art Decor - 13 x 15 Inch Frame, Black","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Black","weight_lb":3.59,"price_cents":9999,"stock":32,"description":"You can almost feel the wind in your hair as you admire this sailboat at sea. A modern black and white image is printed using a high quality giclee process. It arrives housed under glass in a black frame.\n13\"W x 15\"H\nBlack finish frame, paper and glass\nModern print of nautical scene\nReady to hang, all hardware included","bullets":"[\"You can almost feel the wind in your hair as you admire this sailboat at sea. A modern black and white image is printed using a high quality giclee process. It arrives housed under glass in a black frame.\", \"13\\\"W x 15\\\"H\", \"Black finish frame, paper and glass\", \"Modern print of nautical scene\", \"Ready to hang, all hardware included\"]","keywords":"[\"prints\", \"wall art\", \"louis vuitton\", \"oliver gal\", \"stone & beam\", \"oliver gal wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"rivet\", \"louis vuitton shoes\", \"stone and beam\", \"framed wall art\", \"farmhouse\", \"black\", \"13\\\" x 15\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-11-15T02:01:10Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8f1"},"product_id":1606,"item_id":"B075YMN185","category_id":90,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet 2-Tiered Industrial Kitchen Rolling Bar Cart with Wheels, 32.3\"W, Natural, Black","brand":"Rivet","color":"Natural/Black","weight_lb":20.6,"price_cents":5099,"stock":37,"description":"This two-tiered rolling bar cart combines the warmth of natural wood with industrial-style black metal framing. Rolling caster wheels make it easy to move, and two wheel locks allow you to keep it in place. Fill with your favorite beverages and you're ready to host friends for a night of fun.\n32.31\"W x 15.76\"D x 27.78\"H\nSolid fir wood shelves. Metal trim, frame and casters have black finish.\nTwo of the four rotating wheels lock to park the cart just where you want it\nThis versatile piece functions as a mobile bar cart or as an accent table for potted plants or decor\nSome assembly is required. Clean with a soft, dry cloth\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This two-tiered rolling bar cart combines the warmth of natural wood with industrial-style black metal framing. Rolling caster wheels make it easy to move, and two wheel locks allow you to keep it in place. Fill with your favorite beverages and you're ready to host friends for a night of fun.\", \"32.31\\\"W x 15.76\\\"D x 27.78\\\"H\", \"Solid fir wood shelves. Metal trim, frame and casters have black finish.\", \"Two of the four rotating wheels lock to park the cart just where you want it\", \"This versatile piece functions as a mobile bar cart or as an accent table for potted plants or decor\", \"Some assembly is required. Clean with a soft, dry cloth\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"serving-carts\", \"kitchen island\", \"bar cart\", \"kitchen cart\", \"microwave cart\", \"kitchen island on wheels\", \"kitchen islands\", \"kitchen island with seating\", \"kitchen islands with storage\", \"microwave stand\", \"kitchen carts and islands\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"natural\", \"kitchen carts\", \"white kitchen cart\", \"home styles kitchen cart\", \"kitchen cart with drawers\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Game & Recreation Room Furniture/Home Bar Furniture/Bar & Serving Carts","created_at":"2024-03-08T19:50:01Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8f2"},"product_id":1607,"item_id":"B075YMN1J8","category_id":94,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Sophia Modern Swivel Kitchen Counter Height Stool, 39.4\"H, Slate Grey","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Slate","weight_lb":24.3,"price_cents":9699,"stock":67,"description":"With a substantial padded back and seat, this counter stool provides maximum comfort and swivels for easy conversation. The solid hardwood frame is sturdy and stable, and performance fabric makes it durable and easy to clean.\n17.7\"D x 21.3\"W x 39.4\"H. Seat height is 26\".\n95% polyester/5% nylon on hardwood frame; solid poplar legs.\nFoam padding and elastic suspension system keeps upholstery firm and resilient\nNo assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"With a substantial padded back and seat, this counter stool provides maximum comfort and swivels for easy conversation. The solid hardwood frame is sturdy and stable, and performance fabric makes it durable and easy to clean.\", \"17.7\\\"D x 21.3\\\"W x 39.4\\\"H. Seat height is 26\\\".\", \"95% polyester/5% nylon on hardwood frame; solid poplar legs.\", \"Foam padding and elastic suspension system keeps upholstery firm and resilient\", \"No assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"barstools\", \"bar stools\", \"bar stools set of 2\", \"counter height bar stools\", \"bar stool\", \"bar stools set of 4\", \"stool\", \"counter stool\", \"bar stools set of 3\", \"counter stools\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"slate\", \"gray\", \"counter height\", \"kitchen bar stools\", \"24 inch bar stools\", \"white bar stools\", \"bar stool set\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Game & Recreation Room Furniture/Home Bar Furniture/Barstools","created_at":"2023-02-12T05:41:57Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8f3"},"product_id":1608,"item_id":"B075YMN1KY","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Alfred Mid-Century Modern Wide Curved Back Accent Kitchen Dining Room Chair, 25.2\"W, Ash Grey","brand":"Rivet","color":"Ash Gray","weight_lb":15.4,"price_cents":12999,"stock":0,"description":"This classic mid-century modern accent chair features a wide curved back and armrest combined with simple tapered legs. Plenty of padding makes it sturdy and comfortable to use in the dining room or anywhere else extra seating is needed.\n25.2\"W x 23.2\"D x 31.9\"H\nFabric is 90% polyester/10% linen. Hardwood legs with espresso finish.\nFoam padding and elastic suspension system keep back and seat firm and springy\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\nSimple assembly; just attach legs. Wipe with soft dry cloth.","bullets":"[\"This classic mid-century modern accent chair features a wide curved back and armrest combined with simple tapered legs. Plenty of padding makes it sturdy and comfortable to use in the dining room or anywhere else extra seating is needed.\", \"25.2\\\"W x 23.2\\\"D x 31.9\\\"H\", \"Fabric is 90% polyester/10% linen. Hardwood legs with espresso finish.\", \"Foam padding and elastic suspension system keep back and seat firm and springy\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\", \"Simple assembly; just attach legs. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\"]","keywords":"[\"dining-chairs\", \"dining chairs\", \"dining room chairs\", \"accent chair\", \"chair\", \"chairs\", \"kitchen chairs\", \"dining chair\", \"dining chairs set of 4\", \"dining table set\", \"accent chair set of 2\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"ash gray\", \"grey\", \"dinning table set\", \"dinning table\", \"round dinning table\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Kitchen & Dining Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2023-05-14T17:30:53Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8f4"},"product_id":1609,"item_id":"B075YMQC29","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Black and White Tropical Palm Branches Photo Wall Art Decor - 18 x 22 Inch Frame, Black","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Black","weight_lb":"","price_cents":15999,"stock":35,"description":"Bring some tropical inspiration to your home or office with this modern art print of a black and white image of the sun peering through palm branches. It is giclee printed on paper and housed behind glass in a black frame.\n18\"W x 22\"H\nBlack finish frame, paper and glass\nModern print of tropical scene\nReady to hang, all hardware included","bullets":"[\"Bring some tropical inspiration to your home or office with this modern art print of a black and white image of the sun peering through palm branches. It is giclee printed on paper and housed behind glass in a black frame.\", \"18\\\"W x 22\\\"H\", \"Black finish frame, paper and glass\", \"Modern print of tropical scene\", \"Ready to hang, all hardware included\"]","keywords":"[\"prints\", \"wall art\", \"louis vuitton\", \"oliver gal\", \"stone & beam\", \"oliver gal wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"rivet\", \"louis vuitton shoes\", \"stone and beam\", \"framed wall art\", \"farmhouse\", \"black\", \"18\\\" x 22\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-04-26T21:38:21Z"}
