{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8fb"},"product_id":1616,"item_id":"B075YQ8Q3T","category_id":82,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Parson Rustic Buffet Sideboard Storage Cabinet 56\"W, Oak Wood","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Buffet","weight_lb":183.0,"price_cents":24999,"stock":22,"description":"This beautiful buffet features sturdy, durable construction and timeless oak finish. Its transitional style has just the right touches of traditional and rustic, while concealed ball-bearing glides support smooth, self-closing drawers.\n56\"W x 18\"D x 32\"H\nHardwood frame and drawers with oak veneer\nSelf-closing drawers move smoothly, thanks to concealed ball-bearing extension glides\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\nAssembly is required. Wipe with soft dry cloth.","bullets":"[\"This beautiful buffet features sturdy, durable construction and timeless oak finish. Its transitional style has just the right touches of traditional and rustic, while concealed ball-bearing glides support smooth, self-closing drawers.\", \"56\\\"W x 18\\\"D x 32\\\"H\", \"Hardwood frame and drawers with oak veneer\", \"Self-closing drawers move smoothly, thanks to concealed ball-bearing extension glides\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\", \"Assembly is required. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\"]","keywords":"[\"sideboards\", \"buffet cabinet\", \"sideboard\", \"buffet\", \"credenza\", \"sideboards and buffet tables with storage\", \"buffet table\", \"liquor cabinet\", \"bar\", \"wine cabinet\", \"sideboard buffet\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"beige\", \"dining buffet\", \"dining room buffet\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Kitchen & Dining Room Furniture/Buffets & Sideboards","created_at":"2024-03-14T02:21:57Z"}
