{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8fd"},"product_id":1618,"item_id":"B075YV7TTW","category_id":94,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Burke Modern Wood Kitchen Counter Bar Stool, 44\"H, Hemp Beige","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Hemp","weight_lb":"","price_cents":8699,"stock":59,"description":"22.1\"W x 17.7\"D x 44\"H. Seat height is 30\".\nSolid wood legs and performance fabric\nFoam padding and elastic suspension system keeps upholstery firm and resilient\nNo assembly required. Vacuum and wipe with soft dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\nThis simple, cleanly designed bar stool features a handsome wood panel accent across the back. Four solid wood legs offer stability and sturdiness, while foam padding and performance fabric help it hold up to a busy family's wear and tear.","bullets":"[\"22.1\\\"W x 17.7\\\"D x 44\\\"H. Seat height is 30\\\".\", \"Solid wood legs and performance fabric\", \"Foam padding and elastic suspension system keeps upholstery firm and resilient\", \"No assembly required. Vacuum and wipe with soft dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\", \"This simple, cleanly designed bar stool features a handsome wood panel accent across the back. Four solid wood legs offer stability and sturdiness, while foam padding and performance fabric help it hold up to a busy family's wear and tear.\"]","keywords":"[\"barstools\", \"bar stools\", \"bar stools set of 2\", \"counter height bar stools\", \"bar stool\", \"bar stools set of 4\", \"stool\", \"counter stool\", \"bar stools set of 3\", \"counter stools\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"hemp\", \"natural\", \"bar height\", \"kitchen bar stools\", \"24 inch bar stools\", \"white bar stools\", \"bar stool set\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Game & Recreation Room Furniture/Home Bar Furniture/Barstools","created_at":"2023-08-15T03:21:15Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab8fe"},"product_id":1619,"item_id":"B075YX4H4N","category_id":72,"name":"Amazon Brand - Symbol Men's Black Leather Formal Shoes - 10 UK (AZ-OM-62A)","brand":"Amazon Brand - Symbol","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":10999,"stock":15,"description":"Outer Material: Leather\nProduct Type: Men's Formal Shoes\nShoe Width: Medium\nClosure Type: Lace-Up\nToe Style: Closed Toe\nClassic formal derby shoes made with genuine leather.\nWarranty Type: Manufacturer\nProduct warranty against manufacturing defects: 30 days\nCare Instructions: Clean your shoes with leather cleaner or leather shampoo, and use a good quality brush to remove loose surface dirt; If your shoes are wet after cleaning, let them air-dry before your proceed with the next step; Dry shoes in room temperature only and never expose them to the sun; Heat from the sun will cause the leather to shrink, wrinkle, harden, dry, and crack.","bullets":"[\"Outer Material: Leather\", \"Product Type: Men's Formal Shoes\", \"Shoe Width: Medium\", \"Closure Type: Lace-Up\", \"Toe Style: Closed Toe\", \"Classic formal derby shoes made with genuine leather.\", \"Warranty Type: Manufacturer\", \"Product warranty against manufacturing defects: 30 days\", \"Care Instructions: Clean your shoes with leather cleaner or leather shampoo, and use a good quality brush to remove loose surface dirt; If your shoes are wet after cleaning, let them air-dry before your proceed with the next step; Dry shoes in room temperature only and never expose them to the sun; Heat from the sun will cause the leather to shrink, wrinkle, harden, dry, and crack.\"]","keywords":"[\"formal shoes for mens leather\", \"leather shoes for mens\", \"formal shoes for men black\", \"shoes\", \"leather shoes for men formal branded\", \"shoes for men\", \"shoes for men formal\", \"men shoes casual shoes\", \"mens shoes\"]","node_path":"Categories/Shoes/Men's Shoes/Formal Shoes","created_at":"2024-02-24T09:48:11Z"}
