{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab904"},"product_id":1625,"item_id":"B075Z6S9CY","category_id":95,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Roland X-Frame Side End Table, 24\"W, Pine","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Walnut + Metal","weight_lb":18.0,"price_cents":19999,"stock":80,"description":"24\"L x 24\"W x 20\"H\nSolid pine top with metal frame\nIndustrial, rustic and modern touches come together in a piece that blends with most décor\nThis sturdy piece will last through years of family movie nights and entertaining guests\nEasy assembly in 15-30 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\nThis wood and metal end table combines elements of industrial and rustic, allowing it to blend with many styles. The solid pine wood top has a natural distressed finish, while the metal base has modern \"x\" frames on either end.","bullets":"[\"24\\\"L x 24\\\"W x 20\\\"H\", \"Solid pine top with metal frame\", \"Industrial, rustic and modern touches come together in a piece that blends with most décor\", \"This sturdy piece will last through years of family movie nights and entertaining guests\", \"Easy assembly in 15-30 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\", \"This wood and metal end table combines elements of industrial and rustic, allowing it to blend with many styles. The solid pine wood top has a natural distressed finish, while the metal base has modern \\\"x\\\" frames on either end.\"]","keywords":"[\"end-tables\", \"end tables\", \"side table\", \"end table\", \"end tables living room\", \"night stand\", \"console table\", \"accent table\", \"coffee table\", \"sofa table\", \"nightstand\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"walnut + metal\", \"brown\", \"accent tables\", \"small accent table\", \"round accent table\", \"outdoor accent table\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Tables/End Tables","created_at":"2023-02-08T03:06:56Z"}
