{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab906"},"product_id":1627,"item_id":"B075Z85VX9","category_id":95,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Sparrow Modern Industrial Coffee Table, 55.1\"W, Wood and Bronze","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Wood and Gold","weight_lb":34.0,"price_cents":29999,"stock":82,"description":"This sturdy, eye-catching coffee table will serve your family well through many fun gatherings. A sleek bronze-finished frame holds a top made of reclaimed elm. Elements of rustic, industrial and glam styles combine for a look that blends with modern décor.\n55.1\"W x 31.5\"D x 18.5\"H\nReclaimed elm wood top; metal frame with a bronze finish\nModern and rustic, with elements of glam\nSturdy and durable for displaying magazines, holding snack trays and every day life\nNo assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This sturdy, eye-catching coffee table will serve your family well through many fun gatherings. A sleek bronze-finished frame holds a top made of reclaimed elm. Elements of rustic, industrial and glam styles combine for a look that blends with modern décor.\", \"55.1\\\"W x 31.5\\\"D x 18.5\\\"H\", \"Reclaimed elm wood top; metal frame with a bronze finish\", \"Modern and rustic, with elements of glam\", \"Sturdy and durable for displaying magazines, holding snack trays and every day life\", \"No assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"coffee-tables\", \"coffee table\", \"coffee tables for living room\", \"round coffee table\", \"coffee tables\", \"lift top coffee table\", \"glass coffee table\", \"coffee table set\", \"modern coffee table\", \"white coffee table\", \"square coffee table\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"wood and gold\", \"brown\", \"mercury row\", \"dark brown coffee table\", \"dark wood coffee table\", \"red coffee table\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furnitu