{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab908"},"product_id":1629,"item_id":"B075Z8KXDT","category_id":95,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Larson Industrial Wood & Metal Round Coffee Table, 33\"D, Walnut","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Walnut + Metal","weight_lb":94.24,"price_cents":36999,"stock":107,"description":"This round coffee table with a solid pine wood top and shelf has a natural distressed finish, while the metal legs and trim have a darker brown matte finish. The lower shelf provides you with ever-important space to store a laptop and remotes.\n18\"H x 33\"Diameter\nSolid pine wood top and shelf with walnut finish; metal legs\nIndustrial and rustic touches allow this table to blend with many styles.\nConvenient lower shelf for extra storage\nEasy assembly in 15-30 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This round coffee table with a solid pine wood top and shelf has a natural distressed finish, while the metal legs and trim have a darker brown matte finish. The lower shelf provides you with ever-important space to store a laptop and remotes.\", \"18\\\"H x 33\\\"Diameter\", \"Solid pine wood top and shelf with walnut finish; metal legs\", \"Industrial and rustic touches allow this table to blend with many styles.\", \"Convenient lower shelf for extra storage\", \"Easy assembly in 15-30 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"coffee-tables\", \"coffee table\", \"coffee tables for living room\", \"round coffee table\", \"coffee tables\", \"lift top coffee table\", \"glass coffee table\", \"coffee table set\", \"modern coffee table\", \"white coffee table\", \"square coffee table\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"walnut + metal\", \"brown\", \"dark brown coffee table\", \"dark wood coffee table\", \"red coffee table\", \"black glass coffee table\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Tables/Coffee Ta