{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab913"},"product_id":1640,"item_id":"B075ZBW1NL","category_id":94,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Mid-Century Modern Microfiber No-Back Saddle Kitchen Counter Bar Stools, Set of 2, 32.3 Inch Height, Brown, Black Metal","brand":"Rivet","color":"Brown","weight_lb":11.3,"price_cents":7099,"stock":112,"description":"19.9\"W x 17.9\"D x 32.3\"H\nMicrofiber fabric over hardwood frame; metal legs have black finish\nAlong with seating, these chairs bring retro fun to your bar area\nAssemble in 15 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\nSimple no-back seats are paired with tall black metal bases for a classic Mid-century style. The microfiber has a distressed finish to give these bar stools a hint of vintage style -- but with the modern conveniences of easy cleaning and durability.","bullets":"[\"19.9\\\"W x 17.9\\\"D x 32.3\\\"H\", \"Microfiber fabric over hardwood frame; metal legs have black finish\", \"Along with seating, these chairs bring retro fun to your bar area\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\", \"Simple no-back seats are paired with tall black metal bases for a classic Mid-century style. The microfiber has a distressed finish to give these bar stools a hint of vintage style -- but with the modern conveniences of easy cleaning and durability.\"]","keywords":"[\"barstools\", \"bar stools\", \"bar stools set of 2\", \"counter height bar stools\", \"bar stool\", \"bar stools set of 4\", \"stool\", \"counter stool\", \"bar stools set of 3\", \"counter stools\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"brown\", \"kitchen bar stools\", \"24 inch bar stools\", \"white bar stools\", \"bar stool set\", \"gray bar stools\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Game & Recreation Room Furniture/Home Bar Furniture/Barstools","created_at":"2023-01-13T15:52:07Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab914"},"product_id":1641,"item_id":"B075ZBW1S4","category_id":95,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Larson Industrial Wood & Metal Side End Table, 22\"W, Walnut","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Walnut + Metal","weight_lb":9.89,"price_cents":17999,"stock":88,"description":"The convenient L shape of this end table makes it perfect for pulling up close to your chair or sofa while working on your laptop. The solid pine top has a natural distressed finish, while the metal legs and trim have a darker brown matte finish.\n16\"W x 10\"D x 26.25H\nSolid pine top and metal frame\nIndustrial and rustic touches allow this table to blend with many styles.\nDistressed top with a walnut finish\nEasy assembly in 15-30 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"The convenient L shape of this end table makes it perfect for pulling up close to your chair or sofa while working on your laptop. The solid pine top has a natural distressed finish, while the metal legs and trim have a darker brown matte finish.\", \"16\\\"W x 10\\\"D x 26.25H\", \"Solid pine top and metal frame\", \"Industrial and rustic touches allow this table to blend with many styles.\", \"Distressed top with a walnut finish\", \"Easy assembly in 15-30 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"end-tables\", \"end tables\", \"side table\", \"end table\", \"end tables living room\", \"night stand\", \"console table\", \"accent table\", \"coffee table\", \"sofa table\", \"nightstand\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"walnut + metal\", \"brown\", \"accent tables\", \"small accent table\", \"round accent table\", \"outdoor accent table\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Tables/End Tables","created_at":"2023-03-09T18:33:15Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab915"},"product_id":1642,"item_id":"B075ZCLPVG","category_id":95,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Wood and Metal Round Nesting Side End Tables, 34\" W, Set of 2, Pine","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Wood + White Marble","weight_lb":43.0,"price_cents":18999,"stock":87,"description":"Large table is 34\" Diameter and 20\"H; Small table is 25\" Diameter and 15.25\"H\nSolid pine top with walnut finish; metal frame with dark brown finish\nModern metal material and designed combined with classic wood top\nSpace savers when kept together, but can be pulled apart partially or completely\nEasy assembly in 15-30 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\nComplement your living room with this set of two round nesting tables with natural solid pine tops and sturdy sleek metal bases. Each table can be used separately or together to create the space you need for your laptop, drink, and remote controls.","bullets":"[\"Large table is 34\\\" Diameter and 20\\\"H; Small table is 25\\\" Diameter and 15.25\\\"H\", \"Solid pine top with walnut finish; metal frame with dark brown finish\", \"Modern metal material and designed combined with classic wood top\", \"Space savers when kept together, but can be pulled apart partially or completely\", \"Easy assembly in 15-30 minutes. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\", \"Complement your living room with this set of two round nesting tables with natural solid pine tops and sturdy sleek metal bases. Each table can be used separately or together to create the space you need for your laptop, drink, and remote controls.\"]","keywords":"[\"coffee-tables\", \"coffee table\", \"coffee tables for living room\", \"round coffee table\", \"coffee tables\", \"lift top coffee table\", \"glass coffee table\", \"coffee table set\", \"modern coffee table\", \"white coffee table\", \"square coffee table\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"wood + white marble\", \"brown\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Tables/Nesting Tables","created_at":"2023-05-14T15:56:11Z"}
