{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab921"},"product_id":1654,"item_id":"B07649QSR6","category_id":65,"name":"Obsidian Sunglasses for Women Fashion Cat-Eye Frame 11, Blush Tortoise, 53.5 mm","brand":"Obsidian Sunglasses","color":"Blush Tortoise","weight_lb":"","price_cents":3799,"stock":21,"description":"A chic essential, these cat-eye sunglasses feature a distinctive angular shape, tinted UV-coated lenses, and a handcrafted acetate frame for lasting style\nFive-barrel hinge enhances durability\nPrescription ready (Rx-able) CR-39 lenses feature anti-reflective coating to reduce glare\nCase and cleaning cloth included\nLens width: 53.5mm, Lens height: 43.5mm, Bridge: 21mm, Arm: 146mm","bullets":"[\"A chic essential, these cat-eye sunglasses feature a distinctive angular shape, tinted UV-coated lenses, and a handcrafted acetate frame for lasting style\", \"Five-barrel hinge enhances durability\", \"Prescription ready (Rx-able) CR-39 lenses feature anti-reflective coating to reduce glare\", \"Case and cleaning cloth included\", \"Lens width: 53.5mm, Lens height: 43.5mm, Bridge: 21mm, Arm: 146mm\"]","keywords":"[\"eyewear designer spring retro throwback pin up shades sunnies clear large\", \"amazon\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-12-17T12:56:25Z"}
