{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab924"},"product_id":1657,"item_id":"B07654KWZQ","category_id":159,"name":"365 Everyday Value, Flu Ease Value Pack, 18 ct","brand":"365 Everyday Value","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1299,"stock":72,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.\nFlu Ease is an established homeopathic formula that should be taken at the first sign of flu-like symptoms for temporary relief of body aches, headache, fever and chills.\nFlu Ease provides temporary relief of flu-like symptoms without drowsiness or risk of drug interactions. Relieves body aches, headaches, fever & chills.\nNo drugs interactions.\nNon-drowsy.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.\", \"Flu Ease is an established homeopathic formula that should be taken at the first sign of flu-like symptoms for temporary relief of body aches, headache, fever and chills.\", \"Flu Ease provides temporary relief of flu-like symptoms without drowsiness or risk of drug interactions. Relieves body aches, headaches, fever & chills.\", \"No drugs interactions.\", \"Non-drowsy.\"]","keywords":"[\"tablet\", \"throat\", \"acetaminophen\", \"nightime\", \"cough\", \"nighttime\", \"effervescent\", \"medicine\", \"sore\", \"medication\", \"decongestant\", \"para\", \"severe\", \"generic\", \"alla\"]","node_path":"Products/Health Care/OTC Medications & Treatments/Cough & Cold/Cold & Flu Relief","created_at":"2023-11-30T03:43:14Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab925"},"product_id":1658,"item_id":"B07656WV77","category_id":113,"name":"Whole Foods Market, Extra Virgin Olive Oil of Sicily, 33.8 fl oz","brand":"Whole Foods Market","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":999,"stock":41,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. When it comes to innovative flavors and products sourced from artisans and producers around the world, the Whole Foods Market brand has you covered. Amazing products, exceptional ingredients, no compromises.\nAn intense flavor and aroma is achieved by blending two of southern Italy's prized olive varieties, ogliarola and coratina. The result is a medium fruity oil with grassy notes that is best drizzled over bruschetta, grilled fish or vegetables.\nNorth American Olive Oil Association Certified Quality. Tested for quality to meet international olive oil standards. Product of Italy.\nCertified GMO-Free, Certified Kosher, Certified Vegan.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. When it comes to innovative flavors and products sourced from artisans and producers around the world, the Whole Foods Market brand has you covered. Amazing products, exceptional ingredients, no compromises.\", \"An intense flavor and aroma is achieved by blending two of southern Italy's prized olive varieties, ogliarola and coratina. The result is a medium fruity oil with grassy notes that is best drizzled over bruschetta, grilled fish or vegetables.\", \"North American Olive Oil Association Certified Quality. Tested for quality to meet international olive oil standards. Product of Italy.\", \"Certified GMO-Free, Certified Kosher, Certified Vegan.\"]","keywords":"[\"oilive\", \"oilve\", \"olive\", \"greece\", \"italian\", \"mediterranean\", \"oil\", \"extravirgin\", \"aceite\", \"unrefined\", \"grocery\", \"canola\", \"greek\", \"pressed\", \"vinegar\"]","node_path":"Categories/Pantry Staples/Cooking & Baking/Cooking Oils, Vinegars & Sprays/Oils/Olive","created_at":"2023-01-17T02:57:26Z"}
