{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab956"},"product_id":1707,"item_id":"B0779CYY96","category_id":159,"name":"Basic Care Arthricream, Trolamine Salicylate 10%, Analgesic & Arthritis Pain Relief Cream, 3 Ounces","brand":"Amazon Basic Care","color":"","weight_lb":0.25,"price_cents":2199,"stock":18,"description":"ACTIVE INGREDIENT: The active ingredient in Basic Care Arthricream Pain Relieving Cream is trolamine salicylate 10%, topical analgesic, which compares to the active ingredient in Aspercreme.\nFAST PAIN RELIEF: Don't be sidelined by minor pain associated with arthritis, simple backache, muscle strains, sprains and bruises. Basic Care Arthricream, Trolamine Salicylate 10%, is an odor-free topical analgesic cream that works fast, with aloe and 3 conditioners so it's gentle on your skin.\nNO-PILL OPTION: Massage Basic Care Arthricream directly onto the skin of the area affected by pain. Arthricream is an analgesic cream and arthritis pain relief cream for effective, temporary relief of arthritis, back and muscular pain.\nNO ODOR: Use Basic Care Arthricream, analgesic cream and arthritis pain relief cream, without worry because it has no liniment odor.\nEASY OPEN FLIP TOP: The container features a top that flips up for your convenience, so this analgesic cream is easy to use as an arthritis pain relief cream.","bullets":"[\"ACTIVE INGREDIENT: The active ingredient in Basic Care Arthricream Pain Relieving Cream is trolamine salicylate 10%, topical analgesic, which compares to the active ingredient in Aspercreme.\", \"FAST PAIN RELIEF: Don't be sidelined by minor pain associated with arthritis, simple backache, muscle strains, sprains and bruises. Basic Care Arthricream, Trolamine Salicylate 10%, is an odor-free topical analgesic cream that works fast, with aloe and 3 conditioners so it's gentle on your skin.\", \"NO-PILL OPTION: Massage Basic Care Arthricream directly onto the skin of the area affected by pain. Arthricream is an analgesic cream and arthritis pain relief cream for effective, temporary relief of arthritis, back and muscular pain.\", \"NO ODOR: Use Basic Care Arthricream, analgesic cream and arthritis pain relief cream, without worry because it has no liniment odor.\", \"EASY OPEN FLIP TOP: The container features a top that flips up for your convenience, so this analgesic cream is easy to use as an arthritis pain relief cream.\"]","keywords":"[\"muscle rub arthritis cream pain relief ointment bengay\", \"arthritis cream, aspercreme, aloe cream, analgesic cream, arthritis, arthritis cream pain relief\"]","node_path":"Products/Health Care/OTC Medications & Treatments/Pain Relievers/Arthritis","created_at":"2024-01-06T21:31:21Z"}
