{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab98e"},"product_id":1763,"item_id":"B078HS2DPZ","category_id":156,"name":"Basic Care Tussin DM, Cough Suppressant & Expectorant, 8 Fluid Ounces","brand":"Amazon Basic Care","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1099,"stock":47,"description":"ACTIVE INGREDIENTS: This product contains dextromethorphan HBr (a cough suppressant) and guaifenesin (expectorant) which compare to the active ingredients in Robitussin Cough + Chest Congestion DM.\nCOUGH SUPPRESSANT: Basic Care Tussin DM temporarily relieves cough due to minor throat and bronchial irritation as may occur with a cold.\nEXPECTORANT: Helps loosen phlegm (mucus) and thin bronchial secretions to drain bronchial tubes for mucus relief and chest congestion relief.\nEFFECTIVE COLD RELIEF: Basic Care Tussin DM provides soothing action that targets the source of your cough, plus relieves your chest congestion.\nNON-DROWSY: When taken as directed, this cough suppressant and expectorant provides mucus relief and is formulated to be a non-drowsy solution for cough and mucus.","bullets":"[\"ACTIVE INGREDIENTS: This product contains dextromethorphan HBr (a cough suppressant) and guaifenesin (expectorant) which compare to the active ingredients in Robitussin Cough + Chest Congestion DM.\", \"COUGH SUPPRESSANT: Basic Care Tussin DM temporarily relieves cough due to minor throat and bronchial irritation as may occur with a cold.\", \"EXPECTORANT: Helps loosen phlegm (mucus) and thin bronchial secretions to drain bronchial tubes for mucus relief and chest congestion relief.\", \"EFFECTIVE COLD RELIEF: Basic Care Tussin DM provides soothing action that targets the source of your cough, plus relieves your chest congestion.\", \"NON-DROWSY: When taken as directed, this cough suppressant and expectorant provides mucus relief and is formulated to be a non-drowsy solution for cough and mucus.\"]","keywords":"[\"cough, cough & chest, congestion, cough and mucus, mucus, cough syrup, cough suppressant, tussin, tussin dm, tussin cough, robitussin, robitussin cough and chest\"]","node_path":"Products/Health Care/OTC Medications & Treatments/Cough & Cold/Coughing & Sore Throats/Cough Syrups","created_at":"2024-03-20T22:08:26Z"}
