{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ab9b0"},"product_id":1797,"item_id":"B0793FPKMQ","category_id":239,"name":"Womens Rose Gold Plated Sterling Silver Swarovski Zirconia Heart Misty Rose Topaz Halo Ring, Size 6","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"Misty Rose","weight_lb":"","price_cents":25999,"stock":58,"description":"Rose-Gold-Plated Sterling Silver ring with Heart-Shape Misty Rose Topaz and embellished with a halo of Swarovski Zirconia\nA size 6 ring\nA timeless and classic piece\nEach Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Rose-Gold-Plated Sterling Silver ring with Heart-Shape Misty Rose Topaz and embellished with a halo of Swarovski Zirconia\", \"A size 6 ring\", \"A timeless and classic piece\", \"Each Swarovski Zirconia is Laser Engraved as a seal of authenticity and guarantees the highest quality diamond simulant in the world\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"hearts\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-02-22T13:12:00Z"}
