{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba06"},"product_id":1883,"item_id":"B07B4CXTRY","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Appleton Farmhouse Tufted Leather Recliner, 35\"W, Driftwood","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Driftwood","weight_lb":99.0,"price_cents":7699,"stock":11,"description":"This is not your dad's old overstuffed recliner. You'll enjoy comfort and coziness along with quality leather and graceful style. With its rolled arms and tufted back, this chair has the modern and classic features to fit a transitional decor.\n35\"W x 40\"D x 41\"H; Seat Height: 20\"H ; Seat Depth: 21\"D; Seat Back Height: 41\"H; Arm Height: 24\"H; Front legs: 5.625\"H; Back legs: 4.75\"H\nLeather upholstery on sturdy pine wood frame\nModern and classic come together for a transitional style\nPush back reclining mechanism; seat cushion can be removed for cleaning\nNo assembly required\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This is not your dad's old overstuffed recliner. You'll enjoy comfort and coziness along with quality leather and graceful style. With its rolled arms and tufted back, this chair has the modern and classic features to fit a transitional decor.\", \"35\\\"W x 40\\\"D x 41\\\"H; Seat Height: 20\\\"H ; Seat Depth: 21\\\"D; Seat Back Height: 41\\\"H; Arm Height: 24\\\"H; Front legs: 5.625\\\"H; Back legs: 4.75\\\"H\", \"Leather upholstery on sturdy pine wood frame\", \"Modern and classic come together for a transitional style\", \"Push back reclining mechanism; seat cushion can be removed for cleaning\", \"No assembly required\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"living-room-chairs\", \"couch\", \"accent chair\", \"sofa\", \"leather sofa\", \"bar stools\", \"full size bed frame\", \"living room furniture\", \"recliner chair\", \"glider rocker\", \"sleeper sofa\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"driftwood\", \"recliner\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2024-05-08T17:35:11Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba07"},"product_id":1884,"item_id":"B07B4D4B6F","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Andover Ottoman, 32\"W, Driftwood Leather","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Driftwood","weight_lb":36.0,"price_cents":14999,"stock":73,"description":"Complete your living space with this stylish ottoman. With its driftwood-colored upholstery, this ottoman is an ideal accent for transitional-style home decor. The solid-wood frame enhances durability and extends this ottoman’s life.\nOverall: 32\"W x 25\"D x 21\"H; seat height: 21\"H; seat depth: 33\"D; leg height: 4.25\"H\nSturdy wood frame with rich top-grain leather upholstery\nTransitional style blends well with a variety of home-decor themes.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\nThis item is made to order just for you.","bullets":"[\"Complete your living space with this stylish ottoman. With its driftwood-colored upholstery, this ottoman is an ideal accent for transitional-style home decor. The solid-wood frame enhances durability and extends this ottoman’s life.\", \"Overall: 32\\\"W x 25\\\"D x 21\\\"H; seat height: 21\\\"H; seat depth: 33\\\"D; leg height: 4.25\\\"H\", \"Sturdy wood frame with rich top-grain leather upholstery\", \"Transitional style blends well with a variety of home-decor themes.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\", \"This item is made to order just for you.\"]","keywords":"[\"ottoman\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2024-06-02T05:45:10Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba08"},"product_id":1885,"item_id":"B07B4D4BWD","category_id":91,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Andover Modern Rectangle Ottoman, 32\"W, Dark Tan","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Dark Tan","weight_lb":36.0,"price_cents":5499,"stock":7,"description":"Wooden legs, clean lines, and box-edge cushions bring stylish sophistication to modern or transitional rooms. With a sturdy frame and springy cushioning, this ottoman is ready to withstand years as a footrest or extra seating for guests.\n32\"W x 25\"D x 21\"H; Seat Height: 21\"H ; Seat Depth: 25\"D; Seat Back Height: 21\"H; Leg Height: 4.25\"H\nStain-resistant polyester fabric on hardwood pine frame\nThe streamlined shape is a hallmark of modern design\nCarefully crafted to ensure durability and years of use\nEasy assembly in less than 15 minutes; just screw in legs\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Wooden legs, clean lines, and box-edge cushions bring stylish sophistication to modern or transitional rooms. With a sturdy frame and springy cushioning, this ottoman is ready to withstand years as a footrest or extra seating for guests.\", \"32\\\"W x 25\\\"D x 21\\\"H; Seat Height: 21\\\"H ; Seat Depth: 25\\\"D; Seat Back Height: 21\\\"H; Leg Height: 4.25\\\"H\", \"Stain-resistant polyester fabric on hardwood pine frame\", \"The streamlined shape is a hallmark of modern design\", \"Carefully crafted to ensure durability and years of use\", \"Easy assembly in less than 15 minutes; just screw in legs\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"sofas\", \"ottoman\", \"storage ottoman\", \"ottoman with storage\", \"storage bench\", \"pouf ottoman\", \"bench\", \"ottoman foot rest\", \"pouf\", \"ottomans\", \"ottoman coffee table\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"dark tan\", \"rectangle ottoman\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Accent Furniture/Ottomans","created_at":"2023-03-12T23:59:45Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba09"},"product_id":1886,"item_id":"B07B4DB65T","category_id":91,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Cliff Mid-Century Modern Round Tufted Velvet Pouf Ottoman, 39\"W, Grey","brand":"Rivet","color":"Grey","weight_lb":25.0,"price_cents":10999,"stock":7,"description":"After a long day, your tired legs and feet will look forward to this plush velvet ottoman. It's also a handy extra seat for guests and a place to rest a tray of snacks. Tufting gives it a mid-century modern flair, while the fabric adds a bit of glam.\n39.3\"W x 39.3\"D x 15.7\"H\nVelvet fabric on wood frame\nMid-century modern meets glam in this statement piece\nCan be a foot rest, extra seating for guests, or a perch for a tray of snacks\nNo assembly required\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\nAvoid direct sunlight as the fabric will fade with exposure","bullets":"[\"After a long day, your tired legs and feet will look forward to this plush velvet ottoman. It's also a handy extra seat for guests and a place to rest a tray of snacks. Tufting gives it a mid-century modern flair, while the fabric adds a bit of glam.\", \"39.3\\\"W x 39.3\\\"D x 15.7\\\"H\", \"Velvet fabric on wood frame\", \"Mid-century modern meets glam in this statement piece\", \"Can be a foot rest, extra seating for guests, or a perch for a tray of snacks\", \"No assembly required\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\", \"Avoid direct sunlight as the fabric will fade with exposure\"]","keywords":"[\"sofas\", \"ottoman\", \"storage ottoman\", \"ottoman with storage\", \"storage bench\", \"pouf ottoman\", \"bench\", \"ottoman foot rest\", \"pouf\", \"ottomans\", \"ottoman coffee table\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"grey\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Accent Furniture/Ottomans","created_at":"2023-08-24T08:32:15Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba0a"},"product_id":1887,"item_id":"B07B4FW792","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Edmunds Traditional Leather Recliner Accnet Chair, 30\"W, Brown Leather","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Brown Leather","weight_lb":88.0,"price_cents":27999,"stock":29,"description":"Straight lines and narrow arms combine modern touches with classic fabric, making this chair an ideal transitional style -- AND it's a recliner that doesn't look like a recliner. This piece will last through years of movies and afternoon naps.\n30\"W x 36\"D x 41\"H; Seat Height: 21\"H ; Seat Depth: 23\"D; Seat Back Height: 41\"H; Arm Height: 23\"H; Front legs: 4.5\"H; Back legs: 4.125\"H\nLeather upholstery on hardwood pine frame\nStreamlined silhouette combines modern style with quality leather for a transitional look\nPush back reclining mechanism\nNo assembly required\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Straight lines and narrow arms combine modern touches with classic fabric, making this chair an ideal transitional style -- AND it's a recliner that doesn't look like a recliner. This piece will last through years of movies and afternoon naps.\", \"30\\\"W x 36\\\"D x 41\\\"H; Seat Height: 21\\\"H ; Seat Depth: 23\\\"D; Seat Back Height: 41\\\"H; Arm Height: 23\\\"H; Front legs: 4.5\\\"H; Back legs: 4.125\\\"H\", \"Leather upholstery on hardwood pine frame\", \"Streamlined silhouette combines modern style with quality leather for a transitional look\", \"Push back reclining mechanism\", \"No assembly required\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"living-room-chairs\", \"couch\", \"accent chair\", \"sofa\", \"leather sofa\", \"bar stools\", \"full size bed frame\", \"living room furniture\", \"recliner chair\", \"glider rocker\", \"sleeper sofa\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"brown leather\", \"recliner\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs","cr