{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba13"},"product_id":1896,"item_id":"B07B4G5RBN","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Varon Modern Lounge Daybed Chaise, 34.2\"W, Dark Grey","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Dark Grey","weight_lb":64.0,"price_cents":22999,"stock":115,"description":"With modern low-slung arms and luxuriously soft upholstery, this chaise lounge will beckon you to rest and relax. An exposed wood base adds a touch of traditional and rustic, giving this piece a transitional style that will blend with most décor.\n34.2\"W x 68.9\"D x 33.4\"H\nCanvas material on wood frame; wood legs\nElements of modern and traditional combine in a transitional style\nGreat for an afternoon nap or extra seating for guests\nEasy assembly in 15 minutes or less; just screw on legs\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"With modern low-slung arms and luxuriously soft upholstery, this chaise lounge will beckon you to rest and relax. An exposed wood base adds a touch of traditional and rustic, giving this piece a transitional style that will blend with most décor.\", \"34.2\\\"W x 68.9\\\"D x 33.4\\\"H\", \"Canvas material on wood frame; wood legs\", \"Elements of modern and traditional combine in a transitional style\", \"Great for an afternoon nap or extra seating for guests\", \"Easy assembly in 15 minutes or less; just screw on legs\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"living-room-chairs\", \"sectional sofa\", \"couch\", \"sofa\", \"accent chair\", \"recliner chair\", \"loveseat\", \"sleeper sofa\", \"sofa sets for living room\", \"chair\", \"sectional couch\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"dark grey\", \"daybed\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chaise Lounges","created_at":"2023-11-07T01:47:37Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba14"},"product_id":1897,"item_id":"B07B4GQ964","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Edmunds Traditional Recliner, 30\"W, Grey","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Grey","weight_lb":88.0,"price_cents":13999,"stock":9,"description":"Straight lines and narrow arms combine modern touches with classic fabric, making this chair an ideal transitional style -- AND it's a recliner that doesn't look like a recliner. This piece will last through years of movies and afternoon naps.\n30\"W x 36\"D x 41\"H; Seat Height: 21\"H ; Seat Depth: 23\"D; Seat Back Height: 41\"H; Arm Height: 23\"H; Front legs: 4.5\"H; Back legs: 4.125\"H\nStain-resistant polyester fabric on hardwood pine frame\nStreamlined silhouette combines modern style with a classic fabric for a transitional look\nPush back reclining mechanism\nNo assembly required\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Straight lines and narrow arms combine modern touches with classic fabric, making this chair an ideal transitional style -- AND it's a recliner that doesn't look like a recliner. This piece will last through years of movies and afternoon naps.\", \"30\\\"W x 36\\\"D x 41\\\"H; Seat Height: 21\\\"H ; Seat Depth: 23\\\"D; Seat Back Height: 41\\\"H; Arm Height: 23\\\"H; Front legs: 4.5\\\"H; Back legs: 4.125\\\"H\", \"Stain-resistant polyester fabric on hardwood pine frame\", \"Streamlined silhouette combines modern style with a classic fabric for a transitional look\", \"Push back reclining mechanism\", \"No assembly required\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"studio\", \"small\", \"heat\", \"love\", \"big\", \"recline\", \"motor\", \"rocker\", \"yard\", \"swivel\", \"hugger\", \"egg\", \"perfect\", \"loveseat\", \"rv\", \"signature\", \"seniors\", \"elderly\", \"lazy\", \"infinite\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2023-12-04T08:53:11Z"}
