{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba20"},"product_id":1909,"item_id":"B07B4M364Y","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Appleton Farmhouse Recliner, 35\"W, Khaki","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Khaki","weight_lb":99.0,"price_cents":29999,"stock":68,"description":"This is definitely not your dad's old overstuffed recliner. This chair features graceful style, neutral colors and durable fabric. With its rolled arms and tufted back, it has the right touches of modern and classic to blend with most decor.\n35\"W x 40\"D x 41\"H; Seat Height: 20\"H ; Seat Depth: 21\"D; Seat Back Height: 41\"H; Arm Height: 24\"H; Front legs: 5.625\"H; Back legs: 4.75\"H\nDurable cotton fabric, sturdy pine wood frame\nModern and classic come together for a transitional style\nPush back reclining mechanism; removable and reversible seat cushion\nNo assembly required\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This is definitely not your dad's old overstuffed recliner. This chair features graceful style, neutral colors and durable fabric. With its rolled arms and tufted back, it has the right touches of modern and classic to blend with most decor.\", \"35\\\"W x 40\\\"D x 41\\\"H; Seat Height: 20\\\"H ; Seat Depth: 21\\\"D; Seat Back Height: 41\\\"H; Arm Height: 24\\\"H; Front legs: 5.625\\\"H; Back legs: 4.75\\\"H\", \"Durable cotton fabric, sturdy pine wood frame\", \"Modern and classic come together for a transitional style\", \"Push back reclining mechanism; removable and reversible seat cushion\", \"No assembly required\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"studio\", \"recliner\", \"small\", \"big\", \"rocker\", \"gliding\", \"oversize\", \"kiwi\", \"swivel\", \"hugger\", \"babyletto\", \"egg\", \"perfect\", \"signature\", \"gliders\", \"usb\", \"lazy\", \"seniors\", \"elderly\", \"glider\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2023-05-01T08:30:50Z"}
