{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba32"},"product_id":1927,"item_id":"B07B4MMTYW","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Jameson Farmhouse Leather Nailhead Recliner Chair, 36\"W, Brown Leather","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Brown Leather","weight_lb":103.0,"price_cents":15999,"stock":53,"description":"Gold-finished nailhead trim takes this recliner up a notch in style. Classic rolled arms and leather upholstery bring rustic sophistication to traditional or modern farmhouse-style rooms. The leather's natural markings make each chair distinctive.\n36\"W x 37\"D x 39\"H; Seat Height: 21\"H ; Seat Depth: 23\"D; Seat Back Height: 39\"H; Arm Height: 25.25\"H; Front legs: 4.25\"H; Back legs: 3.125\"H\nLeather upholstery on hardwood pine frame\nClassic roll arms and rustic nailhead trim combine for ideal modern farmhouse style\nPush-back reclining mechanism\nNo assembly required\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Gold-finished nailhead trim takes this recliner up a notch in style. Classic rolled arms and leather upholstery bring rustic sophistication to traditional or modern farmhouse-style rooms. The leather's natural markings make each chair distinctive.\", \"36\\\"W x 37\\\"D x 39\\\"H; Seat Height: 21\\\"H ; Seat Depth: 23\\\"D; Seat Back Height: 39\\\"H; Arm Height: 25.25\\\"H; Front legs: 4.25\\\"H; Back legs: 3.125\\\"H\", \"Leather upholstery on hardwood pine frame\", \"Classic roll arms and rustic nailhead trim combine for ideal modern farmhouse style\", \"Push-back reclining mechanism\", \"No assembly required\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"living-room-chairs\", \"couch\", \"accent chair\", \"sofa\", \"leather sofa\", \"bar stools\", \"full size bed frame\", \"living room furniture\", \"recliner chair\", \"glider rocker\", \"sleeper sofa\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"brown leather\", \"recliner\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs