{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba3c"},"product_id":1937,"item_id":"B07B4N29DG","category_id":93,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Frederick Mid-Century Modern Tufted Velvet Sofa Couch, 77.5\"W, Navy Blue","brand":"Rivet","color":"Navy Blue Velvet","weight_lb":"","price_cents":95999,"stock":17,"description":"The rectangular shape and channeled upholstery are unmistakably mid-century, while velvet fabric and shiny metal legs bring glamour to this sofa. This piece is a stunning style statement and a conversation starter for your modern-style room.\n77.5\"W x 34.6\"D x 31.4\"H; Seat Height: 17.7\"H ; Seat Depth: 23.2\"D; Seat Back Height: 22.2\"H; Arm Height: 31.4\"H; Leg Height: 9.3\"H\nVelvet fabric on sturdy wood frame; aluminum legs with brass finish\nMid-century modern meets glam in this statement piece\nEasy assembly in less than 30 minutes; just screw in legs\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"The rectangular shape and channeled upholstery are unmistakably mid-century, while velvet fabric and shiny metal legs bring glamour to this sofa. This piece is a stunning style statement and a conversation starter for your modern-style room.\", \"77.5\\\"W x 34.6\\\"D x 31.4\\\"H; Seat Height: 17.7\\\"H ; Seat Depth: 23.2\\\"D; Seat Back Height: 22.2\\\"H; Arm Height: 31.4\\\"H; Leg Height: 9.3\\\"H\", \"Velvet fabric on sturdy wood frame; aluminum legs with brass finish\", \"Mid-century modern meets glam in this statement piece\", \"Easy assembly in less than 30 minutes; just screw in legs\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"sofas\", \"sectional sofa\", \"couch\", \"sofa\", \"accent chair\", \"recliner chair\", \"loveseat\", \"sleeper sofa\", \"sofa sets for living room\", \"chair\", \"sectional couch\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"navy blue\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Sofas & Couches","created_at":"2024-02-03T04:08:00Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba3d"},"product_id":1938,"item_id":"B07B4NVTPX","category_id":90,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Andover Slipcover Loveseat, 67\"W, Linen Fabric","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Linen","weight_lb":115.0,"price_cents":5799,"stock":35,"description":"Complete your living space with this stylish loveseat. With its linen-colored upholstery, this loveseat is an ideal accent for transitional-style home decor. The solid-wood frame is stable, and reversible cushions enhance durability and extend this loveseat’s life.\nOverall: 67\"W x 38\"D x 33\"H; seat height: 21\"H; seat depth: 25\"D; seat back height: 28\"H; arm height: 28\"H; leg height: 4.25\"H\nSturdy wood frame with stain-resistant fabric\nTransitional style blends well with a variety of home-decor themes.\nBack and seat cushions are reversible so you can choose the configuration that's right for you.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\nThis item is made to order just for you.","bullets":"[\"Complete your living space with this stylish loveseat. With its linen-colored upholstery, this loveseat is an ideal accent for transitional-style home decor. The solid-wood frame is stable, and reversible cushions enhance durability and extend this loveseat’s life.\", \"Overall: 67\\\"W x 38\\\"D x 33\\\"H; seat height: 21\\\"H; seat depth: 25\\\"D; seat back height: 28\\\"H; arm height: 28\\\"H; leg height: 4.25\\\"H\", \"Sturdy wood frame with stain-resistant fabric\", \"Transitional style blends well with a variety of home-decor themes.\", \"Back and seat cushions are reversible so you can choose the configuration that's right for you.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\", \"This item is made to order just for you.\"]","keywords":"[\"loveseat\"]","node_path":"Categories","created_at":"2023-07-19T13:54:26Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba3e"},"product_id":1939,"item_id":"B07B4NW5WQ","category_id":90,"name":"Rusik Ottoman Stone & Beam","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Stone","weight_lb":49.0,"price_cents":6499,"stock":52,"description":"Clean lines and an exposed wood base add modern touches to this handsome ottoman. With stain-resistant performance fabric and a durable wooden frame, this piece is designed to withstand years of life with two-legged and four-legged family members.\n[Dimensions Placeholder]\nPolyester performance fabric on solid hardwood frame; comes with 3 lumbar accent pillows\nA handsome transitional ottoman that will blend with a range of décor\nFabric is resistant to stains and pilling, making it ideal for a busy family\nNo assembly required\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Clean lines and an exposed wood base add modern touches to this handsome ottoman. With stain-resistant performance fabric and a durable wooden frame, this piece is designed to withstand years of life with two-legged and four-legged family members.\", \"[Dimensions Placeholder]\", \"Polyester performance fabric on solid hardwood frame; comes with 3 lumbar accent pillows\", \"A handsome transitional ottoman that will blend with a range of décor\", \"Fabric is resistant to stains and pilling, making it ideal for a busy family\", \"No assembly required\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"recliner\", \"love\", \"bed\", \"small\", \"sectionals\", \"loveseat\", \"color\", \"queen\", \"sized\", \"sierra\", \"buy\", \"hideabed\", \"couch\", \"mid\", \"chesterfield\", \"rolled\", \"couches\", \"button\", \"homelegance\", \"red\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture","created_at":"2023-03-30T02:40:42Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba3f"},"product_id":1940,"item_id":"B07B4NW6PY","category_id":93,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Brandeberry Leather Sofa, 82\"W, Saddle","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Saddle","weight_lb":173.0,"price_cents":160999,"stock":79,"description":"Complete your interior design with this elegant sofa. With its rich saddle-colored leather, this sofa is an ideal match for traditional, farmhouse, or vintage home decor. The sturdy wood frame and reversible cushions add durability and extend the life of this beautiful piece.\nOverall: 82\"W x 43\"D x 39\"H; seat height: 21\"H; seat depth: 22\"D; seat back height: 37\"H; arm height: 27\"H; leg height: 5.25\"H\nSturdy wood frame with rich top-grain leather upholstery\nRich leather enhances tasteful traditional style\nSturdy frame; reversible cushions for durability; front-leg casters make it easy to move\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\nThis item is made to order just for you.","bullets":"[\"Complete your interior design with this elegant sofa. With its rich saddle-colored leather, this sofa is an ideal match for traditional, farmhouse, or vintage home decor. The sturdy wood frame and reversible cushions add durability and extend the life of this beautiful piece.\", \"Overall: 82\\\"W x 43\\\"D x 39\\\"H; seat height: 21\\\"H; seat depth: 22\\\"D; seat back height: 37\\\"H; arm height: 27\\\"H; leg height: 5.25\\\"H\", \"Sturdy wood frame with rich top-grain leather upholstery\", \"Rich leather enhances tasteful traditional style\", \"Sturdy frame; reversible cushions for durability; front-leg casters make it easy to move\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\", \"This item is made to order just for you.\"]","keywords":"[\"sofa\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Sofas & Couches","created_at":"2023-01-27T18:09:07Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba40"},"product_id":1941,"item_id":"B07B4SC2JF","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Vintage Industrial Cage Flush Mount Ceiling Chandelier Fixture With 4 Light Bulbs - 18.5 x 18.5 x 9.3 Inches, Matte Black","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Matte Black","weight_lb":3.8,"price_cents":7499,"stock":10,"description":"A black-finished wire cage encompasses four Edison bulbs, bringing together vintage and modern industrial influences. This flush-mount ceiling light will bring eye-catching style along with plenty of light to a kitchen or bathroom area.\n18.5\"W x 18.5\"D x 9.25\"H\nMetal with black finish\nMounts flush to the ceiling\nBulbs included\nProfessional hardwiring recommended\nIntended for indoor use only","bullets":"[\"A black-finished wire cage encompasses four Edison bulbs, bringing together vintage and modern industrial influences. This flush-mount ceiling light will bring eye-catching style along with plenty of light to a kitchen or bathroom area.\", \"18.5\\\"W x 18.5\\\"D x 9.25\\\"H\", \"Metal with black finish\", \"Mounts flush to the ceiling\", \"Bulbs included\", \"Professional hardwiring recommended\", \"Intended for indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"stone & beam; isf528b04bk; ceiling pendant fixtures; light bulbs; led bulbs; industrial chandelier; vintage chandelier\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Ceiling Lights/Chandeliers","created_at":"2023-10-03T19:30:28Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba41"},"product_id":1942,"item_id":"B07B4SC3KP","category_id":79,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Tisbury Nailhead Trim Queen Bed, 66\"W, Curious Charcoal","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Curious Charcoal","weight_lb":141.0,"price_cents":60999,"stock":15,"description":"This bed adds classic style to any space. A hand-applied pewter nailhead trim accents the scalloped silhouette for added design detail. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort.\nThis item is made to order just for you\n66\"W x 92\"D x 56\"H; Legs: 5.5\"H; Footboard: 18\"H\nPolyster/linen blend fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame\nThe bed is fully upholstered on the front and back of the headboard and footboard.\nCross-slat support system with adjustable levelers included.\nAssemble in 30 minutes-1 hour. Vacuum, brush lightly or spot-clean only.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This bed adds classic style to any space. A hand-applied pewter nailhead trim accents the scalloped silhouette for added design detail. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort.\", \"This item is made to order just for you\", \"66\\\"W x 92\\\"D x 56\\\"H; Legs: 5.5\\\"H; Footboard: 18\\\"H\", \"Polyster/linen blend fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame\", \"The bed is fully upholstered on the front and back of the headboard and footboard.\", \"Cross-slat support system with adjustable levelers included.\", \"Assemble in 30 minutes-1 hour. Vacuum, brush lightly or spot-clean only.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"stone and beam\", \"upholstered front bed\", \"stone and beam 72710-050sliplago\", \"beds\", \"72710-050sliplago\", \"trim queen bed\", \"classic style bed\", \"metal beds\", \"queen bedset\", \"king platform beds\", \"king beds\", \"wood bunk beds\", \"wood beds\", \"single beds\", \"double beds\", \"kids twin beds\", \"trundle beds\", \"metal bunk beds\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Bedroom Furniture/Beds, Frames & Bases/Beds","created_at":"2023-12-07T06:26:25Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba42"},"product_id":1943,"item_id":"B07B4SC6PN","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Mid-Century Modern Double Glass Globe Wall Sconce With Light Bulb - 5 x 6 x 13.5 Inches, Gold","brand":"Rivet","color":"Gold","weight_lb":0.57,"price_cents":6099,"stock":248,"description":"With hints of Art Deco and Mid-Century, this gold-finished 2-light sconce brings an air of glam to your home. Hand-blown glass orbs on a metal arm add handsome style along with illumination, whether used alone or in a pair.\n5\"W x 6\"D x 13.5\"H\nMetal with brushed gold finish; clear glass orb shades\nEye-catching vintage glam style\nBulbs included\nProfessional hardwiring recommended\nIntended for indoor use only","bullets":"[\"With hints of Art Deco and Mid-Century, this gold-finished 2-light sconce brings an air of glam to your home. Hand-blown glass orbs on a metal arm add handsome style along with illumination, whether used alone or in a pair.\", \"5\\\"W x 6\\\"D x 13.5\\\"H\", \"Metal with brushed gold finish; clear glass orb shades\", \"Eye-catching vintage glam style\", \"Bulbs included\", \"Professional hardwiring recommended\", \"Intended for indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"wall-sconces\", \"pendant lighting\", \"ceiling light\", \"chandeliers\", \"light fixtures ceiling\", \"wall sconce\", \"kitchen light fixtures\", \"flush mount light fixture\", \"flush mount ceiling light\", \"wall lamp\", \"bathroom light fixtures\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"gold\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Wall Lights/Wall Lamps & Sconces","created_at":"2024-01-27T06:44:42Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba43"},"product_id":1944,"item_id":"B07B4SC6SS","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Mid-Century Modern 6-Light Ceiling Pendant Chandelier Fixture, 29.3\"W, Adjustable Hanging Height, Brass","brand":"Rivet","color":"Brass","weight_lb":6.7,"price_cents":19999,"stock":39,"description":"This mobile-style 6-light chandelier is sure to turn heads upward. Three brass arms, each with clear glass orbs on the ends, are presented in tri-level style. This beautiful statement piece adds a touch of glam to a modern or industrial style room.\n29.3\"W x 6.5\"D x 80\"H, Hanging Length: 60\"\nMetal with brass finish; glass orb shades\nIncluded rods allow you to adjust the height\nBulbs not included\nProfessional hardwiring recommended\nIntended for indoor use only","bullets":"[\"This mobile-style 6-light chandelier is sure to turn heads upward. Three brass arms, each with clear glass orbs on the ends, are presented in tri-level style. This beautiful statement piece adds a touch of glam to a modern or industrial style room.\", \"29.3\\\"W x 6.5\\\"D x 80\\\"H, Hanging Length: 60\\\"\", \"Metal with brass finish; glass orb shades\", \"Included rods allow you to adjust the height\", \"Bulbs not included\", \"Professional hardwiring recommended\", \"Intended for indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"ceiling-pendant-fixtures\", \"pendant lighting\", \"ceiling light\", \"chandeliers\", \"light fixtures ceiling\", \"wall sconce\", \"kitchen light fixtures\", \"flush mount light fixture\", \"flush mount ceiling light\", \"wall lamp\", \"bathroom light fixtures\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"brass\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Ceiling Lights/Chandeliers","created_at":"2024-03-10T04:55:46Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba44"},"product_id":1945,"item_id":"B07B4SC7DG","category_id":79,"name":"Rivet A8910 Chest of Drawers","brand":"Rivet","color":"","weight_lb":190.0,"price_cents":56999,"stock":27,"description":"[Dimensions Placeholder]\nOak hardwood; ash, oak and hickory veneers\nFunctional, stylish rustic design\nSelf-close drawers with dove tailjoints.\nEasy assembly in 15-30 minutes; screw legs into base\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty\nA mix of style and function, this rustic chest is a great addition to farmhouse décor. Five?? roomy drawers with iron pulls will hold plenty of clothes, while the blend of multi-toned wood will add a beautiful natural look to your room.","bullets":"[\"[Dimensions Placeholder]\", \"Oak hardwood; ash, oak and hickory veneers\", \"Functional, stylish rustic design\", \"Self-close drawers with dove tailjoints.\", \"Easy assembly in 15-30 minutes; screw legs into base\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty\", \"A mix of style and function, this rustic chest is a great addition to farmhouse décor. Five?? roomy drawers with iron pulls will hold plenty of clothes, while the blend of multi-toned wood will add a beautiful natural look to your room.\"]","keywords":"[\"bed\", \"sleigh\", \"mattress\", \"cherry\", \"de\", \"mirror\", \"lingerie\", \"madera\", \"jennifer\", \"stein\", \"upholstery\", \"queen\", \"woodland\", \"south\", \"rod\", \"bureaus\", \"kid\", \"adults\", \"folding\", \"bright\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Bedroom Furniture/Beds, Frames & Bases/Beds","created_at":"2023-06-09T18:44:36Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba45"},"product_id":1946,"item_id":"B07B4SC9TN","category_id":89,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Corsa Contemporary Metal Bed with Headboard, King, 81\"W, Dark Bronze","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Dark Bronze","weight_lb":94.0,"price_cents":28999,"stock":35,"description":"80.5\"W x 85.5\"L x 55\"H\nSturdy metal construction with deep bronze finish\nTrue transitional design with a mix of traditional and contemporary elements\nAssemble in 30 minutes-1 hour with two people\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty\nThis metal bed will add a mix of traditional and contemporary style to your room. The moderately curved open headboard and footboard are accentuated by decorative spindles, while the classic dark bronze finish adds a touch of warmth.","bullets":"[\"80.5\\\"W x 85.5\\\"L x 55\\\"H\", \"Sturdy metal construction with deep bronze finish\", \"True transitional design with a mix of traditional and contemporary elements\", \"Assemble in 30 minutes-1 hour with two people\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty\", \"This metal bed will add a mix of traditional and contemporary style to your room. The moderately curved open headboard and footboard are accentuated by decorative spindles, while the classic dark bronze finish adds a touch of warmth.\"]","keywords":"[\"beds\", \"bed frame\", \"queen bed frame\", \"twin bed frame\", \"king bed frame\", \"headboards for queen beds\", \"platform bed frame\", \"daybed\", \"queen headboard\", \"bed\", \"bed frame queen\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"dark bronze\", \"king\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Bedroom Furniture/Beds, Frames & Bases/Headboards & Footboards/Headboards","created_at":"2024-04-17T05:20:11Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba46"},"product_id":1947,"item_id":"B07B4SCN5F","category_id":89,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Bridgewater Curved Queen Headboard, 66\"W, Classic Cream","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Classic Cream","weight_lb":66.0,"price_cents":10999,"stock":32,"description":"This headboard adds classic style to any space. Hand-applied pewter nailhead trim accents the headboards curved silhouette. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort.\nThis item is made to order just for you\nPolyster/linen blend fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame\nThe headboard is fully upholstered on the front and the back. Compatible with most bolt-on bed frames.\nThe sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort.\nAssemble in 30 minutes-1 hour. Vacuum, brush lightly or spot-clean only.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\n66\"W x 4\"D x 56\"H","bullets":"[\"This headboard adds classic style to any space. Hand-applied pewter nailhead trim accents the headboards curved silhouette. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort.\", \"This item is made to order just for you\", \"Polyster/linen blend fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame\", \"The headboard is fully upholstered on the front and the back. Compatible with most bolt-on bed frames.\", \"The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort.\", \"Assemble in 30 minutes-1 hour. Vacuum, brush lightly or spot-clean only.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\", \"66\\\"W x 4\\\"D x 56\\\"H\"]","keywords":"[\"stone & beam\", \"curved queen headboards\", \"headboards\", \"678-050slipcrea\", \"bridgewater headboards\", \"beds\", \"metal beds\", \"queen bedset\", \"king platform beds\", \"king beds\", \"wood bunk beds\", \"wood beds\", \"single beds\", \"double beds\", \"kids twin beds\", \"trundle beds\", \"metal bunk beds\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Bedroom Furniture/Beds, Frames & Bases/Headboards & Footboards/Headboards","created_at":"2023-10-05T19:43:53Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba47"},"product_id":1948,"item_id":"B07B4SF24F","category_id":213,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Modern Geometric Runner Rug, 2' 6\" x 8', Green","brand":"Rivet","color":"Green","weight_lb":9.0,"price_cents":6999,"stock":5,"description":"Swirls of lush green on beige make this rug a refreshing focal point for living room, dining room or bedroom. It's sure to draw compliments when your guests see how well it pulls the entire room together with a whimsical modern pattern.\n2' 6\" x 8'\nMedium pile is easy to clean.\nPair with rug pad (sold separately)\nShips tightly rolled in a protective bag","bullets":"[\"Swirls of lush green on beige make this rug a refreshing focal point for living room, dining room or bedroom. It's sure to draw compliments when your guests see how well it pulls the entire room together with a whimsical modern pattern.\", \"2' 6\\\" x 8'\", \"Medium pile is easy to clean.\", \"Pair with rug pad (sold separately)\", \"Ships tightly rolled in a protective bag\"]","keywords":"[\"area-rugs\", \"area rugs\", \"rugs\", \"rug\", \"area rug\", \"rugs for living room\", \"area rugs 8x10 clearance\", \"outdoor rug\", \"area rugs 5x7 clearance under 50\", \"8x10 area rug\", \"area rugs 8x10\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"green\", \"2'6\\\"x8\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-11-02T17:25:31Z"}
