{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba4c"},"product_id":1953,"item_id":"B07B4VGZ9B","category_id":200,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Mid-Century Modern Curved Task Desk Table Lamp With USB Port And Light Bulb - 26 Inches, Matte Black &amp; Brushed Steel","brand":"Adesso","color":"Matte Black With Brushed Steel Accents","weight_lb":4.0,"price_cents":3899,"stock":107,"description":"A curved arm with antique brass finish merges with a banded, asymmetrical shade for a refresh of the standard task lamp. A joint just below the shade allows you to adjust the direction of the light in your modern or industrial style room.\n7\"W x 11\"D x 26\"H\nBulb included\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nIntended for indoor use only","bullets":"[\"A curved arm with antique brass finish merges with a banded, asymmetrical shade for a refresh of the standard task lamp. A joint just below the shade allows you to adjust the direction of the light in your modern or industrial style room.\", \"7\\\"W x 11\\\"D x 26\\\"H\", \"Bulb included\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Intended for indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"desk-lamps\", \"floor lamp\", \"lamp\", \"table lamp\", \"desk lamp\", \"lamps\", \"floor lamps for living room\", \"lamps for bedrooms\", \"lamps for living room\", \"salt lamp\", \"table lamps\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"matte black with brushed steel accents\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Lamps & Shades/Table Lamps","created_at":"2024-04-26T12:14:19Z"}
