{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba51"},"product_id":1958,"item_id":"B07B4W2PYH","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Mid Century Modern Ceiling Pendant Chandelier With Light Bulb - 16.5 x 16.5 x 19.25 Inch Shade, 6-48 Inch Cord, Wood Finished Steel Shade","brand":"Rivet","color":"Wood Finish","weight_lb":6.7,"price_cents":20999,"stock":4,"description":"Faux wood veneer on a round shade is paired with black metal hardware, marrying rustic and industrial styles in a stunning chandelier. A metal grill of concentric circles on the bottom adds an additional retro touch to a truly eye-catching piece.\n16.5\"W x 16.5\"D x 19.25\"H, Hanging Length: 6\"-48\"\nBulbs included\nProfessional hardwiring recommended\nIntended for indoor use only","bullets":"[\"Faux wood veneer on a round shade is paired with black metal hardware, marrying rustic and industrial styles in a stunning chandelier. A metal grill of concentric circles on the bottom adds an additional retro touch to a truly eye-catching piece.\", \"16.5\\\"W x 16.5\\\"D x 19.25\\\"H, Hanging Length: 6\\\"-48\\\"\", \"Bulbs included\", \"Professional hardwiring recommended\", \"Intended for indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"chandeliers\", \"pendant lighting\", \"ceiling light\", \"light fixtures ceiling\", \"wall sconce\", \"kitchen light fixtures\", \"flush mount light fixture\", \"flush mount ceiling light\", \"wall lamp\", \"bathroom light fixtures\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"wood finish\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Ceiling Lights/Chandeliers","created_at":"2023-09-04T01:00:29Z"}
