{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba5e"},"product_id":1971,"item_id":"B07B4YBVQP","category_id":200,"name":"Rivet Mid Century Modern Pyramid Pillar Table Desk Lamp With Light Bulb - 22 Inches, Brass with Linen Shade","brand":"Rivet","color":"Brass","weight_lb":4.34,"price_cents":6999,"stock":71,"description":"The warm tones of this modern lamp will bring a bit of glam to your room along with soft ambient light. A contemporary base with a matte brass finish is topped by an off-white linen shade, ready to add cozy eclectic charm.\n4\"W x 4\"D x 22\"H\nBulb included\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nIntended for indoor use only","bullets":"[\"The warm tones of this modern lamp will bring a bit of glam to your room along with soft ambient light. A contemporary base with a matte brass finish is topped by an off-white linen shade, ready to add cozy eclectic charm.\", \"4\\\"W x 4\\\"D x 22\\\"H\", \"Bulb included\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Intended for indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"table-lamps\", \"floor lamp\", \"lamp\", \"table lamp\", \"desk lamp\", \"lamps\", \"floor lamps for living room\", \"lamps for bedrooms\", \"lamps for living room\", \"salt lamp\", \"table lamps\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"brass\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting Fixtures/Indoor Lighting/Lamps","created_at":"2023-01-31T19:57:21Z"}
