{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba63"},"product_id":1976,"item_id":"B07B4YLW78","category_id":89,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Bridgewater Curved Queen Headboard, 66\"W, Curious Pearl","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Curious Weave Pearl","weight_lb":66.0,"price_cents":18999,"stock":131,"description":"This headboard adds classic style to any space. Hand-applied pewter nailhead trim accents the headboards curved silhouette. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort.\nThis item is made to order just for you\nPolyster/linen blend fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame\nThe headboard is fully upholstered on the front and the back. Compatible with most bolt-on bed frames.\nThe sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort.\nAssemble in 30 minutes-1 hour. Vacuum, brush lightly or spot-clean only.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\n66\"W x 4\"D x 56\"H","bullets":"[\"This headboard adds classic style to any space. Hand-applied pewter nailhead trim accents the headboards curved silhouette. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort.\", \"This item is made to order just for you\", \"Polyster/linen blend fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame\", \"The headboard is fully upholstered on the front and the back. Compatible with most bolt-on bed frames.\", \"The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort.\", \"Assemble in 30 minutes-1 hour. Vacuum, brush lightly or spot-clean only.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\", \"66\\\"W x 4\\\"D x 56\\\"H\"]","keywords":"[\"headboards\", \"bed frame\", \"queen bed frame\", \"twin bed frame\", \"king bed frame\", \"headboards for queen beds\", \"platform bed frame\", \"daybed\", \"queen headboard\", \"bed\", \"bed frame queen\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"curious weave pearl\", \"queen\", \"beds\", \"metal beds\", \"queen bedset\", \"king platform beds\"]","nod