{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba6a"},"product_id":1983,"item_id":"B07B4ZFBNP","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Industrial Glass Shade Wall Sconce Fixture With Edison Light Bulb - 6.25 x 8.25 x 10.75 Inches, Matte Black","brand":"Rivet","color":"Matte Black","weight_lb":0.5,"price_cents":5199,"stock":10,"description":"Mount this sconce over your vanity to bring a modern industrial touch to your bathroom. A bell-shaped glass shade is paired with a matte black metal plate and arm. Vintage design touches are accented by a vintage-inspired bulb.\n6.25\"W x 8.25\"D x 10.75\"H\nBulb included\nProfessional hardwiring recommended\nIntended for indoor use only","bullets":"[\"Mount this sconce over your vanity to bring a modern industrial touch to your bathroom. A bell-shaped glass shade is paired with a matte black metal plate and arm. Vintage design touches are accented by a vintage-inspired bulb.\", \"6.25\\\"W x 8.25\\\"D x 10.75\\\"H\", \"Bulb included\", \"Professional hardwiring recommended\", \"Intended for indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"bed\", \"de\", \"mirror\", \"lamps\", \"crystal\", \"brushed\", \"mid\", \"hansford\", \"goods\", \"decorations\", \"two\", \"house\", \"fixtures\", \"polished\", \"rustic\", \"chic\", \"mason\", \"fall\", \"decor\", \"of\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Wall Lights/Vanity Lights","created_at":"2023-02-25T17:02:24Z"}
