{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba7c"},"product_id":2001,"item_id":"B07B519FLZ","category_id":89,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Bridgewater Curved Queen Headboard, 82\"W, Fresh Dune","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Fresh Weave Dune","weight_lb":82.0,"price_cents":17999,"stock":75,"description":"This headboard adds classic style to any space. Hand-applied pewter nailhead trim accents the headboards curved silhouette. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort.\nThis item is made to order just for you\nPolyster/linen blend fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame\nThe headboard is fully upholstered on the front and the back. Compatible with most bolt-on bed frames.\nThe sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort.\nAssemble in 30 minutes-1 hour. Vacuum, brush lightly or spot-clean only.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\n82\"W x 4\"D x 56\"H","bullets":"[\"This headboard adds classic style to any space. Hand-applied pewter nailhead trim accents the headboards curved silhouette. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort.\", \"This item is made to order just for you\", \"Polyster/linen blend fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame\", \"The headboard is fully upholstered on the front and the back. Compatible with most bolt-on bed frames.\", \"The sturdy frame is covered in a thick polyester padding for extra comfort.\", \"Assemble in 30 minutes-1 hour. Vacuum, brush lightly or spot-clean only.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\", \"82\\\"W x 4\\\"D x 56\\\"H\"]","keywords":"[\"queen headboards only\", \"zinus headboard queen\", \"bed headboard\", \"bed frame and mattress set queen\", \"tufted headboard queen\", \"beds\", \"metal beds\", \"queen bedset\", \"king platform beds\", \"king beds\", \"wood bunk beds\", \"wood beds\", \"single beds\", \"double beds\", \"kids twin beds\", \"trundle beds\", \"metal bunk beds\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furn