{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba8a"},"product_id":2015,"item_id":"B07B78M4C4","category_id":90,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Ian Mid-Century Modern Industrial Wood Dining Table, Storage, Brown","brand":"Rivet","color":"Brown","weight_lb":24.25,"price_cents":10999,"stock":15,"description":"Retro style meets practicality in this dining chair. With no fabric to stain, it's easy to keep clean. The rounded back is curved for comfort, while slanted legs complete a silhouette that is the epitome of mid-century modern style.\n22.125\"L x 19.5\"W x 32.5\"H\nHardwood legs and seat; plywood back is reinforced with steel\nFun retro design is a style statement\nEasy to care for and durable\nAssembly in 15-30 minute; just bolt on legs\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Retro style meets practicality in this dining chair. With no fabric to stain, it's easy to keep clean. The rounded back is curved for comfort, while slanted legs complete a silhouette that is the epitome of mid-century modern style.\", \"22.125\\\"L x 19.5\\\"W x 32.5\\\"H\", \"Hardwood legs and seat; plywood back is reinforced with steel\", \"Fun retro design is a style statement\", \"Easy to care for and durable\", \"Assembly in 15-30 minute; just bolt on legs\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"dining-chairs\", \"dining chairs\", \"dining room chairs\", \"accent chair\", \"chair\", \"chairs\", \"kitchen chairs\", \"dining chair\", \"dining chairs set of 4\", \"dining table set\", \"accent chair set of 2\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"brown\", \"dining chair, wood\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Kitchen & Dining Room Furniture","created_at":"2023-07-18T06:00:32Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba8b"},"product_id":2016,"item_id":"B07B78M4GB","category_id":94,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Elden Leather Nailhead-Trim Kitchen Counter-Height Backless Stool, 26\"H, Black","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Black Leather","weight_lb":12.1,"price_cents":13999,"stock":78,"description":"With a top-grain leather seat and brass-finished nailhead trim, this handsome counter stool exudes sophistication. The seat is curved for extra comfort, while high quality construction and materials ensure it will last through many good times.\n14.2\"W x 19.7\"D x 26\"H\nTop-grain leather seat on hardwood base\nLeather, wood and nailhead trim combine for a sophistication that blends with any décor\nNo assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"With a top-grain leather seat and brass-finished nailhead trim, this handsome counter stool exudes sophistication. The seat is curved for extra comfort, while high quality construction and materials ensure it will last through many good times.\", \"14.2\\\"W x 19.7\\\"D x 26\\\"H\", \"Top-grain leather seat on hardwood base\", \"Leather, wood and nailhead trim combine for a sophistication that blends with any décor\", \"No assembly required. Wipe with soft dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"barstools\", \"bar stools\", \"bar stools set of 2\", \"counter height bar stools\", \"bar stool\", \"bar stools set of 4\", \"stool\", \"counter stool\", \"bar stools set of 3\", \"counter stools\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"black leather\", \"counter height\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Game & Recreation Room Furniture/Home Bar Furniture/Barstools","created_at":"2023-05-23T01:37:10Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba8c"},"product_id":2017,"item_id":"B07B78RCT5","category_id":82,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Creston Modern Wood Dining Buffet, Cabinet Credenza, Storage, 56\"W, Grey","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Grey","weight_lb":140.0,"price_cents":11999,"stock":28,"description":"Distressed finish combined with clean, simple design makes this buffet ideal for a modern farmhouse décor. Removable shelves and dividers inside give you versatile storage options, while the three drawers are ideal for silverware and small items.\n19\"L x 56\"W x 32\"H\nHardwood made of poplar solids; oak veneer has distressed finish\nIdeal for a modern farmhouse décor\nTop drawer includes a removable utensil holder\nNo assembly required\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Distressed finish combined with clean, simple design makes this buffet ideal for a modern farmhouse décor. Removable shelves and dividers inside give you versatile storage options, while the three drawers are ideal for silverware and small items.\", \"19\\\"L x 56\\\"W x 32\\\"H\", \"Hardwood made of poplar solids; oak veneer has distressed finish\", \"Ideal for a modern farmhouse décor\", \"Top drawer includes a removable utensil holder\", \"No assembly required\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"sideboards\", \"buffet cabinet\", \"sideboard\", \"buffet\", \"credenza\", \"sideboards and buffet tables with storage\", \"buffet table\", \"liquor cabinet\", \"bar\", \"wine cabinet\", \"sideboard buffet\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"grey\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Kitchen & Dining Room Furniture/Buffets & Sideboards","created_at":"2023-10-16T08:02:05Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba8d"},"product_id":2018,"item_id":"B07B7B3ZN1","category_id":83,"name":"Rivet Ian Modern Mid-Century Wood Dining Kitchen Chair, Set of 2, Red","brand":"Rivet","color":"Red","weight_lb":26.46,"price_cents":9999,"stock":79,"description":"Hints of mid-century, including sloping armless sides and a tall curved back, combine with traditional fabric for a transitional style that will blend with a variety of décor. Quality materials and construction make this chair sturdy and stable.\n19\"W x 24\"D x 33\"H; Seat Height: 18\"H ; Seat Depth: 18\"D; Seat Back Height: 15.25\"H\nSturdy hardwood frame and legs with performance fabric\nMultiple design touches combine for a transitional style\nPerformance fabric and solid construction enhance this chair's durability\nAssemble in 30 minutes or less; just bolt on legs\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Hints of mid-century, including sloping armless sides and a tall curved back, combine with traditional fabric for a transitional style that will blend with a variety of décor. Quality materials and construction make this chair sturdy and stable.\", \"19\\\"W x 24\\\"D x 33\\\"H; Seat Height: 18\\\"H ; Seat Depth: 18\\\"D; Seat Back Height: 15.25\\\"H\", \"Sturdy hardwood frame and legs with performance fabric\", \"Multiple design touches combine for a transitional style\", \"Performance fabric and solid construction enhance this chair's durability\", \"Assemble in 30 minutes or less; just bolt on legs\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"dining-chairs\", \"dining chairs\", \"dining room chairs\", \"accent chair\", \"chair\", \"chairs\", \"kitchen chairs\", \"dining chair\", \"dining chairs set of 4\", \"dining table set\", \"accent chair set of 2\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"red\", \"dining chair, upholstered\"]","node_path":"Home & Garden/Home & Kitchen/Categories/Furniture/Dining Room Furniture/Dining Chairs","created_at":"2023