{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba8f"},"product_id":2021,"item_id":"B07B7BPZMH","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Ferry Modern Industrial Dining Room Kitchen Chairs, 36\"H, Set of 2 - Blue/Green","brand":"Rivet","color":"Blue/Green","weight_lb":9.9,"price_cents":11999,"stock":121,"description":"A fun retro vibe makes these chairs eclectic and modern. Clever metal leg bases are left exposed a short way up the sides for an extra industrial touch. The armless style is compact for the dining table or other rooms in need of extra seating.\n19.2\"W x 25.9\"D x 35.8\"H; Seat Height: 19.2\"H ; Seat Depth: 18.1\"D; Seat Back Height: 16.5\"H; Arm Height: 19.2\"H\nMetal frames with cotton fabric\nModern industrial with a retro vibe\nUse as dining room chair or as extra chair in living room or bedroom\nNo assembly required\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"A fun retro vibe makes these chairs eclectic and modern. Clever metal leg bases are left exposed a short way up the sides for an extra industrial touch. The armless style is compact for the dining table or other rooms in need of extra seating.\", \"19.2\\\"W x 25.9\\\"D x 35.8\\\"H; Seat Height: 19.2\\\"H ; Seat Depth: 18.1\\\"D; Seat Back Height: 16.5\\\"H; Arm Height: 19.2\\\"H\", \"Metal frames with cotton fabric\", \"Modern industrial with a retro vibe\", \"Use as dining room chair or as extra chair in living room or bedroom\", \"No assembly required\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"dining-chairs\", \"dining chairs\", \"dining room chairs\", \"accent chair\", \"chair\", \"chairs\", \"kitchen chairs\", \"dining chair\", \"dining chairs set of 4\", \"dining table set\", \"accent chair set of 2\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"blue/green\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Kitchen & Dining Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2024-01-27T20:07:15Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba90"},"product_id":2020,"item_id":"B07B7B94L2","category_id":95,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Hughes Modern Casual Wood Buffet Bar, Cabinet Credenza, Brown","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Brown","weight_lb":242.51,"price_cents":24999,"stock":23,"description":"With its warm wood tones and crossed-leg metal base, this head-turning buffet has touches of rustic, mid-century modern and industrial. It's as functional as it is eye-catching, with an adjustable shelf behind each door and three drawers for storage.\n18\"L x 54\"W x 32\"H\nHardwood frame, doors and drawers; steel base\nA casual transitional piece with elements of many styles\nUse as a dining room buffet or a storage cabinet in a hallway or living space\nAssembly in less than 15 minutes; bolt on base\nFree returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty","bullets":"[\"With its warm wood tones and crossed-leg metal base, this head-turning buffet has touches of rustic, mid-century modern and industrial. It's as functional as it is eye-catching, with an adjustable shelf behind each door and three drawers for storage.\", \"18\\\"L x 54\\\"W x 32\\\"H\", \"Hardwood frame, doors and drawers; steel base\", \"A casual transitional piece with elements of many styles\", \"Use as a dining room buffet or a storage cabinet in a hallway or living space\", \"Assembly in less than 15 minutes; bolt on base\", \"Free returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"sideboards\", \"buffet cabinet\", \"sideboard\", \"buffet\", \"credenza\", \"sideboards and buffet tables with storage\", \"buffet table\", \"liquor cabinet\", \"bar\", \"wine cabinet\", \"sideboard buffet\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"brown\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Kitchen & Dining Room Furniture/Tables","created_at":"2023-01-06T23:29:49Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba91"},"product_id":2022,"item_id":"B07B7DMLPL","category_id":84,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Elias Industrial Metal Office Computer Desk, 60\"W, Brown/Black","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Brown/Black","weight_lb":87.96,"price_cents":20999,"stock":8,"description":"This mid-century inspired piece makes an artful style statement while serving as a desk -- and could serve as a craft table as well. The wood and steel combo give it rustic and industrial touches, while open shelving gives you storage areas.\n28\"L x 60\"W x 30\"H\nWood veneer over wood composites; steel\nMid-century minimalist, retro style\nFour open shelves; metal casters add to the industrial look and make it easy to move\nAssembly in 30 minutes or less; bolt together base, then bolt to top\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This mid-century inspired piece makes an artful style statement while serving as a desk -- and could serve as a craft table as well. The wood and steel combo give it rustic and industrial touches, while open shelving gives you storage areas.\", \"28\\\"L x 60\\\"W x 30\\\"H\", \"Wood veneer over wood composites; steel\", \"Mid-century minimalist, retro style\", \"Four open shelves; metal casters add to the industrial look and make it easy to move\", \"Assembly in 30 minutes or less; bolt together base, then bolt to top\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"home-office-desks\", \"desk\", \"computer desk\", \"corner desk\", \"office desk\", \"l shaped desk\", \"gaming desk\", \"writing desk\", \"white desk\", \"desks\", \"small desk\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"brown/black\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Home Office Furniture/Home Office Desks","created_at":"2024-03-22T01:34:32Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba92"},"product_id":2023,"item_id":"B07B7J8CGH","category_id":95,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Mid-Century Modern Honeycomb Square End/Side/Nesting Tables, Wood and Bronze","brand":"Rivet","color":"Maple","weight_lb":17.4,"price_cents":12999,"stock":47,"description":"Simple and practical, these two square nesting tables provide maximum function for small spaces. Use separately for extra table space or nest inside one another. The bronze metal frame complements the maple finish, giving a warm yet modern look.\nLarge: 19.87x19.87x21.62; Small 18x18x18.62\nMaple honeycomb wood top, metal base with powder-coated bronze finish\nMid-century modern minimalist style\nA narrow, compact design ideal for small spaces and versatile uses\nNo assembly required\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Simple and practical, these two square nesting tables provide maximum function for small spaces. Use separately for extra table space or nest inside one another. The bronze metal frame complements the maple finish, giving a warm yet modern look.\", \"Large: 19.87x19.87x21.62; Small 18x18x18.62\", \"Maple honeycomb wood top, metal base with powder-coated bronze finish\", \"Mid-century modern minimalist style\", \"A narrow, compact design ideal for small spaces and versatile uses\", \"No assembly required\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"nightstand\", \"play\", \"bed\", \"sauder\", \"toddlers\", \"beam\", \"steel\", \"cherry\", \"mirror\", \"carson\", \"eames\", \"kidcraft\", \"powered\", \"tone\", \"signature\", \"usb\", \"entryway\", \"mid\", \"outlets\", \"chairside\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Tables/End Tables","created_at":"2024-03-31T12:39:40Z"}
