{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba95"},"product_id":2032,"item_id":"B07B8NY189","category_id":217,"name":"Stone & Beam Modern Wood Wall Hook, 3.8\"H, Walnut and Black","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Walnut and Black","weight_lb":1.21,"price_cents":4099,"stock":99,"description":"Walnut-finished wood and black metal hooks combine for a modern rustic -- and even industrial -- style. This piece, ideal for an entryway or mudroom, will decorate a wall while allowing you to hang coats, purses and umbrellas.\n5.2\" W x 3.75\" H\nPine hardwood and metal hooks\nReady to hang, all hardware included","bullets":"[\"Walnut-finished wood and black metal hooks combine for a modern rustic -- and even industrial -- style. This piece, ideal for an entryway or mudroom, will decorate a wall while allowing you to hang coats, purses and umbrellas.\", \"5.2\\\" W x 3.75\\\" H\", \"Pine hardwood and metal hooks\", \"Ready to hang, all hardware included\"]","keywords":"[\"coat-hooks\", \"jewelry organizer\", \"jewelry armoire\", \"jewelry box\", \"full length mirror\", \"plate stand\", \"mirror\", \"ring holder\", \"plate stands for display\", \"plant stand\", \"jewlery holder organizer\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"walnut and black\"]","node_path":"Categories","created_at":"2023-03-08T12:25:29Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba96"},"product_id":2031,"item_id":"B07B8NW6C9","category_id":292,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Wood Mirror with Message Board, 30\"H, Walnut And Black","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Walnut and Black","weight_lb":"","price_cents":2599,"stock":9,"description":"Along with serving as a mirror and wall decor, this multi-functional piece is ready to help you organize your busy schedule. Pin reminders on the cork board, stash your keys on the ledge, and hang hats, umbrellas and purses on the hooks.\n21\" W x 30\" H\nCork, mirrored glass, fiberboard, and paulownia, a lightweight wood\nReady to hang, all hardware included","bullets":"[\"Along with serving as a mirror and wall decor, this multi-functional piece is ready to help you organize your busy schedule. Pin reminders on the cork board, stash your keys on the ledge, and hang hats, umbrellas and purses on the hooks.\", \"21\\\" W x 30\\\" H\", \"Cork, mirrored glass, fiberboard, and paulownia, a lightweight wood\", \"Ready to hang, all hardware included\"]","keywords":"[\"entryway;mirror;bulletin board\", \"bulletin board; mirror; entryway\"]","node_path":"Categories/Home Décor/Home Décor Accents/Memo Boards/Decorative Chalkboards","created_at":"2024-01-15T18:29:54Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba97"},"product_id":2026,"item_id":"B07B7MWMCG","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Alicia Contemporary Office Desk Chair, 36\"H, Washed Off Oak","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Washed Off Oak","weight_lb":41.58,"price_cents":16999,"stock":34,"description":"A vintage style gets modern functional updates in this elegant office chair. Handsome wood trim gives it a warmer, homier feel, while the height and tilt of the seat can be adjusted. It also swivels 360 degrees, and is easy to move on metal casters.\n25.6\"W x 30\"D x 35.8\"-40.4\"H\nLinen upholstery on foam cushion; hardwood frame; metal base and casters\nThis chair will blend with traditional, transitional, or modern farmhouse décor\nCushioning adds comfort to a highly functional chair\nAssembly in less than 30 minutes\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"A vintage style gets modern functional updates in this elegant office chair. Handsome wood trim gives it a warmer, homier feel, while the height and tilt of the seat can be adjusted. It also swivels 360 degrees, and is easy to move on metal casters.\", \"25.6\\\"W x 30\\\"D x 35.8\\\"-40.4\\\"H\", \"Linen upholstery on foam cushion; hardwood frame; metal base and casters\", \"This chair will blend with traditional, transitional, or modern farmhouse décor\", \"Cushioning adds comfort to a highly functional chair\", \"Assembly in less than 30 minutes\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"home-office-desk-chairs\", \"office chair\", \"desk chair\", \"gaming chair\", \"computer chair\", \"chair\", \"office chairs\", \"desk\", \"computer desk\", \"ergonomic office chair\", \"chairs\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"washed off oak\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Home Office Furniture/Home Office Chairs/Home Office Desk Chairs","created_at":"2024-05-07T17:53:24Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba98"},"product_id":2025,"item_id":"B07B7L147Y","category_id":95,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Mid-Century Modern Wood and Metal 2-Tiered Side End Accent Table, 20\"W, Walnut","brand":"Rivet","color":"Walnut","weight_lb":"","price_cents":12999,"stock":23,"description":"Bring a bit of nature into your home with this striking end table. The wood is reminiscent of growth rings in trees, while simple metal legs add modern industrial style. The clever compact design gives you two tabletops in the space of one.\n20.1\"W x 29\"D x 21.3\"H; Leg Height: 15.7\"H\nFiberboard tops with walnut veneer; metal legs with black metal powder coat\nModern industrial style with a relaxing, natural touch\nCompact design for small spaces\nAssembly in 30 minutes or less; attach base frame\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Bring a bit of nature into your home with this striking end table. The wood is reminiscent of growth rings in trees, while simple metal legs add modern industrial style. The clever compact design gives you two tabletops in the space of one.\", \"20.1\\\"W x 29\\\"D x 21.3\\\"H; Leg Height: 15.7\\\"H\", \"Fiberboard tops with walnut veneer; metal legs with black metal powder coat\", \"Modern industrial style with a relaxing, natural touch\", \"Compact design for small spaces\", \"Assembly in 30 minutes or less; attach base frame\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"2 tiered side table\", \"wood metal tables\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Tables/End Tables","created_at":"2023-09-23T13:34:14Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba99"},"product_id":2027,"item_id":"B07B82PXCW","category_id":95,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Federal Mid-Century Modern Drop Leaf Dining Kitchen Table, Walnut Wood","brand":"Rivet","color":"Brown","weight_lb":99.21,"price_cents":45999,"stock":34,"description":"With rich walnut veneer and tapered legs, this mid-century modern drop leaf dining table will make a style statement along with accommodating meals and board games. The beautiful table top is attached to the legs with a handsome y-shaped joint.\n32\"L x 28-52\"W x 30\"H\nSturdy construction and durable hardwoods\nMid-century modern retro style\nAssembly in 30 minutes or less; just bolt on legs\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\nDrop leaf sides with latches","bullets":"[\"With rich walnut veneer and tapered legs, this mid-century modern drop leaf dining table will make a style statement along with accommodating meals and board games. The beautiful table top is attached to the legs with a handsome y-shaped joint.\", \"32\\\"L x 28-52\\\"W x 30\\\"H\", \"Sturdy construction and durable hardwoods\", \"Mid-century modern retro style\", \"Assembly in 30 minutes or less; just bolt on legs\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\", \"Drop leaf sides with latches\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"pedestal\", \"sauder\", \"behind\", \"door\", \"de\", \"expanding\", \"tv\", \"casa\", \"con\", \"conference\", \"homy\", \"hidden\", \"expandable\", \"signature\", \"mid\", \"couch\", \"storage\", \"media\", \"long\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Kitchen & Dining Room Furniture/Tables","created_at":"2023-02-20T15:42:26Z"}
