{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba9c"},"product_id":2034,"item_id":"B07B8PXTSY","category_id":224,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Ombre Stoneware Home Decor Flower Vase - 10 Inch, Dark Brown Red White","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Dark Brown","weight_lb":1.96,"price_cents":3399,"stock":125,"description":"Glazing techniques are used to create the beautiful multi-colored effect of this stoneware vase. With or without silk or fresh flowers, it will bring a warm rustic touch to your room. Allow for variations in color, as each is one of a kind.\n4.125\" Diameter x 10.25\" H\nCan serve as a vase for silk or cut fresh flowers, or simply as a decorative piece\n100% stoneware\nReactive glazing technique means no two are exactly alike","bullets":"[\"Glazing techniques are used to create the beautiful multi-colored effect of this stoneware vase. With or without silk or fresh flowers, it will bring a warm rustic touch to your room. Allow for variations in color, as each is one of a kind.\", \"4.125\\\" Diameter x 10.25\\\" H\", \"Can serve as a vase for silk or cut fresh flowers, or simply as a decorative piece\", \"100% stoneware\", \"Reactive glazing technique means no two are exactly alike\"]","keywords":"[\"vases\", \"vase\", \"flower vase\", \"glass vase\", \"floor vase\", \"farmhouse decor\", \"vases for decor\", \"floor vases decorative tall\", \"white vase\", \"vases for centerpieces\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"dark brown\", \"large\"]","node_path":"Categories/Home Décor/Vases","created_at":"2024-02-01T22:57:16Z"}
