{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978aba9e"},"product_id":2033,"item_id":"B07B8P11Q5","category_id":181,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Mid Century Modern Wood Floating Wall Mounted Wine Rack - 27.8 Inch, Gold and White","brand":"Rivet","color":"Gold,white","weight_lb":"","price_cents":3099,"stock":6,"description":"White wood and gold-finished metal come together to form a handsome and convenient wine rack that doubles as wall art. With the capacity to hold six wine bottles horizontally, this functional piece is a perfect complement to a modern or industrial style room.\n13\" W x 27.8\" H x 4.5\" D\nFiberboard and iron\nReady to hang, all hardware included","bullets":"[\"White wood and gold-finished metal come together to form a handsome and convenient wine rack that doubles as wall art. With the capacity to hold six wine bottles horizontally, this functional piece is a perfect complement to a modern or industrial style room.\", \"13\\\" W x 27.8\\\" H x 4.5\\\" D\", \"Fiberboard and iron\", \"Ready to hang, all hardware included\"]","keywords":"[\"wall-mounted-wine-racks\", \"jewelry organizer\", \"jewelry armoire\", \"jewelry box\", \"full length mirror\", \"plate stand\", \"mirror\", \"ring holder\", \"plate stands for display\", \"plant stand\", \"jewlery holder organizer\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"gold,white\"]","node_path":"Categories/Kitchen & Dining/Storage & Organization/Wine Racks & Cabinets/Wall-Mounted Wine Racks","created_at":"2023-02-23T00:10:26Z"}
