{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abaa2"},"product_id":2039,"item_id":"B07BDS3SJG","category_id":257,"name":"Stone & Beam 20-Piece Flatware Set, Service for 4 - Hammered","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Silver","weight_lb":3.57,"price_cents":1399,"stock":25,"description":"This distinctive flatware has a pleasing aesthetic and texture. The handles have the look and feel of hammered silver, but it's made of long-lasting, easy-to-clean stainless steel. The subtle pattern can blend with casual or elegant dinnerware.\n18/10 stainless steel\nDurable and easy to clean\nDishwasher safe\nDinner Knives: 9.06\"L x 0.34\"W x 0.97\"H; Dinner Spoons: 7.44\"L x 1.57\"W x 0.67\"H; Dinner Forks: 8\"L x 1.06\"W x 0.93\"H; Tea Spoons: 6.22\"L x 1.18\"W x 0.71\"H; Salad Forks: 6.18\"L x 0.83\"W x 0.61\"H\n20 pieces/4 place settings; each has dinner knife, spoon and fork; tea spoon; salad fork\ncleaning guidance: Please clean the flatware in short time after using it, within two hours will be more prefer. Do not leave lemon or jam on the surface, and don not leave flatware soaking in water for a long time.","bullets":"[\"This distinctive flatware has a pleasing aesthetic and texture. The handles have the look and feel of hammered silver, but it's made of long-lasting, easy-to-clean stainless steel. The subtle pattern can blend with casual or elegant dinnerware.\", \"18/10 stainless steel\", \"Durable and easy to clean\", \"Dishwasher safe\", \"Dinner Knives: 9.06\\\"L x 0.34\\\"W x 0.97\\\"H; Dinner Spoons: 7.44\\\"L x 1.57\\\"W x 0.67\\\"H; Dinner Forks: 8\\\"L x 1.06\\\"W x 0.93\\\"H; Tea Spoons: 6.22\\\"L x 1.18\\\"W x 0.71\\\"H; Salad Forks: 6.18\\\"L x 0.83\\\"W x 0.61\\\"H\", \"20 pieces/4 place settings; each has dinner knife, spoon and fork; tea spoon; salad fork\", \"cleaning guidance: Please clean the flatware in short time after using it, within two hours will be more prefer. Do not leave lemon or jam on the surface, and don not leave flatware soaking in water for a long time.\"]","keywords":"[\"de\", \"flatwear\", \"45\", \"basics\", \"usa\", \"tableware\", \"acero\", \"cubiertos\", \"lianyu\", \"palm\", \"cutlery\", \"adults\", \"brushed\", \"bowls\", \"sterling\", \"wear\", \"silverwear\", \"goods\", \"ware\", \"silverware\"]","node_path":"Categories/Kitchen & Dining/Dining & Entertaining/Flatware/Flatware Sets","created_at":"2023-10-11T08:11:13Z"}
