{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ababc"},"product_id":2065,"item_id":"B07BLCD3X9","category_id":272,"name":"Stone & Beam Tri-Ply Stainless Steel Kitchen Cookware Set, Pots and Pans, 12-Piece","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Stainless Steel","weight_lb":19.34,"price_cents":1299,"stock":50,"description":"You get the best of all worlds with this tri-ply cookware set: comfortable grip handles, stainless steel's durability and easy cleaning, plus aluminum's even heat distribution. It can be used on gas or electric stoves and in the oven.\n80% Stainless Steel/20% Aluminum; an aluminum layer between two layers of stainless\nDurable, easy to clean, can be used on stovetops or in oven\nDishwasher safe; do not use scouring pads or harsh detergents\nSafe for use with induction\n1.5 and 3 Qt Saucepans with lids; 8- and 10-inch skillets, 3.5 qt saute pan with lid; 8 Qt stockpot with lid; steamer insert with lid.","bullets":"[\"You get the best of all worlds with this tri-ply cookware set: comfortable grip handles, stainless steel's durability and easy cleaning, plus aluminum's even heat distribution. It can be used on gas or electric stoves and in the oven.\", \"80% Stainless Steel/20% Aluminum; an aluminum layer between two layers of stainless\", \"Durable, easy to clean, can be used on stovetops or in oven\", \"Dishwasher safe; do not use scouring pads or harsh detergents\", \"Safe for use with induction\", \"1.5 and 3 Qt Saucepans with lids; 8- and 10-inch skillets, 3.5 qt saute pan with lid; 8 Qt stockpot with lid; steamer insert with lid.\"]","keywords":"[\"ceramic\", \"standard\", \"de\", \"pans\", \"cuisinart\", \"allclad\", \"titanium\", \"ware\", \"plate\", \"nordic\", \"molcajete\", \"non\", \"cooks\", \"anodized\", \"d3\", \"fal\", \"wmf\", \"kitchenware\", \"tefal\", \"multiclad\"]","node_path":"Homeware & Furniture/Kitchen & Dining/Cookware/Pots & Pans/Sets","created_at":"2023-12-17T20:49:14Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ababd"},"product_id":2066,"item_id":"B07BM7DBD2","category_id":163,"name":"365 EVERYDAY VALUE Organic Acacia Clear Fiber, 12 OZ","brand":"365 by Whole Foods Market","color":"","weight_lb":0.75,"price_cents":4699,"stock":36,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\nSupports intestinal health.\nDoes not contain artificial colors, artificial flavors, or artificial preservatives.\nGentle fiber mixes easily.\nCertified Organic, Vegan.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\", \"Supports intestinal health.\", \"Does not contain artificial colors, artificial flavors, or artificial preservatives.\", \"Gentle fiber mixes easily.\", \"Certified Organic, Vegan.\"]","keywords":"[\"specialty supplements, cleanse and detox, digest, health & household vitamins & dietary supplements supplements digestive supplements dietary fibers\"]","node_path":"Products/Vitamins & Dietary Supplements/Supplements/Digestive Supplements/Dietary Fibers","created_at":"2023-03-28T22:12:34Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ababe"},"product_id":2067,"item_id":"B07BMTN6GF","category_id":209,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Abstract Geometric Throw Pillow, 20\" x 20\", Ivory","brand":"Rivet","color":"Ivory","weight_lb":"","price_cents":3699,"stock":46,"description":"A global-inspired abstract pattern has pops of yellow, blue, green, and red, while soft chenille yarns add a warm coziness. For a different look, it reverses to a solid ivory side. This pillow will freshen up a modern or transitional bedroom.\nPillow cover features hidden bottom zipper\n20\"L x 20\"W, Pillow cover dimensions are measured from seam to seam when cover is laid flat.\nSpot clean with damp white cloth and allow to air dry","bullets":"[\"A global-inspired abstract pattern has pops of yellow, blue, green, and red, while soft chenille yarns add a warm coziness. For a different look, it reverses to a solid ivory side. This pillow will freshen up a modern or transitional bedroom.\", \"Pillow cover features hidden bottom zipper\", \"20\\\"L x 20\\\"W, Pillow cover dimensions are measured from seam to seam when cover is laid flat.\", \"Spot clean with damp white cloth and allow to air dry\"]","keywords":"[\"throw-pillows\", \"throw pillows\", \"decorative pillows\", \"throw pillow covers\", \"pillows decorative throw pillows\", \"throw pillows for couch\", \"couch pillows\", \"pillow covers\", \"outdoor pillows\", \"decorative pillow covers\", \"throw pillow\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"ivory\", \"20\\\"x 20\\\"\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-02-21T05:02:08Z"}
