{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abad8"},"product_id":2093,"item_id":"B07BYYJVTR","category_id":236,"name":"Sterling Silver Created Opal Celtic Knot Linear Drop Earrings, White","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"White","weight_lb":0.01,"price_cents":18999,"stock":0,"description":"Drop earrings featuring a linear Celtic knot design with oval cut 6x4mm created opal stones in sterling silver with an oxidized look\nOpal is the October birthstone\nCeltic knot jewelry inspired by the interlacing and continuous designs prevalent in Celtic artwork, illuminating the interconnectedness and continuity of life\nFishhook backing\nHand-crafted in pure .925 Sterling Silver; Rhodium plating added to enhance shine and durability; Black oil polished for an oxidized look\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Drop earrings featuring a linear Celtic knot design with oval cut 6x4mm created opal stones in sterling silver with an oxidized look\", \"Opal is the October birthstone\", \"Celtic knot jewelry inspired by the interlacing and continuous designs prevalent in Celtic artwork, illuminating the interconnectedness and continuity of life\", \"Fishhook backing\", \"Hand-crafted in pure .925 Sterling Silver; Rhodium plating added to enhance shine and durability; Black oil polished for an oxidized look\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"drops\", \"dangles\", \"ireland\", \"irish\", \"oxidized silver\", \"oxidized sterling silver\", \"gemstone jewelry\", \"birthstone jewelry\", \"october birthday\", \"october birthday gift\", \"october birthday present\", \"october push present\", \"prime day\", \"prime day jewelry\", \"prime week\", \"prime week jewelry\", \"jewelry with free shipping\", \"gift\", \"jewelry gift\", \"gift for woman\"]","node_path":"Categories/Women/Jewelry/Earrings","created_at":"2023-11-05T13:12:40Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abad9"},"product_id":2094,"item_id":"B07BZB3HMH","category_id":210,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Mid-Century Ceramic Planter with Stand, 17\"H, Dark Brown","brand":"Rivet","color":"Dark Brown","weight_lb":12.76,"price_cents":5399,"stock":16,"description":"This two-tone round stoneware planter is an attractive piece on its own. Combined with an iron shelf/stand, it makes a mid-century style statement in addition to holding plants. Planter and shelf can be used together or separately.\n100% stoneware with iron stand\nDurable piece designed for house plants, but also stands alone as a decorative container\n12.6'' diameter x 17'' high with stand; 10.24\" diameter x 11\" high without stand\nPlanter does not have drainage holes.","bullets":"[\"This two-tone round stoneware planter is an attractive piece on its own. Combined with an iron shelf/stand, it makes a mid-century style statement in addition to holding plants. Planter and shelf can be used together or separately.\", \"100% stoneware with iron stand\", \"Durable piece designed for house plants, but also stands alone as a decorative container\", \"12.6'' diameter x 17'' high with stand; 10.24\\\" diameter x 11\\\" high without stand\", \"Planter does not have drainage holes.\"]","keywords":"[\"planters\", \"planter\", \"plant stand\", \"wall planter\", \"artificial plants\", \"fake plants\", \"ceramic planter\", \"easter basket\", \"flower pots\", \"galvanized planter\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"brown\", \"large\"]","node_path":"Categories/Gardening & Lawn Care/Pots, Planters & Container Accessories/Planters","created_at":"2023-09-02T10:56:27Z"}
