{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abae3"},"product_id":2104,"item_id":"B07C31G3M1","category_id":314,"name":"Eono Essentials 70L Waterproof, Ultralight Hiking Backpack with Internal Frame and Breathable Mesh Back","brand":"Eono","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":2299,"stock":7,"description":"HYDRATION SYSTEM COMPATIBLE: It offers water bottles access on both sides of the pack with water reservoir sleeves for easy hydration when running, cycling or hiking. Its big enough for a 3 liters’ hydration bladder.\nHIGH CAPACITY TREKKING BACKPACK: The main compartments provide enough room (40 Liters) to carry what you need in the trip for a full day or a week journey. The exterior pockets are good for holding small accessories and for easy access.\nHIP BELT USE: The hip belt provides more carrying comfort while it also serves as a good storage for mobile phone and cameras.\nLIGHTWEIGHT YET STURDY: 3lbs won’t add your burden in the long trip, the backpack is also made from high end material, exquisite stitching, tear resistant, reinforced zippers that’s easy to unzip anytime!\nGREAT GIFT IDEA: Super functional gift for husband, sons, couples, outdoor endeavors, commuter, etc. Best partner for domestic and international travel!","bullets":"[\"HYDRATION SYSTEM COMPATIBLE: It offers water bottles access on both sides of the pack with water reservoir sleeves for easy hydration when running, cycling or hiking. Its big enough for a 3 liters’ hydration bladder.\", \"HIGH CAPACITY TREKKING BACKPACK: The main compartments provide enough room (40 Liters) to carry what you need in the trip for a full day or a week journey. The exterior pockets are good for holding small accessories and for easy access.\", \"HIP BELT USE: The hip belt provides more carrying comfort while it also serves as a good storage for mobile phone and cameras.\", \"LIGHTWEIGHT YET STURDY: 3lbs won’t add your burden in the long trip, the backpack is also made from high end material, exquisite stitching, tear resistant, reinforced zippers that’s easy to unzip anytime!\", \"GREAT GIFT IDEA: Super functional gift for husband, sons, couples, outdoor endeavors, commuter, etc. Best partner for domestic and international travel!\"]","keywords":"[\"hiking backpack\", \"sport backpack\", \"waterproof backpack\"]","node_path":"Categories/Outdoor Recreation/Camping & Hiking/Bags & Packs/Internal Frame Backpacks","created_at":"2024-01-30T06:18:46Z"}
