{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abae6"},"product_id":2107,"item_id":"B07C3W6FPD","category_id":314,"name":"UMI Jujuu (Sunshine, Standard)","brand":"UMI","color":"Sunshine","weight_lb":5.73,"price_cents":2599,"stock":34,"description":"PROMOTES THE DEVELOPMENT OF THE CHILD: The gentle vibrations of the Hanging Crow’s Nest playfully ensure that the sense of balance is strengthened. The option to retreat, for example, when reading or learning helps concentration.\nWITHOUT HARMFUL MATERIALS: GOTS-certified organic cotton and real pillow filling instead of cheap air cushions guarantee healthy fun at play. With an inner compartment the size of an iPad as book holder or secret compartment for little adventurers.\nSAFE AND STURDY: The integrated swivel holds the Hanging Crow’s Nest securely to the ceiling and prevents the annoying screwing of other makes, which shortens the durability of other hanging crow’s nests.\nLARGE ENOUGH FOR THE LITTLE ONES: total height 150 cm (required minimum height of the ceiling 200 cm), seat 70 cm wide, can hold up to 80 kg, only 2.6 kg light.","bullets":"[\"PROMOTES THE DEVELOPMENT OF THE CHILD: The gentle vibrations of the Hanging Crow’s Nest playfully ensure that the sense of balance is strengthened. The option to retreat, for example, when reading or learning helps concentration.\", \"WITHOUT HARMFUL MATERIALS: GOTS-certified organic cotton and real pillow filling instead of cheap air cushions guarantee healthy fun at play. With an inner compartment the size of an iPad as book holder or secret compartment for little adventurers.\", \"SAFE AND STURDY: The integrated swivel holds the Hanging Crow’s Nest securely to the ceiling and prevents the annoying screwing of other makes, which shortens the durability of other hanging crow’s nests.\", \"LARGE ENOUGH FOR THE LITTLE ONES: total height 150 cm (required minimum height of the ceiling 200 cm), seat 70 cm wide, can hold up to 80 kg, only 2.6 kg light.\"]","keywords":"[\"baby swing hanging\",