{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abaf1"},"product_id":2118,"item_id":"B07C78LRVT","category_id":207,"name":"AmazonBasics Commercial Outdoor Patio Heater, Stainless Steel and Hammered Black","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Hammered Black/SS","weight_lb":40.0,"price_cents":3299,"stock":51,"description":"Outdoor patio heater with 46,000 BTU's of heat output; ideal for the serious outdoor entertainer\nMade with aluminum, sturdy plastic, and rugged steel with a durable powder-coated black finish that stands up to outdoor elements; stylish stainless-steel accents for modern appeal\nPiezo ignition system for easy push-button start ups; requires LPG tank (not included); provides a chain to help secure an LPG tank\nSafety auto shut-off tilt valve; waterbox for adding weight to the base; wheel assembly included for easy mobility\nMeasures approximately 18 by 89 inches (LxH); weighs 40 pounds; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty\nSecure the patio heater when not in use to avoid any potential damage to the patio heater","bullets":"[\"Outdoor patio heater with 46,000 BTU's of heat output; ideal for the serious outdoor entertainer\", \"Made with aluminum, sturdy plastic, and rugged steel with a durable powder-coated black finish that stands up to outdoor elements; stylish stainless-steel accents for modern appeal\", \"Piezo ignition system for easy push-button start ups; requires LPG tank (not included); provides a chain to help secure an LPG tank\", \"Safety auto shut-off tilt valve; waterbox for adding weight to the base; wheel assembly included for easy mobility\", \"Measures approximately 18 by 89 inches (LxH); weighs 40 pounds; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty\", \"Secure the patio heater when not in use to avoid any potential damage to the patio heater\"]","keywords":"[\"outdoor; propane; heater; patio heater; deck; warm; winter\"]","node_path":"Categories","created_at":"2023-06-01T09:34:03Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abaf2"},"product_id":2119,"item_id":"B07C7TPRB7","category_id":194,"name":"Eono Essentials 500ml/17oz BPA-Free, One-Hand Valve Squeeze Water Bottle (Blue)","brand":"Eono","color":"Blue","weight_lb":"","price_cents":4999,"stock":59,"description":"Designed for one-handed use with strategically placed grip and ergonomic bottle shape. Perfect for use while cycling, on the sports field, camping or hiking\nFeatures a leak-proof, puff valve spout to provide a quick flow of water without any mess or waste. Just squeeze for instant hydration\nThe anti-slip finger groove and silicone grips make this bottle easy to handle when you're on the go\nMade from BPA-free, pliable, 100% non-toxic food-grade material for eco-friendly and safe drinking\nPortable and perfect whether you're on your bike or in the car. The simple squeeze valve design makes it easy to drink from and won't leak, no matter how you carry it","bullets":"[\"Designed for one-handed use with strategically placed grip and ergonomic bottle shape. Perfect for use while cycling, on the sports field, camping or hiking\", \"Features a leak-proof, puff valve spout to provide a quick flow of water without any mess or waste. Just squeeze for instant hydration\", \"The anti-slip finger groove and silicone grips make this bottle easy to handle when you're on the go\", \"Made from BPA-free, pliable, 100% non-toxic food-grade material for eco-friendly and safe drinking\", \"Portable and perfect whether you're on your bike or in the car. The simple squeeze valve design makes it easy to drink from and won't leak, no matter how you carry it\"]","keywords":"[\"bike water bottle\", \"cycling bottle\", \"water\", \"bike bottle\", \"bike drink holders\", \"bike water bottles\", \"water bottle\"]","node_path":"Categories/Sports/Cycling/Accessories/Bottles","created_at":"2023-11-29T22:13:03Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abaf3"},"product_id":2120,"item_id":"B07C92LRVT","category_id":203,"name":"AmazonBasics Commercial Grade LED Tube Light - DLC Certified, 4000K, T8/T10/T12 Compatible, Cool White, 4-Foot, 24-Pack","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"cool white","weight_lb":13.23,"price_cents":1699,"stock":54,"description":"With a correlated color temperature of 4000 Kelvin, this LED tube light offers a clean, cool white light that creates a bright atmosphere in any room\nLED tube light with 50,000 hour lifespan (up to 45 years, based on 3 hours of use each day)\nLights up to full 1800 lumens immediately, with no warm-up time\nEnergy-efficient 14 watt power consumption costs appx. $1.69 per year and saves up to $99.00 over the bulb's lifespan vs. incandescent (based on appx. 3 hours a day, 11 cents/kWh)\nT8 Compatible\nThis tube light is DLC rated and UL listed\n1 year limited warranty","bullets":"[\"With a correlated color temperature of 4000 Kelvin, this LED tube light offers a clean, cool white light that creates a bright atmosphere in any room\", \"LED tube light with 50,000 hour lifespan (up to 45 years, based on 3 hours of use each day)\", \"Lights up to full 1800 lumens immediately, with no warm-up time\", \"Energy-efficient 14 watt power consumption costs appx. $1.69 per year and saves up to $99.00 over the bulb's lifespan vs. incandescent (based on appx. 3 hours a day, 11 cents/kWh)\", \"T8 Compatible\", \"This tube light is DLC rated and UL listed\", \"1 year limited warranty\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"Categories/Indoor Lighting/Light Bulbs/LED Bulbs","created_at":"2024-06-07T19:45:15Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abaf4"},"product_id":2121,"item_id":"B07C9YVDHJ","category_id":90,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Bowlyn Mid-Century Modern Wood TV Media Table Stand, 54\", Walnut","brand":"Rivet","color":"","weight_lb":106.92,"price_cents":5199,"stock":54,"description":"The minimalist brass drawer pulls and curved metal legs make this media console a mid-century modern showpiece. Four drawers give you ample room for storing electronics, while open cubbies accommodate gaming consoles, cords and wires.\n18\"L x 54\"W x 24\"H\nHardwoods made of rubberwood and poplar; walnut finish; metal hardware\nAssembly in 30 minutes or less; bolt on legs\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"The minimalist brass drawer pulls and curved metal legs make this media console a mid-century modern showpiece. Four drawers give you ample room for storing electronics, while open cubbies accommodate gaming consoles, cords and wires.\", \"18\\\"L x 54\\\"W x 24\\\"H\", \"Hardwoods made of rubberwood and poplar; walnut finish; metal hardware\", \"Assembly in 30 minutes or less; bolt on legs\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"audio-video-media-cabinets\", \"tv stand\", \"gaming chair\", \"entertainment center\", \"tv stands\", \"tv stands for flat screens\", \"corner tv stand\", \"tv stand for 55 inch tv\", \"fireplace tv stand\", \"tv console\", \"tv stand for 65 inch tv\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"54\\\"\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/TV & Media Furniture/Media Storage","created_at":"2024-01-23T03:06:45Z"}
