{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abb1d"},"product_id":2162,"item_id":"B07CTLY8N4","category_id":158,"name":"FIND Shimmer Mania Lipstick Matte No. 4 + Lip Gloss No. 10","brand":"find.","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1899,"stock":16,"description":"Package includes: 1 x lip gloss + 1 x lipstick.\nThe matte lipstick lasts up to 12 hours, even in extreme conditions.\nWith just one application, the lipstick moisturises your lips for 4 hours.\nThe lip gloss has a creamy, non-sticky consistency and leaves a pure shimmer on your lips.\nThe lip gloss moisturises and smooths, so you have a fuller and softer lip feeling.\nFor statement lips, apply an intense, matte colour under the glitter lip gloss on the matte lipstick and the gloss can be used together or individually.","bullets":"[\"Package includes: 1 x lip gloss + 1 x lipstick.\", \"The matte lipstick lasts up to 12 hours, even in extreme conditions.\", \"With just one application, the lipstick moisturises your lips for 4 hours.\", \"The lip gloss has a creamy, non-sticky consistency and leaves a pure shimmer on your lips.\", \"The lip gloss moisturises and smooths, so you have a fuller and softer lip feeling.\", \"For statement lips, apply an intense, matte colour under the glitter lip gloss on the matte lipstick and the gloss can be used together or individually.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-11-12T22:28:44Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abb1e"},"product_id":2163,"item_id":"B07CTM8Y1H","category_id":158,"name":"FIND - Lip Kit - Dazzling Fuchsia (Matte Lip Fluid no.6 and Gloss no.6)","brand":"find.","color":"Pink","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1699,"stock":31,"description":"Pack contains: 1 x Lip Gloss + 1 x Lip Fluid\nThe Lip Fluid gives an intense matte colour finish and has non-transfer properties\nThe Matte Lip Fluid is easy to apply and is comfortable to wear\nThe Lip Gloss has a creamy, non sticky texture, giving a pure gleam to your lips\nThe Lip Gloss has a moisturizing and smoothening effect, giving a fuller feel to your lips\nCreate a fab beauty statement with a sensual matte lip fluid and a dazzling lip gloss topper. Composed of a matte lip fluid and a sparkling gloss to be used separately or together\nNot suitable for sensitive skin","bullets":"[\"Pack contains: 1 x Lip Gloss + 1 x Lip Fluid\", \"The Lip Fluid gives an intense matte colour finish and has non-transfer properties\", \"The Matte Lip Fluid is easy to apply and is comfortable to wear\", \"The Lip Gloss has a creamy, non sticky texture, giving a pure gleam to your lips\", \"The Lip Gloss has a moisturizing and smoothening effect, giving a fuller feel to your lips\", \"Create a fab beauty statement with a sensual matte lip fluid and a dazzling lip gloss topper. Composed of a matte lip fluid and a sparkling gloss to be used separately or together\", \"Not suitable for sensitive skin\"]","keywords":"[\"lipstick\", \"lip gloss matte\", \"mat lip gloss\", \"matte lip fluid\", \"matte lipsticks\", \"lip liner\", \"glossy lipstick\", \"lip gloss\", \"lip gloss non sticky\", \"lipfluid\", \"liquid lipstick\", \"matte liquid\", \"lip paint\", \"lip color\", \"shiny lipstick\", \"gloss\", \"set makeup lips\", \"lip kit\", \"find beauty\", \"find make-up\"]","node_path":"Categories/Make-up/Lips/Lip Glosses","created_at":"2023-09-07T14:33:06Z"}
