{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abb24"},"product_id":2169,"item_id":"B07CVNCXDM","category_id":327,"name":"AmazonBasics Multi-Purpose Enzyme Cleaner, Concentrate, 32-Ounces, 12-Pack","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"","weight_lb":27.2,"price_cents":2399,"stock":13,"description":"32-ounce container (12-pack) of multi-purpose enzyme cleaner; great for spot cleaning, cleaning floors, and maintaining drains\nContains enzyme-producing bacteria to digest complex proteins, fats, oils, greases, hair, and other organic waste\nEliminates the source of bad odors; leaves behind a fresh, pleasant scent\nNon-corrosive, non-flammable, non-acid, and non-caustic solution\nConcentrated formula with a dilution ratio of 1:26 - 1:64","bullets":"[\"32-ounce container (12-pack) of multi-purpose enzyme cleaner; great for spot cleaning, cleaning floors, and maintaining drains\", \"Contains enzyme-producing bacteria to digest complex proteins, fats, oils, greases, hair, and other organic waste\", \"Eliminates the source of bad odors; leaves behind a fresh, pleasant scent\", \"Non-corrosive, non-flammable, non-acid, and non-caustic solution\", \"Concentrated formula with a dilution ratio of 1:26 - 1:64\"]","keywords":"[\"cleaner\"]","node_path":"Categories/Household Supplies/Household Cleaners/All-Purpose Cleaners","created_at":"2023-07-31T23:16:19Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abb25"},"product_id":2170,"item_id":"B07CVRS82M","category_id":201,"name":"AmazonBasics Professional Mold and Mildew Stain Remover, Ready-to-Use, 32-Ounces, 12-Pack","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"","weight_lb":28.0,"price_cents":5699,"stock":0,"description":"32-ounce container (12-pack) of ready-to-use solution for removing tough mold and mildew stains\nQuickly cleans and whitens even the most difficult stains; formulated with an odor counteractant and a chlorine stabilizer to help remove bad odors\nWorks on multiple surfaces, including tile, grout, Fiberglass, shower doors, and vinyl\nIdeal for shower rooms, locker rooms, and other restroom areas; note: use only in well ventilated areas\nIncludes one trigger spray head\nSimply spray effected area until thoroughly wet, then let it stand several minutes until mold and mildew stains disappear (no elbow grease required)","bullets":"[\"32-ounce container (12-pack) of ready-to-use solution for removing tough mold and mildew stains\", \"Quickly cleans and whitens even the most difficult stains; formulated with an odor counteractant and a chlorine stabilizer to help remove bad odors\", \"Works on multiple surfaces, including tile, grout, Fiberglass, shower doors, and vinyl\", \"Ideal for shower rooms, locker rooms, and other restroom areas; note: use only in well ventilated areas\", \"Includes one trigger spray head\", \"Simply spray effected area until thoroughly wet, then let it stand several minutes until mold and mildew stains disappear (no elbow grease required)\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"Categories","created_at":"2023-09-19T06:24:00Z"}
