{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abb2b"},"product_id":2176,"item_id":"B07CWZ53SW","category_id":128,"name":"365 Everyday Value, Organic Italian Dressing, 16 fl oz","brand":"365 Everyday Value","color":"","weight_lb":1.14,"price_cents":699,"stock":7,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\nOur 365 Everyday Value Organic Italian Dressing can bring fabulous flavor to countless dishes. Of course, it's perfect for drizzling over a fresh green salad, but that's only the beginning.\nUse it to make a pasta salad. Toss it with roasted potatoes, steamed vegetables or cooked beans. Use it to marinate steak, chicken or vegetable kabobs before grilling. The possibilities are endless-and delicious!\nNo sugar added.\nCertified Organic, Vegan.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\", \"Our 365 Everyday Value Organic Italian Dressing can bring fabulous flavor to countless dishes. Of course, it's perfect for drizzling over a fresh green salad, but that's only the beginning.\", \"Use it to make a pasta salad. Toss it with roasted potatoes, steamed vegetables or cooked beans. Use it to marinate steak, chicken or vegetable kabobs before grilling. The possibilities are endless-and delicious!\", \"No sugar added.\", \"Certified Organic, Vegan.\"]","keywords":"[\"condiments salad dressings grocery & gourmet food condiments & salad dressings salad dressings italian\"]","node_path":"Categories/Pantry Staples/Condiments & Salad Dressings/Salad Dressings/Italian","created_at":"2023-06-24T16:18:42Z"}
