your hair and ear from bacteria, chloride and other substances in the water.\", \"Our swim cap for long hair covers the head snugly, and doesn't move or slide. Your hair will be fully protected by a cool swim caps and will always stay dry. You won't even remember that you have the swim cap on while swimming ¨C no discomfort.\", \"Silicone swim caps can be stretched to more than 2 times their original size with featuring great elasticity. This swim caps can be stretched easily for optimum fit for men, women and youth. Since it is lightweight, you barely feel.\", \"Lifetime friendly customer service. If you have any issues, you are welcome to contact us for quick and easy support.\"]","keywords":"[\"swim cap^silicone swim cap^swim cap for adults^breathable swim cap^waterproof swim cap^swimming accessory\"]","node_path":"Categories/Sports/Water Sports/Swimming/Caps","created_at":"2023-05-20T01:56:22Z"}
