nd for any reason, just let us know and we'll refund you in full.\"]","keywords":"[\"long resistance bands pull up resistance band set rubber bands crossfit assist pullups stretch resistance weightlifting fitness gym weight training bands elastic exercise undersun men women\"]","node_path":"Categories/Fitness/Accessories/Exercise Bands & Tubes","created_at":"2023-08-11T03:48:40Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abb42"},"product_id":2199,"item_id":"B07D574SSQ","category_id":305,"name":"UMI. by Amazon - Resistance Loop Bands [Set of 5] with Instruction Guide and Carry Bag Exercise Bands for Home Gym Yoga Latex Fitness Bands for Women and Men","brand":"UMI","color":"","weight_lb":0.35,"price_cents":5299,"stock":8,"description":"Resistance loop bands are suitable for women and men at all fitness levels,it is ideal to work muscles throughout the whole body progressively and safely. Use any one band individually or multiple bands together to provide the right level of resistance for you.\nExercise bands set of 5 pieces, different colors representive different stretching weights,Yellow-10 pounds;Green-20 pounds;Blue-30 pounds; red-40 pounds Black-50 pounds.\nOur Exercise bands is versatile for Yoga, Pilates, CrossFit, Fitness and ideal for increasing strength and mobility. Use of resistance bands can help to strengthen stabilising muscles which may help to prevent injury or assist greatly in injury rehabilitation.\nOur resistance loop bands can be stretched repeatedly year after year and are made from natural latex material which is friendly to the environment.\nIt is easy to carry to any place and any time you want. The exercise bands fit easily into the carry bag provided. Use them at home, in the gym, fitness course,or at travel time.","bullets":"[\"Resistance loop bands are suitable for women and men at all fitness levels,it is ideal to work muscles throughout the whole body progressively and safely. Use any one band individually or multiple bands together to provide the right level of resistance for you.\", \"Exercise bands set of 5 pieces, different colors representive different stretching weights,Yellow-10 pounds;Green-20 pounds;Blue-30 pounds; red-40 pounds Black-50 pounds.\", \"Our Exercise bands is versatile for Yoga, Pilates, CrossFit, Fitness and ideal for increasing strength and mobility. Use of resistance bands can help to strengthen stabilising muscles which may help to prevent injury or assist greatly in injury rehabilitation.\", \"Our resistance loop bands can be stretched repeatedly year after year and are made from natural latex material which is friendly to the environment.\", \"It is easy to carry to any place and any time you want. The exercise bands fit easily into the carry bag provided. Use them at home, in the gym, fitness course,or at travel time.\"]","keywords":"[\"mini band set of 5 loop fitness bands exercise resistance loop bands exercise bands for legs and arms physical therapy bands stretching bands home fitness strength band resistance bands resistant resistance loop bands resistant loop bands resistance bands therapist elastic rubber latex\"]","node_path":"Categories/Fitness/Accessories/Exercise Bands & Tubes","created_at":"2024-05-13T09:10:59Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abb43"},"product_id":2200,"item_id":"B07D57C21X","category_id":306,"name":"UMI. by Amazon - Eco Yoga Mat Extra Large Non-Slip Pilates Mat Thick TPE Workout Exercise Mat with Free Carry Strap for Home Gym Use (Purple+Pink) 1830×660×6mm","brand":"UMI","color":"Purple+Pink","weight_lb":2.87,"price_cents":6199,"stock":8,"description":"BEST PRODUCT ACCORDING TO QUALITY TEST - Made of modern TPE (thermoplastic elastomer), it is absolutely non-toxic, ecological and free of dangerous substances. Unlike PVC , it is phthalate-free and you don't need to worry about any skin allergies\nDUAL ANTI SLIP LAYERS - The double-sided texture provides premium skid resistance. The bottom layer guarantees optimal grip and absolutely non-slip on any floor surface. While the top layer with flower pattern is super comfortable and anti-slip even when sweaty\nPERFECT FOR BEGINNER AND PROFESSIONAL - 6mm in thickness, our yoga mats give ultra comfort and great rebounding. It prevents damage to your knees and palms. Adaptable to any discipline of yoga and sport\nTEAR RESISTANT NET - Our unique anti-tear mesh is placed between the ground layer and top layer, offering the best durability. This long-lasting technology avoids chafing or rips, so it does not wear out with use. The surface is created by closed cells that block the passage of germs, dirt and moisture\nEXTRA WIDE PRO MAT - Dimensions: 1830×660×6mm / 1830×800×6mm. Our yoga mat is larger and wider than normal mats while stays portable and optimal quality.","bullets":"[\"BEST PRODUCT ACCORDING TO QUALITY TEST - Made of modern TPE (thermoplastic elastomer), it is absolutely non-toxic, ecological and free of dangerous substances. Unlike PVC , it is phthalate-free and you don't need to worry about any skin allergies\", \"DUAL ANTI SLIP LAYERS - The double-sided texture provides premium skid resistance. The bottom layer guarantees optimal grip and absolutely non-slip on any floor surface. While the top layer with flower pattern is super comfortable and anti-slip even when sweaty\", \"PERFECT FOR BEGINNER AND PROFESSIONAL - 6mm in thickness, our yoga mats give ultra comfort and great rebounding. It prevents damage to your knees and palms. Adaptable to any discipline of yoga and sport\", \"TEAR RESISTANT NET - Our unique anti-tear mesh is placed between the ground layer and top layer, offering the best durability. This long-lasting technology avoids chafing or rips, so it does not wear out with use. The surface is created by closed cells that block the passage of germs, dirt and moisture\", \"EXTRA WIDE PRO MAT - Dimensions: 1830×660×6mm / 1830×800×6mm. Our yoga mat is larger and wider than normal mats while stays portable and optimal quality.\"]","keywords":"[\"yoga mat non slip pilates mat for home long workout mat fitness exercise mat for women yoga mat for men long thick extra large yoga mat\"]","node_path":"Categories/Fitness/Yoga/Mats","created_at":"2023-07-01T09:40:41Z"}
