{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abb55"},"product_id":2218,"item_id":"B07D7XH2Q9","category_id":75,"name":"Eono Canvas Large Shopping Bag Reusable Shopping Bag Environmentally Friendly Grocery Shoulder Jute Tote Bags for Women, Men, Girls Handbags - Plain Off White | 0504","brand":"Eono","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":4999,"stock":0,"description":"Shopping bag: measuring 20 inches x 15 inches + 6 inches (gusset). This beautiful women's bag comes in a simple whitish colour. This reusable shoulder bag is super robust and can hold up to 20 kg in weight.\nEco-friendly fabric shopping bag: this 12 ounce shopping bag is a special blend of jute and cotton. This fabric is a very high quality fabric that is specially designed to combine the strength of jute with the softness of canvas. Best of both worlds!\nZipper area for bags: Our large carry bags are with a simple zip that keeps your belongings safe and it also has shoulder strap attached with reinforced for strength sewing. The fabric is extremely durable, which makes the bag ideal for daily work and travel. 100% reusable and biodegradable.\nShopper bag: this shoulder bag for women has an extra pocket inside, which can be used very practical things such as keys, jewellery, earphones, phone etc. you can use it for daily needs such as shopping, travel and day trips. This bag is also perfect as an airline hand luggage.\nEasy to wash: all handbags are pre-washed to reduce shrinkage as far as possible | Machine wash | Open dry, do not machine dry | The measurements may vary from 0.5 to 1 inch as these bags are hand sewn Minor colour variations may exist due to the differences in lighting and screen settings.","bullets":"[\"Shopping bag: measuring 20 inches x 15 inches + 6 inches (gusset). This beautiful women's bag comes in a simple whitish colour. This reusable shoulder bag is super robust and can hold up to 20 kg in weight.\", \"Eco-friendly fabric shopping bag: this 12 ounce shopping bag is a special blend of jute and cotton. This fabric is a very high quality fabric that is specially designed to combine the strength of jute with the softness of canvas. Best of both worlds!\", \"Zipper area for bags: Our large carry bags are with a simple zip that keeps your belongings safe and it also has shoulder strap attached with reinforced for strength sewing. The fabric is extremely durable, which makes the bag ideal for daily work and travel. 100% reusable and biodegradable.\", \"Shopper bag: this shoulder bag for women has an extra pocket inside, which can be used very practical things such as keys, jewellery, earphones, phone etc. you can use it for daily needs such as shopping, travel and day trips. This bag is also perfect as an airline hand luggage.\", \"Easy to wash: all handbags are pre-washed to reduce shrinkage as far as possible | Machine wash | Open dry, do not machine dry | The measurements may vary from 0.5 to 1 inch as these bags are hand sewn Minor colour variations may exist due to the differences in lighting and screen settings.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-05-25T15:08:23Z"}
