{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abb88"},"product_id":2269,"item_id":"B07DF3XKFK","category_id":109,"name":"365 Everyday Value, Wild Skipjack Tuna in Water, Salt Added, 5 oz","brand":"365 Everyday Value","color":"","weight_lb":0.39,"price_cents":1699,"stock":86,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\nTuna is a classic staple. A good tuna salad makes a dependably tasty sandwich or salad-topper with protein. And our 365 Everyday Value Skipjack Wild Tuna goes one better.\nIn addition to its excellent flavor, it offers you the assurance that it's been responsibly sourced. So whether you're making a tuna melt or a tuna casserole, you can feel good about what you're eating.\nTraceable from fishing vessel to retail shelf.\nCertified Kosher, Certified GMO-Free, Certified Sustainable Seafood by Marine Stewardship Council (MSC).","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\", \"Tuna is a classic staple. A good tuna salad makes a dependably tasty sandwich or salad-topper with protein. And our 365 Everyday Value Skipjack Wild Tuna goes one better.\", \"In addition to its excellent flavor, it offers you the assurance that it's been responsibly sourced. So whether you're making a tuna melt or a tuna casserole, you can feel good about what you're eating.\", \"Traceable from fishing vessel to retail shelf.\", \"Certified Kosher, Certified GMO-Free, Certified Sustainable Seafood by Marine Stewardship Council (MSC).\"]","keywords":"[\"grocery & gourmet food canned, jarred & packaged foods meat, poultry & seafood seafood tuna fish canned meat and seafood tuna\"]","node_path":"Categories/Pantry Staples/Canned, Jarred & Packaged Foods/Meat, Poultry & Seafood/Seafood/Tuna Fish","created_at":"2023-05-31T11:47:55Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abb89"},"product_id":2270,"item_id":"B07DFKXDZP","category_id":193,"name":"UMI by Amazon Woven Textured Blackout Curtains Thermal Insulated Decorative Eyelet Window Treatment for Livingroom with Coating Back Layer 55 x 70 Inch Light Grey Set of 2","brand":"UMI","color":"Light Grey/Woven Textured","weight_lb":"","price_cents":9999,"stock":24,"description":"Ready Made and High End Curtains: Crafted from imported 100 percent premium quality fabric (Polyester composition). Each panel measures 140 cm wide x 180 cm drop. 2 panels per package.\nBlackout Curtains: These curtains block 100% of external light and sun rays thanks to the foam back layer coating. Perfect curtains for bedrooms and living rooms.\nThermal Insulated and Energy Saving Curtains: Our curtains are coated with a layer of thermal insulation foam which helps on reducing energy bills by preventing heat from getting out during winter and in during summer.\nDecorative and Beautifying Curtain: Beautifully designed with solid color and unique subtle texture, Umi. curtains will blend well with your home decor and provide comfort in style.\nCare Instruction: Hand wash. Wash below 30 degrees. Machine wash and tumble drying here are not recommended. No bleaching.","bullets":"[\"Ready Made and High End Curtains: Crafted from imported 100 percent premium quality fabric (Polyester composition). Each panel measures 140 cm wide x 180 cm drop. 2 panels per package.\", \"Blackout Curtains: These curtains block 100% of external light and sun rays thanks to the foam back layer coating. Perfect curtains for bedrooms and living rooms.\", \"Thermal Insulated and Energy Saving Curtains: Our curtains are coated with a layer of thermal insulation foam which helps on reducing energy bills by preventing heat from getting out during winter and in during summer.\", \"Decorative and Beautifying Curtain: Beautifully designed with solid color and unique subtle texture, Umi. curtains will blend well with your home decor and provide comfort in style.\", \"Care Instruction: Hand wash. Wash below 30 degrees. Machine wash and tumble drying here are not recommended. No bleaching.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"Home & Garden/Home & Kitchen/Categories/Home Accessories/Window Treatments/Curtains","created_at":"2024-04-26T07:06:25Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abb8a"},"product_id":2271,"item_id":"B07DFMP341","category_id":101,"name":"365 Everyday Value, Organic Mini Peanut Butter Sandwich Crackers, 7.5 oz","brand":"365 Everyday Value","color":"","weight_lb":0.47,"price_cents":399,"stock":9,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.\nThese little sandwich crackers are among the world's best snacks. Here's why: they're easy to pack and portable. They're truly tasty. And they do a great job of satisfying your hunger. Kids love them, too. So we recommend stocking up.\nDoes not contain artificial flavors or hydrogenated oils.\nNo high fructose corn syrup.\nCertified Organic, Certified Vegetarian.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.\", \"These little sandwich crackers are among the world's best snacks. Here's why: they're easy to pack and portable. They're truly tasty. And they do a great job of satisfying your hunger. Kids love them, too. So we recommend stocking up.\", \"Does not contain artificial flavors or hydrogenated oils.\", \"No high fructose corn syrup.\", \"Certified Organic, Certified Vegetarian.\"]","keywords":"[\"crackers and crispbreads shelf stable crackers grocery & gourmet food snack foods crackers sandwich\"]","node_path":"Categories/Snack Foods/Crackers/Sandwich","created_at":"2024-04-19T09:17:22Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abb8b"},"product_id":2272,"item_id":"B07DFNSFSF","category_id":122,"name":"Engine 2, Organic Firehouse Chili, 17 oz","brand":"Engine 2","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":599,"stock":16,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market.\nOrganic navy beans, red kidney beans, and black beans join organic tomatoes, red peppers, corn, and spices to create a chili so hearty, satisfying, and delicious that meat won't be missed!\nEnjoy this flavorful chili with a slice of whole grain bread - or on its own!\nLow Fat, no sugar added.\nCertified Organic, Certified Vegan.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market.\", \"Organic navy beans, red kidney beans, and black beans join organic tomatoes, red peppers, corn, and spices to create a chili so hearty, satisfying, and delicious that meat won't be missed!\", \"Enjoy this flavorful chili with a slice of whole grain bread - or on its own!\", \"Low Fat, no sugar added.\", \"Certified Organic, Certified Vegan.\"]","keywords":"[\"meals soups chili grocery & gourmet food pantry staples soups, stocks & broths\"]","node_path":"Categories/Pantry Staples/Soups, Stocks & Broths/Chili","created_at":"2024-05-18T21:06:53Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abb8c"},"product_id":2273,"item_id":"B07DFRWQCR","category_id":113,"name":"365 Everyday Value, Almondmilk Mocha Java Fudge Non-Dairy Dessert, 1 pint, (Frozen)","brand":"365 Everyday Value","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":599,"stock":28,"description":"The cold, creamy taste of coffee and fudge hits your taste buds, but you feel good knowing there's something different about this indulgence - almond milk!\nDairy-free, gluten-free and vegan, our Almond Milk Frozen Desserts give your sweet tooth what it craves without the things your body doesn't.\nProduct of USA.\nCertified GMO-Free, Certified Gluten Free, Certified Kosher, Certified Vegan.\nBrought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.","bullets":"[\"The cold, creamy taste of coffee and fudge hits your taste buds, but you feel good knowing there's something different about this indulgence - almond milk!\", \"Dairy-free, gluten-free and vegan, our Almond Milk Frozen Desserts give your sweet tooth what it craves without the things your body doesn't.\", \"Product of USA.\", \"Certified GMO-Free, Certified Gluten Free, Certified Kosher, Certified Vegan.\", \"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.\"]","keywords":"[\"ice cream\", \"non-dairy ice cream\", \"non dairy ice cream\", \"almond milk\", \"almondmilk\", \"non-gmo\", \"vegan\", \"dessert\", \"gluten free\", \"dairy free\", \"mocha java fudge\", \"mocha java\", \"mocha\", \"java\", \"fudge\", \"chocolate fudge\", \"coffee\", \"frozen dessert\", \"whole foods market\", \"whole foods\"]","node_path":"Categories/Frozen/Desserts & Toppings","created_at":"2023-04-14T21:01:47Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abb8d"},"product_id":2274,"item_id":"B07DFT5S5X","category_id":169,"name":"Whole Foods Market, Triple Milled Soap, Vetiver, 6 oz","brand":"Whole Foods Market","color":"","weight_lb":0.38,"price_cents":1399,"stock":47,"description":"The vetiver root extract in this triple-milled soap lends it a fresh and uniquely delightful fragrance that some describe as a \"green earthiness.\" We think you'll love it. Lather up, and let your senses rejoice.\nMade with shea butter & coconut oil.\nNo added Phthalates, Parabens, Sodium Lauryl or Laureth Sulfate.\nCertified Sustainable Palm Oil.\nBrought to you by Whole Foods Market. When it comes to innovative flavors and products sourced from artisans and producers around the world, the Whole Foods Market brand has you covered. Amazing products, exceptional ingredients, no compromises.","bullets":"[\"The vetiver root extract in this triple-milled soap lends it a fresh and uniquely delightful fragrance that some describe as a \\\"green earthiness.\\\" We think you'll love it. Lather up, and let your senses rejoice.\", \"Made with shea butter & coconut oil.\", \"No added Phthalates, Parabens, Sodium Lauryl or Laureth Sulfate.\", \"Certified Sustainable Palm Oil.\", \"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. When it comes to innovative flavors and products sourced from artisans and producers around the world, the Whole Foods Market brand has you covered. Amazing products, exceptional ingredients, no compromises.\"]","keywords":"[\"soap\", \"clean\", \"fresh\", \"bath\", \"bathtime\", \"bath time\", \"whole foods\", \"no parabens\", \"vetiver\", \"triple milled\", \"shea butter\", \"coconut oil\"]","node_path":"Products/Skin Care/Body/Cleansers/Soaps","created_at":"2023-10-11T13:51:15Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abb8e"},"product_id":2275,"item_id":"B07DFVTFS8","category_id":333,"name":"AmazonBasics Expandable Flexible Garden Hose, 15 m, with 9-Function Spray Gun","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"","weight_lb":1.76,"price_cents":2199,"stock":60,"description":"15-meter green garden hose for watering the garden, washing the car, cleaning patio furniture, and other outdoor chores\nExpandable and flexible design includes a double latex inner tube and an exterior fabric made of high-tenacity stretchable yarn\nSmall easy-to-carry size; kink- and tangle-resistant for reliable water flow; resists UV rays and low temperatures\nSpray gun attachment included with 9 spray modes: Cone, Rinse, Shower, Vertical, Angle, Center, Mist, Flat, and Soaker\nQuick, easy connection to most 1/2-inch and 3/4-inch male-thread taps; +1/2-inch - 3/4-inch tap adapter included","bullets":"[\"15-meter green garden hose for watering the garden, washing the car, cleaning patio furniture, and other outdoor chores\", \"Expandable and flexible design includes a double latex inner tube and an exterior fabric made of high-tenacity stretchable yarn\", \"Small easy-to-carry size; kink- and tangle-resistant for reliable water flow; resists UV rays and low temperatures\", \"Spray gun attachment included with 9 spray modes: Cone, Rinse, Shower, Vertical, Angle, Center, Mist, Flat, and Soaker\", \"Quick, easy connection to most 1/2-inch and 3/4-inch male-thread taps; +1/2-inch - 3/4-inch tap adapter included\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"Categories/Gardening/Watering Equipment/Watering Hoses & Accessories/Garden Hoses","created_at":"2023-11-06T04:37:21Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abb8f"},"product_id":2276,"item_id":"B07DFVYZTM","category_id":113,"name":"365 EVERYDAY VALUE Organic Caribbean Black Bean Soup, 17 OZ","brand":"365 Everyday Value","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":999,"stock":7,"description":"Flavorful and fulfilling, this hearty organic soup is a delicious departure from the ordinary. Flavors of garlic, ginger, jalapeno, and cayenne and hints of pineapple, lime, and allspice give this recipe an authentic Caribbean vibe.\nIt takes just minutes to prepare, but has a flavor you wont want to end.\nFat Free, high Fiber.\nCertified Organic, Certified Vegan.\nBrought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.","bullets":"[\"Flavorful and fulfilling, this hearty organic soup is a delicious departure from the ordinary. Flavors of garlic, ginger, jalapeno, and cayenne and hints of pineapple, lime, and allspice give this recipe an authentic Caribbean vibe.\", \"It takes just minutes to prepare, but has a flavor you wont want to end.\", \"Fat Free, high Fiber.\", \"Certified Organic, Certified Vegan.\", \"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.\"]","keywords":"[\"meals soups soup grocery & gourmet food pantry staples soups, stocks & broths\"]","node_path":"Categories/Pantry Staples/Soups, Stocks & Broths/Vegetable Soups","created_at":"2023-08-02T07:00:45Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abb90"},"product_id":2277,"item_id":"B07DFWQV5V","category_id":188,"name":"Amazon Brand - Solimo Tandoor Grill (1500W, Black)","brand":"Amazon Brand - Solimo","color":"Black","weight_lb":"","price_cents":3599,"stock":66,"description":"Non-stick heating plates are double Teflon coated providing ease and convenience to clean\nFloating hinge design for evenly grilling patty or fully loaded sandwiches of variable thickness making it easy to close and open wide\nIntegrated drip tray holds excess oil, butter or gravy avoiding spillage\nVariable heat control helps grill sandwiches, patty, meat, vegetables and also toast breads\nStainless steel housing and over-sized handle to protect your hands from heat\nRed light on the Tandoor grill indicates it is ON, Green indicates the Tandoor Grill has reached the desired temperature as set through the knob\n1m long power cord for better mobility and access; Fixed grill plates with hinged lock helps seal and grill the food easily\nWarranty: 1 year limited warranty. To claim it, please contact_us on: [1800-419-0416]\nPower Rating: 1500W provides efficient toasting and grilling; Dimension: 36cm x 33cm x 11.5cm; Weight: 3.2kg","bullets":"[\"Non-stick heating plates are double Teflon coated providing ease and convenience to clean\", \"Floating hinge design for evenly grilling patty or fully loaded sandwiches of variable thickness making it easy to close and open wide\", \"Integrated drip tray holds excess oil, butter or gravy avoiding spillage\", \"Variable heat control helps grill sandwiches, patty, meat, vegetables and also toast breads\", \"Stainless steel housing and over-sized handle to protect your hands from heat\", \"Red light on the Tandoor grill indicates it is ON, Green indicates the Tandoor Grill has reached the desired temperature as set through the knob\", \"1m long power cord for better mobility and access; Fixed grill plates with hinged lock helps seal and grill the food easily\", \"Warranty: 1 year limited warranty. To claim it, please contact_us on: [1800-419-0416]\", \"Power Rating: 1500W provides efficient toasting and grilling; Dimension: 36cm x 33cm x 11.5cm; Weight: 3.2kg\"]","keywords":"[\"grill\", \"grill sandwich maker\", \"home appliances kitchen\", \"grilled sandwich makers\", \"toaster griller sandwich\", \"maker\", \"sandwich griller\", \"griller\", \"electric griller\", \"sandwich maker\", \"sandwich makers\", \"sandwich maker grill\", \"sandwich toaster and grill\", \"tandoor grill\", \"electric tandoor grill\", \"electric tandoor\", \"grill sandwich\", \"grill toaster\", \"electric grill\", \"home appliance\"]","node_path":"Categories/Kitchen & Home Appliances/Small Kitchen Appliances/Tandoors & Grills","created_at":"2023-02-28T08:29:51Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abb91"},"product_id":2278,"item_id":"B07DHL2ZM2","category_id":327,"name":"Amazon Brand - Presto! Glass and Household Cleaner Refill - 500 ml (Pack of 2)","brand":"Presto!","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":2199,"stock":71,"description":"Multi-purpose glass and household cleaner which can be used on glass, mirrors, appliances like TVs microwaves, ceramic tiles, glazed tiles, granite, etc.\nConvenient refill pack that can be used with Presto! Glass Cleaner Spray Bottle\nGets rid of tough stains including grease and other cooking stains in your kitchen\nEnsures 100% streak-free shine, making it apt for usage on glass surfaces, mirror and appliances\nUser-friendly formulation designed to be safe on hands\nEffective formula for convenient everyday cleaning\nPackage Contents: 2 Glass Cleaner Refills (500 ml)","bullets":"[\"Multi-purpose glass and household cleaner which can be used on glass, mirrors, appliances like TVs microwaves, ceramic tiles, glazed tiles, granite, etc.\", \"Convenient refill pack that can be used with Presto! Glass Cleaner Spray Bottle\", \"Gets rid of tough stains including grease and other cooking stains in your kitchen\", \"Ensures 100% streak-free shine, making it apt for usage on glass surfaces, mirror and appliances\", \"User-friendly formulation designed to be safe on hands\", \"Effective formula for convenient everyday cleaning\", \"Package Contents: 2 Glass Cleaner Refills (500 ml)\"]","keywords":"[\"glass cleaner refill\", \"glass cleaner\", \"glass cleaners\", \"kitchen cleaner refill\", \"mirror cleaner spray\", \"window cleaner\", \"surface cleaner\", \"kitchen cleaner\", \"spray cleaner\", \"table cleaner\", \"multipurpose cleaner\", \"car glass cleaner\"]","node_path":"Categories/Household Supplies/Household Cleaners/Glass Cleaners","created_at":"2023-11-13T03:36:34Z"}
