{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abbad"},"product_id":2306,"item_id":"B07DSSBGFV","category_id":203,"name":"AmazonBasics Commercial Grade LED Tube Light - 5000K, 30W T8/T10/T12 Compatible, Ballast Bypass, Daylight, 8-Foot, 12-Pack","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Daylight","weight_lb":0.9,"price_cents":1399,"stock":44,"description":"LONG LASTING: With an extended lifetime of 36,000 hours, the bulb will last over 32 years (based on 3 hours of use each day)\nBRIGHT: Provides 3500 lumens of light immediately, with no waiting time to warm up to full brightness\nDAYLIGHT COLOR: With a correlated color temperature of 5000 Kelvin, this bulb provides a cool daylight, creating an energizing atmosphere for any room\nThis bulb costs only $3.61 per year to operate (based on 3 hours/day, 11 cents/kWh) making it an economical alternative to fluorescent bulbs\nEasy Ballast Bypass Installation - This lamp is dual end powered and requires a simple, energy saving removal of the ballast (direct wire) installation. Refer to instruction manual and images.\nENERGY EFFICIENT: This LED light bulb uses only 30 watts of energy, saving up to $114 over the life of the bulb vs. its fluorescent equivalent (based on 3 hours/day, 11 cents/kWh, may vary depending on rates and use)","bullets":"[\"LONG LASTING: With an extended lifetime of 36,000 hours, the bulb will last over 32 years (based on 3 hours of use each day)\", \"BRIGHT: Provides 3500 lumens of light immediately, with no waiting time to warm up to full brightness\", \"DAYLIGHT COLOR: With a correlated color temperature of 5000 Kelvin, this bulb provides a cool daylight, creating an energizing atmosphere for any room\", \"This bulb costs only $3.61 per year to operate (based on 3 hours/day, 11 cents/kWh) making it an economical alternative to fluorescent bulbs\", \"Easy Ballast Bypass Installation - This lamp is dual end powered and requires a simple, energy saving removal of the ballast (direct wire) installation. Refer to instruction manual and images.\", \"ENERGY EFFICIENT: This LED light bulb uses only 30 watts of energy, saving up to $114 over the life of the bulb vs. its fluorescent equivalent (based on 3 hours/day, 11 cents/kWh, may vary depending on rates and use)\"]","keywords":"[\"ballast bypass\", \"tube\", \"light\", \"tube light\", \"philips\", \"led tube\", \"amazon basics\", \"tubelight\", \"low energy\", \"energy efficient\", \"t8\", \"t10\", \"t12\", \"commericial grade tube\"]","node_path":"Categories/Light Bulbs/LED Bulbs","created_at":"2023-08-28T04:08:46Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abbae"},"product_id":2307,"item_id":"B07DSTZFJR","category_id":23,"name":"AmazonBasics Micro USB Universal Car Charger for Android - Coiled Cable, White, 10-Pack","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"","weight_lb":0.13,"price_cents":1599,"stock":45,"description":"Product Size :4.2*1.2*0.86 in\nProduct weight: 2.16 ounces\nCharges through your car's DC adapter\nDelivers high-speed charging with 2.1 amp output\nCable extends naturally to approximately 1.5 feet (pulled tightly extends to 4.9 feet)\nBacked by an AmazonBasics Limited 1-Year Warranty","bullets":"[\"Product Size :4.2*1.2*0.86 in\", \"Product weight: 2.16 ounces\", \"Charges through your car's DC adapter\", \"Delivers high-speed charging with 2.1 amp output\", \"Cable extends naturally to approximately 1.5 feet (pulled tightly extends to 4.9 feet)\", \"Backed by an AmazonBasics Limited 1-Year Warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"car charger,usb charger,car,iphone,iphone car charger,phone charger,fast,iphone 6\", \"car charger;usb charger;car;iphone;iphone car charger;phone charger;fast;iphone 6\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-11-09T23:32:54Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abbaf"},"product_id":2308,"item_id":"B07DT4GYP3","category_id":200,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Glass Table Lamp With Light Bulb And White Shade - 15 x 15x 28 Inches, White","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Chrome","weight_lb":6.76,"price_cents":3699,"stock":37,"description":"Simple colors and mixed matched finishes join to add an elegant touch to your space. Topped by a white shade, the piece blends seamlessly with existing décor and brings ambient lighting.\n15\" W x 15\" D x 28\" H\nTwo-tone clear glass with a white finish topped by a white shade\nOn/off rotary switch on socket perfect for an office, living room, or bedroom\n1 LED bulb included","bullets":"[\"Simple colors and mixed matched finishes join to add an elegant touch to your space. Topped by a white shade, the piece blends seamlessly with existing décor and brings ambient lighting.\", \"15\\\" W x 15\\\" D x 28\\\" H\", \"Two-tone clear glass with a white finish topped by a white shade\", \"On/off rotary switch on socket perfect for an office, living room, or bedroom\", \"1 LED bulb included\"]","keywords":"[\"table-lamps\", \"floor lamp\", \"lamp\", \"table lamp\", \"desk lamp\", \"lamps\", \"floor lamps for living room\", \"lamps for bedrooms\", \"lamps for living room\", \"salt lamp\", \"table lamps\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"chrome\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Lamps & Shades/Table Lamps","created_at":"2023-01-08T02:32:22Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abbb0"},"product_id":2309,"item_id":"B07DTFBCZ7","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Farmhouse Wood Bead Chandelier Ceiling Fixture With 4 LED Light Bulbs - 24 x 24 x 45.5 Inches, Grey","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Grey","weight_lb":12.1,"price_cents":6799,"stock":21,"description":"Dazzling and elegant. A sea of cascading delicate wood beads descend against a metal silhouette backdrop, radiating sophistication and warmth. Make a striking statement by hanging the chandelier in an entryway, dinning space, bedroom or family room.\n24\" W x 24\" D x 45.5\" H, adjustable hanging height to 72\" long, mountable on both level and sloped ceilings\nMetal in a dark bronze finish with real wood beads in a light grey stain\nFeatures 28 strands of real wood beads on the bottom and 8 strands on top\n4 LED 40-Watt equivalent size E12 Candelabra Bulbs included","bullets":"[\"Dazzling and elegant. A sea of cascading delicate wood beads descend against a metal silhouette backdrop, radiating sophistication and warmth. Make a striking statement by hanging the chandelier in an entryway, dinning space, bedroom or family room.\", \"24\\\" W x 24\\\" D x 45.5\\\" H, adjustable hanging height to 72\\\" long, mountable on both level and sloped ceilings\", \"Metal in a dark bronze finish with real wood beads in a light grey stain\", \"Features 28 strands of real wood beads on the bottom and 8 strands on top\", \"4 LED 40-Watt equivalent size E12 Candelabra Bulbs included\"]","keywords":"[\"chandeliers\", \"chandelier\", \"crystal chandelier\", \"ceiling light\", \"dining room lighting fixtures hanging\", \"pendant lighting\", \"chandeliers for dining rooms\", \"light fixtures ceiling\", \"lighting\", \"modern chandelier\", \"stone & beam\", \"stone and beam\", \"farmhouse\", \"grey\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Ceiling Lights/Chandeliers","created_at":"2024-05-12T20:35:44Z"}
