{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abbb4"},"product_id":2313,"item_id":"B07DW8LG9B","category_id":193,"name":"UMI. Essentials Artificial Silk Hanging Wisteria (Pack of 6)","brand":"UMI","color":"White","weight_lb":0.42,"price_cents":2699,"stock":41,"description":"✿ SUMMER STUNNER: Wow ,Wow ,Wow ,your guests with up to 19.1ft of beautiful hanging wisteria. Our silk hanging wisteria comes in six individual 38.18in pieces.\n✿ NO SMELL: Made with high-quality plastic so there's no smell or unpleasant chemicals.Our silk hanging wisteria featuring wonderful, shapely leaves and green hues, looks lifelike and will add elegance to your landscape.\n✿ THICK AND DURABLE: .Our silk hanging wisteria comes in six individual 38.18in pieces so it's quick and easy to hang and untangle. Each leaf is up two times thicker than other brands of products and won't fade in the hot summer sun.\n✿ PERFECT FOR ALL OCCASIONS: Perfect for decoration around the home and office or for special occasions like weddings and parties.Our hanging ivy makes the perfect addition to parties, weddings, receptions and other events. Hang it on arbors and arches, walls, doors, swings and mirrors.\n✿ Easy to Maintain: Unlike fresh plants, artificial plants are maintenance free and durable to last for a long time, never wither or fall. Vivid realistic decor for your home all year round, bring the atmosphere of nature. If you love plants, but you don't have time to take care of them, This emulation Ivy will be a good choice.","bullets":"[\"✿ SUMMER STUNNER: Wow ,Wow ,Wow ,your guests with up to 19.1ft of beautiful hanging wisteria. Our silk hanging wisteria comes in six individual 38.18in pieces.\", \"✿ NO SMELL: Made with high-quality plastic so there's no smell or unpleasant chemicals.Our silk hanging wisteria featuring wonderful, shapely leaves and green hues, looks lifelike and will add elegance to your landscape.\", \"✿ THICK AND DURABLE: .Our silk hanging wisteria comes in six individual 38.18in pieces so it's quick and easy to hang and untangle. Each leaf is up two times thicker than other brands of products and won't fade in the hot summer sun.\", \"✿ PERFECT FOR ALL OCCASIONS: Perfect for decoration around the home and office or for special occasions like weddings and parties.Our hanging ivy makes the perfect addition to parties, weddings, receptions and other events. Hang it on arbors and arches, walls, doors, swings and mirrors.\", \"✿ Easy to Maintain: Unlike fresh plants, artificial plants are maintenance free and durable to last for a long time, never wither or fall. Vivid realistic decor for your home all year round, bring the atmosphere of nature. If you love plants, but you don't have time to take care of them, This emulation Ivy will be a good choice.\"]","keywords":"[\"artificial bouquet\", \"artificial flowers\", \"wedding decoration\"]","node_path":"Home & Garden/Home & Kitchen/Categories/Home Accessories/Artificial Flora/Artificial Flowers","created_at":"2023-03-14T22:26:07Z"}
