{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abbbc"},"product_id":2321,"item_id":"B07DZVW1YW","category_id":357,"name":"Eono Essentials Foam Brush Set of 6 Stamp Painter,Sponges Brush Set for Kids Wood Handle","brand":"Umi.","color":"Multi-coloured","weight_lb":"","price_cents":2399,"stock":14,"description":"VERSATILE AND FUN: Includes foam brushes in six different sizes and shapes, perfect for use with water colours, gouache and acrylic paints.\nEASY TO USE: These light and easy-to-handle brushes are perfect for little hands. The sponge end is perfect for shapes, while the handle can be used to paint lines and fill in gaps. The foam ends reusable and washable\nPERFECT PAINT TOOL: These brushes make painting fun and easy for children as young as 2-4 years old. They're perfect for creating all sorts of shapes: stars, flowers, hearts, trees and whatever else their imagination allows\nCLEVER CRAFTING: These brushes have all sorts of creative uses. Paint multicoloured designs on paper then cut them out for perfectly-shaped decorations\nA GREAT GIFT: These brushes make an amazing gift for all sorts of occasions or even just because!","bullets":"[\"VERSATILE AND FUN: Includes foam brushes in six different sizes and shapes, perfect for use with water colours, gouache and acrylic paints.\", \"EASY TO USE: These light and easy-to-handle brushes are perfect for little hands. The sponge end is perfect for shapes, while the handle can be used to paint lines and fill in gaps. The foam ends reusable and washable\", \"PERFECT PAINT TOOL: These brushes make painting fun and easy for children as young as 2-4 years old. They're perfect for creating all sorts of shapes: stars, flowers, hearts, trees and whatever else their imagination allows\", \"CLEVER CRAFTING: These brushes have all sorts of creative uses. Paint multicoloured designs on paper then cut them out for perfectly-shaped decorations\", \"A GREAT GIFT: These brushes make an amazing gift for all sorts of occasions or even just because!\"]","keywords":"[\"craft stamps\", \"foam stamps for painting\", \"handle stamps for children\", \"kids stamps\", \"paint sponges\", \"paint stamp\", \"paint stamps for kids\", \"stamps for children\", \"foam for stamps\", \"kids heart stamp set\", \"kids paint stamps\", \"paint sample\"]","node_path":"Home & Garden/Home & Kitchen/Categories/Arts & Crafts/Painting/Paint Sponges","created_at":"2023-05-08T03:05:30Z"}
