{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abbcb"},"product_id":2336,"item_id":"B07F8C9X89","category_id":114,"name":"Amazon Brand - Solimo Parsley, 10g","brand":"Amazon Brand - Solimo","color":"","weight_lb":0.02,"price_cents":499,"stock":1,"description":"10g of Dried Parsley\nUndergoes rigorous laboratory testing and stringent checks for quality control\nHygienic packaging that retains aroma and flavour\nAdheres to FSSAI food safety standards\nSectioned lid with two flip-open sides for ease of sprinkling\nSmart packaging doubles up as storage container\nSolimo Parsley adds a distinctive mild, grassy aroma and a robust flavour to your preparations\nEnhances European, Middle Eastern and American dishes like pasta, hummus, salads, stews, etc","bullets":"[\"10g of Dried Parsley\", \"Undergoes rigorous laboratory testing and stringent checks for quality control\", \"Hygienic packaging that retains aroma and flavour\", \"Adheres to FSSAI food safety standards\", \"Sectioned lid with two flip-open sides for ease of sprinkling\", \"Smart packaging doubles up as storage container\", \"Solimo Parsley adds a distinctive mild, grassy aroma and a robust flavour to your preparations\", \"Enhances European, Middle Eastern and American dishes like pasta, hummus, salads, stews, etc\"]","keywords":"[\"solimo\", \"parsley seasonings\", \"pizza seasoningherbs\", \"parsley\", \"driedherbs\", \"parsleyleaves\", \"parsley leaves dried\", \"spices\", \"herb\", \"seasoning\", \"herbs\", \"spice\", \"driedparsley\", \"pizza seasonings\"]","node_path":"Products/Cooking & Baking Supplies/Spices & Masalas/Whole Spices, Seeds & Herbs/Parsley","created_at":"2023-09-17T10:09:24Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abbcc"},"product_id":2337,"item_id":"B07F8GZ7QG","category_id":236,"name":"Sterling Silver Celtic Knot Drop Earrings","brand":"Amazon Collection","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":13999,"stock":27,"description":"Dangle earrings featuring Celtic knots in sterling silver\nCeltic knot jewelry inspired by the interlacing and continuous designs prevalent in Celtic artwork, illuminating the interconnectedness and continuity of life\nFrench wire backing\nHand-crafted in pure .925 Sterling Silver; Oxidized finish added to enhance detail and depth in jewelry design\nImported\nThese silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.","bullets":"[\"Dangle earrings featuring Celtic knots in sterling silver\", \"Celtic knot jewelry inspired by the interlacing and continuous designs prevalent in Celtic artwork, illuminating the interconnectedness and continuity of life\", \"French wire backing\", \"Hand-crafted in pure .925 Sterling Silver; Oxidized finish added to enhance detail and depth in jewelry design\", \"Imported\", \"These silver pieces are built for longevity. This piece features a metal plating or flashing, or an electrocoating for a more lustrous appearance, but it can wear off with long-term or heavy use. To ensure the longevity of your plated items store your jewelry in a dark, cool, dry place such as a pouch or air tight box and avoid rubbing plated items together. Also try to avoid exposure to cleaning products and perfume which can both negatively affect your items. Your local jeweler can advise you where to send your jewelry if you would ever like them replated.\"]","keywords":"[\"celtic earrings\", \"celtic knot earrings\", \"oxidized silver\", \"oxidized silver earrings\", \"prime day\", \"prime day jewelry\", \"prime week\", \"prime week jewelry\", \"jewelry with free shipping\", \"gift\", \"jewelry gift\", \"gift for woman\", \"gifts for women\", \"gifts for her\", \"romantic gift\", \"birthday\", \"birthday gift\", \"birthday present\", \"anniversary\", \"aniversary\"]","node_path":"Categories/Women/Earrings","created_at":"2023-07-06T08:27:37Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abbcd"},"product_id":2338,"item_id":"B07F8TC9LV","category_id":108,"name":"Amazon Brand - Solimo Extra Light Olive Oil, 2L","brand":"Amazon Brand - Solimo","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":699,"stock":23,"description":"Is trans-fat-free and helps maintain a healthy lifestyle\nHigh burning point makes it ideal for deep frying, roasting and baking\nSuitable for everyday Indian cooking due to its mild olive taste and aroma\nA healthier cooking alternative containing omega-3 and antioxidants\nStore carefully, away from direct heat & sunlight; It is characteristic for olive oil to get cloudy below 4℃","bullets":"[\"Is trans-fat-free and helps maintain a healthy lifestyle\", \"High burning point makes it ideal for deep frying, roasting and baking\", \"Suitable for everyday Indian cooking due to its mild olive taste and aroma\", \"A healthier cooking alternative containing omega-3 and antioxidants\", \"Store carefully, away from direct heat & sunlight; It is characteristic for olive oil to get cloudy below 4℃\"]","keywords":"[\"olive oil for frying\", \"extra light olive oil\", \"olive oil 2 l\", \"2 l olive oil\", \"light olive oil\", \"cooking olive oil\", \"extra light olive oil 2 l\"]","node_path":"Products/Cooking & Baking Supplies/Oils & Ghee/Oils/Olive","created_at":"2023-05-11T14:25:31Z"}
