{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abc6c"},"product_id":2497,"item_id":"B07GSQH5NM","category_id":90,"name":"UMI. Essentials C-shaped 12mm Thick Acrylic Sofa Side Slide End Table 58x35x31.8cm","brand":"UMI","color":"Clear","weight_lb":"","price_cents":4099,"stock":125,"description":"Blends well with any decor. It can be hold either vertically or horizontally. No Assembly Required.\nA HANDY TABLE for holding snacks and drinks while watching TV, for holding your remote, phone, tablet, magazines, etc., in the living room beside a sofa or easy chair, or beside your bed.\nCONVENIENT \"C\" SHAPED CONSTRUCTION. You can slide the feet of this table underneath a sofa or bed so the table can be right next to you, or in between two people on a couch.\nPERFECT HIGHT AND DURABLE. At 23 inches high, it's higher than a coffee table but lower than a regular table, putting everything right at arm level when you're sitting.\nPackage: 1 x End Table, 1 x Clean Cloth.","bullets":"[\"Blends well with any decor. It can be hold either vertically or horizontally. No Assembly Required.\", \"A HANDY TABLE for holding snacks and drinks while watching TV, for holding your remote, phone, tablet, magazines, etc., in the living room beside a sofa or easy chair, or beside your bed.\", \"CONVENIENT \\\"C\\\" SHAPED CONSTRUCTION. You can slide the feet of this table underneath a sofa or bed so the table can be right next to you, or in between two people on a couch.\", \"PERFECT HIGHT AND DURABLE. At 23 inches high, it's higher than a coffee table but lower than a regular table, putting everything right at arm level when you're sitting.\", \"Package: 1 x End Table, 1 x Clean Cloth.\"]","keywords":"[\"acrylic side end table end table for living room sofa end table clear acrylic end table perspex coffee table\"]","node_path":"Home & Garden/Home & Kitchen/Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Tables/End Tables","created_at":"2023-10-05T09:24:17Z"}
