nd gluten-free. For ages 2 years and over (dosing cup included).\", \"ALLERGY MEDICINE: Amazon Basic Care Children's Allergy Relief temporarily relieves symptoms due to hay fever or other upper respiratory allergies: runny nose; itchy, watery eyes; sneezing; itching of the nose or throat.\"]","keywords":"[\"basic care children's allergy relief loratadine oral solution 5 mg antihistamine non-drowsy 24 hour relief sneezing runny nose itchy watery eyes itchy throat nose grape flavor claritin dye-free 4 fl oz\", \"loratadine solution\", \"loratadine 5\", \"loratadine 4oz\", \"loratadine 5mg\", \"loratadine\"]","node_path":"Products/Health Care/OTC Medications & Treatments/Allergy, Sinus & Asthma/Allergy Medicine","created_at":"2024-06-13T02:07:09Z"}
