{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abcc1"},"product_id":2582,"item_id":"B07HD8SFNT","category_id":156,"name":"Basic Care Allergy Relief, Diphenhydramine HCl Antihistamine, 25 mg, 100 Count","brand":"Amazon Basic Care","color":"","weight_lb":0.23,"price_cents":1899,"stock":15,"description":"ACTIVE INGREDIENT: Amazon Basic Care Allergy Relief tablets contain diphenhydramine HCl 25 mg, an antihistamine, which compares to the active ingredient in Benadryl Allergy Tablets.\nMULTI-SYMPTOM RELIEF: One dose provides temporary allergy relief of runny nose, sneezing, itching of the nose or throat and itchy, watery eyes. Also temporarily relieves runny nose and sneezing due to the common cold.\nEACH TABLET contains 25 mg of diphenhydramine HCl, an antihistamine to help relieve allergy symptoms.\nALLERGY RELIEF TABLETS also provide nighttime allergy relief. Easy to swallow tablets. Gluten free.","bullets":"[\"ACTIVE INGREDIENT: Amazon Basic Care Allergy Relief tablets contain diphenhydramine HCl 25 mg, an antihistamine, which compares to the active ingredient in Benadryl Allergy Tablets.\", \"MULTI-SYMPTOM RELIEF: One dose provides temporary allergy relief of runny nose, sneezing, itching of the nose or throat and itchy, watery eyes. Also temporarily relieves runny nose and sneezing due to the common cold.\", \"EACH TABLET contains 25 mg of diphenhydramine HCl, an antihistamine to help relieve allergy symptoms.\", \"ALLERGY RELIEF TABLETS also provide nighttime allergy relief. Easy to swallow tablets. Gluten free.\"]","keywords":"[\"basic care multi-symptom allergy relief diphenhydramine hcl antihistamine 25 mg benadryl 100 tablets sneezing itchy watery eyes runny nose throat\", \"basic care allergy relief, diphenhydramine hcl 25 mg, allergy pills, runny nose, benadryl\"]","node_path":"Products/Health Care/OTC Medications & Treatments/Allergy, Sinus & Asthma/Allergy Medicine","created_at":"2023-12-27T06:25:58Z"}
