{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abce3"},"product_id":2616,"item_id":"B07HK3PNSK","category_id":200,"name":"Rivet Contemporary Palm Tree Neon Table Lamp, 11.75\"H, White AF44228","brand":"Rivet","color":"White","weight_lb":"","price_cents":12999,"stock":20,"description":"Dream of warmer climes with this fun LED neon lamp in the shape of a pineapple. This lamp can make a wonderfully quirky addition to your living space. You can place it on a table or desk or hang it from the wall.\n3.5\"W x 3.5\"D x 11.75\"H\nPineapple LED neon\nHas wall hooks to hang on the wall; takes 3 AA batteries; 1-watt LED; on/off push-button switch\nIntegrated LED included\nNo assembly required\nIntended for indoor use only","bullets":"[\"Dream of warmer climes with this fun LED neon lamp in the shape of a pineapple. This lamp can make a wonderfully quirky addition to your living space. You can place it on a table or desk or hang it from the wall.\", \"3.5\\\"W x 3.5\\\"D x 11.75\\\"H\", \"Pineapple LED neon\", \"Has wall hooks to hang on the wall; takes 3 AA batteries; 1-watt LED; on/off push-button switch\", \"Integrated LED included\", \"No assembly required\", \"Intended for indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"bed\", \"nightstand\", \"friendship\", \"mood\", \"lamps\", \"color\", \"distance\", \"phillips\", \"mid\", \"ambient\", \"alexa\", \"philip\", \"changing\", \"rgb\", \"long\", \"smart\", \"apple\", \"bulbs\", \"strip\"]","node_path":"Categories/Indoor Lighting/Lamps, Bases & Shades/Table Lamps","created_at":"2023-01-09T12:16:01Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abce4"},"product_id":2617,"item_id":"B07HK3YLG9","category_id":28,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Indoor Remote Control Ceiling Fan With Integrated LED Light - 52 x 52 x 8.94 Inches, Brushed Nickel","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Brushed Nickel","weight_lb":16.5,"price_cents":3099,"stock":2,"description":"This beautiful ceiling fan features a brushed nickel finish on a steel dome, housing a disk of light surrounded by 4 espresso-finished wooden blades to complete the modern motif.\n52\"W x 52\"D x 8.94\"H\nBrushed nickel steel housing with 4 espresso blades\nVersatile casual style fan, for any room\n3 speed full function remote, 18-watt integrated LED light\nProfessional installation recommended\nFor indoor use only","bullets":"[\"This beautiful ceiling fan features a brushed nickel finish on a steel dome, housing a disk of light surrounded by 4 espresso-finished wooden blades to complete the modern motif.\", \"52\\\"W x 52\\\"D x 8.94\\\"H\", \"Brushed nickel steel housing with 4 espresso blades\", \"Versatile casual style fan, for any room\", \"3 speed full function remote, 18-watt integrated LED light\", \"Professional installation recommended\", \"For indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"ass\", \"de\", \"big\", \"commercial\", \"cieling\", \"raptor\", \"rubbed\", \"crystal\", \"palm\", \"folding\", \"dk\", \"lucci\", \"harbor\", \"alexa\", \"air\", \"techo\", \"aeratron\", \"smart\", \"blade\", \"rustic\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Ceiling Fans & Accessories/Ceiling Fans","created_at":"2023-06-09T23:45:28Z"}
