{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abce7"},"product_id":2620,"item_id":"B07HK67PJM","category_id":200,"name":"Rivet Modern Industrial Cement Cube Base Table Lamp with Amber Edison Light Bulb - 4.5 x 4.5 x 3.5 Inches, Cement","brand":"Rivet","color":"Cement","weight_lb":1.1,"price_cents":5499,"stock":7,"description":"Offering a modern spin on the classic incandescent bulb, this lamp has a solid cement base topped with an antique-looking bulb that's actually a long-lasting LED. You can easily turn it on and off with the in-line rocker switch.\n4.5\"W x 4.5\"D x 3.5\"H\nCement base\nBulb Included\nNo assembly required\nFor indoor use only","bullets":"[\"Offering a modern spin on the classic incandescent bulb, this lamp has a solid cement base topped with an antique-looking bulb that's actually a long-lasting LED. You can easily turn it on and off with the in-line rocker switch.\", \"4.5\\\"W x 4.5\\\"D x 3.5\\\"H\", \"Cement base\", \"Bulb Included\", \"No assembly required\", \"For indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"bed\", \"nightstand\", \"friendship\", \"lamps\", \"mood\", \"color\", \"distance\", \"phillips\", \"mid\", \"ambient\", \"led\", \"alexa\", \"philip\", \"changing\", \"rgb\", \"long\", \"smart\", \"apple\", \"bulbs\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting Fixtures/Indoor Lighting/Lamps","created_at":"2023-04-10T22:40:44Z"}
