{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abce9"},"product_id":2622,"item_id":"B07HK6LTJL","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Vintage Farmhouse Pendant Chandelier with LED Light Bulb - 10 x 10 Inch Clear Glass Shade, 60.12 Inch Cord, Antique Bronze","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Antique Bronze","weight_lb":3.97,"price_cents":3699,"stock":31,"description":"Give your indoor or outdoor spaces a vintage feel with this schoolhouse-style pendant light. The antique bronze steel lends strength to the elegantly curved clear glass shade.\n10\"W x 10\"D x 60.12\"H\nAntique bronze steel with clear glass shade\nWet rated for indoor or outdoor use\n5-watt LED bulb included (JA8 Certified)\nExpert installation required","bullets":"[\"Give your indoor or outdoor spaces a vintage feel with this schoolhouse-style pendant light. The antique bronze steel lends strength to the elegantly curved clear glass shade.\", \"10\\\"W x 10\\\"D x 60.12\\\"H\", \"Antique bronze steel with clear glass shade\", \"Wet rated for indoor or outdoor use\", \"5-watt LED bulb included (JA8 Certified)\", \"Expert installation required\"]","keywords":"[\"aesthetic\", \"shop\", \"rubbed\", \"tringco\", \"exterior\", \"brushed\", \"bright\", \"tripleglow\", \"tribright\", \"house\", \"fixtures\", \"rustic\", \"canopy\", \"cage\", \"oil\", \"modern\", \"school\", \"trilight\", \"low\", \"and\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Ceiling Lights/Close To Ceiling Lights","created_at":"2024-05-26T04:10:43Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abcea"},"product_id":2623,"item_id":"B07HK6N3GK","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Rustic Indoor Outdoor Wall Sconce with Light Bulb - 10 x 11 x 10 Inches, Antique Bronze","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Antique Bronze","weight_lb":3.09,"price_cents":5399,"stock":21,"description":"This rustic but casual wall sconce can blend into any decor style with the antique bronze hardware and the clear glass domed shade.\n10\"W x 11.02\"D x 10\"H\nAntique bronze steel housing, with clear glass shade\nCasual wall sconce has style and versatility\nBulb included\nProfessional installation recommended\nIndoor or outdoor use, rated for wet locations","bullets":"[\"This rustic but casual wall sconce can blend into any decor style with the antique bronze hardware and the clear glass domed shade.\", \"10\\\"W x 11.02\\\"D x 10\\\"H\", \"Antique bronze steel housing, with clear glass shade\", \"Casual wall sconce has style and versatility\", \"Bulb included\", \"Professional installation recommended\", \"Indoor or outdoor use, rated for wet locations\"]","keywords":"[\"door\", \"24\", \"powered\", \"gooseneck\", \"dusk\", \"phillips\", \"exterior\", \"solar\", \"operated\", \"led\", \"battery\", \"two\", \"house\", \"fixtures\", \"switch\", \"security\", \"modern\", \"barn\", \"litom\", \"of\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Outdoor Lighting/Porch & Patio Lights/Wall Lights","created_at":"2023-10-01T08:57:38Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abceb"},"product_id":2624,"item_id":"B07HK85S8B","category_id":200,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Mid-Century Contemporary Table Lamp with Bulb, 21\"H, White - 67095","brand":"Rivet","color":"White","weight_lb":2.0,"price_cents":7199,"stock":75,"description":"This bold contemporary table lamp features a white resin base formed into a modern design with three tiers. The all-white theme is carried through the neck and linen shade, making it an ideal addition to any minimalist space.\n13\"W x 13\"D x 21\"H\nLinen fabric shade with a resin body in a white finish\nMid-century modern encompasses a wide array of feelings amongst interior design circles and this white table lamp is the epitome mid-century modern design. A white linen shade sits atop of a uniquely shaped base to create a perfect lamp for mid-century modern and contemporary rooms alike. The rotary switch is located on the socket for quick and easy use.\nBulb included\nSimple assembly in less than 15 minutes\nFor indoor use only","bullets":"[\"This bold contemporary table lamp features a white resin base formed into a modern design with three tiers. The all-white theme is carried through the neck and linen shade, making it an ideal addition to any minimalist space.\", \"13\\\"W x 13\\\"D x 21\\\"H\", \"Linen fabric shade with a resin body in a white finish\", \"Mid-century modern encompasses a wide array of feelings amongst interior design circles and this white table lamp is the epitome mid-century modern design. A white linen shade sits atop of a uniquely shaped base to create a perfect lamp for mid-century modern and contemporary rooms alike. The rotary switch is located on the socket for quick and easy use.\", \"Bulb included\", \"Simple assembly in less than 15 minutes\", \"For indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"bed\", \"nightstand\", \"small\", \"ceramic\", \"45\", \"camping\", \"lamps\", \"color\", \"mood\", \"distance\", \"usb\", \"stocking\", \"lanp\", \"sized\", \"phillips\", \"fatboy\", \"mid\", \"box\", \"decorations\", \"ambient\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Lamps & Shades/Table Lamps","created_at":"2023-02-09T08:55:49Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abcec"},"product_id":2625,"item_id":"B07HKB6V27","category_id":194,"name":"Amazon Brand - Solimo 100% Cotton Printed Comforter, Double (Floral Splash, 200GSM)","brand":"Amazon Brand - Solimo","color":"Orange","weight_lb":"","price_cents":3399,"stock":29,"description":"Soft, cosy and light weight printed comforter with 200 GSM hollow siliconized polyester filling\n100% 144 TC Cotton shell for a rich, luxurious feel\nHypoallergenic filling which protects against allergens\nMachine stitched pattern to keep the filling in place for durability\nPack Content: 1 double comforter(230 cm X 254 cm)","bullets":"[\"Soft, cosy and light weight printed comforter with 200 GSM hollow siliconized polyester filling\", \"100% 144 TC Cotton shell for a rich, luxurious feel\", \"Hypoallergenic filling which protects against allergens\", \"Machine stitched pattern to keep the filling in place for durability\", \"Pack Content: 1 double comforter(230 cm X 254 cm)\"]","keywords":"[\"comforter\", \"cotton comforter\"]","node_path":"Categories/Home Furnishing/Bedding & Linen/Blankets, Throws & Quilts/Duvets & Comforters","created_at":"2023-03-30T18:16:56Z"}
