{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abcf4"},"product_id":2633,"item_id":"B07HKFY94D","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Industrial Swiveling Wall Sconce with Bulb, 18.1\"H, Matte White and Antique Brass","brand":"Rivet","color":"Gold and White","weight_lb":"","price_cents":11999,"stock":43,"description":"This eye-catching wall sconce is the perfect accent for industrial-style home décor. Matte white pairs with antique brass for a clean, classy look. The swiveling arm allows you to direct the light where you need it, and the double plug-in or hard-wire design provides unlimited placement options.\n5.5\"W x 12.3\"D x 18.1\"H\nMetal shade and arm with plug-in or hard-wire options\nThis wall sconce's matte-white and antique-brass color combination blends well with industrial, modern, vintage, and rustic home-décor styles.\nBulb included\nProfessional installation recommended\nFor indoor use only","bullets":"[\"This eye-catching wall sconce is the perfect accent for industrial-style home décor. Matte white pairs with antique brass for a clean, classy look. The swiveling arm allows you to direct the light where you need it, and the double plug-in or hard-wire design provides unlimited placement options.\", \"5.5\\\"W x 12.3\\\"D x 18.1\\\"H\", \"Metal shade and arm with plug-in or hard-wire options\", \"This wall sconce's matte-white and antique-brass color combination blends well with industrial, modern, vintage, and rustic home-décor styles.\", \"Bulb included\", \"Professional installation recommended\", \"For indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"bed\", \"de\", \"steel\", \"commercial\", \"mirror\", \"lamps\", \"decoracion\", \"rubbed\", \"exterior\", \"book\", \"brushed\", \"bright\", \"mid\", \"decorations\", \"two\", \"vanity\", \"house\", \"smart\", \"switch\", \"fixtures\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Wall Lights/Wall Lamps & Sconces","created_at":"2024-05-24T16:03:06Z"}
