{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abcfc"},"product_id":2641,"item_id":"B07HNJFGH4","category_id":83,"name":"UMI. Essentials Portable Camping Chair Compact Ultralight Folding Chair with Carry Bag for Hiking, Beach,Fishing,Outdoor Heavy Duty 265 lb Capacity Red","brand":"UMI","color":"Red","weight_lb":"","price_cents":12999,"stock":5,"description":"COMFORT: This is a ergonomic chair. High off the Ground. Deeper Seat makes you feel surrounded and very relaxed. Mesh Panels on the back and sides allow for increased airflow to keep you cool even in wet, hot environments.\nDURABLE AND STURDY: Seat fabric is windproof and waterproof, thick and durable. You will feel sturdy and safe sitting on it for the frame is made of high strength aluminum alloy.Includes TerraGrip Feet- the chair WON'T SINK IN SAND OR MUD.\nMULTI-FUNCTION POCKET DESIGN:There are total three pockets on the front side and on both sides, which can be equipped with water cup, mobile phone, iPad, etc. No need to worry about where things are placed.\nSET UP IN SECONDS: The frame system is divergent on one main rack.With elastic ropes inside,frames can be connected naturally and quickly. The seat fabric with a thoughtful pull-tab design will fit easily with just four corners.\nULTRA PORTABLE DESIGN:The chair is housed in a tiny storage bag and can be lifted up with only one finger.Take a load off no matter where you decide to go. Perfect for hiking, camping, fishing, BBQ, picnics, concerts, sporting events, the beach or anywhere you may need a chair!","bullets":"[\"COMFORT: This is a ergonomic chair. High off the Ground. Deeper Seat makes you feel surrounded and very relaxed. Mesh Panels on the back and sides allow for increased airflow to keep you cool even in wet, hot environments.\", \"DURABLE AND STURDY: Seat fabric is windproof and waterproof, thick and durable. You will feel sturdy and safe sitting on it for the frame is made of high strength aluminum alloy.Includes TerraGrip Feet- the chair WON'T SINK IN SAND OR MUD.\", \"MULTI-FUNCTION POCKET DESIGN:There are total three pockets on the front side and on both sides, which can be equipped with water cup, mobile phone, iPad, etc. No need to worry about where things are placed.\", \"SET UP IN SECONDS: The frame system is divergent on one main rack.With elastic ropes inside,frames can be connected naturally and quickly. The seat fabric with a thoughtful pull-tab design will fit easily with just four corners.\", \"ULTRA PORTABLE DESIGN:The chair is housed in a tiny storage bag and can be lifted up with only one finger.Take a load off no matter where you decide to go. Perfect for hiking, camping, fishing, BBQ, picnics, concerts, sporting events, the beach or anywhere you may need a chair!\"]","keywords":"[\"chairs patio chairs outdoor chairs folding chairs outdoor camping chairs folding lightweight beach chairs folding camp chair folding camping chairs lightweight portable seat fishing seat outdoor seat travel seat festival chairs portable\"]","node_path":"Categories/Outdoor Recreation/Camping & Hiking/Camping Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2023-07-19T02:06:27Z"}
