{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd09"},"product_id":2654,"item_id":"B07HS8L5QL","category_id":144,"name":"WHOLE FOODS MARKET Nourishing Mask Gift Set, 1 EA","brand":"WHOLE FOODS MARKET","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1899,"stock":11,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. When it comes to innovative flavors and products sourced from artisans and producers around the world, the Whole Foods Market brand has you covered. Amazing products, exceptional ingredients, no compromises.\nThis sampler set includes three sheet masks that help soothe, nourish and clarify skin in as little as 15 minutes. Just place on face, sit back, relax and experience glowing, healthy-looking skin.\nHypoallergenic & dermatologist tested.\nMade without synthetic fragance, Sodium Lauryl or Laureth Sulfate, Parabens or Phthalates.\nCertified Vegetarian.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. When it comes to innovative flavors and products sourced from artisans and producers around the world, the Whole Foods Market brand has you covered. Amazing products, exceptional ingredients, no compromises.\", \"This sampler set includes three sheet masks that help soothe, nourish and clarify skin in as little as 15 minutes. Just place on face, sit back, relax and experience glowing, healthy-looking skin.\", \"Hypoallergenic & dermatologist tested.\", \"Made without synthetic fragance, Sodium Lauryl or Laureth Sulfate, Parabens or Phthalates.\", \"Certified Vegetarian.\"]","keywords":"[\"treatment trio assorted facial masks (3 pack)\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-04-11T02:36:45Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd0a"},"product_id":2655,"item_id":"B07HSBJC1L","category_id":94,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Kinsley Kitchen Dining Room Chair, 37.5\"H, Set of 2, Ivory","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Ivory","weight_lb":28.0,"price_cents":7099,"stock":42,"description":"This set of 2 beautiful wingback dining chairs feature plush cushioning and gorgeous ivory fabric. The nailhead details on the distressed wooden legs bring a dash of industrial flair to this classic design.\nSolid wood frame for reliable, long-lasting support with upholstered fabric and nailhead detail.\nNo assembly required\nProduct Dimensions: 26.5”D x 25”W x 37.5”H\nFree returns for 30 days. 3 year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This set of 2 beautiful wingback dining chairs feature plush cushioning and gorgeous ivory fabric. The nailhead details on the distressed wooden legs bring a dash of industrial flair to this classic design.\", \"Solid wood frame for reliable, long-lasting support with upholstered fabric and nailhead detail.\", \"No assembly required\", \"Product Dimensions: 26.5”D x 25”W x 37.5”H\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3 year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"studio\", \"container\", \"trading\", \"stool\", \"de\", \"24\", \"auto\", \"swivel\", \"barstools\", \"navy\", \"folding\", \"direct\", \"back\", \"mid\", \"armen\", \"plywood\", \"tools\", \"barra\", \"baxton\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Game & Recreation Room Furniture/Home Bar Furniture/Barstools","created_at":"2023-07-21T03:32:24Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd0b"},"product_id":2656,"item_id":"B07HSCJZQQ","category_id":95,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Heather Modern End Table, 17.7 Inch Weight, Walnut","brand":"Rivet","color":"Multi Color","weight_lb":"","price_cents":16999,"stock":7,"description":"Complement your home’s modern design with this beautifully simple mid-century-style end table. The 2 walnut-colored shelves and leather bag provide both elegance and organization options, and a strong metal frame keeps the table sturdy.\n17.7\"W x 15.7\"D x 20.9\"H\nWalnut-colored MDF on a metal frame, with a leather bag\nMid-century design updated to complement a modern simple style\nThis end table's 2 layers of shelves and extra leather bag offer options for eazy organization.\nNo assembly required\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Complement your home’s modern design with this beautifully simple mid-century-style end table. The 2 walnut-colored shelves and leather bag provide both elegance and organization options, and a strong metal frame keeps the table sturdy.\", \"17.7\\\"W x 15.7\\\"D x 20.9\\\"H\", \"Walnut-colored MDF on a metal frame, with a leather bag\", \"Mid-century design updated to complement a modern simple style\", \"This end table's 2 layers of shelves and extra leather bag offer options for eazy organization.\", \"No assembly required\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"nightstand\", \"tray\", \"small\", \"bed\", \"recliner\", \"sauder\", \"cherry\", \"de\", \"beam\", \"steel\", \"mirror\", \"tv\", \"carson\", \"eames\", \"pink\", \"fridge\", \"powered\", \"tone\", \"usb\", \"folding\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Tables/End Tables","created_at":"2024-02-03T00:14:13Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd0c"},"product_id":2657,"item_id":"B07HSCNKDC","category_id":90,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Roxmere Modern Media Center, 49.2\"W, Acacia Wood and Dark Metal","brand":"Rivet","color":"","weight_lb":208.0,"price_cents":4299,"stock":10,"description":"Complete your interior design with this beautiful modern-style media center, made from solid acacia with a sandblast-gray finish that nicely complements most home-décor themes. With 2 niches, 2 drawers, and 2 shelves, this media center will add both style and organization to your room.\n49.2\"W x 15.7\"D x 70.9\"H\nSolid acacia with MDF acacia veneer\nModern styling that also blends well with rustic- and contemporary-style home décor\nThis media center has 2 niches, 2 drawers, and 2 shelves for maximum organization options.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nAvoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Complete your interior design with this beautiful modern-style media center, made from solid acacia with a sandblast-gray finish that nicely complements most home-décor themes. With 2 niches, 2 drawers, and 2 shelves, this media center will add both style and organization to your room.\", \"49.2\\\"W x 15.7\\\"D x 70.9\\\"H\", \"Solid acacia with MDF acacia veneer\", \"Modern styling that also blends well with rustic- and contemporary-style home décor\", \"This media center has 2 niches, 2 drawers, and 2 shelves for maximum organization options.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"sauder\", \"sliding\", \"vhs\", \"rotating\", \"door\", \"tv\", \"game\", \"carson\", \"movie\", \"royce\", \"entertainment\", \"mid\", \"barrister\", \"boards/buffet\", \"storage\", \"video\", \"crosley\", \"long\", \"stands\", \"rustic\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/TV & Media Furniture/Media Storage