{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd0d"},"product_id":2658,"item_id":"B07HSDPS35","category_id":94,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Vermont Modern Diamond-Stitched Kitchen Counter-Height Stool, 38\"H, Chalk White and Brass","brand":"Rivet","color":"Chalk","weight_lb":19.8,"price_cents":12999,"stock":12,"description":"The gorgeous diamond-patterned texture of the cushioned seat back lends this classic counter-height barstool a modern air of sleek sophistication.\nOverall: 22\"D x 19\"W x 38\"H.\nSolid wood frame with sturdy metal base.\nUpholstered, padded barstool with brass legs and footrest support.\nAvoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"The gorgeous diamond-patterned texture of the cushioned seat back lends this classic counter-height barstool a modern air of sleek sophistication.\", \"Overall: 22\\\"D x 19\\\"W x 38\\\"H.\", \"Solid wood frame with sturdy metal base.\", \"Upholstered, padded barstool with brass legs and footrest support.\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"stool\", \"de\", \"gun\", \"steel\", \"24\", \"auto\", \"swivel\", \"saddle\", \"navy\", \"barstools\", \"line\", \"mid\", \"angel\", \"tools\", \"products\", \"barra\", \"inches\", \"bar\", \"high\", \"gray\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Game & Recreation Room Furniture/Home Bar Furniture/Barstools","created_at":"2024-04-11T06:40:59Z"}
