{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd10"},"product_id":2661,"item_id":"B07HSF53X6","category_id":213,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Contemporary Polyester Area Rug, 8 x 11 Foot, Silver, Grey, White","brand":"Rivet","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":18999,"stock":31,"description":"This rug’s striking geometric pattern and elegant silver, gray, and white color scheme are sure to capture attention wherever you place the rug in your home. If you’re decorating your room with transitional-style home décor, this area rug will be the ideal centerpiece.\n8'W x 11'L\nImported. 49% polyester, 29% polypropylene, 16% jute, 6% cotton\nMachine made with a textured geometric pattern\nMedium .39\" pile suits any indoor space\nPair with rug pad (sold separately)","bullets":"[\"This rug’s striking geometric pattern and elegant silver, gray, and white color scheme are sure to capture attention wherever you place the rug in your home. If you’re decorating your room with transitional-style home décor, this area rug will be the ideal centerpiece.\", \"8'W x 11'L\", \"Imported. 49% polyester, 29% polypropylene, 16% jute, 6% cotton\", \"Machine made with a textured geometric pattern\", \"Medium .39\\\" pile suits any indoor space\", \"Pair with rug pad (sold separately)\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"foundry\", \"no\", \"wool\", \"olga\", \"8x10\", \"skid\", \"blythe\", \"for\", \"skin\", \"mid\", \"bd16\", \"cow\", \"non\", \"trellis\", \"jute\", \"shag\", \"10x12\", \"12x15\", \"rustic\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-04-27T02:36:24Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd11"},"product_id":2662,"item_id":"B07HSF6Z8G","category_id":94,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Kinsley Kitchen Counter Height Stool, 38\"H, Washed Denim","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Washed Denim","weight_lb":20.0,"price_cents":9799,"stock":28,"description":"This wingback counter height stool takes its inspiration from classic French design and pairs it with a modern wood frame for the best of both the old and new worlds.\nSolid wood frame, fabric, nailheads\nSquare stretcher bars for supreme stability and support\nProduct Dimensions: 22\"D x 19.5\"W x 38\"H\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This wingback counter height stool takes its inspiration from classic French design and pairs it with a modern wood frame for the best of both the old and new worlds.\", \"Solid wood frame, fabric, nailheads\", \"Square stretcher bars for supreme stability and support\", \"Product Dimensions: 22\\\"D x 19.5\\\"W x 38\\\"H\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"de\", \"iowa\", \"24\", \"auto\", \"swivel\", \"shop\", \"barstools\", \"signature\", \"university\", \"straps\", \"craftsman\", \"back\", \"armen\", \"riding\", \"tools\", \"bagger\", \"products\", \"barra\", \"cyclones\", \"inches\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Game & Recreation Room Furniture/Home Bar Furniture/Barstools","created_at":"2024-04-05T12:39:33Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd12"},"product_id":2663,"item_id":"B07HSF7N83","category_id":213,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Contemporary Polypropylene Area Rug, 7'10\" x 10', Ivory","brand":"Rivet","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":8999,"stock":30,"description":"Update your home decor with this unique contemporary-style rug. Perfect for large rooms, this rug has a neutral-ivory color focus that pairs well with most home-decor styles, and its captivating geometric design adds interest to any room.\n7'10\" x 10'\n100% polypropylene\nMachine made\nHigh 1.25\" pile shag","bullets":"[\"Update your home decor with this unique contemporary-style rug. Perfect for large rooms, this rug has a neutral-ivory color focus that pairs well with most home-decor styles, and its captivating geometric design adds interest to any room.\", \"7'10\\\" x 10'\", \"100% polypropylene\", \"Machine made\", \"High 1.25\\\" pile shag\"]","keywords":"[\"carpets\", \"rugs for home\", \"floor rug\", \"bedroom carpets\", \"area rug\", \"contemporary rug\", \"white+kilim 8x10\", \"off white rug 8x10\", \"rivet wool rug\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-04-28T01:03:15Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd13"},"product_id":2664,"item_id":"B07HSFDTH8","category_id":94,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Kinsley Barstool, 42\"H, Washed Denim","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Washed Denim","weight_lb":20.0,"price_cents":7099,"stock":13,"description":"This wingback barstool takes its inspiration from classic French design and pairs it with a modern, high-legged frame for the best of both the old and new worlds.\nSolid wood frame with upholstered fabric and nailhead detail.\nSquare stretcher bars for supreme stability and support\nProduct Dimensions: 22\"D x 19.5\"W x 42\"H\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This wingback barstool takes its inspiration from classic French design and pairs it with a modern, high-legged frame for the best of both the old and new worlds.\", \"Solid wood frame with upholstered fabric and nailhead detail.\", \"Square stretcher bars for supreme stability and support\", \"Product Dimensions: 22\\\"D x 19.5\\\"W x 42\\\"H\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"stool\", \"de\", \"steel\", \"24\", \"auto\", \"swivel\", \"shop\", \"barstools\", \"navy\", \"straps\", \"craftsman\", \"back\", \"armen\", \"riding\", \"tools\", \"bagger\", \"barra\", \"gold\", \"inches\", \"patio\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Game & Recreation Room Furniture/Home Bar Furniture/Barstools","created_at":"2023-07-02T20:04:10Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd14"},"product_id":2665,"item_id":"B07HSFLQKQ","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Levy Dining Room Kitchen Chair 40 Inch Height, Dove Grey","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Gray","weight_lb":23.5,"price_cents":21999,"stock":114,"description":"Dove gray upholstery and natural wooden legs combine for a timeless classic dining chair, while a gently curved armrest provides a slight contemporary twist.\nSolid wood frame, fabric\nCurved armrests for style and comfort\n22.5\"D x 22.5\"W x 40\"H","bullets":"[\"Dove gray upholstery and natural wooden legs combine for a timeless classic dining chair, while a gently curved armrest provides a slight contemporary twist.\", \"Solid wood frame, fabric\", \"Curved armrests for style and comfort\", \"22.5\\\"D x 22.5\\\"W x 40\\\"H\"]","keywords":"[\"container\", \"trading\", \"gun\", \"eames\", \"waiting\", \"signature\", \"folding\", \"direct\", \"mid\", \"armen\", \"teens\", \"plywood\", \"rustic\", \"patio\", \"east\", \"bar\", \"modern\", \"white\", \"para\", \"furniture\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Kitchen & Dining Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2023-07-02T14:25:34Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd15"},"product_id":2666,"item_id":"B07HSG8DPR","category_id":95,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Industrial Round Coffee Table, 48\"W, Wood & Dark Metal","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"","weight_lb":102.62,"price_cents":17999,"stock":44,"description":"This stunning industrial-style coffee table will be the highlight of your room. Constructed from solid mango with a French onyx finish and supported with sturdy steel legs, this table pairs perfectly with a variety of décor themes, and its parquetry surface makes it a work of art in itself.\n48\"W x 48\"D x 18\"H\nSolid mango top with a French onyx finish. The multistep finish leaves subtle dark highlights in the wood's medium-brown tones. The metal base has a dark-gunmetal powder-coated finish.\nThe styling is modern industrial, but the natural wood parquetry top gives it a rich casual look.\nThis table is great for a larger space, and its wide surface width has plenty of room for board games and other uses.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nCare: Clean as required with a soft, damp cloth; wipe completely dry. Avoid placing furniture near heat vents or open windows. Long periods of heat or excessive dampness can cause splitting, warping, and swelling in solid wood. Protect fine furniture finishes from hot dishes, alcohol, and excessive moisture or dampness.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This stunning industrial-style coffee table will be the highlight of your room. Constructed from solid mango with a French onyx finish and supported with sturdy steel legs, this table pairs perfectly with a variety of décor themes, and its parquetry surface makes it a work of art in itself.\", \"48\\\"W x 48\\\"D x 18\\\"H\", \"Solid mango top with a French onyx finish. The multistep finish leaves subtle dark highlights in the wood's medium-brown tones. The metal base has a dark-gunmetal powder-coated finish.\", \"The styling is modern industrial, but the natural wood parquetry top gives it a rich casual look.\", \"This table is great for a larger space, and its wide surface width has plenty of room for board games and other uses.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Care: Clean as required with a soft, damp cloth; wipe completely dry. Avoid placing furniture near heat vents or open windows. Long periods of heat or excessive dampness can cause splitting, warping, and swelling in solid wood. Protect fine furniture finishes from hot dishes, alcohol, and excessive moisture or dampness.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"stool\", \"de\", \"refrigerated\", \"game\", \"tv\", \"fridge\", \"48\", \"tone\", \"signature\", \"crystal\", \"folding\", \"rattan\", \"drum\", \"led\", \"storage\", \"lifttop\", \"sobro\", \"video\", \"bolanburg\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Tables/Coffee Tables","created_at":"2023-01-27T20:40:49Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd16"},"product_id":2667,"item_id":"B07HSGSBDY","category_id":193,"name":"Stone & Beam Vintage Metal Buckets, Set of 2, 9.58\"H and 8.66\"H, Galvanized","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":3899,"stock":38,"description":"These vintage galvanized buckets come in a traditional grooved pattern with thick rope handles, giving each a rustic style that adds to the farmhouse decor of any room. Add a plant or store other items, such as towels, in a creative way. The set contains 2 different size buckets.\n10.8\" diameter x 9.5\"H; 9.3\" diameter x 8.99\"H\n100% galvanized iron\nThese vintage galvanized buckets come with rope handles.\nAvoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.","bullets":"[\"These vintage galvanized buckets come in a traditional grooved pattern with thick rope handles, giving each a rustic style that adds to the farmhouse decor of any room. Add a plant or store other items, such as towels, in a creative way. The set contains 2 different size buckets.\", \"10.8\\\" diameter x 9.5\\\"H; 9.3\\\" diameter x 8.99\\\"H\", \"100% galvanized iron\", \"These vintage galvanized buckets come with rope handles.\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\"]","keywords":"[\"door\", \"mantels\", \"dipped\", \"knob\", \"ladders\", \"glove\", \"for\", \"seasoned\", \"blankets\", \"decorations\", \"mantel\", \"dried\", \"hitting\", \"pole\", \"enterprises\", \"fireplace\", \"got\", \"house\", \"ft\", \"running\"]","node_path":"Archive/2021-02/4300899030 - Home Décor Accents","created_at":"2023-08-04T18:27:05Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd17"},"product_id":2668,"item_id":"B07HSHMFWD","category_id":213,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Modern Geometric Area Rug, 4 x 6 Foot, Blue Multicolor","brand":"Rivet","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":11999,"stock":65,"description":"With bold, irregular shapes, this rug is an ideal accent for modern-style home decor. Blue and gray hues enhance the engaging design, and varying textures provide added interest.\n4' x 6'\nPile: 98% wool, 2% nylon\nThis richly textured rug uses spaced-dyed yarn in a looped-and-cut technique. The thick pile makes it luxurious, and the hand-tufted construction means it is both soft and durable, perfectly suited to high-traffic indoor areas.\nThe medium 0.3'' pile makes this rug ideal for moderate-traffic areas like bedrooms or sitting rooms\nPair with rug pad (sold separately)","bullets":"[\"With bold, irregular shapes, this rug is an ideal accent for modern-style home decor. Blue and gray hues enhance the engaging design, and varying textures provide added interest.\", \"4' x 6'\", \"Pile: 98% wool, 2% nylon\", \"This richly textured rug uses spaced-dyed yarn in a looped-and-cut technique. The thick pile makes it luxurious, and the hand-tufted construction means it is both soft and durable, perfectly suited to high-traffic indoor areas.\", \"The medium 0.3'' pile makes this rug ideal for moderate-traffic areas like bedrooms or sitting rooms\", \"Pair with rug pad (sold separately)\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"foundry\", \"carpets\", \"wool\", \"fur\", \"grey/off\", \"office\", \"5\\\"\", \"shag\", \"12x15\", \"magnolia\", \"bohemian\", \"5'\", \"loom\", \"white\", \"nonslip\", \"rubber\", \"7x10\", \"ruggables\", \"10\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-04-19T03:36:17Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd18"},"product_id":2669,"item_id":"B07HSHMQ62","category_id":213,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Global Bohemian Kilim Rug, 4 x 6 Foot, Multicolor","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":6699,"stock":183,"description":"Rich colors and an intricate design combine to form this stunning kilim-style rug. Complete with fringe and pile texture for added style, this rug is an ideal addition to a variety of home-decor themes, including modern, contemporary, and bohemian.\n4' x 6'\n78% wool, 22% cotton\nThis handcrafted rug is made by Craftmark-certified artisans, preserving the global craft tradition. The braided-trim detail and extra fringe give this reversible rug a classic look.\nFlatweave (pile is not applicable)\nPair with rug pad (sold separately)","bullets":"[\"Rich colors and an intricate design combine to form this stunning kilim-style rug. Complete with fringe and pile texture for added style, this rug is an ideal addition to a variety of home-decor themes, including modern, contemporary, and bohemian.\", \"4' x 6'\", \"78% wool, 22% cotton\", \"This handcrafted rug is made by Craftmark-certified artisans, preserving the global craft tradition. The braided-trim detail and extra fringe give this reversible rug a classic look.\", \"Flatweave (pile is not applicable)\", \"Pair with rug pad (sold separately)\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"foundry\", \"no\", \"carpets\", \"wool\", \"fur\", \"olga\", \"8x10\", \"skid\", \"woven\", \"grey/off\", \"bd16\", \"office\", \"non\", \"trellis\", \"5\\\"\", \"shag\", \"10x13\", \"magnolia\", \"5'\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-01-22T18:21:54Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd19"},"product_id":2670,"item_id":"B07HSHMVNF","category_id":213,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Modern Moroccan Inspired Area Rug, 4 x 6 Foot, Multicolor Red Accent","brand":"Rivet","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":10999,"stock":27,"description":"Enhance your home decor with this rug’s exotic flair. Inspired by traditional Moroccan designs, this rug features a bold geometric design and tastefully contrasting colors. Four fringes adorn the corners for added style.\n4' x 6'\nPile: 100% wool\nThis handcrafted rug is made by Craftmark-certified artisans, preserving the global craft tradition. The hand-tied tassels give this reversible rug a classic look.\nMedium pile rug perfect for transitional areas\nPair with rug pad (sold separately)","bullets":"[\"Enhance your home decor with this rug’s exotic flair. Inspired by traditional Moroccan designs, this rug features a bold geometric design and tastefully contrasting colors. Four fringes adorn the corners for added style.\", \"4' x 6'\", \"Pile: 100% wool\", \"This handcrafted rug is made by Craftmark-certified artisans, preserving the global craft tradition. The hand-tied tassels give this reversible rug a classic look.\", \"Medium pile rug perfect for transitional areas\", \"Pair with rug pad (sold separately)\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"foundry\", \"no\", \"deal\", \"olga\", \"8x10\", \"skid\", \"blythe\", \"mid\", \"bd16\", \"office\", \"non\", \"trellis\", \"jute\", \"shag\", \"thick\", \"10x12\", \"12x15\", \"10x13\", \"magnolia\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-05-04T05:55:36Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd1a"},"product_id":2671,"item_id":"B07HSHPJQQ","category_id":213,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Modern Color-Block Area Rug, 5 x 8 Foot, Round, Multicolor","brand":"Rivet","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":9299,"stock":21,"description":"Complete your modern-style home decor with this attractive round rug. With a size and shape ideal for the center of a room or beneath a table, this rug features distinct shapes in bold colors, a unique design that also pairs well with contemporary or vintage interior-design styles.\n5' x 8' Round\nPile: 100% nylon\nThe thick, soft pile of this luxurious brushstroke-patterned rug makes it both beautiful and practical. A handstitched binding gives it a handcrafted, elevated look. The round shape makes it suitable for smaller dining rooms and living rooms.\nThe medium 0.25\" pile makes this rug perfect for medium- to high-traffic areas like bedrooms or living rooms.\nPair with rug pad (sold separately)","bullets":"[\"Complete your modern-style home decor with this attractive round rug. With a size and shape ideal for the center of a room or beneath a table, this rug features distinct shapes in bold colors, a unique design that also pairs well with contemporary or vintage interior-design styles.\", \"5' x 8' Round\", \"Pile: 100% nylon\", \"The thick, soft pile of this luxurious brushstroke-patterned rug makes it both beautiful and practical. A handstitched binding gives it a handcrafted, elevated look. The round shape makes it suitable for smaller dining rooms and living rooms.\", \"The medium 0.25\\\" pile makes this rug perfect for medium- to high-traffic areas like bedrooms or living rooms.\", \"Pair with rug pad (sold separately)\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"foundry\", \"carpets\", \"wool\", \"fur\", \"grey/off\", \"office\", \"5\\\"\", \"shag\", \"thick\", \"12x15\", \"magnolia\", \"bohemian\", \"loom\", \"12x12\", \"white\", \"nonslip\", \"rubber\", \"ruggables\", \"runner\"]","node_path":