{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd1d"},"product_id":2674,"item_id":"B07HSJJDRW","category_id":94,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Wickstrom Upholstered Counter-Height Bar Stool with Arms, 37\"H, Slate Grey","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Slate Gray","weight_lb":24.2,"price_cents":3699,"stock":54,"description":"This stylish counter-height barstool features a classic wingback design, complete with armrests and a curved seatback for all-around comfort. The plush seat and cushioned frame are upholstered in gorgeous neutral fabric, and dark wood legs complete the elegant appearance.\nOverall: 23\"D x 23\"W x 37\"H\nSolid wood frame and legs with metal kickplate\nCurved back legs add a flair of style without compromising strength\nAvoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty","bullets":"[\"This stylish counter-height barstool features a classic wingback design, complete with armrests and a curved seatback for all-around comfort. The plush seat and cushioned frame are upholstered in gorgeous neutral fabric, and dark wood legs complete the elegant appearance.\", \"Overall: 23\\\"D x 23\\\"W x 37\\\"H\", \"Solid wood frame and legs with metal kickplate\", \"Curved back legs add a flair of style without compromising strength\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"de\", \"gun\", \"steel\", \"24\", \"auto\", \"swivel\", \"barstools\", \"mid\", \"tools\", \"barra\", \"inches\", \"rustic\", \"high\", \"modern\", \"para\", \"white\", \"low\", \"furniture\", \"tractor\", \"extra\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Game & Recreation Room Furniture/Home Bar Furniture/Barstools","created_at":"2023-05-09T21:09:03Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd1e"},"product_id":2675,"item_id":"B07HSJKY8H","category_id":210,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet planters","brand":"Rivet","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1699,"stock":71,"description":"This casual planter in cement and gold tones looks great on a table with your favorite plant or fairy garden. The open gold stand brings interest and beauty to your airy indoor garden, while the neutral tones help bring together the other colors in the room.\n12.2\" diameter x 15.94\"H\n100% iron\nThis casual cement-hued planter in a gold-toned stand looks great with most decors.\nWipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.","bullets":"[\"This casual planter in cement and gold tones looks great on a table with your favorite plant or fairy garden. The open gold stand brings interest and beauty to your airy indoor garden, while the neutral tones help bring together the other colors in the room.\", \"12.2\\\" diameter x 15.94\\\"H\", \"100% iron\", \"This casual cement-hued planter in a gold-toned stand looks great with most decors.\", \"Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\"]","keywords":"[\"ceramic\", \"tray\", \"bed\", \"saucer\", \"6ft\", \"gardening\", \"fig\", \"for\", \"mid\", \"box\", \"pots\", \"stands\", \"patio\", \"growing\", \"modern\", \"fern\", \"composite\", \"elevated\", \"bird\", \"tall\"]","node_path":"Categories/Gardening & Lawn Care/Pots, Planters & Container Accessories/Planters","created_at":"2024-03-08T14:49:54Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd1f"},"product_id":2676,"item_id":"B07HSJQ3DB","category_id":90,"name":"Stone & Beam Classic Serving Cart 40.98\"H, Bronze, Natural","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"","weight_lb":24.5,"price_cents":2999,"stock":11,"description":"Ornate accents give this bronzed iron cart frame a traditional hand-crafted appearance. Metal studs accent the natural wooden shelves while arches provide extra stability for all your storage needs.\nRubberwood, Iron\nThis features 3 rubberwood shelves and an iron frame. Wheeled casters allow easy mobility throughout the home.\nSimple assembly in less than 15 minutes\n13.4\"D x 21.67\"W x 40.98\"H\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty","bullets":"[\"Ornate accents give this bronzed iron cart frame a traditional hand-crafted appearance. Metal studs accent the natural wooden shelves while arches provide extra stability for all your storage needs.\", \"Rubberwood, Iron\", \"This features 3 rubberwood shelves and an iron frame. Wheeled casters allow easy mobility throughout the home.\", \"Simple assembly in less than 15 minutes\", \"13.4\\\"D x 21.67\\\"W x 40.98\\\"H\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"wheels\", \"mirror\", \"deco\", \"folding\", \"utility\", \"liquor\", \"viski\", \"gold\", \"tea\", \"bar\", \"modern\", \"top\", \"cocktail\", \"zuo\", \"decor\", \"station\", \"antique\", \"kitchen\", \"microwave\", \"on\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Game & Recreation Room Furniture/Home Bar Furniture/Bar & Serving Carts","created_at":"2024-02-28T21:15:27Z"}
