{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd21"},"product_id":2678,"item_id":"B07HSJSS2P","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Contemporary Bridge Print with Gold Leaf Wall Art Decor on Canvas - 24 x 36 Inch, Blue and Gold","brand":"Rivet","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":8899,"stock":104,"description":"Featuring a charming cityscape, this captivating contemporary print reminisces Impressionism-style paintings. Printed on canvas with a cool-blue color focus, gold accents, and hand-painted details, this scene will add a sense of calm reflection to any room.\n24\"H x 36\"W x 1.5\"D\nPrinted canvas with hand-painted details\nThis unframed cityscape features a light-blue background and a gold-toned bridge.\nHanging materials not included\nFrame not included","bullets":"[\"Featuring a charming cityscape, this captivating contemporary print reminisces Impressionism-style paintings. Printed on canvas with a cool-blue color focus, gold accents, and hand-painted details, this scene will add a sense of calm reflection to any room.\", \"24\\\"H x 36\\\"W x 1.5\\\"D\", \"Printed canvas with hand-painted details\", \"This unframed cityscape features a light-blue background and a gold-toned bridge.\", \"Hanging materials not included\", \"Frame not included\"]","keywords":"[\"gift\", \"steel\", \"iranian\", \"traveler\", \"year\", \"destination\", \"for\", \"yellow\", \"mid\", \"seven\", \"project\", \"stabilo\", \"pins\", \"your\", \"when\", \"personalized\", \"years\", \"psychedelic\", \"trio\", \"world\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-12-12T20:50:28Z"}
