{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd23"},"product_id":2680,"item_id":"B07HSK114P","category_id":180,"name":"Stone & Beam Modern Handmade Round Macrame Basket - Set of 3, Ivory","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":6499,"stock":23,"description":"Add elegance to your home décor with this beautiful basket. Handmade with cotton, this basket features a delicate lacelike design that complements a variety of interior-design styles, including modern, traditional, and vintage. Its neutral ivory color matches most home-décor themes.\nDimensions measure 14\"L X 14\"W X 14\"H, 10\"L X 10\"W X 10\"H, 6\"L X 6\"W X 6\"H\nHandmade with cotton\nThis elegant basket is perfect for both display and decorative storage.","bullets":"[\"Add elegance to your home décor with this beautiful basket. Handmade with cotton, this basket features a delicate lacelike design that complements a variety of interior-design styles, including modern, traditional, and vintage. Its neutral ivory color matches most home-décor themes.\", \"Dimensions measure 14\\\"L X 14\\\"W X 14\\\"H, 10\\\"L X 10\\\"W X 10\\\"H, 6\\\"L X 6\\\"W X 6\\\"H\", \"Handmade with cotton\", \"This elegant basket is perfect for both display and decorative storage.\"]","keywords":"[\"stone & beam\", \"home storage baskets bins and containers\", \"stone & beam home storage baskets bins and containers\"]","node_path":"Categories/Kitchen & Dining","created_at":"2023-11-30T11:14:19Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd24"},"product_id":2681,"item_id":"B07HSK72CN","category_id":90,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Rustic Serving Bar Cart with Wheels, 22.83\"W, Black, Natural and Dark Metal","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"","weight_lb":11.57,"price_cents":5599,"stock":22,"description":"This modern serving cart makes convenience a priority with handles built into the 3-tiered lipped natural-fir shelving, making them ideal for use as trays. Handles formed by the black metal frame, coupled with wheeled casters, extend the convenience factor to the whole house.\nFir, Iron\nHandled frame and 3 lipped wooden trays with built-in handles for maximum ease-of-use\nSimple assembly in 15-30 minutes\n11.81\"L x 22.83\"W x 73.03\"H\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty","bullets":"[\"This modern serving cart makes convenience a priority with handles built into the 3-tiered lipped natural-fir shelving, making them ideal for use as trays. Handles formed by the black metal frame, coupled with wheeled casters, extend the convenience factor to the whole house.\", \"Fir, Iron\", \"Handled frame and 3 lipped wooden trays with built-in handles for maximum ease-of-use\", \"Simple assembly in 15-30 minutes\", \"11.81\\\"L x 22.83\\\"W x 73.03\\\"H\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"sauder\", \"small\", \"wheels\", \"big\", \"deco\", \"entertainment\", \"ermont\", \"wagon\", \"drinks\", \"folding\", \"utility\", \"storage\", \"liquor\", \"collapsible\", \"viski\", \"gold\", \"rolling\", \"tea\", \"patio\", \"white\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Game & Recreation Room Furniture/Home Bar Furniture/Bar & Serving Carts","created_at":"2023-04-03T00:27:32Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd25"},"product_id":2682,"item_id":"B07HSKSN5C","category_id":84,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Roxmere Modern Storage Office Computer Desk, 39.4\"W, Sandblast Gray","brand":"Rivet","color":"Gray","weight_lb":142.0,"price_cents":31999,"stock":44,"description":"Complete your interior design with this beautiful modern-style desk, made from solid acacia with a sandblast-gray finish that nicely complements most home-décor themes. With 2 drawers, a desktop, and 2 sliding cabinet doors, this desk will add both style and organization to your room.\n39.4\"W x 19.7\"D x 70.9\"H\nSolid acacia with MDF acacia veneer\nModern styling that also blends well with rustic- and contemporary-style home décor\nThis desk has 2 drawers and 2 sliding cabinet doors for maximum organization options.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nAvoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Complete your interior design with this beautiful modern-style desk, made from solid acacia with a sandblast-gray finish that nicely complements most home-décor themes. With 2 drawers, a desktop, and 2 sliding cabinet doors, this desk will add both style and organization to your room.\", \"39.4\\\"W x 19.7\\\"D x 70.9\\\"H\", \"Solid acacia with MDF acacia veneer\", \"Modern styling that also blends well with rustic- and contemporary-style home décor\", \"This desk has 2 drawers and 2 sliding cabinet doors for maximum organization options.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"respawn\", \"small\", \"college\", \"standard\", \"sauder\", \"beam\", \"big\", \"game\", \"study\", \"racing\", \"rising\", \"escritorio\", \"arrozzi\", \"compact\", \"student\", \"usb\", \"bush\", \"line\", \"shaped\", \"mid\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Home Office Furniture/Home Office Desks","created_at":"2023-11-22T12:33:07Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd26"},"product_id":2683,"item_id":"B07HSLG6XK","category_id":193,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Rustic Mirror Wall Shelf, 24\"H, White","brand":"Rivet","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":7299,"stock":6,"description":"Made from fir wood with a distressed white finish, this circular mirrored wall shelf is a perfect accent for rustic décor. The mirror reflects the beautiful natural grain of the wood’s inside rim, and the shelf is just the right size for displaying small treasures.\n24\"H x 24\"W x 4\"D\nFir wood with MDF and mirror\nThis mirror shelf's distressed white finish works well with a variety of home-décor themes, including modern simple and vintage.\nNo hanging materials needed","bullets":"[\"Made from fir wood with a distressed white finish, this circular mirrored wall shelf is a perfect accent for rustic décor. The mirror reflects the beautiful natural grain of the wood’s inside rim, and the shelf is just the right size for displaying small treasures.\", \"24\\\"H x 24\\\"W x 4\\\"D\", \"Fir wood with MDF and mirror\", \"This mirror shelf's distressed white finish works well with a variety of home-décor themes, including modern simple and vintage.\", \"No hanging materials needed\"]","keywords":"[\"makeup\", \"sliding\", \"door\", \"beam\", \"country\", \"24\", \"tv\", \"24x36\", \"knob\", \"brushed\", \"slim\", \"mid\", \"led\", \"storage\", \"body\", \"vanity\", \"hamilton\", \"gold\", \"stands\", \"edge\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-05-01T23:37:43Z"}
