{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd28"},"product_id":2685,"item_id":"B07HSLPNLV","category_id":94,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Bentley Dining Chair 38\"H, Black Legs, Set of 2, Flax","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"","weight_lb":1.0,"price_cents":7399,"stock":58,"description":"This sleek, sophisticated dining chair features a high-backed design and a rollback silhouette for a timeless touch of class. The flax fabric covers soft, luxurious cushions for supreme comfort.\nSolid Wood Frame, Fabric\nSolid wooden frame with stylish black finish for support that makes a statement\n27”D x 20”W x 38”H\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty","bullets":"[\"This sleek, sophisticated dining chair features a high-backed design and a rollback silhouette for a timeless touch of class. The flax fabric covers soft, luxurious cushions for supreme comfort.\", \"Solid Wood Frame, Fabric\", \"Solid wooden frame with stylish black finish for support that makes a statement\", \"27”D x 20”W x 38”H\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"stool\", \"iowa\", \"24\", \"auto\", \"shop\", \"navy\", \"barstools\", \"university\", \"back\", \"american\", \"tools\", \"cyclones\", \"gold\", \"inches\", \"rustic\", \"bar\", \"gray\", \"modern\", \"low\", \"furniture\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-11-22T02:18:49Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd29"},"product_id":2686,"item_id":"B07HSLQY2F","category_id":92,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Modern Corner Floating Triangle 5 Shelf Wall Unit Decor - 36 Inch, Natural Wood and Gold","brand":"Rivet","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":8599,"stock":40,"description":"This wall unit offers a modern take on shelving with 5 tiers of shelves. The triangle shape makes this unit perfect for utilizing otherwise wasted corner space, and the gold color of the frame suggests contemporary luxury.\n36.02\"H x 22.05\"W x 15.75\"D\n90% rubberwood; 10% fir\nShelf unit\nAvoid moisture. This item wipes clean with a soft, dry cloth. Hanging hardware is included.","bullets":"[\"This wall unit offers a modern take on shelving with 5 tiers of shelves. The triangle shape makes this unit perfect for utilizing otherwise wasted corner space, and the gold color of the frame suggests contemporary luxury.\", \"36.02\\\"H x 22.05\\\"W x 15.75\\\"D\", \"90% rubberwood; 10% fir\", \"Shelf unit\", \"Avoid moisture. This item wipes clean with a soft, dry cloth. Hanging hardware is included.\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"bed\", \"nightstand\", \"lovekankei\", \"steel\", \"mattress\", \"big\", \"24\", \"commercial\", \"tv\", \"deep\", \"48\", \"reach\", \"racks\", \"mid\", \"shelf24\", \"quantum\", \"powder\", \"units\", \"storage\"]","node_path":"Categories/Storage & Organization/Racks, Shelves & Drawers","created_at":"2023-04-11T00:45:02Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd2a"},"product_id":2687,"item_id":"B07HSLTFY3","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Contemporary Striped Print with Sand Texture Wall Art Decor on Canvas - 30 x 40 Inch, Pink and Blue","brand":"Rivet","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":7899,"stock":22,"description":"This print features a classic mid-century color scheme that can complement the muted tones in your home. The horizontal stripes evoke both progressive modernity and a bygone era of industry.\n30\"H x 40\"W x 1.5\"D\nPrinted canvas with hand-painted details\nWall decor\nHanging materials not included\nFrame not included","bullets":"[\"This print features a classic mid-century color scheme that can complement the muted tones in your home. The horizontal stripes evoke both progressive modernity and a bygone era of industry.\", \"30\\\"H x 40\\\"W x 1.5\\\"D\", \"Printed canvas with hand-painted details\", \"Wall decor\", \"Hanging materials not included\", \"Frame not included\"]","keywords":"[\"unicycles\", \"big\", \"blades\", \"deep\", \"tiefsee\", \"ninebot\", \"hovershoe\", \"skateboard\", \"pancho\", \"10th\", \"superride\", \"minipro\", \"book\", \"isbn\", \"segway\", \"adults\", \"es4\", \"for\", \"mid\", \"edition\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-09-23T19:18:09Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd2b"},"product_id":2688,"item_id":"B07HSLTFYL","category_id":226,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Traditional Desert Landscape Print Artwork on Canvas - 18 x 24 Inch","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":2999,"stock":15,"description":"The striking contrast of rust and blue draw the eye to this abstract landscape print, making it a wonderful accent piece for a colorful interior decor. The white and yellow in the clouds and foreground balance out the vivid colors in a way that’s pleasing to the eye.\n18\"H x 24\"W x 1.5\"D\nPrinted canvas with hand-painted details\nWall decor\nHanging materials not included\nFrame not included","bullets":"[\"The striking contrast of rust and blue draw the eye to this abstract landscape print, making it a wonderful accent piece for a colorful interior decor. The white and yellow in the clouds and foreground balance out the vivid colors in a way that’s pleasing to the eye.\", \"18\\\"H x 24\\\"W x 1.5\\\"D\", \"Printed canvas with hand-painted details\", \"Wall decor\", \"Hanging materials not included\", \"Frame not included\"]","keywords":"[\"big\", \"basics\", \"24x36\", \"wanderlust\", \"guns\", \"movie\", \"recoil\", \"mymap\", \"bag\", \"cotton\", \"project\", \"pins\", \"scratchable\", \"lazer\", \"vests\", \"when\", \"states\", \"gold\", \"psychedelic\", \"deluxe\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-03-27T20:11:12Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd2c"},"product_id":2689,"item_id":"B07HSLTL8K","category_id":95,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Stevens Modern Storage Accent Side End Table Nightstand, 19.69\"W, Brushed Tundra Gray","brand":"Rivet","color":"Gray","weight_lb":65.0,"price_cents":22999,"stock":19,"description":"Update your home décor with this gorgeous modern-style end table. Made from solid acacia, this table is highly durable, and its brushed tundra-gray finish blends well with most home-décor themes. Its drawer and top surface offer helpful organization and display options.\n19.69\"W x 19.69\"D x 19.69\"H\nSolid acacia\nClean lines and rich gray finish create a modern design that's perfect for any contemporary-style home.\nThis stylish end table has a drawer for storing items.\nNo assembly required\nAvoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Update your home décor with this gorgeous modern-style end table. Made from solid acacia, this table is highly durable, and its brushed tundra-gray finish blends well with most home-décor themes. Its drawer and top surface offer helpful organization and display options.\", \"19.69\\\"W x 19.69\\\"D x 19.69\\\"H\", \"Solid acacia\", \"Clean lines and rich gray finish create a modern design that's perfect for any contemporary-style home.\", \"This stylish end table has a drawer for storing items.\", \"No assembly required\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"nightstand\", \"small\", \"steel\", \"mirror\", \"powered\", \"tone\", \"signature\", \"usb\", \"entryway\", \"mid\", \"outlets\", \"chairside\", \"desks\", \"convenience\", \"media\", \"bolanburg\", \"ports\", \"two\", \"space\", \"mirrored\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Tables/End Tables","created_at":"2023-04-04T08:26:25Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd2d"},"product_id":2690,"item_id":"B07HSLXH4F","category_id":213,"name":"Stone & Beam Rug, 5'3\" x 7'3\", Gray, Orange, Multicolor","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Navy","weight_lb":"","price_cents":13999,"stock":19,"description":"This striking rug will provide the ideal finishing touch to your home decor. Its timeless design will perfectly support your traditional-style interior design, and its engaging multicolor theme will add a splash of color to the room.\n5'3\" x 7'3\"\nImported; pile: 100% polypropylene; backing: 100% jute\nAdvanced power-loom construction for excellent value and quality\nMedium .5'' pile is ideal for moderate-traffic areas like bedrooms or sitting rooms.\nPair with rug pad (sold separately)","bullets":"[\"This striking rug will provide the ideal finishing touch to your home decor. Its timeless design will perfectly support your traditional-style interior design, and its engaging multicolor theme will add a splash of color to the room.\", \"5'3\\\" x 7'3\\\"\", \"Imported; pile: 100% polypropylene; backing: 100% jute\", \"Advanced power-loom construction for excellent value and quality\", \"Medium .5'' pile is ideal for moderate-traffic areas like bedrooms or sitting rooms.\", \"Pair with rug pad (sold separately)\"]","keywords":"[\"foundry\", \"small\", \"carpets\", \"wool\", \"pink\", \"fur\", \"rooms\", \"olga\", \"8x10\", \"blythe\", \"skin\", \"cow\", \"girls\", \"office\", \"trellis\", \"bohemian\", \"gray\", \"modern\", \"white\", \"by\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-04-12T10:16:19Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd2e"},"product_id":2691,"item_id":"B07HSM8NGX","category_id":213,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Wool Rug, 8' x 10', Gray, Charcoal","brand":"Rivet","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":13999,"stock":116,"description":"Give your room the perfect centerpiece with this captivating area rug. Its hand-tufted abstract design is an ideal complement for transitional-style home decor, and its neutral gray-and-charcoal color scheme is sure to blend well with your existing interior-design theme.\n8' x 10'\nImported; 80% wool, 20% cotton\nHand tufted with a textured abstract pattern\nHigh .6\" pile suits any indoor space\nPair with rug pad (sold separately)","bullets":"[\"Give your room the perfect centerpiece with this captivating area rug. Its hand-tufted abstract design is an ideal complement for transitional-style home decor, and its neutral gray-and-charcoal color scheme is sure to blend well with your existing interior-design theme.\", \"8' x 10'\", \"Imported; 80% wool, 20% cotton\", \"Hand tufted with a textured abstract pattern\", \"High .6\\\" pile suits any indoor space\", \"Pair with rug pad (sold separately)\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"foundry\", \"no\", \"olga\", \"8x10\", \"skid\", \"blythe\", \"skin\", \"mid\", \"bd16\", \"cow\", \"non\", \"trellis\", \"jute\", \"shag\", \"12x15\", \"10x12\", \"10x13\", \"distressed\", \"rustic\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-12-09T21:35:56Z"}
