{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd34"},"product_id":2697,"item_id":"B07HSNF966","category_id":213,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Modern Color-Block Area Rug, 4 x 6 Foot, Multicolor","brand":"Rivet","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":7099,"stock":9,"description":"Complete your home decor with this unique modern-style rug. With a fascinating design composed of bold shapes that extend beyond the rug’s edges and subtly contrasting hues, this rug is sure to be the highlight of any room in which you place it.\n4' x 6'\nPile: 100% wool\nThis richly textured rug uses spaced-dyed yarn in a looped-and-cut technique. The thick pile makes it luxurious, and the hand-tufted construction means it is both soft and durable, perfectly suited to high-traffic indoor areas.\nThe medium 0.3'' pile makes this rug ideal for moderate-traffic areas like bedrooms or sitting rooms\nPair with rug pad (sold separately)","bullets":"[\"Complete your home decor with this unique modern-style rug. With a fascinating design composed of bold shapes that extend beyond the rug’s edges and subtly contrasting hues, this rug is sure to be the highlight of any room in which you place it.\", \"4' x 6'\", \"Pile: 100% wool\", \"This richly textured rug uses spaced-dyed yarn in a looped-and-cut technique. The thick pile makes it luxurious, and the hand-tufted construction means it is both soft and durable, perfectly suited to high-traffic indoor areas.\", \"The medium 0.3'' pile makes this rug ideal for moderate-traffic areas like bedrooms or sitting rooms\", \"Pair with rug pad (sold separately)\"]","keywords":"[\"foundry\", \"small\", \"carpets\", \"fur\", \"olga\", \"8x10\", \"grey/off\", \"mid\", \"bd16\", \"office\", \"trellis\", \"jute\", \"5\\\"\", \"shag\", \"12x15\", \"10x13\", \"magnolia\", \"bohemian\", \"5'\", \"gray\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-10-22T23:01:01Z"}
