{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd38"},"product_id":2701,"item_id":"B07HXPHFJN","category_id":171,"name":"Belei Vitamin C Moisturizer, Fragrance Free, Paraben Free, 2 Fluid Ounce (60 mL)","brand":"Belei","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1399,"stock":9,"description":"Created for all skin types, including sensitive skin\nFormulated without parabens, fragrance, sulfates, phthalates\nDermatologist tested. Formula not tested on animals\nA stable, high performance moisturizer using the latest technology in vitamin C delivery to help brighten skin\nOur vitamin C is blended with hyaluronic acid and a botanical complex to help skin appear smoother with daily use\nApply day and night as needed, after cleansing and applying serum. Use alone or under makeup. For daytime use we recommend following with sun protection\nMade in the U.S.A from U.S. and imported ingredients\nSatisfaction Guarantee: We're proud of our products. If you aren't satisfied, we'll refund you for any reason within a year of purchase. 1-877-485-0385\nAn Amazon brand","bullets":"[\"Created for all skin types, including sensitive skin\", \"Formulated without parabens, fragrance, sulfates, phthalates\", \"Dermatologist tested. Formula not tested on animals\", \"A stable, high performance moisturizer using the latest technology in vitamin C delivery to help brighten skin\", \"Our vitamin C is blended with hyaluronic acid and a botanical complex to help skin appear smoother with daily use\", \"Apply day and night as needed, after cleansing and applying serum. Use alone or under makeup. For daytime use we recommend following with sun protection\", \"Made in the U.S.A from U.S. and imported ingredients\", \"Satisfaction Guarantee: We're proud of our products. If you aren't satisfied, we'll refund you for any reason within a year of purchase. 1-877-485-0385\", \"An Amazon brand\"]","keywords":"[\"anti aging,brightening,glow,glowing,hydrating,dry skin,private label,belie,skincare,belei,belei skin care,belei skincare,belei,amazon skin care,amazon skincare\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-04-14T14:07:15Z"}
