{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd4c"},"product_id":2721,"item_id":"B07HZ782D2","category_id":93,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Blaine Modern Sofa Couch, 79.5\"W, Navy Blue","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Navy Blue","weight_lb":110.0,"price_cents":74999,"stock":20,"description":"Add mid-century elegance to your living room with this navy blue sofa. The solid-wood frame and polyester upholstery make this sofa both sturdy and cozy, and the removable/reversible cushions ensure durability and comfort.\nOverall: 79.5\"W x 37.8\"D x 35\"H; seat height: 19.3\"H; seat depth: 22\"D; seat back height: 25.6\"H; arm height: 24.4\"H; leg height: 4.9\"H\nSolid-wood frame and legs with 100% polyester upholstery\nThe tight, removable back cushions and fixed seat cushions ensure durability and comfort.\nSimple assembly in less than 15 minutes\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\nThis item is made to order just for you","bullets":"[\"Add mid-century elegance to your living room with this navy blue sofa. The solid-wood frame and polyester upholstery make this sofa both sturdy and cozy, and the removable/reversible cushions ensure durability and comfort.\", \"Overall: 79.5\\\"W x 37.8\\\"D x 35\\\"H; seat height: 19.3\\\"H; seat depth: 22\\\"D; seat back height: 25.6\\\"H; arm height: 24.4\\\"H; leg height: 4.9\\\"H\", \"Solid-wood frame and legs with 100% polyester upholstery\", \"The tight, removable back cushions and fixed seat cushions ensure durability and comfort.\", \"Simple assembly in less than 15 minutes\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\", \"This item is made to order just for you\"]","keywords":"[\"bed\", \"small\", \"recliner\", \"love\", \"microfiber\", \"de\", \"sectionals\", \"rooms\", \"casa\", \"loveseat\", \"color\", \"smith\", \"queen\", \"signature\", \"shaped\", \"buy\", \"chaise\", \"hideabed\", \"couch\", \"facing\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Sofas & Couches","created_at":"2024-02-22T19:35:48Z"}
