{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd71"},"product_id":2758,"item_id":"B07JC8Q6T8","category_id":144,"name":"WHOLE FOODS MARKET Diffuser Whale, 1 EA","brand":"WHOLE FOODS MARKET","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1899,"stock":16,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market\nUSB/battery operated\nCovers areas up to 200 sq ft\nColor: White\nThis baby beluga-shaped diffuser is a fun way to get your little ones into aromatherapy. With three working modes, you can switch between timed diffusion, intermittent diffusion or continuous diffusion. Covers areas up to 200 square feet. Powered by USB cable. Contents of box include the diffuser, USB cable and instruction manual.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market\", \"USB/battery operated\", \"Covers areas up to 200 sq ft\", \"Color: White\", \"This baby beluga-shaped diffuser is a fun way to get your little ones into aromatherapy. With three working modes, you can switch between timed diffusion, intermittent diffusion or continuous diffusion. Covers areas up to 200 square feet. Powered by USB cable. Contents of box include the diffuser, USB cable and instruction manual.\"]","keywords":"[\"home goods; décor; aromatherapy; room\"]","node_path":"Products/Health Care/Alternative Medicine/Aromatherapy","created_at":"2023-12-28T03:25:28Z"}
