{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd84"},"product_id":2777,"item_id":"B07JKS3J3G","category_id":163,"name":"365 Everyday Value, Adult 50+ Probiotic 5 Billion CFU, 30 ct","brand":"365 by Whole Foods Market","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1199,"stock":21,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\nBifidobacteria declines as you age. Our Adult 50+ Probiotic formula combines 10 types of beneficial bacteria for colon flora balance, including 4 Bifidobacteria strains.\nIn addition to a healthy lifestyle and diet, add our probiotics to your daily wellness routine to help maintain overall digestive health.\nEach capsule contains 5 billion colony forming units (CFU), and when taken daily, helps support digestive health. The ten Probiotic strains have been clinically studied for safety and efficacy.\nVegetarian.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\", \"Bifidobacteria declines as you age. Our Adult 50+ Probiotic formula combines 10 types of beneficial bacteria for colon flora balance, including 4 Bifidobacteria strains.\", \"In addition to a healthy lifestyle and diet, add our probiotics to your daily wellness routine to help maintain overall digestive health.\", \"Each capsule contains 5 billion colony forming units (CFU), and when taken daily, helps support digestive health. The ten Probiotic strains have been clinically studied for safety and efficacy.\", \"Vegetarian.\"]","keywords":"[\"probiotic\"]","node_path":"Products/Vitamins & Dietary Supplements/Supplements/Digestive Supplements/Probiotics","created_at":"2024-04-28T08:37:20Z"}
