{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd86"},"product_id":2779,"item_id":"B07JKZBQ6M","category_id":159,"name":"Basic Care Nighttime Cold & Flu Original Flavor, 12 Fl. Oz","brand":"Basic Care","color":"","weight_lb":1.0,"price_cents":4099,"stock":17,"description":"ACTIVE INGREDIENTS: This product contains acetaminophen (pain reliever and fever reducer), dextromethorphan HBr (cough suppressant) and doxylamine succinate (antihistamine) which compares to the active ingredients in Vicks NyQuil Cold & Flu.\nPOWERFUL NIGHTTIME RELIEF: This cold and flu medicine provides multi-symptom relief of common cold and flu symptoms for up to 6 hours while you sleep.\nPAIN RELIEVER AND FEVER REDUCER: Relieves sore throat, minor aches and pains and reduces fever associated with the common cold and flu.\nCOUGH SUPPRESSANT: This nighttime cold and flu relief medicine helps to relieve coughing so you can rest.\nANTIHISTAMINE: Helps relieve runny nose and sneezing associated with the common cold and flu.","bullets":"[\"ACTIVE INGREDIENTS: This product contains acetaminophen (pain reliever and fever reducer), dextromethorphan HBr (cough suppressant) and doxylamine succinate (antihistamine) which compares to the active ingredients in Vicks NyQuil Cold & Flu.\", \"POWERFUL NIGHTTIME RELIEF: This cold and flu medicine provides multi-symptom relief of common cold and flu symptoms for up to 6 hours while you sleep.\", \"PAIN RELIEVER AND FEVER REDUCER: Relieves sore throat, minor aches and pains and reduces fever associated with the common cold and flu.\", \"COUGH SUPPRESSANT: This nighttime cold and flu relief medicine helps to relieve coughing so you can rest.\", \"ANTIHISTAMINE: Helps relieve runny nose and sneezing associated with the common cold and flu.\"]","keywords":"[\"basic care nighttime cold & flu vicks nyquil acetaminophen dextromethorphan hbr doxylamine succinate pain reliever fever reducer cough suppressant antihistamine alcohol 10% original flavor 12 fl oz\", \"cold and flu relief, cold and flu liquid, cold and flu relief liquid, nyquil, acetaminophen, dextromethorphan, doxylamine, cold and flu medicine, nighttime cold and flu relief, cold and flu symptom, pain reliever, fever reducer, cough suppressant, antihistamine, common cold, cold, runny nose, coughing, common cold\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-11-18T22:05:36Z"}
