{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd8e"},"product_id":2787,"item_id":"B07JLSP8JF","category_id":209,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Industrial Throw Pillow - 17 x 17 Inch, Flax/Cognac","brand":"Rivet","color":"Cognac","weight_lb":"","price_cents":2899,"stock":60,"description":"Made in the United States and imported\nThe cognac leather accent stripe on this stylish contemporary throw pillow adds an element of class to the stark, industrial flax fabric for a stylish blend of modern and classic.\n17\"L x 17\"W\nThis pillow features a leather accent stripe on a flax-colored ground to add a touch of sophistication to your space. Hidden zipper at bottom of pillow.\nPillow cover and insert\nSpot clean.\nPillow insert arrives in vacuum sealed bag. Carefully remove insert from packaging and let it fully expand before putting inside of pillow cover. Please note: As it is made of a natural material, the leather pieces vary slightly in texture and color.","bullets":"[\"Made in the United States and imported\", \"The cognac leather accent stripe on this stylish contemporary throw pillow adds an element of class to the stark, industrial flax fabric for a stylish blend of modern and classic.\", \"17\\\"L x 17\\\"W\", \"This pillow features a leather accent stripe on a flax-colored ground to add a touch of sophistication to your space. Hidden zipper at bottom of pillow.\", \"Pillow cover and insert\", \"Spot clean.\", \"Pillow insert arrives in vacuum sealed bag. Carefully remove insert from packaging and let it fully expand before putting inside of pillow cover. Please note: As it is made of a natural material, the leather pieces vary slightly in texture and color.\"]","keywords":"[\"stuffing\", \"bed\", \"gift\", \"big\", \"plushie\", \"rug\", \"owl\", \"foam\", \"outlanders\", \"slim\", \"wedge\", \"couch\", \"bag\", \"boys\", \"official\", \"red\", \"16x16\", \"white\", \"lavender\", \"case\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-05-23T07:21:09Z"}
