{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abd90"},"product_id":2789,"item_id":"B07JM1QSL6","category_id":209,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Casual Outdoor Throw Pillow - 24 x 12 Inch, Coral","brand":"Rivet","color":"Coral","weight_lb":"","price_cents":3899,"stock":83,"description":"Made in USA and imported\nThis outdoor pillow has textured yarns in the simple stripes that give an updated look to a classic pattern. The bright color is perfect for your outdoor patio. The back is a solid coral-colored fabric.\n12\"L x 24\"W\nPillow\nSpot clean. Put in dryer on low heat for 20 minutes to release wrinkles or use garment steamer. Do not iron.\nPillow arrives in vacuum-sealed bag. Carefully remove pillow from packaging and let it fully expand.","bullets":"[\"Made in USA and imported\", \"This outdoor pillow has textured yarns in the simple stripes that give an updated look to a classic pattern. The bright color is perfect for your outdoor patio. The back is a solid coral-colored fabric.\", \"12\\\"L x 24\\\"W\", \"Pillow\", \"Spot clean. Put in dryer on low heat for 20 minutes to release wrinkles or use garment steamer. Do not iron.\", \"Pillow arrives in vacuum-sealed bag. Carefully remove pillow from packaging and let it fully expand.\"]","keywords":"[\"stuffing\", \"bed\", \"gift\", \"big\", \"plushie\", \"hands\", \"wwe\", \"rug\", \"owl\", \"foam\", \"year\", \"outlanders\", \"couch\", \"goods\", \"red\", \"16x16\", \"furniture\", \"lavender\", \"22x22\", \"sofa\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-11-27T18:37:36Z"}
