{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abdad"},"product_id":2818,"item_id":"B07JXJM8L1","category_id":159,"name":"Amazon Basic Care Extra Strength Pain Relief, Acetaminophen Caplets, 500 mg, 225 Count","brand":"Amazon Basic Care","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1199,"stock":43,"description":"ACTIVE INGREDIENT: Amazon Basic Care Extra Strength Pain Relief's active ingredient is Acetaminophen, 500 mg, which compares to the active ingredient of Extra Strength Tylenol Caplets\nAmazon Basic Care Extra Strength Pain Relief, Acetaminophen Caplets, 500 mg, temporarily relieves minor aches and pains due to: the common cold, headache, backache, minor pain of arthritis, toothache, muscular aches, and premenstrual and menstrual cramps It also temporarily reduces fever\nUSE: Acetaminophen may be used as a pain reliever and fever reducer for adults and children 12 years and over\nPAIN: Pain may begin with an injury or illness, but could also originate with anything from a bad mattress to arthritis\nACUTE PAIN: Acute pain acts as an alarm such as with a bee sting or stubbing your toe and can last for a few moments or for longer","bullets":"[\"ACTIVE INGREDIENT: Amazon Basic Care Extra Strength Pain Relief's active ingredient is Acetaminophen, 500 mg, which compares to the active ingredient of Extra Strength Tylenol Caplets\", \"Amazon Basic Care Extra Strength Pain Relief, Acetaminophen Caplets, 500 mg, temporarily relieves minor aches and pains due to: the common cold, headache, backache, minor pain of arthritis, toothache, muscular aches, and premenstrual and menstrual cramps It also temporarily reduces fever\", \"USE: Acetaminophen may be used as a pain reliever and fever reducer for adults and children 12 years and over\", \"PAIN: Pain may begin with an injury or illness, but could also originate with anything from a bad mattress to arthritis\", \"ACUTE PAIN: Acute pain acts as an alarm such as with a bee sting or stubbing your toe and can last for a few moments or for longer\"]","keywords":"[\"basic care acetaminophen extra strength pain reliever fever reducer for adults 225 caplets 500 mg tylenol\", \"basic care, pain relief, acetaminophen, minor aches and pains, common cold, headache, backache, tylenol, arthritis, toothache, menstrual cramps, fever, pain\", \"acetaminophen 500mg\"]","node_path":"Products/Health Care/OTC Medications & Treatments/Pain Relievers/Non-Aspirin/Acetaminophen","created_at":"2024-03-08T16:07:47Z"}
