{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abdb4"},"product_id":2825,"item_id":"B07K1YTPCS","category_id":149,"name":"Eono Essentials Men's Sport Travel Overnight Wash Gym Toiletry Shaving Bag with Carry Handle Black","brand":"Eono","color":"Black","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1399,"stock":0,"description":"HIGH-QUALITY DURABLE MATERIAL: This exceptional toiletry travel bag is made of attractive Cationic Oxford cloth, which is known for its lightweight yet durable qualities, the perfect combination for traveling. This specific material is water resistant, making it safe for use in environments where it may become wet, such as a bathroom or shower area. The interior of the bag is securely lined with a special material that can handle accidental toiletry spills and can be easily cleaned\nWIDE OPEN DESIGN WITH ORGANIZED COMPARTMENTS: Compact yet spacious, this travel bag provides adequate room for all your essentials. It features a main compartment that holds larger items such as shampoo bottles or shaving cream, a zippered mesh pouch that keeps your smaller toiletries and cosmetics in place, and a front zipper pocket that provides extra storage with easy\nMADE FOR TRAVEL AND PORTABILITY: Designed with the traveler in mind, this case comes complete with a built-in hook perfect for hanging your bag to allow for fast access to your items, as well as simply storing your travel case when not needed. A side handle is included to ensure that carrying your bag while traveling is made easy.\nCONVENIENT MULTI-USE BAG: Whether you are travelling for business or personal reasons, this portable wash bag will certainly meet your needs. It was designed for both men and women, and is an extremely versatile travel bag that can be used as a traditional toiletry bag, makeup or shaving kit case, a safe place to store your healthcare items while traveling, or it can be used as a carry-on airline bag to store needed in-flight elements.\n12 MONTH GUARANTEE: Buy with confidence. If anything happens to your bag within the first 12 months of owning it, we will replace it at no charge to you. This includes coverage for discoloration, broken zippers, or wear and tear in the material. We stand by our products because we are so confident in their quality and durability.","bullets":"[\"HIGH-QUALITY DURABLE MATERIAL: This exceptional toiletry travel bag is made of attractive Cationic Oxford cloth, which is known for its lightweight yet durable qualities, the perfect combination for traveling. This specific material is water resistant, making it safe for use in environments where it may become wet, such as a bathroom or shower area. The interior of the bag is securely lined with a special material that can handle accidental toiletry spills and can be easily cleaned\", \"WIDE OPEN DESIGN WITH ORGANIZED COMPARTMENTS: Compact yet spacious, this travel bag provides adequate room for all your essentials. It features a main compartment that holds larger items such as shampoo bottles or shaving cream, a zippered mesh pouch that keeps your smaller toiletries and cosmetics in place, and a front zipper pocket that provides extra storage with easy\", \"MADE FOR TRAVEL AND PORTABILITY: Designed with the traveler in mind, this case comes complete with a built-in hook perfect for hanging your bag to allow for fast access to your items, as well as simply storing your travel case when not needed. A side handle is included to ensure that carrying your bag while traveling is made easy.\", \"CONVENIENT MULTI-USE BAG: Whether you are travelling for business or personal reasons, this portable wash bag will certainly meet your needs. It was designed for both men and women, and is an extremely versatile travel bag that can be used as a traditional toiletry bag, makeup or shaving kit case, a safe place to store your healthcare items while traveling, or it can be used as a carry-on airline bag to store needed in-flight elements.\", \"12 MONTH GUARANTEE: Buy with confidence. If anything happens to your bag within the first 12 months of owning it, we will replace it at no charge to you. This includes coverage for discoloration, broken zippers, or wear and tear in the material. We stand by our products because we are so confident in their quality and durability.\"]","keywords":"[\"wash bag travel toiletry bag hanging luggage pouch make up cosmetic bag make up kit beauty case large toiletry for men women kids ladies travel toiletries set sport bag\"]","node_path":"Categories/Accessories/Travel Accessories/Toiletry Bags","created_at":"2023-09-09T18:06:23Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abdb5"},"product_id":2826,"item_id":"B07K1ZGJ78","category_id":149,"name":"Eono Essentials Hanging Toiletry Bag Wash Bag Shaving Bag Toiletry Bag for Men and Women Blue","brand":"Eono","color":"Blue","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1199,"stock":19,"description":"Made from high quality, durable material. This unique toiletry bag is made from attractive oxford fabric, known for its lightweight yet durable properties. This special material is water resistant and therefore good for use in damp environments such as suitable for use in bathrooms or shower rooms.\nSpacious, open design and good partitions: Compact yet spacious, this toiletry bag offers enough space for all your essentials. It features a main compartment to store larger items such as shampoo bottles or shaving cream, a zippered mesh pouch that holds your smaller toiletries and cosmetics in place, and a front zip pocket for extra storage.\nMade for travel and mobility: Designed specifically for travellers, this toiletry bag features an integrated hanging hook for quick access to your belongings and easy to store when needed. A handle on the side ensures that the toiletry bag is easy to carry.\nPractical bag with many functions: Designed for both men and women, the bag is an extremely versatile travel companion that can be used as a traditional toiletry bag, make-up or shaving bag, a safe place to keep your health products while travelling, or it can be used as carry-on luggage for air travel to store things you need during the flight.\n- - - - -","bullets":"[\"Made from high quality, durable material. This unique toiletry bag is made from attractive oxford fabric, known for its lightweight yet durable properties. This special material is water resistant and therefore good for use in damp environments such as suitable for use in bathrooms or shower rooms.\", \"Spacious, open design and good partitions: Compact yet spacious, this toiletry bag offers enough space for all your essentials. It features a main compartment to store larger items such as shampoo bottles or shaving cream, a zippered mesh pouch that holds your smaller toiletries and cosmetics in place, and a front zip pocket for extra storage.\", \"Made for travel and mobility: Designed specifically for travellers, this toiletry bag features an integrated hanging hook for quick access to your belongings and easy to store when needed. A handle on the side ensures that the toiletry bag is easy to carry.\", \"Practical bag with many functions: Designed for both men and women, the bag is an extremely versatile travel companion that can be used as a traditional toiletry bag, make-up or shaving bag, a safe place to keep your health products while travelling, or it can be used as carry-on luggage for air travel to store things you need during the flight.\", \"- - - - -\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-03-01T21:26:11Z"}
