{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abe08"},"product_id":2909,"item_id":"B07KZ6C76M","category_id":113,"name":"Amazon Brand - Vedaka SOYA Mini Chunks, 500g","brand":"Vedaka","color":"","weight_lb":1.1,"price_cents":699,"stock":78,"description":"Vedaka Soya is hygienically packed and undergoes stringent and rigorous laboratory tests to meet FSSAI food safety norms\nSorted to deliver consistent quality\nNo artificial flavours. No preservatives\nNet weight: 500g\nCooking instructions: 1. To 1 cup soya mini chunks, add 3 cups water in a pan. 2. Add a pinch of salt (optional) and cook in an open pan for 4 minutes on medium flame. 3. Rinse the cooked mini chunks in cold water 2-3 times. 4. Squeeze dry and add to your favourite recipes!","bullets":"[\"Vedaka Soya is hygienically packed and undergoes stringent and rigorous laboratory tests to meet FSSAI food safety norms\", \"Sorted to deliver consistent quality\", \"No artificial flavours. No preservatives\", \"Net weight: 500g\", \"Cooking instructions: 1. To 1 cup soya mini chunks, add 3 cups water in a pan. 2. Add a pinch of salt (optional) and cook in an open pan for 4 minutes on medium flame. 3. Rinse the cooked mini chunks in cold water 2-3 times. 4. Squeeze dry and add to your favourite recipes!\"]","keywords":"[\"vedaka\", \"soya nugget\", \"pantry\", \"soya chunks\", \"grocery\", \"soyabeans chunks\", \"nutrela\", \"nutreela soya chunks\", \"nutrella\", \"nutrella soya chunks\", \"nutrella soya\", \"soyabean\", \"soya chunks pantry\", \"soyabean badi\", \"soyabin chunks\", \"nutri nuggets\", \"nutrela soya chunks\", \"soyabean chunks\", \"nutrella mini soya chunks\", \"mini soya chunks\"]","node_path":"Products/Rice, Flour & Pulses/Dals & Pulses/Soy Beans","created_at":"2024-05-26T13:50:39Z"}
