or and provide comfort in style.\", \"Care Instruction: Hand wash. Wash below 30 degrees. Machine wash and tumble drying here are not recommended. No bleaching.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"Home & Garden/Home & Kitchen/Categories/Home Accessories/Window Treatments/Curtains","created_at":"2024-03-05T16:11:45Z"}
