{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abe2c"},"product_id":2945,"item_id":"B07LCYHKTX","category_id":113,"name":"Whole Foods Market, Cotton Cupra Mask, Clarifying Papaya, 0.77 fl oz","brand":"Whole Foods Market","color":"","weight_lb":0.05,"price_cents":799,"stock":7,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. When it comes to innovative flavors and products sourced from artisans and producers around the world, the Whole Foods Market brand has you covered. Amazing products, exceptional ingredients, no compromises.\nOur cotton cupra face masks are made from 100% cotton linter, the soft downy fiber surrounding the cotton seed. This material has a high level of liquid retention and adhesion, so it clings tightly to the skin and fits perfectly along the facial contours.\nHelps diminish skin impurities that can cause dullness.\nHypoallergenic & dermatologist tested. Made without synthetic fragance, Sodium Lauryl or Laureth Sulfate, Parabens or Phthalates.\nCertified Vegan.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. When it comes to innovative flavors and products sourced from artisans and producers around the world, the Whole Foods Market brand has you covered. Amazing products, exceptional ingredients, no compromises.\", \"Our cotton cupra face masks are made from 100% cotton linter, the soft downy fiber surrounding the cotton seed. This material has a high level of liquid retention and adhesion, so it clings tightly to the skin and fits perfectly along the facial contours.\", \"Helps diminish skin impurities that can cause dullness.\", \"Hypoallergenic & dermatologist tested. Made without synthetic fragance, Sodium Lauryl or Laureth Sulfate, Parabens or Phthalates.\", \"Certified Vegan.\"]","keywords":"[\"cupra\", \"mask\", \"facial\"]","node_path":"Products/Skin Care/Face/Treatments & Masks/Masks","created_at":"2024-01-07T18:50:11Z"}
