nd brushed stainless steel finish (enviroment-friendly process, no chemicals involved) is built to resist daily scratches and tarnishing.\", \"PACKAGE INCLUDES: Hand Towel Holder x 1, Hardware Pack (for wall mount) x 1, Installation Instructions x 1. Easy and quick installation. Screw mounting can be used on all smooth walls, with the EXCEPTION of tile, stucco and marble walls.\"]","keywords":"[\"hanging hand towels metal iron hardware hotel bath bathroom hand hotel washcloth kitchen heavy duty toilet paper storage bars rail satin nickel brass hook organizer euro round small large set european under the door cabinet counter organiser durable\"]","node_path":"Products/Hardware/Bathroom Hardware/Towel Rings","created_at":"2024-06-02T22:14:27Z"}
