{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abe37"},"product_id":2956,"item_id":"B07M7B278G","category_id":159,"name":"Basic Care Multi-symptom Severe Cold Daytime & Severe Cold & Cough Nighttime Value Pack, 12Count","brand":"Basic Care","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":999,"stock":94,"description":"ACTIVE INGREDIENTS: Amazon Basic Care Severe Cold Daytime contains acetaminophen (a pain reliever and fever reducer), dextromethorphan HBr (a cough suppressant) and phenylephrine HCl (a nasal decongestant). Amazon Basic Care Severe Cold & Cough Nighttime contains acetaminophen (a pain reliever and fever reducer), diphenhydramine HCl (an antihistamine and cough suppressant) and phenylephrine HCl (a nasal decongestant). Compare to Theraflu Severe Cold and Nighttime Severe Cold & Cough active ingredients.\nHOT LIQUID THERAPY: Simply add powder to hot water and sip your way to multi-symptom relief of nasal and sinus congestion, cough, body aches, sore throat pain, headache, fever during the day and nasal congestion, cough, runny nose, sneezing, body aches, sore throat pain, headache and fever at night.\nDAYTIME COLD AND FLU RELIEF: Amazon Basic Care Severe Cold Daytime provides non-drowsy relief of your worst daytime cold and flu symptoms: nasal and sinus congestion, sore throat pain, headaches, body aches, fever, cough and pain.\nNIGHTTIME COLD AND FLU RELIEF: Amazon Basic Care Severe Cold & Cough Nighttime provides relief of your worst nighttime cold and flu symptoms: nasal and sinus congestion, sore throat pain, runny nose, headaches, body aches, fever, cough, sneezing and pain.\nWARM, SOOTHING COLD AND FLU RELIEF: Amazon Basic Care Severe Cold Daytime has a green tea and honey lemon flavor while Amazon Basic Care Severe Cold & Cough Nighttime has honey lemon infused with white tea flavors. Daytime and Nighttime provide multi-symptom relief of your nastiest cold and flu symptoms.","bullets":"[\"ACTIVE INGREDIENTS: Amazon Basic Care Severe Cold Daytime contains acetaminophen (a pain reliever and fever reducer), dextromethorphan HBr (a cough suppressant) and phenylephrine HCl (a nasal decongestant). Amazon Basic Care Severe Cold & Cough Nighttime contains acetaminophen (a pain reliever and fever reducer), diphenhydramine HCl (an antihistamine and cough suppressant) and phenylephrine HCl (a nasal decongestant). Compare to Theraflu Severe Cold and Nighttime Severe Cold & Cough active ingredients.\", \"HOT LIQUID THERAPY: Simply add powder to hot water and sip your way to multi-symptom relief of nasal and sinus congestion, cough, body aches, sore throat pain, headache, fever during the day and nasal congestion, cough, runny nose, sneezing, body aches, sore throat pain, headache and fever at night.\", \"DAYTIME COLD AND FLU RELIEF: Amazon Basic Care Severe Cold Daytime provides non-drowsy relief of your worst daytime cold and flu symptoms: nasal and sinus congestion, sore throat pain, headaches, body aches, fever, cough and pain.\", \"NIGHTTIME COLD AND FLU RELIEF: Amazon Basic Care Severe Cold & Cough Nighttime provides relief of your worst nighttime cold and flu symptoms: nasal and sinus congestion, sore throat pain, runny nose, headaches, body aches, fever, cough, sneezing and pain.\", \"WARM, SOOTHING COLD AND FLU RELIEF: Amazon Basic Care Severe Cold Daytime has a green tea and honey lemon flavor while Amazon Basic Care Severe Cold & Cough Nighttime has honey lemon infused with white tea flavors. Daytime and Nighttime provide multi-symptom relief of your nastiest cold and flu symptoms.\"]","keywords":"[\"basic care multi-symptom severe cold cough & flu theraflu daytime nighttime acetaminophen pain reliever fever reducer dextromethorphan hbr suppressant phenylephrine hcl nasal decongestant diphenhydramine sinus congestion body ache sore throat headache runny nose sneezing green tea honey lemon flavors infused white tea 6 packets 12 count\", \"cold and flu relief, cold and flu liquid, cold and flu relief liquid, acetaminophen, cold and flu medicine, nighttime cold and flu relief, cold and flu symptoms, pain reliever, fever reducer, cough suppressant, common cold, cold, runny nose, coughing, common cold\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-02-07T02:47:11Z"}
