{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abe45"},"product_id":2970,"item_id":"B07MBFDRY5","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam French Country Dining Chair with Arms, Set of 2, 24.6\"W, Beige and Natural","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Beige","weight_lb":36.16,"price_cents":32999,"stock":8,"description":"Add rustic, old-world charm to your dining room with this set of 2 French country-inspired dining chairs. An ideal complement for vintage and farmhouse-style home decor, these chairs features a solid wood frame, rattan backing and comfortable upholstered seat and armrests.\nOverall: 24.63\"W x 23.25\"D x 37\"H; seat height: 17.75\"H; seat depth: 19\"D; seat back height: 20.25\"H; arm height: 25.5\"H\nSturdy wood frame and legs in a distressed natural finish with rattan backing and durable upholstered seat\nThis set of 2 vintage-inspired dining chairs double as accent chairs for the living room or anywhere you need extra seating.\nFoam padding and elastic suspension system keep the back and seat firm and springy.\nAvoid moisture. Wipe clean with soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Add rustic, old-world charm to your dining room with this set of 2 French country-inspired dining chairs. An ideal complement for vintage and farmhouse-style home decor, these chairs features a solid wood frame, rattan backing and comfortable upholstered seat and armrests.\", \"Overall: 24.63\\\"W x 23.25\\\"D x 37\\\"H; seat height: 17.75\\\"H; seat depth: 19\\\"D; seat back height: 20.25\\\"H; arm height: 25.5\\\"H\", \"Sturdy wood frame and legs in a distressed natural finish with rattan backing and durable upholstered seat\", \"This set of 2 vintage-inspired dining chairs double as accent chairs for the living room or anywhere you need extra seating.\", \"Foam padding and elastic suspension system keep the back and seat firm and springy.\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"container\", \"gun\", \"de\", \"eames\", \"con\", \"signature\", \"cushions\", \"direct\", \"mid\", \"armen\", \"plywood\", \"rustic\", \"gray\", \"trattoria\", \"para\", \"white\", \"modern\", \"furniture\", \"decor\", \"mesa\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Kitchen & Dining Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2024-05-29T03:17:44Z"}
