{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abe58"},"product_id":2989,"item_id":"B07MFC5ZBK","category_id":159,"name":"Amazon Basic Care Day Time Cold & Flu and Night Time Cold & Flu Combo Pack, Fast Dissolving Liquid Gels, 24 Count","brand":"Amazon Basic Care","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":999,"stock":24,"description":"Amazon Basic Care Daytime Cold & Flu and Nighttime Cold & Flu Liquid Gels Combo Pack is a convenience pack of two cold & flu medicines. Compare to Mucinex Fast-Max Day & Mucinex Fast-Max Night Cold & Flu active ingredients.\nAmazon Basic Care Day Time Cold & Flu: Active ingredients are acetaminophen, pain reliever/fever reducer; dextromethorphan HBr, cough suppressant; guaifenesin, expectorant; and phenylephrine HCl, nasal decongestant.\nAmazon Basic Care Night Time Cold & Flu: Active ingredients are acetaminophen, pain reliever/fever reducer; dextromethorphan HBr, cough suppressant; doxylamine succinate, antihistamine; and phenylephrine HCl, nasal decongestant.\nAmazon Basic Care Day Time & Night Time both relieve aches, fever & sore throat; and control cough. Day Time relieves nasal & chest congestion; thins & loosens mucus. Night Time relieves nasal congestion; runny nose & sneezing.\nCold & flu symptoms can drag you down around the clock. This combo pack contains two cold & flu medicines that relieve multiple symptoms whenever they occur. Maximum strength, per 4-hour dose. For ages 12+ years. These products are gluten free.","bullets":"[\"Amazon Basic Care Daytime Cold & Flu and Nighttime Cold & Flu Liquid Gels Combo Pack is a convenience pack of two cold & flu medicines. Compare to Mucinex Fast-Max Day & Mucinex Fast-Max Night Cold & Flu active ingredients.\", \"Amazon Basic Care Day Time Cold & Flu: Active ingredients are acetaminophen, pain reliever/fever reducer; dextromethorphan HBr, cough suppressant; guaifenesin, expectorant; and phenylephrine HCl, nasal decongestant.\", \"Amazon Basic Care Night Time Cold & Flu: Active ingredients are acetaminophen, pain reliever/fever reducer; dextromethorphan HBr, cough suppressant; doxylamine succinate, antihistamine; and phenylephrine HCl, nasal decongestant.\", \"Amazon Basic Care Day Time & Night Time both relieve aches, fever & sore throat; and control cough. Day Time relieves nasal & chest congestion; thins & loosens mucus. Night Time relieves nasal congestion; runny nose & sneezing.\", \"Cold & flu symptoms can drag you down around the clock. This combo pack contains two cold & flu medicines that relieve multiple symptoms whenever they occur. Maximum strength, per 4-hour dose. For ages 12+ years. These products are gluten free.\"]","keywords":"[\"basic care daytime severe cold nighttime flu maximum strength mucinex fast-max ages 12+ acetaminophen dextromethorphan hbr guaifenesin phenylephrine hcl doxylamine succinate pain reliever fever reducer cough suppressant expectorant nasal decongestant antihistamine relieves aches sore throat congestion runny nose sneezing 16 + 8 liquid gels 24 liquid filled capsules\"]","node_path":"Products/Health Care/OTC Medications & Treatments/Cough & Cold/Cold & Flu Relief","created_at":"2023-09-19T21:25:33Z"}
