{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abe63"},"product_id":3000,"item_id":"B07MHMNK1L","category_id":200,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Two-Toned Ceramic Base Table Lamp, Bulb Included, 19.75\"H, Beige","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Beige","weight_lb":"","price_cents":2799,"stock":26,"description":"The tall, cylindrical base of this transitional-style lamp is dip-dyed for a modern-feeling ombre effect. Gradually darkening shades of beige merge softly into each other, highlighting the mix of smooth and textured surfaces. The off-white linen drum shade provides visual balance.\n9\"W x 9\"D x 19.75\"H\nSmooth and textured dip-dyed ceramic with 3 hues of beige glaze; brushed-nickel accents; off-white linen shade\nThe drum shade casts an ambient glow.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nStone & Beam","bullets":"[\"The tall, cylindrical base of this transitional-style lamp is dip-dyed for a modern-feeling ombre effect. Gradually darkening shades of beige merge softly into each other, highlighting the mix of smooth and textured surfaces. The off-white linen drum shade provides visual balance.\", \"9\\\"W x 9\\\"D x 19.75\\\"H\", \"Smooth and textured dip-dyed ceramic with 3 hues of beige glaze; brushed-nickel accents; off-white linen shade\", \"The drum shade casts an ambient glow.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Stone & Beam\"]","keywords":"[\"nightstand\", \"bed\", \"small\", \"45\", \"t7\", \"lamps\", \"color\", \"usb\", \"stocking\", \"lanp\", \"phillips\", \"lt\", \"mid\", \"decorations\", \"alexa\", \"philip\", \"ports\", \"house\", \"life\", \"tablelight\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Lamps & Shades/Table Lamps","created_at":"2023-12-12T22:07:01Z"}
