{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abe7a"},"product_id":3017,"item_id":"B07MLTLQST","category_id":159,"name":"Basic Care Mucus Relief Severe Congestion & Cough; Helps Relieve Cold Symptoms, 6 Fluid Ounces","brand":"Amazon Basic Care","color":"","weight_lb":0.53,"price_cents":899,"stock":22,"description":"ACTIVE INGREDIENTS: This product contains dextromethorphan HBr (cough suppressant), guaifenesin (expectorant) and phenylephrine HCl (nasal decongestant), which compare to the active ingredients in Mucinex Fast-Max Severe Congestion & Cough.\nMULTI-SYMPTOM MUCUS RELIEF: Use one medicine for multiple symptoms of your toughest coughs and colds: controls cough, relieves nasal & chest congestion, thins and loosens mucus for ages 12+\nEXPECTORANT: Basic Care Mucus Relief Severe Congestion & Cough contains guaifenesin to help break up and thin mucus, make coughs more productive and clear out phlegm.\nCOUGH SUPPRESSANT: Basic Care Mucus Relief Severe Congestion & Cough contains dextromethorphan hydrobromide to help control the impulse to cough to help you sleep.\nNASAL DECONGESTANT: Basic Care Mucus Relief Severe Congestion & Cough contains phenylephrine HCl to help relieve nasal congestion due to a cold.","bullets":"[\"ACTIVE INGREDIENTS: This product contains dextromethorphan HBr (cough suppressant), guaifenesin (expectorant) and phenylephrine HCl (nasal decongestant), which compare to the active ingredients in Mucinex Fast-Max Severe Congestion & Cough.\", \"MULTI-SYMPTOM MUCUS RELIEF: Use one medicine for multiple symptoms of your toughest coughs and colds: controls cough, relieves nasal & chest congestion, thins and loosens mucus for ages 12+\", \"EXPECTORANT: Basic Care Mucus Relief Severe Congestion & Cough contains guaifenesin to help break up and thin mucus, make coughs more productive and clear out phlegm.\", \"COUGH SUPPRESSANT: Basic Care Mucus Relief Severe Congestion & Cough contains dextromethorphan hydrobromide to help control the impulse to cough to help you sleep.\", \"NASAL DECONGESTANT: Basic Care Mucus Relief Severe Congestion & Cough contains phenylephrine HCl to help relieve nasal congestion due to a cold.\"]","keywords":"[\"basic care maximum strength mucus relief severe congestion & cough ages 12+ mucinex fast-max dextromethorphan hbr guaifenesin phenylephrine hcl suppressant expectorant nasal decongestant relieves chest congestion thins loosens 6 fl oz\", \"guaifenesin, dextromethorphan hydrobromide, mucus, phlegm, cough, common cold, mucus relief\"]","node_path":"Products/Health Care/OTC Medications & Treatments/Cough & Cold/Cold & Flu Relief","created_at":"2024-01-29T20:51:28Z"}
