{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abe9d"},"product_id":3058,"item_id":"B07N7W8837","category_id":314,"name":"Eono Essentials Women’s High Waist Long Swimsuit Board Shorts/Beach Bottoms Dark-Blue","brand":"Eono","color":"Dark-blue","weight_lb":"","price_cents":6099,"stock":337,"description":"Modest, stretchy, fitted swim shorts for women; quick drying and lightweight; comfortable, skin-friendly material (helps prevent chafing); ideal for surfing, snorkeling, kayaking, beach volley ball, and other outdoor fun in the sun\nThigh-length fit (just above the knee) offers full coverage for carefree movement; built-in bikini bottom ensures smooth, soft, breathable comfort\nHigh-waist design offer slimming tummy control and an overall flattering fit\nPairs nicely with a rash guard, tankini, or bikini swim top or a sporty crop or running top; Black or Navy Blue color options for easy coordinating\nUPF 50+ fabric offers excellent sun protection-blocks covered skin from harmful Ultraviolet A and Ultraviolet B rays (UVA and UVB)","bullets":"[\"Modest, stretchy, fitted swim shorts for women; quick drying and lightweight; comfortable, skin-friendly material (helps prevent chafing); ideal for surfing, snorkeling, kayaking, beach volley ball, and other outdoor fun in the sun\", \"Thigh-length fit (just above the knee) offers full coverage for carefree movement; built-in bikini bottom ensures smooth, soft, breathable comfort\", \"High-waist design offer slimming tummy control and an overall flattering fit\", \"Pairs nicely with a rash guard, tankini, or bikini swim top or a sporty crop or running top; Black or Navy Blue color options for easy coordinating\", \"UPF 50+ fabric offers excellent sun protection-blocks covered skin from harmful Ultraviolet A and Ultraviolet B rays (UVA and UVB)\"]","keywords":"[\"women high waisted long swim shorts board short swim bottom boyleg beachwear surf jammer swimming shorts\"]","node_path":"Categories/Women/Swimwear/Shorts","created_at":"2023-12-24T04:27:22Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abe9e"},"product_id":3059,"item_id":"B07NBDG7VC","category_id":159,"name":"Basic Care Tioconazole Ointment 6.5%, Vaginal Antifungal; 1-Dose Treatment for Vaginal Yeast Infection","brand":"Basic Care","color":"","weight_lb":0.08,"price_cents":1499,"stock":76,"description":"Active ingredient: This product contains Tioconazole, a vaginal antifungal, which compares to the active ingredient in Monistat 1.\nOne dose treatment: ready-to-use pre-filled applicator provides a one dose treatment for vaginal yeast infection.\nVaginal antifungal medicine like Basic Care Tioconazole ointment 6.5% cures most vaginal yeast infections. Just one dose of treatment with the pre-filled applicator will provide some relief within one day and complete relief of symptoms within 7 days.\nA vaginal yeast infection is a fungal infection that causes irritation, discharge and intense vaginal itching.\nSymptoms: yeast infection symptoms can range from mild to moderate, and include: vaginal itching and irritation (in the vagina and vulva), redness and swelling of the vulva, vaginal rash, vaginal pain and soreness, watery vaginal discharge, a burning sensation - during Intercourse or while urinating, and thick, white, odor-free vaginal discharge with a cottage cheese appearance.","bullets":"[\"Active ingredient: This product contains Tioconazole, a vaginal antifungal, which compares to the active ingredient in Monistat 1.\", \"One dose treatment: ready-to-use pre-filled applicator provides a one dose treatment for vaginal yeast infection.\", \"Vaginal antifungal medicine like Basic Care Tioconazole ointment 6.5% cures most vaginal yeast infections. Just one dose of treatment with the pre-filled applicator will provide some relief within one day and complete relief of symptoms within 7 days.\", \"A vaginal yeast infection is a fungal infection that causes irritation, discharge and intense vaginal itching.\", \"Symptoms: yeast infection symptoms can range from mild to moderate, and include: vaginal itching and irritation (in the vagina and vulva), redness and swelling of the vulva, vaginal rash, vaginal pain and soreness, watery vaginal discharge, a burning sensation - during Intercourse or while urinating, and thick, white, odor-free vaginal discharge with a cottage cheese appearance.\"]","keywords":"[\"medical supplies & equipment;mobility aids;yeast-infection-treatment-products\", \"basic care\", \"tioconazole 1\", \"health personal care\", \"yeast-infection-treatment-products\", \"basic care health personal care\", \"basic care tioconazole 1 health personal care\", \"vaginal yeast infection, vaginal antifungal, monistat, vagina, vaginal itching, vaginal discharge, internal yeast infection, vaginal infection\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-08-18T05:15:01Z"}
