{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abec8"},"product_id":3101,"item_id":"B07NRZ741N","category_id":295,"name":"WHOLE PAWS Grain Free Blueberry & Cinnamon Recipe Biscuits, 16 OZ","brand":"Whole Paws","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":2599,"stock":47,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market.\nMix real blueberries, potatoes and molasses with a few easily pronounced premium ingredients, and you've got a dog-treat-hit on your hands.\nLow, slow baking makes for a loud, tail-wagging crunch and enticing cinnamon-tinged flavors create extra focus for tricks.\nMade with real Blueberries!\nMade without Corn, Soy or Wheat, and Grain Free!","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market.\", \"Mix real blueberries, potatoes and molasses with a few easily pronounced premium ingredients, and you've got a dog-treat-hit on your hands.\", \"Low, slow baking makes for a loud, tail-wagging crunch and enticing cinnamon-tinged flavors create extra focus for tricks.\", \"Made with real Blueberries!\", \"Made without Corn, Soy or Wheat, and Grain Free!\"]","keywords":"[\"pet\", \"dog\", \"treats\", \"biscuits\", \"grain-free\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-03-20T16:25:35Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abec9"},"product_id":3102,"item_id":"B07NS5RP13","category_id":113,"name":"Whole Paws Grain Free Baked Salmon Recipe Dog Jerky Bites, 5 oz","brand":"Whole Paws","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":699,"stock":12,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market.\nSalmon has long been treasured for its bold flavor and essential fatty acids - dogs know this.\nBake the salmon for extra flavor then mix with a few easily pronounced premium jerky ingredients, and you're holding a treat rock star in your hand - and your dog knows every song.\n#1 Ingredient is real salmon! Omega-3 Oils help support healthy coat and skin.\nMade without Corn, Soy or Wheat, and Grain Free!","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market.\", \"Salmon has long been treasured for its bold flavor and essential fatty acids - dogs know this.\", \"Bake the salmon for extra flavor then mix with a few easily pronounced premium jerky ingredients, and you're holding a treat rock star in your hand - and your dog knows every song.\", \"#1 Ingredient is real salmon! Omega-3 Oils help support healthy coat and skin.\", \"Made without Corn, Soy or Wheat, and Grain Free!\"]","keywords":"[\"pet\", \"dog\", \"treats\", \"jerky\", \"grain-free\", \"salmon\", \"baked\"]","node_path":"Categories","created_at":"2024-06-09T12:05:00Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abeca"},"product_id":3103,"item_id":"B07NS5RQPP","category_id":113,"name":"Whole Paws Lactose & Grain Free Cheese Dog Chew, Medium, 1 ct","brand":"Whole Paws","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":599,"stock":94,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market.\nWhat dog doesn't love cheese? The beauty of our chews is that they're hard-smoked for the kind of chewiness that'll keep your dog good and busy - and happy.\nHandcrafted using a traditional Nepalese-inspired method, they're pressed, patiently smoked, and ready for some eager, focused chewing.\nMade without corn, soy or wheat, our chews are nothing but good stuff for your good, four-legged friend.\nFor dogs 35 pounds or under.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market.\", \"What dog doesn't love cheese? The beauty of our chews is that they're hard-smoked for the kind of chewiness that'll keep your dog good and busy - and happy.\", \"Handcrafted using a traditional Nepalese-inspired method, they're pressed, patiently smoked, and ready for some eager, focused chewing.\", \"Made without corn, soy or wheat, our chews are nothing but good stuff for your good, four-legged friend.\", \"For dogs 35 pounds or under.\"]","keywords":"[\"pet\", \"dog\", \"treats\", \"bones\", \"chew\", \"cheese, extra-large\", \"grain-free\", \"lactose-free\"]","node_path":"Categories","created_at":"2024-01-18T00:22:01Z"}
