ucts. If you aren't satisfied, we'll refund you for any reason within a year of purchase. 1-877-485-0385\", \"An Amazon brand\"]","keywords":"[\"coffee\", \"coffee k cups\", \"k cups coffee\", \"coffee cups\", \"coffee pods\", \"coffee pod\", \"keurig k cups\", \"keurig coffee pods\", \"coffee pods for keurig\", \"keurig pods\", \"keurig cups\", \"dark roast k cups\", \"dark roast coffee\", \"dark roast coffee k cups\", \"dark roast coffee k cup\", \"dark roast\", \"k-cups\", \"sinlge-serve\", \"happy belly\", \"keurig\"]","node_path":"Categories/Beverages/Coffee, Tea & Cocoa/Coffee/Single-Serve Capsules & Pods","created_at":"2023-04-01T03:50:40Z"}
