{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abedd"},"product_id":3122,"item_id":"B07P5LLX43","category_id":91,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Lauren Down Filled Oversized Ottoman with Hardwood Frame, 46.5\"W, Chocolate","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Chocolate","weight_lb":66.0,"price_cents":22999,"stock":23,"description":"Dimensions: 46\"W x 46\"D x 19\"H\nSoft down-filled cushions on a frame of solid hardwood mean this ottoman offers plush support and security. Neutral chocolate-colored upholstery allows this piece to blend into your existing color scheme with ease.\nSolid hardwood frame with moisture-repellent, stain-resistant fabric made of 98% polyester, 2% nylon; down-filled seat and back cushions\nWide surface provides a comfortable space for rest or extra seating.\nClassic design will fit any space.\nNo assembly required\nAvoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Dimensions: 46\\\"W x 46\\\"D x 19\\\"H\", \"Soft down-filled cushions on a frame of solid hardwood mean this ottoman offers plush support and security. Neutral chocolate-colored upholstery allows this piece to blend into your existing color scheme with ease.\", \"Solid hardwood frame with moisture-repellent, stain-resistant fabric made of 98% polyester, 2% nylon; down-filled seat and back cushions\", \"Wide surface provides a comfortable space for rest or extra seating.\", \"Classic design will fit any space.\", \"No assembly required\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"tray\", \"bed\", \"studio\", \"nightstand\", \"recliner\", \"cushioned\", \"small\", \"furnture\", \"big\", \"mirror\", \"fur\", \"deep\", \"tv\", \"swivel\", \"loveseat\", \"saddle\", \"beauty\", \"crystal\", \"adults\", \"chaise\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Accent Furniture/Ottomans","created_at":"2023-05-21T16:27:48Z"}
