{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abee5"},"product_id":3130,"item_id":"B07P6JTSYP","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Aiden Mid-Century Leather Chair with Tapered Wood Legs, 35\"W, Black","brand":"Rivet","color":"Black","weight_lb":58.3,"price_cents":8699,"stock":0,"description":"This chair features easy-care leather with removable cushions that will help keep cleaning simple, and the attractive black color will blend in with the decor of almost any room. Foam padding offers comfort, but the solid hardwood frame ensures stability and support.\n35\"W x 36\"D x 30\"H\nSolid hardwood frame with tapered wood legs and top grain leather\nRemovable and reversible back cushions\nMid-century style and top grain leather combine to make this a welcome addition to any room.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nAvoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This chair features easy-care leather with removable cushions that will help keep cleaning simple, and the attractive black color will blend in with the decor of almost any room. Foam padding offers comfort, but the solid hardwood frame ensures stability and support.\", \"35\\\"W x 36\\\"D x 30\\\"H\", \"Solid hardwood frame with tapered wood legs and top grain leather\", \"Removable and reversible back cushions\", \"Mid-century style and top grain leather combine to make this a welcome addition to any room.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"studio\", \"recliner\", \"big\", \"swivel\", \"egg\", \"signature\", \"seniors\", \"elderly\", \"lazy\", \"mid\", \"royalty\", \"dome\", \"boy\", \"lazyboy\", \"baxton\", \"modern\", \"furniture\", \"design\", \"by\", \"chairs\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2023-06-10T00:05:51Z"}
