{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abee7"},"product_id":3132,"item_id":"B07P6JVMJL","category_id":93,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Cove Modern Tufted Loveseat with Tapered Legs, Mid-Century, 56\"W, Caramel","brand":"Rivet","color":"Caramel","weight_lb":73.0,"price_cents":51999,"stock":61,"description":"This modern loveseat comes with tufted back and seat cushions atop tall tapered legs. The design offers simple lines that fit well with most decors, and the solid wood frame give this beautiful piece a sense of solidity and timelessness.\n32.7\"W x 33.9\"D x 35.4\"H\nSolid wood frame and legs; leather upholstery\nAdd style when you add extra seating with this gorgeous modern loveseat.\nTufting on the seat and back cushions adds elegance to this modern loveseat.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nWipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This modern loveseat comes with tufted back and seat cushions atop tall tapered legs. The design offers simple lines that fit well with most decors, and the solid wood frame give this beautiful piece a sense of solidity and timelessness.\", \"32.7\\\"W x 33.9\\\"D x 35.4\\\"H\", \"Solid wood frame and legs; leather upholstery\", \"Add style when you add extra seating with this gorgeous modern loveseat.\", \"Tufting on the seat and back cushions adds elegance to this modern loveseat.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"bed\", \"recliner\", \"small\", \"love\", \"sectionals\", \"queen\", \"signature\", \"sierra\", \"shaped\", \"mid\", \"couch\", \"sleepers\", \"chesterfield\", \"rolled\", \"couches\", \"space\", \"out\", \"ikea\", \"sleep\", \"button\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Sofas & Couches","created_at":"2024-01-29T03:34:13Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abee8"},"product_id":3133,"item_id":"B07P6JVMZD","category_id":93,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Bradbury Chesterfield Classic Sofa, 92.9\"W, Slate","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Slate","weight_lb":127.6,"price_cents":100999,"stock":11,"description":"This lovely sofa has the low button-tufted back, scroll arms, and short legs that are the hallmark of the classic chesterfield style. Whether as a statement piece or part of a living-room suite, this sofa will be a welcome addition to any decor.\nDimensions: 93\"W x 39\"D x 30\"H\nSolid hardwood frame; upholstery: 98% polyester, 2% nylon\nRemovable and reversible seat cushions\nA classic style updated in stain-resistant fabric makes this perfect for the modern home.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nAvoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This lovely sofa has the low button-tufted back, scroll arms, and short legs that are the hallmark of the classic chesterfield style. Whether as a statement piece or part of a living-room suite, this sofa will be a welcome addition to any decor.\", \"Dimensions: 93\\\"W x 39\\\"D x 30\\\"H\", \"Solid hardwood frame; upholstery: 98% polyester, 2% nylon\", \"Removable and reversible seat cushions\", \"A classic style updated in stain-resistant fabric makes this perfect for the modern home.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"bed\", \"recliner\", \"small\", \"cortinas\", \"sectionals\", \"rooms\", \"casa\", \"calion\", \"memory\", \"loveseat\", \"smith\", \"queen\", \"signature\", \"foam\", \"shaped\", \"chaise\", \"couch\", \"facing\", \"sleepers\", \"couches\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Sofas & Couches","created_at":"2023-11-03T03:02:22Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abee9"},"product_id":3134,"item_id":"B07P6P2L22","category_id":23,"name":"AmazonBasics 65W One-Port USB-C 3.0 Wall Charger for Laptops, Tablets and Phones - Black","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Black","weight_lb":0.32,"price_cents":3399,"stock":29,"description":"Portable charger for phones, laptops, tablets, and more\nProvides lightning fast charge for Type-C phones, laptops, and tablets such as Macbooks, the 2018 iPad Pro, iPhone Xs Max Xs Xr X 8 8 Plus, Google Pixel 3 /3xl / 2 / 2xl, Nintendo Switch, Samsung Galaxy Note 9 / Note 8 / S9 / S9 Plus / S8 / S8 Plus/ S7, Nexus 5X 6P and more\nBuilt-in device detection to ensure the fastest possible charging for the specific plugged-in device; over-current protection (OCP) helps keep connected devices safe\nBlue LED indicates when charger is plugged into a power outlet, plus makes the charging port easy to find in the dark\nSafety features that include protection against over-voltage, over-heating, and short circuiting\nLightweight, compact design that’s easy to bring with you to use while traveling, at work, or at home\nIncludes one USB wall charger; cable not included. Backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty","bullets":"[\"Portable charger for phones, laptops, tablets, and more\", \"Provides lightning fast charge for Type-C phones, laptops, and tablets such as Macbooks, the 2018 iPad Pro, iPhone Xs Max Xs Xr X 8 8 Plus, Google Pixel 3 /3xl / 2 / 2xl, Nintendo Switch, Samsung Galaxy Note 9 / Note 8 / S9 / S9 Plus / S8 / S8 Plus/ S7, Nexus 5X 6P and more\", \"Built-in device detection to ensure the fastest possible charging for the specific plugged-in device; over-current protection (OCP) helps keep connected devices safe\", \"Blue LED indicates when charger is plugged into a power outlet, plus makes the charging port easy to find in the dark\", \"Safety features that include protection against over-voltage, over-heating, and short circuiting\", \"Lightweight, compact design that’s easy to bring with you to use while traveling, at work, or at home\", \"Includes one USB wall charger; cable not included. Backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"anker,45,ravpower,quick,hp,dongle,(2,laptop,type,poweriq,ipod,f272wm,45w,macbook,pavilion,pavillion,piq,block,cube,61w,portal,10,tech,adapter,nitride,crossery,15,multiport,rav,portals,13252,ports),dodocool,night,hdmi,pro,100w,av,5,6,60,rp,65,iii,apple,gan,87w,digital,c,mini,pc112,usbc,pd,watt,60w\"]","node_path":"Categories/Cell Phones & Accessories/Accessories/Chargers/Wall Chargers","created_at":"2024-01-15T11:21:23Z"}
