{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abef5"},"product_id":3146,"item_id":"B07P81V1SD","category_id":144,"name":"Amazon Brand - Solimo Eucalyptus Essential Oil, 100% Pure & Natural, 15 ml","brand":"Amazon Brand - Solimo","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1099,"stock":66,"description":"Essential oil for aromatherapy made from natural Eucalyptus globulus Labill\n100% Pure and natural oil manufactured using steam distillation\nProvides a pleasing eucalyptus fragrance known having a cooling and deodorizing effect on the body\nEucalyptus helps with fevers, migraine and malaria and soothes inflammation and clears the head from the stuffiness of colds and hay fever\nUsage direction: Use with aroma diffuser for the best experience\nSafety direction: For external use only. Do not ingest or apply directly to skin or hair. Meant only for aromatic use\nStorage instructions: Keep away from direct sunlight. Store in a cool and dry place. Keep out of reach of children.","bullets":"[\"Essential oil for aromatherapy made from natural Eucalyptus globulus Labill\", \"100% Pure and natural oil manufactured using steam distillation\", \"Provides a pleasing eucalyptus fragrance known having a cooling and deodorizing effect on the body\", \"Eucalyptus helps with fevers, migraine and malaria and soothes inflammation and clears the head from the stuffiness of colds and hay fever\", \"Usage direction: Use with aroma diffuser for the best experience\", \"Safety direction: For external use only. Do not ingest or apply directly to skin or hair. Meant only for aromatic use\", \"Storage instructions: Keep away from direct sunlight. Store in a cool and dry place. Keep out of reach of children.\"]","keywords":"[\"aromatic oil\", \"essential oil\", \"natural essential oil\", \"aromatherapy\", \"massage oil\", \"fragrance oil\", \"oil for massage\", \"home spa\", \"natural aroma oil\", \"aromatherapy oil\", \"aroma oil\", \"aroma oil for diffuser\"]","node_path":"Categories/Health Care/Alternative Medicine/Scented Oils","created_at":"2023-10-23T01:04:01Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abef6"},"product_id":3147,"item_id":"B07P824Z6B","category_id":271,"name":"Amazon Brand - Solimo Stainless Steel Inner Lid Pressure Cooker (2L, ISI Certified, Induction and Gas Stove Compatible)","brand":"Amazon Brand - Solimo","color":"Silver","weight_lb":"","price_cents":4299,"stock":2,"description":"2L pressure cooker made from high quality, 100% food grade Stainless Steel; Compatible with induction and gas stoves\nComes with ISI mark, ensuring quality and safety standards as per government certification norms\nPackage contents - 1 Pressure cooker base, 1 Lid, 1 Whistle valve, 1 gasket\nHeavy gauge premium Stainless Steel with thickness of 3.25mm and weight of 1.34 kg ensuring rapid yet even heating and pressure build up\nIdeal inner lid mechanism for cooking rice, dal, pulses like channa etc\nBakelite handle that prevent heat transfer to the hands and has a 4-rivet bracket design that offers great sturdiness and resistance to general wear and tear\nOval opening that allows for easier sliding of the lid in and out of the base\nThe pressure cooker has dimensions of 334.3 x 177.0 x 167.9 mm with handle dimensions of 148.3 x 25.2 mm","bullets":"[\"2L pressure cooker made from high quality, 100% food grade Stainless Steel; Compatible with induction and gas stoves\", \"Comes with ISI mark, ensuring quality and safety standards as per government certification norms\", \"Package contents - 1 Pressure cooker base, 1 Lid, 1 Whistle valve, 1 gasket\", \"Heavy gauge premium Stainless Steel with thickness of 3.25mm and weight of 1.34 kg ensuring rapid yet even heating and pressure build up\", \"Ideal inner lid mechanism for cooking rice, dal, pulses like channa etc\", \"Bakelite handle that prevent heat transfer to the hands and has a 4-rivet bracket design that offers great sturdiness and resistance to general wear and tear\", \"Oval opening that allows for easier sliding of the lid in and out of the base\", \"The pressure cooker has dimensions of 334.3 x 177.0 x 167.9 mm with handle dimensions of 148.3 x 25.2 mm\"]","keywords":"[\"cookware\", \"steamer\", \"rice cooker\", \"isi\", \"isi mark\", \"outer lid\", \"inner lid\", \"cooker\", \"pressure cooker\"]","node_path":"Categories/Kitchen & Dining/Cookware/Pots & Pans/Pressure Cookers","created_at":"2023-09-04T14:25:43Z"}
