{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abefb"},"product_id":3152,"item_id":"B07P8ST73W","category_id":93,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Lauren Down-Filled Oversized Leather Sofa Couch with Hardwood Frame, 89\"W, Cognac","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Cognac","weight_lb":147.4,"price_cents":48999,"stock":6,"description":"Dimensions: 89\"W x 45\"D x 37\"H\nSoft down-filled cushions on a frame of solid hardwood mean this sofa offers plush support and security. Neutral cognac-colored leather upholstery allows this piece to blend into your existing color scheme with ease.\nSolid hardwood frame with moisture-repellent, stain-resistant fabric made of 98% polyester, 2% nylon; down-filled seat and back cushions\nRemovable and reversible seat cushion.\nClassic design will fit any space.\nNo assembly required\nAvoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Dimensions: 89\\\"W x 45\\\"D x 37\\\"H\", \"Soft down-filled cushions on a frame of solid hardwood mean this sofa offers plush support and security. Neutral cognac-colored leather upholstery allows this piece to blend into your existing color scheme with ease.\", \"Solid hardwood frame with moisture-repellent, stain-resistant fabric made of 98% polyester, 2% nylon; down-filled seat and back cushions\", \"Removable and reversible seat cushion.\", \"Classic design will fit any space.\", \"No assembly required\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"bed\", \"recliner\", \"small\", \"de\", \"sectionals\", \"deep\", \"loveseat\", \"queen\", \"shaped\", \"chaise\", \"mid\", \"sof\\\"xe1\", \"chesterfield\", \"rolled\", \"seats\", \"down\", \"couches\", \"space\", \"catanzaro\", \"out\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Sofas & Couches","created_at":"2023-03-12T00:40:45Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abefc"},"product_id":3153,"item_id":"B07P8STHJC","category_id":93,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Leila Tufted Leather Loveseat Sofa, 69\"W, Sod","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Sod","weight_lb":115.0,"price_cents":80999,"stock":0,"description":"Vintage design and chic leather upholstery combine in this piece, making it the perfect fit for modern and classic decor schemes. Foam-padded cushions and solid wood legs ensure that this loveseat is functional and comfortable as well as a stylish addition to any lounge area.\n69\"W x 36\"D x 31\"\nSturdy wood frame and solid wood legs in a dark walnut finish with rich 100% top-grain leather. Foam cushions provide lasting support and comfort.\nTreat yourself to luxury with this striking vintage-look loveseat. The classic upholstery and solid wood legs in an espresso finish exude opulence.\nRich leather upholstery adds sophistication and comfort to any space.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nVacuum or wipe with a dry cloth. Spot clean if needed.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Vintage design and chic leather upholstery combine in this piece, making it the perfect fit for modern and classic decor schemes. Foam-padded cushions and solid wood legs ensure that this loveseat is functional and comfortable as well as a stylish addition to any lounge area.\", \"69\\\"W x 36\\\"D x 31\\\"\", \"Sturdy wood frame and solid wood legs in a dark walnut finish with rich 100% top-grain leather. Foam cushions provide lasting support and comfort.\", \"Treat yourself to luxury with this striking vintage-look loveseat. The classic upholstery and solid wood legs in an espresso finish exude opulence.\", \"Rich leather upholstery adds sophistication and comfort to any space.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Vacuum or wipe with a dry cloth. Spot clean if needed.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"recliner\", \"sectionals\", \"queen\", \"sierra\", \"couch\", \"mid\", \"chesterfield\", \"rolled\", \"couches\", \"button\", \"homelegance\", \"daybed\", \"gray\", \"white\", \"furniture\", \"trundle\", \"savonburg\", \"sectional\", \"power\", \"arm\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Sofas & Couches","created_at":"2024-02-02T04:04:09Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abefd"},"product_id":3154,"item_id":"B07P8STJ2Q","category_id":93,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Aiden Mid-Century Sofa with Tapered Wood Legs, 87\"W, Wathet Blue","brand":"Rivet","color":"Wathet Blue","weight_lb":114.4,"price_cents":32999,"stock":44,"description":"This sofa features easy-care upholstery with removable cushions that will help keep cleaning simple, and the attractive blue fabric will blend in with the decor of almost any room. Foam padding offers comfort, but the solid hardwood frame ensures stability and support.\n87\"W x 36\"D x 30\"H\nSolid hardwood frame with tapered wood legs\nRemovable and reversible back cushions\nMid-century style and easy-care fabric combine to make this a welcome addition to any room.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nAvoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This sofa features easy-care upholstery with removable cushions that will help keep cleaning simple, and the attractive blue fabric will blend in with the decor of almost any room. Foam padding offers comfort, but the solid hardwood frame ensures stability and support.\", \"87\\\"W x 36\\\"D x 30\\\"H\", \"Solid hardwood frame with tapered wood legs\", \"Removable and reversible back cushions\", \"Mid-century style and easy-care fabric combine to make this a welcome addition to any room.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"bed\", \"small\", \"recliner\", \"microfiber\", \"cortinas\", \"sectionals\", \"rooms\", \"loveseat\", \"smith\", \"queen\", \"signature\", \"sierra\", \"shaped\", \"chaise\", \"mid\", \"couch\", \"sleepers\", \"chesterfield\", \"couches\", \"space\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Sofas & Couches","created_at":"2024-03-28T18:09:40Z"}
