{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf00"},"product_id":3157,"item_id":"B07P9Y5SDP","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Andrews Contemporary Top-Grain Leather Chair with Removable Cushions, 40\"W, Dark Brown","brand":"Rivet","color":"Dark Brown","weight_lb":74.8,"price_cents":38999,"stock":13,"description":"This chair features removable cushions in an attractive brown leather that will bring class to your living room or den or any room you add it to. Foam padding offers comfort, but the solid hardwood frame ensures stability and support.\n40\"W x 37\"D x 36\"H\nSolid hardwood frame with tapered wood legs and top grain leather\nRemovable back and seat cushions\nMid-century style and top grain leather combine to make this a welcome addition to any room.\nNo assembly required\nAvoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This chair features removable cushions in an attractive brown leather that will bring class to your living room or den or any room you add it to. Foam padding offers comfort, but the solid hardwood frame ensures stability and support.\", \"40\\\"W x 37\\\"D x 36\\\"H\", \"Solid hardwood frame with tapered wood legs and top grain leather\", \"Removable back and seat cushions\", \"Mid-century style and top grain leather combine to make this a welcome addition to any room.\", \"No assembly required\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"studio\", \"recliner\", \"tray\", \"heat\", \"big\", \"game\", \"swivel\", \"hugger\", \"egg\", \"movie\", \"signature\", \"seniors\", \"elderly\", \"lazy\", \"infinite\", \"mid\", \"couch\", \"royalty\", \"dome\", \"boy\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2024-01-20T22:17:12Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf01"},"product_id":3158,"item_id":"B07PB3MTJJ","category_id":73,"name":"Amazon Basics Suitcase Carrying Case with Extended Capacity with Built-In TSA Lock Premium Hardside - grey","brand":"Amazonベーシック(AmazonBasics)","color":"grays","weight_lb":18.67,"price_cents":10999,"stock":29,"description":"Imported\nPremium carry-on hardside rolling suitcase perfect for weekend trips or overseas travel. Built-in TSA lock\nProtective hard shell made of flexible polycarbonate material, not ABS like the original, but very durable. Choose from several stylish colors\n15% more expandable Sturdy and durable zipper Telescoping handle for easy carrying Secured short handle\nFour swivel double casters allow for smooth rotation and movement in any direction. Amazon Basics 1 Year Limited Warranty\nSet of 2 suitcases in 20.1 inches (51 cm) and 28.0 inches (71 cm). Please note that this item will be shipped as one package with a small suitcase inside a large suitcase.\nFirst time opening your suitcase: set the code to \"000\" and slide the keyhole button.\nTo set a new code, keep the code \"000\" and press the button with a pen. Then remove the pen and set the unique code (e.g. 836). Then slide the button forward to set the cord.\nFully lined with dividers Compression padding provides ample interior space 150 denier polyester divider with three zippered pockets for convenient storage of small items.","bullets":"[\"Imported\", \"Premium carry-on hardside rolling suitcase perfect for weekend trips or overseas travel. Built-in TSA lock\", \"Protective hard shell made of flexible polycarbonate material, not ABS like the original, but very durable. Choose from several stylish colors\", \"15% more expandable Sturdy and durable zipper Telescoping handle for easy carrying Secured short handle\", \"Four swivel double casters allow for smooth rotation and movement in any direction. Amazon Basics 1 Year Limited Warranty\", \"Set of 2 suitcases in 20.1 inches (51 cm) and 28.0 inches (71 cm). Please note that this item will be shipped as one package with a small suitcase inside a large suitcase.\", \"First time opening your suitcase: set the code to \\\"000\\\" and slide the keyhole button.\", \"To set a new code, keep the code \\\"000\\\" and press the button with a pen. Then remove the pen and set the unique code (e.g. 836). Then slide the button forward to set the cord.\", \"Fully lined with dividers Compression padding provides ample interior space 150 denier polyester divider with three zippered pockets for convenient storage of small items.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-03-11T02:04:52Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf02"},"product_id":3159,"item_id":"B07PB3P1N8","category_id":73,"name":"AmazonBasics 20-Inch Carry-on, Black","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Black","weight_lb":7.2,"price_cents":7199,"stock":31,"description":"Imported\nInterior capacity: 39 Litres\nProtective hard shell made of supremely durable, yet flexible, polycarbonate material (instead of ABS like the original); choice of stylish color\nFully lined interior with divider; compression pad helps free up space; 150D-polyester interior organizer with 3 zippered pockets for securing smaller items\nExpandable for up to 15% additional packing capacity; solid, strong zippers; sturdy telescoping handle; securely mounted short handle\n4 double spinning wheels ensure smooth-rolling mobility in any direction\nTo open luggage for the first time: set code to “000” and slide the button with keyhole\nTo set your new code: keep the code at \"000\" and push button with a pen; remove the pen; set your unique code (e.g. 836); slide the button forward; the code is set\n3-year limited warranty for luggage\nFor customer service and warranty related queries please contact_us on: [1800-419-0416] (available Monday to Saturday from 9:30 AM to 6:00 PM except national holidays)","bullets":"[\"Imported\", \"Interior capacity: 39 Litres\", \"Protective hard shell made of supremely durable, yet flexible, polycarbonate material (instead of ABS like the original); choice of stylish color\", \"Fully lined interior with divider; compression pad helps free up space; 150D-polyester interior organizer with 3 zippered pockets for securing smaller items\", \"Expandable for up to 15% additional packing capacity; solid, strong zippers; sturdy telescoping handle; securely mounted short handle\", \"4 double spinning wheels ensure smooth-rolling mobility in any direction\", \"To open luggage for the first time: set code to “000” and slide the button with keyhole\", \"To set your new code: keep the code at \\\"000\\\" and push button with a pen; remove the pen; set your unique code (e.g. 836); slide the button forward; the code is set\", \"3-year limited warranty for luggage\", \"For customer service and warranty related queries please contact_us on: [1800-419-0416] (available Monday to Saturday from 9:30 AM to 6:00 PM except national holidays)\"]","keywords":"[\"luggage,carry on,carry on luggage,spinner,luggage spinner,suitcase,suit case,carry-on luggage,bag,suitcases\"]","node_path":"Categories/Luggage/Suitcases & Trolley Bags","created_at":"2023-04-03T04:32:54Z"}
