{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf08"},"product_id":3165,"item_id":"B07PBZ9CSS","category_id":93,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Kristin Mid-Century Wood-Framed Sleeper Sofa, 76\"W, Stone","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Stone","weight_lb":140.0,"price_cents":113999,"stock":62,"description":"This sofa’s foam-padded cushions sit loosely on the hardwood frame, making them easy to remove and creating a casual look that gives any space a welcoming and comfortable appearance. Performance fabrics and reversible seat cushions make this sofa easy to maintain.\n76\"W x 37\"D x 37.5\"H\nPerformance fabric over padded solid-wood frame with mortise-and-tenon construction; poly-Dacron foam filling\nLoose back and seat cushions are removable and reversible, ensuring durability and comfort. Sofa easily opens to provide extra sleeping space.\nSewn-in detailing along front provides texture.\nNo assembly required\nQuickly blot spills with a damp cloth. Use a soft, dry cloth for routine care.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This sofa’s foam-padded cushions sit loosely on the hardwood frame, making them easy to remove and creating a casual look that gives any space a welcoming and comfortable appearance. Performance fabrics and reversible seat cushions make this sofa easy to maintain.\", \"76\\\"W x 37\\\"D x 37.5\\\"H\", \"Performance fabric over padded solid-wood frame with mortise-and-tenon construction; poly-Dacron foam filling\", \"Loose back and seat cushions are removable and reversible, ensuring durability and comfort. Sofa easily opens to provide extra sleeping space.\", \"Sewn-in detailing along front provides texture.\", \"No assembly required\", \"Quickly blot spills with a damp cloth. Use a soft, dry cloth for routine care.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"recliner\", \"tray\", \"heat\", \"big\", \"armless\", \"yard\", \"swivel\", \"hugger\", \"movie\", \"perfect\", \"navy\", \"signature\", \"elderly\", \