{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf09"},"product_id":3166,"item_id":"B07PBZVP9S","category_id":93,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Charles Classic Oversized Upholstered Loveseat, 63\"W, Dove","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Dove","weight_lb":119.0,"price_cents":50999,"stock":46,"description":"Let yourself be wrapped in comfort by this generously plush loveseat. Traditional rolled arms and turned wood legs are combined with modern upholstery for a welcome update on a classic piece.\n63\"W x 39\"D x 38\"H\nSolid hardwood frame; upholstery: 95% polyester, 5% nylon\nRemovable back and seat cushions make upkeep a breeze.\nA traditional silhouette is paired with modern, stain-resistant fabric, making this the perfect addition to a busy home.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nVacuum or wipe with a dry cloth. Spot clean if needed.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Let yourself be wrapped in comfort by this generously plush loveseat. Traditional rolled arms and turned wood legs are combined with modern upholstery for a welcome update on a classic piece.\", \"63\\\"W x 39\\\"D x 38\\\"H\", \"Solid hardwood frame; upholstery: 95% polyester, 5% nylon\", \"Removable back and seat cushions make upkeep a breeze.\", \"A traditional silhouette is paired with modern, stain-resistant fabric, making this the perfect addition to a busy home.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Vacuum or wipe with a dry cloth. Spot clean if needed.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"bed\", \"small\", \"sectionals\", \"queen\", \"signature\", \"shaped\", \"chaise\", \"couch\", \"facing\", \"sleepers\", \"chesterfield\", \"couches\", \"out\", \"sleep\", \"button\", \"homelegance\", \"daybed\", \"gray\", \"para\", \"furniture\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Sofas & Couches","created_at":"2023-04-26T11:25:02Z"}
