{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf80"},"product_id":3285,"item_id":"B07QB6C9R8","category_id":84,"name":"AmazonBasics Retro Hairpin Console Table - Espresso with Black Legs","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Espresso/Black","weight_lb":24.4,"price_cents":22999,"stock":72,"description":"Mid-century modern-inspired desk for offices, studios, bedrooms, or anywhere desk space is needed\nHairpin-style powder-coated metal legs add style and stability\nIdeal for computer work, writing, as a vanity, console table, and more\nSlim, minimal design saves space while offering an ample work area\nSturdy MDF wood plank desk surface\nEasy assembly with provided hardware and instructions","bullets":"[\"Mid-century modern-inspired desk for offices, studios, bedrooms, or anywhere desk space is needed\", \"Hairpin-style powder-coated metal legs add style and stability\", \"Ideal for computer work, writing, as a vanity, console table, and more\", \"Slim, minimal design saves space while offering an ample work area\", \"Sturdy MDF wood plank desk surface\", \"Easy assembly with provided hardware and instructions\"]","keywords":"[\"desk\", \"computer desk\", \"office desk\", \"gaming desk\", \"l shaped desk\", \"corner desk\", \"desks\", \"white desk\", \"small desk\", \"standing desk\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Home Office Furniture/Home Office Desks","created_at":"2024-03-06T10:55:10Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf81"},"product_id":3286,"item_id":"B07QB6L2CN","category_id":29,"name":"AmazonBasics DisplayPort to HDMI Monitor Adapter - 5-Pack","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"","weight_lb":0.56,"price_cents":1199,"stock":7,"description":"5-Pack\nDisplayPort to HDMI Adapter connects your computer to an HDTV for audio/video streaming or to an HD monitor or projector—HDMI cable required (not included)\nDisplayPort is not compatible with USB port. Please ensure your computer has a DisplayPort before purchasing.\nSupports video resolutions up to 1920x1200 and 1080p (Full HD) and uncompressed digital audio channels (7.1, 5.1, or 2)\nConnects any laptop or desktop equipped with a DisplayPort port (DP, DP++, or DisplayPort++) to an HDTV, monitor, or projector with HDMI input\nThe adapter is not a bi-directional adapter—it can only convert signal from DisplayPort to HDMI; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-Year Limited Warranty\nGold-plated connectors for superior signal transmission and enhanced strength","bullets":"[\"5-Pack\", \"DisplayPort to HDMI Adapter connects your computer to an HDTV for audio/video streaming or to an HD monitor or projector—HDMI cable required (not included)\", \"DisplayPort is not compatible with USB port. Please ensure your computer has a DisplayPort before purchasing.\", \"Supports video resolutions up to 1920x1200 and 1080p (Full HD) and uncompressed digital audio channels (7.1, 5.1, or 2)\", \"Connects any laptop or desktop equipped with a DisplayPort port (DP, DP++, or DisplayPort++) to an HDTV, monitor, or projector with HDMI input\", \"The adapter is not a bi-directional adapter—it can only convert signal from DisplayPort to HDMI; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-Year Limited Warranty\", \"Gold-plated connectors for superior signal transmission and enhanced strength\"]","keywords":"[\"dvid\", \"display\", \"converter\", \"dongle\", \"adaptor\", \"single\", \"cord\", \"vga\", \"connector\", \"dvi\", \"hmdi\", \"female\", \"male\", \"foot\"]","node_path":"Categories/Computers & Accessories/Computer Accessories & Peripherals/Computer Cable Adapters","created_at":"2024-01-14T21:26:47Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf82"},"product_id":3287,"item_id":"B07QB7HXYQ","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Ravenna Home Vanity 5-Piece Vanity Wall Sconce with Bathroom Hardware Set, 7\"H, Dark Bronze","brand":"Ravenna Home","color":"Dark Bronze With Double Frost Glass","weight_lb":5.0,"price_cents":5599,"stock":14,"description":"This dark bronze vanity light with 3 double-frosted glass shades and matching bathroom hardware accessories gives a streamlined, welcoming appearance to your bathroom or vanity.\nMetal construction with dark bronze finish; frosted glass shades. Sconce requires (3) A19 60-watt maximum bulbs\nVanity wall sconce measurements: 19.25\"W x 6.25\"D x 7\"H.\nOther measurements: Towel Bar: 2.2\"H x 21.28\"W x 2.72\"D. Towel Ring: 8\"H x 6.08\"W x 2.72\"D. Robe Hook: 2.2\"H x 1.54\" W x 2.72\"D. Toilet Paper Holder: 5.18\"H x 6.70\"W x 2.72\"D.\n5-piece set includes (1 each) vanity light, towel bar, hand towel ring, toilet paper holder, robe hook. Mounting hardware included.\nAssemble in 15-30 minutes\nRated for damp areas; intended for indoor use only.","bullets":"[\"This dark bronze vanity light with 3 double-frosted glass shades and matching bathroom hardware accessories gives a streamlined, welcoming appearance to your bathroom or vanity.\", \"Metal construction with dark bronze finish; frosted glass shades. Sconce requires (3) A19 60-watt maximum bulbs\", \"Vanity wall sconce measurements: 19.25\\\"W x 6.25\\\"D x 7\\\"H.\", \"Other measurements: Towel Bar: 2.2\\\"H x 21.28\\\"W x 2.72\\\"D. Towel Ring: 8\\\"H x 6.08\\\"W x 2.72\\\"D. Robe Hook: 2.2\\\"H x 1.54\\\" W x 2.72\\\"D. Toilet Paper Holder: 5.18\\\"H x 6.70\\\"W x 2.72\\\"D.\", \"5-piece set includes (1 each) vanity light, towel bar, hand towel ring, toilet paper holder, robe hook. Mounting hardware included.\", \"Assemble in 15-30 minutes\", \"Rated for damp areas; intended for indoor use only.\"]","keywords":"[\"sconce\", \"bathroom\", \"fixture\", \"rubbed\", \"wall\", \"brushed\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Wall Lights/Vanity Lights","created_at":"2024-03-01T21:21:01Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf83"},"product_id":3288,"item_id":"B07QB8JVBC","category_id":213,"name":"Ravenna Home Floral Medallion Tiled Rug, 2' x 4', Cerulean Blue with Ivory","brand":"Ravenna Home","color":"Ivory/Blue","weight_lb":2.0,"price_cents":7699,"stock":12,"description":"2'W x 4'L\n100% polypropylene; backing: 100% latex\nThis gorgeous rug is power loomed with bold floral medallions across a rich blue field.\nThe medium 0.5\" pile suits any indoor space.\nPair with rug pad (sold separately)","bullets":"[\"2'W x 4'L\", \"100% polypropylene; backing: 100% latex\", \"This gorgeous rug is power loomed with bold floral medallions across a rich blue field.\", \"The medium 0.5\\\" pile suits any indoor space.\", \"Pair with rug pad (sold separately)\"]","keywords":"[\"floral\", \"solid\", \"rug\", \"pile\", \"tile\", \"indoor\", \"medium\", \"space\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-01-24T13:25:17Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf84"},"product_id":3289,"item_id":"B07QBMQ4YF","category_id":93,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Aiden Mid-Century Sectional with Tapered Wood Legs, 86\"W, Hunter Green","brand":"Rivet","color":"Hunter Green","weight_lb":126.5,"price_cents":51999,"stock":22,"description":"This sectional features easy-care upholstery with removable cushions that will help keep cleaning simple, and the attractive green fabric will blend in with the decor of almost any room. Foam padding offers comfort, but the solid hardwood frame ensures stability and support.\n86\"W x 37\"D x 33\"H\nSolid hardwood frame with tapered wood legs\nRemovable and reversible seat and back cushions\nMid-century style and easy-care fabric combine to make this a welcome addition to any room.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nAvoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This sectional features easy-care upholstery with removable cushions that will help keep cleaning simple, and the attractive green fabric will blend in with the decor of almost any room. Foam padding offers comfort, but the solid hardwood frame ensures stability and support.\", \"86\\\"W x 37\\\"D x 33\\\"H\", \"Solid hardwood frame with tapered wood legs\", \"Removable and reversible seat and back cushions\", \"Mid-century style and easy-care fabric combine to make this a welcome addition to any room.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"bed\", \"small\", \"recliner\", \"big\", \"rocker\", \"gliding\", \"sectionals\", \"rooms\", \"casa\", \"kiwi\", \"swivel\", \"babyletto\", \"queen\", \"signature\", \"usb\", \"shaped\", \"mid\", \"couch\", \"sleepers\", \"couches\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Sofas & Couches","created_at":"2023-10-09T19:31:29Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf85"},"product_id":3290,"item_id":"B07QBMQ543","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Ravenna Home Pritchard Antique Recliner 4 Living Room Chair, Fabric, BUFF","brand":"Ravenna Home","color":"Light Grey","weight_lb":"","price_cents":17999,"stock":28,"description":"29.1\"W x 35.8\"D x 40.6\"H; seat depth: 22.8\"D\nFabric over fiberboard and iron frame\nThe upholstered fabric seat makes this a comfortable, single-chair manual recliner.\nRelax, read, or watch television in comfort in this classic recliner.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nAvoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"29.1\\\"W x 35.8\\\"D x 40.6\\\"H; seat depth: 22.8\\\"D\", \"Fabric over fiberboard and iron frame\", \"The upholstered fabric seat makes this a comfortable, single-chair manual recliner.\", \"Relax, read, or watch television in comfort in this classic recliner.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"ravenna home\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2023-02-12T22:57:48Z"}
