{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf87"},"product_id":3292,"item_id":"B07QBMQC8S","category_id":90,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Joanna Contemporary Tufted Accent Chair with Reversible Cushions, 40\"W, Grey","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Vintage","weight_lb":75.0,"price_cents":3599,"stock":25,"description":"Clean lines give this accent armchair a modern, sophisticated look. Removable seat cushions and backs are comfortable and easy to adjust, and the performance fabric upholstery can be cleaned with a cloth or simple vacuuming. Steel seat springs and a wood frame provide structure, support and durability.\nOverall: 40\"W x 37\"D x 38\"H. Seat height: 21.5\"H; seat depth: 23\"D; seat back height: 19\"H\nSteel seat springs, wood frame and wood legs add structure and durability\nLoose, reversible seat cushions and inside back cushions in 100% polyester performance fabric\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nLightly vacuum every month or two to remove dirt and dust\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Clean lines give this accent armchair a modern, sophisticated look. Removable seat cushions and backs are comfortable and easy to adjust, and the performance fabric upholstery can be cleaned with a cloth or simple vacuuming. Steel seat springs and a wood frame provide structure, support and durability.\", \"Overall: 40\\\"W x 37\\\"D x 38\\\"H. Seat height: 21.5\\\"H; seat depth: 23\\\"D; seat back height: 19\\\"H\", \"Steel seat springs, wood frame and wood legs add structure and durability\", \"Loose, reversible seat cushions and inside back cushions in 100% polyester performance fabric\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Lightly vacuum every month or two to remove dirt and dust\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"recliner\", \"sectionals\", \"sierra\", \"couch\", \"mid\", \"chesterfield\", \"gray\", \"modern\", \"white\", \"furniture\", \"sectional\", \"power\", \"reclining\", \"farmhouse\", \"sofa\", \"living\", \"set\", \"tuxedo\", \"sets\", \"modway\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture","created_at":"2023-06-21T02:26:05Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf88"},"product_id":3293,"item_id":"B07QBQBXV7","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Contemporary Curved-Back Dining Chair, 35\"H, Aqua","brand":"Rivet","color":"Aqua","weight_lb":18.92,"price_cents":5399,"stock":88,"description":"The curved back and outside channel of this dining chair create an elegant touch in any room while providing comfortable support. Aqua fabric allows a pop of color in a number of decor schemes. The solid wood frame creates a sturdy dining seat.\n24\"W x 26\"D x 35\"H; seat height: 19\"H; seat depth: 18\"D; seat back height: 15\"H\n100% polyester fabric on solid wood frame\nCurved back with outside channel\nNo assembly required\nAvoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"The curved back and outside channel of this dining chair create an elegant touch in any room while providing comfortable support. Aqua fabric allows a pop of color in a number of decor schemes. The solid wood frame creates a sturdy dining seat.\", \"24\\\"W x 26\\\"D x 35\\\"H; seat height: 19\\\"H; seat depth: 18\\\"D; seat back height: 15\\\"H\", \"100% polyester fabric on solid wood frame\", \"Curved back with outside channel\", \"No assembly required\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"gun\", \"eames\", \"waiting\", \"folding\", \"mid\", \"lucite\", \"teens\", \"leg\", \"rustic\", \"patio\", \"ghost\", \"modern\", \"white\", \"para\", \"furniture\", \"ladderback\", \"tolix\", \"acrylic\", \"legs\", \"chairs\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Kitchen & Dining Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2023-03-25T16:53:05Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf89"},"product_id":3294,"item_id":"B07QBQCPMR","category_id":89,"name":"Stone & Beam Glenwilde Queen Headboard, 75\"W, Pearl","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Pearl","weight_lb":65.0,"price_cents":26999,"stock":6,"description":"The strong, smooth lines of this pearl-colored queen-size headboard will center the focus of your bedroom where it belongs—on the bed. The plush upholstery makes the headboard as comfortable as it is stylish, whether you're ready to read, relax, or sleep.\n75\"W x 11\"D x 52\"H\nPolyester and linen blend fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame\nThis bed adds modern classic style to any space. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick layer of padding for extra comfort.\nThe headboard is fully upholstered on both the front and the back.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\nVacuum, brush lightly, or spot clean only.","bullets":"[\"The strong, smooth lines of this pearl-colored queen-size headboard will center the focus of your bedroom where it belongs—on the bed. The plush upholstery makes the headboard as comfortable as it is stylish, whether you're ready to read, relax, or sleep.\", \"75\\\"W x 11\\\"D x 52\\\"H\", \"Polyester and linen blend fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame\", \"This bed adds modern classic style to any space. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick layer of padding for extra comfort.\", \"The headboard is fully upholstered on both the front and the back.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\", \"Vacuum, brush lightly, or spot clean only.\"]","keywords":"[\"sleigh\", \"cherry\", \"mattress\", \"de\", \"crema\", \"panels\", \"boards\", \"storage\", \"taupe\", \"platform\", \"cal\", \"head\", \"distressed\", \"split\", \"white\", \"para\", \"furniture\", \"zinus\", \"ajustable\", \"only\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Bedroom Furniture/Beds, Frames & Bases/Headboards & Footboards/Headboards","created_at":"2024-04-22T17:04:28Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf8a"},"product_id":3295,"item_id":"B07QBQD6RC","category_id":89,"name":"Stone & Beam Merrill King Headboard with Decorative Nailhead Trim, 92\" W, Charcoal","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Gray","weight_lb":70.0,"price_cents":41999,"stock":26,"description":"This chic charcoal-colored king-size headboard has strong, simple lines that take it from classic to modern. As comfortable as it is attractive, the headboard is accented with a pewter nailhead trim that adds an extra pop of style.\n92\"W x 11\"D x 52\"H\nPolyester and linen blend fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame\nThis bed adds modern classic style to any space. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick layer of padding for extra comfort.\nThe headboard is fully upholstered on both the front and the back.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\nVacuum, brush lightly, or spot clean only.","bullets":"[\"This chic charcoal-colored king-size headboard has strong, simple lines that take it from classic to modern. As comfortable as it is attractive, the headboard is accented with a pewter nailhead trim that adds an extra pop of style.\", \"92\\\"W x 11\\\"D x 52\\\"H\", \"Polyester and linen blend fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame\", \"This bed adds modern classic style to any space. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick layer of padding for extra comfort.\", \"The headboard is fully upholstered on both the front and the back.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\", \"Vacuum, brush lightly, or spot clean only.\"]","keywords":"[\"sleigh\", \"cherry\", \"mattress\", \"de\", \"crema\", \"upholstery\", \"queen\", \"panels\", \"boards\", \"storage\", \"taupe\", \"platform\", \"cal\", \"head\", \"split\", \"para\", \"white\", \"ajustable\", \"only\", \"hotel\"]","node_path":"Home & Garden/Home & Kitchen/Categories/Furniture/Bedroom Furniture/Beds, Frames & Bases/Headboards","created_at":"2023-