{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf8b"},"product_id":3296,"item_id":"B07QBQD99Z","category_id":89,"name":"Stone & Beam Canton Twin Button-Tufted Headboard, 42\"W, Iron","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Iron","weight_lb":44.0,"price_cents":43999,"stock":37,"description":"Button tufting gives this headboard a classic, homey look that is equally at home in shabby-chic or transitional surroundings. The soft iron-colored upholstery offers a restful place to lean back with a good book before sinking into a good night's sleep.\n42\"W x 3\"D x 62\"H\nCotton fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame\nThis bed adds modern classic style to any space. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick layer of padding for extra comfort while you rest in bed with a good book.\nThe headboard is fully upholstered on both the front and the back.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\nVacuum, brush lightly, or spot clean only.","bullets":"[\"Button tufting gives this headboard a classic, homey look that is equally at home in shabby-chic or transitional surroundings. The soft iron-colored upholstery offers a restful place to lean back with a good book before sinking into a good night's sleep.\", \"42\\\"W x 3\\\"D x 62\\\"H\", \"Cotton fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame\", \"This bed adds modern classic style to any space. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick layer of padding for extra comfort while you rest in bed with a good book.\", \"The headboard is fully upholstered on both the front and the back.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\", \"Vacuum, brush lightly, or spot clean only.\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"de\", \"mattress\", \"pink\", \"crema\", \"escritorio\", \"poppy\", \"queen\", \"sized\", \"panels\", \"kid\", \"boards\", \"desks\", \"girls\", \"lttle\", \"taupe\", \"youth\", \"platform\", \"monarch\", \"cal\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Bedroom Furniture/Beds, Frames & Bases/Headboards & Footboards/Headboards","created_at":"2023-08-07T02:19:05Z"}
