{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf8d"},"product_id":3298,"item_id":"B07QBQDD73","category_id":83,"name":"Stone & Beam Button-Tufted Dining Chair, 36.2\"H, Set of 2, Praline Gray","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Gray","weight_lb":22.0,"price_cents":7299,"stock":28,"description":"The button-tufted backs of these chairs create a twist on a classic design and, along with piping along the chair tops, bring a textured visual to any dining area. Cushions feature web suspension and no-sag springs, offering plenty of comfort and support, and solid wood forms a sturdy base.\n22.80\"W x 26.50\"D x 36.20\"H; seat height: 19\"H; seat dimensions: 18\" x 18.5\"\nSolid wood frame creates durability. Fabric upholstery is easy to maintain. Web suspension and no-sag springs provide comfortable seating.\nDecorative elements include a button-tufted back with piping detail.\nThe back of the chair features a button-tufted detail that creates a distinctive look. The chair easily blends with traditional or modern farmhouse style and is sold in a set of 2.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nClean by vacuuming or wiping with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"The button-tufted backs of these chairs create a twist on a classic design and, along with piping along the chair tops, bring a textured visual to any dining area. Cushions feature web suspension and no-sag springs, offering plenty of comfort and support, and solid wood forms a sturdy base.\", \"22.80\\\"W x 26.50\\\"D x 36.20\\\"H; seat height: 19\\\"H; seat dimensions: 18\\\" x 18.5\\\"\", \"Solid wood frame creates durability. Fabric upholstery is easy to maintain. Web suspension and no-sag springs provide comfortable seating.\", \"Decorative elements include a button-tufted back with piping detail.\", \"The back of the chair features a button-tufted detail that creates a distinctive look. The chair easily blends with traditional or modern farmhouse style and is sold in a set of 2.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Clean by vacuuming or wiping with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-06-02T18:49:58Z"}
