{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf90"},"product_id":3301,"item_id":"B07QC76NMH","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Ravenna Home Outdoor Wall Sconce Light, 11.73\"H, Bronze","brand":"Ravenna Home","color":"Bronze","weight_lb":2.5,"price_cents":7399,"stock":14,"description":"5.24\"W x 6.61\"D x 11.73\"H\nThis outdoor wall sconce with a bronze finish and a ribbed glass shade adds a perfect finishing touch to your doorway or outdoor wall.\nHardwired; 1 S60 60-watt maximum vintage incandescent bulb included\nExpert installation required\nRated for outdoor use; mounting hardware included","bullets":"[\"5.24\\\"W x 6.61\\\"D x 11.73\\\"H\", \"This outdoor wall sconce with a bronze finish and a ribbed glass shade adds a perfect finishing touch to your doorway or outdoor wall.\", \"Hardwired; 1 S60 60-watt maximum vintage incandescent bulb included\", \"Expert installation required\", \"Rated for outdoor use; mounting hardware included\"]","keywords":"[\"sconce\", \"fixture\", \"wall\", \"gooseneck\", \"porch\", \"indoor\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Wall Lights/Wall Lamps & Sconces","created_at":"2023-03-07T03:27:47Z"}
