{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf92"},"product_id":3303,"item_id":"B07QC85X8Y","category_id":95,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Industrial Nesting Tables, Set of 2, 19.69\"W and 14.96\"W, Antique Natural and Black","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Antique Natural/Black","weight_lb":45.15,"price_cents":17999,"stock":34,"description":"These industrial nesting tables tout iron bases in a black powder-coated finish and solid wood tops with an antique finish. The smaller table easily stores under the larger when not in use. The sturdiness of the bases adds durability. The modern style with a rustic flair looks great with most decor.\nTable 1: 19.69\"W x 17.72\"D x 21.65\"H; table 2: 14.96\"W x 17.72\"D x 19.29\"H\nSolid wood tops upon iron bases\nThese casual nesting tables with iron legs and solid wood tops with an antique finish look great with most decor styles.\nThe smaller table stores nicely under the larger table when not in use.\nNo assembly required\nWipe with a soft, damp cloth; dry thoroughly.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"These industrial nesting tables tout iron bases in a black powder-coated finish and solid wood tops with an antique finish. The smaller table easily stores under the larger when not in use. The sturdiness of the bases adds durability. The modern style with a rustic flair looks great with most decor.\", \"Table 1: 19.69\\\"W x 17.72\\\"D x 21.65\\\"H; table 2: 14.96\\\"W x 17.72\\\"D x 19.29\\\"H\", \"Solid wood tops upon iron bases\", \"These casual nesting tables with iron legs and solid wood tops with an antique finish look great with most decor styles.\", \"The smaller table stores nicely under the larger table when not in use.\", \"No assembly required\", \"Wipe with a soft, damp cloth; dry thoroughly.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"farmhouse\", \"glass\", \"coffee\", \"geometric\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Tables/Nesting Tables","created_at":"2023-08-22T12:38:35Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf93"},"product_id":3304,"item_id":"B07QC876Z6","category_id":95,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Modern Coffee Table, 39.37\"W, Pine Veneer and Natural Wood","brand":"Rivet","color":"Natural","weight_lb":59.5,"price_cents":46999,"stock":24,"description":"Constructed with simple miter joints and straight lines, this pine veneer coffee table in a natural color offers a sleek look. The moderate size allows plenty of room for magazines, coffee cups, and, of course, feet. Enjoy relaxing while the table adds comfort and functionality to any room.\n39.37\"W x 21.65\"D x 16.54\"H\n85% MDF, 10% solid pine, 5% pine veneer\nThe simple design brings a modern look to this coffee table.\nThe pine veneer in a natural color comes together with miter joints to create a sleek-looking contemporary coffee table.\nNo assembly required\nWipe with a soft, damp cloth; dry thoroughly.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Constructed with simple miter joints and straight lines, this pine veneer coffee table in a natural color offers a sleek look. The moderate size allows plenty of room for magazines, coffee cups, and, of course, feet. Enjoy relaxing while the table adds comfort and functionality to any room.\", \"39.37\\\"W x 21.65\\\"D x 16.54\\\"H\", \"85% MDF, 10% solid pine, 5% pine veneer\", \"The simple design brings a modern look to this coffee table.\", \"The pine veneer in a natural color comes together with miter joints to create a sleek-looking contemporary coffee table.\", \"No assembly required\", \"Wipe with a soft, damp cloth; dry thoroughly.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"sauder\", \"nightstand\", \"wheels\", \"de\", \"big\", \"gun\", \"country\", \"carson\", \"game\", \"tv\", \"aldwin\", \"hidden\", \"entertainment\", \"mid\", \"bromborough\", \"storage\", \"pop\", \"rustic\", \"tables\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Tables/Coffee Tables","created_at":"2023-01-22T17:01:18Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf94"},"product_id":3305,"item_id":"B07QC8B6TG","category_id":213,"name":"Amazon Brand – Ravenna Home Floral Medallion Tiled Rug, 7'10\" x 9'10\", Pale Aqua with Ivory","brand":"Ravenna Home","color":"Ivory/Green","weight_lb":20.0,"price_cents":8799,"stock":22,"description":"7'10\"W x 9'10\"L\n100% polypropylene; backing: 100% latex\nThis gorgeous rug is power loomed with bold floral medallions across a beachy aqua-blue field.\nThe medium 0.5\" pile suits any indoor space.\nPair with rug pad (sold separately)","bullets":"[\"7'10\\\"W x 9'10\\\"L\", \"100% polypropylene; backing: 100% latex\", \"This gorgeous rug is power loomed with bold floral medallions across a beachy aqua-blue field.\", \"The medium 0.5\\\" pile suits any indoor space.\", \"Pair with rug pad (sold separately)\"]","keywords":"[\"geometric\", \"resistant\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-05-29T00:29:25Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf95"},"product_id":3306,"item_id":"B07QCMBKYT","category_id":91,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Faraday Down-Filled Ottoman, 33\"W, Charcoal","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Charcoal","weight_lb":66.0,"price_cents":11999,"stock":0,"description":"This modern ottoman comes with a down-filled cushion for comfort, and the neutral tone matches most decor, making it a great choice for any room. The luxury of a cotton-blend upholstery helps keep everyone cool through the summer and the ottoman looking crisp.\n33.07\" Width x 47.24\" Length x 16.93\" Height\nSolid hardwood frame with down-filled cushion\nComfortable fabric in charcoal\nThis casual ottoman offers down-filled cushions for extra comfort.\nNo assembly required\nAvoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This modern ottoman comes with a down-filled cushion for comfort, and the neutral tone matches most decor, making it a great choice for any room. The luxury of a cotton-blend upholstery helps keep everyone cool through the summer and the ottoman looking crisp.\", \"33.07\\\" Width x 47.24\\\" Length x 16.93\\\" Height\", \"Solid hardwood frame with down-filled cushion\", \"Comfortable fabric in charcoal\", \"This casual ottoman offers down-filled cushions for extra comfort.\", \"No assembly required\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"studio\", \"bed\", \"nightstand\", \"stool\", \"game\", \"jennifer\", \"loveseat\", \"signature\", \"entryway\", \"fringed\", \"chests\", \"storage\", \"hope\", \"footstools\", \"long\", \"ottomans\", \"gray\", \"knight\", \"rectangular\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Accent Furniture/Ottomans","created_at":"2023-11-25T02:47:18Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf96"},"product_id":3307,"item_id":"B07QCNTCK8","category_id":274,"name":"Waterdrop Chubby NSF Certified 10-Cup Water Filter Pitcher with 1 Filter, Long-Lasting (200 gallons), 5X Times Lifetime Filtration Jug, Reduces Lead, Fluoride, Chlorine and More, BPA Free, White","brand":"Waterdrop","color":"White","weight_lb":"","price_cents":3699,"stock":51,"description":"Certified filtration: The pitcher is NSF 42 certified for the reduction of chlorine, taste and odor. It is also NSF 372 certified for lead-free material. Using 7-stage water filter technology, this water filter pitcher can effectively reduce arsenic, fluoride, lead, and other contaminants in water. Drink more water everyday with Waterdrop. 3-pack replacement filters are available for purchase! (search model: WD-PF-01A Plus)\nExceptional quality: The product is made up of high-grade BPA-free plastic, with a simple, yet rigid natural wooden handle, which makes handling of the equipment easier. Using silver-loaded activated carbon and highly efficient ACF from Japan for the premium water pitcher filter, you are assured of optimal filter performance.\nLong-lasting life with risk-free guarantee: The high-quality filters produce over 200 gallons of water before replacement. Plus, one Waterdrop Chubby water filter pitcher replaces over 1600 standard 16-oz bottle water. This pitcher also comes with a 90-day guarantee, quality assurance, and prompt service delivery.\nIntelligent indicator: Our Intelligent design ensures a healthier and hassle-free life for users, as you can monitor water quality at any time. Thanks to the replaceable intelligent indicator which can sense when water is being poured, you can now see the usage state of the filter element based on the display mode of the LED (light-emitting diode) in real time.\nInnovative design: Waterdrop Chubby water filter pitcher design allows the pitcher’s water filter to be perfectly placed on most fridge doors, the innovative design of the spout lid can help keep dust and other particles from getting into the pitcher. It is very easy to refill the pitcher, as you don’t even need to remove the lid.","bullets":"[\"Certified filtration: The pitcher is NSF 42 certified for the reduction of chlorine, taste and odor. It is also NSF 372 certified for lead-free material. Using 7-stage water filter technology, this water filter pitcher can effectively reduce arsenic, fluoride, lead, and other contaminants in water. Drink more water everyday with Waterdrop. 3-pack replacement filters are available for purchase! (search model: WD-PF-01A Plus)\", \"Exceptional quality: The product is made up of high-grade BPA-free plastic, with a simple, yet rigid natural wooden handle, which makes handling of the equipment easier. Using silver-loaded activated carbon and highly efficient ACF from Japan for the premium water pitcher filter, you are assured of optimal filter performance.\", \"Long-lasting life with risk-free guarantee: The high-quality filters produce over 200 gallons of water before replacement. Plus, one Waterdrop Chubby water filter pitcher replaces over 1600 standard 16-oz bottle water. This pitcher also comes with a 90-day guarantee, quality assurance, and prompt service delivery.\", \"Intelligent indicator: Our Intelligent design ensures a healthier and hassle-free life for users, as you can monitor water quality at any time. Thanks to the replaceable intelligent indicator which can sense when water is being poured, you can now see the usage state of the filter element based on the display mode of the LED (light-emitting diode) in real time.\", \"Innovative design: Waterdrop Chubby water filter pitcher design allows the pitcher’s water filter to be perfectly placed on most fridge doors, the innovative design of the spout lid can help keep dust and other particles from getting into the pitcher. It is very easy to refill the pitcher, as you don’t even need to remove the lid.\"]","keywords":"[\"fluoride lead chlorine brita purifier jug machine dispenser\"]","node_path":"Categories/Kitchen & Dining/Water Coolers & Filters/Pitcher Water Filters","created_at":"2023-11-02T02:20:47Z"}
