{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf9a"},"product_id":3311,"item_id":"B07QD4WMMM","category_id":29,"name":"AmazonBasics Mini DisplayPort to HDMI/DVI/VGA Adapter - Black, 5-Pack","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Black","weight_lb":"","price_cents":3499,"stock":54,"description":"5-Pack\nMale-to-female adapter connects computer with Mini DisplayPort or Thunderbolt 2 to an HDTV, monitor, or projector with HDMI/DVI-D/VGA\n3-in-1 convenience—use the HDMI, DVI, or VGA port; only 1 port works at a time\nTransmits audio and video with resolution up to 4K at 30Hz via HDMI, or 1920x1200 and 1080p (Full HD) via VGA/DVI (no audio output via DVI or VGA)\nPlug and play (no drivers required); separate HDMI/DVI/VGA cable required (sold separately); Black color\nFor Windows 10/8.1/8/7 and Mac OS 10.0 and above; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty","bullets":"[\"5-Pack\", \"Male-to-female adapter connects computer with Mini DisplayPort or Thunderbolt 2 to an HDTV, monitor, or projector with HDMI/DVI-D/VGA\", \"3-in-1 convenience—use the HDMI, DVI, or VGA port; only 1 port works at a time\", \"Transmits audio and video with resolution up to 4K at 30Hz via HDMI, or 1920x1200 and 1080p (Full HD) via VGA/DVI (no audio output via DVI or VGA)\", \"Plug and play (no drivers required); separate HDMI/DVI/VGA cable required (sold separately); Black color\", \"For Windows 10/8.1/8/7 and Mac OS 10.0 and above; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"usb\", \"converter\", \"display\", \"hdmi\", \"dongle\", \"adaptor\", \"monitor\", \"0b47072\", \"convert\", \"splitter\", \"dvi/vga\", \"external\", \"connector\", \"3.0\", \"hmdi\", \"female\", \"lenovo\", \"male\"]","node_path":"Categories/Computers & Accessories/Computer Accessories & Peripherals/Computer Cable Adapters","created_at":"2023-11-29T05:46:53Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf9b"},"product_id":3312,"item_id":"B07QD5L94T","category_id":252,"name":"Rivet 18-Piece Stoneware Plates and Bowls Dinnerware Set, Service for 6, Indigo Burst Glaze","brand":"Rivet","color":"Indigo Burst","weight_lb":18.0,"price_cents":4299,"stock":61,"description":"Add the finishing touch to your dining room with these lovely indigo blue and white dinner plates, salad plates, and bowls. With service for 6, these bowls work well for both everyday use and dinner parties, and they’re dishwasher safe for easy cleanup.\nMade in Portugal, 100% stoneware with a reactive glaze, printed design, and glossy finish.\nThese durable dishes are dishwasher safe and microwave safe\nDinner plate: 10.5\"L x 10.5\"W x 1\"H; salad plate: 8.5\"L x 8.5\"W x .75\"H; soup/cereal bowl: 5.5\"L x 5.5\"W x 2.5\"H\nSet includes 6 dinner plates, 6 salad plates, and 6 soup/cereal bowls","bullets":"[\"Add the finishing touch to your dining room with these lovely indigo blue and white dinner plates, salad plates, and bowls. With service for 6, these bowls work well for both everyday use and dinner parties, and they’re dishwasher safe for easy cleanup.\", \"Made in Portugal, 100% stoneware with a reactive glaze, printed design, and glossy finish.\", \"These durable dishes are dishwasher safe and microwave safe\", \"Dinner plate: 10.5\\\"L x 10.5\\\"W x 1\\\"H; salad plate: 8.5\\\"L x 8.5\\\"W x .75\\\"H; soup/cereal bowl: 5.5\\\"L x 5.5\\\"W x 2.5\\\"H\", \"Set includes 6 dinner plates, 6 salad plates, and 6 soup/cereal bowls\"]","keywords":"[\"rivet\", \"4014009\", \"dinnerware set\", \"reactive glaze\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-08-28T14:12:59Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf9c"},"product_id":3313,"item_id":"B07QD5SGKP","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Ravenna Home Classic Flush Mount, 6.25\"H, Bronze","brand":"Ravenna Home","color":"Bronze","weight_lb":3.0,"price_cents":7999,"stock":29,"description":"11\"W x 11\"D x 6.25\"H\nThe classic simplicity of this flush-mounted ceiling light design is offset by trendy watered glass panes to create the perfect outdoor fixture.\nHardwired; 2 S60 60-watt maximum vintage incandescent bulbs included\nExpert installation required\nOutdoor and indoor use; mounting hardware included","bullets":"[\"11\\\"W x 11\\\"D x 6.25\\\"H\", \"The classic simplicity of this flush-mounted ceiling light design is offset by trendy watered glass panes to create the perfect outdoor fixture.\", \"Hardwired; 2 S60 60-watt maximum vintage incandescent bulbs included\", \"Expert installation required\", \"Outdoor and indoor use; mounting hardware included\"]","keywords":"[\"flush\", \"flushmount\", \"fixture\", \"ceiling\", \"porch\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Ceiling Lights/Close To Ceiling Lights","created_at":"2024-03-04T23:57:15Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf9d"},"product_id":3314,"item_id":"B07QD5SW4K","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Steel-Framed 5-Piece Vanity Wall Sconce Light with Bathroom Hardware Set, 10.99\"H, Brass","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Brass","weight_lb":4.5,"price_cents":3899,"stock":84,"description":"With 3 bulbs shaded with clear blown glass that hang from a sturdy metal base, this vanity light with matching accessories can provide a bright glow to any space. The brass finish creates an industrial feel that will match modern decor, but the elegance of the glass shades makes it perfect for classic and vintage looks as well.\nVanity wall sconce measurements: 24.03\"W x 8.2\"D x 10.99\"H\nMetal construction with a brass finish and clear glass shades. Includes (3) S60 60-watt maximum vintage incandescent bulbs\n5-piece set includes (1 each) vanity light, towel bar, hand towel ring, toilet paper holder, robe hook\nOther measurements: Towel Bar: 1.97\"H x 24.03\"W x 1.97\"D. Towel Ring: 7.32\"H x 6.08\"W x 1.97\"D. Robe Hook: 1.22\"H x 2.2\" W x 1.97\"D. Toilet Paper Holder: 4.45\"H x 6.44\"W x 1.97\"D\nAssemble in 15-30 minutes\nIndoor use only","bullets":"[\"With 3 bulbs shaded with clear blown glass that hang from a sturdy metal base, this vanity light with matching accessories can provide a bright glow to any space. The brass finish creates an industrial feel that will match modern decor, but the elegance of the glass shades makes it perfect for classic and vintage looks as well.\", \"Vanity wall sconce measurements: 24.03\\\"W x 8.2\\\"D x 10.99\\\"H\", \"Metal construction with a brass finish and clear glass shades. Includes (3) S60 60-watt maximum vintage incandescent bulbs\", \"5-piece set includes (1 each) vanity light, towel bar, hand towel ring, toilet paper holder, robe hook\", \"Other measurements: Towel Bar: 1.97\\\"H x 24.03\\\"W x 1.97\\\"D. Towel Ring: 7.32\\\"H x 6.08\\\"W x 1.97\\\"D. Robe Hook: 1.22\\\"H x 2.2\\\" W x 1.97\\\"D. Toilet Paper Holder: 4.45\\\"H x 6.44\\\"W x 1.97\\\"D\", \"Assemble in 15-30 minutes\", \"Indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"mirror\", \"hauschen\", \"rubbed\", \"crystal\", \"28\", \"exterior\", \"brushed\", \"mid\", \"hansford\", \"led\", \"two\", \"smart\", \"fixtures\", \"polished\", \"gold\", \"rustic\", \"oil\", \"decor\", \"floating\", \"wholesaleplumbing\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Wall Lights/Vanity Lights","created_at":"2023-11-01T14:30:16Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf9e"},"product_id":3315,"item_id":"B07QD6V1RV","category_id":90,"name":"Rivet Raven Mid-Century Media Console, 52.01\"W, Brown","brand":"Rivet","color":"Walnut","weight_lb":143.0,"price_cents":5899,"stock":31,"description":"This mid-century console combines vintage and modern styles. The sleek cabinet in an oak-brown finish sits elegantly atop gold-toned legs. Pulls in a brushed gold tone make opening the 2 cabinet doors, 2 drawers, and cubby space a breeze. The adjustable shelf and roomy drawers offer plenty of storage.\n52.01\"W x 15.98\"D x 30\"H\nHardwood, manufactured woods, veneers\nThis mid-century media console has sleek lines with metal pulls and legs for a modern flair.\nThe cabinet features an adjustable shelf behind 2 doors and a storage cubby and 2 drawers for storage.\nNo assembly required\nAvoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This mid-century console combines vintage and modern styles. The sleek cabinet in an oak-brown finish sits elegantly atop gold-toned legs. Pulls in a brushed gold tone make opening the 2 cabinet doors, 2 drawers, and cubby space a breeze. The adjustable shelf and roomy drawers offer plenty of storage.\", \"52.01\\\"W x 15.98\\\"D x 30\\\"H\", \"Hardwood, manufactured woods, veneers\", \"This mid-century media console has sleek lines with metal pulls and legs for a modern flair.\", \"The cabinet features an adjustable shelf behind 2 doors and a storage cubby and 2 drawers for storage.\", \"No assembly required\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"Categories","created_at":"2024-03-22T20:14:19Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abf9f"},"product_id":3316,"item_id":"B07QD6Z6NZ","category_id":210,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Mid-Century 2-Toned Stoneware Planter, 6.3\"H, Gray and White","brand":"Rivet","color":"","weight_lb":3.0,"price_cents":2499,"stock":97,"description":"With or without a plant, this beautiful 2-toned stoneware pot brings a stylish touch to your office or any room in your home. Its minimalistic style blends with any type of home decor, and its compact size makes it great for a windowsill or desktop.\n7.48\" diameter x 6.3\"H\n100% stoneware\nBring this durable stoneware planter to life with colorful flowers, or use it as a simple home-decor piece.\nWipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.","bullets":"[\"With or without a plant, this beautiful 2-toned stoneware pot brings a stylish touch to your office or any room in your home. Its minimalistic style blends with any type of home decor, and its compact size makes it great for a windowsill or desktop.\", \"7.48\\\" diameter x 6.3\\\"H\", \"100% stoneware\", \"Bring this durable stoneware planter to life with colorful flowers, or use it as a simple home-decor piece.\", \"Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\"]","keywords":"[\"ceramic\", \"tray\", \"bed\", \"pets\", \"tub\", \"small\", \"trump\", \"tv\", \"saucer\", \"half\", \"gardening\", \"fig\", \"bin\", \"mid\", \"box\", \"pots\", \"changing\", \"stands\", \"patio\", \"whisky\"]","node_path":"Categories/Gardening & Lawn Care/Pots, Planters & Container Accessories/Planters","created_at":"2023-09-26T12:04:32Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfa0"},"product_id":3317,"item_id":"B07QD97T5J","category_id":339,"name":"AmazonBasics EZ-Change Advanced Filtration Replacement Cartridge | 500 Gallons, Equivalent To Culligan RC-EZ-3","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"","weight_lb":0.69,"price_cents":4099,"stock":22,"description":"Use in Under the Sink or Refrigerators: The EZ-Change Advanced Filtration Replacement Cartridge helps reduce sediment, chemicals, and unpleasant odors that are often associated with unfiltered water\nEnjoy Filtered Water Every Day: This advanced replacement water filter cartridge is compatible with refrigerator ice-maker and water systems. It has a lifespan of 500 gallons/6 months\nEasy Installation: This filter is compatible with all EZ change water filter systems, including inline ice-maker, RV, and under-sink models. It is equivalent to the Culligan RC-EZ-3 replacement filter\nReduce Class I Particulates: This advanced water filter helps reduce class I particulates, chlorine, cyst, chloroform, MTBE, Mercury, turbidity, and lead so you have safe, great-tasting water and ice\nAmazon Basics: We make premium water filtration systems, including faucet filters, whole house filters, under the sink filters, shower filters and more, so you can provide clean water for your whole family","bullets":"[\"Use in Under the Sink or Refrigerators: The EZ-Change Advanced Filtration Replacement Cartridge helps reduce sediment, chemicals, and unpleasant odors that are often associated with unfiltered water\", \"Enjoy Filtered Water Every Day: This advanced replacement water filter cartridge is compatible with refrigerator ice-maker and water systems. It has a lifespan of 500 gallons/6 months\", \"Easy Installation: This filter is compatible with all EZ change water filter systems, including inline ice-maker, RV, and under-sink models. It is equivalent to the Culligan RC-EZ-3 replacement filter\", \"Reduce Class I Particulates: This advanced water filter helps reduce class I particulates, chlorine, cyst, chloroform, MTBE, Mercury, turbidity, and lead so you have safe, great-tasting water and ice\", \"Amazon Basics: We make premium water filtration systems, including faucet filters, whole house filters, under the sink filters, shower filters and more, so you can provide clean water for your whole family\"]","keywords":"[\"bed\", \"treatment\", \"reactivator\", \"hydro\", \"purpose\", \"crystal\", \"wsc\", \"for\", \"conditioner\", \"pur\", \"ppf951k\", \"pure\", \"resup\", \"rk41n\", \"products\", \"rescare\", \"solution\", \"systems\", \"crf\", \"softener\"]","node_path":"Categories/Kitchen & Bath Fixtures/Water Filtration & Softeners/Water Filtration Replacement Parts","created_at":"2023-08-24T21:37:17Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfa1"},"product_id":3318,"item_id":"B07QDL42R8","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Ravenna Home Oakesdale Contemporary Recliner, 35.4\"W, Langley Taupe","brand":"Ravenna Home","color":"Taupe","weight_lb":84.7,"price_cents":16999,"stock":26,"description":"35.4\"W x 36.6\"D x 39.8\"H; seat depth: 20.9\"D\nFabric over fiberboard and iron frame\nThe upholstered fabric seat makes this a comfortable, single-chair manual recliner.\nRelax, read, or watch television in comfort in this classic recliner.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nAvoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"35.4\\\"W x 36.6\\\"D x 39.8\\\"H; seat depth: 20.9\\\"D\", \"Fabric over fiberboard and iron frame\", \"The upholstered fabric seat makes this a comfortable, single-chair manual recliner.\", \"Relax, read, or watch television in comfort in this classic recliner.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"ravenna home\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2023-01-07T19:54:05Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfa2"},"product_id":3319,"item_id":"B07QDNQSVF","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Contemporary Square-Back Armless Dining Chair, 34\"H, Felt Gray, Set of 2, Queen","brand":"Rivet","color":"Felt Gray","weight_lb":9.9,"price_cents":11999,"stock":10,"description":"The felt-gray upholstery, armless structure, and clean-line design combine to make this a modern chair that will fit into nearly any dining area’s color scheme and decor. Polished, tapered wood legs lend elegance to the piece and combine with a solid wood frame for a sturdy framework.\n18\"W x 22\"D x 34\"H; seat height: 19\"H; seat depth: 16\"H; seat back height: 15\"H\nSet of 2\n100% polyester fabric on solid wood frame\nElegant chair with polished and tapered legs\nNo assembly required\nAvoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"The felt-gray upholstery, armless structure, and clean-line design combine to make this a modern chair that will fit into nearly any dining area’s color scheme and decor. Polished, tapered wood legs lend elegance to the piece and combine with a solid wood frame for a sturdy framework.\", \"18\\\"W x 22\\\"D x 34\\\"H; seat height: 19\\\"H; seat depth: 16\\\"H; seat back height: 15\\\"H\", \"Set of 2\", \"100% polyester fabric on solid wood frame\", \"Elegant chair with polished and tapered legs\", \"No assembly required\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"gun\", \"eames\", \"waiting\", \"folding\", \"mid\", \"lucite\", \"teens\", \"leg\", \"rustic\", \"patio\", \"trattoria\", \"ghost\", \"para\", \"white\", \"decor\", \"furniture\", \"ladderback\", \"tolix\", \"acrylic\", \"chairs\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Kitchen & Dining Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2023-12-20T08:47:33Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfa3"},"product_id":3320,"item_id":"B07QDNRBSX","category_id":94,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Seagrass-Woven Barstool, 30\"H, Brown","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Brown","weight_lb":21.08,"price_cents":9699,"stock":82,"description":"This traditional-style barstool offers a woven seat of natural seagrass that fits comfortably with most decor. The solid birch frame offers the perfect height for use in the kitchen, at the bar, or at a counter-height table, while the backless design makes storing it out of the way a snap.\n20\"L*20\"W*30\"H\n95% birch, 5% seagrass\nThis barstool can be used at the bar, counter, or counter-height dinner table.\nThis traditional grass-woven barstool adds style to any kitchen or bar.\nSimple assembly in less than 15 minutes\nUse a dampened, soft and clean cloth with water only. Wipe in the direction of the grain.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This traditional-style barstool offers a woven seat of natural seagrass that fits comfortably with most decor. The solid birch frame offers the perfect height for use in the kitchen, at the bar, or at a counter-height table, while the backless design makes storing it out of the way a snap.\", \"20\\\"L*20\\\"W*30\\\"H\", \"95% birch, 5% seagrass\", \"This barstool can be used at the bar, counter, or counter-height dinner table.\", \"This traditional grass-woven barstool adds style to any kitchen or bar.\", \"Simple assembly in less than 15 minutes\", \"Use a dampened, soft and clean cloth with water only. Wipe in the direction of the grain.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"stool\", \"de\", \"24\", \"auto\", \"swivel\", \"saddle\", \"barstools\", \"navy\", \"signature\", \"line\", \"back\", \"angel\", \"tools\", \"products\", \"barra\", \"inches\", \"rustic\", \"bar\", \"gray\", \"white\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Game & Recreation Room Furniture/Home Bar Furniture/Barstools","created_at":"2023-11-11T19:17:03Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfa4"},"product_id":3321,"item_id":"B07QDNRBX2","category_id":89,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Seahurst Queen Bed Headboard, 64\"W, Gray Taupe","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Wood","weight_lb":92.59,"price_cents":78999,"stock":69,"description":"This queen-size headboard in a charming neutral shade of gray taupe gives your bed a sense of serene grandeur.\n64\"W x 3\"D x 64\"H\nGray-taupe finish, oak veneers, rubberwood solids, nickel acrylic hardware\nThe casual contemporary style of this collection makes it the perfect addition or update to your bedroom.\nPurchase the headboard alone and pair with your existing bed frame, or purchase the matching footboard and side rails to complete the look.\nAssemble in 15-30 minutes\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\nWipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.","bullets":"[\"This queen-size headboard in a charming neutral shade of gray taupe gives your bed a sense of serene grandeur.\", \"64\\\"W x 3\\\"D x 64\\\"H\", \"Gray-taupe finish, oak veneers, rubberwood solids, nickel acrylic hardware\", \"The casual contemporary style of this collection makes it the perfect addition or update to your bedroom.\", \"Purchase the headboard alone and pair with your existing bed frame, or purchase the matching footboard and side rails to complete the look.\", \"Assemble in 15-30 minutes\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\", \"Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\"]","keywords":"[\"diamonds\", \"de\", \"crema\", \"upholstery\", \"navy\", \"panels\", \"boards\", \"rattan\", \"platform\", \"cal\", \"head\", \"distressed\", \"white\", \"furniture\", \"zinus\", \"only\", \"clearance\", \"linen\", \"hotel\", \"wood\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Bedroom Furniture/Beds, Frames & Bases/Headboards & Footboards/Headboards","created_at":"2023-09-19T20:01:54Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfa5"},"product_id":3322,"item_id":"B07QDNS385","category_id":89,"name":"Stone & Beam Glenwilde King Headboard, 92\"W, Lagoon","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Lagoon","weight_lb":70.0,"price_cents":14999,"stock":2,"description":"The strong, smooth lines of this lagoon-colored king-size headboard will center the focus of your bedroom where it belongs—on the bed. The plush upholstery makes the headboard as comfortable as it is stylish, whether you're ready to read, relax, or sleep.\n92\"W x 11\"D x 52\"H\nPolypropylene fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame\nThis bed adds modern classic style to any space. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick layer of padding for extra comfort.\nThe headboard is fully upholstered on both the front and the back.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\nVacuum, brush lightly, or spot clean only.","bullets":"[\"The strong, smooth lines of this lagoon-colored king-size headboard will center the focus of your bedroom where it belongs—on the bed. The plush upholstery makes the headboard as comfortable as it is stylish, whether you're ready to read, relax, or sleep.\", \"92\\\"W x 11\\\"D x 52\\\"H\", \"Polypropylene fabric, polyurethane foam, plywood frame\", \"This bed adds modern classic style to any space. The sturdy frame is covered in a thick layer of padding for extra comfort.\", \"The headboard is fully upholstered on both the front and the back.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\", \"Vacuum, brush lightly, or spot clean only.\"]","keywords":"[\"sleigh\", \"cherry\", \"mattress\", \"de\", \"crema\", \"queen\", \"panels\", \"boards\", \"storage\", \"taupe\", \"platform\", \"cal\", \"head\", \"distressed\", \"split\", \"white\", \"para\", \"furniture\", \"zinus\", \"ajustable\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Bedroom Furniture/Beds, Frames & Bases/Headboards & Footboards/Headboards","created_at":"2023-06-03T23:32:11Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfa6"},"product_id":3323,"item_id":"B07QDPSYNX","category_id":99,"name":"365 Everyday Value, Organic Pumpkin Spice Coffee Capsules, 12 ct","brand":"365 Everyday Value","color":"","weight_lb":0.29,"price_cents":1299,"stock":28,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us Stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.\nLimited Edition - get yours while they last!\nOur 365 Everyday Value Flavored coffees come in a variety of Roasts sure to satisfy any aficionado. 100% Arabica coffee is sourced from Guatemala and every batch is artfully roasted to consistently deliver outstanding flavor and aroma, cup after cup.\nNaturally flavored coffee with other natural flavors.\nCertified Organic, Certified Kosher, Certified Vegan, Certified Fair Trade.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us Stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.\", \"Limited Edition - get yours while they last!\", \"Our 365 Everyday Value Flavored coffees come in a variety of Roasts sure to satisfy any aficionado. 100% Arabica coffee is sourced from Guatemala and every batch is artfully roasted to consistently deliver outstanding flavor and aroma, cup after cup.\", \"Naturally flavored coffee with other natural flavors.\", \"Certified Organic, Certified Kosher, Certified Vegan, Certified Fair Trade.\"]","keywords":"[\"grocery & gourmet food beverages coffee, tea & cocoa coffee single-serve capsules & pods\"]","node_path":"Categories/Beverages/Coffee, Tea & Cocoa/Coffee/Single-Serve Capsules & Pods","created_at":"2023-09-24T00:42:17Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfa7"},"product_id":3324,"item_id":"B07QDRL2C4","category_id":193,"name":"Pinzon Basics Hypoallergenic Down Alternative Year Round Comforter","brand":"Pinzon by Amazon","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":4999,"stock":50,"description":"Year-round comforter with 25-ounce down-alternative hypoallergenic Polyester-fiber fill\nBrushed 100% Microfiber-Polyester, 220-thread-count shell ensures a soft hand\nEnd-to-end box-stitched construction keeps filling in place\nSolid white; can be used as a duvet insert; machine washable for easy cleaning\nMeasures 86 by 86 inches","bullets":"[\"Year-round comforter with 25-ounce down-alternative hypoallergenic Polyester-fiber fill\", \"Brushed 100% Microfiber-Polyester, 220-thread-count shell ensures a soft hand\", \"End-to-end box-stitched construction keeps filling in place\", \"Solid white; can be used as a duvet insert; machine washable for easy cleaning\", \"Measures 86 by 86 inches\"]","keywords":"[\"bed\", \"pink\", \"queen\", \"bag\", \"blankets\", \"good\", \"comforters\", \"cover\", \"bedding\", \"dinosaur\", \"twin\", \"silk\", \"set\", \"filled\", \"mulberry\", \"brown\", \"cheap\", \"ienjoy\", \"home\", \"grey\"]","node_path":"Categories","created_at":"2024-02-17T05:33:24Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfa8"},"product_id":3325,"item_id":"B07QF9Y71V","category_id":95,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Industrial Coffee Table, 53\"W, Antique Natural and Black","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Antique Natural/Black","weight_lb":75.84,"price_cents":20999,"stock":26,"description":"This industrial coffee table touts an iron base in a black powder-coated finish and a natural-antique, solid-wood top and has a contemporary-meets-country flair that looks great with most decor. The sturdy iron base adds durability to the rustic elegance and helps reduce daily wear and tear.\n53.15\"W x 29.53\"D x 15.75\"H\nSolid wood tops an iron base.\nThis casual coffee table with an iron base and a solid wood top in an antique finish looks great with most decor styles.\nThe solid wood top and iron base add durability.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nWipe with a soft, damp cloth; dry thoroughly.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This industrial coffee table touts an iron base in a black powder-coated finish and a natural-antique, solid-wood top and has a contemporary-meets-country flair that looks great with most decor. The sturdy iron base adds durability to the rustic elegance and helps reduce daily wear and tear.\", \"53.15\\\"W x 29.53\\\"D x 15.75\\\"H\", \"Solid wood tops an iron base.\", \"This casual coffee table with an iron base and a solid wood top in an antique finish looks great with most decor styles.\", \"The solid wood top and iron base add durability.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Wipe with a soft, damp cloth; dry thoroughly.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"valebeck\", \"big\", \"country\", \"tv\", \"game\", \"aldwin\", \"tone\", \"signature\", \"folding\", \"rattan\", \"bromborough\", \"storage\", \"lifttop\", \"bolanburg\", \"two\", \"monarch\", \"distressed\", \"tables\", \"japanese\", \"t637\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Tables/Coffee Tables","created_at":"2024-04-26T20:11:03Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfa9"},"product_id":3326,"item_id":"B07QF9ZFQZ","category_id":95,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Campbell Mid-Century Media Console with Tapered Legs, 47\"W, Dark Wood and White","brand":"Rivet","color":"Walnut/White","weight_lb":88.2,"price_cents":31999,"stock":43,"description":"Tall tapered legs add visual interest to this casual, 2-toned media console with a vintage flair. The 3 self-closing drawers and cabinet provide necessary storage for those on the go, while the engineered and solid wood construction offer a lasting durability.\n47\"W x 16\"D x 32\"H\n80% MDF, 20% solid wood\nVintage tapered legs add interest to the clean lines of this media console.\nA cabinet and 3 self-closing drawers provide a needed storage solution.\nAssemble in 15-30 minutes\nWipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Tall tapered legs add visual interest to this casual, 2-toned media console with a vintage flair. The 3 self-closing drawers and cabinet provide necessary storage for those on the go, while the engineered and solid wood construction offer a lasting durability.\", \"47\\\"W x 16\\\"D x 32\\\"H\", \"80% MDF, 20% solid wood\", \"Vintage tapered legs add interest to the clean lines of this media console.\", \"A cabinet and 3 self-closing drawers provide a needed storage solution.\", \"Assemble in 15-30 minutes\", \"Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"century\", \"modern\", \"mid\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/TV & Media Furniture/Media Storage","created_at":"2024-04-30T14:49:24Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfaa"},"product_id":3327,"item_id":"B07QFB1L2P","category_id":82,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Sumner Modern Filing Cabinet, 21.5\"W, White","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"White","weight_lb":45.0,"price_cents":20999,"stock":59,"description":"Additional storage space is always in style! Form combines with function in this white wooden filing or storage cabinet, perfect for a study or home office.\n21.5''W x 20''D x 30.5''H\nSolid pine and MDF\nThis wooden filing cabinet has 2 deep drawers for all of your storage and filing needs.\nThe simple yet distinctive design of this modern white cabinet blends with furnishings of any decorative style.\nAssemble in 15-30 minutes\nWipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Additional storage space is always in style! Form combines with function in this white wooden filing or storage cabinet, perfect for a study or home office.\", \"21.5''W x 20''D x 30.5''H\", \"Solid pine and MDF\", \"This wooden filing cabinet has 2 deep drawers for all of your storage and filing needs.\", \"The simple yet distinctive design of this modern white cabinet blends with furnishings of any decorative style.\", \"Assemble in 15-30 minutes\", \"Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"makeup\", \"sandusky\", \"appliance\", \"steel\", \"country\", \"server\", \"stool\", \"lingerie\", \"eames\", \"tv\", \"fridge\", \"swivel\", \"replica\", \"sources\", \"bush\", \"craft\", \"mid\", \"office\", \"vanity\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Home Office Furniture/Home Office Cabinets","created_at":"2023-05-03T12:08:17Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfab"},"product_id":3328,"item_id":"B07QFB1TH8","category_id":95,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Modern Sliding-Top Coffee Table, 47\"W","brand":"Rivet","color":"Walnut","weight_lb":58.7,"price_cents":17999,"stock":38,"description":"A light wood-patterned top slides away to reveal extra storage in this modern coffee table. Avoid mess and keep needed items close at hand. Strong metal legs give support. The natural coloring means that this item will match most color schemes, making it a must-have in any casual living space.\n47\"W x 24\"D x 13\"H\nMDF and metal\nThe wood finish will match any decor.\nSliding top\nAssemble in 15-30 minutes\nClean with a soft cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"A light wood-patterned top slides away to reveal extra storage in this modern coffee table. Avoid mess and keep needed items close at hand. Strong metal legs give support. The natural coloring means that this item will match most color schemes, making it a must-have in any casual living space.\", \"47\\\"W x 24\\\"D x 13\\\"H\", \"MDF and metal\", \"The wood finish will match any decor.\", \"Sliding top\", \"Assemble in 15-30 minutes\", \"Clean with a soft cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"drop\", \"small\", \"nightstand\", \"wheels\", \"beam\", \"country\", \"tv\", \"folding\", \"mid\", \"house\", \"monarch\", \"rustic\", \"patio\", \"distressed\", \"tables\", \"white\", \"furniture\", \"low\", \"tempered\", \"dark\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Tables/Coffee Tables","created_at":"2023-10-18T05:35:00Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfac"},"product_id":3329,"item_id":"B07QFB4DQB","category_id":193,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Decorative Stoneware Container with Strap, 10.43\"H, Beige and White","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"","weight_lb":4.0,"price_cents":1999,"stock":92,"description":"This decorative container comes in a dual-tone reactive glaze finish with a lattice design and a cord strap. Use by itself, with dry flowers, or with a votive candle and add a modern elegance to any room. The reactive glaze makes each piece unique.\n7.76\" diameter x 10.43\"H\n100% stoneware\nThis dual-toned modern decorative container with a cut-out pattern offers many various decor options.\nWipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.","bullets":"[\"This decorative container comes in a dual-tone reactive glaze finish with a lattice design and a cord strap. Use by itself, with dry flowers, or with a votive candle and add a modern elegance to any room. The reactive glaze makes each piece unique.\", \"7.76\\\" diameter x 10.43\\\"H\", \"100% stoneware\", \"This dual-toned modern decorative container with a cut-out pattern offers many various decor options.\", \"Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"ceramic\", \"de\", \"camping\", \"shades\", \"biodegradable\", \"snowman\", \"navidad\", \"casa\", \"pirate\", \"bee\", \"memory\", \"reindeer\", \"powered\", \"lamps\", \"steampunk\", \"decoracion\", \"mu\\\"xf1ecos\", \"owl\", \"ring\"]","node_path":"Categories/Home Décor/Candles & Holders/Candleholders/Decorative Candle Lanterns","created_at":"2024-05-11T13:55:12Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfad"},"product_id":3330,"item_id":"B07QFB4XG1","category_id":213,"name":"Ravenna Home Vintage Damask Patterned Rug, 4' x 6', Ivory on Warm Grey","brand":"Ravenna Home","color":"Grey","weight_lb":6.0,"price_cents":10999,"stock":85,"description":"4'W x 6'L\n100% polypropylene; backing: 100% latex\nThis gorgeous rug is power loomed with striated tones of ivory-white on a warm grey field, bringing an elegance to your favorite room.\nThe medium 0.5\" pile suits any indoor space.\nPair with rug pad (sold separately)","bullets":"[\"4'W x 6'L\", \"100% polypropylene; backing: 100% latex\", \"This gorgeous rug is power loomed with striated tones of ivory-white on a warm grey field, bringing an elegance to your favorite room.\", \"The medium 0.5\\\" pile suits any indoor space.\", \"Pair with rug pad (sold separately)\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-12-27T07:20:11Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfae"},"product_id":3331,"item_id":"B07QFP4PYG","category_id":90,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Berkley High-Leg Recliner, 39\"H, Leather, Dark Roast","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Dark Roast","weight_lb":70.0,"price_cents":4999,"stock":24,"description":"This transitional recliner keeps you comfortable while adding a touch of elegance to your room with high wood legs and top grain leather where it matters most. Durable vinyl wraps the back and sides, making care a breeze. Manually recline in peace with noise-reducing hardware and insulated springs.\n30\"W x 39\"D x 39\"H\nTop grain cowhide with vinyl on the back and sides\nNoise-reducing hardware with insulated mechanism springs keeps chair movement quiet.\nThe high legs on this leather-seat recliner combine elegance with comfort.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nWipe with a damp cloth once a month.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty","bullets":"[\"This transitional recliner keeps you comfortable while adding a touch of elegance to your room with high wood legs and top grain leather where it matters most. Durable vinyl wraps the back and sides, making care a breeze. Manually recline in peace with noise-reducing hardware and insulated springs.\", \"30\\\"W x 39\\\"D x 39\\\"H\", \"Top grain cowhide with vinyl on the back and sides\", \"Noise-reducing hardware with insulated mechanism springs keeps chair movement quiet.\", \"The high legs on this leather-seat recliner combine elegance with comfort.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Wipe with a damp cloth once a month.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"farmhouse\"]","node_path":"Categories","created_at":"2023-03-21T12:58:35Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfaf"},"product_id":3332,"item_id":"B07QFP4T15","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Faraday Down-Filled Casual Living Room Chair, 47\"W, Charcoal","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Charcoal","weight_lb":84.7,"price_cents":20999,"stock":70,"description":"This modern living room chair comes with removable and reversible down-filled cushions for comfort. Roomy seating is nice with company or family, and the neutral tone matches most decor, making it a great choice for any room. The luxury of a cotton-blend upholstery helps keep everyone cool through the summer.\n47\" Width x 43\" Depth x 33\" Height\nSolid hardwood frame with down-filled seat and back cushions\nRemovable and reversible cushions\nThis casual living room chair offers down-filled cushions and a seat depth of 43\" for extra comfort.\nNo assembly required\nAvoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This modern living room chair comes with removable and reversible down-filled cushions for comfort. Roomy seating is nice with company or family, and the neutral tone matches most decor, making it a great choice for any room. The luxury of a cotton-blend upholstery helps keep everyone cool through the summer.\", \"47\\\" Width x 43\\\" Depth x 33\\\" Height\", \"Solid hardwood frame with down-filled seat and back cushions\", \"Removable and reversible cushions\", \"This casual living room chair offers down-filled cushions and a seat depth of 43\\\" for extra comfort.\", \"No assembly required\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"studio\", \"recliner\", \"big\", \"mirror\", \"swivel\", \"64011\", \"egg\", \"signature\", \"seniors\", \"elderly\", \"lazy\", \"sign\", \"led\", \"boy\", \"corvette\", \"baxton\", \"reflect\", \"view\", \"furniture\", \"design\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2023-03-14T10:00:54Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfb0"},"product_id":3333,"item_id":"B07QFP4ZG4","category_id":93,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Joanna Contemporary Tufted Sofa Couch with Reversible Cushions, 84\"W, Blue","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Slate","weight_lb":122.0,"price_cents":83999,"stock":74,"description":"Clean lines give this sofa a modern, sophisticated look. Removable seat cushions and backs are comfortable and easy to adjust, and the performance fabric upholstery can be cleaned with a cloth or simple vacuuming. Steel seat springs and a wood frame provide structure, support and durability.\nOverall: 84\"W x 37\"D x 38\"H. Seat height: 21.5\"H; seat depth: 23\"D; seat back height: 19\"H\nSteel seat springs, wood frame and wood legs add structure and durability\nLoose, reversible seat cushions and inside back cushions in 100% polyester performance fabric\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nLightly vacuum every month or two to remove dirt and dust\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Clean lines give this sofa a modern, sophisticated look. Removable seat cushions and backs are comfortable and easy to adjust, and the performance fabric upholstery can be cleaned with a cloth or simple vacuuming. Steel seat springs and a wood frame provide structure, support and durability.\", \"Overall: 84\\\"W x 37\\\"D x 38\\\"H. Seat height: 21.5\\\"H; seat depth: 23\\\"D; seat back height: 19\\\"H\", \"Steel seat springs, wood frame and wood legs add structure and durability\", \"Loose, reversible seat cushions and inside back cushions in 100% polyester performance fabric\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Lightly vacuum every month or two to remove dirt and dust\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"recliner\", \"sectionals\", \"sierra\", \"mid\", \"chesterfield\", \"gray\", \"modern\", \"white\", \"furniture\", \"sectional\", \"power\", \"reclining\", \"farmhouse\", \"living\", \"set\", \"tuxedo\", \"sets\", \"modway\", \"leather\", \"room\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Sofas & Couches","created_at":"2023-01-06T23:43:43Z"}
