{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfc4"},"product_id":3353,"item_id":"B07QGSZ4LN","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Ravenna Home Margaret Modern Living Room Chair, 28\"W, Light Grey","brand":"Ravenna Home","color":"Light Grey","weight_lb":39.79,"price_cents":12999,"stock":50,"description":"28\"W x 30.5\"D x 37.5\"H; seat height: 18\"H; seat depth: 20.5\"D; back cushion height: 20\"H; arm height: 23.25\"H\nDurable fabric on wood frame; solid wood legs with natural finish\nFoam padding and an elastic suspension system help keep the back and seat firm and springy.\nModern style and classic comfort meet in one attractive chair.\nAssemble in 15-30 minutes\nAvoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"28\\\"W x 30.5\\\"D x 37.5\\\"H; seat height: 18\\\"H; seat depth: 20.5\\\"D; back cushion height: 20\\\"H; arm height: 23.25\\\"H\", \"Durable fabric on wood frame; solid wood legs with natural finish\", \"Foam padding and an elastic suspension system help keep the back and seat firm and springy.\", \"Modern style and classic comfort meet in one attractive chair.\", \"Assemble in 15-30 minutes\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"ravenna home\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2024-06-12T07:53:56Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfc5"},"product_id":3354,"item_id":"B07QGSZ4YJ","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Slade Contemporary Living Room Accent Swivel Chair, 27\"W, Aqua","brand":"Rivet","color":"Aqua","weight_lb":55.0,"price_cents":12999,"stock":274,"description":"The comfortable curved shape and cutout design give this swivel chair a modern look that coordinates with a variety of decor styles. The solid hardwood frame creates a sturdy base and foam cushions provide comfort.\nOverall: 27\"W x 22\"D x 28\"H; seat height: 18\"H; seat depth: 22\"D; seat back height: 27\"H; arm height: 28\"H; leg height: 1\"H\nSolid hardwood frame, wood swivel base, and 100% polyester fabric\nThis swivel chair adds a pop of style to a living room, bedroom or home office equally well.\nNo assembly required\nAvoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"The comfortable curved shape and cutout design give this swivel chair a modern look that coordinates with a variety of decor styles. The solid hardwood frame creates a sturdy base and foam cushions provide comfort.\", \"Overall: 27\\\"W x 22\\\"D x 28\\\"H; seat height: 18\\\"H; seat depth: 22\\\"D; seat back height: 27\\\"H; arm height: 28\\\"H; leg height: 1\\\"H\", \"Solid hardwood frame, wood swivel base, and 100% polyester fabric\", \"This swivel chair adds a pop of style to a living room, bedroom or home office equally well.\", \"No assembly required\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"studio\", \"gun\", \"egg\", \"powered\", \"huck\", \"fuel\", \"mid\", \"2550\", \"insert\", \"rivnut\", \"operated\", \"air\", \"battery\", \"nut\", \"tools\", \"nutsert\", \"m12\", \"baxton\", \"pneumatic\", \"millwalkie\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2023-04-02T15:24:39Z"}
