{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfc8"},"product_id":3357,"item_id":"B07QGWM3G2","category_id":89,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Aikins Modern Queen Bed Headboard, 68\"W, Glazed Mocha","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Wood","weight_lb":106.9,"price_cents":13999,"stock":69,"description":"This queen-size headboard in a charming neutral shade of glazed mocha gives your bed a sense of serene grandeur.\n68\"W x 5\"D x 50\"H\nGlazed mocha finish, oak veneers, select solids, champagne hardware\nThe casual contemporary style of this collection makes it the perfect addition or update to your bedroom.\nAssemble in 15-30 minutes\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\nWipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.","bullets":"[\"This queen-size headboard in a charming neutral shade of glazed mocha gives your bed a sense of serene grandeur.\", \"68\\\"W x 5\\\"D x 50\\\"H\", \"Glazed mocha finish, oak veneers, select solids, champagne hardware\", \"The casual contemporary style of this collection makes it the perfect addition or update to your bedroom.\", \"Assemble in 15-30 minutes\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\", \"Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\"]","keywords":"[\"diamonds\", \"de\", \"crema\", \"upholstery\", \"navy\", \"panels\", \"boards\", \"rattan\", \"taupe\", \"platform\", \"cal\", \"head\", \"distressed\", \"white\", \"furniture\", \"zinus\", \"and\", \"only\", \"clearance\", \"linen\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Bedroom Furniture/Beds, Frames & Bases/Headboards & Footboards/Headboards","created_at":"2023-06-17T11:05:17Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfc9"},"product_id":3358,"item_id":"B07QGWNLQX","category_id":94,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Modern Dining Chairs, Set of 2, 39.5\"H, Blue","brand":"Rivet","color":"Blue","weight_lb":32.89,"price_cents":8999,"stock":67,"description":"These high-back dining chairs feature blue plush upholstered fabric on a durable metal frame for a distinctive contemporary look. Open sides allow for freedom of movement, perfect for gatherings around the dining table.\n19.5\"W x 21.25\"D x 39.5\"H; seat height: 25.5\"H; seat depth: 17.5\"D; seat back height: 13.5\"H\nDurable fabric on metal frame\nThe foam padding and elastic suspension system help keep the back and seat firm and springy.\nContemporary design combines plush blue upholstered fabric with metal legs finished in black.\nAssemble in 15-30 minutes\nAvoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"These high-back dining chairs feature blue plush upholstered fabric on a durable metal frame for a distinctive contemporary look. Open sides allow for freedom of movement, perfect for gatherings around the dining table.\", \"19.5\\\"W x 21.25\\\"D x 39.5\\\"H; seat height: 25.5\\\"H; seat depth: 17.5\\\"D; seat back height: 13.5\\\"H\", \"Durable fabric on metal frame\", \"The foam padding and elastic suspension system help keep the back and seat firm and springy.\", \"Contemporary design combines plush blue upholstered fabric with metal legs finished in black.\", \"Assemble in 15-30 minutes\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"stool\", \"de\", \"gun\", \"microfiber\", \"24\", \"auto\", \"eames\", \"swivel\", \"waiting\", \"barstools\", \"iconic\", \"folding\", \"mid\", \"lucite\", \"tools\", \"leg\", \"barra\", \"inches\", \"rustic\", \"patio\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Game & Recreation Room Furniture/Home Bar Furniture/Barstools","created