{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfca"},"product_id":3359,"item_id":"B07QGWQM5D","category_id":83,"name":"Rivet Mid-Century Luxe Velvet Dining Chair, 34.1\"H, Set of 2, Dark Green","brand":"Rivet","color":"Dark Green","weight_lb":13.2,"price_cents":14999,"stock":5,"description":"These mid-century casual dining chairs in dark green offer a touch of glam with easy-care luxe velvet upholstery and a Hollywood regency flavor. Rounded edges on the seat and back along with golden powder-coated legs accent this simple design that comes as a set of 2.\n21\"W x 21.5\"D x 41\"H\nEasy-care fabric on wood frame with metal legs\nSoft, rounded edges on the seat and back\nThese casual dining chairs with a mid-century look offer a touch of glam with luxe velvet upholstery that rests on golden powder-coated legs.\nSimple assembly in 15-30 minutes\nVacuum or wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"These mid-century casual dining chairs in dark green offer a touch of glam with easy-care luxe velvet upholstery and a Hollywood regency flavor. Rounded edges on the seat and back along with golden powder-coated legs accent this simple design that comes as a set of 2.\", \"21\\\"W x 21.5\\\"D x 41\\\"H\", \"Easy-care fabric on wood frame with metal legs\", \"Soft, rounded edges on the seat and back\", \"These casual dining chairs with a mid-century look offer a touch of glam with luxe velvet upholstery that rests on golden powder-coated legs.\", \"Simple assembly in 15-30 minutes\", \"Vacuum or wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"country\", \"de\", \"microfiber\", \"eames\", \"gratien\", \"signature\", \"iconic\", \"folding\", \"mid\", \"armen\", \"rattan\", \"lucite\", \"leg\", \"rustic\", \"gray\", \"ghost\", \"modern\", \"para\", \"white\", \"furniture\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Kitchen & Dining Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2023-10-31T06:38:18Z"}
