{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfcf"},"product_id":3364,"item_id":"B07QH7KTJ2","category_id":34,"name":"AmazonBasics Performance Range 50-85\" Flat to Wall Low Profile Rail TV Mount","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Black","weight_lb":1.5,"price_cents":2799,"stock":23,"description":"From the stunning Performance range, comes this 50 – 85 inch flat to wall TV mount for all types and sizes of Plasma, LED or LCD televisions\nBeing a flat to wall mount, it has an easy rail style design which makes it easy to get a level mounting and can adapt to a wide range of TV screens\nWith a two-step slide in process which acts as a safety mechanism, you can trust the Performance wall mount to support your TV to a maximum weight of 40 kg (88 lbs)\nThe Performance series are simple, no-fuss TV mounts that offer fully featured, easy to use functionality at excellent value for money and come with a five-year warranty\nAll the brackets conform to the VESA standards which require an industry wide hole pattern on the back of the TV or monitor for mounting purposes – the VESA hole pattern for this mount is 600 x 400 mm","bullets":"[\"From the stunning Performance range, comes this 50 – 85 inch flat to wall TV mount for all types and sizes of Plasma, LED or LCD televisions\", \"Being a flat to wall mount, it has an easy rail style design which makes it easy to get a level mounting and can adapt to a wide range of TV screens\", \"With a two-step slide in process which acts as a safety mechanism, you can trust the Performance wall mount to support your TV to a maximum weight of 40 kg (88 lbs)\", \"The Performance series are simple, no-fuss TV mounts that offer fully featured, easy to use functionality at excellent value for money and come with a five-year warranty\", \"All the brackets conform to the VESA standards which require an industry wide hole pattern on the back of the TV or monitor for mounting purposes – the VESA hole pattern for this mount is 600 x 400 mm\"]","keywords":"[\"tv brackets mount wall bracket 32 inch 55 50\"]","node_path":"Categories/Home Cinema, TV & Video/Accessories/TV Mounts, Stands & Turntables/TV Wall & Ceiling Mounts","created_at":"2024-03-16T23:08:09Z"}
