{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfd1"},"product_id":3366,"item_id":"B07QHJPNQB","category_id":210,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Rustic Stoneware Crosshatch Indoor Outdoor Flower Plant Pot, 7.9\"H, Silver","brand":"Rivet","color":"Silver","weight_lb":5.7,"price_cents":3499,"stock":17,"description":"Planter is 100% stoneware with electroplated silver crosshatch textured look.\n8.7'' diameter x 7.9'' high\nDurable stoneware pot great for display or holding a plant. Clean, simple design and neutral colors will blend anywhere.\nWipes clean with soft, dry cloth. Pot includes a drainage hole.\nWith or without a plant, this pot will add class and sophistication to any room. The exterior is white with an electroplated silver colored finish, and the interior is metallic silver color. This piece will bridge modern and classic styles in your home.","bullets":"[\"Planter is 100% stoneware with electroplated silver crosshatch textured look.\", \"8.7'' diameter x 7.9'' high\", \"Durable stoneware pot great for display or holding a plant. Clean, simple design and neutral colors will blend anywhere.\", \"Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth. Pot includes a drainage hole.\", \"With or without a plant, this pot will add class and sophistication to any room. The exterior is white with an electroplated silver colored finish, and the interior is metallic silver color. This piece will bridge modern and classic styles in your home.\"]","keywords":"[\"tray\", \"bed\", \"tub\", \"half\", \"fig\", \"bin\", \"deck\", \"pots\", \"office\", \"cans\", \"stands\", \"whisky\", \"washtub\", \"fern\", \"tin\", \"wood\", \"tall\", \"stock\", \"10\", \"boxes\"]","node_path":"Categories/Gardening & Lawn Care/Pots, Planters & Container Accessories/Planters","created_at":"2024-05-22T12:41:42Z"}
