{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfd7"},"product_id":3372,"item_id":"B07QHKV56Y","category_id":213,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Modern Lattice-Patterned Rug, 5' x 8', Beige and Cream","brand":"Rivet","color":"","weight_lb":22.0,"price_cents":9999,"stock":2,"description":"A beige and cream geometric pattern creates a rug that is textured enough to create an accent anywhere it is placed but subtle enough to work with almost any room’s color scheme. The soft pile adds a warm and stylish cushioning to your bare floors.\n5'W x 8'L\nFront: 91% cotton, 8% polyester, 1% viscose; backing: 100% cotton\nModern geometric design in classic neutrals\nThe medium pile makes this rug ideal for moderate traffic areas.\nPair with rug pad (sold separately)","bullets":"[\"A beige and cream geometric pattern creates a rug that is textured enough to create an accent anywhere it is placed but subtle enough to work with almost any room’s color scheme. The soft pile adds a warm and stylish cushioning to your bare floors.\", \"5'W x 8'L\", \"Front: 91% cotton, 8% polyester, 1% viscose; backing: 100% cotton\", \"Modern geometric design in classic neutrals\", \"The medium pile makes this rug ideal for moderate traffic areas.\", \"Pair with rug pad (sold separately)\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"no\", \"fur\", \"pink\", \"rooms\", \"wool\", \"8x10\", \"skid\", \"woven\", \"yellow\", \"mid\", \"shaggy\", \"girls\", \"non\", \"trellis\", \"ft\", \"long\", \"shag\", \"colors\", \"fauxfur\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-01-10T07:08:34Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfd8"},"product_id":3373,"item_id":"B07QHKWJNQ","category_id":213,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Handtufted Diamond-Patterned Cotton and Wool Area Rug, 4' x 6', Cream with Blue and Orange","brand":"Rivet","color":"Orange/Navy","weight_lb":21.1,"price_cents":26999,"stock":25,"description":"This cotton-and-wool rug is soft and plush, the perfect accent for any bare space. The diamond pattern in bright blues and oranges will add a pop of color to your decor, offering a blend of the bohemian and modern that will suit any taste.\n4'W x 6'L\n85% wool, 15% cotton\nHandtufted with a geometric pattern\nThe high 0.6\" pile suits lower traffic areas such as bedrooms.\nPair with rug pad (sold separately)","bullets":"[\"This cotton-and-wool rug is soft and plush, the perfect accent for any bare space. The diamond pattern in bright blues and oranges will add a pop of color to your decor, offering a blend of the bohemian and modern that will suit any taste.\", \"4'W x 6'L\", \"85% wool, 15% cotton\", \"Handtufted with a geometric pattern\", \"The high 0.6\\\" pile suits lower traffic areas such as bedrooms.\", \"Pair with rug pad (sold separately)\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"foundry\", \"de\", \"nutserts\", \"auto\", \"huck\", \"powered\", \"rivnut\", \"cert\", \"nut\", \"body\", \"shag\", \"white\", \"nonslip\", \"rubber\", \"ruggables\", \"10\", \"laurel\", \"farmhouse\", \"large\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-11-26T04:54:35Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfd9"},"product_id":3374,"item_id":"B07QHL2D2V","category_id":210,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Modern Lattice-Patterned Stoneware Planter, 8.85\"H, Gray and White","brand":"Rivet","color":"","weight_lb":9.5,"price_cents":2599,"stock":16,"description":"Display your favorite plant in style with this visually engaging stoneware planter. Perfect for houseplants and succulents, this planter will provide the perfect finishing touch to your modern-style home decor, and its stoneware construction is durable and sturdy.\n10.04\" diameter x 8.85\"H\n100% stoneware\nBring this durable stoneware planter to life with colorful flowers, or use it as a simple home-decor piece.\nWipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.","bullets":"[\"Display your favorite plant in style with this visually engaging stoneware planter. Perfect for houseplants and succulents, this planter will provide the perfect finishing touch to your modern-style home decor, and its stoneware construction is durable and sturdy.\", \"10.04\\\" diameter x 8.85\\\"H\", \"100% stoneware\", \"Bring this durable stoneware planter to life with colorful flowers, or use it as a simple home-decor piece.\", \"Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\"]","keywords":"[\"ceramic\", \"tray\", \"bed\", \"next\", \"small\", \"concrete\", \"zz\", \"saucer\", \"6ft\", \"gardening\", \"fig\", \"deck\", \"snake\", \"mid\", \"box\", \"pots\", \"hydroponic\", \"air\", \"office\", \"vegetable\"]","node_path":"Categories/Gardening & Lawn Care/Pots, Planters & Container Accessories/Planters","created_at":"2023-03-10T22:36:11Z"}
