{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfdb"},"product_id":3376,"item_id":"B07QHYD995","category_id":93,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Hillman Mid-Century Sofa Couch with Wood Base and Legs, 78\"W, Ivory","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Ivory","weight_lb":112.2,"price_cents":56999,"stock":14,"description":"Wide, comfortable cushions are a hallmark of this mid-century inspired sofa. Easy-care ivory upholstery and reversible back cushions help keep this piece looking fresh. A hardwood frame connects to tapered wood legs and lends structure to the foam-padded cushions. High arms give additional support.\n78\"W x 38\"D x 33\"H; seat height: 18\"H; seat depth: 21\"D; seat back height: 18\"H; arm height: 26\"H; leg height: 8\"H\nSolid hardwood frame, tapered wood legs, and 85% polyester and 15% acrylic performance fabric\nRemovable and reversible back and throw cushions\nClassic shape and plush cushions make this sofa work in a variety of decors.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nAvoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Wide, comfortable cushions are a hallmark of this mid-century inspired sofa. Easy-care ivory upholstery and reversible back cushions help keep this piece looking fresh. A hardwood frame connects to tapered wood legs and lends structure to the foam-padded cushions. High arms give additional support.\", \"78\\\"W x 38\\\"D x 33\\\"H; seat height: 18\\\"H; seat depth: 21\\\"D; seat back height: 18\\\"H; arm height: 26\\\"H; leg height: 8\\\"H\", \"Solid hardwood frame, tapered wood legs, and 85% polyester and 15% acrylic performance fabric\", \"Removable and reversible back and throw cushions\", \"Classic shape and plush cushions make this sofa work in a variety of decors.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"bed\", \"small\", \"recliner\", \"sectionals\", \"rooms\", \"queen\", \"signature\", \"shaped\", \"chaise\", \"mid\", \"facing\", \"sleepers\", \"couches\", \"space\", \"out\", \"ikea\", \"sleep\", \"gray\", \"para\", \"modern\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Sofas & Couches","created_at":"2023-04-03T08:55:38Z"}
