{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfe5"},"product_id":3385,"item_id":"B07QJLBQBJ","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Industrial Wall Sconce Light with Clear Glass Shade, 9.5\"H, Dark Bronze","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Painted Bronze","weight_lb":2.68,"price_cents":9999,"stock":102,"description":"Quick installation means that you can easily bring light wherever you need it without adding a lot of extra furniture. The dark-bronze design of the compact, sturdy metal wall fixture will add a classic touch to any space. Light beams from the elongated clear glass shade, brightening any room.\n6.75\"W x 9\"D x 9.5\"H\nDark-bronze wall sconce with 1 light and an elongated clear glass shade\nThis versatile design mixes a touch of the nautical with modern industrial sophistication.\nIncludes 1 LED vintage-style bulb","bullets":"[\"Quick installation means that you can easily bring light wherever you need it without adding a lot of extra furniture. The dark-bronze design of the compact, sturdy metal wall fixture will add a classic touch to any space. Light beams from the elongated clear glass shade, brightening any room.\", \"6.75\\\"W x 9\\\"D x 9.5\\\"H\", \"Dark-bronze wall sconce with 1 light and an elongated clear glass shade\", \"This versatile design mixes a touch of the nautical with modern industrial sophistication.\", \"Includes 1 LED vintage-style bulb\"]","keywords":"[\"bed\", \"de\", \"mirror\", \"commercial\", \"lamps\", \"rubbed\", \"bright\", \"mid\", \"acegoo\", \"two\", \"vanity\", \"three\", \"switch\", \"fixtures\", \"gold\", \"rustic\", \"oil\", \"supplies\", \"pared\", \"insect\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Wall Lights/Wall Lamps & Sconces","created_at":"2023-01-26T21:50:55Z"}
