{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfe7"},"product_id":3388,"item_id":"B07QJNJCQS","category_id":274,"name":"AmazonBasics AMZN-FM-15RA Cartridge | Equivalent To Culligan FM-15RA Faucet Mount Replacement Filter - White Finish","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"White","weight_lb":0.06,"price_cents":1399,"stock":56,"description":"Faucet Mount Water Filter Cartridge: Equivalent To Culligan FM-15RA, this long-lasting replacement filter reduces sediment, chemicals, and unpleasant odors that are often associated with unfiltered water\n200 Gallon Filter: Featuring a flow rate of 5 GPM, and filter life of 2 months/200 gallons (depending on usage and conditions), this Amazon Basics faucet mount filter is perfect for the kitchen sink\nDiverter Tab: With a diverter valve that lets you easily switch between filtered and unfiltered water, this tap filter helps ensure that you have clean water on demand. Not compatible with drop down faucets\nReduce Class I Particulates: This advanced faucet mount water filter helps reduce class I particulates, atrazine, chlorine, lindane, lead, and turbidity so you have safe, great-tasting water\nAmazon Basics: We make premium water filtration systems, including faucet filters, whole house filters, under the sink filters, shower filters and more, so you can provide clean water for your whole family","bullets":"[\"Faucet Mount Water Filter Cartridge: Equivalent To Culligan FM-15RA, this long-lasting replacement filter reduces sediment, chemicals, and unpleasant odors that are often associated with unfiltered water\", \"200 Gallon Filter: Featuring a flow rate of 5 GPM, and filter life of 2 months/200 gallons (depending on usage and conditions), this Amazon Basics faucet mount filter is perfect for the kitchen sink\", \"Diverter Tab: With a diverter valve that lets you easily switch between filtered and unfiltered water, this tap filter helps ensure that you have clean water on demand. Not compatible with drop down faucets\", \"Reduce Class I Particulates: This advanced faucet mount water filter helps reduce class I particulates, atrazine, chlorine, lindane, lead, and turbidity so you have safe, great-tasting water\", \"Amazon Basics: We make premium water filtration systems, including faucet filters, whole house filters, under the sink filters, shower filters and more, so you can provide clean water for your whole family\"]","keywords":"[\"filtro,ff,de,advanced,pure,pur,purifier,mineralclear,para,filtered,attachment,stream,of,britta,pitcher,9999,faucets,hard,replacements,brita,kitchen,everything,day,on,agua,prime,tap,in,sink,132017515311,maxion,pack,lead,the,100,refill,filtration\"]","node_path":"Categories","created_at":"2023-10-03T18:57:38Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978abfe8"},"product_id":3389,"item_id":"B07QJWXMST","category_id":91,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Damien Mid-Century Modern Channel-Backed Loveseat, 61\"W, Leather, Cognac","brand":"Rivet","color":"Cognac","weight_lb":99.0,"price_cents":14999,"stock":13,"description":"A channeled back brings elegance to this mid-century 100% top grain leather love seat with tapered wood legs. The solid hardwood frame combines with the stain resistance of the upholstery, decreasing the wear and tear that comes with daily life and helping to keep this love seat looking like new.\n61\"W x 38\"D x 32\"H\nSolid hardwood frame, top grain leather, bench seat cushion with high-density foam, tapered wood legs, brass metal cap\nRemovable and reversible seat cushion\nA solid hardwood frame with high-density foam adds durability to this channel-backed mid-century love seat.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nAvoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"A channeled back brings elegance to this mid-century 100% top grain leather love seat with tapered wood legs. The solid hardwood frame combines with the stain resistance of the upholstery, decreasing the wear and tear that comes with daily life and helping to keep this love seat looking like new.\", \"61\\\"W x 38\\\"D x 32\\\"H\", \"Solid hardwood frame, top grain leather, bench seat cushion with high-density foam, tapered wood legs, brass metal cap\", \"Removable and reversible seat cushion\", \"A solid hardwood frame with high-density foam adds durability to this channel-backed mid-century love seat.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"bed\", \"recliner\", \"stool\", \"beam\", \"sectionals\", \"rooms\", \"casa\", \"jennifer\", \"queen\", \"shaped\", \"chaise\", \"mid\", \"couch\", \"fringed\", \"sleepers\", \"footstools\", \"space