{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac04f"},"product_id":3492,"item_id":"B07RFS8XMW","category_id":113,"name":"Whole Foods Market, Fizzing Bath Bomb, Frosted Winter Berry, 4.6 oz","brand":"Whole Foods Market","color":"","weight_lb":0.33,"price_cents":599,"stock":19,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. When it comes to innovative flavors and products sourced from artisans and producers around the world, the Whole Foods Market brand has you covered. Amazing products, exceptional ingredients, no compromises.\nFill your tub and release a fizzing bath bomb into pleasantly warm water. Thousands of tiny bubbles release the skin softening mixture of salt, sugar, coconut oil and natural fragrance from the most enjoyable of essential oils.\nSoak, breathe deeply, and enjoy the benefits of aromatherapy with a bathing experience that soothes and renews.\nProduct of USA.\nWhole Foods Market Premium Body Care.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. When it comes to innovative flavors and products sourced from artisans and producers around the world, the Whole Foods Market brand has you covered. Amazing products, exceptional ingredients, no compromises.\", \"Fill your tub and release a fizzing bath bomb into pleasantly warm water. Thousands of tiny bubbles release the skin softening mixture of salt, sugar, coconut oil and natural fragrance from the most enjoyable of essential oils.\", \"Soak, breathe deeply, and enjoy the benefits of aromatherapy with a bathing experience that soothes and renews.\", \"Product of USA.\", \"Whole Foods Market Premium Body Care.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"Products/Personal Care/Bath & Bathing Accessories/Bath/Bubble Bath","created_at":"2024-01-03T06:42:53Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac050"},"product_id":3493,"item_id":"B07RFS91SD","category_id":113,"name":"365 by Whole Foods Market, Organic Shelf-Stable Coconutmilk, Unsweetened - Original, 32 Fl Oz","brand":"365 by Whole Foods Market","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":699,"stock":2,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\nLooking for the perfect dairy-free, plant-based milk alternative? Pour a smooth 50-calorie cup of our Organic Coconutmilk and be impressed.\nNo sugar was added, but there’s still a subtle sweetness and, of course, delicious notes of coconut in every sip. It’s amazing what organic coconut cream can do when prepped just right—like make it hard to just sip.\nExcellent Source of Vitamins D & B12\nLow-Sodium\nVegan\nCertified Kosher\nUSDA Certified Organic\nQAI Certified Organic - If It's Organic It's Non-GMO","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\", \"Looking for the perfect dairy-free, plant-based milk alternative? Pour a smooth 50-calorie cup of our Organic Coconutmilk and be impressed.\", \"No sugar was added, but there’s still a subtle sweetness and, of course, delicious notes of coconut in every sip. It’s amazing what organic coconut cream can do when prepped just right—like make it hard to just sip.\", \"Excellent Source of Vitamins D & B12\", \"Low-Sodium\", \"Vegan\", \"Certified Kosher\", \"USDA Certified Organic\", \"QAI Certified Organic - If It's Organic It's Non-GMO\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-06-11T05:11:57Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac051"},"product_id":3494,"item_id":"B07RFS91YW","category_id":113,"name":"365 Everyday Value, Hand Sanitizing Gel, Peppermint Vanilla, 1 fl oz","brand":"365 Everyday Value","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":599,"stock":169,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.\nCarry holiday scents with you wherever you go with our Peppermint hand sanitizer gel. Effectively kills 99.9% of germs and bacteria.\nMade with chia seed oil and glycerin to replace moisture. Comes with a carabiner clip for easy transportation.\nLimited edition, so get it while you can!\nWhole Foods Market Premium Body Care.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. Our standards are what set us apart, and our quality is what keeps us stocking pantries, fridges and freezers with the best natural and organic 365 Everyday Value products every day.\", \"Carry holiday scents with you wherever you go with our Peppermint hand sanitizer gel. Effectively kills 99.9% of germs and bacteria.\", \"Made with chia seed oil and glycerin to replace moisture. Comes with a carabiner clip for easy transportation.\", \"Limited edition, so get it while you can!\", \"Whole Foods Market Premium Body Care.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"Products/Foot, Hand & Nail Care/Foot & Hand Care","created_at":"2023-06-30T13:36:32Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac052"},"product_id":3495,"item_id":"B07RFS96PQ","category_id":113,"name":"365 Everyday Value, Maximum Digestive Health Probiotic 10 Billion CFU, 30 ct","brand":"365 by Whole Foods Market","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1699,"stock":0,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\nOur Maximum Digestive Health Probiotic formula combines 2 types of beneficial bacteria, including L. rhamnosus GG and l. acidophilus, to help reduce digestive upsets and ease occasional gas and bloating.\nEach capsule contains 10 billion colony forming units (CFU), and when taken daily, helps promote growth of beneficial microflora and helps support digestive health. Probiotics may support balance in the gastrointestinal tract.\nThe two Probiotic strains have been clinically studied for safety and efficacy. Compare with probiotic strain in Culturelle Digestive Health.\nCertified Vegetarian.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\", \"Our Maximum Digestive Health Probiotic formula combines 2 types of beneficial bacteria, including L. rhamnosus GG and l. acidophilus, to help reduce digestive upsets and ease occasional gas and bloating.\", \"Each capsule contains 10 billion colony forming units (CFU), and when taken daily, helps promote growth of beneficial microflora and helps support digestive health. Probiotics may support balance in the gastrointestinal tract.\", \"The two Probiotic strains have been clinically studied for safety and efficacy. Compare with probiotic strain in Culturelle Digestive Health.\", \