{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac05a"},"product_id":3503,"item_id":"B07RGL7283","category_id":148,"name":"FIND - Contour Brush Set for Foundation, Bronzer and Contouring - 3 Brushes - No. 08, No. 09, No. 14","brand":"find.","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":2199,"stock":34,"description":"Box contents: 3 brushes - foundation (no.08), bronzer (no.09), contouring (no.14)\nThe perfect set to apply your makeup. Our products provide even better results.\nThe foundation brush (no.08) is ideal for liquid, creamy and powder foundation. The flat tip allows for even and smooth application.\nThe bronze brush (#09) has a soft, round tip, so you get the desired shade. Best used with loose or pressed powder.\nThe No.14 Contour Brush has an angled tip that adapts to the cheekbones, forehead and jaw, giving you a flawless finish. It is ideal for liquid, creamy and powder make-up.\nUse water with detergent to clean the brushes","bullets":"[\"Box contents: 3 brushes - foundation (no.08), bronzer (no.09), contouring (no.14)\", \"The perfect set to apply your makeup. Our products provide even better results.\", \"The foundation brush (no.08) is ideal for liquid, creamy and powder foundation. The flat tip allows for even and smooth application.\", \"The bronze brush (#09) has a soft, round tip, so you get the desired shade. Best used with loose or pressed powder.\", \"The No.14 Contour Brush has an angled tip that adapts to the cheekbones, forehead and jaw, giving you a flawless finish. It is ideal for liquid, creamy and powder make-up.\", \"Use water with detergent to clean the brushes\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-12-24T09:19:17Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac05b"},"product_id":3504,"item_id":"B07RGQFQJ8","category_id":72,"name":"Amazon Brand - Arthur Harvey Men's BLACK Leather Formal Shoes - 11 UK (AZ-ST-009A)","brand":"Amazon Brand - Arthur Harvey","color":"BLACK","weight_lb":"","price_cents":3799,"stock":2,"description":"Outer Material: Leather\nProduct Type: Men's Formal Shoes\nShoe Width: Regular\nClosure Type: Lace-Up\nToe Style: Pointed Toe\nHeel Type: Block Heel; Heel Height: 1 inches\nWarranty Type: Seller\nProduct warranty against manufacturing defects: 90 days\nCare Instructions: Clean your shoes with leather cleaner or leather shampoo, and use a good quality brush to remove loose surface dirt; If your shoes are wet after cleaning, let them air-dry before your proceed with the next step; Dry shoes in room temperature only and never expose them to the sun; Heat from the sun will cause the leather to shrink, wrinkle, harden, dry, and crack.","bullets":"[\"Outer Material: Leather\", \"Product Type: Men's Formal Shoes\", \"Shoe Width: Regular\", \"Closure Type: Lace-Up\", \"Toe Style: Pointed Toe\", \"Heel Type: Block Heel; Heel Height: 1 inches\", \"Warranty Type: Seller\", \"Product warranty against manufacturing defects: 90 days\", \"Care Instructions: Clean your shoes with leather cleaner or leather shampoo, and use a good quality brush to remove loose surface dirt; If your shoes are wet after cleaning, let them air-dry before your proceed with the next step; Dry shoes in room temperature only and never expose them to the sun; Heat from the sun will cause the leather to shrink, wrinkle, harden, dry, and crack.\"]","keywords":"[\"formal shoes for mens leather\", \"leather shoes for mens\", \"formal shoes for men black\", \"shoes\", \"leather shoes for men formal branded\", \"shoes for men\", \"shoes for men formal\", \"men shoes casual shoes\", \"mens shoes\"]","node_path":"Categories/Shoes/Men's Shoes/Formal Shoes","created_at":"2024-05-12T05:57:14Z"}
