{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac0b3"},"product_id":3592,"item_id":"B07S69L94Q","category_id":193,"name":"UMI. Essentials 7x5 Photo Frames Glass Mirrored Picture Frame 7 x 5 Set, 4 Pack, Tabletop Display","brand":"UMI","color":"7x5","weight_lb":2.43,"price_cents":3999,"stock":13,"description":"PACKAGE includes 4 piece 7x5 inch photo frames,the overall size of frame is about 9x7 inches,fits7x5 photo,it’s a great addition for your desk, table, countertop and more.\nHIGH-QUALIT MATERIAL: Made of real glass frame protects your pictures from duct, moisture, tearing and more. It is easy to clean and will save your time.\nATTRACTIVE DESIGN: Glass photo frames accented with mirror front design, it helps draw the eye to the photo and look excellent on a mantelpiece, a sideboard, a coffee table or a chest of drawers.\nVERSATILE AND FLEXIBLE: Photos can be added or changed easily with turn buttons. This is a modern and elegant frame for displaying photos, degrees, diplomas, etc.\nFITS FOR DIFFRENT OCCASIONS: 4 pack 7 x 5 photo frames are a great addition for any room decoration. Perfect gift for special occasion like Valentine's day, Birthday, Wedding, Anniversary, Sweetest day,Christmas day.","bullets":"[\"PACKAGE includes 4 piece 7x5 inch photo frames,the overall size of frame is about 9x7 inches,fits7x5 photo,it’s a great addition for your desk, table, countertop and more.\", \"HIGH-QUALIT MATERIAL: Made of real glass frame protects your pictures from duct, moisture, tearing and more. It is easy to clean and will save your time.\", \"ATTRACTIVE DESIGN: Glass photo frames accented with mirror front design, it helps draw the eye to the photo and look excellent on a mantelpiece, a sideboard, a coffee table or a chest of drawers.\", \"VERSATILE AND FLEXIBLE: Photos can be added or changed easily with turn buttons. This is a modern and elegant frame for displaying photos, degrees, diplomas, etc.\", \"FITS FOR DIFFRENT OCCASIONS: 4 pack 7 x 5 photo frames are a great addition for any room decoration. Perfect gift for special occasion like Valentine's day, Birthday, Wedding, Anniversary, Sweetest day,Christmas day.\"]","keywords":"[\"7x5 glass 5x7 desk tabletop standing mirror crystal photo picture frames set pack bulk 7 by 5 family wedding baby 7 x 5 multi kidsmom dad sister grandparents friends office grandma photo frame collage birthday anniversary christmas gifts home decor\"]","node_path":"Home & Garden/Home & Kitchen/Categories/Home Accessories/Photo Frames/Wall & Tabletop Frames","created_at":"2024-06-19T10:47:16Z"}
