{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac0ba"},"product_id":3599,"item_id":"B07S8DRS5Q","category_id":288,"name":"AmazonBasics Metal Stapler - Small, 20 Sheet","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"","weight_lb":0.55,"price_cents":4899,"stock":21,"description":"Stapler holds a full strip of 210 staples and offers a 20-sheet stapling capacity\nCan be opened for easily tacking papers to a bulletin board; can also produce pointed staples for temporarily pinning up documents (simply reverse the anvil)\nMade of durable metal for long-lasting reliable performance; small size works well on any desktop\nLow-staple indicator shows when it’s time to refill the stapler\nBacked by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty","bullets":"[\"Stapler holds a full strip of 210 staples and offers a 20-sheet stapling capacity\", \"Can be opened for easily tacking papers to a bulletin board; can also produce pointed staples for temporarily pinning up documents (simply reverse the anvil)\", \"Made of durable metal for long-lasting reliable performance; small size works well on any desktop\", \"Low-staple indicator shows when it’s time to refill the stapler\", \"Backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"standard\", \"kokuyo\", \"de\", \"commercial\", \"basics\", \"stampler\", \"pink\", \"staple\", \"held\", \"harinacks\", \"1000\", \"office\", \"tools\", \"red\", \"dispenser\", \"bates\", \"swinger\", \"teacher\", \"school\", \"staplers\"]","node_path":"Categories/Office & School Supplies/Staplers & Punches/Manual Staplers/Desktop Staplers","created_at":"2024-06-20T22:11:18Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac0bb"},"product_id":3600,"item_id":"B07S9555SL","category_id":34,"name":"Eono by Amazon - TV Wall Mount Swivels and Tilts for Most 26-55 Inch LED, LCD, OLED TVs up to VESA 400 x 400 mm and 27 kg Fischer dowels","brand":"Eono","color":"","weight_lb":10.14,"price_cents":4699,"stock":110,"description":"Compatibility: this TV wall mount is compatible with most 66 - 140 cm (26 - 55 inches) TVs up to 45 kg with VESA standard from 75 x 75 mm to 400 x 400 mm. This TV mount is intended for the installation of solid concrete, concrete block walls and wooden posts. It is not suitable for drywall / plasterboard wall.\nAdjustable in many positions, this TV mount can be tilted +5° and -15° and rotated ±45°. (The max. swivel angle depends on TV size). The level adjustment of ±3° after installation allows for perfect TV levelling. The wall distance from the TV wall bracket is 79 - 389 mm. Your TV will now be mounted on the wall securely, space-saving and stylish thanks to these features. Watching TV is more convenient.\nEasy to install thanks to a wide range of accessories: the 3-step installation with proper instructions in 5 languages (EN / DE / FR / ES / IT) is very easy. All accessories supplied are in pre-labelled bags. The included template helps to find the mounting holes on the wall easier and faster.\nPatented design: thanks to the robust material construction and robot welding technology, this wall mount for TV is stable and safe. With double arms, this TV mount offers you double security and better viewing experience.\nYou can find a suitable TV wall mount: please check the images on the left, on this website before ordering, to determine whether this TV mount is compatible with your TV. - There is always one that suits your needs. -","bullets":"[\"Compatibility: this TV wall mount is compatible with most 66 - 140 cm (26 - 55 inches) TVs up to 45 kg with VESA standard from 75 x 75 mm to 400 x 400 mm. This TV mount is intended for the installation of solid concrete, concrete block walls and wooden posts. It is not suitable for drywall / plasterboard wall.\", \"Adjustable in many positions, this TV mount can be tilted +5° and -15° and rotated ±45°. (The max. swivel angle depends on TV size). The level adjustment of ±3° after installation allows for perfect TV levelling. The wall distance from the TV wall bracket is 79 - 389 mm. Your TV will now be mounted on the wall securely, space-saving and stylish thanks to these features. Watching TV is more convenient.\", \"Easy to install thanks to a wide range of accessories: the 3-step installation with proper instructions in 5 languages (EN / DE / FR / ES / IT) is very easy. All accessories supplied are in pre-labelled bags. The included template helps to find the mounting holes on the wall easier and faster.\", \"Patented design: thanks to the robust material construction and robot welding technology, this wall mount for TV is stable and safe. With double arms, this TV mount offers you double security and better viewing experience.\", \"You can find a suitable TV wall mount: please check the images on the left, on this website before ordering, to determine whether this TV mount is compatible with your TV. - There is always one that suits your needs. -\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-06-23T09:15:30Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac0bc"},"product_id":3601,"item_id":"B07S9692CN","category_id":297,"name":"Eono Essentials TV Wall Mount Tiltable for Many 26-55 Inch LEDs, LCD, OLED, Plasma TVs up to VESA 400 x 400 mm and 40 kg, Inclinable TV Bracket including Fischer dowels","brand":"Eono","color":"","weight_lb":4.72,"price_cents":1599,"stock":71,"description":"Compatibility: this TV wall mount is compatible with most 37-70 inches (93-177 cm) TVs up to 60 kg with max. VESA standard 600 x 400 mm compatible. This TV mount is intended for the installation of solid concrete, concrete block walls and wooden posts. It is not suitable for drywall / plasterboard wall!\nPatented and ultra-thin design - let your TV stand up to 38 mm close to the wall. Your TV is now securely mounted on the wall, saving space and stylishly. Tilt your TV forward (+8°) by tilting it to reduce glare for better viewing. Simply lock or unlock your TV with the locking strap.\nEasy to install thanks to a wide range of accessories – the 3-step installation with proper instructions in 5 languages (EN / DE / FR / ES / IT) is very easy. All included accessories (including spirit level and Velcro fastener for cable management) are in pre-labeled bags.\nUltra robust and safe – thanks to the robust material construction and robot welding technology, this wall mount for TV is stable and safe. This TV wall mount has passed CE and RoHS certification. Our TV wall mount comes with a 10-year guarantee.\nYou can find suitable TV wall mount – please check the left images on this website before ordering to determine whether this TV mount is compatible with your TV. If not, please search for other TV mounts at Eono Essentials. There is always one that suits your needs. If there is any question, please contact our professional customer service team.","bullets":"[\"Compatibility: this TV wall mount is compatible with most 37-70 inches (93-177 cm) TVs up to 60 kg with max. VESA standard 600 x 400 mm compatible. This TV mount is intended for the installation of solid concrete, concrete block walls and wooden posts. It is not suitable for drywall / plasterboard wall!\", \"Patented and ultra-thin design - let your TV stand up to 38 mm close to the wall. Your TV is now securely mounted on the wall, saving space and stylishly. Tilt your TV forward (+8°) by tilting it to reduce glare for better viewing. Simply lock or unlock your TV with the locking strap.\", \"Easy to install thanks to a wide range of accessories – the 3-step installation with proper instructions in 5 languages (EN / DE / FR / ES / IT) is very easy. All included accessories (including spirit level and Velcro fastener for cable management) are in pre-labeled bags.\", \"Ultra robust and safe – thanks to the robust material construction and robot welding technology, this wall mount for TV is stable and safe. This TV wall mount has passed CE and RoHS certification. Our TV wall mount comes with a 10-year guarantee.\", \"You can find suitable TV wall mount – please check the left images on this website before ordering to determine whether this TV mount is compatible with your TV. If not, please search for other TV mounts at Eono Essentials. There is always one that suits your needs. If there is any question, please contact our professional customer service team.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-06-24T14:10:45Z"}
