{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac11a"},"product_id":3695,"item_id":"B07T4PNFMN","category_id":72,"name":"Amazon Brand - Symbol Men's Tan Leather Formal Shoes - 6 UK (AZ-WS-115C)","brand":"Amazon Brand - Symbol","color":"Tan","weight_lb":"","price_cents":6499,"stock":36,"description":"Outer Material: Leather\nProduct Type: Men's Formal Shoes\nShoe Width: Regular\nClosure Type: Lace-Up\nToe Style: Round Toe\nHeel Type: Block Heel; Heel Height: 1 inches\nWarranty Type: Seller\nProduct warranty against manufacturing defects: 90 days\nCare Instructions: Clean your shoes with leather cleaner or leather shampoo, and use a good quality brush to remove loose surface dirt; If your shoes are wet after cleaning, let them air-dry before your proceed with the next step; Dry shoes in room temperature only and never expose them to the sun; Heat from the sun will cause the leather to shrink, wrinkle, harden, dry, and crack.","bullets":"[\"Outer Material: Leather\", \"Product Type: Men's Formal Shoes\", \"Shoe Width: Regular\", \"Closure Type: Lace-Up\", \"Toe Style: Round Toe\", \"Heel Type: Block Heel; Heel Height: 1 inches\", \"Warranty Type: Seller\", \"Product warranty against manufacturing defects: 90 days\", \"Care Instructions: Clean your shoes with leather cleaner or leather shampoo, and use a good quality brush to remove loose surface dirt; If your shoes are wet after cleaning, let them air-dry before your proceed with the next step; Dry shoes in room temperature only and never expose them to the sun; Heat from the sun will cause the leather to shrink, wrinkle, harden, dry, and crack.\"]","keywords":"[\"formal shoes for mens leather\", \"leather shoes for mens\", \"formal shoes for men black\", \"shoes\", \"leather shoes for men formal branded\", \"shoes for men\", \"shoes for men formal\", \"men shoes casual shoes\", \"mens shoes\"]","node_path":"Categories/Shoes/Men's Shoes/Formal Shoes","created_at":"2024-05-21T07:00:26Z"}
