{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac11e"},"product_id":3699,"item_id":"B07T61JF2Z","category_id":336,"name":"AmazonCommercial Heavy Duty Double Diaphragm Transfer Pump 1/2\" FPM / FKM - 13GPM / 50LPM Polypropylene Air Operated Pneumatic for Bio-diesel, Windscreen & Similar Chemicals","brand":"AmazonCommercial","color":"","weight_lb":12.0,"price_cents":1899,"stock":50,"description":"Heavy-duty double diaphragm fuel pump for transferring non-flammable liquids like bio-diesel, windscreen, and similar chemicals (note: DO NOT USE for gasoline, diesel, or other similar types of combustible fuels)\nSelf-priming pneumatic pump provides a flow rate of 13GPM (50LPM); ideal for fuel stations, construction sites, textile factories, mining stations, and environmental/water facilities\nMaximum pressure of 116PSI/8BAR with 1/2-inch inlet/outlets and an air inlet of 1/4-inch NPT; maximum suction height of 10 feet and a maximum head of 164 feet; can accommodate suspended solids up to 1/8-inch wide\nCompact, lightweight design with durable aluminum/polypropylene body and PTFE ball valves; membrane, o-rings, seals, and elastomers are made of FKM/FPM (Fluorocarbon rubber) material\nMount upright for safety; measures 10.3 by 6.7 by 11.8 inches; weighs 12 pounds; backed by an AmazonCommercial 1-year limited warranty","bullets":"[\"Heavy-duty double diaphragm fuel pump for transferring non-flammable liquids like bio-diesel, windscreen, and similar chemicals (note: DO NOT USE for gasoline, diesel, or other similar types of combustible fuels)\", \"Self-priming pneumatic pump provides a flow rate of 13GPM (50LPM); ideal for fuel stations, construction sites, textile factories, mining stations, and environmental/water facilities\", \"Maximum pressure of 116PSI/8BAR with 1/2-inch inlet/outlets and an air inlet of 1/4-inch NPT; maximum suction height of 10 feet and a maximum head of 164 feet; can accommodate suspended solids up to 1/8-inch wide\", \"Compact, lightweight design with durable aluminum/polypropylene body and PTFE ball valves; membrane, o-rings, seals, and elastomers are made of FKM/FPM (Fluorocarbon rubber) material\", \"Mount upright for safety; measures 10.3 by 6.7 by 11.8 inches; weighs 12 pounds; backed by an AmazonCommercial 1-year limited warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"gas siphon\", \"siphon pump\", \"siphon pump for gasoline\", \"transfer pump\", \"fuel transfer pump\", \"fluid pump\", \"siphon\", \"oil pump\", \"gas siphon hand pump\", \"fluid transfer pump\", \"fuel siphon\", \"gas siphon,siphon pump,siphon pump for gasoline\"]","node_path":"Categories/Hydraulics, Pneumatics & Plumbing/Pneumatic Equipment/Pumps/Diaphragm Pumps","created_at":"2023-08-01T08:31:35Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac11f"},"product_id":3700,"item_id":"B07T6GDGYS","category_id":329,"name":"AmazonBasics Digital Tire Pressure Gauge - Red, 3-Pack","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"red","weight_lb":0.22,"price_cents":2599,"stock":68,"description":"Digital tire pressure gauge (red, 3-pack) with LED flashlight and backlight for quick, easy tire-pressure readings, even in dim light\nPressure range from 3-100 PSI with a high level of accuracy (+/-1 PSI)\nMade of durable ABS and stainless steel; battery powered: 3 LR44 and 1 CR2039 included\nIdeal for cars, trucks, and other vehicles; compact size can be easily stored in a glove box\nMeasures 5.3 by 2.2 by 1.2 inches; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited *","bullets":"[\"Digital tire pressure gauge (red, 3-pack) with LED flashlight and backlight for quick, easy tire-pressure readings, even in dim light\", \"Pressure range from 3-100 PSI with a high level of accuracy (+/-1 PSI)\", \"Made of durable ABS and stainless steel; battery powered: 3 LR44 and 1 CR2039 included\", \"Ideal for cars, trucks, and other vehicles; compact size can be easily stored in a glove box\", \"Measures 5.3 by 2.2 by 1.2 inches; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited *\"]","keywords":"[\"auto;$10;bicycle;truck;gage;presta;dollars;gauges;air;accutire;bike;motorcycle;low;car;men;electronic;gifts;10;tires;image;sharper;accessories;accugage;mens;cars;guage;astroai;accu;astroal;under;women\"]","node_path":"Categories","created_at":"2023-11-15T14:22:29Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac120"},"product_id":3701,"item_id":"B07T6VNGJ1","category_id":336,"name":"AmazonCommercial Air Operated Pneumatic Oil Transfer Pump Heavy Duty Double Action 5:1 High Pressure 180PSI Flow Rate 10.6GPM / 40LPM for SAE240 Oils/Fluids (NOT for Gasoline or Diesel)","brand":"AmazonCommercial","color":"","weight_lb":17.0,"price_cents":1699,"stock":18,"description":"Heavy-duty air-operated (pneumatic) oil transfer pump provides a high flow rate of 10.6GPM (40LPM); for use with SAE240 oils and fluids, including motor oil, synthetic hydraulic oil, gear oil, and automatic transmission fluid (NOT for gasoline or diesel)\nDouble-action self-priming pump delivers a 5:1 compression ratio, an air inlet pressure of 1.2MPa / 5-12BAR / 70-180PSI, and a maximum fluid pressure of 6 MPa / 60BAR / 870PSI\nEfficiently uses compressed air supply for continuous pump operation without icing; minimal moving parts in the air motor assembly mean less downtime and lower repair costs\nMade of heavy-duty industrial-grade stainless steel; corrosion-resistant design also includes liquid salt nitriding, nickel plating, aluminum, and chrome for longer life; impact-resistant polypropylene case included for storage and transport\nEasy to install; can be barrel, cart, or wall mounted (wall mount kit or extension tub kit sold separately); measures 9.8 by 7.9 by 28.6 inches; weighs 17 pounds; backed by an AmazonCommercial 1-year limited warranty","bullets":"[\"Heavy-duty air-operated (pneumatic) oil transfer pump provides a high flow rate of 10.6GPM (40LPM); for use with SAE240 oils and fluids, including motor oil, synthetic hydraulic oil, gear oil, and automatic transmission fluid (NOT for gasoline or diesel)\", \"Double-action self-priming pump delivers a 5:1 compression ratio, an air inlet pressure of 1.2MPa / 5-12BAR / 70-180PSI, and a maximum fluid pressure of 6 MPa / 60BAR / 870PSI\", \"Efficiently uses compressed air supply for continuous pump operation without icing; minimal moving parts in the air motor assembly mean less downtime and lower repair costs\", \"Made of heavy-duty industrial-grade stainless steel; corrosion-resistant design also includes liquid salt nitriding, nickel plating, aluminum, and chrome for longer life; impact-resistant polypropylene case included for storage and transport\", \"Easy to install; can be barrel, cart, or wall mounted (wall mount kit or extension tub kit sold separately); measures 9.8 by 7.9 by 28.6 inches; weighs 17 pounds; backed by an AmazonCommercial 1-year limited warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"gas siphon\", \"siphon pump\", \"siphon pump for gasoline\", \"transfer pump\", \"fuel transfer pump\", \"fluid pump\", \"siphon\", \"oil pump\", \"gas siphon hand pump\", \"fluid transfer pump\", \"fuel siphon\", \"gas siphon,siphon pump,siphon pump for gasoline\"]","node_path":"Categories/Replacement Parts/Engines & Engine Parts/Engine Parts/Oil Pumps & Parts/Oil Pumps","created_at":"2024-03-28T12:40:26Z"}
