{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac178"},"product_id":3789,"item_id":"B07TKH7LY2","category_id":193,"name":"UMI by Amazon Curtains Thermal Insulated Tab Top Blackout Curtains for Livingroom 55 x 70 Inch Royal Blue Two Panels","brand":"UMI","color":"Blue","weight_lb":"","price_cents":2499,"stock":49,"description":"Package Detail: Two panels per package, each curtain measuring 140 x 175 cm. Umi solid blackout curtains are crafted from import premium quality soft fabric (100% Polyester).\nPerfect Blackout Performance: Advanced triple weave technology promise the nice shading effect and hang down feeling of our curtains. They will impede most of the extra sunlight and prevent your furniture from summer sun exposure to promise a longer service life.\nThermal Insulation and Energy Smart: Umi thermal insulated room darkening curtains will balance your room temperature by preventing from heat escaping. They will keep heat from getting out during winter and in during summer, thereby they will save your energy bill.\nHome Decoration: On appearance design, we use the contracted design style. Simple designs tend to be timelessly \"in\", outlasting passing trends because they are the basis of good design. With elegant colors, Umi curtains will blend well with your home decor and provide comfort in style.\nEasy Care: Machine washable with gentle iron. Please wash in cold water.","bullets":"[\"Package Detail: Two panels per package, each curtain measuring 140 x 175 cm. Umi solid blackout curtains are crafted from import premium quality soft fabric (100% Polyester).\", \"Perfect Blackout Performance: Advanced triple weave technology promise the nice shading effect and hang down feeling of our curtains. They will impede most of the extra sunlight and prevent your furniture from summer sun exposure to promise a longer service life.\", \"Thermal Insulation and Energy Smart: Umi thermal insulated room darkening curtains will balance your room temperature by preventing from heat escap