ools necessary for setup, as well as two markers and an eraser. The heavy-duty frame is easy to assemble and is built to withstand the most demanding environments in schools, offices, hospitals, universities, and more.\", \"Your satisfaction and happiness are our top priority, and that's why we go above and beyond to ship our whiteboards in reinforced multi-layer padded boxes for maximum protection. In addition, with your purchase, you receive our Lifetime Satisfaction Guarantee. LOVE IT OR YOUR MONEY BACK!\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-10-03T03:07:03Z"}
