{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac1ac"},"product_id":3841,"item_id":"B07V1N548D","category_id":324,"name":"AmazonCommercial 24-inch Push Broom Kit, Fine Floor - 6-Pack","brand":"AmazonCommercial","color":"","weight_lb":3.02,"price_cents":2599,"stock":0,"description":"6-pack of push brooms for fine floors; includes both broom heads and handles\nDesigned for reliable performance in the most demanding industrial settings\nPlastic foam block-style head picks up small particles and resists cracking, warping, and bacteria growth\n2 threaded handle holes allow for switching the handle from one side of the block to the other for even wear\nBroom head 24 inches wide\nBacked by an AmazonComcercial 1-year limited warranty","bullets":"[\"6-pack of push brooms for fine floors; includes both broom heads and handles\", \"Designed for reliable performance in the most demanding industrial settings\", \"Plastic foam block-style head picks up small particles and resists cracking, warping, and bacteria growth\", \"2 threaded handle holes allow for switching the handle from one side of the block to the other for even wear\", \"Broom head 24 inches wide\", \"Backed by an AmazonComcercial 1-year limited warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"concrete\", \"squeegie\", \"commercial\", \"shop\", \"curved\", \"deck\", \"floors\", \"sqeegy\", \"construction\", \"squeegee\", \"brush\", \"large\", \"wallpaper\", \"garage\", \"court\", \"water\", \"squugee\", \"tennis\", \"heavy\", \"outdoor\"]","node_path":"Products/Household Supplies/Cleaning Tools/Sweeping/Brooms/Push Brooms","created_at":"2024-06-24T18:06:10Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac1ad"},"product_id":3842,"item_id":"B07V2BGM4R","category_id":40,"name":"AmazonBasics USB 3.0 7-Port HUB with AC Adapter, Black","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Black","weight_lb":0.59,"price_cents":2999,"stock":31,"description":"Includes 2 USB 3.0 ports (blue terminal) and 5 USB 2.0 ports (white terminal) for connecting multiple peripherals to PCs and laptops\nThe 2 USB 3.0 ports (blue terminal) support 5Gbps high-speed transmission and are backwards compatible with USB 2.0 (480Mbps). The 5 USB 2.0 ports (white terminal) support 480Mbps transmission. In order to benefit from USB 3.0 high-speed charging all devices/cables connected must support USB 3.0 specifications.\nThe first USB 3.0 port (with lightning symbol) provides a 1.5 Amp output and can be used to charge your device. The second USB 3.0 port (without lightning symbol) provide a 900mA output while the USB 2.0 ports can provide a 500mA output each. Please use the DC Adapter (included) when connecting high-current devices and ensure total consumption across all connected devices does not exceed 4A.\nCompatible with all major operating systems including Windows Vista, Windows XP, Windows Me, Windows 2000, Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 10, and Mac OS X v10.8-10.12.5.\nSlim case takes up minimal desk space and is easy to travel with\nIncludes a 5V/4A DC Power Adapter (20W) and USB 3.0 Micro-B to USB-A data cable. Backed by an AmazonBasics 1-Year Standard Limited Warranty","bullets":"[\"Includes 2 USB 3.0 ports (blue terminal) and 5 USB 2.0 ports (white terminal) for connecting multiple peripherals to PCs and laptops\", \"The 2 USB 3.0 ports (blue terminal) support 5Gbps high-speed transmission and are backwards compatible with USB 2.0 (480Mbps). The 5 USB 2.0 ports (white terminal) support 480Mbps transmission. In order to benefit from USB 3.0 high-speed charging all devices/cables connected must support USB 3.0 specifications.\", \"The first USB 3.0 port (with lightning symbol) provides a 1.5 Amp output and can be used to charge your device. The second USB 3.0 port (without lightning symbol) provide a 900mA output while the USB 2.0 ports can provide a 500mA output each. Please use the DC Adapter (included) when connecting high-current devices and ensure total consumption across all connected devices does not exceed 4A.\", \"Compatible with all major operating systems including Windows Vista, Windows XP, Windows Me, Windows 2000, Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 10, and Mac OS X v10.8-10.12.5.\", \"Slim case takes up minimal desk space and is easy to travel with\", \"Includes a 5V/4A DC Power Adapter (20W) and USB 3.0 Micro-B to USB-A data cable. Backed by an AmazonBasics 1-Year Standard Limited Warranty\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"Categories/Computers & Accessories/Networking Products/Hubs","created_at":"2023-09-30T22:45:49Z"}
