{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac1b7"},"product_id":3853,"item_id":"B07V9N45PM","category_id":180,"name":"Amazon Brand - Solimo 6 Piece Storage Basket Set, Beige","brand":"Amazon Brand - Solimo","color":"Biege","weight_lb":2.98,"price_cents":3799,"stock":125,"description":"Made sturdy from high-quality virgin PP plastic\nWoven design for a premium look\nIdeal for storing your clothes, office stationery, makeup items and more\nRigorously tested large, medium and small size baskets can hold 10 kg, 7 kg and 5 kg weight respectively\nDimensions- Large: LWH: 380 x 320 x 140 mm, Weight: 420 gm; Medium: LWH: 240 x 200 x 100 mm, Weight: 160 gm; Small: LWH: 200 x 140 x 60 mm, Weight: 90 gm\nPackage Contents- 2 Large Pieces, 2 Medium Pieces and 2 Small Pieces of Storage Basket; Color: Beige","bullets":"[\"Made sturdy from high-quality virgin PP plastic\", \"Woven design for a premium look\", \"Ideal for storing your clothes, office stationery, makeup items and more\", \"Rigorously tested large, medium and small size baskets can hold 10 kg, 7 kg and 5 kg weight respectively\", \"Dimensions- Large: LWH: 380 x 320 x 140 mm, Weight: 420 gm; Medium: LWH: 240 x 200 x 100 mm, Weight: 160 gm; Small: LWH: 200 x 140 x 60 mm, Weight: 90 gm\", \"Package Contents- 2 Large Pieces, 2 Medium Pieces and 2 Small Pieces of Storage Basket; Color: Beige\"]","keywords":"[\"storage basket\", \"storage basket plastic\", \"baskets\", \"baskets for storage\", \"basket for clothes\", \"storage boxes\", \"plastic box\", \"wardrobe baskets for clothes\", \"plastic basket for storage\", \"basket\", \"plastic basket\"]","node_path":"Categories/Home Storage & Organization/Boxes, Baskets & Bins/Storage Baskets/Shelf Baskets","created_at":"2024-06-27T08:06:41Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac1b8"},"product_id":3848,"item_id":"B07V5W38WY","category_id":227,"name":"AmazonBasics 7 kg Fully-Automatic Front Load Washing Machine (Grey/Silver, In-built Heater, Self cleaning technology)","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Dark Grey","weight_lb":"","price_cents":4699,"stock":56,"description":"Fully-automatic front load washing machine for best wash quality along with Energy and Water saving. It has self cleaning technology, 'Drum Clean' which uses strong flow of hot water (90°C) to flush gaps between inner and outer drums thus cleaning every corner of the washer\nCapacity: 7 kg, suitable for daily washing requirements for families with 3-4 members.\nWarranty: 1 year on product, 3 years on motor; For claiming warranty, A) Go to 'Your orders' section, B) select the product, C) Click on Get product support and D) schedule an appointment. No need to call anyone and wait in a queue. Hassle free process. Paperless Experience with complete visibility on every step of your warranty claim.\n1300 RPM: Higher the spin speed, faster the drying time\nLED display panel informs and alerts of the progress of the wash cycle and is easy to read even in low light\n23 wash programs let you wash everything – from baby clothes, to satins and silks and even heavily soiled bedsheets\nSpecial features: Drum clean function, Extra rinse function, Up to 24 hours delay start, In-built heater, Rat mesh protection, Mute washing, Pre-wash function\nError code – E10 means -Water supply is slow or insufficient. This error will be displayed when the unit senses that the water supply is insufficient and is taking too long to fill the tub with water. Check to make sure the water supply line is not crimped or twisted in a way that prevents or inhibits water flow. Restart the machine post correcting for any issues with the water supply line.\nFor safe delivery, screws are attached to the drum on the back side of the machine. During installation, please ask the technician to remove these screws else it will result in too much vibration & noise. Please do not attempt this on your own.","bullets":"[\"Fully-automatic front load washing machine for best wash quality along with Energy and Water saving. It has self cleaning technology, 'Drum Clean' which uses strong flow of hot water (90°C) to flush gaps between inner and outer drums thus cleaning every corner of the washer\", \"Capacity: 7 kg, suitable for daily washing requirements for families with 3-4 members.\", \"Warranty: 1 year on product, 3 years on motor; For claiming warranty, A) Go to 'Your orders' section, B) select the product, C) Click on Get product support and D) schedule an appointment. No need to call anyone and wait in a queue. Hassle free process. Paperless Experience with complete visibility on every step of your warranty claim.\", \"1300 RPM: Higher the spin speed, faster the drying time\", \"LED display panel informs and alerts of the progress of the wash cycle and is easy to read even in low light\", \"23 wash programs let you wash everything – from baby clothes, to satins and silks and even heavily soiled bedsheets\", \"Special features: Drum clean function, Extra rinse function, Up to 24 hours delay start, In-built heater, Rat mesh protection, Mute washing, Pre-wash function\", \"Error code – E10 means -Water supply is slow or insufficient. This error will be displayed when the unit senses that the water supply is insufficient and is taking too long to fill the tub with water. Check to make sure the water supply line is not crimped or twisted in a way that prevents or inhibits water flow. Restart the machine post correcting for any issues with the water supply line.\", \"For safe delivery, screws are attached to the drum on the back side of the machine. During installation, please ask the technician to remove these screws else it will result in too much vibration & noise. Please do not attempt this on your own.\"]","keywords":"[\"washing machine\", \"fully automatic washing machine\", \"front load washing machine\", \"washing machine 7kg\", \"7kg front load washing machine\", \"washing machine front load\", \"amazonbasics washing machine\"]","node_path":"Categories/Large Appliances/Washing Machines & Dryers/All-in-One Washers & Dryers","created_at":"2023-01-15T12:05:18Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac1b9"},"product_id":3854,"item_id":"B07V9NK92Y","category_id":198,"name":"AmazonBasics Humidifier with Night Light and Aroma Diffuser - 4-Liter, White","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"White","weight_lb":3.57,"price_cents":3999,"stock":40,"description":"Cool-mist humidifier: distributes a cool mist into the air to help make an overly dry, air-conditioned room more comfortable; the direction of the mist nozzle can be adjusted as needed\nEasy to use: simply turn the manual control knob to operate; set the run time to either 12 hours or 24 hours; auto shut-off feature turns the unit off automatically at the end of the run time\n4-liter water tank: includes a hand grip for a secure hold and a flat top, which allows for resting the tank without support while filling with water; large opening for easy cleaning (cleaning brush included)\nNight light and aroma diffuser: multi-functional with optional soft light for soothing ambiance, also doubles as a diffuser for aromatherapy—simply add any favorite essential oil to the tray (oil not included)\nQuiet operation and warranty: whisper-quiet operation (<45 dB) makes it a great choice for a bedroom, office, yoga studio, or other living space; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty","bullets":"[\"Cool-mist humidifier: distributes a cool mist into the air to help make an overly dry, air-conditioned room more comfortable; the direction of the mist nozzle can be adjusted as needed\", \"Easy to use: simply turn the manual control knob to operate; set the run time to either 12 hours or 24 hours; auto shut-off feature turns the unit off automatically at the end of the run time\", \"4-liter water tank: includes a hand grip for a secure hold and a flat top, which allows for resting the tank without support while filling with water; large opening for easy cleaning (cleaning brush included)\", \"Night light and aroma diffuser: multi-functional with optional soft light for soothing ambiance, also doubles as a diffuser for aromatherapy—simply add any favorite essential oil to the tray (oil not included)\", \"Quiet operation and warranty: whisper-quiet operation (<45 dB) makes it a great choice for a bedroom, office, yoga studio, or other living space; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"4010\", \"furnace\", \"swizz\", \"best\", \"h3200bar\", \"anton\", \"general\", \"top\", \"oils\", \"defense\", \"7l\", \"humidity\", \"fire\", \"purest\", \"ee\", \"crane\", \"su\", \"diffusers\", \"mini\", \"black\"]","node_path":"Categories/Heating, Cooling & Air Quality/Humidifiers","created_at":"2024-01-08T09:58:28Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac1ba"},"product_id":3855,"item_id":"B07V9NTK8M","category_id":303,"name":"Eono Essentials Mobile Phone Ring Holder, Phone Ring Holder: Universal 360° Rotating Smartphone Finger Holder for Phone Xs Max Xs XR X, Phone 7 7 Plus 8 8 Plus, Samsung S10 S9 S8 S7 S6 S5 S4, Silver","brand":"Eono","color":"Silver","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1199,"stock":42,"description":"Wide compatibility: the mobile phone ring holder is almost compatible with all smartphones in 4-8 inches, such as phone Xs Max XR X 8 8 Plus 7 7 Plus 6 6 Plus 5 5s 5c, HUAWEI, Galaxy S10 S9 S8 S7 S6 S5 S4, Note 6 5, LG, Sony, Nexus, other Android phones, although with case. (Cannot be used for wireless charging.)\n【360 degree rotation and 180 degree adjustable】The phone ring stand is characterized by a great leakage, so you can adjust and turn it over and it stays firmly fixed. It is a perfect finger ring stand in landscape or portrait mode for reading, watching videos.\n【DURABLE ADHESIVE】 Adhesive is extremely sticky, which holds the phone and prevents phone from dropping on many occasions. (Note: Use the stand for 24 hours after the bell holder attached to the phone. Clean the area (recommended on smooth and flat surfaces) where the ring holder is attached before use.\nHigh quality materials: the finger ring holder for mobile phone is made of high-quality zinc alloy and stainless steel. Zinc alloy has good ductility and has toughness which contributes to a long service life. Polished ring holder, smooth edge, no worry about scratches on your fingers.\n【Multi-function】It can be used as a phone handle, table kickstand and cable winder. Besides, put it on a magnetic car mount while driving and it will also work. With one finger, hold your phone with one hand greatly reduce the risk of accidentally falling.","bullets":"[\"Wide compatibility: the mobile phone ring holder is almost compatible with all smartphones in 4-8 inches, such as phone Xs Max XR X 8 8 Plus 7 7 Plus 6 6 Plus 5 5s 5c, HUAWEI, Galaxy S10 S9 S8 S7 S6 S5 S4, Note 6 5, LG, Sony, Nexus, other Android phones, although with case. (Cannot be used for wireless charging.)\", \"【360 degree rotation and 180 degree adjustable】The phone ring stand is characterized by a great leakage, so you can adjust and turn it over and it stays firmly fixed. It is a perfect finger ring stand in landscape or portrait mode for reading, watching videos.\", \"【DURABLE ADHESIVE】 Adhesive is extremely sticky, which holds the phone and prevents phone from dropping on many occasions. (Note: Use the stand for 24 hours after the bell holder attached to the phone. Clean the area (recommended on smooth and flat surfaces) where the ring holder is attached before use.\", \"High quality materials: the finger ring holder for mobile phone is made of high-quality zinc alloy and stainless steel. Zinc alloy has good ductility and has toughness which contributes to a long service life. Polished ring holder, smooth edge, no worry about scratches on your fingers.\", \"【Multi-function】It can be used as a phone handle, table kickstand and cable winder. Besides, put it on a magnetic car mount while driving and it will also work. With one finger, hold your phone with one hand greatly reduce the risk of accidentally falling.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-04-01T18:03:45Z"}
