{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac1da"},"product_id":3887,"item_id":"B07VN3KPVQ","category_id":346,"name":"UMI by Amazon 800W Portable Garden Water Transfer Pump, Max Flow 3200L/H Max Water Lift 44m, Sprinkling Jet Pump for Lawn Irrigation and Pressure Booster, with 1\" Hose Adapter","brand":"UMI by Amazon","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":3599,"stock":56,"description":"【Garden Sprinkler Pump】With Plastic housing and waterproof on/off switch, 1\" hose adapter included, easy for you to get pump started, simple carry handle for portability and storage.\n【800W High Power High Efficiency】The pump has maximum flow rate of 3200L/H, Maximum Lift head up to 44m and Max suction depth 8m; provides the necessary power to booster water pressure and connects to sprinklers.\n【Durable Seal Structure with Thermal Protection】Durable seal structure can bring better and more lasting work to the pump, overheat protection ensures that the pump will not be burned out.\n【Widely Use】Pump is designed to work only with CLEAN WATER, Sutiable for ponds, pools, sprinkling systems, flow irrigation systems, gardening, rain barrels, large aquariums, use in agriculture settings, shallow and water wells. The pump is also compatible with a pressure regulator and work as a booster pump.\n【12 Month Warranty】You have 12 month warranty for any pump you purchase from our store.","bullets":"[\"【Garden Sprinkler Pump】With Plastic housing and waterproof on/off switch, 1\\\" hose adapter included, easy for you to get pump started, simple carry handle for portability and storage.\", \"【800W High Power High Efficiency】The pump has maximum flow rate of 3200L/H, Maximum Lift head up to 44m and Max suction depth 8m; provides the necessary power to booster water pressure and connects to sprinklers.\", \"【Durable Seal Structure with Thermal Protection】Durable seal structure can bring better and more lasting work to the pump, overheat protection ensures that the pump will not be burned out.\", \"【Widely Use】Pump is designed to work only with CLEAN WATER, Sutiable for ponds, pools, sprinkling systems, flow irrigation systems, gardening, rain barrels, large aquariums, use in agriculture settings, shallow and water wells. The pump is also compatible with a pressure regulator and work as a booster pump.\", \"【12 Month Warranty】You have 12 month warranty for any pump you purchase from our store.\"]","keywords":"[\"pump^water pump^portable water pump^garden water pump^jet pump^garden jet pump\"]","node_path":"Home & Garden/Garden & Outdoors/Categories/Pools, Hot Tubs & Supplies/Filters, Pumps & Accessories/Pumps","created_at":"2023-04-07T08:30:56Z"}
