 to clean and dry the wall surfaces before installation. Not recommended for painted, wallpaper & uneven surfaces.\", \"DURABLE & SAFE - All stainless steel constructions, ensuring long service life. Rounded corner design, safe for kids to use. Dimensions: 2.76-inch (height) by 6.26-inch (width)\"]","keywords":"[\"rustproof towel ring kitchen towels papers 3m stick suction self-adhesive silver rv roller big large damage free no-drilling screw wall-mount paper-roll nickel toolet mega shelf hang tissues toliet rack bath spring rod toilet-paper-holders\"]","node_path":"Products/Hardware/Bathroom Hardware/Toilet Paper Holders","created_at":"2023-11-09T19:41:39Z"}
