{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac281"},"product_id":4054,"item_id":"B07WTWN1M3","category_id":53,"name":"AmazonBasics Four Socket Extension Lead with 2 USB Charging Ports and Power Switch, 1 Metre, White","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"White","weight_lb":0.94,"price_cents":1899,"stock":50,"description":"Use your electrical appliances safely around the home: With the 1-metre, 4 gang extension lead with 2 USB charging ports from the AmazonBasics range\nThe four-socket extension lead has a 13 Amp fuse: Eliminating the problem when the number of electrical items outnumber the amount of available sockets\nUse efficiently around the home with wall fixing capability: Giving you the option to mount the extension lead onto the wall, if you are struggling with available ground space\nTrust in the ‘SMART’ USB feature: Which goes into standby mode, once your device has fully charged and it can also auto detect your USB device and adjust its charging pattern – making it suitable for iPhone and android appliances\nThe rounded compact slimline appearance of the four-socket extension lead has safety shuttered sockets as well as a power switch","bullets":"[\"Use your electrical appliances safely around the home: With the 1-metre, 4 gang extension lead with 2 USB charging ports from the AmazonBasics range\", \"The four-socket extension lead has a 13 Amp fuse: Eliminating the problem when the number of electrical items outnumber the amount of available sockets\", \"Use efficiently around the home with wall fixing capability: Giving you the option to mount the extension lead onto the wall, if you are struggling with available ground space\", \"Trust in the ‘SMART’ USB feature: Which goes into standby mode, once your device has fully charged and it can also auto detect your USB device and adjust its charging pattern – making it suitable for iPhone and android appliances\", \"The rounded compact slimline appearance of the four-socket extension lead has safety shuttered sockets as well as a power switch\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"Categories/Power Accessories/Extension Cords","created_at":"2023-08-30T11:33:22Z"}
