{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac283"},"product_id":4056,"item_id":"B07WVMFQDW","category_id":130,"name":"365 by Whole Foods Market, Sandwich Flavored Potato Chips, Pastrami on Rye, 10 Ounce","brand":"365 by Whole Foods Market","color":"","weight_lb":0.63,"price_cents":1199,"stock":37,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\nTHIS IS ONE OF THOSE WILD IDEAS we had to make happen: chips that taste just like some of the world’s best sandwiches.\nHurry - it's a limited edition!\nCertified Gluten-Free.\nHere, thin, crispy potato chips are layered with the ­flavors of a Pastrami on Rye—salty-sweet, mustard, savory umami and a touch of heat. And crunch. Lots and lots of limited-edition crunch. Hurry, it's a limited edition!","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. The packaging for this product has a fresh new look. During this transition, you may get the original packaging or the new packaging in your order, but the product and quality is staying exactly the same. Enjoy!\", \"THIS IS ONE OF THOSE WILD IDEAS we had to make happen: chips that taste just like some of the world’s best sandwiches.\", \"Hurry - it's a limited edition!\", \"Certified Gluten-Free.\", \"Here, thin, crispy potato chips are layered with the ­flavors of a Pastrami on Rye—salty-sweet, mustard, savory umami and a touch of heat. And crunch. Lots and lots of limited-edition crunch. Hurry, it's a limited edition!\"]","keywords":"[\"candy snacks salty snacks potato chips and alternative chips grocery & gourmet food snack foods chips & crisps potato\"]","node_path":"Categories/Snack Foods/Chips & Crisps/Potato","created_at":"2024-02-14T20:50:11Z"}
