{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac315"},"product_id":4202,"item_id":"B07YHDQXZZ","category_id":113,"name":"Whole Foods Market, Frozen Egg White Bites, Spinach, Basil & Feta, 4.2 Ounce","brand":"Whole Foods Market","color":"","weight_lb":0.26,"price_cents":799,"stock":41,"description":"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. When it comes to innovative flavors and products sourced from artisans and producers around the world, the Whole Foods Market brand has you covered. Amazing products, exceptional ingredients, no compromises.\nCage-free eggs whites, tangy feta cheese, spinach and basil come together in these sous vide egg bites, seasoned with dash of ground white pepper.\nWith 12 grams of protein per serving, they're not only petite and delicious, but light and fluffy too.\n4g of Carbs.","bullets":"[\"Brought to you by Whole Foods Market. When it comes to innovative flavors and products sourced from artisans and producers around the world, the Whole Foods Market brand has you covered. Amazing products, exceptional ingredients, no compromises.\", \"Cage-free eggs whites, tangy feta cheese, spinach and basil come together in these sous vide egg bites, seasoned with dash of ground white pepper.\", \"With 12 grams of protein per serving, they're not only petite and delicious, but light and fluffy too.\", \"4g of Carbs.\"]","keywords":"[\"grocery frozen breakfast egg grocery & gourmet food frozen breakfast foods\"]","node_path":"Categories/Frozen/Breakfast Foods","created_at":"2023-12-06T16:40:34Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac316"},"product_id":4203,"item_id":"B07YJ652YK","category_id":203,"name":"AmazonBasics 90 Watt Equivalent, Daylight, Non-Dimmable, PAR38 LED Light Bulb | 6-Pack (Renewed)","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Daylight","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1599,"stock":7,"description":"With a life of 15,000 hours, the bulb will last over 13 years (based on 3 hours of use each day)\nProvides 900 lumens of light immediately, with no waiting time to warm up to full brightness\nWith a correlated color temperature of 5000 Kelvin, the bulb simulates daylight, creating a bright atmoshphere for any room\nThis LED light bulb uses only 12 watts of energy, saving up to $128.70 over the life of the bulb vs. its incandescent equivalent (based on 3 hours/day, 11 cents/kWh, may vary depending on rates and use)\nThis bulb costs only $1.45 per year to operate (based on 3 hours/day, 11 cents/kWh) making it an economical alternative to incandescent bulbs\nThe PAR38 bulb shape is commonly used in floodlights.\nNot eligible for shipments to California","bullets":"[\"With a life of 15,000 hours, the bulb will last over 13 years (based on 3 hours of use each day)\", \"Provides 900 lumens of light immediately, with no waiting time to warm up to full brightness\", \"With a correlated color temperature of 5000 Kelvin, the bulb simulates daylight, creating a bright atmoshphere for any room\", \"This LED light bulb uses only 12 watts of energy, saving up to $128.70 over the life of the bulb vs. its incandescent equivalent (based on 3 hours/day, 11 cents/kWh, may vary depending on rates and use)\", \"This bulb costs only $1.45 per year to operate (based on 3 hours/day, 11 cents/kWh) making it an economical alternative to incandescent bulbs\", \"The PAR38 bulb shape is commonly used in floodlights.\", \"Not eligible for shipments to California\"]","keywords":"[\"voice\", \"(hue\", \"works\", \"phillip's\", \"sylvania\", \"phillips\", \"floodlight\", \"link\", \"lightbulbs\"