{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac3ca"},"product_id":4383,"item_id":"B081VKSDGV","category_id":144,"name":"Eono 6 Pcs Makeup Sponge Set Blender Beauty Foundation Blender Sponge, Multi-colored Non-Latex Blending Sponge for Foundation, Professional Beauty Makeup Set for Dry & Wet Use","brand":"Eono","color":"6pcs-3 Color- 3 Shape","weight_lb":0.12,"price_cents":899,"stock":0,"description":"SET CONTAINS 6 Pcs Makeup Sponge Set includes 3 different shapes of beauty sponge: Oblique Olive, Pear, Teardrop shape, Multicolor makeup sponge for all kinds of cosmetics.\nEXQUISITE QUALITY: Made from non-latex material, soft feeling, well bouncy beauty sponge, easy to distinguish.\nA SET TO SOLVE ALL MAKEUP: Three different shapes to meet all the needs of makeup, it can reach each corner of your face, even such as nose wing, the skin around your eyes.\nDUAL-USE: They get bigger when adding water, pls squeeze out any extra water when wet use, Concealer, and cream are the best choice. Restore dimension after drying, powder cosmetics is the best choice.\nATTENTION: For best results replace the makeup sponge every 1-3 months.","bullets":"[\"SET CONTAINS 6 Pcs Makeup Sponge Set includes 3 different shapes of beauty sponge: Oblique Olive, Pear, Teardrop shape, Multicolor makeup sponge for all kinds of cosmetics.\", \"EXQUISITE QUALITY: Made from non-latex material, soft feeling, well bouncy beauty sponge, easy to distinguish.\", \"A SET TO SOLVE ALL MAKEUP: Three different shapes to meet all the needs of makeup, it can reach each corner of your face, even such as nose wing, the skin around your eyes.\", \"DUAL-USE: They get bigger when adding water, pls squeeze out any extra water when wet use, Concealer, and cream are the best choice. Restore dimension after drying, powder cosmetics is the best choice.\", \"ATTENTION: For best results replace the makeup sponge every 1-3 months.\"]","keywords":"[\"makeup set^sponges^makeup sponges^blending sponges^dry and wet use sponge^contour brus