{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac3cb"},"product_id":4384,"item_id":"B081W37RZW","category_id":54,"name":"AmazonBasics 3 in 1 Metronome Tuner - Designed for Guitar, Bass, Violin and Ukulele","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"","weight_lb":0.15,"price_cents":2899,"stock":87,"description":"3-in-1 metronome, tuner, and tone generator for use with any musical instrument; ideal for a guitar, bass, ukulele, or violin\nMetronome provides a precise tempo, a tempo range of 30 - 250 beats per minute (bpm), and an electronic metronome sound\nTuner offers a wide range (A0-C8), flat tuning, and multiple tuning modes (chromatic, guitar, bass, ukulele, and violin) for versatility, plus auto and manual tuning, an LCD display with LED indicators, and 2 detection methods (mic and line-in)\nPrecise tone generator provides a reference tone range of chromatic 2A - 6A; device turns off automatically after 3 minutes if no signal; freely rotates 360 degrees for easy access; battery powered (batteries not included)\nMeasures 4 by 2.6 by 0.2 inches; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty","bullets":"[\"3-in-1 metronome, tuner, and tone generator for use with any musical instrument; ideal for a guitar, bass, ukulele, or violin\", \"Metronome provides a precise tempo, a tempo range of 30 - 250 beats per minute (bpm), and an electronic metronome sound\", \"Tuner offers a wide range (A0-C8), flat tuning, and multiple tuning modes (chromatic, guitar, bass, ukulele, and violin) for versatility, plus auto and manual tuning, an LCD display with LED indicators, and 2 detection methods (mic and line-in)\", \"Precise tone generator provides a reference tone range of chromatic 2A - 6A; device turns off automatically after 3 minutes if no signal; freely rotates 360 degrees for easy access; battery powered (batteries not included)\", \"Measures 4 by 2.6 by 0.2 inches; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"shark\", \"digital\", \"viola\", \"electric\", \"accessories\", \"acoustic\", \"guitar\", \"tuners\", \"cello\", \"bass\", \"snark\", \"tunner\", \"headstock\", \"clip\", \"on\"]","node_path":"Categories/Guitars & Gear/Accessories/Tuners","created_at":"2023-04-10T11:51:16Z"}
