{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac3e5"},"product_id":4410,"item_id":"B0828FFDWG","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand - Ravenna Home 2-Light Flush-Mount Ceiling Light with White Frosted Glass Shade, 5.1\"H, Brushed Steel","brand":"Ravenna Home","color":"Brushed Steel","weight_lb":3.7,"price_cents":6399,"stock":27,"description":"14.3\"W x 14.3\"D x 5.1\"H\nWhite frosted glass shade, metal base in a brushed-steel finish\nThis classic flush-mount ceiling light with frosted glass shade and brushed-steel base adds sophistication to any room with vintage or classic decor.\n2 60-watt E26 bulbs required. Bulbs not included.\nAssemble in 15-30 minutes\nFor indoor use only.","bullets":"[\"14.3\\\"W x 14.3\\\"D x 5.1\\\"H\", \"White frosted glass shade, metal base in a brushed-steel finish\", \"This classic flush-mount ceiling light with frosted glass shade and brushed-steel base adds sophistication to any room with vintage or classic decor.\", \"2 60-watt E26 bulbs required. Bulbs not included.\", \"Assemble in 15-30 minutes\", \"For indoor use only.\"]","keywords":"[\"lighting & fans\", \"outdoor & landscape lighting\", \"ceiling porch lights\", \"home lighting and lamps\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Ceiling Lights/Close To Ceiling Lights","created_at":"2023-12-31T08:49:37Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac3e6"},"product_id":4411,"item_id":"B082BLFMRC","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Celine Upholstered Home Office Task Chair, 22.25\"W, Beige","brand":"Rivet","color":"Beige","weight_lb":30.31,"price_cents":17999,"stock":17,"description":"Bring a touch of Scandinavian style to your home or office with this upholstered task chair. Subtly tufted beige fabric is paired with a clever wood grain-patterned vinyl backing, bucket seat and brass-finished base for a high comfort, low maintenance modern style.\nOverall: 22.25\"W x 26.25\"D x 35.75\"–38.75\"H; adjustable seat height: 19.75\"–22.75\"\nUpholstered chair in a neutral stone-colored fabric accented with blonde wood grain-patterned vinyl.\nThis chair has a 360-degree swivel mechanism with height and tension adjustments to accommodate your work style.\nThe tufted barrel-back design of this chair looks equally stylish in the office or in the living room as occasional seating.\nAssemble in 15-30 minutes\nAlways use on firm, level ground. Do not stand on the seat or let children play with this chair. Check (and if necessary, tighten) all screws every 90 days.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Bring a touch of Scandinavian style to your home or office with this upholstered task chair. Subtly tufted beige fabric is paired with a clever wood grain-patterned vinyl backing, bucket seat and brass-finished base for a high comfort, low maintenance modern style.\", \"Overall: 22.25\\\"W x 26.25\\\"D x 35.75\\\"–38.75\\\"H; adjustable seat height: 19.75\\\"–22.75\\\"\", \"Upholstered chair in a neutral stone-colored fabric accented with blonde wood grain-patterned vinyl.\", \"This chair has a 360-degree swivel mechanism with height and tension adjustments to accommodate your work style.\", \"The tufted barrel-back design of this chair looks equally stylish in the office or in the living room as occasional seating.\", \"Assemble in 15-30 minutes\", \"Always use on firm, level ground. Do not stand on the seat or let children play with this chair. Check (and if necessary, tighten) all screws every 90 days.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"makeup\", \"stool\", \"big\", \"shop\", \"500lbs\", \"mid\", \"vanity\", \"capacity\", \"executive\", \"computer\", \"pound\", \"extra\", \"chairs\", \"tall\", \"man\", \"ergonomic\", \"wide\", \"&\", \"weight\", \"500lb\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Home Office Furniture/Home Office Chairs/Home Office Desk Chairs","created_at":"2024-03-07T02:35:01Z"}
