{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac3ed"},"product_id":4418,"item_id":"B082DNTKB6","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Single-Light Plug-In Wall Sconce with Frosted Glass Shade, 12\"H, LED Bulb Included, Matte Brass","brand":"Rivet","color":"Brass","weight_lb":0.8,"price_cents":9799,"stock":53,"description":"This matte-brass wall sconce has a mid-century feel, perfect for giving your space a classic accent. The opal glass shades cast a warm light that will brighten any room in your home. A convenient plug-in feature allows you to easily move this fixture to where you need it the most.\n10\"W x 7\"D x 12\"H\nOpal glass shade with a metal base in a matte-brass finish\nThe plug-in feature creates an easily movable lamp that allows you to bring style and light where you need to.\n1 60-watt CEC Title 20 LED bulb included.\nAssemble in 15-30 minutes\nFor indoor use only.","bullets":"[\"This matte-brass wall sconce has a mid-century feel, perfect for giving your space a classic accent. The opal glass shades cast a warm light that will brighten any room in your home. A convenient plug-in feature allows you to easily move this fixture to where you need it the most.\", \"10\\\"W x 7\\\"D x 12\\\"H\", \"Opal glass shade with a metal base in a matte-brass finish\", \"The plug-in feature creates an easily movable lamp that allows you to bring style and light where you need to.\", \"1 60-watt CEC Title 20 LED bulb included.\", \"Assemble in 15-30 minutes\", \"For indoor use only.\"]","keywords":"[\"bed\", \"de\", \"mirror\", \"lamps\", \"rubbed\", \"exterior\", \"mid\", \"acegoo\", \"two\", \"vanity\", \"smart\", \"switch\", \"fixtures\", \"rustic\", \"oil\", \"modern\", \"decor\", \"pared\", \"clearance\", \"headboard\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Wall Lights/Wall Lamps & Sconces","created_at":"2023-05-02T16:43:03Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac3ee"},"product_id":4419,"item_id":"B082DP4S94","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Single-Light Domed Metal Pendant Light, 63\"H, Soft Matte Gray","brand":"Rivet","color":"Soft Gray","weight_lb":0.6,"price_cents":7199,"stock":17,"description":"This matte gray pendant light adds subtle interest to any space without clashing with existing color schemes. The dome shape lends contemporary flair to any room in your home, and the long cord provides versatility, allowing you to easily move light to the areas that need it most.\n10\"W x 10\"D x 63\"H\nMetal shade in a matte finish\nThe industrial style and long cord provide style and function, making this lamp perfect in kitchens, bar areas, or wherever you need a versatile light.\n1 60-watt E26 bulb required. Bulb not included.\nAssemble in 15-30 minutes\nFor indoor use only.","bullets":"[\"This matte gray pendant light adds subtle interest to any space without clashing with existing color schemes. The dome shape lends contemporary flair to any room in your home, and the long cord provides versatility, allowing you to easily move light to the areas that need it most.\", \"10\\\"W x 10\\\"D x 63\\\"H\", \"Metal shade in a matte finish\", \"The industrial style and long cord provide style and function, making this lamp perfect in kitchens, bar areas, or wherever you need a versatile light.\", \"1 60-watt E26 bulb required. Bulb not included.\", \"Assemble in 15-30 minutes\", \"For indoor use only.\"]","keywords":"[\"de\", \"shop\", \"monkey\", \"lamps\", \"lumen\", \"mid\", \"drum\", \"utility\", \"led\", \"techo\", \"tribright\", \"semiflush\", \"fixtures\", \"modern\", \"flush\", \"trilight\", \"flex\", \"semi\", \"kitchen\", \"panel\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Ceiling Lights/Pendant Lights","created_at":"2024-05-01T09:49:32Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac3ef"},"product_id":4420,"item_id":"B082DP4YX5","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Single-Light Outdoor Pendant Light with Clear Glass Shade, Vintage Edison Bulb Included, 40.3\"H, Bronze","brand":"Rivet","color":"Matte Gray","weight_lb":1.5,"price_cents":5799,"stock":121,"description":"This vintage-inspired indoor/outdoor pendant light adds the perfect design accent to your home. The tapered clear glass shade and warm Edison bulb create visual appeal, while also allowing bright, clear light wherever you need it.\n6.54\"W x 7.49\"D x 40.3\"H\nClear glass shade with a metal base in a bronze finish\nThe light is hardwired so you can enjoy it anywhere without the mess of cords.\n1 60-watt E26 vintage Edison bulb included.\nExpert installation recommended\nWet rated for indoor or outdoor use.","bullets":"[\"This vintage-inspired indoor/outdoor pendant light adds the perfect design accent to your home. The tapered clear glass shade and warm Edison bulb create visual appeal, while also allowing bright, clear light wherever you need it.\", \"6.54\\\"W x 7.49\\\"D x 40.3\\\"H\", \"Clear glass shade with a metal base in a bronze finish\", \"The light is hardwired so you can enjoy it anywhere without the mess of cords.\", \"1 60-watt E26 vintage Edison bulb included.\", \"Expert installation recommended\", \"Wet rated for indoor or outdoor use.\"]","keywords":"[\"luminaid\", \"shed\", \"powered\", \"exterior\", \"mid\", \"solar\", \"led\", \"operated\", \"decorations\", \"remote\", \"battery\", \"fixtures\", \"switch\", \"rustic\", \"cage\", \"modern\", \"white\", \"barn\", \"kit\", \"power\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Outdoor Lighting/Porch & Patio Lights/Pendant Lights","created_at":"2024-02-25T17:58:57Z"}
