{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac3f5"},"product_id":4426,"item_id":"B082DV4G2P","category_id":254,"name":"Amazon Brand - Solimo Pinton Stainless Steel Steel Soap Holder with Toothbrush Tumbler","brand":"Amazon Brand - Solimo","color":"white","weight_lb":"","price_cents":2899,"stock":8,"description":"Premium quality stainless steel soap holder with toothbrush tumbler for bathroom use\nWell-designed product with presence of chrome plating gives a pleasing, shiny look\nCan be easily assembled as it comes with wall plugs and screws\nWall mounted soap holder with toothbrush tumbler can be fixed anywhere in the bathroom or near the washbasin\nRust and corrosion-resistant to withstand prolonged usage\nIdeal size for placing a soap along with toothbrushes, toothpaste, and tongue cleaner\nDimensions:- Length: 130 mm (13 cm); Width: 180 mm (18 cm); Height: 150 mm (15 cm)\nPackage Contents:- 1 Solimo Pinton Stainless Steel Soap Holder with Toothbrush Tumbler; Weight: 262 gms","bullets":"[\"Premium quality stainless steel soap holder with toothbrush tumbler for bathroom use\", \"Well-designed product with presence of chrome plating gives a pleasing, shiny look\", \"Can be easily assembled as it comes with wall plugs and screws\", \"Wall mounted soap holder with toothbrush tumbler can be fixed anywhere in the bathroom or near the washbasin\", \"Rust and corrosion-resistant to withstand prolonged usage\", \"Ideal size for placing a soap along with toothbrushes, toothpaste, and tongue cleaner\", \"Dimensions:- Length: 130 mm (13 cm); Width: 180 mm (18 cm); Height: 150 mm (15 cm)\", \"Package Contents:- 1 Solimo Pinton Stainless Steel Soap Holder with Toothbrush Tumbler; Weight: 262 gms\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"Categories/Kitchen & Dining/Tableware/Glassware & Drinkware/Tumblers","created_at":"2023-07-27T20:38:30Z"}
