{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac3f7"},"product_id":4428,"item_id":"B082F2LFTC","category_id":203,"name":"AmazonBasics 100W Equivalent, Daylight, Non-Dimmable, 15,000 Hour Lifetime, CEC Compliant, A21 LED Light Bulbs | 6-Pack (Renewed)","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Daylight","weight_lb":"","price_cents":799,"stock":35,"description":"With a CRI (color rendering index) of 90 this bulb will bring out the rich, natural colors wherever it is installed\nProvides 1600 lumens of light immediately, with no waiting time to warm up to full brightness; operates up to 15,000 hours and will last over 13 years (based on 3 hours of use each day)\nWith a correlated color temperature of 5000 Kelvin, this bulb simulates daylight, creating a bright atmosphere for any room\nThis LED light bulb uses only 17 watts of energy, saving up to $136.96 over the life of the bulb vs. its incandescent equivalent (based on 3 hours/day, 11 cents/kWh, may vary depending on rates and use)\nThis bulb costs only $2.05 per year to operate (based on 3 hours/day, 11 cents/kWh) making it an economical alternative to incandescent bulbs\nManufactured to meet California Energy Commission requirements for LED light bulbs","bullets":"[\"With a CRI (color rendering index) of 90 this bulb will bring out the rich, natural colors wherever it is installed\", \"Provides 1600 lumens of light immediately, with no waiting time to warm up to full brightness; operates up to 15,000 hours and will last over 13 years (based on 3 hours of use each day)\", \"With a correlated color temperature of 5000 Kelvin, this bulb simulates daylight, creating a bright atmosphere for any room\", \"This LED light bulb uses only 17 watts of energy, saving up to $136.96 over the life of the bulb vs. its incandescent equivalent (based on 3 hours/day, 11 cents/kWh, may vary depending on rates and use)\", \"This bulb costs only $2.05 per year to operate (based on 3 hours/day, 11 cents/kWh) making it an economical alternative to incandescent bulbs\", \"Manufactured to meet California Energy Commission requirements for LED light bulbs\"]","keywords":"[\"led\", \"light bulb\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Light Bulbs/LED Bulbs","created_at":"2023-07-29T20:33:03Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac3f8"},"product_id":4429,"item_id":"B082F7Q7Y5","category_id":90,"name":"Stone & Beam Kristin Ottoman, 33\"W, Indigo (Renewed)","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Navy","weight_lb":"","price_cents":7799,"stock":14,"description":"Add style and comfort to your home with this classic ottoman. With a time-tested traditional design, this ottoman is an ideal accent for many home-decor styles, and its beautiful indigo hue brightens the room with color. Its cushions are reversible to extend this ottoman’s life.\nOverall: 33\"W x 24\"D x 18.5\"H; Seat Height: 21.5\"H; Seat Depth 24\"D; Leg Height: 2.5\"H\nSolid-wood frame with mortise-and-tenon construction and 8-guage sinuous spring support system, fully padded and upholstered with performance fabric\nTraditional design is both fashionable and practical.\nLoose back and seat cushions are removable and reversible to ensure durability and comfort.\nNo assembly required\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\nThis item is made to order just for you.","bullets":"[\"Add style and comfort to your home with this classic ottoman. With a time-tested traditional design, this ottoman is an ideal accent for many home-decor styles, and its beautiful indigo hue brightens the room with color. Its cushions are reversible to extend this ottoman’s life.\", \"Overall: 33\\\"W x 24\\\"D x 18.5\\\"H; Seat Height: 21.5\\\"H; Seat Depth 24\\\"D; Leg Height: 2.5\\\"H\", \"Solid-wood frame with mortise-and-tenon construction and 8-guage sinuous spring support system, fully padded and upholstered with performance fabric\", \"Traditional design is both fashionable and practical.\", \"Loose back and seat cushions are removable and reversible to ensure durability and comfort.\", \"No assembly required\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty.\", \"This item is made to order just for you.\"]","keywords":"[\"bed\", \"studio\", \"recliner\", \"small\", \"skyler\", \"gun\", \"gliding\", \"country\", \"game\", \"forest\", \"swivel\", \"laguna\", \"entryway\", \"chests\", \"dollars\", \"storage\", \"office\", \"hope\", \"seats\", \"long\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Accent Furniture/Ottomans","created_at":"2024-01-21T19:46:36Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac3f9"},"product_id":4430,"item_id":"B082HFFDK4","category_id":296,"name":"UMI. Essential Dog Dental Care Care Value Pack","brand":"UMI","color":"","weight_lb":0.66,"price_cents":2199,"stock":52,"description":"Pack of 2 The spiked football measures 24cm and weighs 180g, the rubber bone measures 16.8cm and weighs 145g\nThis toy set is made from durable pet safe material and encourages your pet to chew, pluck, throw and fetch during playtime.\nMade of high quality rubber with cotton rope.\nSupervision by the pet owner is highly recommended. Wipe clean only\nAll photos were taken with our production samples","bullets":"[\"Pack of 2 The spiked football measures 24cm and weighs 180g, the rubber bone measures 16.8cm and weighs 145g\", \"This toy set is made from durable pet safe material and encourages your pet to chew, pluck, throw and fetch during playtime.\", \"Made of high quality rubber with cotton rope.\", \"Supervision by the pet owner is highly recommended. Wipe clean only\", \"All photos were taken with our production samples\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-02-20T13:16:56Z"}
