{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac3fb"},"product_id":4432,"item_id":"B082JGV1YM","category_id":92,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam 5-Shelf Bookcase, 75\"H, Weathered Oak Finish","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Weathered Oak","weight_lb":66.0,"price_cents":7499,"stock":19,"description":"This bookcase brings sophistication and functionality to your home with a timeless, airy design; generous shelf space; and classic molding. The X-design of the sides not only adds style but also strength.\n31.7\"W x 13.2\"D x 75\"H\nDurable MDF wood and solid pine with pine veneer in weathered oak finish\nThe 5 wide and sturdy shelves offer ample storage for books, objets d'art, keepsakes, and more.\nAlone or in series, this sturdy bookcase exudes classic style, equally at home in the living room, study, office, or hallway.\nAssemble in 15-30 minutes\nUsing a soft, damp cloth, wipe in the direction of the wood grain.\nFree returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This bookcase brings sophistication and functionality to your home with a timeless, airy design; generous shelf space; and classic molding. The X-design of the sides not only adds style but also strength.\", \"31.7\\\"W x 13.2\\\"D x 75\\\"H\", \"Durable MDF wood and solid pine with pine veneer in weathered oak finish\", \"The 5 wide and sturdy shelves offer ample storage for books, objets d'art, keepsakes, and more.\", \"Alone or in series, this sturdy bookcase exudes classic style, equally at home in the living room, study, office, or hallway.\", \"Assemble in 15-30 minutes\", \"Using a soft, damp cloth, wipe in the direction of the wood grain.\", \"Free returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"dress\", \"cherry\", \"mirror\", \"salvaged\", \"book\", \"kid\", \"mid\", \"cabin\", \"barrister\", \"bookshelves\", \"girls\", \"vanity\", \"rustic\", \"closets\", \"inches\", \"library\", \"modern\", \"white\", \"furniture\", \"decor\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Home Office Furniture/Bookcases","created_at":"2023-05-30T02:06:18Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac3fc"},"product_id":4433,"item_id":"B082JH42QQ","category_id":82,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam 2-Drawer Rolling File Cabinet, 15.8\"W, Weathered Gray Finish","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Weathered Grey","weight_lb":37.5,"price_cents":9199,"stock":41,"description":"Modern farmhouse style meets contemporary convenience with this charming weathered-gray file cabinet. Both functional and beautiful, this piece is designed to look great while standing up to daily use. Sturdy casters make it especially flexible and easy to use.\n15.8\"W x 16.2\"D x 22.8\"H\nDurable MDF wood with gray-washed pine veneer, casters and antique bronze handles\nThe 2 generously sized drawers offer stylish storage of files, supplies, and more. Casters make this cabinet especially adaptable.\nThe appealing weathered-gray finish of this usefully sized filing cabinet gives it a stylish edge.\nAssemble in 15-30 minutes\nUsing a soft, damp cloth, wipe in the direction of the wood grain.\nFree returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"Modern farmhouse style meets contemporary convenience with this charming weathered-gray file cabinet. Both functional and beautiful, this piece is designed to look great while standing up to daily use. Sturdy casters make it especially flexible and easy to use.\", \"15.8\\\"W x 16.2\\\"D x 22.8\\\"H\", \"Durable MDF wood with gray-washed pine veneer, casters and antique bronze handles\", \"The 2 generously sized drawers offer stylish storage of files, supplies, and more. Casters make this cabinet especially adaptable.\", \"The appealing weathered-gray finish of this usefully sized filing cabinet gives it a stylish edge.\", \"Assemble in 15-30 minutes\", \"Using a soft, damp cloth, wipe in the direction of the wood grain.\", \"Free returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"farmhouse\", \"art\", \"deep\", \"scranton\", \"locking\", \"metal\", \"black\", \"storage\", \"co\", \"blueprint\", \"filing\", \"3\", \"flat\", \"organizer\", \"files\", \"lock\", \"18\\\"\", \"cabinets\"]","node_path":"Categories/Office Furniture & Lighting/Cabinets, Racks & Shelves/File Cabinets","created_at":"2023-06-04T10:11:48Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac3fd"},"product_id":4434,"item_id":"B082JH9VWG","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Contemporary Vanity Light with Metal Cage Shades, Vintage Edison Bulbs Included, 10\"H, Brushed Nickel","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Brushed Nickel","weight_lb":3.5,"price_cents":13999,"stock":22,"description":"The caged shades on this brushed-nickel two-light sconce are mounted on an arm that extends from a matching wall plate. This clean design and classic details will add a sense of timeless glamour to any bathroom vanity or hallway.\n16\"W x 6.5\"D x 10\"H\nMetal cage shades and base in a brushed nickel finish\nThis sconce illuminates bathrooms and powder rooms of all sizes and can be mounted facing up or down.\n2 60-watt E26 vintage Edison bulbs included\nAssemble in 15-30 minutes\nFor indoor use only","bullets":"[\"The caged shades on this brushed-nickel two-light sconce are mounted on an arm that extends from a matching wall plate. This clean design and classic details will add a sense of timeless glamour to any bathroom vanity or hallway.\", \"16\\\"W x 6.5\\\"D x 10\\\"H\", \"Metal cage shades and base in a brushed nickel finish\", \"This sconce illuminates bathrooms and powder rooms of all sizes and can be mounted facing up or down.\", \"2 60-watt E26 vintage Edison bulbs included\", \"Assemble in 15-30 minutes\", \"For indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"mirror\", \"crystal\", \"mid\", \"led\", \"fixtures\", \"polished\", \"gold\", \"modern\", \"decor\", \"wholesaleplumbing\", \"antique\", \"bath\", \"lights\", \"brush\", \"over\", \"chrome\", \"black\", \"brass\", \"lighting\", \"bronze\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Wall Lights/Vanity Lights","created_at":"2023-05-15T17:25:08Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac3fe"},"product_id":4435,"item_id":"B082JHF969","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Metal Vanity Light Wall Sconce with Seeded Glass Shade, Vintage Edison Bulb Included, 10.75\"H, Dark Bronze","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Dark Bronze","weight_lb":"","price_cents":29999,"stock":30,"description":"The dark bronze finish of this vanity wall sconce accents the cute seeded glass shade to create a vintage fixture suitable for any room in your home. Whether by a mirror in your bathroom or on either side of your bed, this light fixture is sure to evoke a warm feeling of nostalgia wherever you place it.\n6\"W x 12\"D x 10.75\"H\nSeeded glass shade with a metal base in a dark bronze finish\nThis sconce illuminates bathrooms and powder rooms of all sizes.\n1 60-watt E26 vintage Edison bulb included\nAssemble in 15-30 minutes\nFor indoor use only","bullets":"[\"The dark bronze finish of this vanity wall sconce accents the cute seeded glass shade to create a vintage fixture suitable for any room in your home. Whether by a mirror in your bathroom or on either side of your bed, this light fixture is sure to evoke a warm feeling of nostalgia wherever you place it.\", \"6\\\"W x 12\\\"D x 10.75\\\"H\", \"Seeded glass shade with a metal base in a dark bronze finish\", \"This sconce illuminates bathrooms and powder rooms of all sizes.\", \"1 60-watt E26 vintage Edison bulb included\", \"Assemble in 15-30 minutes\", \"For indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"bed\", \"de\", \"steel\", \"lamps\", \"rubbed\", \"exterior\", \"brushed\", \"led\", \"acegoo\", \"two\", \"smart\", \"switch\", \"fixtures\", \"that\", \"rustic\", \"oil\", \"modern\", \"decor\", \"pared\", \"clearance\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Wall Lights/Wall Lamps & Sconces","created_at":"2023-08-15T15:23:32Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac3ff"},"product_id":4436,"item_id":"B082JHH2VF","category_id":204,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Contemporary Outdoor Pendant Light with Clear Seeded Glass Shade, Vintage Edison Bulb Included, 7\"H, Matte Black","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Matte Black","weight_lb":1.7,"price_cents":52999,"stock":1,"description":"A modern black finish is paired with a wide seeded glass shade to create a smooth mid-century pendant with an edge. Placed over a doorway or patio, this ceiling light makes your outdoor living space feel like the chic and inviting extension of your home you always wanted it to be.\n7.9\"W x 7.9\"D x 7\"H; hanging length: 46\"H\nClear seeded glass shade with a metal base in a matte-black finish\nWith a modern sense of flair, this ceiling lamp is ideal for any space, indoors or out.\n1 60-watt E26 vintage Edison bulb included\nExpert installation required\nWet rated for indoor or outdoor use","bullets":"[\"A modern black finish is paired with a wide seeded glass shade to create a smooth mid-century pendant with an edge. Placed over a doorway or patio, this ceiling light makes your outdoor living space feel like the chic and inviting extension of your home you always wanted it to be.\", \"7.9\\\"W x 7.9\\\"D x 7\\\"H; hanging length: 46\\\"H\", \"Clear seeded glass shade with a metal base in a matte-black finish\", \"With a modern sense of flair, this ceiling lamp is ideal for any space, indoors or out.\", \"1 60-watt E26 vintage Edison bulb included\", \"Expert installation required\", \"Wet rated for indoor or outdoor use\"]","keywords":"[\"de\", \"shop\", \"monkey\", \"lamps\", \"lumen\", \"bright\", \"drum\", \"utility\", \"led\", \"techo\", \"tribright\", \"semiflush\", \"fixtures\", \"flush\", \"trilight\", \"flex\", \"semi\", \"kitchen\", \"panel\", \"lights\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Ceiling Lights/Pendant Lights","created_at":"2023-11-03T09:55:58Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac400"},"product_id":4437,"item_id":"B082JHMPP2","category_id":200,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Contemporary Adjustable Height Floor Lamp with Rectangular Linen Shade, LED Bulb Included, 63\"H, Brown","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Brown","weight_lb":10.0,"price_cents":7899,"stock":21,"description":"This simple contemporary floor lamp can be adjusted from 53-inches tall to 63-inches tall. This gives you the freedom to manipulate this lamp and place the light where you need it most while making it the perfect lighting accessory in any room.\n14\"W x 11\"D x 53\"–63\"H\nLinen fabric shade with a metal base in a brown finish\nThe casual styling of this lamp is ideal for everyday life.\n1 60-watt CEC Title 20 LED bulb included\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nFor indoor use only","bullets":"[\"This simple contemporary floor lamp can be adjusted from 53-inches tall to 63-inches tall. This gives you the freedom to manipulate this lamp and place the light where you need it most while making it the perfect lighting accessory in any room.\", \"14\\\"W x 11\\\"D x 53\\\"–63\\\"H\", \"Linen fabric shade with a metal base in a brown finish\", \"The casual styling of this lamp is ideal for everyday life.\", \"1 60-watt CEC Title 20 LED bulb included\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"For indoor use only\"]","keywords":"[\"45\", \"usa\", \"lamps\", \"stocking\", \"bright\", \"craft\", \"brightech\", \"office\", \"pole\", \"remote\", \"house\", \"arched\", \"torchiere\", \"smart\", \"life\", \"leg\", \"tripod\", \"artiva\", \"award\", \"modern\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Lamps & Shades/Floor Lamps","created_at":"2023-01-31T18:13:27Z"}
