{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac42b"},"product_id":4480,"item_id":"B082QCDT5R","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet New Luna Upholstered Crescent Mid-Century Accent Chair with Tapered Legs, 31.5\"W, Dark Grey","brand":"Rivet","color":"Dark Grey","weight_lb":"","price_cents":7199,"stock":86,"description":"A sturdy frame of solid wood and wooden tapered legs form the base of this classic mid-century accent chair. Foam padding provides cushioned support. Soft dark-grey upholstery creates a comfortable place to sit and gives the piece a classic neutral color that will be at home in any living space.\n31.5\"W x 35\"D x 36.6\"H; seat height: 18.1\"H; seat depth: 21.3\"D; seat back height: 27.6\"H; arm height: 24.4\"H; leg height: 9.1\"H\nSolid wood frame\nThis handy and beautiful accent chair offers extra seating for surprise guests.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nAvoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty","bullets":"[\"A sturdy frame of solid wood and wooden tapered legs form the base of this classic mid-century accent chair. Foam padding provides cushioned support. Soft dark-grey upholstery creates a comfortable place to sit and gives the piece a classic neutral color that will be at home in any living space.\", \"31.5\\\"W x 35\\\"D x 36.6\\\"H; seat height: 18.1\\\"H; seat depth: 21.3\\\"D; seat back height: 27.6\\\"H; arm height: 24.4\\\"H; leg height: 9.1\\\"H\", \"Solid wood frame\", \"This handy and beautiful accent chair offers extra seating for surprise guests.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"studio\", \"recliner\", \"swivel\", \"egg\", \"navy\", \"signature\", \"elderly\", \"lazy\", \"mid\", \"glider\", \"boy\", \"lazyboy\", \"baxton\", \"modern\", \"furniture\", \"design\", \"by\", \"chairs\", \"clearance\", \"recliners\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Fu