{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac42c"},"product_id":4481,"item_id":"B082QDDJV9","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Bayard Contemporary Leather Living Room Chair with Curved Back and Armrests, 35.5\"W, Cognac","brand":"Rivet","color":"Cognac","weight_lb":46.3,"price_cents":21999,"stock":20,"description":"This living room chair is a stylish way to add extra seating wherever you need it. Cognac leather upholstery and tapered legs form a piece that combines modern design elements with a classic silhouette. Sit in comfort, supported by foam-padded cushions, a solid wood frame, and gently sloping armrests.\n35.5\"W x 34.2\"D x 32.7\"H; seat height: 17.7\"H; seat depth: 21.2\"D; seat back height: 16.53\"H; arm height: 24.8\"H; leg height: 8.27\"H\nSolid wood frame, leather upholstery\nThis chair combines chic, contemporary design elements in a classic structure, making it the perfect fit wherever you need seating.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nAvoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty","bullets":"[\"This living room chair is a stylish way to add extra seating wherever you need it. Cognac leather upholstery and tapered legs form a piece that combines modern design elements with a classic silhouette. Sit in comfort, supported by foam-padded cushions, a solid wood frame, and gently sloping armrests.\", \"35.5\\\"W x 34.2\\\"D x 32.7\\\"H; seat height: 17.7\\\"H; seat depth: 21.2\\\"D; seat back height: 16.53\\\"H; arm height: 24.8\\\"H; leg height: 8.27\\\"H\", \"Solid wood frame, leather upholstery\", \"This chair combines chic, contemporary design elements in a classic structure, making it the perfect fit wherever you need seating.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"studio\", \"recliner\", \"swivel\", \"egg\", \"navy\", \"signature\", \"elderly\", \"lazy\", \"mid\", \"glider\", \"boy\",