{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac42d"},"product_id":4482,"item_id":"B082QDZLRC","category_id":93,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Bigelow Modern Leather Sofa with Square Legs, 89.4\"W, Cognac","brand":"Rivet","color":"Cognac","weight_lb":110.23,"price_cents":84999,"stock":102,"description":"Clean lines and cognac-leather upholstery combine to give this sofa a timeless feel sure to become the key feature in any space. You won’t sacrifice comfort for style with this piece. The solid wood frame and square legs form a sturdy foundation, and foam-padded cushions slope for added back support.\n89.4\"W x 37.4\"D x 30.7\"H; seat height: 18.1\"H; seat depth: 22.8\"D; seat back height: 18.1\"H; arm height: 24\"H; leg height: 5.9\"H\nSolid wood frame, plinth, and tapered legs; leather upholstery\nA sturdy, solid wood frame and soft, foam-padded cushions bring a mix of comfort and support to any seating area.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nAvoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty","bullets":"[\"Clean lines and cognac-leather upholstery combine to give this sofa a timeless feel sure to become the key feature in any space. You won’t sacrifice comfort for style with this piece. The solid wood frame and square legs form a sturdy foundation, and foam-padded cushions slope for added back support.\", \"89.4\\\"W x 37.4\\\"D x 30.7\\\"H; seat height: 18.1\\\"H; seat depth: 22.8\\\"D; seat back height: 18.1\\\"H; arm height: 24\\\"H; leg height: 5.9\\\"H\", \"Solid wood frame, plinth, and tapered legs; leather upholstery\", \"A sturdy, solid wood frame and soft, foam-padded cushions bring a mix of comfort and support to any seating area.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipes clean with soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"recliner\", \"bed\", \"sectionals\", \"sierra\", \"shaped\", \"mid\", \"chesterfield\", \"couches\", \"out\", \"ikea\", \"gray\", \"para\", \"co