{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac43a"},"product_id":4496,"item_id":"B082VFS7ZW","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand - Ravenna Home Archer Steel-Framed Outdoor Patio Swivel Dining Chairs, Set of 2, 35\"H, Gray","brand":"Ravenna Home","color":"Grey","weight_lb":39.25,"price_cents":6799,"stock":198,"description":"24.41\"W x 22.64\"D x 35\"H\nPowder-coated, rust- and weather-resistant steel frame with water-resistant polyester cushions\nChairs have the flexibility to turn 360 degrees for your convenience. A curved armrest provides optimal comfort.\nTimeless, neutral colors and a crossed-back design give these chairs a clean, modern look, perfect for any outdoor dining area.\nRemovable cushions make these dining chairs low maintenance and easy to care for. Wipe the frame with a damp cloth to clean.\nAssemble in 15-30 minutes\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\nVisit Amazon.com/ravennahome to explore the Archer mix-and-match outdoor seating and dining collection.","bullets":"[\"24.41\\\"W x 22.64\\\"D x 35\\\"H\", \"Powder-coated, rust- and weather-resistant steel frame with water-resistant polyester cushions\", \"Chairs have the flexibility to turn 360 degrees for your convenience. A curved armrest provides optimal comfort.\", \"Timeless, neutral colors and a crossed-back design give these chairs a clean, modern look, perfect for any outdoor dining area.\", \"Removable cushions make these dining chairs low maintenance and easy to care for. Wipe the frame with a damp cloth to clean.\", \"Assemble in 15-30 minutes\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\", \"Visit Amazon.com/ravennahome to explore the Archer mix-and-match outdoor seating and dining collection.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"Categories/Patio Furniture & Accessories/Patio Seating/Chairs/Patio Dining Chairs","created_at":"2023-09-02T02:54:35Z"}
