{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac43c"},"product_id":4497,"item_id":"B082VLKSP9","category_id":93,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Frederick Mid-Century Modern Tufted Leather Sofa Couch, 77.5\"W, Taupe","brand":"Rivet","color":"Taupe Leather","weight_lb":100.09,"price_cents":82999,"stock":42,"description":"The rectangular shape and channeled upholstery are unmistakably mid-century, while soft leather fabric and shiny metal legs bring glamour to this sofa. This piece is a stunning style statement and a conversation starter for your modern-style room.\n77.5\"W x 34.6\"D x 31.4\"H; Seat Height: 17.7\"H ; Seat Depth: 23.2\"D; Seat Back Height: 22.2\"H; Arm Height: 31.4\"H; Leg Height: 9.3\"H\nLeather on sturdy wood frame; aluminum legs with brass finish\nMid-century modern meets glam in this statement piece\nEasy assembly in less than 30 minutes; just screw in legs\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"The rectangular shape and channeled upholstery are unmistakably mid-century, while soft leather fabric and shiny metal legs bring glamour to this sofa. This piece is a stunning style statement and a conversation starter for your modern-style room.\", \"77.5\\\"W x 34.6\\\"D x 31.4\\\"H; Seat Height: 17.7\\\"H ; Seat Depth: 23.2\\\"D; Seat Back Height: 22.2\\\"H; Arm Height: 31.4\\\"H; Leg Height: 9.3\\\"H\", \"Leather on sturdy wood frame; aluminum legs with brass finish\", \"Mid-century modern meets glam in this statement piece\", \"Easy assembly in less than 30 minutes; just screw in legs\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"recliner\", \"sectionals\", \"living\", \"set\", \"tuxedo\", \"sets\", \"sierra\", \"modway\", \"mid\", \"couch\", \"chesterfield\", \"room\", \"grey\", \"century\", \"sleeper\", \"gray\", \"white\", \"furniture\", \"lodge\", \"sectional\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Sofas & Couches","created_at":"2023-04-08T11:41:48Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac43d"},"product_id":4498,"item_id":"B082VLQY4M","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Jamie Leather Mid-Century Modern Low Arm Accent Chair, 31\"W, Grey","brand":"Rivet","color":"Grey","weight_lb":33.07,"price_cents":11999,"stock":91,"description":"A great addition to any room, this versatile accent chair is sure to be a conversation piece. It features eye catching Mid-century inspired design with distinctive slanted arms and sturdy hardwood legs.\n31\"W x 32.3\"D x 35”H\nSolid hardwood frame and soft top-grain leather.\nHighly fashionable design in a compact size for small spaces.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\nSimple leg assembly. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.","bullets":"[\"A great addition to any room, this versatile accent chair is sure to be a conversation piece. It features eye catching Mid-century inspired design with distinctive slanted arms and sturdy hardwood legs.\", \"31\\\"W x 32.3\\\"D x 35”H\", \"Solid hardwood frame and soft top-grain leather.\", \"Highly fashionable design in a compact size for small spaces.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\", \"Simple leg assembly. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\"]","keywords":"[\"studio\", \"recliner\", \"swivel\", \"living\", \"set\", \"egg\", \"navy\", \"gdf\", \"mid\", \"glider\", \"room\", \"baxton\", \"century\", \"2\", \"blue\", \"kieran\", \"furniture\", \"of\", \"chairs\", \"tufted\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2023-09-14T17:35:23Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac43e"},"product_id":4499,"item_id":"B082VLRCCP","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Jamie Leather Mid-Century Modern Low Arm Accent Chair, 31\"W, Brown","brand":"Rivet","color":"Brown","weight_lb":33.07,"price_cents":11999,"stock":18,"description":"A great addition to any room, this versatile accent chair is sure to be a conversation piece. It features eye catching Mid-century inspired design with distinctive slanted arms and sturdy hardwood legs.\n31\"W x 32.3\"D x 35”H\nSolid hardwood frame and soft top-grain leather.\nHighly fashionable design in a compact size for small spaces.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\nSimple leg assembly. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.","bullets":"[\"A great addition to any room, this versatile accent chair is sure to be a conversation piece. It features eye catching Mid-century inspired design with distinctive slanted arms and sturdy hardwood legs.\", \"31\\\"W x 32.3\\\"D x 35”H\", \"Solid hardwood frame and soft top-grain leather.\", \"Highly fashionable design in a compact size for small spaces.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\", \"Simple leg assembly. Wipe with a soft, dry cloth.\"]","keywords":"[\"studio\", \"recliner\", \"swivel\", \"living\", \"set\", \"egg\", \"navy\", \"gdf\", \"mid\", \"glider\", \"room\", \"baxton\", \"century\", \"2\", \"blue\", \"kieran\", \"furniture\", \"of\", \"chairs\", \"tufted\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2024-06-20T00:27:51Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac43f"},"product_id":4500,"item_id":"B082VLYF53","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Shorebrook Deep Leather Accent Chair, 27.6\"W, Cognac","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Cognac","weight_lb":33.07,"price_cents":19999,"stock":48,"description":"This leather chair, with its clean lines and classy look, is well suited for any room in your home. Sturdy, easy to clean, and faintly retro in design while at the same time embracing a modern-day sleekness—what's not to love?\n27.6\"W x 33.9\"D x 35.8\"H\nSolid wood frame with 100% top-grain leather and brass nailhead trim\nThis sturdy chair possesses a classy, timeless look, perfect as occasional seating or to add a touch of style to your living room.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nTo clean, avoid moisture and wipe down with a clean, soft cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty","bullets":"[\"This leather chair, with its clean lines and classy look, is well suited for any room in your home. Sturdy, easy to clean, and faintly retro in design while at the same time embracing a modern-day sleekness—what's not to love?\", \"27.6\\\"W x 33.9\\\"D x 35.8\\\"H\", \"Solid wood frame with 100% top-grain leather and brass nailhead trim\", \"This sturdy chair possesses a classy, timeless look, perfect as occasional seating or to add a touch of style to your living room.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"To clean, avoid moisture and wipe down with a clean, soft cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 3-year warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"studio\", \"recliner\", \"swivel\", \"egg\", \"navy\", \"signature\", \"elderly\", \"lazy\", \"glider\", \"boy\", \"lazyboy\", \"baxton\", \"modern\", \"furniture\", \"by\", \"chairs\", \"clearance\", \"recliners\", \"power\", \"massage\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2023-11-10T21:30:32Z"}
