{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac445"},"product_id":4506,"item_id":"B082XD1PKG","category_id":28,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Remote-Controlled 4-Blade Ceiling Fan with Light, 52\" Diameter, Antique Brass","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Antique Brass","weight_lb":14.85,"price_cents":1299,"stock":101,"description":"The 4 blades of this modern ceiling fan bisect the sphere-like antique-brass center of the fixture, a unique touch that gives this lamp extra appeal. The remote-control feature means that both light and breeze are easily adjustable.\nThis fan is made out of metal with a glass shade.\nWith LED efficiency and balanced blades this ceiling fan aids in evenly lighting and cooling your room.\nA modern design with classic touches make this fan a charming addition to any room.\n52\" diameter x 15\"H\nSimple assembly in 15-30 minutes\nThis ceiling fan comes with an LED bulb and is rated for indoor use.","bullets":"[\"The 4 blades of this modern ceiling fan bisect the sphere-like antique-brass center of the fixture, a unique touch that gives this lamp extra appeal. The remote-control feature means that both light and breeze are easily adjustable.\", \"This fan is made out of metal with a glass shade.\", \"With LED efficiency and balanced blades this ceiling fan aids in evenly lighting and cooling your room.\", \"A modern design with classic touches make this fan a charming addition to any room.\", \"52\\\" diameter x 15\\\"H\", \"Simple assembly in 15-30 minutes\", \"This ceiling fan comes with an LED bulb and is rated for indoor use.\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"44\", \"de\", \"commercial\", \"cieling\", \"tropicalfan\", \"hugger\", \"crystal\", \"lucci\", \"harbor\", \"brushed\", \"air\", \"techo\", \"modernas\", \"without\", \"gold\", \"gray\", \"white\", \"flush\", \"decor\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Ceiling Fans & Accessories/Ceiling Fans","created_at":"2024-04-17T19:02:19Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac446"},"product_id":4507,"item_id":"B082XLG9TD","category_id":28,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Scandinavian Ceiling Fan with Light, 52\" Diameter, Matte White","brand":"Rivet","color":"Matte White","weight_lb":13.4,"price_cents":4099,"stock":6,"description":"The matte-white center accentuates the 3 propeller-shaped woodgrain blades of this beautifully designed ceiling fan. This fixture cools your space while providing glare-free ambient lighting and a touch of mid-century style.\nThis fan is made out of metal and outfitted with ABS polymer. An LED bulb is included.\nThis ceiling fan, with its LED bulb and balanced blades, aids in evenly lighting and cooling your room.\nThe modern design of this ceiling fan has classic touches to help it blend with any room.\n52\" diameter x 14\"H\nSimple assembly in 15-30 minutes\nThis ceiling fan comes with an LED bulb and is rated for indoor use.","bullets":"[\"The matte-white center accentuates the 3 propeller-shaped woodgrain blades of this beautifully designed ceiling fan. This fixture cools your space while providing glare-free ambient lighting and a touch of mid-century style.\", \"This fan is made out of metal and outfitted with ABS polymer. An LED bulb is included.\", \"This ceiling fan, with its LED bulb and balanced blades, aids in evenly lighting and cooling your room.\", \"The modern design of this ceiling fan has classic touches to help it blend with any room.\", \"52\\\" diameter x 14\\\"H\", \"Simple assembly in 15-30 minutes\", \"This ceiling fan comes with an LED bulb and is rated for indoor use.\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"de\", \"commercial\", \"cieling\", \"tropicalfan\", \"hugger\", \"crystal\", \"lucci\", \"brushed\", \"harbor\", \"mid\", \"air\", \"techo\", \"remote\", \"modernas\", \"without\", \"blade\", \"gold\", \"gray\", \"flush\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Ceiling Fans & Accessories/Ceiling Fans","created_at":"2024-04-11T21:38:42Z"}
