{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac448"},"product_id":4509,"item_id":"B082XLWY2S","category_id":200,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Globe Stick Floor Lamp, 69\"H, Pink Terrazzo","brand":"Rivet","color":"Pink","weight_lb":15.0,"price_cents":2399,"stock":29,"description":"This floor lamp is sleek and subtle in design, the tall, slim metal upright rising from a solid, sturdy cylindrical base to end in a globe shade that will shed diffused light. As much sculpture as lamp, this piece will add a pop of interest to any room.\nThis floor lamp is made out of metal, terrazzo, and acrylic.\nThis floor lamp will help light your living space, providing a warm ambiance.\nThe stylish combination of metal and terrazzo gives this lamp structural appeal.\n9\"W x 9\"D x 69\"H\nSimple assembly in 15-30 minutes\nThis lamp comes with a bulb and is rated for indoor use.","bullets":"[\"This floor lamp is sleek and subtle in design, the tall, slim metal upright rising from a solid, sturdy cylindrical base to end in a globe shade that will shed diffused light. As much sculpture as lamp, this piece will add a pop of interest to any room.\", \"This floor lamp is made out of metal, terrazzo, and acrylic.\", \"This floor lamp will help light your living space, providing a warm ambiance.\", \"The stylish combination of metal and terrazzo gives this lamp structural appeal.\", \"9\\\"W x 9\\\"D x 69\\\"H\", \"Simple assembly in 15-30 minutes\", \"This lamp comes with a bulb and is rated for indoor use.\"]","keywords":"[\"45\", \"usa\", \"stained\", \"lamps\", \"stocking\", \"craft\", \"bright\", \"mid\", \"led\", \"office\", \"150\", \"pole\", \"house\", \"arched\", \"torchiere\", \"life\", \"leg\", \"tripod\", \"artiva\", \"award\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans/Lamps & Shades/Floor Lamps","created_at":"2024-03-17T22:16:15Z"}
