{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac44d"},"product_id":4514,"item_id":"B08316XB4V","category_id":272,"name":"(Renewed) AmazonBasics Non-Stick Grill Pan (Induction and Gas Compatible), 28 cm","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Others","weight_lb":2.99,"price_cents":2799,"stock":21,"description":"This Certified Refurbished product is tested to work and look like new with minimal to no signs of wear & tear; the product comes with relevant accessories and is backed by a minimum six month supplier backed warranty; box may be generic\nNon-stick induction grill pan (28cm) with raised ridges along the bottom, helps keep food up and away from excess fat\nMade of cast-aluminium for fast, efficient heating, titanium-plasma and Dakin non-stick coating for effortless food release\nStay-cool Bakelite riveted handle for comfortable lifting and carrying, hole offers convenient hanging-storage option\nSuitable for all heat sources, including induction, oven-safe up to 175 degree celsius","bullets":"[\"This Certified Refurbished product is tested to work and look like new with minimal to no signs of wear & tear; the product comes with relevant accessories and is backed by a minimum six month supplier backed warranty; box may be generic\", \"Non-stick induction grill pan (28cm) with raised ridges along the bottom, helps keep food up and away from excess fat\", \"Made of cast-aluminium for fast, efficient heating, titanium-plasma and Dakin non-stick coating for effortless food release\", \"Stay-cool Bakelite riveted handle for comfortable lifting and carrying, hole offers convenient hanging-storage option\", \"Suitable for all heat sources, including induction, oven-safe up to 175 degree celsius\"]","keywords":"[\"amazonbasics\", \"111602oc940\", \"kitchen\", \"others\", \"amazonbasics 111602oc940 kitchen\", \"amazonbasics kitchen\", \"amazonbasics others\", \"amazonbasics kitchen others\", \"amazonbasics others kitchen\"]","node_path":"Categories/Kitchen & Dining/Cookware/Pots & Pans/Grill Pans","created_at":"2023-11-29T14:25:24Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac44e"},"product_id":4515,"item_id":"B0831PV6X6","category_id":210,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Terrazzo Planter with Wood Stand, 12.6\"H, White","brand":"Rivet","color":"White","weight_lb":8.94,"price_cents":4399,"stock":7,"description":"A classic look with a contemporary new take, this terrazzo planter suits living room, bedroom, or just about everywhere else you can imagine. It's a timeless look stripped down to its beautiful bare basics, useful for both direct and indirect planting.\n8.75\" diameter x 8\"H (12.6\"H including stand); 7.75\" interior diameter\nMade from combining contrasting tonal-colored rock chips with a colored cement set atop a wooden stand\nThis planter is both durable and lovely. Made of terrazzo cement, it is perfect on its own, but it also comes with drainage hole for direct potting needs.\nThe terrazzo of the 1920s is making a trendy comeback. This striking planter will work in any room of your house!\nNo assembly required\nHand wash with a damp cloth.","bullets":"[\"A classic look with a contemporary new take, this terrazzo planter suits living room, bedroom, or just about everywhere else you can imagine. It's a timeless look stripped down to its beautiful bare basics, useful for both direct and indirect planting.\", \"8.75\\\" diameter x 8\\\"H (12.6\\\"H including stand); 7.75\\\" interior diameter\", \"Made from combining contrasting tonal-colored rock chips with a colored cement set atop a wooden stand\", \"This planter is both durable and lovely. Made of terrazzo cement, it is perfect on its own, but it also comes with drainage hole for direct potting needs.\", \"The terrazzo of the 1920s is making a trendy comeback. This striking planter will work in any room of your house!\", \"No assembly required\", \"Hand wash with a damp cloth.\"]","keywords":"[\"ceramic\", \"tray\", \"next\", \"small\", \"saucer\", \"mid\", \"groot\", \"pots\", \"box\", \"gardener\", \"flower\", \"100\", \"succulent\", \"century\", \"modern\", \"hedgehog\", \"pot\", \"planters\", \"gallon\", \"flowerpot\"]","node_path":"Categories/Gardening & Lawn Care/Pots, Planters & Container Accessories/Planters","created_at":"2024-01-31T04:16:25Z"}
