y\", \"modern\", \"hedgehog\", \"pot\", \"gallon\", \"light\", \"kit\", \"plant\", \"hydroponics\"]","node_path":"Categories/Gardening & Lawn Care/Pots, Planters & Container Accessories/Planters","created_at":"2023-09-17T09:31:04Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac450"},"product_id":4517,"item_id":"B0831Q5ZW3","category_id":210,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Global Stoneware Planter with Black Wood Stand, 10.4\"H, Black Glaze","brand":"Rivet","color":"Black","weight_lb":4.62,"price_cents":6399,"stock":13,"description":"Contemporary in design, this playfully geometric piece will bring a sense of modern sophistication to your home. This striking black-glazed planter is excellent as a single piece or as part of a set. It can be placed anywhere from a living room to a bedroom to display a favorite plant.\n7.7\" diameter x 6.25\"H (10.4\"H including stand); 6.75\" interior diameter\nCeramic stoneware pot with wooden stand\nThis flower pot is multifunctional and user friendly. It is equipped for planting with drainage hole and form-fitting wooden stand.\nThe playful geometrical shapes displayed on this glazed pot really show creative expression.\nNo assembly required\nHand wash with a damp cloth.","bullets":"[\"Contemporary in design, this playfully geometric piece will bring a sense of modern sophistication to your home. This striking black-glazed planter is excellent as a single piece or as part of a set. It can be placed anywhere from a living room to a bedroom to display a favorite plant.\", \"7.7\\\" diameter x 6.25\\\"H (10.4\\\"H including stand); 6.75\\\" interior diameter\", \"Ceramic stoneware pot with wooden stand\", \"This flower pot is multifunctional and user friendly. It is equipped for planting with drainage hole and form-fitting wooden stand.\", \"The playful geometrical shapes displayed on this glazed pot really show creative expression.\", \"No assembly required\", \"Hand wash with a damp cloth.\"]","keywords":"[\"tray\", \"trending\", \"gift\", \"pets\", \"trump\", \"donald\", \"saucer\", \"25\", \"dad\", \"mid\", \"gag\", \"america\", \"head\", \"chia\", \"white\", \"freedom\", \"top\", \"bear\", \"make\", \"funny\"]","node_path":"Categories/Gardening & Lawn Care/Pots, Planter