{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac488"},"product_id":4573,"item_id":"B083VWH5JJ","category_id":156,"name":"Amazon Basic Care Children's Ibuprofen Chewable Tablets, 100 mg, Grape Flavor, Pain Reliever and Fever Reducer (NSAID), 24 Count","brand":"Amazon Basic Care","color":"","weight_lb":0.09,"price_cents":999,"stock":37,"description":"ACTIVE INGREDIENT: The active ingredient in Amazon Basic Care Children's Ibuprofen Chewable Tablets, 100 mg, Grape Flavor, is ibuprofen 100 mg, a pain reliever and fever reducer. Compare to the active ingredient of Children's Motrin.\nNSAID: Chewable tablets are a convenient choice for busy families: No dosing container or water needed. Amazon Basic Care Children's Ibuprofen Chewable Tablets, 100 mg temporarily reduces fever and provides up to 8 hours of relief of minor aches & pains.\nMADE FOR CHILDREN: Amazon Basic Care Children's Ibuprofen Chewable Tablets, 100 mg is a pain reliever and fever reducer specifically formulated for children ages 2-11. This product is gluten free and preservative free.\nLASTS UP TO 8 HOURS: Amazon Basic Care Children's Ibuprofen Chewable Tablets, 100 mg provide multiple symptom relief that lasts up to 8 hours per dose. Grape flavor is a child-pleasing favorite to help the medicine go down.\nPAIN RELIEVER/FEVER REDUCER: Amazon Basic Care Children's Ibuprofen Chewable Tablets, 100 mg, reduces fever and relieves minor aches and pains due to the common cold, flu, sore throat, headaches and toothaches.","bullets":"[\"ACTIVE INGREDIENT: The active ingredient in Amazon Basic Care Children's Ibuprofen Chewable Tablets, 100 mg, Grape Flavor, is ibuprofen 100 mg, a pain reliever and fever reducer. Compare to the active ingredient of Children's Motrin.\", \"NSAID: Chewable tablets are a convenient choice for busy families: No dosing container or water needed. Amazon Basic Care Children's Ibuprofen Chewable Tablets, 100 mg temporarily reduces fever and provides up to 8 hours of relief of minor aches & pains.\", \"MADE FOR CHILDREN: Amazon Basic Care Children's Ibuprofen Chewable Tablets, 100 mg is a pain reliever and fever reducer specifically formulated for children ages 2-11. This product is gluten free and preservative free.\", \"LASTS UP TO 8 HOURS: Amazon Basic Care Children's Ibuprofen Chewable Tablets, 100 mg provide multiple symptom relief that lasts up to 8 hours per dose. Grape flavor is a child-pleasing favorite to help the medicine go down.\", \"PAIN RELIEVER/FEVER REDUCER: Amazon Basic Care Children's Ibuprofen Chewable Tablets, 100 mg, reduces fever and relieves minor aches and pains due to the common cold, flu, sore throat, headaches and toothaches.\"]","keywords":"[\"amazon basic care ibuprofen pain reliever fever reducer headaches common cold ibuprofen 100 mg motrin reduces fever flu ibuprofen tablets fever fever treatment\"]","node_path":"Products/Health Care/OTC Medications & Treatments/Pain Relievers/Non-Aspirin/Ibuprofen","created_at":"2024-01-20T09:33:49Z"}
