{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac48a"},"product_id":4575,"item_id":"B083YFKSJ2","category_id":210,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Small Floral-Embossed Planter, 4.3\"H, Cloud Dancer White","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"White","weight_lb":1.18,"price_cents":5699,"stock":118,"description":"This eye-catching planter is the perfect vessel for a plant, flower, or other greenery of your choice, or you can choose to keep it empty or use it to display other items in your home. The white color will look great in any room or outdoor space.\n4.9\" diameter x 4.3\"H; 4.25\" interior diameter\n100% ceramic stoneware\nThis natural stoneware pot is perfect for showing off your favorite flower or plant and includes a drainage hole.\nWith an embossed floral pattern in white glaze, there's no wrong way to display this classic pot. Fill it with your favorite plant or keep it empty.\nNo assembly required\nHand wash with a wet cloth.","bullets":"[\"This eye-catching planter is the perfect vessel for a plant, flower, or other greenery of your choice, or you can choose to keep it empty or use it to display other items in your home. The white color will look great in any room or outdoor space.\", \"4.9\\\" diameter x 4.3\\\"H; 4.25\\\" interior diameter\", \"100% ceramic stoneware\", \"This natural stoneware pot is perfect for showing off your favorite flower or plant and includes a drainage hole.\", \"With an embossed floral pattern in white glaze, there's no wrong way to display this classic pot. Fill it with your favorite plant or keep it empty.\", \"No assembly required\", \"Hand wash with a wet cloth.\"]","keywords":"[\"farmhouse\", \"tray\", \"12\", \"saucer\", \"large\", \"fig\", \"tree\", \"mid\", \"pots\", \"leaf\", \"fox\", \"100\", \"century\", \"hedgehog\", \"fern\", \"modern\", \"planters\", \"gallon\", \"plants\", \"fiddle\"]","node_path":"Categories/Gardening & Lawn Care/Pots, Planters & Container Accessories/Planters","created_at":"2023-10-20T06:55:47Z"}
