{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac490"},"product_id":4581,"item_id":"B0842F237S","category_id":108,"name":"Amazon Brand - Vedaka Mustard Oil Bottle, 1L","brand":"Vedaka","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":599,"stock":9,"description":"100% pure and unadulterated oil, ensured by the Fatty Acid Profiling process\nPrepared through physical refining technology which removes any free fatty acids present\nDelicious taste and aromatic flavour\nSource of Monounsaturated Fatty Acids (MUFA); Decreasing saturated fatty acids and increasing Monounsaturated fatty acids in diet helps maintaining a healthy heart and normal cholesterol levels\nAnti-spillage bottle design\nEasy to store and convenient to use when cooking\nSuitable for use in frying, marinating and dressing salads","bullets":"[\"100% pure and unadulterated oil, ensured by the Fatty Acid Profiling process\", \"Prepared through physical refining technology which removes any free fatty acids present\", \"Delicious taste and aromatic flavour\", \"Source of Monounsaturated Fatty Acids (MUFA); Decreasing saturated fatty acids and increasing Monounsaturated fatty acids in diet helps maintaining a healthy heart and normal cholesterol levels\", \"Anti-spillage bottle design\", \"Easy to store and convenient to use when cooking\", \"Suitable for use in frying, marinating and dressing salads\"]","keywords":"[\"mustard oil for cooking\", \"kadugu oil\", \"mustard oil pantry\", \"avalu oil\", \"sarson ka tel 5 litre\", \"cooking oil\", \"kachi ghani oil\", \"pure mustard oil\", \"mustard oil pantry 1 ltr\", \"kachi ghani oil 1 litre\", \"eṇṇey\", \"mustard oil\", \"sarson oil\"]","node_path":"Products/Cooking & Baking Supplies/Oils & Ghee/Oils/Mustard","created_at":"2024-03-19T19:49:22Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac491"},"product_id":4582,"item_id":"B0842H2F7C","category_id":193,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Mid-Century Ceramic Planter with Stand, 18.9\"H, White","brand":"Rivet","color":"Solid White","weight_lb":19.9,"price_cents":3699,"stock":28,"description":"This all-white stoneware planter is an attractive piece in its own right. Combined with an iron stand, it makes a mid-century style statement in addition to holding plants. Planter and stand can be used together or separately.\n14.2'' diameter x 13.75\"H (18.9''H with stand); 12\" interior diameter\n100% stoneware with iron stand\nThis durable piece is designed for house plants but stands alone as a decorative piece as well.\nThis planter with iron stand can be used as a stand-alone item, filled with house plants, or changed to meet your seasonal decor needs.\nNo assembly required\nWipe clean with soft, dry cloth.","bullets":"[\"This all-white stoneware planter is an attractive piece in its own right. Combined with an iron stand, it makes a mid-century style statement in addition to holding plants. Planter and stand can be used together or separately.\", \"14.2'' diameter x 13.75\\\"H (18.9''H with stand); 12\\\" interior diameter\", \"100% stoneware with iron stand\", \"This durable piece is designed for house plants but stands alone as a decorative piece as well.\", \"This planter with iron stand can be used as a stand-alone item, filled with house plants, or changed to meet your seasonal decor needs.\", \"No assembly required\", \"Wipe clean with soft, dry cloth.\"]","keywords":"[\"boxes\", \"outdoor\", \"century\", \"wrought\", \"modern\", \"planters\", \"plant\", \"multiple\", \"mid\", \"indoor\", \"window\"]","node_path":"Categories/Gardening & Lawn Care/Pots, Planters & Container Accessories/Plant Container Accessories/Stands","created_at":"2023-05-10T00:32:06Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac492"},"product_id":4583,"item_id":"B0842H7CKG","category_id":210,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Geometric Ceramic Planter, 6.5\"H, Golden Yellow","brand":"Rivet","color":"Yellow","weight_lb":4.12,"price_cents":1999,"stock":8,"description":"With or without a plant, this beautiful stoneware pot brings a stylish touch to your office or any room in your home. Its compact size makes it great for a windowsill or desktop. White geometric patterns on a golden-yellow background add a splash of color.\n7.6\" diameter x 6.5\"H; 6.875\" interior diameter\nMade from 100% stoneware for long-lasting durability\nIdeal for a house plant, or simply for decor\nThis pot with its drainage hole can be used for direct or indirect planting. The internal glaze will keep soil moist.\nNo assembly required\nClean with a damp cloth.","bullets":"[\"With or without a plant, this beautiful stoneware pot brings a stylish touch to your office or any room in your home. Its compact size makes it great for a windowsill or desktop. White geometric patterns on a golden-yellow background add a splash of color.\", \"7.6\\\" diameter x 6.5\\\"H; 6.875\\\" interior diameter\", \"Made from 100% stoneware for long-lasting durability\", \"Ideal for a house plant, or simply for decor\", \"This pot with its drainage hole can be used for direct or indirect planting. The internal glaze will keep soil moist.\", \"No assembly required\", \"Clean with a damp cloth.\"]","keywords":"[\"tray\", \"100\", \"century\", \"saucer\", \"modern\", \"hedgehog\", \"gallon\", \"planter\", \"mid\"]","node_path":"Categories/Gardening & Lawn Care/Pots, Planters & Container Accessories/Planters","created_at":"2023-12-01T16:34:12Z"}
