{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac4c3"},"product_id":4632,"item_id":"B084KCZXFC","category_id":193,"name":"Amazon Brand - Stone & Beam Vintage Compass Wooden Accent Mirror, 28\"H, Dark Stain","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Dark","weight_lb":15.58,"price_cents":5099,"stock":29,"description":"This unique mirror features multiple panels in a compass pattern. A dark-colored fir frame adds a vintage feel to this modern design—this statement piece will be at home in any decor schemes. The bold framework makes this perfect for a living room, entryway, or any space that needs a focal point.\n28\"H x 28\"L x 1.5\"D\nSolid fir frame\nMultiple panels reflect the light, helping your space feel brighter and more open.\nThe unique pattern on this mirror’s interior framework draws the eye by creating dimension wherever it is hung.\nAvoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Hanging hardware not included.","bullets":"[\"This unique mirror features multiple panels in a compass pattern. A dark-colored fir frame adds a vintage feel to this modern design—this statement piece will be at home in any decor schemes. The bold framework makes this perfect for a living room, entryway, or any space that needs a focal point.\", \"28\\\"H x 28\\\"L x 1.5\\\"D\", \"Solid fir frame\", \"Multiple panels reflect the light, helping your space feel brighter and more open.\", \"The unique pattern on this mirror’s interior framework draws the eye by creating dimension wherever it is hung.\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Hanging hardware not included.\"]","keywords":"[\"farmhouse\", \"chain\", \"coop\", \"large\", \"mirrors\", \"chrome\", \"length\", \"metal\", \"creative\", \"round\", \"framed\", \"pivot\", \"leaner\", \"floor\", \"circle\", \"wall\", \"bathroom\", \"full\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-04-08T09:34:09Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac4c4"},"product_id":4633,"item_id":"B084KD11DF","category_id":197,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Vintage Farmhouse Wooden Arched Multipanel Mantel Mirror, 36\"H, Dark Stain","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Dark","weight_lb":19.49,"price_cents":8099,"stock":0,"description":"The arched dark fir frame and grid-and-diamond design on this elegant mirror bring to mind vintage elegance, making it the perfect accent piece in any classic or rustic design scheme. Hang it anywhere you need an accent piece or a touch of dimension. Solid fir forms the frame and interior details.\n36\"H x 24\"L x 1.25\"D\nSolid fir frame\nMultiple panels reflect the light, helping your space feel brighter and more open.\nComplement your classic decor style or brighten any space with the multiple grid-and-diamond panels on this vintage-style mirror.\nAvoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Hanging hardware not included.","bullets":"[\"The arched dark fir frame and grid-and-diamond design on this elegant mirror bring to mind vintage elegance, making it the perfect accent piece in any classic or rustic design scheme. Hang it anywhere you need an accent piece or a touch of dimension. Solid fir forms the frame and interior details.\", \"36\\\"H x 24\\\"L x 1.25\\\"D\", \"Solid fir frame\", \"Multiple panels reflect the light, helping your space feel brighter and more open.\", \"Complement your classic decor style or brighten any space with the multiple grid-and-diamond panels on this vintage-style mirror.\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth. Hanging hardware not included.\"]","keywords":"[\"studio\", \"chain\", \"coop\", \"large\", \"mirrors\", \"chrome\", \"for\", \"length\", \"metal\", \"equipment\", \"creative\", \"home\", \"round\", \"framed\", \"pivot\", \"gym\", \"leaner\", \"floor\", \"circle\", \"dance\"]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-07-01T17:16:07Z"}
