{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac4d2"},"product_id":4647,"item_id":"B084QWW4LR","category_id":95,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Mid-Century Modern Two-Door Media Console Table, 48\"W, Antique Espresso","brand":"Rivet","color":"Antique Espresso","weight_lb":109.0,"price_cents":12999,"stock":69,"description":"The classic lines and solid pine construction give this espresso media console table a mid-century look that will blend with any decor. Two shelves behind two sliding doors provide plenty of storage to help you prevent clutter. A wide top provides the ideal place for a TV or other electronics.\n48\"W x 12.2\"D x 27.5\"H\nSolid pine construction\nA pair of sliding doors reveal two shelves, perfect for storing items out of sight. Solid construction helps provide a secure base for electronics.\nA traditional design and espresso finish create a vintage feel that will add a classic touch to any space.\nAssemble in 15-30 minutes\nAvoid moisture. Wipe clean with soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"The classic lines and solid pine construction give this espresso media console table a mid-century look that will blend with any decor. Two shelves behind two sliding doors provide plenty of storage to help you prevent clutter. A wide top provides the ideal place for a TV or other electronics.\", \"48\\\"W x 12.2\\\"D x 27.5\\\"H\", \"Solid pine construction\", \"A pair of sliding doors reveal two shelves, perfect for storing items out of sight. Solid construction helps provide a secure base for electronics.\", \"A traditional design and espresso finish create a vintage feel that will add a classic touch to any space.\", \"Assemble in 15-30 minutes\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"cherry\", \"sofa\", \"glass\", \"vortex\", \"c\", \"entryway\", \"mid\", \"american\", \"collection\", \"way\", \"home\", \"entry\", \"century\", \"tables\", \"infinity\", \"wood\", \"safavieh\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Tables/Sofa & Console Tables","created_at":"2023-04-29T03:08:03Z"}
