{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac4ed"},"product_id":4674,"item_id":"B0852D5LG9","category_id":193,"name":"AmazonBasics Sustain Pedal for Portable Keyboards - Black (Renewed)","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"","weight_lb":0.25,"price_cents":3399,"stock":0,"description":"Sustain pedal works with all portable electronic keyboards and digital pianos\nSimilar function and feel to an acoustic piano's sustain pedal; extends or “sustains” the sound of the note\nDurable metal housing with non-slip rubber surface for secure placement while in use\nA small sliding switch makes it easy to set the polarity of the switch signal; foot switchable function for Casio- and Yamaha-style electronic keyboards\nMeasures 4 by 4 by 2 inches; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty","bullets":"[\"Sustain pedal works with all portable electronic keyboards and digital pianos\", \"Similar function and feel to an acoustic piano's sustain pedal; extends or “sustains” the sound of the note\", \"Durable metal housing with non-slip rubber surface for secure placement while in use\", \"A small sliding switch makes it easy to set the polarity of the switch signal; foot switchable function for Casio- and Yamaha-style electronic keyboards\", \"Measures 4 by 4 by 2 inches; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"bed\", \"college\", \"basket\", \"tv\", \"controls\", \"rv\", \"conditioner\", \"air\", \"storage\", \"remote\", \"cell\", \"shelves\", \"attachment\", \"top\", \"holders\", \"acrylic\", \"pen\", \"adhesive\", \"buddy\", \"bathroom\"]","node_path":"Categories/Keyboards & Pianos/Keyboard Accessories/Pedals & Footswitches","created_at":"2023-09-19T13:16:54Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac4ee"},"product_id":4675,"item_id":"B0853JVBVF","category_id":89,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Curved Upholstered Headboard with Nailhead Trim, Queen, 60\"W, Gray","brand":"Rivet","color":"Gray","weight_lb":25.7,"price_cents":10999,"stock":163,"description":"This lovely classic headboard features decorative nailhead detailing that gives the curved design a touch of sophistication and an heirloom look. The padded frame and gray upholstery make this the perfect neutral addition to any bedroom suite.\n60\"W x 3.5\"D x 42\"–50\"H\nThe well-constructed wood frame is padded with polyurethane foam for added comfort.\nThe legs of this headboard adjust to 3 different heights, allowing it to attach to any standard bed frame.\nThe arched design has notched corners, perfectly accented by decorative nailhead trim that lends instant eye-catching appeal to your space.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nAvoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This lovely classic headboard features decorative nailhead detailing that gives the curved design a touch of sophistication and an heirloom look. The padded frame and gray upholstery make this the perfect neutral addition to any bedroom suite.\", \"60\\\"W x 3.5\\\"D x 42\\\"–50\\\"H\", \"The well-constructed wood frame is padded with polyurethane foam for added comfort.\", \"The legs of this headboard adjust to 3 different heights, allowing it to attach to any standard bed frame.\", \"The arched design has notched corners, perfectly accented by decorative nailhead trim that lends instant eye-catching appeal to your space.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"set\", \"king\", \"queen\", \"navy\", \"mid\", \"distressed\", \"century\", \"modern\", \"white\", \"furniture\", \"zinus\", \"headboards\", \"only\", \"progressive\", \"beds\", \"footboard\", \"tufted\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Bedroom Furniture/Beds, Frames & Bases/Headboards & Footboards/Headboards","created_at":"2024-06-12T14:37:18Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac4ef"},"product_id":4676,"item_id":"B0853KM5Q3","category_id":94,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Eli Modern Curved-Back Counter-Height Barstool, 38.2\"H, Stucco","brand":"Rivet","color":"Stucco","weight_lb":14.74,"price_cents":8299,"stock":30,"description":"Powerful in its simplicity, this counter-height barstool is fully upholstered, with strong wooden legs and a curved, supportive back. The addition of 4 offset rungs adds stability and provides a handy and comfortable footrest.\n18.9\"W x 22.4\"D x 38.2\"H; seat height: 26\"H; seat depth: 16.5\"D; seat back height: 16.1\"H; leg height: 22\"H\nSolid wood frame with 80% polyester, 20% acrylic fabric\nThe solid wood frame is well cushioned and fully upholstered.\nA lovely example of mid-century simplicity, this barstool is both comfortable and durable.\nNo assembly required\nAvoid moisture; wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty","bullets":"[\"Powerful in its simplicity, this counter-height barstool is fully upholstered, with strong wooden legs and a curved, supportive back. The addition of 4 offset rungs adds stability and provides a handy and comfortable footrest.\", \"18.9\\\"W x 22.4\\\"D x 38.2\\\"H; seat height: 26\\\"H; seat depth: 16.5\\\"D; seat back height: 16.1\\\"H; leg height: 22\\\"H\", \"Solid wood frame with 80% polyester, 20% acrylic fabric\", \"The solid wood frame is well cushioned and fully upholstered.\", \"A lovely example of mid-century simplicity, this barstool is both comfortable and durable.\", \"No assembly required\", \"Avoid moisture; wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"stool\", \"de\", \"24\", \"auto\", \"swivel\", \"barstools\", \"mid\", \"tools\", \"barra\", \"inches\", \"bar\", \"para\", \"low\", \"decor\", \"tractor\", \"chairs\", \"tall\", \"stools\", \"kitchen\", \"bancos\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Game & Recreation Room Furniture/Home 