\"stool\", \"de\", \"24\", \"auto\", \"swivel\", \"mid\", \"tools\", \"barra\", \"inches\", \"bar\", \"para\", \"low\", \"decor\", \"tractor\", \"chairs\", \"tall\", \"stools\", \"kitchen\", \"bancos\", \"height\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Game & Recreation Room Furniture/Home Bar Furniture/Barstools","created_at":"2024-05-31T02:42:15Z"}
