{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac4f2"},"product_id":4679,"item_id":"B0853NDBRR","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Olander Mid-Century Modern Recliner Chair with a Swivel Base, 31.1\"W, Stucco","brand":"Rivet","color":"Stucco","weight_lb":"","price_cents":16999,"stock":46,"description":"This extra-deep, plush manual recliner features soft padding and textured fabric for all-around comfort. A swivel base provides easy maneuverability. The curved lines of this chair create a supportive framework. A modern design and light-stucco color mean this piece will be at home in any space.\n31.1\"W x 33.1\"D x 39.4\"H; seat height: 16.5\"H; seat depth: 19.3\"D; seat back height: 27.6\"H; arm height: 22.8\"H\nBrushed-brass base with polyester and acrylic upholstery\nThe ratchet headrest and swivel base make this chair comfortable and easy to move in.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nAvoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty","bullets":"[\"This extra-deep, plush manual recliner features soft padding and textured fabric for all-around comfort. A swivel base provides easy maneuverability. The curved lines of this chair create a supportive framework. A modern design and light-stucco color mean this piece will be at home in any space.\", \"31.1\\\"W x 33.1\\\"D x 39.4\\\"H; seat height: 16.5\\\"H; seat depth: 19.3\\\"D; seat back height: 27.6\\\"H; arm height: 22.8\\\"H\", \"Brushed-brass base with polyester and acrylic upholstery\", \"The ratchet headrest and swivel base make this chair comfortable and easy to move in.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Avoid moisture. Wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"small\", \"euro\", \"motion\", \"ottoman\", \"&\", \"black\", \"mid\", \"collection\", \"ekornes\", \"leather\", \"mac\", \"ottomans\", \"matching\", \"century\", \"stressless\", \"oslo\", \"chairs\", \"recliners\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furnit