{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac4f3"},"product_id":4680,"item_id":"B0853P7JWV","category_id":204,"name":"AmazonBasics 20W Waterproof LED Outdoor Motion Sensor Security Light with 2 Adjustable Heads - 5000K Daylight, 2000 Lumen, Up to 180 Detection Angle, ETL Certified","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"White","weight_lb":1.21,"price_cents":10999,"stock":8,"description":"Security light for outdoor illumination; Save more on electricity bills compared with equivalent traditional halogen bulbs\n2 ultra-bright LED light heads produce up to 2000 lumen brightness, 5000k daylight, 20W; ETL-certified\n2-headed design gives you a wider light casting and motion detection range; adjust light head to preferred angles up to 180° and motion detection up to 49 feet; adjustable duration timer setting\nDurable aluminum design provides reliable heat dissipation; bulb lifespan of up to 50,000 hours (included)\nWaterproof rating ensures the security light can withstand rain, sleet, or snow\nMotion sensor time control duration settings range from 5 seconds to 12 minutes","bullets":"[\"Security light for outdoor illumination; Save more on electricity bills compared with equivalent traditional halogen bulbs\", \"2 ultra-bright LED light heads produce up to 2000 lumen brightness, 5000k daylight, 20W; ETL-certified\", \"2-headed design gives you a wider light casting and motion detection range; adjust light head to preferred angles up to 180° and motion detection up to 49 feet; adjustable duration timer setting\", \"Durable aluminum design provides reliable heat dissipation; bulb lifespan of up to 50,000 hours (included)\", \"Waterproof rating ensures the security light can withstand rain, sleet, or snow\", \"Motion sensor time control duration settings range from 5 seconds to 12 minutes\"]","keywords":"[\"150\", \"flood\", \"400\", \"600\", \"cob\", \"missbee\", \"600w\", \"400w\", \"150w\", \"watt\", \"morsen\", \"lights\", \"gopretty\"]","node_path":"Categories/Lighting & Ceiling Fans