{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac4f5"},"product_id":4682,"item_id":"B0853Q7C48","category_id":82,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Mid-Century Modern Pine Bar Cabinet, 31.5\"W, Brown","brand":"Rivet","color":"Brown","weight_lb":74.03,"price_cents":16999,"stock":58,"description":"This mid-century-style 2-door bar cabinet offers an understated but classic way to store your kitchen and bar supplies. It can easily fit in your kitchen or dining room, reducing clutter while adding a simple elegance.\n31.5\"W x 15.8\"D x 39.4\"H\nPine and MDF with pine veneer\nThis cabinet offers storage for your kitchen, bar, or dining room, with interior shelving for ample storage space.\nThis bar cabinet sports a classic mid-century design that allows it to fit in any kitchen or dining room.\nAssemble in 15-30 minutes\nUsing a soft, damp cloth, wipe in the direction of the grain.\nFree returns for 30 days; 1-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This mid-century-style 2-door bar cabinet offers an understated but classic way to store your kitchen and bar supplies. It can easily fit in your kitchen or dining room, reducing clutter while adding a simple elegance.\", \"31.5\\\"W x 15.8\\\"D x 39.4\\\"H\", \"Pine and MDF with pine veneer\", \"This cabinet offers storage for your kitchen, bar, or dining room, with interior shelving for ample storage space.\", \"This bar cabinet sports a classic mid-century design that allows it to fit in any kitchen or dining room.\", \"Assemble in 15-30 minutes\", \"Using a soft, damp cloth, wipe in the direction of the grain.\", \"Free returns for 30 days; 1-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"hodedah\", \"de\", \"mid\", \"gabinetes\", \"long\", \"standing\", \"century\", \"para\", \"furniture\", \"wooden\", \"pantry\", \"microondas\", \"tall\", \"stand\", \"cabinets\", \"microwave\", \"muebles\", \"mueble\", \"cocina\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Kitchen & Dining Room Furniture/China Cabinets","created_at":"2023-10-13T06:00:15Z"}
