{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac526"},"product_id":4731,"item_id":"B08576LZKD","category_id":304,"name":"(Renewed) AmazonBasics Double Nylon Braided Apple Certified Lightning to USB Charge and Sync Tough Cable, 10 Feet (3 Meters) - Rose Gold","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Rose Gold","weight_lb":0.25,"price_cents":4599,"stock":14,"description":"This Certified Refurbished product is tested to work and look like new with minimal to no signs of wear & tear; the product comes with relevant accessories and is backed by a minimum six month supplier backed warranty; box may be generic\nApple MFi certified charging and syncing cable for your Apple devices\nCopper wire with added Kevlar to improve durability and strength; durable nylon fiber cloth provides protection, strength, and flexibility\nConnects to your iPhone, iPad, or iPod with Lightning Connector and charges/syncs by connecting the USB connector into your wall charger or computer; small connector head fits most cases\nApple MFi certification ensures complete charge and sync compatibility with iPhone X / 8 Plus / 8 / 7 Plus / 7 / 6s Plus / 6s / 6 Plus / 6 / 5s / 5c / 5 / iPad Pro / iPad Air / Air 2 / iPad mini / mini 2 / mini 4 / iPad 4th gen / iPod Touch 5th gen / iPod nano 7th gen and Beats Pill+","bullets":"[\"This Certified Refurbished product is tested to work and look like new with minimal to no signs of wear & tear; the product comes with relevant accessories and is backed by a minimum six month supplier backed warranty; box may be generic\", \"Apple MFi certified charging and syncing cable for your Apple devices\", \"Copper wire with added Kevlar to improve durability and strength; durable nylon fiber cloth provides protection, strength, and flexibility\", \"Connects to your iPhone, iPad, or iPod with Lightning Connector and charges/syncs by connecting the USB connector into your wall charger or computer; small connector head fits most cases\", \"Apple MFi certification ensures complete charge and sync compatibility with iPhone X / 8 Plus / 8 / 7 Plus / 7 / 6s Plus / 6s / 6 Plus / 6 / 5s / 5c / 5 / iPad Pro / iPad Air / Air 2 / iPad mini / mini 2 / mini 4 / iPad 4th gen / iPod Touch 5th gen / iPod nano 7th gen and Beats Pill+\"]","keywords":"[\"lightning cables\", \"lightning cable\", \"apple lightning cable\", \"apple lightning charging cables\", \"lightning cable for iphone\", \"iphone lightning cable\", \"apple certified lightning cable\", \"mfi certified iphone cable\", \"iphone cables apple certified\", \"usb to lightning cable\", \"amazon basics lightning cable\", \"short lightning cable\", \"mfi certified lightning cable\", \"mfi certified cable\", \"apple lightning cable original\", \"apple certified cable\", \"iphone 6 lightning cable\", \"ipad lightning cable\", \"nylon braided iphone cable\", \"lightning cable protector\"]","node_path":"Categories/Mobiles & Accessories/Mobile Accessories/Cables & Adapters","created_at":"2023-10-13T23:10:41Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac527"},"product_id":4732,"item_id":"B0857JQ3DY","category_id":83,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Modern Farmhouse Birch Dining Chair, 17.5\"W, Brown","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Natural","weight_lb":17.9,"price_cents":9299,"stock":4,"description":"This solid birch dining chair has a timeless, traditional look but is still comfortable enough for the most casual of get-togethers. Its brown color helps it match with different tables and types of rooms.\n17.5\"W x 21.5\"D x 39\"H\nSolid birch\nThe 100% birch construction makes this chair sturdy enough to last a lifetime but easy to sit in every day.\nThe birch and brown finish give this chair a classic, understated look that can be adapted to different purposes.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nUsing a soft, damp cloth, wipe in the direction of the grain.\nFree returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"This solid birch dining chair has a timeless, traditional look but is still comfortable enough for the most casual of get-togethers. Its brown color helps it match with different tables and types of rooms.\", \"17.5\\\"W x 21.5\\\"D x 39\\\"H\", \"Solid birch\", \"The 100% birch construction makes this chair sturdy enough to last a lifetime but easy to sit in every day.\", \"The birch and brown finish give this chair a classic, understated look that can be adapted to different purposes.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Using a soft, damp cloth, wipe in the direction of the grain.\", \"Free returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"farmhouse\", \"faux\", \"living\", \"and\", \"chairs\", \"armen\", \"leather\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Kitchen & Dining Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2023-05-06T05:12:21Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac528"},"product_id":4733,"item_id":"B0857JYVBP","category_id":94,"name":"Amazon Brand – Stone & Beam Beech Wishbone Counter-Height Barstool, 38.2\"H, Natural","brand":"Stone & Beam","color":"Natural","weight_lb":13.23,"price_cents":7299,"stock":70,"description":"The graceful curves of this natural-colored beech barstool mask its everyday durability. It's light, portable, and perfect for any place in the house where there's a countertop. The soft, comfortable woven paper-rope seat is 100% natural.\n22.4\"W x 22.8\"D x 38.2\"H\nBeech frame with a woven seat\nThe sturdy beech frame will stand the test of time, while the soft woven paper-rope seat is easy to sink into.\nSimple but fashionable, this natural-colored wishbone-style curved design adds sophistication to any counter area.\nNo assembly required\nUsing a soft, damp cloth, wipe in the direction of the grain.\nFree returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty.","bullets":"[\"The graceful curves of this natural-colored beech barstool mask its everyday durability. It's light, portable, and perfect for any place in the house where there's a countertop. The soft, comfortable woven paper-rope seat is 100% natural.\", \"22.4\\\"W x 22.8\\\"D x 38.2\\\"H\", \"Beech frame with a woven seat\", \"The sturdy beech frame will stand the test of time, while the soft woven paper-rope seat is easy to sink into.\", \"Simple but fashionable, this natural-colored wishbone-style curved design adds sophistication to any counter area.\", \"No assembly required\", \"Using a soft, damp cloth, wipe in the direction of the grain.\", \"Free returns for 30 days; 3-year warranty.\"]","keywords":"[\"farmhouse\", \"stool\", \"24\", \"auto\", \"set\", \"metal\", \"back\", \"tools\", \"inches\", \"2\", \"creepers\", \"low\", \"tractor\", \"inch\", \"stools\", \"kitchen\", \"automotive\", \"backs\", \"creeper\", \"height\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Game & Recreation Room Furniture/Home Bar Furniture/Barstools","created_at":"2023-05-21T21:23:59Z"}
