{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac532"},"product_id":4743,"item_id":"B0859RJ7SQ","category_id":320,"name":"AmazonBasics 5W-30 Type F Engine Oil 1 L","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"","weight_lb":1.88,"price_cents":1399,"stock":32,"description":"This 5w 30 oil is suitable for a wide range of petrol and diesel vehicles including some Ford vehicles as well as vehicles with injection, multi-valve and turbocharger engines. Recommended for applications with the following requirements: ACEA A5/B5. API SL CF and FORD WSS-M2C913-A, FORD WSS-M2C913-B, FORD WSS-M2C913-C.\nMaintains engine life, power and fuel efficiency and reduces engine wear\nSuitable for the latest vehicles, even during the warranty period, if the oil complies with the vehicle manufacturer's recommendations.\nAvailable in various sizes, suitable for filling or for complete oil changes.\nPlease check the manufacturer's manual to ensure that the oil is suitable before use.","bullets":"[\"This 5w 30 oil is suitable for a wide range of petrol and diesel vehicles including some Ford vehicles as well as vehicles with injection, multi-valve and turbocharger engines. Recommended for applications with the following requirements: ACEA A5/B5. API SL CF and FORD WSS-M2C913-A, FORD WSS-M2C913-B, FORD WSS-M2C913-C.\", \"Maintains engine life, power and fuel efficiency and reduces engine wear\", \"Suitable for the latest vehicles, even during the warranty period, if the oil complies with the vehicle manufacturer's recommendations.\", \"Available in various sizes, suitable for filling or for complete oil changes.\", \"Please check the manufacturer's manual to ensure that the oil is suitable before use.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-06-28T03:09:46Z"}
