{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac53f"},"product_id":4756,"item_id":"B085FJR48X","category_id":83,"name":"Ravenna Home Beaver Creek Upholstered Rocking Recliner Chair with Swivel, 40\"W, Cream","brand":"Ravenna Home","color":"Beige","weight_lb":130.0,"price_cents":7799,"stock":9,"description":"Overall: 30\"W x 40\"D x 41\"H; seat height 21\"; seat depth 22\"\nKiln-dried hardwood frame, mortise & tenson joints and heat-tempered steel seat and back springs add stability, support and resist sag. Fiber-wrapped foam cushions are upholstered in performance fabric.\nSteel rocker base provides multiple pitch options and the wooden cam system with high tension springs provides an even, smooth, quieter rock.\nAssemble in 15 minutes or less\nClean with a soft dry cloth, or water-based shampoo or foam upholstery cleaner as needed. Do not overwet.\nFree returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\nReclining mechanisms are designed to reduce noise and provide a smooth reclining function. The mechanisms are mounted to the frame with (4) 2\" bolts and locking t-nuts.","bullets":"[\"Overall: 30\\\"W x 40\\\"D x 41\\\"H; seat height 21\\\"; seat depth 22\\\"\", \"Kiln-dried hardwood frame, mortise & tenson joints and heat-tempered steel seat and back springs add stability, support and resist sag. Fiber-wrapped foam cushions are upholstered in performance fabric.\", \"Steel rocker base provides multiple pitch options and the wooden cam system with high tension springs provides an even, smooth, quieter rock.\", \"Assemble in 15 minutes or less\", \"Clean with a soft dry cloth, or water-based shampoo or foam upholstery cleaner as needed. Do not overwet.\", \"Free returns for 30 days. 1-year warranty.\", \"Reclining mechanisms are designed to reduce noise and provide a smooth reclining function. The mechanisms are mounted to the frame with (4) 2\\\" bolts and locking t-nuts.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2023-04-20T04:20:52Z"}
