rns for 30 days. 3-year warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"farmhouse\", \"small\", \"euro\", \"swivel\", \"motion\", \"ottoman\", \"black\", \"collection\", \"ekornes\", \"leather\", \"mac\", \"ottomans\", \"matching\", \"stressless\", \"oslo\", \"chairs\", \"recliners\"]","node_path":"Categories/Furniture/Living Room Furniture/Chairs","created_at":"2024-03-14T07:43:26Z"}
