{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac560"},"product_id":4789,"item_id":"B086BY4DVP","category_id":148,"name":"Eono by Amazon Makeup Brush Rack Dryer 28 Holes Makeup Brush Holder Black","brand":"Eono","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1499,"stock":22,"description":"The set contains: 1 tower dry make-up brush holder. Clean the makeup brush thoroughly and then keep it dry on the drying rack. This perfectly solves the problem of brush cleaning and effectively prolongs the life of the makeup brush.\nSave space and protect the brushes: it is important to dry the makeup brushes in the air after washing. Makeup brush rack with a total of 28 silicone holes in mixed size fits all makeup brushes, art brushes etc. It is more convenient to hold and protect the brushes, not to take up much space and make more professional makeup easier.\nStable and durable: brush stand with protective sticker (peel off before use), prolongs the life of your brushes.\n4, Various and functional use: Foldable and tiltable makeup brush dry rack is so easy to carry when you travel outside. After washing, the brushes point upwards while putting the brushes down during makeup. If you have a small number of brushes, it is more convenient to tip them.\n5, Attention: And we give you the 100% refund guarantee. Take care of your makeup brush. Buy with confidence and you will love it.","bullets":"[\"The set contains: 1 tower dry make-up brush holder. Clean the makeup brush thoroughly and then keep it dry on the drying rack. This perfectly solves the problem of brush cleaning and effectively prolongs the life of the makeup brush.\", \"Save space and protect the brushes: it is important to dry the makeup brushes in the air after washing. Makeup brush rack with a total of 28 silicone holes in mixed size fits all makeup brushes, art brushes etc. It is more convenient to hold and protect the brushes, not to take up much space and make more professional makeup easier.\", \"Stable and durable: brush stand with protective sticker (peel off before use), prolongs the life of your brushes.\", \"4, Various and functional use: Foldable and tiltable makeup brush dry rack is so easy to carry when you travel outside. After washing, the brushes point upwards while putting the brushes down during makeup. If you have a small number of brushes, it is more convenient to tip them.\", \"5, Attention: And we give you the 100% refund guarantee. Take care of your makeup brush. Buy with confidence and you will love it.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-02-19T03:51:46Z"}
