{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac56a"},"product_id":4799,"item_id":"B086N77TVM","category_id":138,"name":"Evansea Red Wine Cabernet Shiraz, Australia (0.75l)","brand":"Evansea","color":"","weight_lb":2.87,"price_cents":899,"stock":60,"description":"The Evansea Cabernet Shiraz has a rich ruby colour\nBursting with blackcurrant and wood on the nose and plum and tannins on the palate\nThe perfect partner for cheeses, beef or wild game dishes\nFrom the sun-drenched vineyards of South-Eastern Australia\nThis dry Cabernet Shiraz has an ABV of 13.0%","bullets":"[\"The Evansea Cabernet Shiraz has a rich ruby colour\", \"Bursting with blackcurrant and wood on the nose and plum and tannins on the palate\", \"The perfect partner for cheeses, beef or wild game dishes\", \"From the sun-drenched vineyards of South-Eastern Australia\", \"This dry Cabernet Shiraz has an ABV of 13.0%\"]","keywords":"[\"wine\", \"red wine\", \"cabernet shiraz\", \"dry red wine\", \"south east australia\", \"present for man\", \"present for woman\", \"present for women\", \"wine for men\", \"wine for women\"]","node_path":"Categories/Beer, Wine & Spirits/Wine/Red Wine","created_at":"2023-02-22T00:36:59Z"}
