{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac585"},"product_id":4826,"item_id":"B087721CRJ","category_id":346,"name":"UMI. Essentials 6\" Bathroom Shelf Wall Mounted 2 Pack Wall Shelves for Digital Devices Anodised Aluminium Silver BSC410S15DG-P2","brand":"UMI","color":"Silver","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1699,"stock":10,"description":"VERSATILE: This small wall shelf is equipped with multiple holders for mobile phones in which different digital devices can be placed, not just the mobile phone. The protruding edge not only protects the devices from falling, but also holds the tablet at a suitable angle. At the same time, the devices can be conveniently charged or connected via a central cable opening.\n2 installation methods: for one hand, the coat hook with the included drill-free strong adhesive, quick and easy, without drilling, without damaging the wall. The other part in installing the screws and dowels in the hardware package.\nRust-free: thanks to the anodised aluminium surface, this small wall shelf with a smooth and durable finish is suitable for a damp environment such as bathroom and kitchen. The screws are made of stainless steel and will not rust.\nStable construction: max. Load capacity 5 kg for both screw and adhesive mounting on the wall.\nPackage contents: 1 x wall shelf, 1 x accessory pack (with screws and adhesive; only the next to the adhesive strip provides extra grip), 1 x instruction manual (English language not guaranteed).","bullets":"[\"VERSATILE: This small wall shelf is equipped with multiple holders for mobile phones in which different digital devices can be placed, not just the mobile phone. The protruding edge not only protects the devices from falling, but also holds the tablet at a suitable angle. At the same time, the devices can be conveniently charged or connected via a central cable opening.\", \"2 installation methods: for one hand, the coat hook with the included drill-free strong adhesive, quick and easy, without drilling, without damaging the wall. The other part in installing the screws and dowels in the hardware package.\", \"Rust-free: thanks to the anodised aluminium surface, this small wall shelf with a smooth and durable finish is suitable for a damp environment such as bathroom and kitchen. The screws are made of stainless steel and will not rust.\", \"Stable construction: max. Load capacity 5 kg for both screw and adhesive mounting on the wall.\", \"Package contents: 1 x wall shelf, 1 x accessory pack (with screws and adhesive; only the next to the adhesive strip provides extra grip), 1 x instruction manual (English language not guaranteed).\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"Categories/Accessories","created_at":"2023-10-17T03:05:47Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac586"},"product_id":4827,"item_id":"B0879XRSV6","category_id":282,"name":"Amazonbasics 52-Tab Paper Binder Divider,Numbered, Multi-Color, 1 Set","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"White","weight_lb":1.01,"price_cents":1499,"stock":22,"description":"Easy organizing: keeps 3-ring binders neatly organized and presentable by conveniently separating pages and sections\n3-hole punched: pre-punched with 3 precisely placed holes for easily loading into a binder (not included)\nMulticolor tabs: the tabs come in an array of colors and allow for flipping to the desired section fast\nNumbered: the tabs are preprinted with numbers (1-52) for indexing\nSturdy: made of durable white paper stock for long-lasting strength","bullets":"[\"Easy organizing: keeps 3-ring binders neatly organized and presentable by conveniently separating pages and sections\", \"3-hole punched: pre-punched with 3 precisely placed holes for easily loading into a binder (not included)\", \"Multicolor tabs: the tabs come in an array of colors and allow for flipping to the desired section fast\", \"Numbered: the tabs are preprinted with numbers (1-52) for indexing\", \"Sturdy: made of durable white paper stock for long-lasting strength\"]","keywords":"[\"alphabetical\", \"3\", \"ring\", \"for\", \"page\", \"alphabet\", \"dividers\"]","node_path":"Categories/Office & School Supplies/Labels, Indexes & Stamps/Index Dividers/Binder Index Dividers","created_at":"2023-10-24T20:46:08Z"}
