{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac58a"},"product_id":4831,"item_id":"B087M92FLG","category_id":193,"name":"[Amazon Brand] Eono Smartphone Stand Holder, Adjustable Angle, Mobile Phone Desk Stand: Tabletop, Charging Stand, Smartphone Stand, iPhone Desk Stand, Aluminium, Switch Compatible, iPhone, Android, iPhone","brand":"Eono(イオーノ)","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":4499,"stock":5,"description":"Compatible models: Compatible with approximately 4-8 inches (iPhone XS Max XR X 8 7 7 plus 6 6s 6plus 5 5s 4, S3 S4 S5 S6 S7, Galaxy S7 S6, Note 6 5, LG, Sony). If you have a protective case, you can use it if the thickness is less than 14mm.\nOverwhelming quality than other manufacturers: Advantage 1: The width of the nail can be expanded, so you can load it with the normal cover on. Advantage 2: Reinforced to prevent the rotation axis from loosening and more durable. BENEFITS THREE: Comes with an extra seal. If the anti-slip seal is not in place, you can replace it yourself.\n(Can be used while charging) The ingenious design includes a hole for cable passing through so that you can charge your device while it is on it. The simple hole combines ease of use and beauty.\nAdjustable Angle, Anti-Slip: The adjustable angle can be adjusted up to 270° to meet the needs of each user. The non-slip rubber pads provide a stable and secure viewing angle, as well as protecting your device and preventing scratches.\n(Suitable for a variety of occasions) Suitable for kitchens, office desks, night tables, and dining tables. It is very convenient for you to check your email and message reception even while you work. It is also useful for leisure activities like watching animation, movies, e-books.","bullets":"[\"Compatible models: Compatible with approximately 4-8 inches (iPhone XS Max XR X 8 7 7 plus 6 6s 6plus 5 5s 4, S3 S4 S5 S6 S7, Galaxy S7 S6, Note 6 5, LG, Sony). If you have a protective case, you can use it if the thickness is less than 14mm.\", \"Overwhelming quality than o