{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac58c"},"product_id":4833,"item_id":"B087MDHQMB","category_id":23,"name":"AmazonBasics 36W Two-Port USB-C Wall Charger for Tablets and Phones with Power Delivery - Black","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Black","weight_lb":0.24,"price_cents":1399,"stock":19,"description":"Fast simultaneous charging: 36-watt combined USB power delivery (3.0) for high-speed charging of compatible devices, like the iPhone 11 Pro Max, iPad Pro, Samsung Galaxy 10, and more\nGaN technology: GaN components waste less power and produce less heat (compared to silicon), which translates to a more efficient charge\nCompact size: small but powerful thanks to innovative GaN technology; design includes a foldable plug for travel-friendly portability\nSafety features: integrated over-voltage, overheating, and short-circuit protection to keep connected devices safe\nLED indicator: when plugged into a power outlet, the charger’s blue LED indicator illuminates, which makes it easy to locate the charging port in the dark\nIncludes: 2-port GaN-tech USB-C wall charger, user manual, and AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty; note: charger does not support intelligent power allocation between the 2 USB-C ports; each port is fixed at 18 watts (5V/3A, 9V/2A, 12V/1.5A)","bullets":"[\"Fast simultaneous charging: 36-watt combined USB power delivery (3.0) for high-speed charging of compatible devices, like the iPhone 11 Pro Max, iPad Pro, Samsung Galaxy 10, and more\", \"GaN technology: GaN components waste less power and produce less heat (compared to silicon), which translates to a more efficient charge\", \"Compact size: small but powerful thanks to innovative GaN technology; design includes a foldable plug for travel-friendly portability\", \"Safety features: integrated over-voltage, overheating, and short-circuit protection to keep connected devices safe\", \"LED indicator: when plugged into a power outlet, the charger’s blue LED indicator illuminates, which makes it easy to locate the charging port in the dark\", \"Includes: 2-port GaN-tech USB-C wall charger, user manual, and AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty; note: charger does not support intelligent power allocation between the 2 USB-C ports; each port is fixed at 18 watts (5V/3A, 9V/2A, 12V/1.5A)\"]","keywords":"[\"pa\", \"tablet\", \"t10\", \"quick\", \"2.0\", \"aukey\", \"motorola\", \"zoom\", \"xoom\", \"qualcomm\"]","node_path":"Categories/Accessories/Chargers & Power Adapters/Wall Chargers","created_at":"2024-02-08T09:41:43Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac58d"},"product_id":4834,"item_id":"B087MKMPX1","category_id":56,"name":"AmazonBasics Wooden Birch Cajon Percussion Box with Internal Guitar Strings - Black","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Black","weight_lb":5.1,"price_cents":3899,"stock":46,"description":"Hand-crafted, traditional panel frame Cajon percussion box made with solid birch wood; black finish\nDelivers rich, resonant sound for acoustic performances, jam sessions, songwriters’ circles, practice, and more\n4 guitar strings anchored inside that can be adjusted for tone and tension with the included tuning screw\nRubber capped feet for dampening outside vibration interference and promoting clear, deep percussion\nCompact, lightweight design is easy to transport and move for gigs or personal use\nIncludes an AmazonBasics 1-Year Limited Warranty","bullets":"[\"Hand-crafted, traditional panel frame Cajon percussion box made with solid birch wood; black finish\", \"Delivers rich, resonant sound for acoustic performances, jam sessions, songwriters’ circles, practice, and more\", \"4 guitar strings anchored inside that can be adjusted for tone and tension with the included tuning screw\", \"Rubber capped feet for dampening outside vibration interference and promoting clear, deep percussion\", \"Compact, lightweight design is easy to transport and move for gigs or personal use\", \"Includes an AmazonBasics 1-Year Limited Warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"meinl\", \"bass\", \"snare\", \"tube\", \"sela\", \"kickport\", \"cajonport\", \"accessories\", \"schlagwerk\", \"drum\", \"cahone\"]","node_path":"Products/Drums & Percussion/Hand Percussion/Folk & World/Cajons","created_at":"2024-04-10T06:35:25Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac58e"},"product_id":4835,"item_id":"B087MSVM7S","category_id":260,"name":"AmazonCommercial Stainless Steel Fine Mesh Frying Pan Splatter Screen, 11.5 Inch","brand":"AmazonCommercial","color":"Stainless Steel","weight_lb":0.43,"price_cents":1899,"stock":34,"description":"Mesh screen: made of premium-quality 18/8 stainless-steel fine mesh (65%) for long-lasting, rust-resistant performance\nSturdy frame and handle: made of 18/0 stainless steel (35%), the frame and handle provide strength and a secure, comfortable hold\nEveryday convenience: keeps bubbling hot oils, simmering sauces, boiling liquids, and more safely contained inside a pot or pan; prevents messy splatters and allows steam to escape; can also be used for draining\nVersatile: measures 11-1/2 inches in diameter, allowing it to accommodate a variety of pots and pans\nEasy care and warranty: dishwasher-safe for quick cleanup; backed by an AmazonCommercial 1-year limited warranty","bullets":"[\"Mesh screen: made of premium-quality 18/8 stainless-steel fine mesh (65%) for long-lasting, rust-resistant performance\", \"Sturdy frame and handle: made of 18/0 stainless steel (35%), the frame and handle provide strength and a secure, comfortable hold\", \"Everyday convenience: keeps bubbling hot oils, simmering sauces, boiling liquids, and more safely contained inside a pot or pan; prevents messy splatters and allows steam to escape; can also be used for draining\", \"Versatile: measures 11-1/2 inches in diameter, allowing it to accommodate a variety of pots and pans\", \"Easy care and warranty: dishwasher-safe for quick cleanup; backed by an AmazonCommercial 1-year limited warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"grease\", \"shield\", \"silicone\", \"set\", \"guard\", \"spin\", \"spatter\", \"screen\", \"spinout\", \"fry\", \"out\"]","node_path":"Categories/Kitchen & Dining/Kitchen Utensils & Gadgets/Specialty Tools & Gadgets/Splatter Screens","created_at":"2024-02-18T12:28:28Z"}
