{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac595"},"product_id":4842,"item_id":"B087TZ41LL","category_id":222,"name":"Umi by Amazon Towel Rail Self Adhesive Bathroom Single Towel Holder Bar 16-Inch 40CM 304 Stainless Steel Square Base Brushed, A7000S40-2","brand":"UMI","color":"Brushed Steel","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1399,"stock":51,"description":"SELF-ADHESIVE STRIP: Quick and easy mounting. Strong adhesiveness and waterproof. No drill holes needed. Remove easily and no trace left behind. Max load: 5 KG.\nRUSTPROOF: Constructed of Type 304 premium grade stainless steel, protecting against corrosion & rust and need trivial maintenance. Suitable for the humid environment such as bathroom and kitchen.\nSPACE SAVING: The usable length for this towel bar is 14.8 inches, perfect for holding 1 extra large bath towel and 2 hand towels.\nBRUSHED FINISH: Hand brushed stainless steel finish (enviroment-friendly process, no chemicals involved), build to resist daily scratches, corrosions, and tarnishing.\nNOTE: Drill-free installation is suitable for flat and smooth surfaces without dust or water, such as tile, glass, and metal. DO NOT apply this product on fabrics nor wallpaper as it may damage to these surfaces. Please wait for 48 hours before use.","bullets":"[\"SELF-ADHESIVE STRIP: Quick and easy mounting. Strong adhesiveness and waterproof. No drill holes needed. Remove easily and no trace left behind. Max load: 5 KG.\", \"RUSTPROOF: Constructed of Type 304 premium grade stainless steel, protecting against corrosion & rust and need trivial maintenance. Suitable for the humid environment such as bathroom and kitchen.\", \"SPACE SAVING: The usable length for this towel bar is 14.8 inches, perfect for holding 1 extra large bath towel and 2 hand towels.\", \"BRUSHED FINISH: Hand brushed stainless steel finish (enviroment-friendly process, no chemicals involved), build to resist daily scratches, corrosions, and tarnishing.\", \"NOTE: Drill-free installation is suitable for flat and smooth surfaces without dust or water, such as tile, glass, and metal. DO NOT apply this product on fabrics nor wallpaper as it may damage to these surfaces. Please wait for 48 hours before use.\"]","keywords":"[\"wall mounted hand tea rails small kitchen holders towels rack chrome clothes hanger silver racks cloths glass accessories suction kitchens wooden hooks paper toilet roll grey door ring over stick rod rolls butchers double shower set\"]","node_path":"Products/Hardware/Bathroom Hardware/Towel Rails","created_at":"2024-05-26T00:08:02Z"}
