{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac59e"},"product_id":4851,"item_id":"B0886BQTVF","category_id":193,"name":"Eono Monthly Rewritable Planner Monthly Magnetic Whiteboard for Fridge Magnetic Dry Erase Board Menu Planner 42.8 x 34 cm","brand":"Eono","color":"White","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1499,"stock":126,"description":"You will feel pressure and anxiety without planning. Our magnetic weekly planner will help you stay organised at a time you are busy. It can help you plan your monthly meals, shopping lists, notes and appointments.\nAfter a few days, no longer worry about rolling up the whiteboard for the fridge. The magnetic back plate is very effective, can be attached well and can also be easily stuck to the fridge.\nThe smooth surface is easy to write. You can easily wipe them off at the end of each month to reuse them repeatedly.\nOrganised with a magnetic whiteboard of 42.8 x 34 cm every month, made of durable and durable materials, of high quality, you will enjoy your daily plan.\nUse colourful marker pens to write down your plan or thoughts, and make your room more fantastic with your imaginative design.","bullets":"[\"You will feel pressure and anxiety without planning. Our magnetic weekly planner will help you stay organised at a time you are busy. It can help you plan your monthly meals, shopping lists, notes and appointments.\", \"After a few days, no longer worry about rolling up the whiteboard for the fridge. The magnetic back plate is very effective, can be attached well and can also be easily stuck to the fridge.\", \"The smooth surface is easy to write. You can easily wipe them off at the end of each month to reuse them repeatedly.\", \"Organised with a magnetic whiteboard of 42.8 x 34 cm every month, made of durable and durable materials, of high quality, you will enjoy your daily plan.\", \"Use colourful marker pens to write down your plan or thoughts, and make your room more fantastic with your imaginative design.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"","created_at":"2023-01-10T17:08:22Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac59f"},"product_id":4852,"item_id":"B0886KTW8H","category_id":83,"name":"AmazonBasics Classic Linen Fabric Guest Chair with Metal Frame - Charcoal Grey","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Grey","weight_lb":22.0,"price_cents":4899,"stock":76,"description":"Contemporary style with classic linen upholstery: linen fabric upholstery (Charcoal Grey) on the padded arms, back, and seat; offers a welcoming place to sit; ideal for home or office\nUltimate comfort: waterfall seat edge helps reduce pressure on the legs to promote healthy blood flow; armrests provide added support\nDurable metal frame: sturdy metal frame stands up to heavy use and provides reliable strength; 275lbs weight capacity\nFloor protection: plastic floor glides promote smooth sliding when moving the chair, which helps keep floors safe from scuffs and scratches\nEasy assembly and warranty: quick and easy to assemble (all hardware included); BIFMA certified; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty","bullets":"[\"Contemporary style with classic linen upholstery: linen fabric upholstery (Charcoal Grey) on the padded arms, back, and seat; offers a welcoming place to sit; ideal for home or office\", \"Ultimate comfort: waterfall seat edge helps reduce pressure on the legs to promote healthy blood flow; armrests provide added support\", \"Durable metal frame: sturdy metal frame stands up to heavy use and provides reliable strength; 275lbs weight capacity\", \"Floor protection: plastic floor glides promote smooth sliding when moving the chair, which helps keep floors safe from scuffs and scratches\", \"Easy assembly and warranty: quick and easy to assemble (all hardware included); BIFMA certified; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"Homeware & Furniture/Furniture/Home Office Furniture/Chairs & Stools","created_at":"2024-04-23T06:30:54Z"}
