ovide a replacement solution (limited to product defects due to normal use). If you have any doubts about the product, please feel free to contact us at any time.","bullets":"[\"Innovative Design: Unlike conventional umbrellas, this long umbrella opens and closes invertently. The wet exterior sits inside so you can get rid of all those annoying vehicles that get wet on the floor, clothing, or people around you. The special upside down folding allows you to set it up when there is no place to hang it. Very convenient.\", \"(Double layer fabric) Uses double layer fabric. The outer fabric is highly water repellent and has a UV coating. Double layer construction provides double UV protection. The inner fabric also blocks out light and heat. The surface of the umbrella is shaped like a lotus leave, so the rain water will not stay on top of the umbrella. Inner fabric is perforated and laser processed. The wind can escape through these holes, so you can use it safely even in storms. The color of the double fabric inside umbrella is different, there are various patterns on the inside. Fashionable and beautiful\", \"Windproof Ribs: The umbrella ribs are made of carbon fiber. The high strength umbrella ribs are hard to break, so you can use it safely even in strong winds. Never worry about rusting. Safe button operated manual opening and closing will not hurt your hands.\", \"C-Shaped Handle: The unique C-shaped handle allows you to release both hands when you hang it on your wrist, and you can use both hands while holding a long umbrella. It is very convenient for you to operate your smartphone, carry your luggage and carry your children.\", \"(100% Customer Satisfaction) If the product is unavailable during this period such as initial defects or natural failure while in use, we will provide a replacement solution (limited to product defects due to normal use). If you have any doubts about the product, please feel free to contact us at any time.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_pat