{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac5cc"},"product_id":4897,"item_id":"B08B59F2LL","category_id":193,"name":"Amazon Brand – Rivet Metallic Palm Tree Silhouette Black on Gold in Black Frame Wall Art, 22\" x 18\" (Renewed)","brand":"Rivet","color":"Black","weight_lb":"","price_cents":3199,"stock":5,"description":"Palm trees are silhouetted against a gold background in this modern piece with a touch of glam. It arrives matted and housed in a handsome black frame, ideal for adding an eclectic twist to an otherwise neutral room.\nSophisticated, contemporary treatment of nature\nPrinted on paper, behind glass in black frame; arrives ready to hang\n22\" x 18\"\nMade to order","bullets":"[\"Palm trees are silhouetted against a gold background in this modern piece with a touch of glam. It arrives matted and housed in a handsome black frame, ideal for adding an eclectic twist to an otherwise neutral room.\", \"Sophisticated, contemporary treatment of nature\", \"Printed on paper, behind glass in black frame; arrives ready to hang\", \"22\\\" x 18\\\"\", \"Made to order\"]","keywords":"[\"framed-prints\", \"wall art\", \"wall decor\", \"canvas wall art\", \"wall art for living room\", \"bathroom decor\", \"posters\", \"framed wall art\", \"wall decorations for living room\", \"living room decor\", \"cuadros de pared de sala\", \"rivet\", \"mid century\", \"modern\", \"black\", \"multi\", \"22\\\"x18\\\"\"]","node_path":"Categories/Home Décor/Photo Albums, Frames & Accessories/Picture Frames/Wall & Tabletop Frames","created_at":"2023-03-21T14:47:56Z"}
