{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac5ce"},"product_id":4899,"item_id":"B08B7W9RHM","category_id":295,"name":"UMI. Essential 43cm Lightweight Reflective Dog Raincoat with Hood & Harness Hole, Yellow, Outdoor Rain Gear Jacket 2 Legs for Dogs","brand":"UMI","color":"Yellow","weight_lb":0.22,"price_cents":2199,"stock":107,"description":"Size 43cm: Chest Girth 60cm- 66cm, Neck 45cm- 50cm, Back Length 43cm. (In order to cover the entire back of the dog, the back length of raincoat is lengthened to 43cm.) Measure your dog from the base of the neck to the base of the tail for back length\nMade with water-proof polyester that offers protection during rainy days for your pets. Our raincoat is constructed with durable water proof fabric. Please be aware that any water repellent material will wear out in case of extensive usage. In extreme weather such as rain storm, or pouring rain, water would normally seem through after time and your pets might get wet\nThere is a leash hole on the back. Reflective stripes on the back, hood and hem areas are to ensure safety and visibility during night. This raincoat features adhesive sticky tapes underneath dogs' belly for a perfect fit. Also, with the handy drawstrings on the neck and hem areas, it is fully adjustable and flattering!\nWipe clean or spot clean Only. Pet owner supervision is suggested.","bullets":"[\"Size 43cm: Chest Girth 60cm- 66cm, Neck 45cm- 50cm, Back Length 43cm. (In order to cover the entire back of the dog, the back length of raincoat is lengthened to 43cm.) Measure your dog from the base of the neck to the base of the tail for back length\", \"Made with water-proof polyester that offers protection during rainy days for your pets. Our raincoat is constructed with durable water proof fabric. Please be aware that any water repellent material will wear out in case of extensive usage. In extreme weather such as rain storm, or pouring rain, water would normally seem through after time and your pets might get wet\", \"There is a leash hole on the back. Reflective stripes on the back, hood and hem areas are to ensure safety and visibility during night. This raincoat features adhesive sticky tapes underneath dogs' belly for a perfect fit. Also, with the handy drawstrings on the neck and hem areas, it is fully adjustable and flattering!\", \"Wipe clean or spot clean Only. Pet owner supervision is suggested.\"]","keywords":"[\"xs s m l xl big tee tshirt tank vest jacket clothes coat outfit pjs jumper onesie sweatershirt hoodie apparel girl boy male female puppy cat kitten toy collar leash harness bed costume xmas holiday fit warm fashion camo dress\"]","node_path":"Categories/Dogs/Clothing & Accessories/Raincoats","created_at":"2023-07-01T04:28:12Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac5cf"},"product_id":4900,"item_id":"B08B9MDZYP","category_id":16,"name":"AmazonBasics AA Rechargeable Batteries 2000mAh (24-Pack) Pre-charged (Renewed)","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"","weight_lb":1.17,"price_cents":1699,"stock":37,"description":"One 24-pack of pre-charged AA rechargeable batteries (2000 mAh), ideal for digital cameras, remote controls, toys, and more\nLong battery life; extremely gradual self-discharge; maintains 80% capacity for 24 months\nComes pre-charged and ready to use; can be recharged 1000 times with minimal power loss\nShips in Certified Frustration-Free Packaging; recyclable; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty\nThe batteries can be recycled when they no longer hold a charge; to find a recycling location near you, simply copy/paste this link into your browser: call2recycle.org/locator/","bullets":"[\"One 24-pack of pre-charged AA rechargeable batteries (2000 mAh), ideal for digital cameras, remote controls, toys, and more\", \"Long battery life; extremely gradual self-discharge; maintains 80% capacity for 24 months\", \"Comes pre-charged and ready to use; can be recharged 1000 times with minimal power loss\", \"Ships in Certified Frustration-Free Packaging; recyclable; backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty\", \"The batteries can be recycled when they no longer hold a charge; to find a recycling location near you, simply copy/paste this link into your browser: call2recycle.org/locator/\"]","keywords":"[\"aaa\", \"electronics\", \"basics\", \"24\", \"guns\", \"ansmann\", \"advanced\", \"emergency\", \"range\", \"eveready\", \"operated\", \"candles\", \"battery\", \"remote\", \"long\", \"radio\", \"lithium\", \"airsoft\", \"fan\", \"2aa\"]","node_path":"Products/Household Supplies/Household Batteries/AA","created_at":"2024-03-26T06:13:22Z"}
