{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac5db"},"product_id":4912,"item_id":"B08BVLRHG8","category_id":265,"name":"Amazon Brand - Solimo Tri-ply Stainless Steel Induction Base Sauce Pot with Steel lid (20cm, 3.1L)","brand":"Amazon Brand - Solimo","color":"Stainless Steel","weight_lb":1.65,"price_cents":2099,"stock":32,"description":"Made from high quality triply stainless steel that is 100% food grade and long lasting\nTri-ply cookwares are specially designed with an aluminum core surrounded by a layer of 304 stainless steel on one side and 430 magnetic stainless steel on the other. The result is a long-lasting kitchen staple both beautiful by design and perfect for the professional chef or home cook\nMiddle layer of aluminium sheet that offers even heat distribution and short cooking time due to its ability to conduct heat better than steel\nInner body is food grade SS 304 grade steel which needs minimal oil facilitating healthy cooking\nOuter layer is SS 430 grade steel for induction compatibility and effective heat retention\nSS 430 grade steel lid for effective heat retention, fast cooking and shinier look\nIdeal for cooking stews, soups and pastas, as well as simmering, boiling and reducing sauces\nScratch and corrosion resistant\nCompatible with gas stove and induction cooktops\nEasy to clean; odour and stain resistant, and dishwasher friendly","bullets":"[\"Made from high quality triply stainless steel that is 100% food grade and long lasting\", \"Tri-ply cookwares are specially designed with an aluminum core surrounded by a layer of 304 stainless steel on one side and 430 magnetic stainless steel on the other. The result is a long-lasting kitchen staple both beautiful by design and perfect for the professional chef or home cook\", \"Middle layer of aluminium sheet that offers even heat distribution and short cooking time due to its ability to conduct heat better than steel\", \"Inner body is food grade SS 304 grade steel which needs minimal oil facilitating healthy cooking\", \"Outer layer is SS 430 grade steel for induction compatibility and effective heat retention\", \"SS 430 grade steel lid for effective heat retention, fast cooking and shinier look\", \"Ideal for cooking stews, soups and pastas, as well as simmering, boiling and reducing sauces\", \"Scratch and corrosion resistant\", \"Compatible with gas stove and induction cooktops\", \"Easy to clean; odour and stain resistant, and dishwasher friendly\"]","keywords":"[\"triply cookware\", \"solimo cookware\", \"triply sauce pot\", \"kitchen utensils\", \"saucepan\", \"sauce pan for tea\", \"milk pan\", \"pans\", \"milk utensil\", \"sauce pot\", \"saucepot\"]","node_path":"Categories/Kitchen & Dining/Cookware/Pots & Pans/Sauce Pots & Handis","created_at":"2024-02-16T08:02:56Z"}
