{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac5ec"},"product_id":4929,"item_id":"B08CS6X36V","category_id":29,"name":"AmazonBasics High-Speed 4 Port USB 3.0 Hub with AC Adapter for use with Macbook, Mac Pro, iMac, Surface Pro and more (Renewed)","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Black","weight_lb":0.4,"price_cents":3599,"stock":82,"description":"Includes 4 USB 3.0 output ports for connecting multiple peripherals simultaneously to PCs and laptops\nSupport USB 3.0 5Gbps high-speed transmission and is backwards compatible with USB 2.0 (480Mbps). In order to benefit from USB 3.0 high-speed charging all devices/cables connected must support USB 3.0 specifications.\nAll 4 USB 3.0 ports provide a 900mA output each. Please use the DC Adapter (included) when connecting high-current devices and ensure total consumption across all connected devices does not exceed 2A.\nCompatible with all major operating systems including Windows Vista, Windows XP, Windows Me, Windows 2000, Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 10, and Mac OS X v10.8-10.12.5.\nSlim case takes up minimal desk space and is easy to travel with\nIncludes a 5V/2A DC Power Adapter (10W) and USB 3.0 Micro-B to USB-A data cable. Backed by an AmazonBasics 1-Year Standard Limited Warranty","bullets":"[\"Includes 4 USB 3.0 output ports for connecting multiple peripherals simultaneously to PCs and laptops\", \"Support USB 3.0 5Gbps high-speed transmission and is backwards compatible with USB 2.0 (480Mbps). In order to benefit from USB 3.0 high-speed charging all devices/cables connected must support USB 3.0 specifications.\", \"All 4 USB 3.0 ports provide a 900mA output each. Please use the DC Adapter (included) when connecting high-current devices and ensure total consumption across all connected devices does not exceed 2A.\", \"Compatible with all major operating systems including Windows Vista, Windows XP, Windows Me, Windows 2000, Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 10, and Mac OS X v10.8-10.12.5.\", \"Slim case takes up minimal desk space and is easy to travel with\", \"Includes a 5V/2A DC Power Adapter (10W) and USB 3.0 Micro-B to USB-A data cable. Backed by an AmazonBasics 1-Year Standard Limited Warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"thunderbolt\", \"latitude\", \"dongle\", \"apple\", \"computer\", \"startech\", \"macbook\", \"power\", \"dongel\", \"lightning\", \"digital\", \"delivery\", \"c\", \"adapter\", \"adapters\", \"multiport\", \"accessories\", \"hb30c4afpd\", \"hdmi\", \"usbc\"]","node_path":"Categories/Computers & Accessories/Networking Products/Hubs","created_at":"2024-05-30T05:33:19Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac5ed"},"product_id":4930,"item_id":"B08CXBJ7QN","category_id":314,"name":"Eono by Amazon - Grip Socks Non Slip Casual Socks Yoga Socks Ideal for Gym Home Indoor Yoga - for Men and Women 2 Pairs (Black+Grey, L)","brand":"Eono","color":"Black+Grey","weight_lb":"","price_cents":2899,"stock":8,"description":"80% Cotton, 17% Polyester, 3% Elastane\nCOMFY HOUSE SOCKS: Fit both women and men. Perfect for wearing on slippery surfaces such as hardwood floors or tile, and provide luxurious comfort without sacrificing performance\nDON’T LOSE YOUR GRIP: Extra strong, non-skid sticky grip pattern covers the full heel and toe for maximum grip and traction. It provides stability and safety for everyday use at home, as well as enhanced performance for exercise such as yoga, pilates, or barre\nSTAY CLEAN AND COVERED: Protect your skin from dirt and blisters with our closed-toe fully-covered design, keeping the entire surface area of your feet free from germ exposure. We’ve lined the soles with luxury cotton blend four-yarn terry loops to create a supremely soft and supportive sock that keeps your feet comfortable on hard or cold surfaces\nEXPERIENCE SUPERIOR FIT: Take your sock basics to the next level. Thick and flexible fibers provide a perfect balance of support, cushion, and mobility, and padded tabs above the heel let you put your socks on quickly","bullets":"[\"80% Cotton, 17% Polyester, 3% Elastane\", \"COMFY HOUSE SOCKS: Fit both women and men. Perfect for wearing on slippery surfaces such as hardwood floors or tile, and provide luxurious comfort without sacrificing performance\", \"DON’T LOSE YOUR GRIP: Extra strong, non-skid sticky grip pattern covers the full heel and toe for maximum grip and traction. It provides stability and safety for everyday use at home, as well as enhanced performance for exercise such as yoga, pilates, or barre\", \"STAY CLEAN AND COVERED: Protect your skin from dirt and blisters with our closed-toe fully-covered design, keeping the entire surface area of your feet free from germ exposure. We’ve lined the soles with luxury cotton blend four-yarn terry loops to create a supremely soft and supportive sock that keeps your feet comfortable on hard or cold surfaces\", \"EXPERIENCE SUPERIOR FIT: Take your sock basics to the next level. Thick and flexible fibers provide a perfect balance of support, cushion, and mobility, and padded tabs above the heel let you put your socks on quickly\"]","keywords":"[\"grip socks yoga socks anti slip gym home casual socks\"]","node_path":"Categories/Fitness/Yoga/Clothing/Women/Socks","created_at":"2023-04-12T07:23:43Z"}
