{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac5f2"},"product_id":4935,"item_id":"B08DKDN4KG","category_id":193,"name":"Umi. Dewalt Jigsaw Blade, Jigsaw Blade, Tip, Tool Set, 20 Pieces, For Carpentry, Ironwork, Stainless Steel, For Cutting Hitachi, Bosch Makita, Black and Decker","brand":"Umi.(ウミ)","color":"","weight_lb":0.29,"price_cents":2999,"stock":3,"description":"(Set Contents) This is a super value 20-piece jigsaw blade. T-119BO*4 pieces (12TPI), T119B x 4 pieces (12TPI), T111C x 4 pieces (8TPI), T218A (21TPI) x 2 pieces T118G x 2 pieces (23TPI), T118A (21TPI) x 2 pieces *1\nMaterial: The blade is made from superior materials such as high carbon steel and high speed steel, giving it high quality and durability.\nT-Shank: The T-shaped handle of the blade has been designed with 5 contact points for maximum fixation and no need to fasten screws to the mounting hole. Compatible with: Hitachi, Bosh, Makita, Black and Decker, Dewalt.\nUses: A basic set that can be used for a wide range of purposes, including hobbies and carpentry projects. The cutting capacity varies depending on the jigsaw.\n[Case Included] Comes with a storage case for easy storage, organization, and transport.","bullets":"[\"(Set Contents) This is a super value 20-piece jigsaw blade. T-119BO*4 pieces (12TPI), T119B x 4 pieces (12TPI), T111C x 4 pieces (8TPI), T218A (21TPI) x 2 pieces T118G x 2 pieces (23TPI), T118A (21TPI) x 2 pieces *1\", \"Material: The blade is made from superior materials such as high carbon steel and high speed steel, giving it high quality and durability.\", \"T-Shank: The T-shaped handle of the blade has been designed with 5 contact points for maximum fixation and no need to fasten screws to the mounting hole. Compatible with: Hitachi, Bosh, Makita, Black and Decker, Dewalt.\", \"Uses: A basic set that can be used for a wide range of purposes, including hobbies and carpentry projects. The cutting capacity varies depending on the jigsaw.\", \"[Case Included] Comes with a storage case for easy storage, organization, and transport.\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"","created_at":"2024-04-25T05:05:35Z"}
