{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac62b"},"product_id":4992,"item_id":"B08H5Q7GDC","category_id":34,"name":"AmazonBasics Performance Range 13-32\" Triple Arms Full Motion TV Wall Mount (Renewed)","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Black","weight_lb":4.77,"price_cents":2499,"stock":38,"description":"From the stunning Performance range, comes this 13 – 32-inch full motion TV mount for all types and sizes of Plasma, LCD or LED televisions\nWith triple arms which not only add support, but they allow for full motion, making it great for corners and easily folds back flat to the wall when not in use\nWith an in-built spirit level for accurate installation, it has an easy slide-on installation as well as a tool-free safety locking feature, so you can trust it to support your TV to a maximum weight of 25 kg (55 lbs)\nThe Performance TV mount has cushioned pads for TV protection and for improved audio performance and comes with a five-year warranty\nAll the brackets conform to the VESA standards which require an industry wide hole pattern on the back of the TV or monitor for mounting purposes – the VESA hole pattern for this mount is 200 x 100 mm","bullets":"[\"From the stunning Performance range, comes this 13 – 32-inch full motion TV mount for all types and sizes of Plasma, LCD or LED televisions\", \"With triple arms which not only add support, but they allow for full motion, making it great for corners and easily folds back flat to the wall when not in use\", \"With an in-built spirit level for accurate installation, it has an easy slide-on installation as well as a tool-free safety locking feature, so you can trust it to support your TV to a maximum weight of 25 kg (55 lbs)\", \"The Performance TV mount has cushioned pads for TV protection and for improved audio performance and comes with a five-year warranty\", \"All the brackets conform to the VESA standards which require an industry wide hole pattern on the back of the TV or monitor for mounting purposes – the VESA hole pattern for this mount is 200 x 100 mm\"]","keywords":"[\"44\", \"55\\\"\", \"ml531be\", \"swivel\", \"cubicle\", \"screen\", \"cheetah\", \"tilt\", \"remote\", \"smart\", \"stands\", \"spring\", \"tripod\", \"horizontal\", \"aptmsb\", \"devialet\", \"samsung\", \"roku\", \"corner\", \"para\"]","node_path":"Categories/Television & Video/Television Accessories/TV Mounts, Stands & Turntables/TV Ceiling & Wall Mounts","created_at":"2024-05-19T20:04:08Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac62c"},"product_id":4993,"item_id":"B08H9JRF1M","category_id":71,"name":"Amazon Essentials Spano Women's Casual Thong with Ankle Strap Sandal, Women's Sandal","brand":"Amazon Essentials","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":2899,"stock":6,"description":"Featuring a comfortable insole crafted from 5mm of latex padding, these casual sandals were designed for daily wear and superior fit\nFaux leather dip-dye upper with natural burnishing\nAdjustable buckle closure with five fit settings and hidden elastic on back strap for a flexible fit\nEveryday made better: we listen to customer feedback and fine-tune every detail to ensure quality, fit, and comfort","bullets":"[\"Featuring a comfortable insole crafted from 5mm of latex padding, these casual sandals were designed for daily wear and superior fit\", \"Faux leather dip-dye upper with natural burnishing\", \"Adjustable buckle closure with five fit settings and hidden elastic on back strap for a flexible fit\", \"Everyday made better: we listen to customer feedback and fine-tune every detail to ensure quality, fit, and comfort\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"Categories/Shoes/Women's Shoes/Sandals & Slides/Fashion Sandals","created_at":"2023-06-29T15:44:45Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac62d"},"product_id":4994,"item_id":"B08HCLVJDG","category_id":36,"name":"AmazonBasics Wireless Keyboard with Touchpad for Smart TV - US Layout (QWERTY) (Renewed)","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Black","weight_lb":"","price_cents":2599,"stock":54,"description":"All-in-one wireless (non-bluetooth) keyboard with touchpad for easily navigating your smart TV-connected PC\nSlim design works well in the living room; 10-meter (33-foot) wireless range promotes a reliable connection even in larger rooms\nKeyboard with familiar US layout (QWERTY) and handy media keys; large integrated touchpad—use 2 fingers to scroll up/down or left/right and pinch out to zoom in or pinch in to zoom out\nPlug-and-play design with USB receiver for simple set-up; compatible with Windows 7, 8, 10; Chrome OS; Mac OS; and Smart TVs that support HID technology. Note that the provided connector is USB-A, if your device only supports USB-C an additional adapter will be required.\nBacked by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty\nIMPORTANT - This keyboard is compatible with most computer and basic keyboard functionality works with USB HID compliant Smart TVs, but some special function keys are not compatible for every brand of Smart TV due to customization OS","bullets":"[\"All-in-one wireless (non-bluetooth) keyboard with touchpad for easily navigating your smart TV-connected PC\", \"Slim design works well in the living room; 10-meter (33-foot) wireless range promotes a reliable connection even in larger rooms\", \"Keyboard with familiar US layout (QWERTY) and handy media keys; large integrated touchpad—use 2 fingers to scroll up/down or left/right and pinch out to zoom in or pinch in to zoom out\", \"Plug-and-play design with USB receiver for simple set-up; compatible with Windows 7, 8, 10; Chrome OS; Mac OS; and Smart TVs that support HID technology. Note that the provided connector is USB-A, if your device only supports USB-C an additional adapter will be required.\", \"Backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty\", \"IMPORTANT - This keyboard is compatible with most computer and basic keyboard functionality works with USB HID compliant Smart TVs, but some special function keys are not compatible for every brand of Smart TV due to customization OS\"]","keywords":"[]","node_path":"Categories/Computers & Accessories/Computer Accessories & Peripherals/Keyboards, Mice & Accessories/Keyboards","created_at":"2023-07-08T19:22:06Z"}
{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac62e"},"product_id":4995,"item_id":"B08HCWCVQ3","category_id":24,"name":"AmazonBasics Wireless Computer Keyboard and Mouse Combo - Full Size - US Layout (QWERTY) (Renewed)","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"Black","weight_lb":"","price_cents":2099,"stock":40,"description":"Full-size keyboard and mouse combo for home or office; keyboard with US layout (QWERTY), 20 shortcut keys, and a handy numeric keypad\nComfortably contoured wireless mouse with textured rubber grips, forward/back thumb buttons, and fast-scrolling wheel for smooth, speedy navigating through large documents and web pages\n2.4 GHz (non-bluetooth) wireless connection; both use 128-bit AES encryption for added security; each connects via a small USB receiver that can stay plugged into your computer without obstructing other ports\nPlug and play (no drivers needed); each run on 2 AAA batteries (included); compatible with Windows 7, 8, and 10\nKeyboard measures 18.3 by 7.3 by 0.8 inches; mouse measures 4 by 2.6 by 1.5 inches; backed by an AmazonBasics limited 1-year warranty","bullets":"[\"Full-size keyboard and mouse combo for home or office; keyboard with US layout (QWERTY), 20 shortcut keys, and a handy numeric keypad\", \"Comfortably contoured wireless mouse with textured rubber grips, forward/back thumb buttons, and fast-scrolling wheel for smooth, speedy navigating through large documents and web pages\", \"2.4 GHz (non-bluetooth) wireless connection; both use 128-bit AES encryption for added security; each connects via a small USB receiver that can stay plugged into your computer without obstructing other ports\", \"Plug and play (no drivers needed); each run on 2 AAA batteries (included); compatible with Windows 7, 8, and 10\", \"Keyboard measures 18.3 by 7.3 by 0.8 inches; mouse measures 4 by 2.6 by 1.5 inches; backed by an AmazonBasics limited 1-year warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"mk570\", \"mk550\", \"color\", \"mk530\", \"002553\", \"advanced\", \"hp\", \"mk710\