{"_id":{"$oid":"6ae14293feb22f5e978ac62f"},"product_id":4996,"item_id":"B08HG9VJWD","category_id":281,"name":"AmazonBasics 12-Sheet Cross-Cut Paper, Junk Mail, CD, and Credit Card Shredder with Pullout Basket (Renewed)","brand":"AmazonBasics","color":"","weight_lb":"","price_cents":1899,"stock":17,"description":"Cross-cut desktop paper shredder with 12-sheet capacity; shreds paper documents, junk mail, CDs/DVDs, credit cards, small paper clips, and staples\nShreds paper into cross section strips measuring 5/32 by 1-7/32 inches (4 x 31mm); security level P-4\n8-minute continuous run time with 45 minute cool-down time; auto start and anti-jam auto reverse to minimize/clear paper jams\n8.7 inch paper feed; 1.8 gallon pullout bin; thermal protection with auto shut-off; measures 13.2 by 9.9 by 11.8 inches\nLED indicators: Standby/Overheat/Overload/Door open; 4-mode switch: Auto/Off/Forward/Reverse\nBacked by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty","bullets":"[\"Cross-cut desktop paper shredder with 12-sheet capacity; shreds paper documents, junk mail, CDs/DVDs, credit cards, small paper clips, and staples\", \"Shreds paper into cross section strips measuring 5/32 by 1-7/32 inches (4 x 31mm); security level P-4\", \"8-minute continuous run time with 45 minute cool-down time; auto start and anti-jam auto reverse to minimize/clear paper jams\", \"8.7 inch paper feed; 1.8 gallon pullout bin; thermal protection with auto shut-off; measures 13.2 by 9.9 by 11.8 inches\", \"LED indicators: Standby/Overheat/Overload/Door open; 4-mode switch: Auto/Off/Forward/Reverse\", \"Backed by an AmazonBasics 1-year limited warranty\"]","keywords":"[\"basics\", \"cut\", \"41334\", \"05\", \"bin\", \"use\", \"microcut\", \"document\", \"p7\", \"for\", \"cutter\", \"office\", \"aurora\", \"crosscut\", \"shedders\", \"out\", \"gxc1820td\", \"shredding\", \"high\", \"shreder\"]","node_path":"Categories/Office Electronics/Other Office Equipment/Shredders","created_at":"2023-04-04T15:57:24Z"}
